{"id": "20478", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20478", "title": "Shooting Dogs Film", "text": "Shooting Dogs, ni filimi yasohokeye muri Amerika nka Beyond the Gates, ni filime yasohotse mu 2005, iyobowe na Michael Caton-Jones ikinwamo na John Hurt, Hugh Dancy na Clare-Hope Ashitey. Ishingiye ku byabaye. kuri producer w\u2019amakuru wa BBC, David Belton, wakoraga mu Rwanda mu gihe cya jenoside yo mu Rwanda. Belton ni umwe mu banditsi ba filime akaba n'umwe mu bayikora.\nImikorere ya firime nq \u00c9cole Technique Officielle (ETO) i Kigali, mu Rwanda, mu 1994, mu gihe cya jenoside yo mu Rwanda. Hurt akina umupadiri gatolika (ushingiye kuri Vjekoslav \u0106uri\u0107) na Dancy umwarimu w\u2019umwongereza, bombi b\u2019abanyaburayi, bafatiwe mu byabaye muri jenoside.\nBitandukanye na \"Hotel Rwanda\", yafatiwe amashusho muri Afrika yepfo ikoresheje abakinnyi ba Afrika yepfo, iyi firime yafatiwe ahahoze amashusho yerekana. Nanone, abantu bamwe na bamwe bakoreshejwe muri filimi ya Shooting Dogs barokotse ubwo bwicanyi bakoreshwaga mu rwego rwo kubyaza umusaruro no mu nshingano zoroheje.\nUmutwe w'iyi filime werekeye ku bikorwa by'abasirikare ba Loni ubwo bajyaga barasa imbwa zizerera zashize imirambo y'abapfuye. Kubera ko abasirikari ba Loni batemerewe kurasa intagondwa z\u2019Abahutu zateje impfu mbere na mbere, kurasa imbwa ni ikimenyetso cy\u2019ubusazi bwibintu filime igerageza gufata.\nUmugambi.\nJoe Connor ni umwarimu muri \u00c9cole Technique Officielle hanze ya Kigali, yari hagarariye Padiri Christopher. Iri shuri kandi ryari ririnzwe na abasirikare b\u2019Ababiligi bayobowe na Kapiteni Delon, mu rwego rwa manda y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ishinzwe kubungabunga amahoro. Joe yegereye umukobwa, Marie, Christopher amubwirako amufitiye ibyiyumviro. Mu ntangiriro za Mata 1994, bareba ibintu byinshi bitera Christopher impungenge, harimo urutonde rwakozwe mu miryango y'Abatutsi, amakuru avuga ko agatsiko k'Abahutu bateye Abatutsi ahandi mu gihugu, ndetse n'inyungu ziteye inkeke zagaragajwe na guverinoma ya Christopher mu mubare w'ingabo za Loni ku ishuri.\nMu ijoro ryo ku ya 6 Mata 1994, nibwo humvikanye ibisasu bya kure n'amasasu, Delon yumva ko indege ya Perezida bayihanuye yarashwe. Akangurira abantu be kurinda impande zose z'ikigo bari bacumbitsemo, ahihindura ikigo cya gisirikare. ubwo Impunzi zari zije zageze ku marembo, Christopher, kubera Delon yanze, ashimangira ko barekuwe. Bukeye bwaho, Joe atwara imodoka kugirango azane Marie kugira ngo amuzane, ariko inzu iratereranwa uretse imbwa. Agaruka ku ishuri asanga yageze mu muryango w\u2019inyuma, kubera ko ubu umuryango w\u2019imbere urinzwe n\u2019agatsiko k\u2019Abahutu. Impunzi zitegura ziyobowe na Roland, se wa Marie. Impunzi zitari nke z\u2019i Burayi nazo zirahagera, kandi, Christopher yababajwe, Delon ategura ko bahabwa icumbi ryiza. Christopher akomeje imirimo yitorero nkuko bisanzwe, naho Joe agerageza gufasha impunzi.\nMu gihe agatsiko gakikije ishuri, Joe atekereza ko byafasha impunzi mu gihe ibibazo byabo biri kuri televiziyo kandi agasaba ubufasha bwa Delon bwo kuzana umunyamakuru wa BBC Rachel akamuzana mu kigo. Delon yabanje gukorana, ariko ahita ahindura ibitekerezo maze yanga kumva ko abasirikari b'Ababiligi barinze Minisitiri w\u2019intebe Uwilingiyimana bishwe. Joe yahisemo kugenda uko byagenda kose maze ashaka inshuti ye Fran\u00e7ois, umuhutu, kumuherekeza aho, ariko Fran\u00e7ois ntabwo ari murugo. Joe asanze Rachel numufotora we abemeza kuza mwishuri ababwira ko hari abanyaburayi. Mugihe basubiye mwishuri bahagarikwa kuri bariyeri hanyuma bakururwa mumodoka yabo bitwaje imbunda. Mugihe Rachel agerageza kumvikana kugirango basohoke, Joe yababajwe no kubona umugabo wumututsi akururwa akamwica akoresheje umuhoro. Yongeye guterwa ubwoba no kubona ko Fran\u00e7ois ari kumwe n'agatsiko, bafashe umuhoro w'amaraso. Fran\u00e7ois arategura Joe nitsinda rya BBC kurekurwa. Abanyamakuru basa nkaho batishimiye ibyabaye kurusha Joe, nyuma yaje kubiganiraho na Rachel, umunyamakuru w'inararibonye ufite uburambe ku bintu nk'ibyo muri Bosiniya.\nMu kiganiro na Delon, Rachel amubaze impamvu ingabo ze zitagize uruhare mu guhagarika ubwo bwicanyi no kubaza manda ya Loni. Delon asoza ikiganiro amubwira ko yasabye ko yahindura manda ye imwemerera kugira icyo akora, ariko nta ntsinzi. Christopher yibarutse umwana wa Edda, umwe mu mpunzi, amwita umwana. Nyuma Christopher yavuye mu ishuri gushaka imiti y\u2019umwana no gusura ikigo cy\u2019abihaye Imana cyari hafi aho, yumvise ko cyatewe. Kuri farumasi, atanga ruswa kugirango abone imiti kandi arakaye abeshya ko umwana ari Umuhutu. Ageze mu kigo cy'ababikira, asanga ababikira bose barishwe. Hanze, imbogamizi z'ishuri yatije nk'ubutoni zirimo gukoreshwa mu rwego rwa bariyeri, ikintu guverinoma ye yavuganye yishimye. Christopher agarutse ku ishuri, Delon amubwira ko bazatangira kurasa imbwa zishakisha imirambo hafi. Christopher abajije asebanya niba imbwa zarashe ku ngabo za Loni, bitewe na manda zabo nke.\nIngabo z\u2019Abafaransa zageze mu kigo ariko zitangaza ko zihari gusa zo gutwara impunzi z\u2019Abafaransa. Nyuma y\u2019uburakari bukaze bwa Delon, bemeye gufata Abanyaburayi bose. Joe agerageza kumvikana na Marie gufata umwanya we ku makamyo ariko aranga. Rachel aragenda ajyana nabafaransa, abwira Joe ko nawe agomba kugenda. Itsinda ry\u2019impunzi, harimo na Edda, bagerageza gutoroka inyuma y\u2019ishuri ariko bagabwaho igitero n\u2019agatsiko. Abenshi muribo bariciwe, ariko bake basubira mumutekano wikigo. Edda yabanje kubyirinda yihisha, ariko umwana we atangira kurira, aburira abicanyi imbere ye. Joe akireba, we n'umwana we baratewe urupfu.\nDelon yaje guhabwa amabwiriza yo kuva kuricyo kigo cyamashuri. Mu gihe Ababiligi barimo kwitegura kugenda, Roland yinginze Delon kurasa izo mpunzi, kugira ngo yirinde ubwicanyi bakoresheje umuhoro, ariko Delon aranga. Joe yahisemo ko atagishoboye kubyihanganira agenda na Delon. Yahuye na Marie ubwo yurira ikamyo kandi ntacyo ashobora kuvuga uretse \"Mbabarira\". Christopher yahisemo kuguma inyuma, mbere yo kumenya ko ashobora kwinjiza abana inyuma yikamyo yishuri. Afata itsinda rito ry'abana, barimo Marie, agambiriye kugaruka kuri byinshi, ariko akimara kuva ku ishuri, agatsiko kateye kandi kica impunzi zisigaye.\nUbwo Christopher yahagarikwaga kuri bariyeri, iyobowe n'inshuti ye Julius. Nubwo Christopher yagerageje kuvuga inzira ye no kwiyambaza umubano wabo, Julius yanga kumugaragaro. Igihe Christopher yanze gufatanya, Julius aramurasa. Marie, yitegereza ibiganiro byabo atinya ko ikamyo izashakishwa, hagati aho abasha kunyerera atabizi hamwe nabana. Christopher abona Marie yahunze mbere yo gupfa.\nAmashusho ya Marie yiruka ari gushaka amashusho yabajijwe hejuru y\u2019uko Loni idashaka kuvuga ibyabereye mu Rwanda \"itsembabwoko\". Muri epilogue ngufi, Marie akurikirana Joe, ubu akaba ari umwarimu ku ishuri rya kera rya Christopher, maze baganira muri make ibyababayeho.\nIyi filime isozwa namakuru ajyanye na jenoside yabereye mu Rwanda n\u2019ubwicanyi bukomeye bwabereye mu kigo cyo muri ETO by'umwihariko, hamwe n'ibisobanuro birambuye ku byabaye ku giti cya bamwe mu bakozi ba filime mu gihe cya jenoside.\nIgisubizo gikomeye.\nUrubuga rusubirwamo rw'urubuga Rotten Tomatoes ruvuga ko rwemejwe rwa 84% rushingiye ku bisubizo 63, impuzandengo ya 7.2 / 10. Ubwumvikane buke bw'uru rubuga bugira buti: \"Biragoye, abantu bavugwa hamwe no kurasa aho biha \"Hanze ya Gatesi\" impagarara kandi byihutirwa.\" Mu kinyamakuru \"The Guardian,\" Rob Mackey yaranditse ati: \"Niba utari uzi inkuru, ushobora kwitega ko iyi filime izatera imbere mu mateka mato mato ashingiye ku muco\u2026 \"Shooting Dogs\" ifite ahantu nyaburanga: ishuri rya Kigali aho inzozi mbi yakinaga.\" Muri \"New Statesman,\" Victoria Segal yaranditse ati: \" \"Shooting dogs ni filimi yafatiwe amashusho\" i Kigali kandi geografiya igira uruhare runini mu gutera ubwoba bukabije: imihanda idasanzwe y\u2019ubutayu, imibiri iri mu gihingwa, ubushuhe n\u2019umukungugu. Yuzuyemo ibihe bibi by\u2019ibibi\u2026\"\nIbihembo.\ninsinzi yambere Iserukiramuco rya Filime ya Heartland 2006 Igihembo gikomeye kubintu bidasanzwe"}
{"id": "20479", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20479", "title": "Stacy Spikes", "text": "Stacy Spikes ni rwiyemezamirimo wumunyamerika. Afite Ibihangano by'ikoranabuhanga byemezwa na leta. Numwemubashinze serivisi yo kwiyandikisha MoviePass akaba ari nawe washinze Urbanworld, iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga ryahariwe kurera abagore n'abanditsi b'inkuru za BIPOC n'abahanze. Uwahoze ari umuyobozi ushinzwe kwamamaza no gutunganya ibicuruzwa, Spikes yagize uruhare runini muri Motown Records, Sony Music Entertainment, Miramax Films, na Filime Ukwakira. \nUbuzima n'umwuga.\nSpikes akomoka muri Houston. Se yarumuyobozi w'ishuri, Nyina yakiragibiganiro kuri televiziyo. \nAmazekwiga amashuriyisumbuye, yimukiye i Los Angeles, aho yabanaga na nyirarume anakoramukazi k'ubururu mbere yokubona akazi ke kambere mubijyanye n'imyidagaduro muri Motown Records. kugeza 1995, Spikes yakoragamuri Miramax Films yariyazamuwe muntera inshuronyinshi, aba visi perezida w\u2019ubucuruzi. guhera 1996-97, Spikes yari visi perezida mukuru ushinzwe kwamamaza m'Ukwakira Films. \nIbirori bya firime ya Urbanworld.\nSpikes yashinziserukiramuco rya sinema ya Urbanworld mu 1997. Iri serukiramuco ryizihijisabukuru yimyaka 25 mu 2021; ibaburi mwaka mumujyi wa New York. \nMoviPass, Twashinze.\nMuri Gashyantare 2011, Spikes yashyizahagaragara MoviePass hamwe n\u2019umushinga washinze Hamet Watt. Mu Kwakira 2012, isosiyete yashyizehuburyo bushyabw\u2019ubucuruzi bwakoresheje uburyo bwo kwishyura bushingiye kukibanza. Robert De Niro yari ashyigikiye hakiri kare MoviePass. Nyuma yo kugurwa na Helios na Matheson Analytics, Spikes yirukanwe muri sosiyete muri Mutarama 2018. MoviePass yatanze ikirego cyo guhomba mu 2020. \nFilimePass, Gusubiramo.\nMu 2021, Spikes yaguze sosiyete mugihombo mazeyongerakuyitangiza mumpeshyi ya 2022. Abantubagera ku 30.000 biyandikishije kurutonde rw\u2019abategereje mbereyogutangira muminota itanu nyuma yo gutangazwa, byatumye ururubuga rwa MoviePass rusenyuka. Itera nshya rya MoviePass ifite ibyiciro bitatu byabakoresha: shingiro, bisanzwe, cyangwa premium. Ikinyamakuru Financial Times cyagize kiti: \"Muguhamagarira ibitekerezo by\u2019ubucuruzi biteye ubwoba, MoviePass irikumwanya wa Sinclair C5, Juicero, na Soup Tube.\" \nIgitabo.\nInyandiko ya Stacy Spikes \"Yashinz'Umwirabura, Imbaraga Zihishe zo Kuba Hanze\" yasohotse muri Gashyantare 2023; yerekana umwugawe. \nAmashusho.\nSpikes yari producer mukuru wa \"Punks\", \"Uruzinduko\", \"Umwami w\u2019ishyamba\", \"Ed Ed\" (2001), \"Kuri da Gukunda Amafaranga\" (2002), na firime ya TV \"Urbanworld Film Festival idasanzwe\" (2004). \nIbihembo &amp; Icyubahiro.\nYakiriye \u201cMade in NY Award\u201d yahawe na Michael Bloomberg, umuyobozi w'umujyi wa New York, mu 2011 kuberakazi yakoranye na Festival Urbanworld. "}
{"id": "20482", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20482", "title": "93 Days Film", "text": "93 DAYS Ni filime ikinamico ifite inkomoko muri Nigeriya isohoka mu mwaka 2016 yayobowe kandi ikorwa na Steve Gukas. Iyi filime ivuga ibyorezo bya Ebola 2014 muri Nijeriya ndetse n\u2019uko byarwanijwe neza n\u2019abakozi b\u2019ubuzima mu bitaro bya Lagos. Irimo Bimbo Akintola, Danny Glover na Bimbo Manuel hamwe na Native FilmWorks, Michel Angelo Production, na Bolanle Austen-Peters Production. \n\"93Days\" yeguriwe na Ameyo Adadevoh, kumugaragari wo muri Nijeriya wagize uruhare runini mu kwirinda ndetse no kurwanya Ebola muri Nijeriya.\nUmugambi.\nKu ya 20 Nyakanga 2014, Patrick Sawyer, umudipolomate wa Liberiya n'Abanyamerika, yageze i Lagos, muri Nijeriya. Yahise ajyanwa mu kigo cy\u2019ubuvuzi cya mbere nyuma yo kugaragarwaho bimwe mu ibimenyetso bikabije. Umwe mu baganga be bitabiriye, Dr. Ameyo Adadevoh, yari afite impungenge yuko ashobora kuba afite indwara ya Ebola, nubwo Sawyer ahakana icyo cyifuzo; nyamara, yahisemo gushyira mu kato Sawyer kandi asaba abakozi be kwitonda mugihe bamwitayeho.\nmumasaha ya saa sita, nibwo ibisubizo by'ibizamini byaje maze, byemeza ko Sawyer afite Ebola.ryabaye Ijambo ryihuta cyane ko i Lagos hashobora kubaho ikibazo cya mbere cy\u2019umurwayi wa Ebola, kandi bidatinze imiryango y\u2019amakuru ku isi yatangiye gutangaza amakuru. Nijeriya ihita itangira kwitegura icyorezo cya Ebola.\nDr. Adadevoh abonana na Dr. Wasiu Gbadamosi ukuriye ikigo cy\u2019indwara zandura Yaba, na Dr. David Brett-Major wo mu muryango w\u2019ubuzima ku isi. yaje gusanga icyo ikigo cya Yasu kidafite ibikoresho bihagije byo gufasha no kwita ku abarwayi ba Ebola. Ku ya 25 Nyakanga, abaganga bavumbuye ko Sawyer yapfuye. Ikigo cy\u2019ubuvuzi cya mbere gitangira ingamba zo kongera ingamba kandi kigenzura abakozi bacyo ibimenyetso n\u2019ibimenyetso bya Ebola.\nIyi nkuru yibanze cyane ku bitambo byatanzwe n'abagabo ndetse n'abagore bashyize ubuzima bwabo mu kaga kugira ngo barebe ko virusi ya Ebola irimo, mbere yuko iba icyorezo. "}
{"id": "20483", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20483", "title": "Abuja Connection Film", "text": "Abuja Connection ni firime y'imirwano ya Nollywood yasohotse mu 2003 yakozwe na Michael Ezeanyaeche ikinwamo na bakinnyi bazwi cyane nka Clarion Chukwura-Abiola. Hariho ibindi bice bibiri, \"Abuja Guhuza 2\" na \"Abuja Guhuza 3\", byombi biyobowe na Adim Williams.\nUmugambi.\nIyi filime ishingiye ku kugaragaza urugamba rwo guharanira ubutegetsi, amafaranga n\u2019uburyo kugira amasano akomeye i Abuja, muri Nijeriya, bishobora guca umurongo hagati yubukene nubutunzi. aho kugira imibanire ikomeye bishobora kuziba icyuho kiri hagati y'ubukene n'ubutunzi. Inkuru ivuga ku bahanganye babiri, Jennifer na Sophia, bahora mu rugamba rwo gutsinda, amaherezo bituma Sophia ashaka inzira nshya. Ivugwa ko ari filime y'imirwano. Ariko, Jennifer ari imbere cyane yumukino. atsinda Sofiya. Kubera ko Sophia yarambiwe agasuzuguro, yahisemo guhagarika guhangana no gushaka amafaranga n'imbaraga ahandi. Azabigeraho? Cyangwa amaherezo Jennifer yatsinze urugamba?"}
{"id": "20484", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20484", "title": "The Accident (film ya 2013)", "text": "Impanuka ni filime yikinamico yo muri Nigeriya 2013 yakozwe kandi ikayoborwa na Teco Benson ikinwamo abakinnyi bazwi nka Kalu Ikeagwu na Chioma Chukwuka. \nibihembo byatanzwe.\nAccide yatsindiye igihembo cyiza cya Nigeriya cya Filime mu bihembo bya 10 bya Afurika Movie Academy.yatowe kandi inshuro 3 muri Nigeriya Imyidagaduro 2014. \nIkindi gihembo mu rwego rwo guha icyubahiro iyi filimi ya the Accident hatioranijwe umwe mu bakinnyi ba filime Chioma, nku mukinnyi mwiza\u201d mu bihembo bya Afurika bya Sinema muri 2014. \nIncamake.\nIyi nkuru yibanda ku buzima bwumunyamategeko wumugore wegerejwe numukiriya ushaka gutandukana no kutanyurwa yagize ububata nigitsina cya mugenzi we bimugira impamvu. Ibintu bitunguranye bibaho biganisha ku ngaruka nyinshi. "}
{"id": "20485", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20485", "title": "The Accidental Spy (film ya 2017)", "text": "The Accident Spy ni filime yo gusetsa kadi irimo ibyahe yo muri Nijeriya 2017 iyobowe na Roger Russell ikorwa na Darlington Abuda hamwe na Nosa Aghayere Dag nka producer mukuru. Muri filime hagaragaramo Ayo Makun, Ramsey Nouah, Henry Morris, Agatha Ezzedine, Miguel A. N\u00fa\u00f1ez Jr. Alibaba Akpobome na Daniel Eghan. Yasohotse ku ya 1 Ukuboza 2017, yerekanwe kuri Netflix ku ya 29 Ugushyingo 2019. \nUmugambi.\nInsanganyamatsiko ya firime yazengurutseho inzobere mu bijyanye n\u2019ikoranabuhanga Emmanuel Prince, yafashe urugendo ava muri Amerika kugira ngo yongere ingufu nyuma yuko umukunzi we amutengushye. Mugihe muri Amerika, Umuyobozi, umuyobozi ukomeye wamakarito aha akazi umwicanyi wabigize umwuga kugirango yice uwahimbye isoko rishya ryingufu zigira ingaruka kumasoko ya karitsiye. Emmanuel atabishaka yishora mubikorwa byose yiyandikisha mubyerekanwe hanyuma yibeshya yibwira umwirondoro wumwicanyi, bityo bitera urujijo rukomeye kandi amaherezo arokora ubuzima bwuwabihimbye. "}
{"id": "20486", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20486", "title": "Ada Omo Daddy Film", "text": "Ada Omo Daddy Ni kinamico yo gusetsa ni filimi yanditswe kandi inakinirwa muri Nigeriya mumwaka wa 2023 yanditswe na Yakubu Olawale, yakozwe na Mercy Aigbe, kandi iyobowe na Akay Mason na Adebayo Tijani. Iyi filime ishingiye ahanini ku buriganya bwa kibyeyi bwerekanwe mu gihe cy\u2019ubukwe buzwi cyane ku izina rya \" Owambe \" muri Yoruba. Muri filime hagaragayemo bamwe mu bakinnyi ba Nollywood nka Charles Okafor, Sola Sobowale, Mercy Aigbe, Chiwetalu Agu na Uche Ndubuisi. \nUmugambi.\n\"Ada Omo Daddy\" Ni filime ivuga kumateka ya Pero ugiye kurongorwa na Victor. Ubuzima bwa Pero burahinduka cyane mugihe Ifeanyi yagaragaye gitunguranye avuga ko ari se wamubyaye, bikurura ibibazo mumuryango wa Balogun usa nkuwuzuye. Kugaragara gutunguranye kwa Ifeanyi, gutandukana ariko noneho kwihana, guhishura amabanga adashimishije agomba gukemurwa mbere yubukwe bwa Pero na Victor. \nKwakira.\n\"Ada Omo Daddy\" ni filimi yakinnye kandi ishyirwe ku rutonde rwa filime icumi za mbere mu gihe cy\u2019ibirori 2023 na \"Premium Times\". "}
{"id": "20487", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20487", "title": "Adesuwa Film", "text": "----Adesuwa (A Wasted Lust) ni filime y\u2019amateka yo muri Nijeriya yasohotse mu 2012, yakozwe kandi ikanayoborwa na Lancelot Oduwa Imasuen. Igaragaramo abakinnyi bazwi nka Olu Jacobs, Bob-Manuel Udokwu, na Kofi Adjorlolo. Filime yari iteganyijwe gusohoka mu mashusho muri Nijeriya ku ya 4 Gicurasi 2012, ariko kubera amakimbirane hagati y\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019iyo filime n\u2019umuproducer mukuru, yasohotse gusa ku buryo bwa DVD. Iyi filime yafatiwe mu Mujyi wa Benin, muri Leta ya Edo.\nYahawe ibihembo 10 mu bihembo bya 8 bya Africa Movie Academy Awards, inatsindira ibihembo bya Achievement in Costume Design, Achievement in Visual effects, na Best Nigerian filime.\nKwakira.\nNollywood Reinvented yahaye \"Adesuwa\" amanota 49%; yashimye uburyo yakozwe, yayoboye, kandi ifite umwihariko. Uwayisuzumye yasanze iyi filime ishimishije ariko idashimishije cyane. "}
{"id": "20489", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20489", "title": "Dusabimana apollos", "text": "Dusabimana Apollos yavutse 1977 ni umunyamabanga mukuru w'uruganda rwa cinema mu Rwanda mu rurimi rw' icyongereza (Rwanda filmi federation) ni umukozi w'amajwi n'amashusho akaba kandi yarabaye mu itangazamakuru,yabaye umwe mubayobozi bashinzwe akanama ko gushyiraho urubuga rw'ubumwe bwa cinema muri afurika y'uburasirazuba.\nAmateka.\nApollos avukiye mu Rwanda AKarere ka Nyanza 13 mars 1977. Yatangiye gukora ibya cinema hashize imyaka 18,yatangiye gukora urugaga rwa cinema mu Rwanda(rwanda filim federation) kuwa 15 Werurwe muri 2023 afatanije na bagenzi be. \nApollos yize muri Kaminuza ya gatolika ya Kabgayi:mucyongereza (Institut catholique de Kabgayi) ndetse abona impamya bumenyi y'ikirenga mu gihugu cya Kenya muri kaminuza y'umusozi wa kenya: mucyongereza (Mount Kenya University).\nDusabimana Apollos ni umugabo arubatse afite umugore n'abana."}
{"id": "20490", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20490", "title": "L\u00e9on Ngabo", "text": "L\u00e9on Ngabo wavutse mu 1990 ni umukinnyi wa filimi mu Rwanda yavukiye Nyamirambo,AKarere ka Nyarugenge akaba azwi ku izina rya Njuga cg Kadogo ayo amazina aturuka ku mikino cg filimi yagiye akinamo.\nAmateka.\nNgabo bakunze kwita Njuga yavutse 1990,yize amashuri yisumbuye muri APACE iherereye mu mugi wa kigali mu ishami ry'icunga mutungo yagiye akina muri filimi nyarwanda zitandukanye, twavuga nka Seburikoko, nshuti friends. avuga kandi ko filimi yambere yakinnye ntagihembo nakimwe yigeze abona, ariko bimufasha kumenyekana no kugaragaza impano afite, bituma ahabwa amahirwe n'umuyobozi wa Inyarwanda.com wicyo gihe, amugirira ikizere ari naho yakinnye muri filimi yitwa inshuti/friends akina ku izina rya Njuga. Njuga yakomeje kumenyekana nyuma yaho bakajya bamuha amahirwe yo gukina mu mafilimi atandukanye ahita atangira kumenyekana. "}
{"id": "20491", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20491", "title": "Umuganwa Sarah", "text": "Umuganwa Sarah yavutse mu 1992 ni umwe mu bagore bakina filimi mu Rwanda azwi cyane ku izina rya Mutoni akaba yaritabiriye ipiganwa ry'umukinnyi w'umugore wakunzwe kurusha abandi. \nImibereho ye.\nUmuganwa ni umunyarwanda wavukiye mu Gihugu cy'Ubugande mu 1992. yaje kugarukana n'ababyeyi be mu Rwanda dore ko aho yavukiye hari mu buhungiro, bagarutse mu gihugu cyababyaye batura mu Karere ka Nyagatare intara y'uburasirazuba,ariho Sarah yakuriye nubwo ubu atakihatuye asigaye aba mu mugi wa Kigali.\nSarah yatangiye umwuga wo gukina filimi muri 2014, aho yatangiriye muri filimi yitwa ndi umukirisitu yakinaga ku izina rya Celine,bavugako iyi filimi yatangiriyeho ariyo yamuhesheje igihembo cy'umukinnyi mwiza, nyuma yaje no gukina izindi filimi nka Akataramagara, Seburikoko n'izindi. yavuzeko umushahara yakuye muri filimi ya Seburikoko wamufashije kwitezaimbere\nAmateka yihariye.\nSarah ubu ni umugore wubatse,yashakanye na Nkunzimana Issa kuwa 15 Nzeri 2019."}
{"id": "20492", "revid": "11347", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20492", "title": "Ramadhan Bizimana", "text": "Ramadhan Bizimana ni umugabo ukina filimi mu Rwanda, yakoze no kuri radio Contact FM. ni umunyarwanda wakukiye mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda.\nUmuwuga akora.\nBizimana yakoze kuri radiyo ya Contact FM, ubusanzwe akora umwuga ugendanye na cinema"}
{"id": "20493", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20493", "title": "Drocelle Mukarubayiza", "text": "Drocelle Mukarubayiza ni umunarwandakazi ukina filimi akaba azwi cyane mu ikinamico yitwa Musekeweya inyura kuri radiyo Rwanda.\nAmateka y'umwuga.\nDrocella yamenyekanye mu ikinamico ya museke weya inyura ku ma radiyo atandukanye mu Rwanda cyane cyane kuri radiyo Rwanda kuko iyo kinamico inyuraho kabiri cyangwa gatatu mu Cyumweru. Ikinamico ya Musekeweya yatangiye kukinwa kuri radiyorwanda kuwa 26 Gicuransi muri 2004 akaba ari nawo munsi wambere ihiseho.\nMukarubayiza akina ku izina rya Zaninka akaba ari umwe mubakinaga musekeweya bamamaye bitewe n'ubuyo batangagamo ubutumwa doreko ahanini iyi kinamico yari igamije kunga no gukiza ibikomere abanyarwanda muri rusange nyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu 1994 byagiye bibigisha kubana amahoro."}
{"id": "20494", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20494", "title": "Afurika Yunze ubumwe (film ya 2010)", "text": "Afurika United ni filime yogusetsa-amakinamico yomu Bwongereza yakozwe mumwaka wa 2010 iyobowe n\u2019umuyobozi wambere w\u2019amafirime mu Bwongereza, Deborah 'Debs' Gardner-Paterson ikinwamo na Emmanuel Jal, Eriya Ndayambaje, Roger Nsengiyumva, Sanyu Joanita Kintu, Sherrie Silver na Yves Dusenge. Uyumugambi ni itsinda ry'abana babanyarwanda bakor'urugendo rw'ibirometero 3000 muri Afrika kugirango bagere mu gikombe cyisi cya Afrika yepfo.\nInyandiko.\nMu Rwanda, umufanaw'umupira w'amaguru Dudu Kayenzi yigish'itsinda ry'abana kubang'umupira w'amaguru akoresheje agakingirizo ka Loni, igikapu cya pulasitike n'umugozi. inshuti yemagara Fabrice yarafite icyifuzo cyokub'icyamamare mu mupirawamaguru w\u2019umupira wamaguru kandi bigaragara ko yahinduy'amateka yabakinnyi bakomeje gukin'umupira wamaguru. Igihe Fabrice yahaw'amahirwe yokugeragezwa mu birori byo gutangiza igikombe cy'isi cy'umupira w'amaguru mu mwaka wa 2010 muri Afurika y'Epfo, yahimbye gahunda yo kunyura mubabyeyibe bakomeye, hamwe na mushiki wa Dudu na Beatrice. Beatrice yifuza kuba umuganga no gushak'umuti wa sida. Fabrice agerageza kubwira nyina kwa akunda umupira w'amaguru, ariko asubiza ati \"Afurika ntabwo ikeneye inzozi, igomba gukanguka\".\nBukeyebwaho, Fabrice yakuyeh'ubutwari bwokuva murugo hakirikare, hamwe na Dudu na Beatrice, biyerekana mu rwego rwomumuryango w'umugore kugirango binjiremuri bisi ijya Kigali. hanyuma babur'ahobahagarara kuko bagomba kwihisha mugihe cyokugenzura itike, bikarangirira muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nBose ukwari batatu bashak'ubuhungiro munkambi y\u2019impunzi, aho bahura na Foreman George, umusirikare wahoze ari umwana, abah'amahirwe yogutoroka inkambi yibasiwe n\u2019interahamwe nijoro, bahatir'umwana uwariwe wese ufite ubuzimabwiza ukomeye kwinjira muntambara y'abenegihugu. Bahungiye mu ijipo, arikwabasirikare bagenzi ba George babagerahobukeye. Itsindarishoboye guhung'imodoka mugihemoteri ishyushy'igaturika. Bashakish'icumbi murigare ishaje mw'ishyamba, aho Fabrice yavumbuye igikapu cyuzuyamafaranga George yibye Jenerali we, byerekana impamvu babakurikiranaga. Ariko, guhangana birahinduka kuko byongeye gushyirwaho hejuru yo kuvumbura pantaro mu musarani.\nDudu, Beatrice, Fabrice na George bagezekunkombe z'ikiyaga cya Tanganyika, ahobagura ubwato kugirango bagere mu Burundi hakurya. Hanoniho Dudu atangiye kuvug'inkuru yimpimbano yumwana na mushiki we bashinzwe n'Imana gushushanya umupira utigera usimbuka (cyane nkuwahimbye). Bazakenera reberi ku giti, plastike yo kuri \"Shit Mountain\" n'umugozi wo mu kiyaga kirinzwe n'amafi akaze.\nNyina wa Fabrice yandika anamuhamagara kuri terefone ye igendanwa, arikwajugunya telefoni mu kiyaga. Amaherezo bagezemuri resitora ya posh, aho Celeste, imbata yimibonano mpuzabitsina, akorera nyir'umuzungu agurisha ibinyobwa. Yafashe abobana bane ashimangira kobasubiye inyuma, ariko George amen'igikapu cy'amafaranga gwatange ruswa bityonyir'ubwite arabemerera kuguma no gukina muri pisine bagategereza. Fabrice afit'umwanya wogukina na \"umupira w'amaguru Dudu. Joriji asinziriye, nyir'ubwite yibye umufuka we w'amafaranga awujugunya muri villa; ariko, bidatinze bagarura igikapu namafaranga hanyuma Celeste yifatanya nabo.\nBakoreshej'ubuhanga bwa Dudu, basang'uburyo butandukanye kandibudasanzwe bwogukurikirana urugendo rwabomuri Afrika yepfo, harimon'ikarito ikururwan'inka. Celeste avugako yahunze'umudugudu wekugira ngoyirinde gushyingiranwa, Fabrice abona George yataye imbunda, yakundaga kurasa bagenzi be mbere.\nIkipe yabuz'amafaranga, Dudu ashimangira kobashobora kubon'amafaranga batang'amaraso ku kigo nderabuzima cyaho. Umuntu wesewatsinze ikizamini cy'amaraso usibye Dudu, usanzw'uzi koyanduye virusi itera sida, nubwo atabimenyesha abandi. Nyuma yo kwambuka umupaka muri Zimbabwe, Dudu ahinduranya kwa Zambiya kwacha ku madorari ya Zimbabwe, ariko Celeste asobanura ko ifaranga ridahwitse kandi ko yashutswe. Agerageza gukusanya amafaranga nyuma yo kujugunywa mu mazi na Fabrice yarakaye, kandi nta bushobozi afite kuko yisuka hejuru y\u2019isumo rya Victoria."}
{"id": "20495", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20495", "title": "White squadron (film ya 1949)", "text": "White Squadron (Igifaransa: L'escadron blanc) ni filime yokwidagadura y\u2019Abafaransa yakozwe mu 1949 ihagarariwe na Ren\u00e9 Chanas abakinnyi bari Jean Chevrier, Ren\u00e9 Lef\u00e8vre na Mich\u00e8le Martin.] \"\u200b\"Amashusho yateguwe numuyobozi wubuhanzi Jean-Roger Bertrand. Kurasa ahantu byabereye hafi ya Adrar mu butayu bwa Sahara muri Alijeriya. Abagize amasosiyete yo muri Sahara yomuri Legio y\u2019amahanga y\u2019Abafaransa bagaragaye nabomuri filime.\nInyandiko.\nItsinda ry\u2019abasirikare bomu Bufaransa bakorubutumwa buteyubwoba mugice cyakure cya Alijeriya. aho kapiteni yiciwe, uwungirije kapiteni yahise ayobora neza ingabo zisigaye zisubira mu birindiro byazo."}
{"id": "20496", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20496", "title": "Munsi y'Ijuru", "text": "Munsi y'Ikindi kirere (French, lit. \"Inzira z'Ikibaya\") ni filime y\u2019ikinamico y\u2019Abafaransa, ihagarariwe na Ga\u00ebl Morel ikanasohoka mu 2002 yoherejwe n'umuryangowe kubanana sekuru (Mohamed Majd) mur'Alijeriya kugirango amurinde, arwanano kumenyera ibidukikije atarasanzwe abana nabyo yatanyaguwe hagati y'ingaruka za mubyara we Issam (Kheireddine Defdaf), umucuruzi w\u2019ibiyobyabwenge muri Alijeriya, na Nadia (Amira Casar), umukozi ushinzwe imibereho myiza y'abaturage ukora mu gufasha abakiri bato bahohotewe. \nMuri ababakinnyi harimo Hamza Bennani, Kaoutar Mohamadi, Mohamed Said Arif, Cl\u00e9ment Deva, Nabil Tahar, Amina Medjoubi, Mathieu Casado, Paul Morel na Akrame El Meziane.\nFilime yatsindiye igihembo cya FIPRESCI mwiserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Toronto 2002."}
{"id": "20497", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20497", "title": "Tartarin ya Tarascon (film ya 1934)", "text": "Tartarin wo muri Tarascon (Igifaransa: Tartarin de Tarascon) ni filime yogusetsa yomu Bufaransa yakozwe mu 1934 ihagarariwe na Raymond Bernard abakinnyibari Raimu, Fernand Charpin na Jean Sino\u00ebl. Ishingiye kugitabo cyakozwe mu 1872 cyahawe umutwumwe na Alphonse Daudet. Yarasiwe kuri sitidiyo ya Joinville i Paris hafi ya Beaucaire na Tarascon mu majyepfo y\u2019Ubufaransa na Bou Sa\u00e2da muri Alijeriya y\u2019Abafaransa. Amashusho ya firime yateguwe nubuyobozi bwubuhanzi Lucien Carr\u00e9 na Jean Perrier. Yongeye gukorwa nka firime yo mu 1962 yizina rimwe iyobowe na Francis Blanche."}
{"id": "20498", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20498", "title": "Afurika (Urukurikirane rwa TV 1984)", "text": "Afurika: Urugendo rwo Kuvumbura rwabaye urukurikirane rw'amateka y'Afurika hamwe na Basil Davidson. Yakozwe kubufatanye bwa Channel 4, Ikigo cya Televiziyo cya Nijeriya na RM Arts mu 1984 cyarikigizwe n'ibice umunani mubice bine. Iyi filime yahawigihembo cya Zahabu mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime na Televiziyo mu 1984. Igice cyose gifite isaha imwe. "}
{"id": "20499", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20499", "title": "Inkuru ya Kafi", "text": "Kafi's Story ni film yerekanamoko y'ubuzima bwa Nuba muri Sudani, ihagarariwe na Amy Hardie na Arthur Howes.\nInyandiko.\nKurasana hagatiyi 1986 ni 1988, \"Inkuru ya Kafi\" yafashamashusho y'ubuzima bwabaturage ba Nuba mbereyuko bagiruruhare muntambara yakabiri yabaturage ya Sudani.\nKafi, umusore womumudugudu wa Torogi mu misozi ya Nuba muri Sudani, n'umwe mubagabo ba mbere bakoze ingendo mumajyaruguru berekeza mumurwa mukuru Khartoum bashaka amafaranga. Kugiramafaranga niyonzira yonyine yokubona umwambaro nokurongora umugore wa kabiri, Tete.\nNyuma yimyaka icumi nyumayiyi firime, Arthur Howes yasubiye muri Sudani gufatamashusho ya \"Nuba Ibiganiro\", ahoyashakaga kwigarurira ubuzima bwabaturage ba Nuba mugihe cy'intambara."}
{"id": "20500", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20500", "title": "Igihugu cyababyaye (2010 film)", "text": "Igihugu cyababyaye (\"\u02c0\u0259nat\u0259 h\u00e4g\u00e4r\") ni filime yigenga yakozwe mu 2010 yanditswe na Owen 'Alik Shahadah. \"Igihugu cyababyaye\" n'urukurikirane rwa documentaire ya 2005 \"Nyuma yimyaka 500\".\nInyandiko.\n\"Igihugu cy'ababyaye\" ni documentaire yerekeye umugabane w'Afrika kuvamuri Egiputa yakera kugezubu. N'incamake y'amateka ny'Afurika nibibazo byikigihe hamwe n'Abanyafurika hagati yinkuru.\nAbakinnyi.\nAbakinnyi barimo bakomeye bomubihugu bya politiki ny'Afurika, harimo:\n5.1 kuzenguruka.\nIgihugu cyababyaye kivanze muri 5.1 Dolby Digital. "}
{"id": "20501", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20501", "title": "Amayobera ya Nili", "text": "Amayobera ya Nili ni filime ya IMAX yakozwemu 2005 yerekanurugendo rwambere rwagenze neza ugendere kuburebure bwa Nili na Nili kuvahwikomoka muri Etiyopiya kugera ku nyanja ya Mediterane. Urwo rugendo rwari ruyobowe na geologiya Pasquale Scaturro. Urwo rugendo rwatwayiminsi 114 guhera kwitariki 22 Ukuboza 2003 kugeza 28 Mata 2004. Iyi filime yasohotse mu 2005. "}
{"id": "20503", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20503", "title": "Nuba", "text": "Nuba conversation ni film yakozwe mu 2000 documentaire na etnografiya ihagarariwe na Arthur Howes.\nInyandiko.\nNyuma yimyakicumi bafashamashusho y'inkuru ya Kafi, umukinnyiwa firime w\u2019Ubwongereza Arthur Howes yongeyekwihisha muri Sudani kugirango amenyuko byagenze kubaturage ba Nuba batuye muri Torogi.\nYasanze ibimenyetso bya jihadi ahantuhose. nkurugero gahundaya tereviziyo izwicyane, \"Fields of Sacrifice\", yizihijabapfuye muricyo cyumweru muntambara yokurwanya Nuba hagaragayemo abagizumuryango bashimira Allah kubayarafashije abahungubabo na barumuna babo bahowe Imana.\nBenshi mubaturage ba Nuba binjijwemu gisirikare n\u2019inyeshyamba zomuri Sudani zishinzwe kwibohora abaturage mugihe cy\u2019intambara ya kabiri ya Sudani. Abandi bavuye mungozabo ubu baba munkambi z'impunzi.\nArthur Howes yazanye documentaire yeyambere, Inkuru ya Kafi, yerekabantu ba Nuba babamu nkambi y'impunzi muri Kenya.\nNyuma, mu 2002, \"Ibiganiro bya Nuba\" byashyikirijwe icyicaro cy\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye i Nairobi kumpande zagizuruhare muri ayomakimbirane. Bikekwa koyagize uruhare runini mukwihutisha inzira y'amahoro. "}
{"id": "20504", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20504", "title": "Fatwa (film ya 2018)", "text": "Fatwa ni filme yo muri Tuniziya yakozwe mu mwaka wa 2018 iyobowe na Mahmoud Ben Mahmoud ndetse afatanije na Habib Ben Hedi, Jean-Pierre Dardenne, na Luc Dardenne. Umukinnyi w'imena ni Ahmed Hafiane hamwe na Ghalia Benali, Sarra Hannachi, Jamel Madani, na Mohamed Maghlaoui mu bandi bakinnyi bagaragayemo. Iyi filime ishingiye ku mugabo Brahim Nadhour uba ugarutse muri Tunis avuye mu Bufaransa agasanga mbere y'uko umuhungu we Marouane apfa yarakoreraga umutwe wa kisilamu ukomeye. \nIyi Filme yerekanwe bwa mbere muri Festival ya Carthage ya 2018. yabaye filme yakiriwe bitandukanye harimo n'ibitekerezo binenga kandi yerekanwe mu bihugu byinshi by\u2019Abarabu ndetse no mu bindi bihugu by\u2019iburengerazuba. kandi icyo gihe 2018 mu iserukirammuco rya Cairo International Film Festival iyi filme yatsindiye ibihembo 2 aribyo: Arab Cinema's Horizons Award ya Prix Saad Eldin Wahba kubwa Filme nziza ndetse na filme nziza y'Abarabu, Muri uwo mwaka kandi yatsindiye ibihembo bibiri mu iserukiramuco ryo muri Carthage Film Festival aribyo: Icy'umukinnyi witwaye neza muri fiction filme ndetse na Tanit d'Or ya Filme ifite onkuru nziza. Mu mwka 2019 iyi filme yahataniye ibihembo mu iserukiramuco rya Malmo Arab Film Festival mu bihembo bya Jury Award kuri filme mpimbano nziza. Filime ry\u2019Abarabu rya Malm\u00f6 igihembo cya Jury Award kubera Filime nziza. "}
{"id": "20505", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20505", "title": "Jangi Jollof", "text": "Jangi Jollof ni filme yo muri Gambiya yakozwe mu mwaka wa 2018 ishingiye kuri Memoire yanditswe na Momodou Sabally wahoze ari umunyamabanga mukuru akaba na minisitiri w\u2019ibikorwa bya perezida mu gihugu cya Gambia. Iyi filme yerekana ahanini amateka y'ubuzima bwa Sabally n'ingorane yaciyemo kugirango agere ku gutsinda mu buzima. iyi filme yakozwe kandi iyoborwa na Bakary Sonko.\nInkuru ya Filme.\nUmusore ukora cyane ngo yiyigishe ibyo yari kwiga muri kaminuza kuberako aturuka mu muryango ukennye, yabereye benshi urugero agaragaza impinduka muri societe ndetse no mu gihugu cye muri rusange, aho abato bamukurikizaga bitewe n'inkuru y'ubuzima bwe.\nIbihembo.\nMu bihembo byihariye byo mu mwaka wa 2028 byitwa Special Movie Awards (SMA) \"Jangi Jollof\" yatsindiye ibihembo bibiri aribyo: kimwe cy'umukinnyi mwiza cyatwawe na Monica Davies, ndetse na Momodou Sabally atsindira icy'inkuru nziza."}
{"id": "20506", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20506", "title": "Kapiteni Singrid", "text": "Kapiteni Singrid (Igifaransa: Capitaine Singrid) ni filime yogutangaza yakozwe mu 1968 ihagarariwe na Jean Leduc abakinnyibari Elga Andersen, Robert Woods na Giorgia Moll. Yakozwe mubufatanye hagati y'Ubufaransa, Ubutaliyani na Porutugali. amashusho yafatiwe muri Angola."}
{"id": "20507", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20507", "title": "Keepers of Memory", "text": "Keepers of Memory ni filme mpamo (filme documentaire) yakozwe mu mwaka wa 2004 iyobowe n'Umunyarwanda ukora filme Eric Kabera. ni inkuru igaruka ku ngaruka n'ihungabana ku bantu biboneye ibyabereye mu Rwanda i 1994 mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nIncamake.\nMuri iyi fulme mpamo hagaragaramo inzirakarengane n'abagizweho ingaruka za Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nImitunganyirize ya filme.\nN'kuko umutwe w'iyi filme ubivuga, Abagaragara muri iyi nkuru mpamo ni abita ku mva zishyinguye imibiri no ku nzibutso zo mu Rwanda, Aho niho hatubitse amateka y'ukuri azahoraho kuri jenoside yabereye mu rwanda iyabikiye urungano rw'ahazaza.\nIyerekanwa.\n\"Keepers of Memory\" yerekanwe mu iserukiramuco ryo muri 2004 rya Toronto International Film Festival.\nkandi yanerekanwe mu iserukiramuco rya Filime ryo ku nshuro ya 5 ryitwa Jewish Film Festival y'i Zagreb muri Korowasiya yabaye mu mwaka wa 2011 mu mwaka 2020 yerekanwa mu iserukiramuco rya Fribourg International Film Festival ryabereye i Fribourg mu Busuwisi."}
{"id": "20508", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20508", "title": "Muri Okavango", "text": "Muri Okavango ni film ya documentaire y'American National Geographic yakozwemuri 2018 yanditswe, ihagarariwena Neil Gelinas.] \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b Filime yafatiwemuri Angola na Botswana. Yasohotse kwitariki 22 Mata 2018 ishimwacyane mukwerekana inyamaswa zomugasozi. Yerekanwe muminsi mikurumpuzamahanga ya firime kandi yatsindiye ibihembo byinshi. \nInyandiko.\nUmuhanga mubuzimabwo kubungabungibidukikije ahuzibihuru byinzuzi atinyagutakaza amateka ye hamwe numusore wifuza siyanse utazineza ejo hazaza he. Bagira uruhare mu rugendo rukomeye ruzenguruka ibihugu bitatu mu gihe cy'amezi ane binyuze ahantu nyaburanga hadakorewe ubushakashatsi buteyakaga, bagamije kurinda inyamaswa zo muri Botswana no kubungabunga Delta ya Okavango, umurage ndangamurage wa UNESCO. "}
{"id": "20509", "revid": "16253", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20509", "title": "Kinshasa Makambo", "text": "Kinshasa Makambo ni filme mbarakuri (filme documentaire) yo muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, yayobowe na Dieudo Hamadi iza gusohoka mu mwaka wa 2018. Iyi filme igaruka ku nkuru y'ukuri y'abagabo 3 baharaniraga demokarasi mu myigaragambyo yabaye muri 2016 idashyigikiye perezida. \nIyi filme yerekanwe bwa mbere ku ya 18 Gashyantare 2018 Mu iserukiramuco rya 68 rya. Filme yatsindiye igihembo cya Tim Hetherington muri Sheffield DocFest ya 2018 na True Vision Award yakuye mu iserukiramuco rya yo mu mwaka wa 2018."}
{"id": "20510", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20510", "title": "Urutonde rwa filme zakozwe kuri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda", "text": "\u00a0Uru ni urutonde ni rwa filme, ibihangano bishushanyije, amakinamico yakinnwe, ndetse n'inkuru mbarakuri zakozwe kuri jenoside yo mu Rwanda yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Mu mwaka wa 2005 yanditse ko nyuma y'imyaka cumi n'umwe Jenoside ibaye, Abakurikirana filme zayikozweho bariyongereye cyane yagize ati: \"Ni ugukwirakwiza no kumenyekanisha ukuri ku mahano yatwaye ubuzima bw'Abatutsi barenga miliyoni bishwe\" "}
{"id": "20511", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20511", "title": "Adire (film)", "text": "Adire ni filime yo muri Nigeriya yasohotse mu 2023 iyobowe na Adeoluwa Owu ikaba irimo abakinnyi nka Kehinde Bankole, Ishami rya Femi na Layi Wasabi. Iyi filime ifite amasaha abiri n'iminota itatu kandi yasohotse muri sinema hirya no hino muri Nijeriya ku filime yongerewe muri Netflix muri Mutarama 2024, \nIncamake ya Filime ya Adire.\nFilimi ya Adire yitiriwe umwana w'umukobwa witwaga Adire yakoraga umwuga w'uburaya igihe kirekire kandi akaba yarashakaga kubuvamo akagenda, ariko shebuja, Kapiteni, akamwangira. Umunsi umwe nijoro, yaje kwitwara neza ku mukiriya maze asaba Kapiteni kumureka, ariko amwemeza ko azagumaho. Umunsi umwe, Adire yatwaye amafaranga ya Kapiteni ahungira mu mujyi muto wa Oyo. Agezeyo, akora umwuga wo gushushanya kuko zarizo nzozi zo gushushanya imideri ndetse n'imyenda y'abagore. Mu mujyi yatuyemo, ijoro rimwe Adire yagiye mu kabari kamwe, abantu babonye ubwiza bwe n imyambarire ye itinyutse, bikurura abagabo bo mumujyi baza kumureba buri kanya. Ibi byababaje abakirisitu bo mumujyi. Adire ahanganye n'inzangano z'abagore b'itorero no gusurwa biteye akaga na Kapiteni, Adire yasanze ari mu kaga gashobora gusenya ibintu byose yari yarubatse kandi akora cyane.\nUko filimi ya Adire yakiriwe.\nShola-Adido Oladotun wo muri \"Premium Times\" yavuze ko iyi filime yashyizwemo imbaraga ku miterere yayo arc kandi inashimangira isomo ryo \"gukunda mugenzi wawe nk'uko wikunda\" kandi itegeko rya \"ntuzacira urubanza\". Yagaragaje kandi ko filime yoroshye guhanura kandi ikayiha amanota 5/10 nurangiza. "}
