{"id": "20513", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20513", "title": "Sidonie Panache", "text": "Sidonie Panache ni filime yogusetsa amateka y\u2019Abafaransa yakozwe mu 1934 ihagarariwe na Henry Wulschleger abakinnyibari Florelle, Bach na Alexandre Mihalesco. amashushoyafatiwe muri Alijeriya. Amashusho ya firime yateguwe numuyobozi wubuhanzi Marcel Magniez. Byari bishingiye kuri operetta yumutwe umwe. Nibimwe mubisohoka cyane mubufaransa muruwo mwaka. \nInyandiko.\nMu 1842 mugihe cyokwigarurira Alijeriya, Sidonie Panache yihinduyenka Zouave kugirango aherekezumukunziwe woherejwe gukorerayo."}
{"id": "20514", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20514", "title": "After 30 Film", "text": "After 30 ni firime ikozwe muburyo bwa ikinamico yo muri Nigeriya ikaba yarasohotse mu 2025 iyobowe na Momo Spaine ikorwa na Ronke Ayeni kuri Studiyo ya Nemsia. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo abakinnyi nka Damilola Adegbite, Beverly Naya, Meg Otanwa, na Anee Icha mu bakinnyi bakomeye, hamwe na OC Ukeje na Patrick Doyle. Yasohotse ku isi yose binyuze kuri Video ya Amazone Prime ku ya 9 Gicurasi \nIyi filime inyura kuri televiziyo yo muri Nijeriya ikaba yarasohotse mu mwaka wa 2015 \"Mbere ya 30\", ihitana ubuzima bw'abagore bane bahuje imyaka mirongo itatu, ubu ikaba irimo gukemura ibibazo bishya nk'uburumbuke, ubutane, umunaniro ukabije, ndetse no gukura kwawe. \nUmugambi.\n\"After 30 iyi filimi\" ikomeje urugendo rw'abagore bane bafite imbaraga - Temi, Nkem, Aisha, na Ama - ubu bafite imyaka mirongo itatu kandi batuye i Lagos, muri Nijeriya. Ntabwo bigisobanurwa nubwoko bwo gushyingirwa, bahura nicyiciro gishya cyubuzima cyuzuyemo ibintu bigoye: umubano utoroshye, imyuga ihindagurika, igitutu cyabaturage hafi yuburumbuke, no gushakisha ibyasohozwa.\nBinyuze mu ndimi za Temi, urukundo rutagira ibyiringiro ruhura nakazi ndetse, guhindura umwuga yakoraga, film irasobanura insanganyamatsiko yo kwisubiraho kugiti cyawe, gukira amarangamutima, hamwe nibisobanuro bigenda bihinduka byibyishimo, intsinzi, nubugore. Mugihe buri mutegarugori ahanganye numutekano muke no guhindura ibyifuzo, After \"30\" filimi ibaye inkuru yerekana imyaka-y-imyaka yerekana uko bigenda iyo igihe cyagenwe n'ibiteganijwe guhinduka.\nuburyo yakozwe.\n\"After 30\" Filimi yakozwe na Nemsia Studios, uruganda rukora ibicuruzwa muri Nigeriya. Iyi studio nayo iri inyuma yicyubahiro nka \"Umwuka wubuzima\", \"Mbere ya 30\", hamwe \"nImana Ihamagara\". Iyi filime yerekana Momo Spaine yerekanwe bwa mbere mu buyobozi, nyuma yo gukora nka producer kuri \"Banana Island Ghost\" (2017) na \"The Wait\" (2021). \nUburyo yasohotse nu uburyo yakiriwe.\nIyi filime yerekanwe kuri Video ya Amazone Prime ku ya 9 Gicurasi 2025, ikaba yaragize agahigo ko gucuruzwa cyane, itangira ku mwanya wa mbere muri Nijeriya mu masaha 24 isohotse. Yagumanye imyanya icumi yambere kumurongo wicyumweru cyose. Abari bateraniye aho bashimye byimazeyo amarangamutima menshi, imiterere ikomeza kuva \"mbere ya 30\", hamwe no kwerekana ukuri kw\u2019umugore wo muri Nijeriya. \nIsano na After \"30\".\n\"After 30\" ni filimi yakomeje kunyura ku ma televiziyo yo muri Nijeriya \"After30\", rwerekanwe mu 2015. Urukurikirane rw'umwimerere rwakurikiranye abakobwa bane b'abakobwa i Lagos ubwo begereye amateka y\u2019imibereho y'abashakanye mbere y\u2019imyaka 30. \"Nyuma yo gusubiramo 30\" bafite imico imwe nyuma yimyaka, basuzuma ubwihindurize mu mibereho yabo nyuma y\u2019imyaka yabo, bafite ibibazo bishya by\u2019umuntu, bifitanye isano, ndetse n\u2019abaturage."}
{"id": "20515", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20515", "title": "Ajuwaya Film", "text": "Ajuwaya ni Filime yo muri Nigeriya yasohotse mu mwaka wa 2017 yakozwe kandi iyobowe na Tolu Awobiyi Lord Tanner. Filime Adventure ikinamo Timini Egbuson, Lanre Hassan, Etinosa Idemudia, Kemi Lala Akindoju na Rahama Sadau. \nInyandiko.\nIyi filime irazenguruka abanyamuryango batandatu b\u2019igihugu gishinzwe ibikorwa by\u2019urubyiruko boherejwe kandi inagaragara muri Nijriya ahazwi nka leta ya Osun kubera ibikorwa byabo by\u2019urubyiruko. Inkuru yabaye ingorabahizi mugihe abanyamuryango ba corp bavuzwe bongeye kubyutsa ibibi bimaze igihe kinini mubaturage. \nUburyo yasohotse.\nIyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere mu gihugu hose ku ya 7 Nyakanga 2019. "}
{"id": "20516", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20516", "title": "Sandman (film ya 1932)", "text": "Sandman (Igifaransa: Le marchand de sable) ni filime y\u2019ikinamico yakozwe mu 1932 y\u2019Abafaransa ihagarariwena Andr\u00e9 Hugon abakinnyibari Jean Toulout, Kaissa Robba na Jean Worms. Yakorewe murisitudio ya Joinville ya Path\u00e9-Natan. amashusho yafatiwe iGharda\u00efa muri Alijeriya y'Abafaransa. Amashusho ya firime yateguwe numuyobozi wubuhanzi Christian-Jaque. Umutwe werekana igishushanyo mbonera cya Sandman.\nInyandiko.\nMugihe yakoraga mubirindiro byomuri Alijeriya y\u2019Abafaransa, liyetona yategetswe gukora iperereza kubyago byagwiririye abasirikare bagenzibe barwaye cyangwa baburiwirengero. Ibyo yavumbuye bimujyana munzitunzwe nu Burusiya bwera butangaje."}
{"id": "20517", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20517", "title": "Aki And Pawpaw Film", "text": "Aki and Pawpaw ni filime yo gusetsa yo muri Nijeriya 2010 ifatanije na Sitidiyo ya Play Network hamwe na Film One intertainment. Iyobowe na Biodun Stephen, yari remake ya firime ya Aki na Ukwa 2002 yakozwe na Chinedu Ikedieze na Osita Iheme. [[Yasohotse ku Ukuboza 2021, itangira kwerekana muri sinema mu gihugu hose ku ya 17 Ukuboza 2021.\nInyandiko.\nAki na Pawpaw kubwimpanuka baje kugera ahantu hari ubutunzi bifuzaga, binyuze muburiganya, none bagomba gukemura ibibazo bizanwa nubutunzi nicyamamare. "}
{"id": "20518", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20518", "title": "Akpe: Return of the Beast Film", "text": "Akpe: Return of the Beast, ni filime yo muri Nigeriya ikaba yarasohotse mu mwaka wa 2019 iyobowe na Toka McBaror kandi yakozwe na Justice Nuagbe. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo abakinnyi nka Jide Kosoko mu mwanya wa mbere mu gihe Juliet Ibrahim, Bolanle Ninalowo, Daniel Lloyd na Eniola Badmus bagize uruhare runini muriyi filimi. Filime izenguruka Akpe, uwiyita umwami wa Zanga aho inshuti ye magara itegura itsinda ryabahungu gutsinda umuhanda. \nIyi filime yakinywe kandi yerekanwe bwa mbere ku ya 27 Ukwakira 2019. "}
{"id": "20519", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20519", "title": "S.O.S Sahara", "text": "S.O.S Sahara ni filime yikinamico yakozwemu 1938 yomu Budage ihagarariwena Jacques de Baroncelli abakinnyibari Charles Vanel, Jean-Pierre Aumont na Marta Labarr. Filime yakozwe mururimi rw'igifaransa, yakozwe n\u2019ishami ry\u2019igifaransa ryasitidiyo yomu Budage UFA. amashusho yafatiwe muri Alijeriya. Amashusho yarashingiye kunkinamico \"Abagabo badafite amateka\" ya Jean Martet. Inguzanyo ya Martet yakuwe muri filime mugihe Abanazi bigaruriye Ubufaransa. Nyumayaje kuzanikirego murukiko UFA kugirango yongere kwerekana uburenganzirabwe kuri filime. \nYasubiwemo mu 1962 nka \"Sitasiyo ya gatandatu-Sahara\". "}
{"id": "20521", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20521", "title": "Mami Wata (film)", "text": "Mami Wata ni filime yakozwe mu 2023 yabirabura nabazungu. filime yanditswe inayoborwa na CJ \"Fiery\" Obasi, ishingiye kumigenzo y'Afrika y'uburengerazuba. Ni ubufatanye hagati ya Nijeriya, Ubufaransa n'Ubwongereza.\nIyi filime yerekanwe bwambere mw'Iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Sundance 2023, rikabarikintu cyagatatu Obasi yerekanagakuri Sundance. Mu Kwakira 2023, hatoranijwe kuba umukinnyi wo muri Nijeriya muri Filime Nziza Mpuzamahanga Yamamaye mu bihembo bya 96 bya Osama na Komite yabayobozi bomuri Nijeriya (NOSC). Yatowemucyiciro cyiza cya Filime Cyiza cya 39 cyigenga cya Spirit Independent Awards, nomucyiciro cy\u2019indashyikirwa mpuzamahanga cyerekana amashusho ya 55 ya NAACP Image Awards. \nAbakinnyi.\nObasi yazanye bwambere atangira gutezimbere \"Mami Wata\" mu 2016. Amaze kwandika imishinga mike, yitabiriye laboratoire nyinshi zifasha gutunganya ibyanditswe. Mukiganiro na CNN, Obasi yavuzeko \"yashakaga gukora filime ya hyper-stylized\" ifitimiterere yashinzimizi, abifashijwemo n\u2019abakinnyi ba firime akunda nka Akira Kurosawa na David Lynch. Inyuguti Prisca na Zinwe bahumekewe na bashiki banyakwigendera Obasi. Ibigo bitangumusaruro bifatanye na \"Mami Wata\" birimo Isosiyete ikora firime ya Obasi, Studiyo ya Guguru, Itangazamakuru rya Palmwine, Ikigega cy\u2019Ubusuwisi Vision Sud Est na Ifind Ifoto y\u2019Ubufaransa. \nIfoto nyamukuru yafatiwe mumidugudu ya Benin yomucyaro ipfunyika muri Mutarama \nKwakira.\nMu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Sundance, umukinnyi wa sinema L\u00edlis Soares yatsindiye igihembo kidasanzwe cy\u2019abacamanza mumarushanwa mpuzamahanga ya Dramatike ku isi ya sinema. Yatwayibihembo bitatu muri FESPACO - Prix de la Critique Paulin S. Vieyra (Igihembo cya African Critics Award), Meilleure Image (Cinematography Award) na Meilleur D\u00e9cor (Set Design Award). Yaguzwe na Dekanalog kugirangwikwirakwizwe. \nIgisubizo gikomeye.\nKu isuzuma ryakozwe na Rotten Tomatoes, iyi filime yemewe 97% yemewehashingiwe kubisubizo 38, abayinengaga bemejeko \"Muburyo butangaje \"Mami Wata\" yakoresha palette kugirango yerekane isi ishimishije, imezenk'inzozi.\" \n\"Umunyamakuru wa Hollywood\" abisobanura nk'inkuru ishimishije nubushakashatsi bukomeye \"\u200b\"\u200b\"\u200b\" Ikinyamakuru \"Los Angeles Times\" cyagize kiti: \"Ubwoburinganire hagati y'abazungu n'abirabura nuburyo Obasi ashimangira cyane insanganyamatsiko zezose: kwizera n'ibimenyetso, imigenzo n'ibigezweho, ku isi yose. ' \"Mami Wata\" gutanga nogufata.\" \"Ikinyamakuru Wall Street Journal\" cyavuzeko \"Inyandiko ya Bwana Obasi yazamuye imigenzo ya rubanda mukuyishiramo muburyo bwihishe mubitekerezo bya politiki ndetse nokureba kugitsinagore n'imbaraga z'abagabo.\" Isuzuma ryakozwe na \"New York Times\" Critic's Pick ryagize riti: \"Muri \"Mami Wata\", archetypes zitamenyerewe, zikora kugirango iyi filime yomuri Nijeriya ibigihangano cy\u2019ubukungu.\" Matt Zoller Seitz womuri \"RogerEbert.com\" mwisubiramorye, yayihaye inyenyeri enye (isumba izindi) agira ati: \"Filime itera amarozi, kandi amarozi akomeza kugeza ku mperuka.\" filime Sean Baker yise imwe muri filime akunda mu 2023."}
{"id": "20522", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20522", "title": "Ubwami bw'inzovu muri Afurika", "text": "Ubwami bw'inzovu muri Afurika ni filime ya IMAX yakozwe mu 1998 yerekana iminsi y'ubuzima bw'inzovu zomur'Afurika. Filime yakozwe numuyoboro wa Discovery binyuze muri discovery pictures. Iyi filime yashyizwe muri Tanzaniya na Kenya, ikavugwa n'inzovu yitwa \"Old Bull\" (yumvikanye na Avery Brooks). Filime yayobowe na Michael Caulfield. "}
{"id": "20523", "revid": "18593", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20523", "title": "008: Igikorwa cyo Kurimbura", "text": "008: Igikorwa cyo Kurimbura (Italian) ni filime y'ibikorwa byo mu 1965 yakorewe mu Butaliyani / Abanyamisiri Eurospy ihagarariwe kandi yanditswe na Umberto Lenzi amashusho afatirwa muri Misiri hamwe no Busuwisi. Yakinwemo na Ingrid Schoeller nka Agent 008, hamwe na Alberto Lupo ari umukozi 006. \nAbakinnyi.\nInkomoko: "}
{"id": "20524", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20524", "title": "Ibirori bitatu byumugabane", "text": "Iserukiramuco rya gatatu (Igifaransa: \"Festival des 3 Continents\") n'iserukiramuco rya firime ngarukamwaka riba guheramu 1979 i Nantes, mu Bufaransa, ryeguriwe sinema zomuri Aziya, Afurika, na Amerika y'Epfo. Yashinzwe na Philippe na Alain Jalladeau. Igihembo cyambere mumarushanwa yibirori ni Montgolfiere d'or imezenka ballon. Kubufatanye n\u2019iri serukiramuco ni Produire au Sud (\"Producer of the South\"), umushinga utanginkunga mu gutunganya amafilime yigenga yaturutse muri Aziya, Afurika, na Amerika y'Epfo. "}
{"id": "20525", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20525", "title": "Hirya no hino mu butayu", "text": "Hirya no hino mu butayu (German) ni filime ya Badage yo mu 1936 yobowe na Johann Alexander H\u00fcbler-Kahla ikinwamo na Fred Raupach, Heinz Evelt hamwe na Aruth Wartan. ishingiye ku gitabo cyanditswe na Karl May. Nibwo bwa mbere amajwi ahuzwa n\u2019igitabo cya May, kandi ni cyo cyonyine cyakozwe mu gihe cy\u2019Abanazi. Yisanze mu Bwami bwa Ottoman mu kinyejana cya cumi n'icyenda, yerekana urukurikirane rw'urugendo rw'ubushakashatsi bw'abagenzi aribo Kara Ben Nemsi na Hadschi Halef Omar.\namashusho yafatiwemuri Egiputa, no kuri Sitidiyo ya Johannisthal mu mugi wa Berlin"}
{"id": "20526", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20526", "title": "Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Sinema na Audiovisual yu Burundi", "text": "Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema na Audiovisual yu Burundi (FESTICAB) ni iserukiramuco rya firime ngarukamwaka riberamu Burundi.\nFESTICAB yashinzwe n\u2019umuyobozi wa firime L\u00e9once Ngabo mumwakawa 2009. Igizwe n\u2019amarushanwa mubyiciro bitatu: filime zi Burundi, filime zomur'Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba na filime mpuzamahanga. \nMuri FESTICAB 2011 yashinzwe umuyoboro wa firime wo muri Afrika yuburasirazuba (EAFN). FESTICAB 2015 yarekeyegukorwa kuber\u2019imyigaragambyo yabaga birukanubutegetsibwa Perezida Nkurunziza yiyamamarizaga kuyobora manda ya gatatu, hagombaguhagarikwa ibintu byinshi. "}
{"id": "20527", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20527", "title": "Umunsi mukuru cin\u00e9mas d'Afrique Lausanne", "text": "Iserukiramuco cin\u00e9mas d'Afrique Lausanne niserukiramuco mpuzamahanga ribaburimwaka ribamuri Kanama ryabereye i Lausanne mu Busuwisi, guhera 2006 ryerekana filime nshyazivuga cyangwa zituruka mur'Afurika. \nIriserukiramuco ryateguwe n\u2019umuryango w\u2019umuryango w'Afrique cin\u00e9mas ikubiyemo ibihangano bya sinema na TV mubyiciro byose birimibihimbano, documentaire, animasiyo, hamwe n'ukuri Yatewinkunga n'abafatanyabikorwa batandukanye, nk'umujyi wa Lausanne, canton yomu Busuwisi ya Vaud, Umuryango Internationale de la Francophonie, Fondation Sandoz Family na Loterie romande\u00a0[fr ; de], Ubufindo bwa Romandy. uwerekanye yari Archive Film yo mu Busuwisi (Cin\u00e9math\u00e8que suisse) kuri Casino de Montbenon i Lausanne. "}
{"id": "20528", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20528", "title": "Ana wa Banati", "text": "Ana wa Banati (Arabic, Icyongereza: Abakobwa banjye nanjye cyangwa njye na abakobwa banjye) ni filime yabanya Misiri yo mu 1961 yakinwemo na Salah Zulfikar, Nahed Sherif hamwe na Zaki Rostom. Iyi filime yanditswe kandi ihagararirwa na Hussein Helmy El-Mohandess, ikagaragaramo itsinda rigizwe na abakinnyi barimo Amaal Farid, Fayza Ahmed na Zahret El-Ola. \nUmugambi.\nSamir yari umuhehesi, ahura na Maysa aramukunda nawe aramukunda, ariko ntiygera abwira se ibijyanye umubano we. Se ni umugabo ushakisha ariko agashobora kurera abakobwa be bane neza, ariko ntiyashobora kubona amafaranga ahagije kugirango bitegure kurushinga, kandi yohererejwe pansiyo, umwe munatubuzi batwa amafaranaga. Se yoherejwe mu bitaro biturutse ku mpanuka, abakobwa be bakora kugira ngo bumve ubuzima. Umwe muribo akora nkumuririmbyi muri salle, uwa kabiri akora nkicyitegererezo, uwa gatatu yandika inkuru kandi ashima umwanditsi ukomeye akamufat nka we, naho uwa kane Maysa aguma murugo. Se yarazi imiterere yabo ahitamo kugumakure yabo. Maysa yakundaga Samir bagirana ibibazo, ahitamo kwiyahura arapfa. Ibyago bisubiza se gusubira guhuza umuryango."}
{"id": "20529", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20529", "title": "Iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Cambridge", "text": "Iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Cambridge (CAFF) niserukiramuco rya firime ny'Afurika muri Cambridge. Iriserukiramuco ryashinzwe mu 2002, ribaburimwaka mu Kwakira cyangwa Ugushyingo. Nibirori birebire bya firime mur'Afrika mubwongereza. \nAmateka.\nIserukiramuco rya Filime rya Cambridge ryatangijwe muri 2002 nitsindarito ryabanyeshuri barangije muri kaminuza ya Cambridge, harimo na Lindiwe Dovey. \nCAFF ya 11 yafunguwe kwitariki 10 Ugushyingo 2012 hamwe na filime yomuri Kenya \"Nairobi Half Life\". ibirori byamaze iminsi 7, banerekana film ya Senegal \"La Pirogue\". yakozwe muri 2013 CAFF yifatanyijenandi mwiserukiramuco ny'Afurika mu Bwongereza - Afurika muri Motion i Edinburgh / Glasgow, Afrika Eye muri Bristol na Film Africa i Londres - kugirango basangire ubumenyi mugukugukora amafilime. CAFF ya 12 yabayekuva ku ya 3 kugeza ku ya 7 Ugushyingo 2013, herekanwe filime zirimo \"Ikintu cya ngombwa\" cya Judy Kibinge na \"Tey\" ya Alain Gomis. CAFF ya 13 yafunguwe ku ya 1 Ugushyingo 2014 hamwe na \"Timbuktu\" ya Abderrahmane Sissako. CAFF ya 14 yabaye kuva ku kugeza ku ya 24 Ukwakira 2015. Muri filime harimo filime yo muri Afurika y'Epfo \"Ayanda\". CAFF ya 15 yabaye kuva ku kugeza 27 Ukwakira \"2016\". "}
{"id": "20530", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20530", "title": "Umwanzi Ukundwa (film 1955)", "text": "Umwanzi Ukundwa (German) ni filime y\u2019amateka yo muBudage yakinwe mu 1955 ihagarariwe na Rolf Hansen igaragaramo Ruth Leuwerik, Werner Hinz hamawena Thomas Holtzmann. filme ishingiye kuri Fashoda incident yo mu 1898 \nAmashusho ya filime yateguwe numuyobozi wubuhanzi Robert Herlth. yafatiwe amashuho muri sitidiyo ya Bavaria muri Munich, hamwe no gufata amashusho byabereye muri Cairo na Saqqara.\nInyandiko.\nMumujyi wa Sudani wegeranye na Nile, konseye w\u2019Ubwongereza yashishikarije umugore we kumenyana na Serija wo mugice cy\u2019amahanga cy\u2019Ubufaransa yizeye ko umugore we ashobora kumenya ibijyanye na gahunda zagisirikare cyabafaransa muri ako karere."}
{"id": "20531", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20531", "title": "Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime Cabo Verde", "text": "Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Cabo Verde (CVIFF) niserukiramuco rya firime muri Cape Verde ryashinzwe bwambere mu 2010. \nKuva muri Nzeri 2018 filime zirenga hafi 200 zimaze kwerekanwa muriryoserukiramuco nubwo CVIFF yakiriye filime zatanzwe nibindi bihugu nyinshimurizo zituruka muricyogihugu \nUbuyobozi.\nUmuyobozi mukuruwa CVIFF ni Suely Neves. Yarangijemuri kaminuza ya Massachusetts Amherst, yanditsimpamyabumenyi ihanitse ya SIT Graduate Institute kuri politiki yokohereza Cape Verde. Yabayumuyobozi w'umushinga mumuryango mpuzamahanga ushinzwe abimukira akabanumuhuzabikorwa wa basketball 3x3. \nAmateka.\nIserukiramuco rya firime ryerekanwe bwambere mu Kwakira 2010 i Espargos, Sal. Mugihe cyatekerejweho muri 2008, igitekerezo cyumunsimukuru wa firime cyarasubitswe kuberikibazo cy'ubukungu mumwaka wa 2008. Ibiroribyambere herekanwe firime eshanu zose Neves yavuzekwari intangiriro nziza kubirori bishya byateguwe. Murikiriya gihe, CVIFF ntiyashoboye kubona inkunga mu bucuruzi cyangwa mu mashyirahamwe y\u2019umuco, ibyo bikaba byakomeza kuba ikibazo byibuze mu myaka itatu iri imbere. \nMuri 2014, byavuzweko umukinnyiwa firime wa Hollywood Mike Costa azitabira CVIFF yuwo mwaka nkumujyanama hamwe n\u2019abagize inteko. iserukiramuco ryafatanije n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abanenga amafilime n\u2019abanyamerika kugirangobongere abanyamerika bitabira. "}
{"id": "20532", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20532", "title": "A Sunday on Kigali", "text": "A Sunday in Kigali (izwi mu gifaransa nka: \"Un dimanche \u00e0 Kigali\") Ni filimi yo muri Canada yakozwe muri 2006 Igaruka kubyabaye mu Rwanda mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi 1994. Yayobowe na iyi filime yakozwe ishingiye ku gitabo \"\" cya.\nInkuru ya Filme.\nbernard Valcourt utunganya filime mbarankuru akaba n'umunyamakuru, yerekeje i Kigali gukora kuri filime mbarankuru kuri ariko ahageze. yisanga mu mivurungano y'ibihe bitari byoroshye byari hagati y'Abahutu n'Abatutsi byaganishije kuri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Mu gihe yamaze muri H\u00f4tel des Mille Collines, Valcourt akundana n'umukobwa mwiza, wagiraga isoni wakiraga abakiriya witwa Gentille. Gentille uwo niwe wakiraga abadipolomate, abayobozi, na ba burugumesitiri bakundaga kuza kuri pisine buri cyumweru. Mu gihe urukundo Valcourt yakundaga Gentille rwiyongeraga igihugu cyari mu ntambara y'ubutita, ivukamo Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi 1994 irabatanya. Amezi make ashize Bernard Valcourt agaruka mu Rwanda atitaye kubyari biri kuba gushakisha Gentille yakunze. Ibyinshi mu byerekanwe bigenda bisubira inyuma. \nGusohoka.\n\"A Sunday in Kigali\" yinjije miliyoni 1.1 z'amadolari y'Abanyakanada muri Qu\u00e9bec mu mpeshyi ya 2006, ku ya 23 Nzeri 2006 nibwo yerekanwe ku banya-canada bavuga Icyongereza. amashusho n'imigozi yabaye uburyo bwiza mu bindi bice. \nUko yakiriwe.\nBox office.\nMu byumweru umunani igisohoka, Filime yakozwe kuri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda ya Robert Favreau ni yo filime ya mbere ya Qu\u00e9becois yo muri 2006 yatsindiye ku kigero cya Million 1 y'amadorali muri CAN. \nIcyo yavuzweho.\nKuri Rotten Tomatoes, iyi filime ifite igipimo cya 88% hashingiwe ku bitekerezo 59 byayikorewe. \nku zindi mbuga bayivuzeho ko: \"ari filime idasanzwe, ifite intego nziza ikora ku marangamutima ya muntu n'imitekerereze ye.\" yahaye iyi filime amanota 2 kuri 4, agira ati \"\"Dore ikintu cyagutera agahinda ukarizwa n'inkuru y'urukundo... ndetse n'abantu ibihumbi n'amagana barimo kwicwa agashinyaguro bitewe no kutita ku nshingano za bamwe\".\" Umwanditsi wa Robert Koehler na we yayihaye inyenyeri 2 kuri 4 maze agira ati: \"Pic rwose yakoze ikintu cyagatangaza, yerekanye mu gihe cy\u2019ubwicanyi bukabije bwo mu minsi 100 n'ibyakurikiye nyuma yayo.\" \nAmashimwe.\nKuva yasohoka, iyi filime yahataniye mu maserukiramuco 42 n'ibihembo. \n 2006 Marrakech International Film Festival - Umukinnyi mwiza ()\n 2007 Genie Awards - Igihembo cy'inkuru nziza yakuwe mu gitabo (,)\n 2007 Jutra Awards - Igihembo cya filme ifite amajwi meza (, na Marie-Claude Gagn\u00e9)\n 2006 Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Marrakech - Inyenyeri ya Zahabu (Robert Favreau)\n 2007 Ibihembo bya Genie awards - filme ikoze neza (Lyse Lafontaine &amp; Michael Mosca)\n 2007 ibihembo bya Genie - Best costume design (Mich\u00e8le Hamel)\n 2007 ibihembo bya Genie - Best directing (Robert Favreau)\n 2007 ibihembo bya Genie - best lead actor (Luc Picard)\n 2007 ibihembo bya Genie - best lead actress (Fatou N'Diaye)\n 2007 ibihembo bya Genie - best sound (Hans Peter Strobl, Jo Caron, Claude La Haye, Benoit Leduc, Bernard Gari\u00e9py Strobl)\n 2007 ibihembo bya Genie - best sound editing (Marie-Claude Gagn\u00e9, Guy Francoeur, Claire Pochon, Jean-Philippe Savard)\n 2007 Jutra Awards 2007 - Filime nziza (Lyse Lafontaine &amp; Michael Mosca)"}
{"id": "20533", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20533", "title": "Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Aswan", "text": "Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga ry\u2019amafirime y\u2019abagore (AIWFF) ryashinzwe mumwaka wa 2017 n\u2019umwanditsi w\u2019umunyamisiri Mohamed Abdel Khalek. Niserukiramuco ryambere ngarukamwaka rya Egiputa ryibanzekubibazo by\u2019abagore n\u2019abakora amafilime, hibandwagaku Misiri nomukarere kagari ka MENA. Niwomunsi mukuru wambere mpuzamahanga wabereye mu Misiri yoharuguru. \nAmateka.\nIriserukiramuco ryashinzwe mumwaka wa 2017rishingwana Mohamed Abdel Khalek, nikimwe mu bikorwa bya filime bya mbere bya Misiri. Ikorwa ku nkunga ya minisiteri y\u2019umuco, ubukerarugendo, n\u2019ubufatanye bw\u2019Abanyamisiri, ifatanyije n\u2019inama y\u2019igihugu y\u2019abagore, guverineri wa Aswan, na kaminuza ya Aswan, n\u2019abandi. \nAbdel-Khalek yavuzeko ibiroribifite inkingi enye: imurika rya firime zikemura ibibazo by\u2019abagore; ihuriro ryibibazo byabagore riteranya abarwanashyaka baturutse kwisi yose; amahugurwa kubakiri bato batojwegukina firime; n'ibikorwa byoguhuza abatunganya firime. \nIriserukiramuco rikurura abitabiriye igihugu ndetse n\u2019amahanga mubyamamare n\u2019abanyapolitiki nka Nelly Karim, Yosra El Lozy, Madeleine Tabar, Randa El Behery, Danny Glover, Barbara Bouchet, na Victoria Abril. \nBurigitabo cyubaha umugoreukomeye. Muriboharimo: Djamila Bouhired, umunyagihugukomoka mugihugu cya Alijeriya witwaje intagondwa warwanijubutegetsi bw'abakoloni b'Abafaransa, ku nshuro ya 2 muri 2018; Mohsena Tawfik, umukinnyi w'amafirime w'inararibonye wa filime na televiziyo byo mu Misiri, ku nshuro muri 2019;] ukomoka muri Siriya Kinda Alloush ku nshuro ya 9 mu 2025.\nKugezamu 2020, abanyeshuri barenga 250, abenshimuribo bakaba arabakobwa, bahuguwe mu mahugurwa y'ibirori. "}
{"id": "20534", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20534", "title": "Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime Amakula", "text": "Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime Amakula niserukiramuco rya firime ngarukamwaka ribera mur'Uganda ryashinzwe mumwaka wa 2004. Niserukiramuco rya filime rya kera rya Uganda ryashinzwe n\u2019umuhanga muby'amateka ya filime yomu Buholandi Alice Smits hamwe n\u2019umukinnyi wa filime w\u2019umunyamerika Lee Elickson. \nAmateka.\nIserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime Amakula Kampala ryabaye kwitariki 21 Gicurasi 2004. Iri serukiramuco ririmo Gahunda yokwerekana izagabanywa muguhitamo bishobora gusobanurwa nka: Sinema y'iki gihe Ubushakashatsi bwakozwe na firime zirihubu ku isi\nIriserukiramuco rigizwe n'amarushanwa, ibiganiro, amahugurwa n'amahugurwa n'ibindi bitaramo byinshi \nGusubira inyuma.\nIriserukiramuco ryasubiyinyuma cyane mumwaka wa 2012 nk'uko amakuru amwabitangaza ngo kubera impamvu z\u2019amafaranga ariko ryasubukuwe ku ya 16 Werurwe 2016 ku buyobozi bushya, riva muri Fondasiyo y\u2019umuco ya Amakula kugeza ubu ryatanzwe na Fondasiyo y\u2019umuco ya Bayimba. "}
{"id": "20535", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20535", "title": "Umunsi mukuru wa Massimadi", "text": "Iserukiramuco rya Massimadi niserukiramuco ngarukamwaka ry\u2019ubuhanzi n\u2019umuco i Montreal, muri Qu\u00e9bec, ryibanda kumuco wa LGBTQ ukomokamuri Afurika nomuri diaspora nyafurika. Yatangijwe mu 2009 n\u2019umukangurambaga Laurent Lafontant, ibirori birategura gahunda yo kwerekana imurikagurisha, kwerekanamafilime nokuganira kubaturage ba Black LGBTQ hamwe n\u2019insanganyamatsiko. \nMumwaka wa 2021, uyumuryango watangije kandi Massimadi en rue, ibiroribyo kumuhanda byateguwe bitandukanye nibirori. \nIbirori byakozwe kubufatanye n\u2019umukangurambaga wa LGBTQ wo muri Hayiti, Charlot Jeudy, byaribiteganijwe kobizatangizwa i Port-au-Prince mu 2016, ariko byahagaritswenyuma y\u2019iterabwoba ry\u2019ihohoterwa ry\u2019abigaragambyaga barwanya abaryamana bahuje ibitsina. \nIbirori byujuje ibisabwa kugirangwibihembo bya Kanada byerekanwe. "}
{"id": "20536", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20536", "title": "Kairo (filime 1963)", "text": "Cairo\u201d ni filime y\u2019abanyamerika yo mu rwego rw\u2019ibyaha yasohotse mu 1963. Irimo abakinnyi barimo George Sanders, Richard Johnson na Walter Rilla. Yayobowe na Wolf Rilla (umuhungu wa Walter Rilla) kandi yanditswe na Joan LaCour Scott. Yashyizwe ahagaragara ku wa 21 Kanama 1963 na sosiyete Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer.r.] \"[\" \u200b\nUmugambi.\nUwahoze umugisirikare Mubwongereza akaba ari na Majoro Pickering yagiye i kairo akoresheje pasiporo y'ibihimabano. yarimaze imyaka muri gereza mu Budage ategure umugambi wo kwiba imitako yumwamwi Tut munzu Ndangamurage yo muri Cairo\nYavuganye na Nicodemos, Umuyobozi wa kasino wihishe muigicucu cya murumuna wumuhanzi we wahoze ari mugenzi we, maze ashyira igisasu cye. Aratangaza ko heist yatinyutse azinjiza miliyoni enye mu mamadorari.\natangira kwegeranya agatsiko kugira ngo bakore umupango we. mu kugenzura utangirana numunyagihugu wizewe nuwahoze ari umusirikare Willy. Impuguke iturika kandi yigeze kuba \"box man\", ubu yashakanye numunyamisiri na se wumwana muto. Yanze kwinjiramo, yemezwa nini nini cyane kuvuga ngo oya gusezeranya $ 25.000.\nIcyingezi, nuko Majoro adafite amafaranga kandi akeneye abaterankunga. gayiye kureba Nikodemu, utanga igitekerezo cyo gukiza no gutunga Kuchuk, umutumiza mu mahanga-wohereza ibicuruzwa hanze ashobora gutera inkunga ako kazi ndetse no kujugunya imitako yacyo.\nKuchuk yarabyemeza, ariko amafaranga yiibanze avuye mugastiko kamabandi yarayamaze koherezwa Nikodimos muri ako kanya\nhari hakenewe umuntu witwaje ibunda, Majoro akurikizaho guha akazi Ali wumuzinzi, akazaba nkumushoferi uzabatwara abasohotse\nKerim yari azi muhinda, ariko Ali akihuta cyane kumanuka... atangiraguhigwa na polisi yaho,bashyirwa mu gihirahiro, hatuje kandi utitaye ku mukobwa wabyinaga mu nda Amina ubwo yerekanaga ko atwite mu byumba bye. Mu mibabaro ye, yibanze ku mushahara w'ubujura nk'amahirwe ye ya nyuma yo kugura umurima w'ibisheke yavukiye hanze y'umujyi no kunyeganyeza abadayimoni bo mu mujyi wa Cairo.\ndukurikije ingengabihe ya Majoro, itsinda ryabashinzwe umutekano ryinjiye mu nzu ndangamurage nkuko byari byapanzwe, ariko ku bw'impanuka impuruza irasakuza irabatamaza. Umuzamu arabikeka atangira kugenzura apfa kurasa, isasu rikubita Willy. akomereka cyane mu nda, abasbako bamugeza imihira\nMugihe Majoro na Ali bahageraga kuri uwo mugoroba bahura na Kuchuk, we na mugenzi we Ghattas bishimye cyane bagerageza gusuhuzanya. Mbahita barasa Ghattas aricwa na Ali arakomereka mu rubavu. Umujinya mwinshi kuri gambit no kumena amaraso, Majoro arasaba Kuchuk gusaba abapolisi amasezerano: amafaranga 200.000 $, cyangwa ubutunzi butagereranywa buzashongeshwa mubikoresho kugirango bijugunywe byoroshye.\nImitwe yibinyamakuru birasakuza, bitatangira gukomera. Nikodemu w'ikigwari aterwa ubwoba abwiza ukuri kose umuyobozi wa polisi, Karim arafungwa, Willy apfira mu rugo.\nUmurambo wa Ghattas ujugunywa mu ruzi,abapolisi batangira gucyeka Kuchuk mbere yuko agira icyo akora. ashyirwaho ingenza buri hamwe birangira yiyahuye\nAli ahungira mumujyi na jeep hamwe na Amina, maze Majoro yiyoberanya nkakavukire ajya mubwato bwomuri Nile.\nAgeze mu mudugudu yakuriyemo, guhinga nti bayhira Ali. Icyiza, apfira mumaboko ya Amina yizeraga cyane\nMajoro, wakundaga gushishoza, aburira mubwato yari yacikiyemo maze yisanga akikijwe n'abapolisi maze arafatwa afungirwa murigereza igihe kirekire, arafatwa nta kurwana.\nAbashoramari.\nIyi filime yahujije umustar, producer n\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019Umudugudu \"wa Damned\" (1960) kandi yakozwe binyuze muri MGM yo mu Bwongereza ikora ibicuruzwa iyobowe na Lawrence Bachmann. \nGufata amashusho byabaye hagati ya 1962 kandi birimo kurasa ahitwa Cairo."}
{"id": "20537", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20537", "title": "Iserukiramuco rya firime ya Halifax", "text": "Iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Halifax niserukiramuco ryaburimwaka muri Halifax, muri Nova Scotia. Bikorwamumpera za Gashyantare cyangwa muntangiriro za Werurwe buri mwaka, gahunda y'ibirori ihitamo filime zo muri Afurika, Karayibe, Abanyamerika n'Abirabura bo muri Kanada. \nIriserukiramuco ryatangijwe mumwaka wa 2017 na Fabienne Colas. Kubericyorezo cya COVID-19 ibiroribyateguwe kumurongo muri 2021 na 2022, mbereyo gusubira mumakinamico mu \nMumishinga y'iriserukiramuco harimo\"kuba Umwirabura muri Halifax\", gahundikora firime ngufi n\u2019abakinnyi ba firime b'abirabura bakizamuka bava muri Halifax, ikaberekana muri gahunda yihariye muririserukiramuco mbereyuko isohoka kuri Televiziyo ya CBC nk'uruhererekane rw'inyandiko. "}
{"id": "20538", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20538", "title": "Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime ya Karayibe", "text": "Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya CaribbeanTales niserukiramuco rya firime ngarukamwaka, rikorwa i Toronto, Ontario. Ibiroribirategura umurongo bihugu bya Karayibe, ndetse na firime zo muri diaspora ya Karayibe muri Kanada.\nIriserukiramuco ryatangijwe mumwaka wa 2006 n\u2019umukinnyi wa filime Frances-Anne Solomon, abinyujije mukigo cyegitunganya CaribbeanTales Media Group. Mumwaka wa 2009, iserukiramuco ryatangije ibirori byabashikibacu batandukanye kuri firime zurubyiruko, byateguwe mukwezi kwamateka yabirabura. Muri 2013, yashyize ahagaragara TV ya CaribbeanTales TV, videwo kuri serivisi isaba amasoko yagenewe firime ya Karayibe. \nUbusanzwe ibiroribyateguwe muri Royal Royal Sinema. Kubericyorezo cya COVID-19 muri Kanada, iserukiramuco rya 2020 ryateguwe kumurongo binyuze kuri TV ya CaribbeanTales. \nIriserukiramuco riterinkunga gahundaya incubator yogutera inkunga imishinga ya firime n\u2019abakinnyi ba firime bakizamuka muri diaspora ya Karayibe. "}
{"id": "20539", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20539", "title": "Amakimbirane (film ya 2016)", "text": "Gushyamirana ni filime ikinamico yakinwe mu cyarabu yo mu 2016 yakozwe ku rwego mpuzamahanga yanditswe kandi yayobowe na Mohamed Diab. Yatoranijwe bidasubirwaho n\u2019iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 2016 yabaye filime itangiza igice cy\u2019ibirori Un Certain Regard muri uwo mwaka yakorewemo. Yatoranijwe muri mu Misiri yose nka Filime nziza y\u2019ururimi rw\u2019amahanga mu bihembo bya 89 bya Osama ariko ntibyatoranijwe. Yatsindiye igihembo cya Filime nziza mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Kerala 2016. \nyerekana ikanavuga ku bya politiki byo muri Kamena 2013, iyi filime yafatiwe mu modoka y\u2019imodoka y\u2019abapolisi irimo abayoboke b\u2019abavandimwe b\u2019abayisilamu nabashyigikiye ingabo, ndetse nabandi bantu bo muri iyo mitwe. \nKwakira.\nFilime yagize amanota 93% ku Rotten Tomatoes bashingiye kuri 45 zasuzumwe. \nDeborah Young \"Umunyamakuru wa Hollywood\" avuga ko iyi filime \"izibukwa nk'imwe mu zivugwa cyane muri Egiputa ya none nyamara yafashwe amashusho\" kandi ngo \"ni umwimerere, akenshi uhungabanya cyane kureba\". \nJay Weissberg wo muri \"Variety\" yaranditse avuga ati \"ubu ni ugukora amafilime atanga ubutumwa bwo gutangiza ubutumwa ku kajagari n'ubugome (hamwe n'ubumuntu).\" \nTom Hanks yashimye iyi filime avuga ati: \"Niba hari uburyo ushobora kubona CLASH yakozwe numunya Misiri, Mohamed Diab, ugomba. Ugomba gusa. Filime izagutera umutima, ariko imurikire bose.\" "}
{"id": "20540", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20540", "title": "Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime ryabirabura", "text": "Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Montreal niserukiramuco rya firime ngarukamwaka i Montreal, muri Qu\u00e9bec, muri Kanada. rikorwa muri Nzeri burimwaka, gahunda y'ibirori yogutoranya filime nyafurika, Karayibe, Afurika y'Abanyamerika n'Abirabura bomuri Kanada. \nIbirori byatangijwe na Fabienne Colas mu 2005 mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Haiti, hibandwa cyane cyane kuri firime zomuri Hayiti. Yahinduwe izina mwiserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Montreal ryabereye i Montreal mumwaka wa 2010, ryagura intumbero yogushyiramo filime mpuzamahanga zomuri diaspora yose yomuri Afurika. Mu mwaka wa 2013, Colas yatangije kandi iserukiramuco rya Filime ry\u2019umukara rya Toronto ryabereye i Toronto, muri Ontario, kuvicyogihe yatangije iserukiramuco rya Filime ry\u2019umukara rya Halifax ndetse n\u2019iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Ottawa.\nKubera icyorezo cya COVID-19 muri Kanada, iserukiramuco rya 2020 ryerekanwe kumurongo wose. Yashimishije abantu barenga 300.000 mugihe cyibirori, inshuro zigera kuri 20 abitabiriye ibirori umuntu kugiticye "}
{"id": "20541", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20541", "title": "Ottawa Iserukiramuco rya Filime", "text": "Iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Ottawa niserukiramuco rya firime ngarukamwaka ryabereye muri Ottawa, muri Ontario, riteguribirori byogutoranya filime nyafurika, Karayibe, Abanyamerika n\u2019Abirabura bomuri Kanada. \nIriserukiramuco ryatangijwe mu 2021 murwego rwogukura mwiserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya filime ry\u2019abirabura rya Montreal, ryakozwe n\u2019umukinnyi w\u2019amafirime akaba n'umukinnyi wa filime Fabienne Colas. Kubericyorezo cya COVID-19 muri Kanada, ibiroribyo gutangiza byateguwe kumurongo. \nFilime zerekanwe mubiroribyo gutangiza zirimo \"The Special\", \"Black Boys\", \"John Ware Yagaruwe\", \"Ubwenegihugu\" na \"Dope ni Urupfu\". "}
{"id": "20542", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20542", "title": "Dahab (film)", "text": "Dahab ni filime yumuziki yabanye Egiputa yo mu 1953 yabowe na Anwar Wagdy, yakinwe na wunderkind Feyrouz wimyaka 10 hamwe na Wagdy muri imwe muri firime zikomeye zumwuga we. "}
{"id": "20543", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20543", "title": "Iserukiramuco rya Filime Yirabura", "text": "Iserukiramuco rya Filime ryirabura rya Toronto niserukiramuco rya firime ngarukamwaka i Toronto, Ontario. rikorwa muri Gashyantare burimwaka murwego rw\u2019ukwezi kwahariwe amateka y\u2019abirabura, gahunda y\u2019ibirori ihitamo filime zo muri Afurika, Karayibe, Abanyamerika n\u2019Abirabura bo muri Kanada. \nIriserukiramuco ryatangijwe mumwaka wa 2013 murwego rwogukura mw'iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga ry\u2019amafirime ry\u2019umukara rya Montreal, ryakozwe n\u2019umukinnyi w\u2019amafirime Fabienne Colas, rikabariterwa inkunga na Global Television Network na TD Canada Trust. Iserukiramuco ryatangijwe ryarimo filime \"Indege iheruka yerekeza Abuja\", \"Guhindura Terefone\", \"Guhindukira\", \"Case d\u00e9part\", \"Guhuza Igitsina (Les Man\u00e8ges humains)\" na \"Witch War (Rebelle)\". \nFilime zerekanwe ahantuhatandukanye mumujyi, harimo Carlton Cinema, Isabel Bader Theatre h n'ubugeni bwubuhanzi bwa Ontario ya Jackman Hall.\nKuvamumwaka wa 2015, iserukiramuco ryatanzibihembo ngarukamwaka mumyuga kumuntu ukomeye muri filime ya diaspora nyafurika. Iriserukiramuco ryahayicyubahiro Fred Williamson mu 2015, Alfre Woodard mu 2016, Lou Gossett Jr. muri 2017, Robi Reed muri 2018, Tarana Burke muri 2019, 2020,\nKubericyorezo cya COVID-19 muri Kanada, iserukiramuco 2021 ryerekanwe kumurongo. Yafunguwe na filime ya \"Foster Boy\", ifunga hamwe na film ya documentaire ya Mia Donovan \"Dope Is Death\". "}
{"id": "20544", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20544", "title": "A Date at the Tower", "text": "A Date at the Tower Ni filime yo mu Misiri yo mu mwaka 1962 yanditswe ina yoborwa na Ezz El-Dine Zulficar. Zulfikar, Soad Hosny na Fouad el-Mohandes. Firime yasohotse kuri 12 Ukuboza 1962 mu Misiri na Sosiyete y'Abarabu ishinzwe Sinema.\nInyandiko.\nAdel na Amaal bahuriye mu gihe bari bavuye mu bwato. Urukundo rubahuza, basezerana ku rushinga nyuma y'amezi atandatu kandi ko bazasohokera ku munara w'i Kayiro. Bapanga gufata amafaranga y'umukunzi wa Amaal Adel yahisemo gushaka akazi gafatika. Akora, akazi gasanzwe muri hoteri aba umuyobozi wungirije. Muri icyo gihe, Amaal asiga umukunzi we. Abura ku mirimo ye yo kwakira abashyitsi kubera ibyaha musaza we Alaa yakoze. Amezi atandatu arangiye. Abapolisi bateye inzu ya Alaa, yicwa amaherezo. Adel na Amaal bahurira ku Munara w Cairo ku gihe."}
{"id": "20545", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20545", "title": "Iserukiramuco rya Filime ya San Diego", "text": "Iserukiramuco rya Filime rya San Diego niserukiramuco ribaburimwaka ribera San Diego, muri Californiya. Iserukiramuco ryemera firime nyafurika yo muri Amerika. Yashinzwe mu 2002 nk'iserukiramuco rya Noir. Nimwemubirori binini bya firime yabirabura muri Amerika. \nAmateka.\nIserukiramuco rya Filime yabirabura San Diego, ubusanzwerizwi kwizina rya Noir Film Festival, ryatangiye mu 2003 mucyumba cya hoteri muri Quarter ya Gaslamp. Herekanwe firime eshatu, abantubagera kuri 20 baritabiriye. Mu 2006 izina ry'iri serukiramuco ryahinduwe mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya San Diego kuberako abateguye babonyeko harurujijo na \" film noir \". Kugeza mumwaka wa 2011, hateganijwe filime 120 kandi hateganijwe ko abayitabira bari hagati ya 15.000 na 30.000, iri serukiramuco ryabaye rimwe mu maserukiramuco manini y\u2019abirabura muri Amerika ndetse akaba n'imwe mu minsi mikuru ikomeye muri San Diego. \nIbirori byerekanye firime mubyiciro bikurikira: urwenya, ikinamico, documentaire, animasiyo, GLBT, iziteyubwoba, idini, abanyamahanga / Abanyafurika Diaspora, filime ngufi, amafilime yerekana amashusho. Muriryo serukiramuco hategurwa ibirori byo kwakira.\nIbibuga byashyizwemo Theatre Yabahanzi Yunze ubumwe mw'isoko rya Westfield Horton Plaza, Multiflex ya Gaslamp ya Pasifika, Theatre Grossmont Theatre i La Mesa, Ikinamico rya AMC Fashion Valley, UltraStar Mission Valley na Theatre Box mumujyi rwagati. Muri 2017 ryagutse mumakinamico atatu maze ritangira gutezimbere ikigo cy\u2019amafirime y\u2019abirabura, amaherezo kizakira ibirori ndetsenokubamo ububiko. \nKaren Willis n'umuyobozi w'iriserukiramuco; Robin Givens yakiriyinshuro nyinshi. "}
{"id": "20546", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20546", "title": "Iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Afurika", "text": "Iserukiramuco rya Filime Pan African (PAFF) nisosiyete idaharanira inyungu i Los Angeles, muri Californiya, mur'Amerika, ivugako integoyayo arugutezimbere \"imyumvire y\u2019umuco hagati y\u2019abantu bakomoka mur'Afurika\" binyuze mu kwerekana ubuhanzi na firime. Itegura iserukiramuco rya firime nibirori byubuhanzi i Los Angeles muri Gashyantare buri mwaka. Ikinyamakuru \"Los Angeles Times\" cyise iserukiramuco rya filime \"iserukiramuco rya firime ninicyane\" muri Amerika. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nIriserukiramuco ryashinzwe mu 1992 n\u2019abakinnyi Danny Glover, Ja'net Dubois, n\u2019umuyobozi mukuru Ayuko Babu. Babu ntasano yarafitanye na Hollywood yakoraga nk'umujyanama mu by'imari mbere yuko agira uruhare mu gushaka iserukiramuco rya firime. Glover n'umukinnyi wa filime Whoopi Goldberg bafatanije gutegura ibirori mu 1992. \nImwemuntego nyamukuru kwarukugaragariza abandamafilime yomuri Afrika kuko amafilime menshi aterekanwaga kandi atamenyekanye. Babu agira ati: \"Ibirori byerekana, wenda bibiri muri byo. Banza, gerageza imwe muri Hollywood. Ibyo bizashimisha imbaga y'amafirime kandi bizashimisha inyungu mpuzamahanga. Noneho, gerageza Washington yakwegera umuryango wa politiki.\" Indintego kwaruguhuza abandi Banyafurika hagatiyabo kukohariho itandukaniro ryinshi mubanyafurika.\nYagaragaje 40 films zakozwe n'abayobozi b'abirabura baturutse kumigabane ine. Ikinyamakuru \"Los Angeles Times\" cyavuzeko filime zifitinsanganyamatsiko rusange ndetse n\u2019insanganyamatsiko nyafurika: \"guhirika ubutegetsi bwa gikoroni, guhangana hagati y\u2019indangagaciro zigezweho n\u2019indangagaciro gakondo, n\u2019imigani y\u2019abahanzi bafite impano\". Filime mw'iserukiramuco rya mbere zirimo \"Sarraounia\", \"Heritage Africa\", na \"Lord of the Street\". Mu 2013, iserukiramuco rya sinema ryitabiriwe 30,000 patrons, nahw'iserukiramuco ry'ubuhanzi ryitabiriwe n'abantu 75.000. Muri 2014, iserukiramuco rya firime ryagaragayemo 179 films zomu 46 countries. Muri firime harimo documentaire-ndende, documentaire ngufi, firime yerekana inkuru, firime ngufi, hamwe nurubuga. \nFilime.\nTsotsi (2005).\nIyobowena Gavin Hood, film yerekanubuzima muri Afrika yepfo nkurubyiruko. Insanganyamatsiko zishingiye kw'ihohoterwa, gucungurwa, n'ubumuntu.\nDry (2014).\nIyobowena Stephanie Okereke, ivugakubyerekeye gushyingirwa kwabana agendeye kunkuru yukuri. Okereke yamenye bwambere ibijyanye nogushyingirwa kw'abana bibera muri Nijeriya igihe yigaga muri kaminuza. Yashakaga kugeza iki kibazo mu bitangazamakuru kugira ngo abimenyeshe. Byitabiriwe cyane ku buryo leta ya Gambiya yabujije gushyingirwa kw'abana. "}
{"id": "20547", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20547", "title": "Featureless Men", "text": "Featureless Men. Iyi ni filime yafashwe, isohoka mu mu 1972. Irimo Salah Zulfikar na Nadia Lutfi Ni filime ya nyuma ya Mahmoud Zulfikar kandi yasohotse nyuma y'urupfu. Filime yakozwe kandi ikwirakwizwa na Naguib Khoury Films.\nInyandiko.\nBya Ibibirori bya (Ahmed) urangije kaminuza ye mwu bwenjeniyeri. Amenya umukobwa wijoro, (Laila), aramukunda abwira se ko azamurongora. Ariko se arabyanga kuko atari kurwego rwimibereho kandi aramutera ubwoba kandi ibintu biriyongera."}
{"id": "20548", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20548", "title": "Iserukiramuco rya Filime rya BlackStar", "text": "Iserukiramuco rya Filime rya BlackStar niserukiramuco rya firime ngarukamwaka ryateguwe na BlackStar Projects. Iriserukiramuco ryibanda kuri firime zivuga ndetse n\u2019abirabura n\u2019abasangwabutaka baturutse hiryanohino ku isi. Kanama i Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, Amerika. Byasobanuwe nka \"Sundance Yirabura.\" \nIbirori byiswe umurongo wokohereza Marcus Garvey, Umurongo wa Black Star. Yashinzwe mu mwaka na Maori Karmael Holmes, ahw'iserukiramuco ryambere rya Filime rya BlackStar ryatekerejwe bwambere nka \"microfestival\" y'umunsi umwe, kuberako umubaremunini wabyoherejwe, amaherezo ryahindutse ibirori mpuzamahanga by\u2019iminsi ine. Holmes yateje imbere iserukiramuco bitewe nuko yabonaga kohabaye iminsi mikuru micye ya firime kubakinnyi ba firime birabura, ndetse nogushaka gusangira inkuru zirenze imyumvire itandukanye yabantu bafite ibara. Abashyigikiye ibirori barimo Fondasiyo ya MacArthur, Knight Foundation, HBO, CAA, Comcast, na Lionsgate. \nIserukiramuco ryambere ryarimo icyiciro cya master hamwe nokwerekana igice cya Hagati ya Ava DuVernay. Yakozwe na Projet idaharanirinyungu ya BlackStar, muririserukiramuco harimo firime 40 zoku migabane ine. Nyuma y'ibirori harimo firime za Arthur Jafa, Ja'Tovia Gary, Terence Nance, Jenn Nkiru, Gabourey Sidibe, Janine Sherman Barrois, Darius Clark Monroe, Shatara Michelle Ford, Garrett Bradley, na Naima Ramos-Chapman. Abagize itsinda barimo Bradford Young, Rashid Shabazz, Spike Lee, na Tarana Burke. \nYaba Blay, Akiba Solomon, Ahmir \u201cQuestlove\u201d Thompson, na Tariq \u201cIgitekerezo Cyirabura\u201d Trotter bose babanje gukorera mu nama ngishwanama y'ibirori. \nMu 2024, ibirori byari byitabiriwe n'abantu barenga 17.000. \nMushikiwabo uteguragahunda ya Blackstar Projects harimo Seen, ikinyamakuru gisohoka kabiri mubuhanzi nokwandika; amahugurwa y'abahanzi b'amabara; ubusabane; n'imurikagurisha. "}
{"id": "20549", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20549", "title": "Freaknik", "text": "Freaknik (/\u02c8 f r i\u02d0 k n \u026a k / ; mu ntangiriro Freaknic) yarumunsi mukuru w'ikiruhuko ngarukamwaka wabereye i Atlanta, Jeworujiya. Yabanje kwitabirwa nabanyeshuri biyandikishije mumateka n'amashuri makuru yabirabura mumateka ya kaminuza ya Atlanta. Yatangiye mu 1983 nka picnic ntoya muri parike rusange hafiyikigo cya kaminuza ya Atlanta yatewe inkunga na DC Metro Club kubanyeshuri batabashaga gusubira murugo kuruhuka rwimpeshyi. Byakomeje nkigikorwa ngarukamwaka cyabayemuri wikendi muri Mata. Ibirori byariyongereye cyane nogukundwa cyane mumyaka ya za 90, bikubiyemamarushanwa yokubyina, ibitaramo, ibirori, amarushanwa ya basketball, amasomo ya rap, iserukiramuco rya firime n\u2019imurikagurisha ryakazi. \nIkinyamakuru \"cya Atlanta\" cyiswe ibirori byomumuhanda bizwi cyane., abapolisi bomu karere ka Atlanta n'abayobozi batowe bakoranye kugirango Freaknik irangire. Impapuro zavuguruwe zagarutse umunsumwe ku ya 22 Kamena 2019, nka \"FreakNik Atlanta '19 - Ibirori hamwe n\u2019igitaramo cyabereye muri Cellairis Amphitheater i Lakewood. \nUbusanzwe \"Freaknic\", izinaryibirorini portmanteau ya \"picnic\" na \"frak\", ukurikije insanganyamatsiko ya DC Metro Club yo mu 1982\u20131983 insanganyamatsiko Kugaruka kwa Freak\". \nAmateka.\nFreaknik yasamwe muri Werurwe 1982 ku kigo cya Spelman College mu nama ya DC Metro Club iyobowe na perezida icyo gihe Schuyla Goodson. Yatewe inkunga niyi club, yari igizwe n\u2019abanyeshuri baturutse i Washington, DC, Maryland, na Virginia. Club DC Metro Club yari igamije ko itoroshye kuri Club ya California muri ibirori binini birangira-umwaka-shuri. Goodson yatanze igitekerezo cyizina Freaknik (icyo gihe cyiswe \"Freaknic\") nka portmanteau yubusa na picnic.\nIzina Freaknik ryahumekewe na Le Freak na Chic, indirimbo n'imbyino bizwi cyane kuva mu 1978. Bwa mbere byabereye muri John A. White Park muri Atlanta muri Mata 1982, ryitabiriwe n\u2019abanyeshuri bagera ku 150.\nKwamamaza.\nMu 1988, Perezida wa College ya Spelman, Johnnetta B. Cole, yabujije DC Metro Club kugira uruhare muri Freaknic kuberimpamvu z\u2019ishuri. Kuberako ntashyirahamwe ryabanyeshuri ryemewe riyobora ibirori, Daryl Miller wigenga yasabwe na DC Metro Club kuyitezimbere. Yakuze ibirori kuva 15.000 agera kuri 250.000 mumyaka itanu nta radio cyangwa amatangazo yamamaza.\nAbandi bamamaza benshi batangiye kuzamura Freakni (k) utarumuyobozi. Kimwemuribyobirori cyabereye kuri hegitari 33 za Fairwood Fairgrounds cyari gifite abantu 60.000. Mu 1993, abanyeshuri babiri batari HBCU, abamamaza ishyaka Ronn Greene na Diya Nabawi, nibobabaye abambere mukuranga iryozina, ryanditswe kumugaragaro nka \"Freaknik\" (risozwa na \"k\"). Ikindi cyabereye muri Club XS hafi ya Moreland Ave. Ikigikorwa cyatejwe imbere nitsinda ryabanyamuryango ba Omega Psi Phi. Ryari rifite abantu bagera ku 30.000 muri parikingi hamwe n\u2019abandi 60.000 bazengurutse Moreland ijoro ryose.\nMu 1991, Kristina Copeland, umutegarugor'ukomoka i Washington, DC, na Ronn Greene, bakoze ibirori byakabiri, byabereye mu imurikagurisha rya Lakewood. Mugihe ibirori byamenyekanye cyane mumico gakondo yabirabura, abashyitsi benshi b'Abirabura baturutse muturere twosetwa Amerika, Kanada, Karayibe n'Uburayi baza kuyitabira. Bamwe murabobashyitsi bahisemo guhindura agace ka Atlanta inzu yabo nshya ihoraho. Mumyaka ya za 90 rwagati, ibirori byitabiriwe n'abantu barenga 250.000 buri mwaka. Ikindikandi ibirori byari imbaraga zikomeye zubukungu mukarere ka Atlanta. Biteganijwe ko mu 1994 ingaruka z\u2019ubukungu zageze kuri miliyoni 20 z'amadolari. \nUko Freaknik yagendagikura, banyir'amazu bahondetse nabanyir'ubucuruzi babibona nabi. Yamaganwe nubucuruzi bwa Atlanta, amashyirahamwe yabaturanyi, abafite ubucuruzi nabayobozi babaturage. Byongeye raporo zihohoterwa rishingiye kugitsina n\u2019izindi mpungenge z\u2019umutekano rusange ziyongereye igihe ibirori byakorwaga. Muri Mata 1997, umuyobozi w\u2019umujyi wa Atlanta, Bill Campbell. kumihanda nyabagendwa yerekeza i Atlanta. Abayobozi b'umugi bamaze gufata ingamba zokugabanya Freaknik kugerwaho, gukundwa kwayo kwaragabanutse. Ibirori byimukiye iburasirazuba kuva Atlanta yerekeza muri Memorial Drive mu ntara ya DeKalb, Jeworujiya.\nKugeza mu 1999, nubwobimukiye mu Ntara ya DeKalb kugirango birinde abapolisi ba Atlanta, abitabiriye baragabanutse, bituma irangira kumugaragaro. Habayeho kugerageza nyuma ya 1999 kubyutsa Freaknik kumugaragaro, ariko ntibyatsinze, abayobozi b'Atlanta bagize bati: \"nta bintu byemewe na Freaknic byemewe mumbibi z'umujyi.\" Umuyobozi w'akarere ka Atlanta, Kasim Reed, yavuze kandi ko \"azakomera ndetse akanarega abategura ibikorwa byose bifitanye isano na Freaknic bitubahiriza amabwiriza y'umujyi.\" \nNyuma yimyaka 20, umuyobozi wanyuma wa Freaknik arimu 1999, isosiyete yamamaza ikorera mur'Atlanta Nyuma ya 9 Partners na Carlos Neal bagiranye amasezerano na Luther Campbell, Juvenile, Trina nabandi kugirango bayobore igitaramo cyiswe Freaknik muri kamena 2019. Freaknik ya 2019 yagaragayemo abahanzi bamuzika ya hip-hop na R&amp;amp;B bakorera muri Cellairis Amphitheater. Ibindi bikorwa byabonetse muri Atlanta, nkigikorwa rusange. Benshi mubagera ku 20.000 bitabiriye baribakuru bakuze bitabiriye Freakniks yemewe yomuri 80 na 90. \nMu muco.\nStudios ya Williams Street yakozisahimwe idasanzwe yiswe \"Freaknik: thevMusical\" ishingiye kumunsi mukuruzwi. Ikiganiro cyanyuze kuri tereviziyo y'abakuze Swim muri Werurwe 2010. \nIgihembwe cya kabiri igice \"cyamamare\" kirangimiterere Mary Cherry agira ati \"Nagiye i Freaknik murihotlanta mpindura nyina\" ubwoyashimishijwe nibikorwa byebyokuruhuka. \nIgihembwe igice kimwe \"cyubuzima nyabwo\" cyakurikiranyabanyeshuri bakaminuza mugihe cya Freaknik ya 1998.\nIgihembwe cya gatandatu igice cya \"Mushikiwabo, Mushikiwabo\" yanditse amateka y'urugendo rwa Tia na Tamera kuva Michigan kugera Atlanta yerekeza Freaknik hamwenabagenzi babobomuri kaminuza. \nMuri mixtape ye \" STN MTN / Kauai \", Childish Gambino afunguravuga koyari afite inzozi zokuyobora Atlanta akazagarura azagarura Freaknik. \nKuri \"Hair Day\", igicecyacumi narimwe cyigihembwe cya gatandatu cyurukurikirane rwa ABC rwitwa \"Black-ish\", Dre ahishurira umuhungu we Jack ko nkumusore yakubiswe murubyiniro n\u2019umuntu wazanye ifirimbi ye mu birori, ibyo bikaba byarakaje umujinya w\u2019umuhungu we mukuru, Junior, wemeza ko Dre yamubwiye ati \"Ibibera kuri Freaknik biguma i Freaknik.\"\nTom Wolfe yerekeje kuri Freaknik / Freaknic mugitabo cye \"A Man in full\" - muntangiriro ahagana kurupapuro rwa 17, igice \"Chocolate Mecca\" ariko n'ahandi. \nFreaknik avugwa mundirimbo za rap kuvamumyaka ya za 90 nomuntangiriro ya 2000. \nBeyonc\u00e9 avugakuri Freaknik 1996 mundirimbo ye \u201cTHIQUE,\u201d yasohotse kuri \"Renaissance\" mu 2022.\nHulu yasohoye documentaire yitwa \"Freaknik: Ishyaka rya Wildest Never Never Told.\" muri Werurwe 2024. \nReba kandi.\nRusange:"}
{"id": "20550", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20550", "title": "Iserukiramuco rya Filime ya Hayti", "text": "Iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Hayti Heritage (HHFF) niserukiramuco rya firime ngarukamwaka ribera i Durham, muri NC, rikaba rigaragaz'ibikorwa by'abakora amafilime bomur'Afurika bakomoka. HHFF numwe muminsi mikuru ya filime y'Abirabura imaze igihe kinini muri Amerika. Iserukiramuco rya firime ryerekana ama documentaire, firime ndende, na.\nAmateka n'ifatizo.\nHayti numuryango wamateka uherereye i Durham, NC. Intambara y'abanyamerik'irangiye, Abirabura bashya babohowe bashinze imidugudu nka Hayti, mumijyi yomuri Carolina y'Amajyaruguru nomumajyepfo. Hayti yabay'umuryango wateyimbere kandi wibeshaho mumujyi wa Durham. Imwe mu nyubako za kera kandi z'umwimerere zisigaye ni Itorero ry'Abepisikopi b'Abanyafurika ryitiriwe Mutagatifu Yozefu, ubu rizwi ku izina rya Heritage Heritage. Mu gihe inkomoko nyayo itazwi, mu 1994, abahanzi n\u2019abafatanyabikorwa baho bishyize hamwe maze bategura iserukiramuco rya mbere rya firime ryabereye mukigo ndangamurage cya Hayti kugira ngo babungabunge umurage mwiza wa Durham. Uyu munsi, intego yabo nukugumya firime yumukara wamajyepfo. \nKubericyorezo cya COVID-19, HHFF ya 27 ngarukamwaka izagaragaramo firime zimwenazimwe zizerekanwa kurimurandasi kimwe nokwerekan'ibinyabiziga. \n2021.\nHHFF ngarukamwaka ya 27 yatangiye kuvakwitariki 1 Werurwe kugeza kugeza 6 Werurwe.Iyo myak'insanganyamatsiko yavugaga \"Urugendo rw'Intwari: Umuhamagaro wo gukora.\" Indwara ya COVID-19 yariyarimbuy'ibirori mw'Itorero rya AME ryitiriwe Mutagatifu Yozefu ryitiriwe AME kugira ngobibe ibintubisanzwe, hamwe n'ibice byokuri interineti Yerekanye firime 40 zohirya nohino ku isi kandi ikoribirori bibiri bya firime ya disiki n'ibiganiro byinshi. Ibintu byingenzi byagaragaye mu mwaka wa 27 wa HHFF harimo kwerekana amashusho ya MLK / FBI ya Sam Pollard na The Outside Story, ikiganiro cyiswe \"Igihugu cy\u2019urukundo gihura n\u2019abakobwa b\u2019abirabura bayobora kurokoka gucura,\" hagati ya Omisade Burney-Scott n\u2019umwanditsi w\u2019igihugu cya Shannon Houston. Muri iri serukiramuco ry\u2019uyu mwaka kandi harimo no guha icyubahiro Cicely Tyson, wapfuye ku ya 28 Mutarama \n2020.\nHHFF ngarukamwaka ya 26 yatangiye kuvaku ya 13 Gashyantare kugezaku ya 15 Gashyantare.Yerekanye filime zirenga 30 kandi yibanda kuri afrofuturism, urupfu, indangamuntu, na politiki. Ibikurubikuru birimo kwerekanwa \"the Black Chapter\", \"Ijwiryoguceceka\", \"Kurengana\", no gufunga hamwe na \"Subira\". Muruwomwaka mukuru wahaye icyubahiro John Singleton, wapfuye muri 2019, mukwerekana \"Amashuri Makuru.\" Byongeye kandi, MasterClass yakinnye yakozwe na Obba Babatund\u00e9 naho hakorwa amahugurwa menshi ninama zabatoza. \nKwemererwa no guhitamo.\nHHFF ifata firime mukuyitanga kandi ju ihitamo film nziza mubyoherejwe. Inteko y'abacamanza izenguruka hafi 60% ya porogaramu noneho ikosora.\nKugira ngo wemererwe gusuzumwa:\nNubwo bidasabwa kwemererwa, hitabwa kuri firime zakozwe mumajyepfo ya Amerika. "}
{"id": "20551", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20551", "title": "Gorillas Revisited", "text": "Gorillas Revisited ni documenteri ya BBC 2006 yakinwe numukinnyi wumunyamerika Sigourney Weaver. Uruhare ni umuhamagaro wo kwerekana Dian Fossey muri \"Gorillas mu gihu\" (1988). \nUmugambi.\nIyi documenteri ishingiye kubuzima bwa primatologue nu kubungabunga ibidukikije Dian Fossey, byavuzwe na Weaver. \nUmusaruro.\nIyi documenteri yafatiwe amashusho mu Rwanda. "}
{"id": "20552", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20552", "title": "Grey Matter (film)", "text": "Gray Matter ni film yabanya Rwanda yomuri 2011 iyobowe na Kivu Ruhorahoza. \nInyandiko.\nFilime ivuga inkuru eshatu zitandukanye ariko zifite ihuriro. Muriyambere, umukinnyi wafilime ukiri muto Balthazar arashaka amafaranga muri Kigali kugirango akore film ye ya mbere, \"Le cycle du cafard\", ariko leta yanze gutera inkunga film ishingiye ku ngaruka za jenoside yabaye mu Rwanda. Iya kabiri, filime ya Balthazar ifata ishusho kandi yerekana umuntu, ufungiye mubuhungiro, wari umwicanyi mu gihe cyintambara. Mu nkuru ya gatatu, Yvan na Justine, umuvandimwe nabashiki bacu, nabasore babiri barokotse bagerageza kubaka ubuzima bwabo. "}
{"id": "20555", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20555", "title": "Umuhengeri", "text": "Dark Tide ni filime iteye ubwoba yomuri 2012 yakozwe na John Stockwell, ishorwamo na Jeanette Buerling (uzwi ku izina rya Jeanette B. Milio) na Matthew E. Chausse kandi yanditswe na Ronnie Christensen na Amy Sorlie. Iyifilime ishingiye kunkuru ya Amy Sorlie ikinamo Halle Berry, Olivier Martinez, na Ralph Brown. Filime yari yananiwe bikomeye nabox-office bomb.\nUmugambi.\nKate ni impuguke mubucuruzi bwananiranye numbwo rimwe narimwe kuba uba impuguke ntago byijya bibura aba bihitana. Kate amaze kwitwa \"shark whisperer\", Kate ahigwa bukware nibuka icyo gitero kandi ntashobora gusubira mumazi. Hamwe na fagitire zuzuye kandi banki igiye kwambura ubwato bwa Kate, umugabo wa Kate, Jeff, Jeff, yamuhaye amahirwe menshi: kuyobora umucuruzi w\u2019umukungu w\u2019umukungu w\u2019umuherwe n\u2019umuhungu we w\u2019umwangavu ku mwobo w\u2019akaga - hanze y\u2019akazu. Mu kurwanya amakenga ye no gutinya, Kate yemeye icyo cyifuzo kandi ashyiraho inzira y\u2019ubutaka bwica kurusha abandi ku isi, \"Shark Alley\".\nUmusaruro.\nGukorwa batangiye muri Nyakanga 2010 i False Bay, Cape Town, Afurika y'Epfo, maze urasa ibyumweru bitandatu mubwato buto bufite inyanja nini yera. Ibicuruzwa byaje kwimukira mu Bwongereza mu byumweru bitatu bifata amashusho muri Stidiyo ya Pinewood kuri stade y\u2019amazi nokuri Sitidiyo ya Black Hangar ku kigega cyamazi yo hanze. Amajwi yanditswe kandi akorwa na Mark Sayfritz. \nKwakira.\nKu Rotten Tomatoes, filime ifite igipimo kidasanzwe cyo kwemerwa cya 0% hashingiwe kubisubizo byatanzwe nabanegura 20, impuzandengo ya 2.59 / 10. Ubwumvikane buke bwurubuga bugira buti: \"Shallow and brackish, \"Tide Tide\" yananiwe kuzamuka\". Kuri Metacritic, ifite amanota 23% hashingiwe kubisubizo byatanzwe nabanegura 4, byerekana \"murirusange bidakwiye\". "}
{"id": "20556", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20556", "title": "Eraser: Reborn", "text": "Eraser: Reborn ni film yibikorwa yabanyamerika yomuri 2022, imeze nka reboot ya \"Eraser\" yomuri 1996, kandi isobanurwa nkigice gikurikira muri francise. Bayobowe na John Pogue agendeye ku nyandiko yanditswe na Michael D. Weiss, umugambi wibanze kukigo cyibanga kizobereye mu buhanga bw\u2019ubuhanga bw\u2019urupfu rw\u2019impimbano zabatangabuhamya bakeneye gusiga ibimenyetso byabo. Umukinnyi wumukinnyi wumwongereza Dominic Sherwood mumwanya wambere nka Marshal Mason Pollard w\u2019umunyamerika, abaterankunga barimo Jacky Lai, McKinley Belcher III na Eddie Ramos. \nUmugambi.\nMarshal wmunyamerika Mason Pollard kabuhariwe mu \"Erasing\" abantu - bahimba impfu zabatangabuhamya baba bafite ibyago byinshi. Iterambere ryikoranabuhanga mu myaka 25 ishize, umukino warazamutse, wari undi munsi kubiro ubwoyahawe Rina Kimura, umugore wa shebuja w'icyaha wafashe icyemezo cyoguhindura ibimenyetso bya leta. Ubwo bombi bahungiraga i Cape Town, muri Afurika y'Epfo, hamwe nitsinda ry'abicanyi batagira impuhwe mu nzira yabo, Pollard yavumbuye ko yashinzwe. Kabiri-yambutse kandi yongerewe na adrenaline, agomba kuba ku isonga ryumukino we, cyangwa niwe uzahanagurwa. Iteka.\nUkoyakozwe.\nMuri Nzeri 2021, urukurikirane rwabaye reboot of \"Eraser\" aho, rwatangajwe koruri mumajyambere hamwena Dominic Sherwood ku mwanya wambere. yatangajwe nkumuyobozi ufite inyandiko yanditswe na Michael D. Weiss. Jacky Lai bafatanije gukina filime, mugihe abaterankunga barimo McKinley Belcher III na Eddie Ramos. Guhiga Lowry na Patty Reed babaye abaproducer. Umushinga ni umusaruro uhuriweho na Warner Bros. Home Home Entertainment Group na Roserock Films. Umusaruro wabaye rwihishwa hamwe nifoto nyamukuru yatangiye hagati ya 2021, mugihe cyorezo cya COVID-19. Filime yatanzwe na Warner Bros. Imyidagaduro yo \nKurekura.\nIkinamico.\n\"Eraser: Reborn\" yerekanwe bwa mbere mu makinamico yo mu Budage ku ya 31 Werurwe \nItangazamakuru ryo murugo no gutambuka.\nImbere mu Gihugu, \"Eraser: Reborn\" yarekuwe mu bitangazamakuru byo mu rugo ku ya 7 Kamena 2022. Nyuma yaje gusohoka kuri HBO Max ku ya 5 Ukwakira 2022. \nInyandiko.\na. yasohokeye mubudage isohowe na Warner Bros.picyures"}
{"id": "20557", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20557", "title": "27 Guns", "text": "27 Guns ni filime y'imirwano, filime biopic y'ibyerekeranye na Yoweri kaguta Museveni na bagenzi be b'Abasirikare mu gihe cy'intambara ya Bush. Yayobowe na Natasha Museveni Karugire, umukobwa wa Yoweri Kaguta Museveni, ikaba yarekanwe bwa mbere i Kampala taliki ya 8 Nzeri 2018 nyuma yaje kwerekanwa i Johannesburg muri Afurika Yepfo taliki ya 19 Nzeri 2018. \nKastingi;.\nUruhare runini rwa Yoweri Kaguta Museveni rwahawe Arnold Mubangizi nk'uruhare rwe rwa mbere. Diana Museveni Kyaremera yakinnye nyina Janet Kataha Museni\nUko yakozwe.\nGufata amashusho ya \"27 Guns\" byatangiye taliki ya 8 Kanama 2017, bikomeza iminsi mirongo icyenda. Iyi filime yasohotse muri Gicurasi 2018. Iyi filime yafatiwe iMpigi / Singo, Buikwe na Kampala hamwe n\u2019abakozi bari bahagaze aho amashusho yose azafatirwa. Yesaya 60 Productions yayoboye ibikorwa byose no gukwirakwiza film. "}
{"id": "20558", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20558", "title": "Africa Speaks!", "text": "Africa Speaks! ni film ya documenteri yabanyamerika 1930 iyobowe na Walter Futter yavuzwe na Lowell Thomas. Ni firime ikoreshwa. \nIkibanza.\nPaul L. Hoefler murugendo rwo mu 1928 muri Afurika gufata inyamaswa nimiryango kuri firime.\nUkoyakozwe.\nNubwo iyi filime yafashwe mumezi cumi nane yurugendo rwabereye i Serengeti nomuri Uganda, bigaragara ko igitero cyintare kuri kavukire bigaragara ko cyakorewe muri pariki ya Selig i Los Angeles kandi kirimo intare itagira amenyo. \nHoefler yanditse igitabo yise \"Africa Speaks\" kurugendo rwasohowe mu 1931. \nIbyerekeye umuco ukunzwe.\nUmutwe wiyi filime wasobanuwe mugikarito cya \"Afurika Squeaks\" yo mu 1940 naFilime ya Abbott na Costello \"yo\" muri 1949.\nItangazamakuru ryo murugo.\n\"Africa Speaks\" yasohokeye kuri Region 0 DVD-R na Alpha video ku ya 7 Nyakanga 2015. "}
{"id": "20559", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20559", "title": "Beyond The Genocide", "text": "Beyond The Genocide ni filme mbarakuri () yo mu Rwanda yakozwe 2025 na Zion Sulaiman Matovu Mukasa. ni filme yerekanwe ku mugaragaro mu Kwibuka ku nshuro ya 31, u Rwanda rwibuka Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu1994, yerekenwa bwa mbere ku kuya 8 Mata 2025. \nni filme igaruka ku mateka y'u Rwanda rwo muri 1990, u Rwanda rwa 1994 aho igihugu cyari cyarabaye amatongo, n'urugendo rwo kongera kwisana, ubumwe n'ubudaheranwa by'u Rwanda rwa nyuma 1994.\nKuva iyi filme \"Beyond The Genocide\" yasohoka muri mata 2025, imaze kugaragarizwa abantu barenga 15.000 bo mu mashuri atandukanye yo mu Rwanda. Yanamuritswe muri sosiyete n\u2019ibigo bitandukanye birimo nka MTN Rwanda, Access Bank, PAGE Rwanda muri Canada, ndetse no mu bihugu nka Kenya, Uganda, Israel, u Budage ndetse n'i Paris mu Bufaransa. aho imaze kugira amashimwe ndetse no kwegukana ibihembo bibiri icya \u2018Impact DOCS Awards\u2019 na \u2018Accolade Global Film Competition\u2019 byose yaherewe muri Amerika \nImitunganyirize ya filme.\nIncamake.\niyi filme igaragaramo ubuhamya bw'abarokotse Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, (survivors) Abagize uruhare mu ikorwa ryayo (perpetrators), Imbwirwa ruhame zihembera urwango z'abanyepolitiki (archived political speeches) ndetse tubonamo n'urubyiruko rwa nyuma ya Jenoside bavuga kucyo amateka mabi u Rwanda rwanyuzemo yabasigiye.\nProduction.\nni filme ifite iminota 100 yatunganyijwe na Zion Films company, ikigo cya Zion Sulaiman Matovu Mukasa wayanditse ndetse aranayiyobora (writer and director), ku bufatanye (producers) Ronnie Abraham, Winnie Adisa ndetse n'abajyanama kuri iyi project advisor aribo Christopher Marler co founder of the ADMA and former Senior Vice President at Pixel Corps na Ali Loukman guturuka muri Uganda na Production unite by Mark walker. kandi ni umushinga Zion Sulaiman yakoze ku bufatanye n'ibigo na za sosiyasiyo n'imiryango nka, The Umbrella Association of Genocide Survivors, CARSA (the Christian Action for Reconciliation and Social Assistance) abo bose bashyigikira uyu mushinga kugeza ugeze ku ntego yawo. \nZion Sulaiman Matovu Mukasa, ni umusore w\u2019 wavutse 1999 muri Uganda. Yatangiye urugendo rwa sinema mu 2016. Mu 2018 nibwo yaje mu Rwanda aho yakoze kuri filme nyinshi zirenga 11 zirimo iyiswe \u201cDangerous Mom\u201d, \u201cNailed\u201d, \u201c2020 Series\u201d, \u201cAlisa\u201d, \u201cInjustice\u201d yerekanwe kuri Zacu TV na \u201cZamani\u201d yagiye hanze mu 2023. \nGusohoka n'Ibihembo.\nKu bufatanye na Never Again Rwanda, AEGIS, CARSA n'abandi kuwa 8 Mata mu cyumweru cyo Kwibuka (kwibuka week) ni bwo iyi filme yamuritswe ku mugaragaro bwa 1 mu rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, byitabirwa n'abantu barenga 600, aho u Rwanda rwari rwibutse ku nshuro ya 31 Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda ibaye.\nKuva iyi filme \"Beyond The Genocide\" yasohoka muri mata 2025, imaze kugaragarizwa abantu barenga 15.000 bo mu mashuri atandukanye yo mu Rwanda. Yanamuritswe muri sosiyete n\u2019ibigo bitandukanye birimo nka MTN Rwanda, Access Bank, PAGE Rwanda muri Canada, ndetse no mu bihugu nka Kenya, Uganda, Israel, u Budage ndetse n'i Paris mu Bufaransa. aho imaze kugira amashimwe ndetse no kwegukana ibihembo bibiri icya \u2018Impact DOCS Awards\u2019 na \u2018Accolade Global Film Competition\u2019 byose yaherewe muri Amerika "}
{"id": "20560", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20560", "title": "Bala Bala Sese", "text": "Bala Bala Sese ni filime yomuri Uganda yayobowe na Lukyamuzi Bashir ishingiye kumashusho yakozwe na Usama Mukwaya, yakinwe na Michael Kasaija, Natasha Sinayobye, Raymond Rushabiro, Ismael Ssesanga, Fiona Birungi, Ashraf Ssemwogerere na Ddungu Jabal. Ni firime yambere, umuyobozi, abanditsi naba producer. \nUmugambi.\nFilime ivuga urugamba rwumukunzi kurukundo binyuze mukwihangana. Mu nkengero zikirwa cya Sese, John (Michael Kasaija) yasaze akunda Maggie (Natasha Sinayobye), bombi bafite ubushake bwo gutera imbere urukundo rwabo. Guhura n\u2019ihohoterwa nogutotezwa na se wa Maggie mubi Kasirivu (Raymond Rushabiro), John, afashijwe na murumuna we Alex (Ssesanga Ismael), yiyemeje kugumana urukundo rwubuzima bwe, cyane cyane iyo amenye ko afite umukunzi mudugudu (Jabal Dungu) nawe uriku murongo wa Maggie.\nUmusaruro.\nGufata amashusho.\nAmafoto yibanze yomuri \"Bala Bala Sese\" yatangiye mumpera zumwaka wa 2012 ararangira muri 2014. Iyi filime yafatiwe amashusho ku birwa bya Ssese muri Uganda, arinaho yakuye izina. \nKurekura.\nIyi filime yasohotse kuya 3 Nyakanga 2015 muri theatre Labonita. \n\"Bala Bala Sese\" ni umushinga wambere wa Uganda wakiriye uburyo bwo kwamamaza bwumwuga. Wariumwe mubikorwa byambere byaho byakozwe muriwo mwaka numwaka ukurikira. \nYatoranyijwe mu bihembo bya 12 bya Afurika Movie Academy Academy ya Filime nziza mu rurimi rwa Afurika. Yakoze imurikagurisha ryayo nyafurika mwiserukiramuco rya Filime rya Luxor nyafurika ryabereye mu Misiri irushanwa mu cyiciro kirekire cyo Kuvuga inkuru muzindi filime 13 zomuri Afurika.] \"[\" \nUmuziki n'amajwi.\namajwi yakoreshwjwemo yali alubum yahibwe na Nessim (producer wumuziki), hamwe nindirimbo yinsanganyamatsiko yemewe \" Wuuyo \" yanditswe na A Pass na Nessim nanone ya Badi Musik. Iyi yabaye umuririmbyi watsinze cyane kugeza ubu. Amashusho yindirimbo yerekanwe bwa mbere ku ya 20 Werurwe 2015 muriClub Guvnor kandi agaragaramo amashusho ya firime. \nIbihembo.\nYatowe.\nIyifilime kandi yiswe imwe muri filime nziza zomuri 2015 na 2016 nabayinenga batandukanye."}
{"id": "20561", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20561", "title": "Bigger Than Us (film)", "text": "Kinini Kurenza ni Filime mbarankuru yomubufaransa 2021 yakozwe kandi iyobowe na Flore Vasseur, yakozwe na Marion Cotillard, yanditswe na Vasseur na Melati Wijsen.] \"\u200b\" \u200b \nUmugamb.\nIyi filime mbarankuru ivuga kuri Melati Wijsen, umukobwa w\u2019imyaka 18 wo muri Indoneziya akaba numuntu uharanira kurwanya umwanda wa plastike mu gihugu cye. Arashaka kumva uburyo bwo gukomeza no gukomeza ibikorwa bye, bityo akomeza guhura nabandi basore batandatu baharanira inyungu kuwisi.\nKurekura.\nIyifilime yerekanwe bwambere kwisi mu iserukiramuco rya Filimi rya 74 rya Cannes mugice cyihariye \"cya Sinema yikirere\" kuya 10 zukwakarindwi yashikeye mubufaransa kuwa 22 mukwacyenda 2021\nKwakira.\nIgisubizo gikomeye.\nAlloCin\u00e9, urubuga rwa sinema rwo muBufaransa, yahaye iyifilime impuzandengo ya 3.3 / 5, ishingiye kubushakashatsi bwingeza 12 zabafaransa. \nItangazamakuru ryo murugo.\nIyi filime yasokeye kuri DVD mu Bufaransa ku ya 1 Gashyantare 2022 "}
{"id": "20562", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20562", "title": "Chief Daddy", "text": "Chief Daddy ni filime y\u2019ikinamico yo muri Nijeriya yo muri 2018 iyobowe na Niyi Akinmolayan, yanditswe na Bode Asiyanbi ikorwa na Mosunmola Abudu na Temidayo Abudu, yasohotse muKuboza Iyifilime yakinnye nabakinnyi bakomeye ba Nollywood barimo Funke Akindele Bello, Kate Henshaw, Nkem Owoh, Joke Silva, Patience Ozokwor, Richard Mofe Damijo ndetse na Racheal Oniga \nIkibanza.\n\"Chief Daddy\" ivuga ku umuherwe w\u2019inganda, Chief Beecroft, ukora nk'umugiraneza kumuryango mugari wa benewabo, abakozi bo murugo, na ba nyirabuja. Yapfuye bitunguranye, bigaterza saga mumiryango yeyose. \nKuyerekana no Kuyisohora.\n\"Chief Daddy\" yarekuwe muriNijeriya kuya 14 Ukuboza 2018 nomuri Buholandi kuya 15 Werurwe 2019 abinyujije kuri Netflix.] Iyifilime yatangarijwe bwa mbere muri Oriental Hotel i Lagos, ahari hateraniye ibyamamare bya sinema byomuri Nollywood birenga 40. Muribo harimo abakinnyi bakomeye nka Olu Jacobs, Joke Silva ndetse na Richard Mofe Damijo Nyuma yaje kwinjiza N387.5 million naira muri Box office N387.5 \nInguzanyo z'isosiyete n'abayitanga.\nIyifilime yakozwe na Ebony Life Films igurishwa na Film One Entertainment muriNijeriya na Netflix mu Buholandi. "}
{"id": "20563", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20563", "title": "Dangerous Twins", "text": "Dangerous Twins ni film yikinamico yomuri Nigeriya 2004 yanditswe, yakozwe kandi iyobowe na Tade Ogidan.] \u200b\u200b\u200bIyi filime, irimo abakinnyi Bimbo Akintola, Ramsey Nouah na Stella Damasus-Aboderin, ifite iminota 135 ikaba igizwe mu bice bitatu. Yegukanye igihembo cyambere cya Africa Movie Academy Awards mucyiciro cyimikorere yihariye y\u2019amashusho (Best Special Effects) \nRamsey Nouah yakinnye ibintubibiri, nka Taiye na Kenny murifilm. \nIncamake.\nFilime ivugaku amateka yimpanga zisa, Taiye na Kehinde. Kehinde afite inkomokomuri Lagos hamwe numugore we nabana be batatu, naho Taiye afite inkomoko imuri Londres. Ububabare bwubukwe butagira abana, nyuma yimyaka myinshi butesha umutwe Taiye, wemeza Kehinde guhahira hamwe nawe kugirango atere inda umugore we. Ariko, ibibazo byinshi bivamo. Kehinde ahemukira murumuna we wimpanga ikizere kigakurirwa nurugomo r. \nUkoyakozwe.\nIyifilime yakorewe muri Nijeriya na OGD Pictures Production ariko ikorerwano mumahanga ahantu henshi, harimo Nijeriya, London, Ubufaransa, Ubusuwisi, Ubuholandi, Ububiligi na Leta zunze ubumwe za Amerika. "}
{"id": "20564", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20564", "title": "The 600: The Soldiers' Story", "text": "The 600: The Soldiers' Story ni filme Nyarwanda mbarakuri () yo mu mwaka wa 2019, yakozwe na Richard Hall afatanyije Annette Uwizeye. \nIyi nkuru igaruka cyane kuri batayo y'ingabo za 600 bagoswe n'umwanzi ubwo Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 yari igitangira birwanaho ku ntwaro nke bari bafite barengera abasivili kugeza kuguhagarika Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. \nIyi filme The 600 the soldiers' story yamuritswe ku mugaragaro kuwa 3 Nyakanga 2019, ihuzwa n'umunsi wo kwibohora ku nshuro ya 25, ni umunsi witabiriwe na Nyakubahwa Paul Kagame n'umuryango we, Abakoze kuri iyi filme ndetse n'abayigaragayemo n'imbaga ya benshi batumiwe. Kuva yamurikwa mu minsi 17 yamaze muri Theaters yakiriwe neza aho abarenga 3400 bayirebye iyi filme kandi imaze kwegukana ibihembo byinshi hirya no hino ku isi aho yatsindiye igihembo cya Best documentary muri Winter Film Awards i muri Amerika itsindira Best Director Feature Documentary mu iserukiramuco rya Golden State Film Festival ndetse itsindira n'igihembo cya Best Feature muri Austria International Film Festival yo muri 2020. "}
{"id": "20565", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20565", "title": "Dinner at My Place", "text": "Dinner at My Place ni filimi yi nkinamico yo muri Nigeriya 2022 isetsa yanditswe kandi iyobowe na Kevin Apaa. Muriiyi filime hagaragaramo Timini Egbuson, Bisola Aiyeola na Sophie Alakija. Iyi filime yasohotse mu kinamico kuya 28 Mutarama 2022 kandi ifungura ibitekerezo byiza byabanenga. \nInyandiko.\nIyifilime ishingiye ku mugabo womuri Nijeriya-Umunyamerika, Nonso, uteganya gusaba umukunzi we ibiryo. Yamaze guteganya guha umukunzi we impeta ya zahabu yari ifite agaciro ka $ 22000, kandi mu ntangiriro yariya nyina yakundaga cyane, kubera konyina wapfuye yamusigiye iyo mpeta kugira ngo amwibuke. Ariko icyamutangaje, ibintu birushaho kuba bibi mubyifuzo bye mugihe uwahoze ari umukunzi we (Bisola Aiyeola) yangije kwishimisha yinjira mwishusho akerekana ko atatumiwe.\nUkoyakinwe.\nUmukinnyi wa firime Kevin Apaa yatangaje koyabanje kuvuga inkuru ibereye firime ngufi kandi akora firime ngufi mu gihe cyiminota 11 ifite umutwe umwe. Yasohotse muri 2019 ifungura ibitekerezo byiza. Filime ngufi yamamaye cyane yatsindiye ibihembo umunani, kandi yanerekanwe mu iserukiramuco rya filime muri Uthe SA na Uthe K. Kwakirwa neza muri firime ngufi byashishikarije Apaa kuzana firime ndende ikomeza izina rimwe. We hamwe nabakozi be bakoze inyandiko nkafirime yikinamico. Abakinnyi bakinnye muri firime yerekana ntabwo bari bagaragaye muri firime ngufi. Filime yafatiwe amashusho yose muri Lagos. "}
{"id": "20566", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20566", "title": "Eyimofe", "text": "Eyimofe (Eyimofe: Iki Nicyo Cyifuzo cyanjye) ni film yikinamico yomuri Nigeriya 2020 yakozwe, yanditswe kandi iyobowe nabavandimwe bimpanga Arie Esiri na Chuko Esiri mugitaramo cyabo cya mbere. Filime ikozwe mu bice bibiri byitwa Espagne nUbutaliyani. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Jude Akuwudike na Temi Ami-Williams mu nshingano nyamukuru. Iyi filime yafunguwe kugirango isuzumwe neza n'abayinenga kandi yerekanwe mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime mpuzamahanga ku isi mu bihugu 17. \nInyandiko.\nIgabanyijemo ibice bibiri bitandukanye, iyifilime irazenguruka umutekinisiye wamaduka Mofe (Jude Akuwudike) hamwe numusatsi witwa Rosa (Temi Ami-Williams) kugushaka ibyo bategereje kandi bizera kobizaba ubuzima bwiza kunkombe zamahanga. Mofe yifuza kujya muri Espagne kandi Rosa yizeye kujya muButaliyani. Icyakora, Mofe yabuze umuryango we, mugihe Rosa yananiwe kwita kuri mushiki wemuto utwite maze arongora nyirinzu bitari ngombwa.\nUkoyakozwe.\niyfilime yatangajwe nimpanga arizo Arie Esiri na Chuko Esiri abakoraga kumushinga fatanije. niyo yabahaye itangiriri ryubuzima bawbo muri sinema kuko bayiyoboye bombi. Umushinga wose watewe inkunga imbere muri Nigeria, ukorwa ukoresheje kamera ya 16mm, kandi ifatwa amashusho mu bice 48 bitandukanye byo muri Lagos, aho inkuru iba ikinirwa. Hari n\u2019uduce duke twafatiwe muri New York. Mu 2018, iyi filime yegukanye igihembo cya Purple List Award, hanyuma mu 2019 itoranywa mu mishinga 10 yaherewe amahugurwa muri IFP Narrative Lab i New York.\nKurekura.\nIyifilime yerekanwe mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga ryafilime mpuzamahanga ryabereye muri Afurika y'Epfo, Ubuholandi, Amerika, Ubutaliyani, Polonye, Ubwongereza, Espagne, Burezili, Porutugali, UAE, Kanada, Otirishiya, Ubushinwa, Ubugereki, Misiri, Ubudage n'Ubuhinde. \nFilime yatoranijwe kumugaragaro kugirango yerekanwe bwambere mubihugu 17 mubirori byabo byafirime kuburyo bukurikira\nGutanga ibihembo.\nFilime yakiriye ibihembo bitandukanye inatoranywa mubirori bya firime. Yatsindiye igihembo cya Achille Valdata mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga ryafirime muri Torino 2020. "}
{"id": "20567", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20567", "title": "Fifty (film)", "text": "Fifty ni filime y\u2019ikinamico y\u2019urukundo yo muri Nijeriya 2015, yayobowe na Biyi Bandele ikaba yarasohotse kuya 18 Ukuboza 2015. \nUmugambi.\nfifty ivuga ku iminsi mike yingenzi yabagore bane kurwego rwo hejuru rwumwuga wabo. Tola, Elizabeth, Maria, na Kate ninshuti enye bahatiwe mu gihe cyo hagati kugira ngobandike ubuzima bwabo bwite mugihe bakora umwuga ndetse numuryango bakurikije uturere twa Lagos. \nTola aba ariumustar kuri TV washakanye numunyamategeko Kunle ntabwo yigeze agira amahirwe kubera ibanga ryumuryango ridasanzwe. Elizabeth abari umuganga ububyaza wamamaye cyane ku basore bamutandukanije numukobwa we. Maria, ufite imyaka mirongo ine n'icyenda, abafitanye ikibazo numugabo wubatse bikaviramo gutwita mu buryo butunguranye, kandi intambara ya Kate n\u2019indwara ishobora guhitana ubuzima bwamuteye kwishora mwidini.\nUkoyakozwe.\nFilime yakozwe mubuyobozi bukuru bwa Ebony Life TV Mo Abudu. Bayobowe na Biyi Bandele. \nUkoyasohotse.\n\"Fifty\" ereksnywe bwa mbere i Londres mukwakira 2015, igurishwa mu minsi ine, kandi muri ukwezi kwa Lagos habereye kwerekanwa kugiti cye. Grand Premiere yariku cyumweru, tarikiya 13 Ukuboza 2015, muri Eko Hotel na Suites. Filime yasohotse muri sinema ku ya 18 Ukuboza 2015. \nKwakira neza.\nFilime yakunzwe cayne nabagenzuzi. Nollywood yayihaye 52% anagaragaza ko idafite ibirimo n'uburebure. "}
{"id": "20568", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20568", "title": "Muganga Bello", "text": "Muganga Bello nifilime yerekana ikinamico yomuri Nigeriya 2013 iyobowe na Tony Abulu yakinwena Yesaya Washington, Vivica A. Fox, Jimmy Jean-Louis, Genevieve Nnaji, Stephanie Okereke, Justus Esiri, Ebbe Bassey na Jon Freda. "}
{"id": "20571", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20571", "title": "Neil Sandilands", "text": "Neil Joseph William Sandilands numukinnyi w'Afurika yepfo, afatamashusho, numucuranzi uzwiho kugaruka kenshi kuri \"Hap na Leonard,\" \"The 100\", Flash season 4 nka Clifford DeVoe / The Thinker. Yakinnye kandi Jenerali Abbott mu \"menyo meza\", ahabwa igihembo cy\u2019abana n\u2019umuryango Emmy kubera igihembo cyiza cyo gushyigikira imikorere. \nUmwuga.\nSandilands yatangiye umwugawe mugihugu cyecy'Afurika y'Epfo kandi akina mumishinga itandukanye, harimo na televiziyo \"7de Laan\", ahoyerekanaga imico Bart Kruger kuva mu 2000 kugeza 2007. Amaze kurangiza imirimo ye kuri \"7de Laan\", yimukiye i Los Angeles, muri Californiya mu 2007. Mu gihe yari i Los Angeles, Sandilands yagaragaye cyane mu \"rukurikirane\" rw'amakinamico y'Abanyamerika. Nyumayaje gusubira muri Afurika y'Epfo agaragara muri filime nyinshi zizwi cyane zo muri Afurika, harimo ikinamico yegukanye ibihembo \"Die Ballade van Robbie de Wee\". Muricyigihe, Sandilands yakoraga indi mirimo nk'umusaruro n'ubwubatsi kugira ngo abone ibimutunga, yigeze kuvuga ati: \"Nagombaga gusubira mu yandi masomo nko kuyobora no nyuma y\u2019umusaruro ndetse rimwe na rimwe nkubaka uruzitiro ku baturanyi banjye cyangwa ibindi bikorwa bimwe na bimwe bitavugwa kugira ngw'ikirura kidahungabana\", Sandilands yagize ati: Sandilands yagarutse mur'Amerika muri 2014.\nmu 2015, Sandilands yashyize umushyitsi kuri hitFX series \"The Americans.yarafite inshingano nka\" Titus muThe CW's \"The 100\" nka Paco muri SundanceTV's \"Hap and Leonard\". mu 2017, Sandilands yagize uruhare rwabashyitsi mugihe cyirekire. CBS series \"NCIS\" mazeyinjira mubakinnyi bakomeye CW superhero drama \"The Flash\" as Clifford DeVoe / The Thinker.\u00a0[\"citation needed\"]\nMuri Kanama 2022, Sandilands yakinnye muri filime \"y'Ubwami bw'Umubumbe wa Apes\", filime ihagarariwe na Wes Ball kuri Studiyo yomu kinyejana cya 20. \nUbuzima bwite.\nSandilands ivuga Afurika n'Icyongereza. "}
{"id": "20572", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20572", "title": "Impostor (film yo muri Amerika 1944)", "text": "Impostor (uzwi ku izina rya Strange Confession) ni filime y'intambara yomuri Amerika yomu 1944 ihagarariwena Julien Duvivier ikinywamona Jean Gabin. \nUmugambi.\nClement (Gabin), umwicanyi wamaganwe muminota mike uvuyekuri guillotine, \"yarabohowe\" igihigisasu cy'Abanazi cyibasiye gereza y'Ubufaransa imufashe. Mugihe yahunze, yibye impapuro n\u2019umwirondoro w\u2019umusirikare w\u2019Ubufaransa wapfuye. Nyuma yihisha mu mategeko yinjira mu ngabo z\u2019Abafaransa zidegembya muri Afurika y\u2019uburinganire bw\u2019Abafaransa. Indangagaciro nshya ya Clement n'intego mubuzima bimuvugurura. Amaherezo yitanze mu murimo w'igihugu cye."}
{"id": "20573", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20573", "title": "Lingui, Inkunga Zera", "text": "Lingui, Inkunga Yera (French) mu 2021 film yakozwe namakinamico mpuzamahanga yakozwe ihagarariwe na Mahamat Saleh Haroun. Muri, filime yatoranijwe guhatanira Palme d'or mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 2021. Yatoranijwe nkuwinjira muri Tchad muri Filime Nziza Mpuzamahanga nziza muri 94th Academy Awards. Yatsindiye kandi umudari wa IFFI ICFT UNESCO Gandhi mwiserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime mu Buhinde\nUmugambi.\nMunkengero za N'Djamena muri Tchad, Amina abana wenyine n'umukobwa we Maria w'imyaka 15 gusa. Isi ye isanzwe yoroheje irasenyuka umunsi yamenye ko umukobwa we atwite. Umwangavu ntashaka iyi nda. Mugihugu aho gukuramo inda bitamaganwa n\u2019amadini gusa, ahubwo nomu mategeko, Amina usanga ahanganye n\u2019intambara isankaho yatsinzwe mbere.\nKurekura.\nNyuma yambere yerekanwe mwiserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes, uburenganzirabwo gukwirakwiza filime muri Amerika, Ubwongereza, Turukiya, Amerika y'Epfo na Irlande bwaguzwe na MUBI. "}
{"id": "20575", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20575", "title": "Umugenzi (film ya 1975)", "text": "Umugenzi (Italian) ni filime ikinamico yo mu 1975 iyobowe na Michelangelo Antonioni. Iyi filime yanditswe na Antonioni, Mark Peploe, na Peter Wollen, ivuga ku bijyanye na Anglo - umunyamakuru w\u2019umunyamerika, David Locke (Jack Nicholson), wibwira ko ari umucuruzi wapfuye ubwo yakoraga documentaire i Tchad, ataziko yiganumucuruzi w\u2019intwaro ufite aho ahuriye n\u2019inyeshyamba muntambara y\u2019abenegihugu. Munzira, aherekejwe n'umukobwa ukirimuto utaravuzwe izina (Maria Schneider).\n\"Umugenzi\" niyo filime yanyumamumasezerano atatu ya Antonioni yagiranye na producer Carlo Ponti na Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer, nyuma ya \"Blowup\" (1966) na \"Zabriskie Point\" (1970). Iyi filime yakiriweneza, abayinenga bashima icyerekezo cy'Antonioni, imikorere ya Nicholson, sinema, hamwe ninsanganyamatsiko iranga, gutenguha nokubaho. Mugihe iyi filime yasohokaga, yari mumarushanwa ya Palme d'or mwiserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes. \nIyi filime yabanje gusohoka na MGM ibinyujije mu bahanzi bunze ubumwe mur'Amerika, ariko mugukemura igice cy\u2019amakimbirane ashingiye kumushinga utandukanye, Nicholson yahawe uburenganzira bwa filime kandi bivugwa koyabujije gukwirakwiza amashusho kugezigihe Sony Pictures yemeye kongera gukora no kongera kuyisohora. Mu 2005, byemejwe na Nicholson, Sony Pictures Classics yongeye gukora iyo filime, itangikinamico ntarengwa yo kongera gusohoka ku ya 28 Ukwakira 2005, ikanayishyira kuri DVD ku ya 25 Mata 2006. \nUmugambi.\nDavid Locke numunyamakuru wa tereviziyo utemewe mu majyaruguru ya Tchad, ashakakubaza abarwanyi b'inyeshyamba bagizuruhare muntambara y'abenegihugu. Guharanira gushaka ababajijwe, arushaho gucikintege iyo Land Rover yiguye mumucanga nyuma yogutabwa aho n'abayobozi. Nyuma y'urugendo rurerure anyuzemuri Sahara asubira muri hoteri ye, Locke ananiwe amenya ko umushyitsi mugenzi we (Robertson), umwongereza bari bafitanye ubucuti busanzwe, yapfiriye mu cyumba cye cy'indwara y'umutima muri iryo joro. Locke yahisemo guhindura imyirondoro na Robertson, basacyane, mazavugako yapfiriye ku meza, umugambi ugenda nta nkomyi. Locke akusanya ibintu bya Robertson, birimo pistolet, igitabo cyabigenewe na pasiporo. Yahinduye pasiporo kugirango yitwaze ifoto ye.\nI Londres, umugore wa Locke wahemutse Rachel ahinduka umwere iyo amenyeye \"urupfu\" rw'umugabo we. Yegereye inshuti ye, producer wa BBC witwa Knight, kugirango akurikirane Robertson kandamenye ibyavuzwe na Locke muminsi yashize. Locke, amazekwerekeza i Munich, ahasanga ikibuga cyindegekirimo ububiko bufite urutonde-rwibiciro hamwe nimpapuro nyinshi zafotowe zerekana intwaro. Akora ku bushake, akurikira ifarashi yera n'amagare mu bukwe muri shapeli ya baroque, aho ategereza inyuma y'itorero. Ubukwe bumaze kurangira, abagabo babiri babonye Locke ku kibuga cy'indege baramuhangana basaba \"impapuro\". Locke amazekubaha impapuro ziva mukabati, bamuha ibahasha y'amafaranga bamubwira kwigice cya kabiri kigomba kwishyurwa muri Barcelona. Bimaze kugaragara ko Robertson yari umucuruzi w'intwaro ku nyeshyamba zimwe Locke yagerageje kuvugana na Tchad.\nMuri Barcelona, Locke ahitamo Knight, ugerageza gushaka Robertson. Locke ahura numunyeshuri wubwubatsi, uzwi nk \" Umukobwa 'gusa, mugihe agerageza kwihisha mu nyubako ya Gaudi, Palau G\u00fcell. Nyuma (kuri La Pedrera, indinyubako ya Gaudi kuri Paseo de Gracia), Locke arasabumukobwa kuzana ibintubye muri hoteri kugirangwatazabonayo hariya na Knight ureba lobby. Knight aramwumva mugihe akusanya imizigo ye, akavugana nawehanze. Yemeye kumujyana guhura na Robertson, amusabako yamukurikira muri tagisi, ariko abasha kumubura. We na Locke bavamuri Barcelona, bahinduka abakunzi mugihebahunze. Koresha amafaranga avuyekwishura mbereyintwaro zitatanzwe, Locke ashushanya kugirangwinama iteganijwe mubitabo bya Robertson. Umubonano we ntugaragara; abagabo bategura amasezerano yintwaro barashimuswe, babazwa, kandi bakubitwa na hitmen bakorera leta ya Tchad.\nI Londres, Rachel yakiriye ibintu bya Locke muri Afurika. Amaze kumva Knight avugako yirukanwe muri Barcelona, Rachel yatunguwe no gufungura pasiporo ya Locke asanga ifoto ya Robertson yanditsimbere. Akeka ukuri, yerekeje muri Espagne gushaka Locke, kuko abamukubise bamukurikira, bibwira ko bakurikira Robertson. Rachel ahabwa ubufasha na polisi ya Espagne mukumukurikirana, ariko Locke n'umukobwa bakomejekubahunga. Imodokayabo yangiritse, Locke yohereje umukobwa, amutegeka guhura nawe nyuma yiminsi itatu i Tangiers. Umutego rwose, Locke agenzura muri hoteri yomumujyi wa Osuna womuri Esipanye, aho yasanze uyumukobwa yagarutse maze yandikisha icyumba cya kabiri yiyita Madamu Robertson. Yongeye kugerageza kumwumvisha kugenda. Yasohotse muri hoteri maze azenguruka mukibanza cyuzuye ivumbi hanze, ashaka kumugarukira. Bidatinze, hitmen bageze muri hoteri, bahaguruka mbereyuko abapolisi bahagera hamwe na Rachel. Umukobwa yinjiye mwitsinda rya nyuma, basanga Locke yapfiriye mu cyumba cye. Abajijwe n'abapolisi niba bamuzi, Rachel avuga ko atigeze amumenya, ariko umukobwa ati: \"Yego\".\nUmusaruro.\nIterambere.\nMumyaka yaza 1960, Michelangelo Antonioni yariyasinyanye amasezerano y\u2019amashusho atatu na producer Carlo Ponti na Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer. Filime ebyiri zambere ni \"Blowup\" (1966) na \"Zabriskie Point\" (1970). Umushingawe wagatatu wiswe \"uburyohe bwa tekiniki\", yagendeye kunkuru ngufi yo mu 1958 yise \"L'avventura di un fotografo\" (bisobanurwa ngo \"Amahirwe yumufotozi\") na Italo Calvino. [9] Umutwe wari watewe inkunga n\u2019amagambo J. Robert Oppenheimer yavuze kuribombe atomike kubera \"tekiniki nziza\" (ubwiza bw'imibare, imibare ya elegance) ibibazo byateje. Antonioni yabanje kwandika ubuvuzi bwa firime mu 1966, nyuma yandika inyandiko ku bufatanye na Mark Peploe, Niccol\u00f2 Tucci, na Tonino Guerra. [10] Nyumayuko \"Zabriskie Point\" (1970) irekuwe, Antonioni yamaze imyaka ibiri mu mirimo yabanjirije umusaruro, harimo n\u2019abaskuti bari hafi y\u2019umugezi wa Amazone. [11]\nJack Nicholson na Maria Schneider baribahujweninyenyeri muruyumushinga. [9] Antonioni yaraziranye na Nicholson mumyaka yashize kuberako \"Zabriskie Point\" (1970) na \"Easy Rider\" (1969) byabaye gufatamashusho hafiyabo. Mugenzi wa Nicholson, Dennis Hopper, yatumiye Antonioni mukwerekana filime yeyambere kugiticye, nyuma Antonioni na Nicholson bavugana byinshi. Icyakora, Ponti yahangayikishijwe nigiciro kinini cyokurasa ahantumaze ahagarikumushinga. Muri [1975, Antonioni yatangarije \"Los Angeles Times\" ko kunanirwa mubucuruzi kwa \"Zabriskie Point\" (1970) byagize uruhare muguhagarika umushinga. Inyandiko, yahinduwe mwizina ry\u2019Ubutaliyani yitwa \"Tecnicamente dolce\", nyuma yasohowe na Einaudi mu 1976. [10] \nFilime yingengo yimari yiswe \"Fatal Exit\" yarimwiterambere rya Carlo Ponti Productions. Uyumushinga wariwanditswe na Mark Peploe, warumuvandimwe wa Antonioni wahoze akorananawe, Clare Peploe. [11] Mwikubitiro, Mark Peploe yagombaga kuyoboriyo filime, akoresheje amashusho yanditswenawe na Peter Wollen. [15] Icyakora, Ponti ahubwoyasabye Antonioni kuyobora iyi filime, cyane cyane kuberuburambe bwa Peploe nk'umuyobozi. Antonioni yemeye icyo cyifuzo, byemejwe na Peploe. Antonioni yari yabonye isano irihagati ya \"Tekiniki Sweet\" na Peploe kuko yariyibanze kumunyamakuru w'amafoto. Ariko, kubera ubwitange bwa Nicholson muri \"Chinatown\" (1974), Antonioni yari afite ibyumweru bitandatu gusa byo kwandika ibyanditswe. [15]\nGufata amashusho.\n[\"[\" File: Igisenge cya Casa Mila, Barcelona. Locke (Nicholson) arasaba Umukobwa gukura ibintu bye muri hoteri kugirango atabonwa na Knight, inshuti ye kuri BBC.]]\nAmafoto nyamukuru yabereye i Tassili N'Ajjer, Intara ya Illizi ya Alijeriya (kwerekana Tchad), Centre ya Brunswick, London, St. Georg (Bogenhausen)\u00a0 5 2] \u200b \u200b [\"kunanirwa kugenzura\"]\nMu gihe kirekire, hakiri kare muri filime, umukinnyi wa Nicholson Locke arimo ahindura amafoto, hagati ya pasiporo ya Locke na Robertson, mu cyumba cye cya hoteri, hamwe na kaseti yafashwe amajwi yakinnye ikiganiro mbere ya Locke na Robertson, ubu akaba yarapfuye. Kamera ipakira amasegonda 25, itagabanijwe, kugirango igumane isura ya Robertson kuri Live kuri bkoni, mugihe Locke agaragaye iruhande rwe maze bombi bakomeza kuvuga (ni ukuvuga muri kamera muri flash-imwe imwe).Iyicwa ry'imfungwa muri iyi film ntabwo ryateguwe. Igizwe namashusho nyayo yibikorwa nyabyo abakozi bafashe amashusho mugihe bari. Ifoto yanyuma ya firime ni iminota itandatu, isegonda 32-isegonda yo gufata amashusho atangirira mucyumba cya hoteri ya Locke, ureba hanze ku mukungugu wuzuye ivumbi, asunika mu tubari tw\u2019idirishya rya hoteri yinjira mu kibuga, azenguruka dogere 180, arangije asubira inyuma yerekeza hafi y\u2019imbere y\u2019icyumba imbere. [26]\nKurekura.\n\"Umugenzi\" yarekuwe na Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer abinyujije ku bahanzi bunze ubumwe muri Amerika ku ya 9 Mata 1975. Nyuma yimyaka iyi filime isohotse, Nicholson yari yarateje imbere kandi ateganya kuzakina umushinga wa firime, ariko MGM yaretse umushinga. Nicholson yasabye indishyi, MGM ireka \"Umugenzi\" kuri Nicholson. Mu myaka hafi mirongo itatu, Nicholson yabujije filime gukwirakwizwa, nubwo yasohotse muri make na Warner Home Video kuri videwo mu myaka ya za 1980. [\"2003\"] Sony Pictures Classics yegereye Nicholson amusaba kugarura no kongera gusohora film. Ku ya 28 Ukwakira 2005, iyi filime yahawe igihe gito muri Amerika, aho yinjije amadorari 768.744 ku isi yose. Filime yasohotse kuri DVD ku Mata 2006.\nKwakira.\nVincent Canby wo mu \"kinyamakuru The New York Times\" yanditse ko iyi filime ari \"melodrama ihagarikwa, inkuru isanzwe isanzwe ku buryo bitarenze byibuze igice cya kabiri way unyuzemo urabona ko ari inzozi nziza, kandi ko uri imbere ureba hanze.\" Gene Siskel wo muri \"Tribune ya Chicago\" yahaye iyi filime isubiramo ryuzuye ry\u2019inyenyeri enye, agira ati: \" \"Umugenzi\" ni filime igoye igaragara gusa mu bwiza bwayo bw'umubiri. Kandi niba udafatiye kuri iyo nkuru yo mu bwonko bwo mu bwonko, birashoboka ko uzasanga umuvuduko w'inkuru yo kwiruka utinda cyane. Abareba bahuza n'urundi rwego, ariko bafite ubushishozi budasanzwe bwo kwerekana ishusho n'ibitekerezo... Nicholson. Igishushanyo cyiza cya Antonioni. \" \u200b\"\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\" \nKevin Thomas wo mu \"kinyamakuru Los Angeles Times\" yise iyi filime \"igihangano cy\u2019ubwiza bugaragara ndetse n\u2019ubuhanzi bukomeye burimo gusebanya nk\u2019uko ari hypnotic. Ni ikintu gikomeye cyagezweho n\u2019umwe mu bakora amafilime akomeye ku isi kandi akirata ikindi kintu cyiza cyatanzwe na Nicholson\". Penelope Gilliatt wo muri \"New Yorker\" yise iyi filime \"intsinzi yo guhanga tekinike irambuye amagambo y\u2019ubuhanga bwa filime kuko atigeze ayirambura mbere\". Hank Werba wo muri \"Variety\" yanditse Antonioni \"akora cyane amaboko yerekana amashusho meza ya firime agaragazwa nuburyo bwe bwite ndetse nububabare bwo gutekereza kubuzima bwa none kugirango ashishikarize guhura nabo.\" \nRoger Ebert yabanje guha iyi filime isuzuma ribi mu 1975. Mu 2005, yasubiyemo iyi filime asubiramo neza, yandika ko ari ukureba neza indangamuntu, kwitandukanya n\u2019icyifuzo cya muntu cyo kwikuramo. Yashimye kandi imikorere ya Schneider nk \"imikorere yo guhumeka neza.\" John Simon, mu gitabo cye cyo mu 1983 \"cyitwa Something to Declare\", yanditse adashidikanya ko \"Ubusa buri hose: ahantu nyaburanga no mu mijyi, mu nsengero no mu byumba bya hoteri, ndetse cyane cyane mu byanditswe. Ntabwo bigeze habaho ibiganiro byitwa ko ari impfabusa, umugambi mubisha ariko utabishaka, biranga ibintu byinshi kandi bidafite ishingiro. \nMuri 2012, \"Umugenzi\" yashyizwe ku mwanya wa 110 ku matora y\u2019abanenga \"Sight &amp;amp; Sound\". Filime yashyizwemo n'ikinyamakuru \"Empire\" nk'imwe muri Filime \"mu bihe byose\". Iki kinyamakuru cyashimye amashusho ya firime (yakozwe na Luciano Tovoli) ndetse n\u2019ibikorwa byakozwe, cyane cyane imikorere ya Nicholson ituje kandi yerekana. [Kurubuga rwumvikanyweho rugira riti: \"Amateka ya Antonioni, umugani w'abantu bonyine, batandukanye mu rugendo nubwo imiterere y'amayobera y'irangamuntu, ihindagurika ifite ubwiza kandi idashidikanywaho.\" Kuri Metacritic, film ifite amanota 90 ishingiye kubisubiramo 20, byerekana \"gushimwa kwisi yose\". "}
{"id": "20576", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20576", "title": "Sira (film)", "text": "Sira ni filime yikinamico yakozwe muri 2023 yanditswe kandi iyoborwa na Apolline Traor\u00e9 ikinwamo na Nafissatou Ciss\u00e9, Mike Danon, Lazare Minoungou, Nathalie Vairac na Ruth Werner. Iyifilime yerekana inkuru yumusore winzererezi witwa Sira, nyuma yigitero simusiga yanze kumanika atarwanye ahubwo agahagurukira kurwanya iterabwoba. Nubufatanye hagati ya Burkina Faso, Senegali, Ubufaransa n'Ubudage.\nYabaye iyambere kwisi ku ya 21 Gashyantare 2023 mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya 73 rya Berlin, ahoyatsindiye igihembo cya Panorama Audience Award kubera Filime nziza. Yatoranijwe nkuwinjira muriBurkinab\u00e9 mubyiciro byiza bya Filime mpuzamahanga byerekana ibihembo bya 96 bya Academy. Burkina filime ku mbere kuva mu 1989. \nInyandiko.\nFilime yashyizwe muri Sahel ivuga amateka yumukobwa ukirimuto wa Fulani, Sira, wagiye guhura numukwe we, Jean-Sidi. Mu buryo butunguranye, wenumuryango we batewe niterabwoba. Abagabo bose bararashwe maze umuyobozi wagatsiko, Y\u00e9r\u00e9, afata Sira aramusambanya. Asigaye apfira mubutayu, Sira yisanga wenyine maze ahungira mubuvumo ubwo yambaraga gahunda yo kubaho.\nUkoyakozwe.\nIyifilime yahawe inkunga nikigega cyisi cya Sinema (WCF Africa Programme) yamayero 39.000 mu Gushyingo \nUmukinnyi wambere, Nafissatou Ciss\u00e9 yatoranijwe mubakobwa barenga 1.000, bagenzuwe. Yafatiwe amashusho yose muri Mauritania, Amajyaruguru yuburengerazuba bwa Afrika. \nKurekura.\n\"Sira\" yagaragaye bwa mbere kuya 21 Gashyantare 2023, murwego rwo kwerekana iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya 73 rya Berlin, muri Panorama. yatumiwe mwi iserukiramuco rya Filime na Televiziyo bya Panafrican 2023 rya Ouagadougou, mumarushanwa yabaye kuva kuya 25 Gashyantare 2023 kugeza kuya 4 Werurwe. mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya 44 rya Durban 20 Nyakanga \nKuya 14 Gashyantare 2023, havuzwe ko sosiyete yokugurisha ikorera mumujyi wa Paris Wide yabonye uburenganzira kwisi yose. \nIzitabira amarushanwa mpuzamahanga mwi iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya 39 Mons ryabaye kuva kuya 8 kugeza kuya 16 Werurwe 2024. \nKwakira.\nVladan Petkovic asubiramo Cineuropa yashimye Nafissatou Ciss\u00e9 yanditse ati: \"Ciss\u00e9 ni wefata abitabiriye igitaramo cyecyose, bigatuma iyi filime ibambi cyane kuruta uburyo bwo kwihorera kugahato.\" Petkovic yashimye umuyobozi Apolline Traor\u00e9 hamwe numukinnyi womuri sinema Nicolas Berteyac \"koreografiya igoye yabantu benshi, inyamaswa nimodoka zigaragaza amashusho menshi\". Yashimye umwanditsi Sylvie Gadmer, we yagize ati: \"ubahuza ubushishozi [amafuti] n\u2019abakunzi ba hafi,\" ndetse n\u2019umuhimbyi Cyril Morin, kubera \"amanota yatanzwe neza\". Kuri iyifilime Petkovic yagize ati: \"Traor\u00e9 yateguye inkuru mu buryo bwubwenge kandi bw'inyangamugayo\", yashyizwe ahantu nyaburanga \"hamwe numugore womuri Afurika w'umunyarugomo nkintwari irwanya ibibazo byose\". Yongeyeho, ibyo byose bituma iba \"filime idasanzwe yo muri Afurika yorohereza abayireba kurwego mpuzamahanga.\" "}
{"id": "20577", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20577", "title": "Inswa", "text": "inswa ni udusimba duto kandi rimwe narimwe turibwa n' inyoni ndetse \nnutundi tunyabuzima dusanga mubice bitandukanye by'isi. utu dusimba\ndukunda kugenda n'ijoro kandi tugakunda urumuri cyane.utu dusimba \nn'ubwo dukunda urumuri ariko dufite ubushobozi bwo kuba no mumwobo\niyo n'amababa dufite.\nrero utu dusimba turimo amako menshi ariko igihe kimwe batwita ibiharara nk'irindi \nzina ryatwo. rero utu dusimba nitwiza kandi dufite akamarom muri rusange."}
{"id": "20578", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20578", "title": "Running the Sahara", "text": "GRunning the Sahara ni filime mbara nkuru omuri 2007 ivugaku amateka ya Ray Zahab, Charlie Engle, na Kevin Lin bagerageza kunyura mu butayu bwose bwa Sahara. Bakoze urugendo rwibirometero 6920, bageraku nyanja Itukura kuya 20 Gashyantare 2007.\nAbaproducer Marc Joubert, Keith Quinn, Larry Tanz hamwe numuyobozi James Moll bafatiye amashusho ahantu muri Afurika mubihugu bitandatu: Senegali, Mauritania, Mali, Niger, Libiya, Misiri. Prepare2go.com yashyigikiye abakozi bafilime hamwe nibikoresho byose."}
