{"id": "20582", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20582", "title": "West Indies: The Fugitive Slaves of Liberty", "text": "West Indies: The Fugitive Slaves of Liberty (French) ni 1979 muri Alijeriya-Mauritanian film yikinamico yumuziki wigifaransa iyobowe na Med Hondo. firime wakuwe mu ikinamico yitwa \"Les Negrier\" (Abacakara), yanditswe na Daniel Boukman. Iyi filime ifatwa cyane nka filime y\u2019ingenzi mu mateka ya sinema nyafurika kukoyakozwe ningengo yimari ingana na miliyoni 1.35 zamadolari yamerika, bityo ikaba imwe murifilime nini zateganijwe muri Afurika zigeze gukorwa. Kubera inyuma y\u2019abakoloni b\u2019Uburengerazuba bw\u2019abakoloni, bwari munsi y\u2019ubwami bw\u2019Abafaransa, ikinamico yashyizwe mu bwato bwabacakara. Filime yasohotse mwikinamico mu 1979."}
{"id": "20583", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20583", "title": "Achoura", "text": "Achoura n'ifilime iteye ubwoba yabanye Marroco bakoresha igifaransa yomuri 2018 yayobowe kandi yandikwa na Talal Selhami. Abakinnyi babanye Maroc Omar Lotfi na Younes Bouab bakinana na Sofia Manousha, Ivan Gonzalez, Mohamed Choubi, na Moussa Masskri. ni firime ishingiye ku inshuti enye zo mu bwana zongera guhura mugihe umwe muribo, waburiwe irengero hashize imyaka 25 mugihe cyibiruhuko bya Ashura, yongeye kwinjira mubuzima bwabo, bituma bahura na djinn iteye ubwoba. Filime ifatwa nka film yambere ya fantasy ya Maroc. \n\"Achoura\" niyo filime ya mbere y'inyamwanswa yafatiwe muri Maroke(morroco), Yerekanwe bwambere mu Kuboza 2018 mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime ry\u2019i Paris. Filime yabonye intsinzi mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Tangier aho yatsindiye igihembo cya filime yakozwe neza, nomwi iserukiramuco rya Filimi rya Marrakech. Iyifilime kandi yatsindiye igihembo kinini mu iserukiramuco rya Hard Line mu Budage mu Kwakira \nUkoyakozwe.\nGufata amashusho byakorewe muri Maroc, hafi ya Casablanca, muei 2015. \nYasohotse.\n\"Achoura\" yerekanwe bwambere muKuboza 2018 mwi iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime rya Paris. [\u200b \u200b \nMuri 2021, Dark Star Pictures yabonye uburenganzira bwo gukwirakwiza \"Achoura\"; iyifilime igiye gusohoka kuri DVD no kumbuga za interineti muri Amerika ku ya 14 Ukuboza \nKwakira.\nMwisubiramo ryiza cyane ryerekanwe kurifirime \"yamaraso yuzuye amaraso\", Patrick Bromley yavuze ko isano irihagati ya \"Achoura\" - yafotowe muri 2015 - nafirime \"It It\" 2017 hamwe nizikurikira 2019. \"\u200b\u200b\"\u200b "}
{"id": "20584", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20584", "title": "Nimbe", "text": "Nimbe uzwi kandi ku izina rya Nimbe: Filime nifilime yi ikinamico yomuri Nigeriya yakozwe 2019 iyobowe na Tope Alake. Muriiyi filime hagaragaramo Chimezie Imo, Toyin Abraham, Rachael Okonkwo na Doyin Abiola. Uruhare rwumutwe rukinishwa numukinnyi wa Imo kandi inkuru ishingiye kubiyobyabwenge. Iyifilime yasohotse mu ikinamico muri Nijeriya kuya 29 Werurwe 2019 kandi yakiriwe neza nabayinenga. Filime yabaye ibihembo byinshi muri office kandiyari imwemuri firime zatsinzwe muri Nigeriya mu mwaka wa 2019. Kurubu filime ifite umwanya wa 59 kurutonde rusange rwamafilime yinjije menshi muri Nijeriya. Iyi filime kandi yatorewe igihembo cyibirori bya Filime Nollywood yo mu Bwongereza 2019. \nInyandiko.\nInsanganyamatsiko yiyi firime ivuga ku umuhungu wumuyangavu Nimbe (Chimezie Imo) uhora asetsa bagenzi be ariko kubwamahirwe akabona ihumure, urukundo. ibintu byajeguhinduka mugihe yamenyeshejwe inzira iteje akaga yo gucuruza ibiyobyabwenge biba impinduka mubuzima bwe. Yiboneye kandi ahamya ibibazo biherekeza, inzitizi ningaruka zijyanye nokunywa ibiyobyabwenge. "}
{"id": "20585", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20585", "title": "Oga Bolaji", "text": "Oga Bolaji nifilime yikinamico yomuri Nigeriya yakozwe muri 2018 yanditswe kandi iyoborwa na Kayode Kasum. Muriyi filime hagaragaramo Ikponmwosa Gold, Omowumi Dada na Idowu Philips mu nshingano zabo. Iyifilime yasohotse ku Kanama 2018 kandi yakiriwe neza nabayinenga kandi yashimiwe cyane kubera amashusho yayo ndetse ninkuru. Iyifilime kandi yerekanwe mubirori firime nka New York African Film Festival, icyumweru cya Nollywood Paris, iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga ryafirime rya Zimbabwe, iserukiramuco rya sinema rya RTF, iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cardiff na Zanzibar International Festival. Iyifilime yerekanwe bwa mbere ku buntu n\u2019umuyobozi ubwe abinyujije kuri YouTube 2020 kubantu babaga mu rugo mugihe cyo gufunga kubera icyorezo cya coronavirus mu gihugu. \nInyandiko.\nOga Bolaji filime ishingiye ku nkuru yubuzima bushimishije-bwamahirwe yumucuranzi wacyuye igihe, ufite imyaka 40 ubuzima bwe burahinduka cyane iteka ryose iyo yambutse inzira numukobwa wimyaka 7. "}
{"id": "20586", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20586", "title": "Dear Affy", "text": "Dear Affy nifilime isekeje y\u2019urukundo yomuri Nijeriya yakozwe muri 2020 yanditswe na Temitope Bolade, Diche Enunwa, Anthony Kehinde Joseph, na Samuel Olatunji kandi iyobowe na Samuel Olatunji. Muri iyifilime hagaragaramo Toyin Abraham, Enyinna Nwigwe, Kehinde Bankole na Odunlade Adekola mubakinnyi ba mbere. Umukinnyi mushya Bianca Udo yatangiye gukina film ye binyuze muriyi film. Iy filime yasohotse muri Gashyantare 2020 ihura n'umunsi w'abakundana kandi yakiriwe neza n'abayinenga. \nInyandiko.\nmukobwa ukundwa cyane ubugiye kurongorwa nu umugabo winzozi ze agahura nimbogamizi nibibazo bitunguranye nyuma yo gutwita byimpanuka mbere yubukwe bwe. biksngiza imyiteguro ye neza kandi ashyiraho gahunda n'ingamba, maze atangira ubutumwa butoroshye bwo gushakisha se w'umwana we utaravuka. "}
{"id": "20587", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20587", "title": "Shadow Parties", "text": "Shadow Parties ni film yinkinamico ya politiki yomuri Nigeriya 2021 yayobowe kandi yakozwe na Yemi Amodu. Muriyi filime hagaragaramo Yemi Blaq, Omotola Jalade-Ekeinde, Toyin Abraham, Jide Kosoko, Sola Sobowale, Magdalena Korpas, na Lucien Morgan. Yerekanwe kuri Netflix kuya 6 Nzeri 2021. \nUmugambi.\nIyi filime ishingiye kumakimbirane asanzwe aho Aremu ukomoka mu mujyi wa Aje, umujyi uturanye na Iludun, arinaho umugore we Arike yavukiye, uzwi cyane muntambara zabavandimwe, zahitanye ubuzima bwababyeyi ba Arike. Iyi mijyi yombi yajugunywe mu ntambara nyuma yuko bene wabo ba Aremu bahisemo gutwika umugore we numwana we ari muzima bavuga kari umwanzi waje gutera ibiterobyo kwihorera biturutse kuri Iludun iyobowe na Lowo, murumuna wa Arike. "}
{"id": "20588", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20588", "title": "Abobaku", "text": "Abobaku ni filime ngufi yakozwe mu2010 yanditswe inakorwa na Femi Odugbemi iyoboye na Niji Akanni. \nInyandiko.\nAremu ugombagupfana n'umwami (Abobaku) yafashwe arimogushimisha umukunziwe no gukurikiza umuco. Nyumayaje kumenyako umwami yarozwe numwe mubatware bityo ubuzima bwe bushobora kubungabungwa nkuko ashimisha mugenzi we utwite. \nIbihembo.\nIyi filime yatsindiye Filime ngufi yagaragaye cyane mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Zuma ryabaye mumwaka wa 2010 n\u2019imyambarire myiza mubihembo bya 6 bya Afurika Movie Academy Awards byabaye ku ya 10 Mata 2010 mukigo ndangamuco cya Gloryland kiri i Yenagoa, muri Leta ya Bayelsa, muri Nijeriya. \nKwakira.\nNyuma yimyaka 10 \"Abobaku\" arekuwe, yakinwe muri Wole Soyinka International Cultural Exchange kwizihiza isabukuru yimyaka 86 yumwanditsi. Filime yarimeze nkumukino wa Wole Soyinka n 'Abamafarasi bumwami "}
{"id": "20589", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20589", "title": "Games Men Play", "text": "Imikino Abagabo Bakina ni film yinkinamico yomuri Nigeriya 2006 iyobowe na Lancelot Oduwa Imasuen.\nUmugambi.\nFilime ireba kudasobanuka mubantu benshi bakize bomuri Lagos. Umukinyi nyamukuru Tara (Kate Henshaw-Nuttal) yahisemo gukora ubushakashatsi kumibanire yikiganiro kuri tereviziyo, yibanda kubushakashatsi yakoze ku bashakanye barimo ibiganiro byerekanwa kuri televiziyo Abby (Monalisa Chinda); umukunzi we Richmond (Mike Ezuruonye) numugorewe ufite umururumba kuruhanderwe (Ini Edo); umugorewo mu rugo ufite amateka ababaje (Chioma Chukwuka) n'umugabo we (Bob-Manuel Udokwu), bahigwa n'amabanga yijimye; nundi mugore wo murugo (Uche Jombo) urwana numugabo ukize, ushuka (Jim Iyke) na nyirabuja usaba (Dakore Egbuson). "}
{"id": "20590", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20590", "title": "Alakada: Bad and Boujee Film", "text": "Alakada: Bad And Boujee ni Film yasohotse mu mwaka wa 2024 ikaba ari filimi yo muri Nigeriya Icyongereza -ururimi rwurwenya-ikinamico ikinamico iyobowe na Adebayo Tijani kandi yanditswe na Toyin Abraham. Ikora nkibikomeza bya firime \"ya Alakada\". Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Toyin Abraham, Odunlade Adekola, Ini Edo, Bimbo Akintola Ronke Odusanya, na Okusanya Lolade, hamwe na Yhemolee, Ik Ogbonna, na Chimezie Imo bakina. Iyi filime ikurikira guhunga kwa Yetunde Animashaun, umukobwa ukiri muto wicisha bugufi wiyitirira kuba intore zo kuyobora ibibazo byimibereho.\nFilime yakinwe kandi isohokera muri Nijeriya ku ya 20 Ukuboza 2024, ikwirakwizwa na Filmone. \"Alakada: Bad and Boujee\" binjije miliyoni 134 z'amapound mu cyumweru cyatangiye, byerekana imikorere ikomeye ya Boxe ya Nigeriya kandi ishishikajwe cyane n\u2019abayitabiriye. Amafaranga yinjiye yagize uruhare mu bucuruzi ndetse no kwamamaza firime mugihe cyambere cyo kuyisohora. \nuburyo yanditswe.\nIyi filimi yerekeye ku nkuru ikurikira Yetunde, akaba yarakoraga kumbuga nkoranyambaga agakora ari umuntu mwiza kuri interineti abifashijwemo n'inshuti ze, Rebecca na Abebi. Bitewe n'icyifuzo kidahwema kuba icyamamare, kwemezwa, no kwemerwa mu nzego z'indobanure, Yetunde akurikirana icyamamare nubwo yakuze yicisha bugufi. Mugihe inkuru igenda itera imbere, ahatirwa guhangana numutekano muke kandi akamenya agaciro ko gukomeza kuba umwizerwa kuri we.\nAbakinnyi.\nAbandi bakinnyi bifashishijwe muri filimi ya \"Alakada: Bad and Boujee\" barimo abakinnyi n\u2019abacuranzi bo muri Nijeriya, baba barashinze kandi bakizamuka, nka King Sunny Ade na Portable. Imyitwarire yabo igira uruhare mubintu byurwenya bya firime. \nUmusaruro.\nKu ya 1 Gicurasi 2024, Toyin Abraham yatangaje ko igice cya gatanu cyiyi filimi y\u2019uruhererekane \"ya Alakada\" kizasohoka mu Kuboza 2024. Azandika kandi ayobore iyi filime izakorerwa munsi y\u2019isosiyete ikora ibicuruzwa. Ibi bikurikira intsinzi ya firime zabanje muri francise, harimo \"Alakada\" (2009), \"Alakada 2\" (2013), \"Alakada Reloaded\" (2017), na \"Fate of Alakada\" (2020). \nMu Gushyingo 2024, Toyin Abraham yemeje ko Umwami Sunny Ade azagaragara cyane muri \"Alakada: Bad and Boujee\" nyuma yo gusangizwa amashusho y\u2019umuririmbyi w\u2019imyaka 78 wageze aho iyi filime iherereye. Yatangaje ku rubuga rwe rwa Twitter, yandika ati: \"\"Umuntu udasanzwe ari muri #Alakadabadandboujee.\" Yatumye inzozi zanjye zisohora.\" "}
{"id": "20591", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20591", "title": "Alan Poza Film", "text": "Alan Poza ni filime yo gusetsa y\u2019urukundo yo muri Nijeriya yasohotse mu mwaka wa 2013 yanditswe, yakozwe kandi iyobowe na Charles Novia ikinwamo nabakinnyi nka OC Ukeje nka Alan Poza. Yakiriye nomination 2 muri 9th Africa Movie Academy Awards. OC Ukeje yatsindiye kandi ibihembo byiza bya Nollywood ibihembo kubera uruhare rwe rukomeye nka Alan Poza. \nUyu mugambi ukurikira Alan Poza (Ukeje), label umuyobozi wumuziki label ikina umuhungu,akaba yarateguye kandi anigarurira imitima yabagore benshi mubigo byitangazamakuru ndetse no hanze yacyo akorera, kugirango abashukishe muburiri bwe. Guhunga amarangamutima atandukanye amaherezo bimutera ibibazo kubera ko umwe mu 'bahohotewe' adashoboye guhangana n\u2019umutima wamuteye.\nuburyo filimi ya Alan Poza yakiriwe.\nFilime yakiriwe cyane nabayinengaga batigeze bayishimira, cyane cyane kubyanditswe no kuvuga inkuru. Nollywood Reinvented ni filimi yahawe amanota angana na 24% maze yandika ati: \"Kuri comedi, Alan Poza ntabwo ari umunyamahirwe. Nkurukundo rwurukundo, ruteye urujijo. Kandi ku ikinamico, ni akajagari cyane. Amaherezo OC ntiyigeze ansanga nkubwoko bwabakinnyi. Sinari nzi neza uko ikintu cyose cyabaye.\" \nAmashimwe.\n\"Alan Poza\" yahawe kandi itsindira ibihembo 2 bya Afurika Movie Academy Awards (AMAA) naho OC Ukeje ukina imico \"Alan Poza\" yatsindiye igihembo cyiza cya Nollywood (BON). "}
{"id": "20592", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20592", "title": "Alero's Symphony Film", "text": "Alero's Symphony ni filime yikinamico yumuziki yo muri Nigeriya 2011 iyobowe na Izu Ojukwu ndetse ikinwamo na Bimbo Manuel, Ivie Okujaye na Chibuzor 'Faze' Oji. Yerekanwe muri Palms, Itangiriro Cinemas, Lagos. Filime n'amashusho yerekana Amstel Malta Box Office 5 (AMBO 5) yerekana ukuri. Alero Symphony ni filimi kandi Yakiriye kandidatire4 mu bihembo bya Afurika Movie Academy Awards kandi yerekanwa mu mijyi minini yo muri Nijeriya na African Film Academy. \nUmugambi.\nFilime ivuga amateka ya Alero (Okujaye), impanga yavukiye mu muryango uzwi cyane wo mu rwego rwo hejuru benshi bita abakire. Amaze kurangiza kaminuza byari icyubahiro, agomba kwiga ishuri ryigisha amategeko. Ababyeyi be batabizi, icyifuzo cye nyacyo ni ukuba umuririmbyi. Umuryango wafashe icyemezo cyo kujya mubiruhuko birirwa kugirango bongere gutwika umubano wabo. Akiri aho, Alero ahura na Lovechild (Faze), umusereri w'umuhanga ariko ukennye. Lovechild afasha Alero gukurikirana ibyo akunda nkumwuga. Baca bakundana.\nKwakira.\nNollywood Reinvented yahaye iyi filime amanota 43% anashimira umwimerere ninkuru, icyakora yanenze imikorere ya Faze maze asoza agira ati: \"Niyo filime ya mbere Izu Ojukwu atakoze neza. Nakozwe ntegereje igihe kirekire rwose kugira ngo ndayirebe ariko mu gusubiza amaso inyuma ndifuza ko nakoresheje icyo gihe kugira ngo mbone umusaruro ushimishije.\" Ntabwo ari filime yuzuye kuri firime. \" "}
{"id": "20593", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20593", "title": "All The Colors Of The World Are Between Black and White", "text": "All the color of the world are between Black and White ni film yikinamico yo muri Nigeriya 2023 yanditswe kandi iyobowe na Babatunde Apalowo mugitangira cye cya mbere. Muri filime hagaragaramo Tope Tedela, Riyo David, Martha Ehinome Orhiere na Uchechika Elumelu. Yerekanwe mu gice cya Panorama mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya 73 rya Berlin, aho ryerekanwe bwa mbere ku isi ku ya 17 Gashyantare 2023 kandi ryegukana igihembo cya Teddy kubera filime nziza ya LGBTQ ifite insanganyamatsiko. \nUburyo abantu bayakiriye.\nJulian Janssen wo muri ObviosulyReviews yanditse kubyerekeranye no kuyobora byuzuye amashusho, byibutsa ibikorwa bya ba shebuja ba sinema Wong Kar-wai na Barry Jenkins. Yanditse ko ibyo Apalowo\u00b4 yagezeho muri filime ari ubushobozi bwe bwo guhuza abantu bavugwa no kwerekana imyumvire imwe n'imwe binyuze mu mashusho ye. "}
{"id": "20594", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20594", "title": "Alter Date Film", "text": "Alter Date ni filime yo gusetsa cyangwa se comedi ndetse n\u2019urukundo yo muri Nijeriya ikaba yarasohotse mu mwaka wa 2019 iyobowe na Marc Adebesin kandi yakozwe na Yemi Banjoko. Muri filime hagaragaramo Iyabo Ojo, Bolanle Ninalowo, na Kenneth Okolie. \nInyandiko.\nFilime izenguruka inshuti eshatu zishaka urukundo. Uwa mbere akeneye umuntu wumukire kugirango agumane amahame ye, uwa kabiri ntabwo afite amahirwe kubagabo naho uwanyuma ntagishoboye gukundana kandi ahora akundana nabagabo babi. \nYashijwe hanze.\nIyi filime yerekanwe ku wa 17 Mata 2019, muri Sinema ya Silverbird, Ikeja City Mall, Lagos. \nIbihembo yahawe.\nFilime yatsindiye ibihembo birindwi kandi yitabiriye amarushanwa inshuro 25 usibye igihembo cyatanzwe na GAP Award Body kubera gutanga umusanzu mu mashusho ya Afrika. "}
{"id": "20595", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20595", "title": "The Amazing Grace Film", "text": "Amazing Grace ni filime y\u2019amakinamico y\u2019amateka yo mu Bwongereza yo mu 2006 yanditswe na Jeta Amata na Nick Moran, Iyoborwa nabahanga nka Jeta Amata kandi yakozwe na Jeta Amata &amp; Alicia Arce. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Joke Silva, Nick Moran, Scott Cleverdon, Mbong Odungide, Fred Amata na Zack Amata. Iyi filime yahawe ibihembo 11 kandi yegukana igihembo cya Achievement in Cinematography muri Africa Movie Academy Awards mu 2007. \nIkibanza.\nIyi filime rimwe na rimwe ivugwa na Joke Silva, ivuga amateka yo kuvugurura ubukoroni bw\u2019abongereza John Newton (Nick Moran), afata ubwato yerekeza muri Nijeriya kugira ngo ajye gushakayo umukoroni. Nyuma, amaze gutungurwa n'ubugome bw'ubucakara, areka umucakara maze aba umupadiri w'Abangilikani. Nyuma Newton yanditse indirimbo yo gucungura Amazing Grace ahinduka aboliste."}
{"id": "20596", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20596", "title": "Amina (film ya 2012)", "text": "Amina ni filime yerekana ikinamico yo muri Nijeriya isohoka mu mwaka wa 2012 yanditswe, yakozwe, kandi iyobowe na Christian Ashaiku, yakinwe na Omotola Jalade Ekeinde, Van Vicker, na Alison Carroll. \"Amina\" yarasiwe i Londres. \nKwakira.\n\"Amina\" ni Filimi yakiriwe muri rusange yakirwa neza ndetse inavugwa nabi nabi; abanenga benshi banenze ikorwa rya firime. NollywoodForever yatanze amanota 45%, anatanga ibitekerezo bibi kubyerekeye gukina. "}
{"id": "20598", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20598", "title": "Going Bongo", "text": "Going Bongo ni film yikinamico iseje yabanyamerika-Tanzaniya yomuri 2015 yayobowe na Dean Matthew Ronalds kandi yakozwe na Brian Ronalds. Muri iyifilime hagaragaramo Ernest Napoleon kandi hagaragaramo Emanuela Galliussi, Nyokabi Gethaiga na Ashley Olds. Yafatiwe amashusho muri Los Angeles na Tanzaniya.\nIyifilime yatorewe ibihembo bya Zuku Bongo Movies Awards muri 2015 yatangajwe mw iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya filime rya Zanzibar. Yatsindiye Filime Nziza yIburasirazuba bwafurika. \nUmugambi.\nUmuganga mushya w\u2019umunyamerika \"kubw' impanuka\" kubushake yijyana gukora muri Tanzaniya, muri Afurika ukwezi kose. iyiFilime ishingiye kunkuru yanayayo yumuganga wumufaransa wavuye i Burayi akajya muri Afrika.\nKurekura.\nIyi filime yerekanwe bwambere i london muri CineWorld Haymarket kuya 4 Kamena 2015."}
{"id": "20599", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20599", "title": "West of Zanzibar (1954 film)", "text": "West of Zanzibar (1954 film) nifilime yomu Bwongereza yomuri 1954 yayobowe na Harry Watt ikinwamo na Anthony Steel, Sheila Sim na Edric Connor. \nigendeye \"aho Nta Vultures Fly\" (1951), yaba kuwayiyoboye numwe na producer nibamwe, kandi ugakomeza ibyabaye kumucungamutungo Bob Payton, wongeye gukinwa na Anthony Steel. Ingingo yiyifilime ni magendu yinzovu, kandi nubwo iyifilime isankaho ishyigikiye kubasagwa butaka nyafurika barwanya ikoreshwa ryubukungu, yabujijwe na guverinoma ya Kenya, yabonaga ko uburyo bwayo ari ubuvandimwe. \nUmugambi.\nUmuryango womur Afurika Galana mucyaro wimukiye i Mombasa nyuma yamapfa. Inzira zamahoro zumuryango zirasenywa n\u2019abacuruzi b\u2019inzovu zitemewe. Ushinzwe umukino, Bob Payton ahinduka umugenzacyaha, yerekeza muri Zanzibar kuvumbura umuyobozi wihishe inyuma yinzovu. Payton akurikirana kariyeri ye binyuze mubice bimwe byahemutse byo mukarere ka Zanzibar. Nubwo hari inzitizi zirimo ingona n'imvubu, Payton amaherezo agana umugome. Umuyobozi w'agatsiko yahaye isambu y'umuryango w'Afurika isubiza amahembe yinzovu, ariko arishyurwa kubera umugambi we igihe umuryango wamuhindukiriye. \nUkoyakozwe.\n\"Aho No Vultures Fly\" yarimwe mu zamenyekanye cyane mu biro by\u2019Ubwongereza muwi 1951 bityo Studios ya Ealing yahisemo gukora urukurikirane rwinyenyeri imwe, umuyobozi na producer, hanyuma yongera gufatanya numuryango wa Schlesinger. Dinah Sheridan yasimbuwe na Sheila Sim. Kuri stade imwe byari biteganijwe kofilm izakorerwa muri 3-D ariko siko byagenze. \nKimwe nafirime yambere, yafatiwe ahantu murAfrika. Umutwe wageze i Nairobi muri Mutarama 1953. \nNimwe muri firime nke ya Steel yakoze kumpinga yeaho atari ashyigikiye umukinnyi wumugabo ukuze. \nAmajwi.\nIndirimbo imbyino byakonzwe cyane mugihe cyo gufata amashusho yari indirimbo yabaswahili yitwa \"Jambo Sigara Baridl\". Abakinnyi bafirime bakunze injyana cyane bahitamo kuyishyiramo nkumuziki wambere. Nyuma hafashwe umwanzuro wogutegura icyongereza cyindirimbo, Anthony Steel aririmba amajwi ayoboye, hamwe nitsinda, Radio Revelers. Abajijwe niba ashobora kuririmba, Steel yarashubije ati: \"Usibye gutera urusaku mu bwogero, sinigeze ngerageza.\" Icyuma cyanditse indirimbo ukobyagenda kose kandibyagenze neza kurutonde. \nKurekura.\nAbakurikirana amafilime yomuri Kenya baciye iyi filime kubera ko yakangiza umubano wamoko muriki gihugu. \nIyifilime kandi yabujijwe muBuhinde nyuma yimyigaragambyo yabanyeshuri babanyafurika murikiriya gihugu. \nKwakira.\nBox office.\nUniversal yakwirakwije film muri Amerika. Bafunguye kuri Theatre yisi yose muri New York, yakundaga kwerekana amafilime yo gukoresha - byari ikigeragezo kugira ngo iyi filime ifatwe nkiyikoreshwa muburyo butandukanye n'ikintu cy\u2019ubukorikori, cyarisoko gakondo rya firime zo mu Bwongereza muramerika. Ubushakashatsi ntabwo bwagenze neza. Filime yarangije gufata amadorari 400.000 muramerika hamwe na booking zirenga 10,000. \nMuwi 1957, iyifilime yashyizwe kurutonde rwa filime cumi na zirindwi zizwi cyane Rank Organisation yigeze gusohora muramerika. \nKwakira neza.\n\"Variety\" yaravuze ati \"Urudodo rwatejwe imbere nkumudandaza ukomeye udasanzwe aho imigenzo gakondo hamwe no guhatana bigira uruhare runini. Hariho kugerageza gato kwerekana imyitwarire iboneye, nubwo ishobora kubari nziza, igaragara kuriferi kuri ecran.\" \nBosley Crowther yanditse mu \"kinyamakuru The New York Times\", \"ni ishusho ishimishije kandimuri rusange yizewe kubijyanye niki gihe cya Afurika yIburasirazuba.\" \nBFI Screenonline yaje kwandika:\"West of Zanzibar\" yashizweho kugirango bunguke intsinzi yababanjirije ariko film nyirizina, n'amateka yayohamwe nabayireba, ntishobora gutandukana cyane. Harry Watt... yashoboye gukomeza umuvuduko ushimishije, cinematografi nziza nokwibanda ku nyamaswa zatumye film ya mbere ikundwa cyane, ariko \"Uburengerazuba bwa Zanzibar\" bufite itandukaniro rimwe ryingenzi: ingingo yaryo. Irasimbuza impungenge zikwiye zita ku mibereho yinyamanswa Ahantu Nta Bisiga biguruka hamwe n\u2019ikibazo kirenze impaka z\u2019ubutabazi - kwimura amoko yo murafurika yo mu cyaro no kugira uruhare muguhiga amahembe yinzovu. Ariko bihakana rwose igisubizo... Bivugwa ko Watt yatunguwe, ariko icyemezo cyinama y\u2019ubuyobozi bwa Kenya cyafashe icyemezo cyerekana ibibazo bya firime byerekana politiki y\u2019amoko. Iburengerazuba bwa Zanzibar kuva yabuze abantu bose, kandi ikomeza kuba imwe mu mazina azwi cyane ya Ealing. Sky Movies yagize ati: \"Anthony Steel yongeye kubamuyobozi wimikino, Bob Payton. Asangiye ubushobozi bwintwari ya Hollywood bwo gutsinda urugamba rukabije ntagitambaro kitagira inenge kiboheye kuri bicep imwe.\" \n\"TV Guide\" yaranditse ati: \"twishingikirije cyane kugace kezaka Afurika, iyi mitekerereze yAbongereza igenda gahoro.\" "}
{"id": "20600", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20600", "title": "Crumbs (film)", "text": "Crumbs ni film yomuri Etiyopiya yakozwe muri 2015 nyuma ya apocalyptic siyanse yimpimbano. Niyofilime yambere yerekanwe numuyobozi wavukiye muri Espagne Miguel Llans\u00f3.\nAmashusho yafatiwe hafiya Dallol, muri Etiyopiya kungengo yimari ingana na amadorali 225,000. \"Crumbs\" \"ifata inzira idasanzwe kandi rimwe na rimwe itagaragara kunkuru yurukundo rworoshye, rukora ku mutima\". Yerekanwe mw iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filimi rya Rotterdam, ndetse na Nightfall Jury Mention mw' iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Los Angeles 2015 ndetse nigihembo cya Filime nziza ya mbere yagaragaye mw' iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Fantasia 2015. \nInyandiko.\nMwiyerekwa riteye ubwoba rya Etiyopiya ya postapocalyptic, umunyabugeni utagira ingano atangira ibintu bitangaje birimo UFO itangaje, abarozi, Santa Santa, abatware b'Abanazi, n'ibindi. Kugereranya isanzure-isanzure ryikirere kuva mubiumuco wa pop wo mu kinyejana cya 20 (kuva Michael Jordan ukageza kuri Ninja Turtles), iyi fantasia ya psychedelic fantasia iratungurwa kandigakundwa kuko izenguruka umurongo wacyo."}
{"id": "20601", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20601", "title": "Under the Southern Cross (1938 film)", "text": "Under the Southern Cross ni filime yikinamico yomu Butaliyani yomuri 1938 yayobowe na Guido Brignone ikinwamo na Antonio Centa, Doris Duranti na Enrico Glori. Filime yashyizwe muri Abyssinia yigaruriwe yintsinzi iheruka y'Ubutaliyani. muzagiye zikurikirana filime umunani zashyizwe mu Bwami bwa Afurika bw\u2019Ubutaliyani mu gihe cy\u2019Abafashisite zasohowe hagati yomuri 1936 na 1939.\nYafatiwe amashusho muri Stidiyo ya Tirrenia hamwe nomuri Tuscany no mu gace ka Galla mu ntara ya Etiyopiya y'Ubutaliyani.\nInyandiko.\nMarco uba uri nyiri igihingwa cya kawa muri Abyssinia, aragerageza kugira uruhare mukubaka Ingoma nshya y'Ubutaliyani. Afite impungenge ariko ko abakozi bebo mubutaliyani, mugihe abagore babo ni miryango idahari, barimo gukundwa cyane numugore kavukire. Mugenzi we muto Paolo agomba kurwanya ibishuko bya Mail\u00f9, umukobwa ukiri muto womu burasirazuba bwo hagati."}
{"id": "20602", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20602", "title": "Mandela: The Living Legend", "text": "Mandela: The Living Legend ni ni filime mbarankuru ya BBC yomuri 2003 ivuga kubuzima bwumukangurambaga Nelson Mandela. Ni filime mbarankuru igizwe nibice bibiri byakozwe na Dominic Allan hamwe nabakozi umwe. Yandikira \"ikinyamakuru The Guardian\", Kathryn Flett yavuze ko iyi documentaire \"yubahwa kandi rimwe narimwe ikagaragaza\" ariko yanzura avuga ko \"atari filime yinjiriye kandi ifite ubushishozi bukabije yigeze gukorwa\". Mu isubiramo rya \"Mandela: Urugendo rurerure rugana ku bwisanzure\" muri \"Grantland\", Wesley Morris yavuze ko \"Mandela: Umugani muzima\" ari \"umurwayi utuje\" kandi \"byavuzwe neza na David Dimbleby\". "}
{"id": "20603", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20603", "title": "Plot for Peace", "text": "Plot for Peace ni filime mbarankuru yo muri Afrika yepfo 2013 yayobowe na Carlos Agull\u00f3 na Mandy Jacobson. \nIyifilime ivuga kumateka y\u2019umucuruzi wumufaransa wavukiye muri Alijeriya Jean-Yves Ollivier muruhare rwubukonje bw\u2019intambara -era yAbanyafurika, isinywa ryamasezerano ya Brazzaville yomu 1988 ndetse nibiganiro bijyanye nirekurwa rya Nelson Mandela. Ukoresheje amashusho ya archive ukomoka kuri apartheid -era Afurika yepfo hamwe nibazwa ryakozwe na Winnie Mandela, Thabo Mbeki, Denis Sassou-Nguesso na Mathews Phosa, Ollivier (mbere utazwi kandi witwa 'Monsieur Jacques') ryerekanwa nkumwubatsi w\u2019ingenzi mu kuvana ingabo zabanya Cuba muri Angola muri 1987. \nUmugambi.\nIyifilime ishingiye kuruhare rwa Jean-Yves Ollivier, umucuruzi ukomeye wumufaransa, mukuganira ku iherezo ryintambara y\u2019umupaka wa Afurika yepfo ndetse nanyuma ya demokarasi ishingiye ku moko menshi muri Afurika yepfo. "}
{"id": "20604", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20604", "title": "Jock the Hero Dog", "text": "Jock the Hero Dog(izwinka Jock wa Bushveld) ni filime yo gusetsa yomur'Afurika y'Epfo ya 2011 yakozwe na Duncan MacNeillie. Irimo amajwi ya Bryan Adams, Donald Sutherland, Helen Hunt, Ted Danson na Mandy Patinkin. Ishingiye ku gitabo cya \"Jock of Bushveld\" cyo mu 1907 cyanditswe na Sir James Percy FitzPatrick. \nHome media.\nIyi filime yasohotse kuri Blu-ray na DVD muri Amerika muri 25 Nzeri 2012 na Arc Entertainment.\nKwakira.\nCommon Sense Media yahaye film inyenyeri eshatu kuri eshanu. "}
{"id": "20605", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20605", "title": "Khumba", "text": "Khumba ni filime yogusetsa ya xenofictive yomur'Afurika yepfo 2013 yayobowe kandi ikorwa na Anthony Silverston yanditswe na Silverston na Raffaella Delle Donne. Muriyi filime hagaragaramo amajwiya Jake T. Austin, Steve Buscemi, Loretta Devine, Laurence Fishburne, Richard E. Grant, AnnaSophia Robb, Anika Noni Rose, Catherine Tate, Ben Vereen, na Liam Neeson. Ni firime yakabiri yakozwe na Studios ya Triggerfish Animation ikaba ikwirakwizwa na Millennium Entertainment muri Amerika. Uburenganzira mpuzamahanga bwogukwirakwiza butanguruhushya nitsinda rishinzwe gucunga sinema. Filime ivuga kuri Khumba, zebra ufite igice kimwe cya kabiri nka quagga kandi akaryozwa kubura imvura mu gihugu cyose nubushyo bwe. Yatangiye gushaka amafaranga yokubura.\nIyi filime yeguriwe kwibuka Reinhold Rau washinze umushinga wa Quagga Ubworozi, wapfuye ku ya 11 Gashyantare 2006. Rau yarazwiho imbaraga zogukoresha ubworozi bw'indobanure kugirangoyongere agarure quagga yazimye, umuvandimwe wahafi w'ikibaya cya zebra. Iyi filime yerekanwe bwambere muri TIFF ku ya 8 Nzeri 2013, isohoka ku ya 25 Ukwakira 2013 n\u2019ikwirakwizwa ry\u2019abasangwabutaka. \"Khumba\" yakiriye ibitekerezo bitandukanye n'abamunenga kandi yatengushye mu biro, yinjije miliyoni 28.4 z'amadolari ku isi yose kungengo y'imari miliyoni 20. \nUmugambi.\nMuri Great Karoo, Khumba yavutse igice cya kabiri ku bushyo bwa zebra. Yarezwe na nyina Lungisa na se Seko, umuyobozi w'ubushyo. Khumba ashinjwa amapfa kandi bamurenganyiriza n'ubushyo, usibye Tombi, zebra w'umugore akaba n'inshutiyemagara. Kimwe na Khumba, Tombi nawe yumva adafite umwanya mubushyo kubera imyifatire ya tomboyish.\nUmunsi umwe, mantis itera Khumba gushushanya ikarita nini yerekana amazi. Khumba yemera itsinda rya amabuye y'agaciro mumwobo wokuvomera kandi aratukwa n'ubusho. Ingwe mbi yitwa Phango iraburira Mkhulu ko ubushyo bugomba kugenda kugira ngobabone amazi. Lungisa avuga inkuru yukuntu zebrasi yambere yariyera. Umunsi umwe, zebra akiri muto yambutse Karoo, avumbura umwobo wo kuvomera ubumaji mu buvumo. Amaze koga mu mazi, yasohotse afite imirongo. Izindi zebra zoga mumazi yubumaji kandi nazo zakira imirongo.\nNyuma y'urupfu rwa Lungisa, Khumba yagiyehanze ahura n'imbwa yomuri Afurika yo mu gasozi yitwa Skalk. Umugore w'inyamanswa witwa Mama V amukiza ibibazo, aherekejwe na ostrich yitwa Bradley. Mugihe batatu bashakishaga amazi, Bradley agaragaza koyari hafi kwicirwa mwibagiro. Khumba afasha ubusho bwimuka bwa springbok mugukingura umwobo muruzitiro runini kugirango ukomeze urugendo.\nItsinda rya Khumba rizerera mumuryango wa bohemian w\u2019inyamaswa zibamuri parike y\u2019igihugu ya Ying. Nyuma yo guhunga gato afatwa n\u2019abashinzwe parike batuza Bradley bagatega umutego Khumba mukato, Khumba na bagenzi be bazamukumusozi urihafi kugirango bavugane na Eagle yirabura.\nKhumba ahura nitsinda rya hyraxes yomurutare rusenga Eagle Yirabura kandi ikabuza iterambere rye. Kuvakuri albino Black Eagle, yiginzira igana umwobo kandi kwari mubuvumo bwa Phango. Black Eagle iragaragaza kandiko Phango yishe umuryango wemurwego rwo kwihorera kuberako yangiwe akiri umwana muto, kuberako yavutse afite impumyi imwe y'amaso, bikamuha kumva impumuro nziza yo kuba umuhigi mwiza. Khumba utabizi, impamvu Phango amuhiga kubera umugani wa ngwe wa kera wahanuye ko havutse igice kimwe cya zebra, kandi ingwe yariye zebra izaba umuhigi ukomeye. Seko aricuza kuba yararetse ubushyo bwe. Abifashijwemo na Tombi, amenya ko aramutse atayoboye ubushyo bwe ngo ashake irindi riba, bose bazapfa. Akurikira inzira ya Phango.\nMugihe Khumba azerera mubuvumo bwijimye, ubushyo bwe bugera munsiyumusozi, hamwenandi matungo menshi yahuye nazomurugendo rwe. Mubuvumo, Khumba asangamo umwobo wokuvomera maze amaze gutekereza kumagambo ya Lungisa ndetse n'imikoranire yose yagize, amenyako ubudasa ari ngombwa kugira ngo umuntu abeho byaba ari itandukaniro ry'umuntu rishobora kuba imbaraga z'umuntu. Mugihe Phango yugaye, yarangije kwirukana Khumba. Khumba yiruka ahunga ubwobuvumo butangira gusenyuka. Inyamaswa ziteranijwe zireba imirwano hagati ya Khumba na Phango, bigatuma bombi bagwa kubera ubuvumo bwaguye. Phango agwa mu rutare aho yiciwe n'amabuye manini manini amugwa hejuru, naho Khumba agwa mu mazi umubiri we wogeje ku nkombe. Mugihe imvura itangiye kugwa, abantu bose batangira kuririra Khumba kugeza akangutse gitunguranye urupfu rwe.\nHamwe na Phango yapfuye n'ubushyo bwa zebra ububufite inzunshya, Khumba yishimira hamwe n'ubushyobwe, Mama V, Bradley, Skalk, Nora, ubushyo bwa gemsbok, ubushyo bw'amasoko, inyamaswa zomuri parike ya Ying, hamwe na hyraxes zomurutare, ububose babana kandi bakora ibikorwa bitandukanye bikikije isumo.\nabakinnyi.\nJon Olson atanga ingaruka zijwi ryinyamaswa ziyongera.\nKurekura.\nIyi filime yasohotse muri sinema ya Afurika y'Epfo ku ya 25 Ukwakira 2013, isohoka kuri DVD ku ya 11 Gashyantare 2014. Iyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere muri TIFF ku ya 8 Nzeri 2013.\nAmajwi.\nAmashusho yumwimerere yerekanwe ya \"Khumba\" yanditswe, ahimbwa, yakozwe kandi ategurwa na Bruce Retief hamwe nizindi ndirimbo yahimbwe na Zwai Bala. Indirimbo z'amajwi zosezanditswe na Retief zikorwa n'abahanzi batandukanye, barimo Loyiso Bala, Ijuru rya Quartez, Korali y'abana ya Karoo, na Richard E. Grant. Yasohotse ku ya 1 Ukuboza 2013 binyuze kuri labelzero.com, iraboneka kuri iTunes na Amazon. \nKwakira.\nKu Rotten Tomatoes, film ifitibyemezo bya 44% hashingiwe kubisubizo 18. Kuri Metacritic, film ifite amanota 40 kuri 100 ishingiye kubisubizo byatanzwe nabanegura 6, byerekana \"isubiramo rivanze cyangwa rigereranyijwe\". "}
{"id": "20606", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20606", "title": "One by One (2004 film)", "text": "One by One ni filime ngufi isanzweya animasiyo iyobowe na Pixote Hunt yasohowe na Walt Disney Pictures ku ya 31 Kanama 2004, nk'ikindi kintu cyiyongereye kuri DVD yasohowe na \"Ntare King II: Ishema ryihariye rya Simba\". kubangufi yaragamije kwiba kimwe mubice byasabwe ariko ntibyigeze birangira \"Fantasia 2006\" byari bigamije kuba urukurikirane rwa kabiri rwa firime ya animasiyo ya 1940 \"Fantasia\" kandi ikoresha indirimbo yandikiwe \"Umwami Ntare\". \nUmugambi.\nIyi filime yerekana inkuruy'abana bomumujyi wa Afurika y'Epfo baguruka mu kirere kumusozi nyuma yuko umuhungu umwe ahumekewe n'ibaba ry'amabara areremba mu kirere. Abana basanga ibikoresho biva ahantu hose mumujyi kandi bagatanga ibyana byamabara angana. Nyuma yogutembera, baguruka kite hanyuma bakabohora mwijuru kugirango film irangire.\nUmusaruro.\nFilime ngufi ifata izina ryayo igendeye one by one\"indirimbo yubwisanzure\" yanditswe kandi ikorwa na Lebo M kuri \"Ntare King\". Nubwo iyi ndirimbo yaciwe muri firime yanyuma, yakoreshejwe mu guhuza imiterere ya Disney Theatrical, mbere yo gukoreshwa muri make. "}
{"id": "20607", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20607", "title": "Born into Struggle", "text": "Born into Struggleni film mbarankuru yomuri Afrika yepfo yakozwe muri 2004.\nInyandiko.\nMuri iyi filme mbarnkuru, umukinnyi wa firime Rehad Desai afata rugendo rwimbitse rwashushanyijeho inkovu zinjiye nu muryango we kuva dufite se wagize uruhare rukomeye muripolitiki. Barney Desai yari umunyapolitiki mu gihe cyo guharanira ubwisanzure muri Afurika yepfo, nyamara nkumubyeyi ntiyabuze amarangamutima. Rehad ubuzima bwe bwose yabukoresheje mubuhungiro maze akora politiki wenyine. Muri ururugendo rwihariye kumatekaye, Rehad amenya ko akurikiza inzira za se igihe yasuzumaga umubano we numuhungu we wumwangavu \nIminsi mikuru.\nIyifilime yagaragaye bwambere kwisi nkumurimo urimo gukorwa kuya 28 Mata 2004 murwego rwa \"Imyaka icumi yUbwigenge - Filime zomuri Afurika y'Epfo,\", ibirori byabereye mumujyi wa New York. "}
{"id": "20608", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20608", "title": "The Cry of Reason", "text": "The Cry of Reason: Beyers Naude \u2013 An Afrikaner Speaks Out ni film mbarabkuru yabanyamerika yomuri 1988 yayobowe na Robert Bilheimer. ivuga kumuhanga mu bya tewolojiya Beyers Naud\u00e9. Yatorewe igihembo cya Akademiki nka Best Documentary Feature. "}
{"id": "20609", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20609", "title": "Dear Mandela", "text": "Dear Mandela ni documentaire yakozwe 2012 Afurika-yepfo / Amerika yibanda kunshuti eshatu zigizumutwe wa shackdwellers zigendana Abahlali baseMjondolo. Barwanywa birukanwa mugutanga ikirego murwego rwo kurwanya KwaZulu-Natal Kurandura no gukumira ko hajyaho itegeko ry\u2019abatuye mu 2007 rirangira rijya mu rukiko rwa nyuma rw'ubujurire, Urukiko Rushinzwe Kurinda Iremezo ry'Itegeko Nshinga. Ikibazo cyagenze neza ariko byihuse bivamo igitero cyubugizi bwa nabi ku muhanda wa Kennedy mu buryo butemewe mu 2009. Abakora firime ubwabo bafatiwe muri icyogitero. \nMugihe ibyabaye muriyi filime bibaye hashizigihe kinini Nelson Mandela yeguye kubutegetsi bwa Perezida wa Afurika y'Epfo, amasezerano ye yo kubakira abaturage bose aracyari ikibazo nyamukuru. \nFilime yanditswe, yakozwe kandi iyobowe na Dara Kell na Christopher Nizza. Yerekanwe mw'Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Brooklyn 2012. "}
{"id": "20610", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20610", "title": "Mandela ( 1996 film)", "text": "Mandela (nanone yitwa Mandela: Umuhungu wa Afurika, Se w'igihugu) ni filime documentaire yomu 1996 iyobowe na Angus Gibson na Jo Menell. Yatorewe igihembo cya Akademiki ya Best Documentary Feature. \nInyandiko.\nIyi filime ni filime yemewe ya Nelson Mandela, perezida wa mbere watowemu buryobwa demokarasi n'Afurika y'Epfo yunze ubumwe. Iyi filime ivuga ku bwana bwa Nelson Mandela, umuryango, amashuri, ndetse n\u2019urugamba rurerure yagize rwo kubona umudendezo w\u2019amoko yose atandukanye yomuri Afurika yepfo, harimo n\u2019ibyamubayeho muri gereza ya Robben.\nKwakira.\nKunegura firime Roger Ebert, wandika kuri \"Chicago Sun-Times\", yakunze iyi filime ariko yumva amakuru menshi yagombye kubarimo, cyane cyane kwishyaka rya FW de Klerk. Yanditse ati: \"Inkuru nyayo y'ibyabaye biganisha ku matora iraruhije kandi irashimishije. Yego, Afurika y'Epfo yahuye n'ibibazo by'ubukungu. Ariko yashoboraga kubaho imyaka myinshi mbere mubuvumo; hashyizweho gahunda yo gucuruza rwihishwa n'ibihugu kuva mu Bushinwa kugeza muri Isiraheli, kandi diyama zayo ziracyabona inzira ku ntoki z'abageni ku isi yose. amategeko... Nta na kimwe muri ibyo bintu kibwirwa i \"Mandela,\" cyoroshya ihererekanyabubasha mu mugani w'umukara urwanya abazungu byose ariko bivuze ko de Klerk atashakaga kubona imbaraga zahinduye amaboko. \" \nAbakenguzamateka Frederic na Mary Ann Brussat bakunze iyi filimi barandika bati: \"Abayobozi Jo Menell na Angus Gibson baduha ishusho yahafi kandi yihariye y'iyi ntwari y'umwirabura... ayamashusho yerekana kandi yubaka ubuzima bwa Mandela nk'umuntu uharanira ubwisanzure n'umudendezo - se w'igihugu.\" \nIbihembo.\nIratsinze\nKandidatire"}
{"id": "20611", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20611", "title": "Death of Apartheid", "text": "Death of Apartheid (US title: Mandela's Fight For Freedom) ni izina ry\u2019uruhererekane rugizwe n\u2019ibice bitatu byerekeranye n\u2019imishyikirano yo guhagarika ivanguramoko muri Afurika yepfo n\u2019amatora ya mbere ya demokarasi yakurikiyeho. Uruhererekane rwatangajwe bwambere muri Gicurasi 1995, kandi rwakozwe na Brian Lapping Associates kuri BBC, kandi rukaba rwarakozwe n\u2019umuvugizi w\u2019Ubuholandi VPRO, televiziyo yomur'Afurika yepfo SABC, n\u2019umuyapani NHK. \nUrukurikirane rwanditswe ahanininubushakashatsi na Allister Sparks, nuwabivuze. Urukurikirane rwaherekejwe nigitabo cyanditswe na Sparks, cyitwa \"Ejo Nibindi Igihugu\". "}
{"id": "20612", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20612", "title": "Gerrie &amp; Louise", "text": "Gerrie &amp; Louise ni filime Mbarankuru yabanye canada yomuri 1997 yayobowe na Sturla Gunnarsson. Iyifilime yerekana iaknasobanura Afurika y'Epfo nyuma ya apartheid ikoresheje lens ya Gerrie Hugo, wahoze ari umusirikare mu ngabo z\u2019ingabo z\u2019Afurika yepfo wakundanye akanashyingiranwa na Louise Flanagan, umunyamakuru ukora iperereza kuruhare rwa SADF mu bihe bitandukanye bitavugwaho rumwe mugihe cya apartheid. \nIyifilime yerekanwe mw' iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Toronto mu 1997, ariko ryatanzwe cyane cyane nka Televiziyo ya CBC. "}
{"id": "20613", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20613", "title": "Elegy for a Revolutionary", "text": "Elegy for Revolutionary ni film ngufi yakozwe muri 2013 iyobowe kandi yanditswe na Paul van Zyl. Muriyi filime hagaragaramo Brian Ames, Martin Copping, na Michael Enright, kandi ishingiye kunkuruy'impamo y'itsinda ry'abasore b'Abazungu bomu majyepfo y'Afurika bagerageza kwigaragambya.\nUruhare rwihangana rya Jeremy James yatsindiye igihembo \"cyumukinnyi witwaye neza\" mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Filmstock 2013. \nKwakira.\nFilime Iterabwoba yatanze isuzuma ryiza kuri iyi filime, ivuga ko \"ikirego cyabo gusa kuri Elegy kuri Revolutionary ari uko ari gito kandi atari ikintu\". "}
{"id": "20614", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20614", "title": "Finding Fela", "text": "Finding Fela ni film mbarabkuru yakozwe nabanyamerika muri 2014 iyobowe na Alex Gibney, yerekana no gusesengura ubuzima bwumucuranzi womuri Nigeriya Fela Kuti. Iyifilime yagaragaye bwa mbere kwisi mw' iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Sundance 2014 kuya 17 Mutarama 2014. \nInyandiko.\nYerekana ubuzima mumuziki byumuririmbyi womuri Nijeriya Fela Kuti, wahujwe n'mashusho yagutse yiterambere ry'umuziki wa New York \"Fela!\" nibiganiro n'umuyobozi wacyo Bill T. Jones. \nKwakira.\n\"Finding Fela\" yatanzweho ibitekerezo bivanze nabagenzuzi. Geoffrey Berkshire womuri \"Variety\", mu isubiramo rye yaravuze ati: \"Iyi nkuru ireba ariko ikaboneka muburyo bworoshye ntishobora kubona icyerekezo gikomeye ku buzima bwa Kuti n'umurage ukomeye.\" \"\u200b David Rooney wu Umunyamakuru wa Hollywood yashimye iyifilime ayisobanura koari \"Ikintu gikurura niba kidasobanutse neza ku buzima n'umurage w'umuhanzi udasanzwe.\" \nIbikuwe murifirime byagaragaye muimurikagurisha ry\u2019ibitabo by\u2019Ubwongereza 2015 \"Afurika y\u2019iburengerazuba: Ijambo, Ikimenyetso, Indirimbo\". "}
{"id": "20615", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20615", "title": "Ernest Cole: Lost and Found", "text": "Ernest Cole: Lost and Found ni film ya documentaire 2024 yakozwe, yanditswe kandi iyobowe na Raoul Peck. Irakurikira Ernest Cole, umufotozi wigenga wo muri Afrika yepfo wagaragaje amahano ya Apartheid muri Afrika yepfo mugihe cya za 1960 na 1970. Byanditswe na LaKeith Stanfield.\nIyi documentaire yerekanwe bwa mbere ku isi mu gice cyerekanwe cyerekanwe mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 2024 ku ya 20 Gicurasi 2024, aho yatsindiye \"L'\u0152il d'or\" ya Documentaire Nziza. Ku nshuro ya 50 C\u00e9sar Awards yatowe mucyiciro cya Filime Nziza.\nYasohowe mwikinamico muri Amerika ku ya 22 Ugushyingo 2024, na Magnolia Pictures, nomu Bufaransa ku ya 25 Ukuboza 2024, na Condor Distribution.\nIkibanza.\nErnest Cole yashyizwe ahagaragara amahano ya Apartheid akoresheje amafoto, bimuviramo guhungira muri Amerika kugira ngoyirinde gutotezwa kw\u2019abanyamakuru b\u2019abirabura muri Afurika yepfo. Byinshi mu bikorwa bye ntibyakomeje gutangazwa kugeza mu 2017, igihe habonetse ibibi 60.000 muri banki yo muri Suwede. \nUmusaruro.\nMuri Gicurasi 2023, byatangajwe ko Raoul Peck azayobora documentaire izenguruka Ernest Cole, hamwe na Magnolia Pictures igiye gukwirakwizwa muri Amerika. Iyi documentaire yakozwe kubufatanye n\u2019umutungo wa Cole, aho Peck yaboneyeho kwinjira mububiko bwe. \nMuri Gashyantare mumwaka wa 2024, byatangajwe ko LaKeith Stanfield izumvikana Cole. \nKurekura.\nYabaye isi mw'Iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes mu ku ya 20 Gicurasi \nKwakira.\nIgisubizo gikomeye.\nKurubuga rwogusubiramo Rotten Tommatoes, 97% ya 34 banengaga ibyiza naho impuzandengo ya 7.4/10.[11] Metacritic, ikoreshampuzandengo iremera ihamanota 82 kwi 100, ishingiye11 kubanegura, indicating \"ishimwa nabose\"."}
{"id": "20616", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20616", "title": "Nollywood Babylon", "text": "Nollywood Babilon ni film mbarankuru yomuri 2008 yayobowe na Ben Addelman na Samir Mallal. Yakozwe nnkigo cy'igihugu gishinzwe amafilime muri Kanada, kijyanye no gukundwa guturika kwa firime zo muri Nigeriya. Ikwirakwizwa ry\u2019Ubwongereza ni Dogwoof Pictures. "}
{"id": "20617", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20617", "title": "Five Roads to Freedom: From Apartheid to the World Cup", "text": "Five Roads to Freedom: From Apartheid to the World cup ni filime ya documentaire ya 2010 ifatanije na Robin Benger na Jane Thandi Lipman ireba impinduka z\u2019impinduramatwara muri Afurika y'Epfo binyuze mumaso y'abagabo n'abagore batanu babaga mu gicucu cya apartheid.\nIyi filime yibanze kubantu batanu baturutse hiryanohino mu mibereho nomubya politiki: abantu basanzwe bafite uburambe bugaragaza impinduka zikomeye zabaye mu myaka 15 ishize kandi ubuzima bwabo mu 2010 bukaba bwerekana amasezerano ndetse n'ibidasobanutse neza muri Afurika y'Epfo.\n\"Five Roads to Freedom\" ni umushinga wihariye ku mukinnyi wa firime Robin Benger. Nkumuyobozi w\u2019abanyeshuri bo muri Afurika yepfo mu mpera za 1960 no mu ntangiriro ya za 70, yatawe muri yombi inshuro eshatu azira ibikorwa byo kurwanya ivanguramoko, amaherezo yirukanwa mu gihugu. Iyi filime yakozwe na Ian Ayres, Robin Benger, Eric Ellena, Jane Thandi Lipman, Joseph Oesi na Christopher Sumpton. "}
{"id": "20618", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20618", "title": "Zwischen 2 Welten", "text": "Between two worlds (umutwe wumwimerere: Zwischen zwei Welten) ni film mbarankuru yo muri 1999 yakozwe numuyobozi Bettina Haasen. Filime yibanze kubiganiro hagati yumuyobozi Haasen nabagize umuryango wimuka wa Woodabe muriNijeriya. Inyandiko ifite uburyo bwamoko."}
{"id": "20619", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20619", "title": "Have You Heard from Johannesburg", "text": "Wigeze Wumva kuva Johannesburg ni urukurikirane rw'amafilime zirindwi ya 2010, akubiyemo urugamba rumaze imyaka 45 rugamije kurwanya ivanguramoko ku isi yose kurwanya gahunda ya apartheid yo muri Afurika y'Epfo ndetse n'abayishyigikiye mpuzamahanga babonaga ko bafatanije mu ntambara y'ubutita.\nFilime zahujwe zifite interanini, izenguruka igice kinini cyisi hejuru yikinyejana. Guhera ku nama ya mbere y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye, bikarangira mu 1990, ubwo, nyuma y\u2019imyaka 27 muri gereza, Nelson Mandela, umuyobozuzwi cyane muri Kongere y\u2019igihugu nyafurika yazengurutse isi nkumuntu wigenga. Yakozwe kandi iyobowe na Connie Field, ikubiyemo ibindi bintu nk'ubwicanyi bwa Sharpeville, imyigaragambyo ya Soweto n'iyicwa rya Steve Biko. \nUrukurikirane rw'izina rukomoka kumagambo y'indirimbo Gil Scott-Heron \"Johannesburg' \nHamwe nigihe cyogukora cyamasaha 8 niminota 30, \"Wigeze wumva kuva Johannesburg\" yerekanwe bwa mbere mu nama ya Film yabereye i Manhattan, mu mujyi wa New York, ku ya 14 Mata \nInyandiko.\nMumyaka ya za 1950, abirabura benshi bomuri Afurika yepfo bamenye ko urugamba rwo kurwanya ivanguramoko rugomba kubakwa mu bibuga bine by\u2019ibikorwa: ibikorwa rusange, ishyirahamwe ry\u2019ubutaka, intambara yitwaje intwaro, hamwe n\u2019ubukangurambaga mpuzamahanga. \"Wigeze Wumva Kuva Johannesburg\" ijyana abayireba imbere yikibuga cyanyuma, ihuriro ryo gukangurira abaturage kwisi yose ibikorwa byo guha akato ubutegetsi bwa apartheid. Batewe inkunga n'ubutwari n'imibabaro by'abaturage ba Afurika y'Epfo ubwo barwanaga kurwanya ihohoterwa no gukandamiza ivanguramoko, imitwe y\u2019ubufatanye bw\u2019amahanga, ku bufatanye n\u2019abanyafurika yepfo bari mu buhungiro, bafashe icyemezo cyo kurwanya ivanguramoko. Mu rwego rwo guhangana n\u2019ibibazo bikomeye, mu bihe byo kutitabira ubutumwa cyangwa gushyigikira guverinoma ya Hendrik Verwoerd, John Vorster na PW Botha, abakangurambaga bahamagariye guverinoma zabo n\u2019amasosiyete akomeye yo mu Burengerazuba guhangana n\u2019ubusambanyi bw\u2019ubufatanye bwabo na apartheid.\nNtabwo yarintambara ya politiki gusa; byarubukungu, umuco, umuco, na roho. Urugamba rwaje mu bibuga byinshi bitangaje: byakorewe mu bibuga by'imikino no muri katedrali, muri ambasade no mu byumba by\u2019inama by\u2019amasosiyete, ku mbuto z\u2019imbuto n\u2019inyanja, mu bitaramo bya rock na sitasiyo ya lisansi. Ibihumbi n\u2019ibihumbi barapfuye, ariko amaherezo, igitutu kitagira urugomo cyagize uruhare runini mu gusenyuka kwa apartheid bityo bituma intsinzi itangaje ya demokarasi muri Afurika yepfo.\nIbice.\n1.. Have You Heard from Johannesburg: Road to Resistance\nFilime yambere itangira mu 1948 igihe Umuryango w\u2019abibumbye wemeje Itangazo Mpuzamahanga ry\u2019Uburenganzira bwa Muntu. Muri uwo mwaka, Afurika y'Epfo yashyize mu bikorwa gahunda y'amategeko yiswe ivanguramoko kugira ngo itandukanya ubwoko bwayo mu bice byose by'ubuzima. Abirabura benshi muri Afurika y'Epfo, bayobowe na Kongere y\u2019igihugu nyafurika, bakoze ubukangurambaga bwo Kwanga, bikurura ibitekerezo by\u2019abarwanashyaka ahantu nk'Ubwongereza, Suwede, na Amerika - maze babiba imbuto z'umuryango mpuzamahanga urwanya ivanguramoko. Isi yakiriye ubwoba ubwo abigaragambyaga mu mahoro baraswaga mu mujyi wa Sharpeville wo muri Afurika yepfo maze abayobozi bose ba Kongere y\u2019igihugu nyafurika bahatirwa mu nsi cyangwa bafungwa. Nelson Mandela afunzwe ubuzima bwe bwose kandi urugendo rwo muri Afurika yepfo rwahagaritswe neza kuko amagana ahungira mubuhungiro.\n2. Have You Heard from Johannesburg: Hell of a Job\nFilime yakabiri itangirigihe Perezida wungirije wa Kongere y\u2019igihugu cy\u2019Afurika Oliver Tambo yatorokaga muri Afurika yepfo akajya mu buhungiro maze atangira icyahindutse urugendo rw\u2019imyaka 30 yo kwishora mu isi mu rugamba rwo kuzana demokarasi muri Afurika yepfo. Hamwe n\u2019imyigaragambyo muri Afurika yepfo yajanjaguwe neza n\u2019ubutegetsi bwa apartheid, iherezo ry\u2019urugamba rwo kwibohora ryari mu maboko ya Tambo. Yabanje kubona abayoboke mu bihugu bishya byigenga bya Afurika, maze hamwe n'imbaraga zabo zose inyuma ye, yegera Umuryango w'Abibumbye kugira ngo amushyigikire, ashimangira ko guverinoma ya apartheid ishobora guhatirwa ku meza y'ibiganiro mu gihe akanama gashinzwe umutekano kazemera kandi kigaha akato ubutegetsi. Ariko ibihugu by\u2019iburengerazuba byanze gukora, bihatira Tambo gushaka inkunga nshya. Yasabye byimazeyo Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Abasoviyeti ubufasha mu kubaka ingabo z\u2019inyeshyamba, icyemezo kikaba cyarafashe Tambo na Kongere y\u2019igihugu nyafurika ku mwanya w\u2019intambara y'ubutita kandi bikurikirana imbaraga z\u2019isi yose mu myaka iri imbere.\nArikwabantu babiri bafashijwe gukingura imiryango ikomeye mu Burengerazuba: Olof Palme, Minisitiri w\u2019intebe wa Suwede, na Arkiyepiskopi Trevor Huddleston, inkunga yabo ya mbere yatumye Oliver Tambo ashakisha ubufatanye n\u2019ubuyobozi bw\u2019amadini ku isi. Mu ntangiriro ya za 70, Tambo na ANC bari barabonye inkunga muri Suwede kandi bashyigikirwa n'Inama y'Itorero ku Isi, abayoboke bayo mu matorero yo ku isi bifatanya mu kurwanya ivanguramoko. Hamwe nabafatanyabikorwa bashya kuruhanderwe, Tambo yagize intangiriro yumuryango wisi yose.\n3. Have You Heard from Johannesburg: The New Generation\nMuri filime yagatatu nurubyiruko, habamuri Afurika y'Epfo ndetse nohanze yayo, bakurikiranwaho kwinjira mumutwe ugenda urwanya ivanguramoko. Tambo yatewe inkunga n'inkunga nshya mu bihugu by'iburengerazuba, yagarutse mu Muryango w'Abibumbye kugira ngo agerageze kumvisha urwego rw'isi kwemerera Afurika y'Epfo. Imbaraga ze zashyigikiwe n\u2019abaturage mu gihe gukandamiza bikabije imyigaragambyo y\u2019urubyiruko mu mujyi wa Soweto wo muri Afurika yepfo ndetse n\u2019urupfu rutavugwaho rumwe na Steve Biko rwahinduye Afurika y'Epfo igihugu kiva mu gihugu, kikaba ikimenyetso cy\u2019akarengane ku isi. Mu 1977, intsinzi ikomeye yatsindiye igihe Umuryango w\u2019abibumbye watangaga intwaro iteganijwe: iyambere mu mateka. Ariko abafatanyabikorwa bakomeye bo muri Afurika yepfo mu bucuruzi bw\u2019iburengerazuba ntibakomeza kubyemera mu bukungu, kandi ubwo Tambo yerekezaga muri Zambiya kugira ngo akorere minisitiri w\u2019ingabo z\u2019inyeshyamba za Kongere y\u2019Afurika yiyongera, kumena amaraso byasaga naho byanze bikunze. Nubwo leta z\u2019iburengerazuba zikomeye zanze kumvira icyifuzo cya Tambo cyo kwamagana umuco n\u2019ubukungu, abaturage bo muri ibyo bihugu by\u2019iburengerazuba bari gufasha guhindura inzira.\n4. Have You Heard from Johannesburg: Fair Play\nMuri firime yakane abakinnyi n\u2019abaharanira inyungu ku isi, bahuye na guverinoma zanga gufata ingamba zifatika zo kurwanya ubutegetsi bwa apartheid, bwibasiye Afurika yepfo yera aho bibabaza: ku kibuga. Ibihano mpuzamahanga byamagana amakipe y'imikino ya apartheid bifasha kuzana ikibazo cy\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu muri Afurika yepfo ku mwanya wa mbere ku isi hose no guca umubano w\u2019umuco w\u2019Afurika yepfo n\u2019umuco w\u2019iburengerazuba. Kubera ko yari azi ko abirabura bagenzi babo bo muri Afurika yepfo bangiwe n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ibanze bw\u2019ikiremwamuntu - tutibagiwe n\u2019uburenganzira bwo kwitabira amarushanwa mpuzamahanga ya siporo - ibihugu by\u2019Afurika byanze guhatana n\u2019amakipe y\u2019abazungu bo muri Afurika yepfo y\u2019abazungu, bahakana imikino Olempike ndetse banashyira ahagaragara ibitaramo ku bitangazamakuru ku isi hose bituma Komite mpuzamahanga ya Olempike ibuza amakipe ya apartheid mu mikino iri imbere. Ihuriro riyobowe na Afurika ryayoboye urugamba rwo gukumira Afurika y'Epfo mu mupira w'amaguru, umukino w'iteramakofe, umukino wo gusiganwa ku magare, gusiganwa ku magare, judo, kuzitira, imikino ngororamubiri, volley ball n'andi marushanwa menshi, kandi ibuza amakipe yo muri Afurika y'Epfo kwitabira imikino hafi ya yose mu myaka ya za 70. Gusa hasigaye ikipe ya nyampinga wa ruhago ku isi muri Afurika yepfo, kandi abaturage bo mu bihugu by\u2019iburengerazuba bikinirwa umukino wa rugby bajyanye mu murima kugira ngo bafunge umuryango wanyuma kuri siporo ya apartheid. Iyamamaza rya siporo ryabaye intsinzi yambere y\u2019umutwe urwanyivanguramoko kandi ryatsindiye umuco wo gutandukanya umuco w\u2019abazungu mukibuga cy\u2019ingirakamaro.\n5. Have You Heard from Johannesburg: From Selma to Soweto\nFilime yagatanu yibanze kurumwe mubafatanyabikorwa bakomeye muri Afrika yepfo Reta Zunzubumwe z'Amerika.Yabaye ikibanza gikomeye mu rugamba rwo kurwanya ivanguramoko kuko Abanyamerika-Abanyamerika bayoboye ikirego cyo guhindura politiki ya guverinoma ku butegetsi bwa apartheid. Umuryango w\u2019ibanze wo gushaka amashuri makuru, inama z\u2019umujyi, na leta kugira ngo bagabanye imigabane yabo mu masosiyete akora ubucuruzi muri Afurika yepfo yakwirakwiriye mu gihugu cyose bahatira Kongere y\u2019Amerika kwemerera Afurika yepfo. Iyi ntsinzi itangaje yatsinzwe na perezida Ronald Reagan utavuga rumwe n\u2019ubutegetsi. Abanyafurika-Abanyamerika bahinduye cyane politiki y\u2019ububanyi n\u2019amahanga ya Amerika ku nshuro ya mbere mu mateka. Ibihano by\u2019i Burayi byakurikiranye, hamwe na bo, kwigunga kwa politiki y\u2019ubutegetsi bwa apartheid.\n6. Have You Heard from Johannesburg: The Bottom Line\nFilime esheshatu ninkuru yubukangurambaga mpuzamahanga bwa mbere bwibanze bwo gukoresha igitutu cyubukungu kugirango ifashe guhirika leta. Amaze kubona ko ubutegetsi bwa apartheid bushingiye ku mikoreshereze y\u2019imari y\u2019iburengerazuba, abaturage ku isi yose, guhera ku bakozi ba Polaroid kugeza ku muyobozi wa Motors rusange, guhera ku bafite konti y\u2019abanyeshuri muri Banki ya Barclays kugeza ku baguzi banga gaze ya Shell, bose banze ko ubucuruzi na Afurika yepfo bukomeza nk'uko bisanzwe. Ubukangurambaga no kwamagana ibikorwa byazanye ibikorwa byo kurwanya ivanguramoko mu mibereho no mu baturage b\u2019abantu ku isi, bifasha abantu ba buri munsi gusobanukirwa no guhangana n\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019iburengerazuba bushingiye ku ivangura. Muguhangana n'ibitero byabereye murugo ndetse n'akajagari kiyongera muri Afurika y'Epfo, amasosiyete mpuzamahanga yavuyemu kwimuka kwabenshi, ateza ikibazo cy'amafaranga muri Afurika y'Epfo kandi byerekana neza kwiminsi y'ubutegetsi bwa apartheid ibaze.\n7. Have You Heard from Johannesburg: Free at Last\nFilime yakarindwi, kandi yanyuma, yibera muntandaro y\u2019amakimbirane, Abanyafurika yepfo bavuga amateka y\u2019imbaraga zikomeye mu gikorwa cyo kurwanya ivanguramoko ryo mu myaka ya za 80: ihuriro ryahuje ingabo zirwanya ivanguramoko muri Afurika yepfo nka mbere. Imbaga nyamwinshi yongerewe imbaraga zitigeze zibaho igihe ibisekuruza bitatu byabarwanyi barwanyaga hamwe nka United Democratic Front. Guhangana n\u2019ubwigunge mpuzamahanga bugenda bwiyongera, guverinoma ya apartheid yagerageje gutsindira abayoboke nokwemeza isi kwaringombwa ko ivugurura ryayo ryihariye nubwo ryageragezaga guhashya kwigomeka ku mugaragaro, rimwe na rimwe rikoresha amayeri y\u2019ibanga. Imyigaragambyo y\u2019ubumwe bwa demokarasi iharanira demokarasi yageze ku ndunduro mu gikorwa gishya cyo Kwanga, kandi ku rwego mpuzamahanga, Nelson Mandela yabaye izina mu rugo kuko ubukangurambaga bwo kumurekura bwatwitse isi yose. Hafashwe hagati y\u2019imyigaragambyo y\u2019imbere idahagarikwa n\u2019igitutu mpuzamahanga gikomeje, ubutegetsi bwa apartheid bwaje guhatirwa ku meza y\u2019imishyikirano, amaherezo bukuraho ibimaze imyaka ibarirwa muri za mirongo bibuza Kongere y\u2019igihugu nyafurika. Nyuma y\u2019imyaka makumyabiri n'irindwi muri gereza, Nelson Mandela yararekuwe, bituma habaho ibirori ku isi yose ubwo yazengurukaga isi ashimira bose. Nyuma yimyaka 30 mu buhungiro, Oliver Tambo amaherezo yashoboye gusubira muri Afrika yepfo. Ariko urugamba rwari rwamuteye ubwoba kandi azapfa umwaka umwe mbere yuko mugenzi we, Nelson Mandela, atorerwa kuba perezida wambere w\u2019abirabura wa Afurika yepfo ishingiye kuri demokarasi.\nBroadcast.\nFilime ndwi zagabanijwe kugezakubice bitanu kuri tereviziyo kandi zerekanwa kuri \"Independent Lens\" kuri PBS muri 2012.\nKwakira.\nKeith Uhlich wo muri \"Time Out New York\" yiswe Have You Heard from \"Johannesburg\" filime ya cumi nziza ya 2010 mu mwaka wa 2010, ayita \"amashusho yagutse, afite impande nyinshi.\" \nIbihembo.\nUruhererekane rwatsindiye igihembo cya Primetime Emmy kubera azigukina amafilime ya documentaire bidasazwe mu 2012, kubera kobyanyuze kuri PBS. \nHome media.\n\"Have You Heard from Johannesburg\" yasohotse kuri DVD irindwi ya disiki yashyizweho mu 2011 na Clarity Films, buri firime kuri disiki itandukanye. Buri disiki irimo ibikoresho byinyongera."}
{"id": "20620", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20620", "title": "Saving Africa's Witch Children", "text": "Saving Africa's Witch Children ni filim mbarankuru yayobowe na Mags Gavan na Joost van der Valk. Irimo Gary Foxcroft numuryango we Stepping Stones Nigeriya biyamamariza kurwanya abana nkabapfumu muriNijeriya, cyane cyane nivugabutumwa \"Liberty Foundation Gospel Ministries\", yayobowe na Helen Ukpabio. \nMu turere tumwe natumwe dukennye cyane twomuri Nijeriya, ishyaka ryivugabutumwa ry\u2019ivugabutumwa rya Pentekote rihujwe nimyizerere ya kera ariko ikomeje gutsimbarara kumyizere yomurafurika nko kuroga no nubupfumu. Ibihumbi n'ibihumbi by'abana barahohotewe, barahohotewe, baratereranywe cyangwa baricwa kuko bashinjwa kuba barazanye indwara, ibyago, urupfu n'inzara kubera uburozi bwabo. \nIyifilime yarimu bice \"byoherejwe na\" Channel 4 kandi yatsindiye ibihembo byinshi, birimo BAFTA na Emmy mpuzamahanga kubibazo byiza bigezweho."}
{"id": "20621", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20621", "title": "More than Just a Game", "text": "More than just a game ni film ya documentaire igice cya 2007 iyobowe na Junaid Ahmed. Iyi filime yerekana uburyo imfungwa za politiki zo ku kirwa cya Robben muri Afurika y'Epfo zashinze Makana FA mu 1966. Ibindi biganiro twagiranye na Mark Shinners, Anthony Suze, Sedick Isaacs, Lizo Sitoto na Marcus Solomon bihuza amashusho yongeye gushyirwaho.\nUmugambi.\nIkirwa cya Robben nigereza iyobowe n'ubutegetsi bwa apartheid yomuri Afurika y'Epfo. Imfungwa zose hari abantu bitandukanije nokurwanya ububutegetsi muburyo bumwe. Nubwo bimeze bityo, imico yabo, ibitekerezo byabo nuburyo butandukanye igihe kinini.\nKubw'impanuka imfungwa zamenye ko zose zikunda umupira w'amaguru. Gushakisha ikintu gishobora gutuma ubuzima bwa gereza butakwihanganirwa, bemeye gusaba uruhushya rwo gukina umupira mugihe cyabo cyakazi hanyuma batangira gutora abahagarariye. Gusaba kwambere kwangwa ariko amaherezo gukomeza imfungwa birishyura. \nByihuse bigakwitegura ubwabo. Shampiyona yumupira wamaguru numutaka abantu bafunzwe bashobora kugeraho kwiyobora neza. Icyerekezo cya gereza amaherezo gishyigikira Makana FA ibaha imyenda yumupira wamaguru ndetse ikanakinirwa ikibuga cyubahiriza amabwiriza ya FIFA.\nNubwobafite imicitandukanye abayobozi batowe n\u2019imfungwa bagaragaza ubushobozi bwabo bwo kujya impaka no gukemura buri wese mu batavuga rumwe muburyo bwiza. Abayobozi bazi ko kandi bativanga iyo batanze ubuhamya. Basa nkaho batangiye kumva abo bantu badakeneye umuntu ubatera inkunga.\nAmaherezo, abashinze Makana FA barangije ibihano kandi bavakukirwa cyagereza. Barekuwe mu gihugu kigiye guhinduka ubuziraherezo kandi kizabaha amahirwe yo kwerekana ubuhanga bwabo bwo kuyobora mu bwisanzure."}
{"id": "20622", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20622", "title": "Suky", "text": "Suky nifilime irwana yomuri Nijeriya 2025 yakozwe na Bamidele Adelusi, yatanzwe binyuze muri Studiyo ya Nemsia kandi iyobowe na Ola Cardoso. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Tobi Bakre, Bimbo Ademoye, James Damilare, Olarotimi Fakunle, Femi Adebayo, Ibrahim Yekini nabandi. Yashyizwe ahagaragara na Video ya Amazone Prime kuya 7 Werurwe 2025, \"Suky\" azenguruka umupira w'iteramakofe wa Dambe munsi yubutaka mazeakurikira umuntu utwarwa no kwihorera kandiko ari ngombwa guhora urupfu rwase, ugasanga yafatiwe mwisi yiteramakofe kandi agomba guharanira umudendezo we. \nIncamake.\nUmuhungu ukiri muto witwa Suky yavukiye mumurage w'iteramakofe wa Dambe, kuberako se yari shampiyoni muri siporo. Ubuzima bwe burahungabana iyo abonye se yiciwe imbere ye. Amaze kwihorera, Suky yiyemeje gushaka umwicanyi no kwihorera urupfu rwa se. Bidatinze, yateguwe kubera ubwicanyi no koherezwa muri gereza ya Aja, aho abanyapolitiki nintore bononekaye bagenzura amarushanwa yoguterana amakofe ya Dambe. Suky yazamutse hejuru, atsinda benshi bahanganye, mugihe cyamarushanwa. Amaherezo arwana numuntu wishese kandi agomba guhitamo kwihorera nicyubahiro. \nKurekura no kwakira.\n\"Suky\" yasohotse gusa kuri Video ya Amazon Prime kuya 7 Werurwe 2025.Ibiganiro byafilime hafi yabyose biri mururimi rwa Yoruba. \"Umuco Custodian\" yavuze ko \"Suky\" ari \"filime y'ibikorwa itakaza ikibazo cyayo kidashubijwe\" bitewe n'uko imico Suky yari itaratera imbere, bigatuma abayireba batazi neza icyo yakoraga mbere yo gufungwa kwe. "}
{"id": "20623", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20623", "title": "My Song Goes Forth", "text": "My Song Goes Forth (izwi kandi ku izina rya Afurika Iririmba, Afurika Irareba, Ubwongereza, 1937), ni filime ya mbere ivuga kuri Afurika y'Epfo kuko ivangura ryashyizweho. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo umuririmbyi, umukinnyi w\u2019umukinnyi uharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu Paul Robeson uririmba indirimbo y\u2019umutwe kandi yongeraho prologue isaba abayireba gusobanura ibisigaye bya filime binyuranyije n\u2019umugambi wa prodiyusa. Ubundi buryo bwiswe \"Afurika Iririmba\", intego yambere ya firime yari nkumukinyi wiganjemo abazungu bigufi-bigizwe n'amatangazo yerekana ivuka rya apartheid muri Afrika yepfo ariko hamwe n'ubutumwa buvuguruzanya mumajwi. Ahanini iyi documentaire yahujwe na Robeson hamwe n\u2019ibikorwa byo kurwanya Anti-Apartheid hakiri kare kubera ko yongeye gutunganya no kwandika inkuru za firime. \nInyandiko.\nAgatabo kamenyekanisha mbere kuriyi filime igihe yiswe \"Afurika Iririmba\", kavuze ko kerekana \"icyo umuzungu yagezeho\" kandi ngo \"ibyo yakoreye abenegihugu.\" \"Afurika Iririmba\" nimwe muri filime za documentaire za mbere zaturutse muri Afurika y'Epfo zarebye ubuzima bw'Abanyafurika y'Epfo b'amoko yose. Hano hari amashusho yubuzima bwaho, amashuri na kaminuza, hamwe nigice cyimyuga, uhereye kubakozi bakora mu birombe kugeza ku gatsiko k\u2019imihanda, abarimu-shuri kugeza ku bakozi bo mu rugo, abategereza kugeza ku bakata inkoni. Abasesenguzi nyamukuru batanze documentaire igisubizo cyiza; Umukozi wa London Daily Worker yatekereje ko ari bibi cyane kuburyo adashobora guharanira intego yo kwibohora. \nPaul Robeson's rewritten narration and singing.\nYahawakazi n'umuyobozi Joseph Best, Robeson yakoze yitonze kugirango asubiremo prologue kandi muri verisiyo yanyuma avuga,\n\"Ubikirenge cyosecya Afurika cyashyizwe mumoko y'abazungu. Kuki ibi byabaye? Niki cyabateye kujyayo? Niba uteze amatwi abagabo nka Mussolini bazakubwira ko ari 'umuco' - umurimo uva ku Mana, washinzwe abantu bamurikirwa gutwara itara ry'umucyo no kwiga, no kugirira akamaro Abanyafurika kugira ngo ubone inyungu - ubwe.\" \nRobeson kandi aririmba indirimbo ishyigikiye kwibohora muri Afurika,\n\"Kuva mumashyamba yo muri Afurika, kraal n'akazu Ahigicucu kigwa kumucyo mwinshi Indirimbo yanjye irasohoka kandi irasaba Mu gushaka urukundo n'uburenganzira Ndashaka iyo nyenyeri iri kure cyangwa hafi Erekana abantu bose inzira isobanutse Gukorera murumuna we Kandiwirukane urwango n'ubwoba \" "}
{"id": "20624", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20624", "title": "Soole", "text": "Soole (igisobanuro Mukinyarwanda: Guhenduka Ride) nifilm yakozwe muri 2021 yomuri Nigeriya isekeje yakozwe na Adunni Ade, Lou-Ellen Clara Company Limited yatanzwe na FilmOne imyidagaduro, kandi iyobowe na Kayode Kasum. Iyifilime Ade yatangije bwa mbere kandi ikinamo Sola Sobowale, Lateef Adedimeji, Femi Jacobs, Meg Otanwa, Shawn Faqua, Bukunmi Oluwasina, Eso Dike, Teniola Aladese, Saidi Balogun n'abandi. Iyifilime yerekanwe bwambere kuya 21 Ugushyingo 2021 ikagera kuri sinema mugihugu hose kuya 26 Ugushyingo 2021 \nInyandiko.\nSoole ninkuru yumubikira gatolika witwaga Veronica, yakinwe na Adunni Ade uva Lagos yerekeza Enugu nyuma yokunanirwa gutera inkunga inzu yimfubyi. Murugendo rwe muri Enugu, yahisemo inzira ihendutse yogutwara abantu bakunze kwita 'Soole,' ahoyahuye nabagenzi batandukanye nka we. Urugendo rwavuye i Lagos rugana Enugu rwagaragaje amakinamico menshi, harimo n\u2019igitero cy\u2019ubujura bwitwaje imbunda berekeza Enugu. \nKwerekanwa.\nKwerekanwa byabereye muri Sinema ya Sinema IMAX Lekki i Lagos kuya 21, Ugushyingo 2021. Muribyo birori hagaragayemo ibyamamare byinshi, birimo ibitagaragara muri filime, bamwe mubyamamare bari bahari ni Kehinde Bankole, Shawn Faqua, Okey Bakassi n'abandi benshi. \nKumenyekanisha no kumenyekana.\nShawn Faqua yatowe kubera uruhare rwemuri firime ya Soole mucyiciro cyumukinnyi mwiza muri comedi (Filime / TV) muri 2022 Afrika Magic Viewers 'Choice Awards. "}
{"id": "20625", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20625", "title": "Sea Point Days", "text": "Sea Point Days ni filime ya documentaire yo mu 2008 ivuga ibyerekeye Cape Town mu nkengero za Sea Point, iyobowe na Fran\u00e7ois Verster.\nInyandiko.\nKuruhande rwumujyi womumajyepfo cyane muri Afrika, utandukanya umujyi ninyanja, ushyiraho agace kihariye cyane. Shyira aharindimuka nziza yinyanja ya Atalantika kuruhande rumwe na Signal Hill kurundi ruhande, Sea Point Promenade hamwe na pisine rusange yo koga hagati yayo ikora umwanya utandukanye na Cape Town. Rimwe na rimwe rishingiye ku guhezwa kwa Apartheid, ubu irihariye mu bigaragara ko byoroshye kuvanga imyaka, ubwoko, igitsina, idini, imiterere y'ubutunzi, ndetse n'imibonano mpuzabitsina. Nuburyo, uyu mwanya wabaye umwe mubanyafurika yepfo bose bumva ko bafite uburenganzira bwo kubaho, kandi amahirwe yo kwishima mwisi yacitsemo ibice asa nkaho bishoboka. Nigute abantu babona ahahise habo? Abantu babona bate amateka yabo, ibihe byabo muruyumwanya ndetse n'ejo hazazahabo murikigihugu? \nIyi filime yagaragaye bwambere ku isi mw'Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Toronto. "}
{"id": "20627", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20627", "title": "Antique (film ya 2014)", "text": "Antique ni filime yikinamico yakiniwe kandi inasohokera mu gihugu cya Nigeriya mu 2014 iyobowe na Darasen Richards na DJ Tee. Irimo Olu Jacobs, Bimbo Akintola, Gabriel Afolayan, Ricardo Agbor, Seun Akindele na Funsho Adeolu. \nFilime ye rekanywe hamwe numuryango wishimye kandi watsinze mugihe basangiye umugabane wabo, ariko haribintu bitunguranye mugihe ibiremwa bitatu bidasanzwe byateye mubwami bashaka ibya kera; ifite imbaraga zo kurinda abaturage bayo no gukomeza ubwami bwayo. Abarwanyi b'ubwami baratsinzwe kandi abateye bakuraho ikirango cyera, bityo bazana umuvumo ku gihugu.\nNyuma yimyaka icumi, umuhungu umwe rukumbi wa Oba yararwaye azagupfa. Nkuko byagaragajwe na muganga wabapfumu, uburwayi buterwa no kubura kera. Kubwibyo rero, kugirango uruziga rw\u2019impfu n\u2019inzara mu gihugu birangire, umukobwa w\u2019inzirakarengane witwa Uki (Oge Indiana) yahisemo gushyira ubuzima bwe mu kaga yerekeza mu gihugu abantu babujijwe, mu rwego rwo gushaka no gusubiza kera.\nAbarwanyi batatu bari baratoranijwe badasanzwe, bazahagarara kubusa kugeza bageze kuntego zabo, baherekeza Uki. Urugendo rugaragaza ko ari ubutumwa bisa nkibidashoboka kuko bahuye nimbaraga mbi zidapfa, zigerageza kubabuza kugera kuntego zabo. Umuganga wumupfumu hamwe numureshya witwa Isoken afite gahunda yihishe mugihe impungenge zagarutse mumudugudu zigaragaza urukurikirane rwingufu mugukoresha ubwami. Hagati aho, kugaruka kwa Uki n'abarwanyi ntibizwi."}
{"id": "20628", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20628", "title": "Apaye", "text": "Apaye (Icyongereza: Urukundo rw'umubyeyi) ni filime yerekana ikozwe mu buryo bwa teyatile yakiniwe kandi inasohokera mu gihugu cya Nigeriya 2014 iyobowe na Desmond Elliot ikinwamo na Clarion Chukwura, Kanayo O. Kanayo, Belinda Effah, na Mbong Amata. Yerekanwe bwa mbere muri Sinema ya Silverbird, ku kirwa cya Victoria, i Lagos ku ya 7 Werurwe \nYepayeye, umubyeyi urera abana batandatu, wakundaga guhangana ndetse no gutsinda ibibazo byinshi kandi amaherezo aratsinda kugira ngo abana be bagororoke n'uburere.\nUburyo filime ya Apaye yakiriwe.\nNollywood Reinvented yahaye firime amanota 53%, ashima inkuru, icyerekezo n'umuziki. Yanzuye ko nubwo muri rusange abantu bategerejwe na firime, \"Apaye\" yatsinze \"gutungurwa gushimishije\". "}
{"id": "20629", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20629", "title": "The Arbitration Film", "text": "Arbitration ni filime iri mubwoko bwi yikinamico y\u2019urukundo yo muri Nijeriya 2016, yanditswe na Chinaza Onuzo, iyobowe na Niyi Akinmolayan, ikorwa na Chinaza Onuzo, Omotayo Adeola, na Zulu Oyibo. Muri filime hagaragaramo OC Ukeje, Adesua Etomi, Iretiola Doyle na Somkele Iyamah-Idhalama.\nUmugambi.\nni Filimi sishingiye ku mugabo witwaga Gbenga yari rwiyemezamirimo mwiza, uyobora isosiyete ikora ibijyanye n\u2019ikoranabuhanga yunguka cyane, kandi ni we uregwa mu rubanza rwatanzwe na Dara injeniyeri wa mudasobwa, impano ye yafashije isosiyete ya Gbenga kubona uburebure bugezeho. Bagenzi be bari abakundana umubano wabo warangiye ubwo Gbenga yamenyaga ko umugore we atwite umwana wabo wa mbere. Urubanza rwe rusaba indishyi kuri izo konti, Dara arega Gbenga kuba yaramuhatiye gukora imibonano mpuzabitsina (bibarwa nko gufata ku ngufu).\nUmusaruro.\nAmashusho yafashwe yabereye ahantu i Lagos. \nyasohowe mu 2016.\nIyi filime yasohotse muri sinema zo muri Nijeriya ku ya 12 Kanama 2016. Yerekanwe kandi mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Toronto. "}
{"id": "20630", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20630", "title": "Special Jollof", "text": "Special Jollof nifilm yakozwe muri 2020 yomuri Nigeriya -Filime yo gusetsa. Yakozwe kandi iyoborwa na Emem Isong ; Yakinwe na Joseph Benjamin, Uche Jombo na Femi Adebayo munshingano zabo. Filime yafatiwe ahanini muri Nijeriya no muri Insanganyamatsiko yafirime yashyizweho nkinkuru yurukundo, hamwe nabimukira inyuma. Iyifilime yasohotse ku Gashyantare 2020 ihura numunsi w'abakundana ndetse nokwizihiza ukwezi kwahariwe amateka y'abirabura muri Amerika. \nInyandiko.\nUmunyamakuru wumunyamerika wumuzungu wongeye kubyuka nyuma yogutandukana numukunzi we atangira gukora nkibanga muri resitora yo muriNijeriya kugira ngoyerekane kabanyanijeriya bimukira muri Amerika muburyo butemewe namategeko. Nyuma yaje gukundana numusore wo muriNigeriya. "}
{"id": "20631", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20631", "title": "Hoodrush", "text": "Hoodrush ni filime ya ishingiye kumuziki yomuri Nigeriya yakizwe muri 2012 yanditswe, yakozwe, kandi yayobowe na Dimeji Ajibola, ikinwamo na OC Ukeje, Bimbo Akintola, na Gabriel Afolayan. Yakiriye ibihembo bibirimu bihembo bya 9 bya Afurika Movie Academy Awards, Gabriel Afolayan yaj gutsindira igihembo cyicyiciro \"cyumukinnyi witwaye neza munshingano zunganira\". \nFilime ivuga ku amateka yabavandimwe babiri bahura nibibazo bitandukanye mugihe baharanira kwitabira kwerekana impano yumuziki.\nKwakira.\nKwakira neza.\nFilime yakiriwe neza cyane kubisanzwe. Nollywood Reinvented yashimye iyifilime kubera umuziki wayomwiza kandi wahimbwe neza mazeawuha amanota 69%, yaravuze ati: \"umuvuduko wafirime mu ntangiriro ushobora kuba wari impuzandengo, ariko waje kugera kuri crescendo nkigitabo gishimishije umuntu yashidikanyagaho, ariko arishima aragisoma kugeza kundunduro. Iyinifilime nziza\". Sodas na Popcorn kurundi koyifilm yaba nziza nindirimbo nke. Yatanze amanota 4 kuri 5 kandi yanditse ati \"Iyiyari inyandiko nzizacyane yuzuyemo ibintu byinshi byo guhagarika umutima, amayeri, amarangamutima ndetse nigikorwa gitocyiza ol 'kandi nkunda cyane, kuririmba. Amashusho meza yarimeza, amashusho yimibonano mpuzabitsina yarihejuru cyane, aho imirwano yari yemerwa, ndetse ikaba nziza kurutazimwe mu mashusho yaberaga i Hollywood\". \nIbihembo.\n\"Hoodrush\" yahawe ibihembo bibirimu bihembo bya 9 bya Afurika Movie Academy Awards harimo icyiciro \"Achievement muri Soundtrack\". Yakiriye kandi nomero cumi nimwe muri Nollywood Movies Awards yomuri 2013 harimoicyiciro cya \"Filime Nziza\"."}
{"id": "20632", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20632", "title": "As Crazy As It Gets", "text": "As Crazy As It Gets ni filime yakimwe muburyo bwa byandagusetsa ariko nanone yiganjemi urukundo rwo muri Nigeriya 2015 iyobowe na Shittu Taiwo ikinwamo na Omoni Oboli na Chuks Chyke mubikorwa byingenzi. \nInshamake y'iyi filime shingiye kumugabo ugiye gusaba umukunzi we gahunda yuko bakwitegura kurushinga kuko umugorewe yari utwite cyane yerekanaga ku muryango we amusaba ko yakwita ku nshingano ze\". \nUmusaruro no kurekurwa.\n\"As Crazy As it Gets ni filimi\" yasohokeye kandi ifatirwa amashusho mu mujyi wa Abuja, FCT. Yerekanwe bwa mbere muri Hoteli Sheraton, Abuja ku ya \nKwakira.\nNollywood Reinvented yashyize ahagaragara filime 40%, ashima inkuru kuba \"itandukanye\", ariko anenga umugambi mubi ndetse no kutagira chimie hagati yabantu bombi bayobora. Yasoje igira iti: \"... filime irashimishije kuko itandukanye. Omoni azana ubuzima bwinshi muri firime kandi umuyobozi wumugabo, Chucks Chyke, akora neza cyane kugiti cye nkumukinnyi. Ubu rwose hari akazi kagomba gukorwa hamwe nibisubizo yatanze kubandi bakinnyi bari murwego\". "}
{"id": "20633", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20633", "title": "Lizard (film)", "text": "Lizard ni filime ngufi yomuri Nijeriya yanditswe na Akinola Davies Jr. na Wale Davies kandi yayobowe na Davies. Nibwo bwonyine yatanzwe muriNigeriya mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Sundance 2021 ndetse numusaruro wambere womuri Nijeriya wegukanye igihembo kinini cya Jury muriri serukiramuco. \nUmugambi.\n\"Lizard\" avuga kunkuru ya Juwon, umukobwa wimyaka umunani wirukanwa mwishuri ryoku cyumweru azirakugira ubushobozi budasanzwe bwokumva akaga. Yishora mubikorwa byubugizi bwanabi bikurikira. \nUmusaruro.\n\"Lizard\" washyizweho mumyaka yaza 90 Lagos kandi ushingiye kubuzima busanzwe bwabaye kurakinola Davies ariko washyizwemo ibitekerezo. \nKwakira.\n\"Lizard\" yatsindiye igihembo kinini cya Jury mwi iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Sundance 2021. "}
{"id": "20634", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20634", "title": "Jumbled", "text": "Jumbled ni filime yikinamico yomuryango womuri Nigeriya ya 2019 yayobowe na Saheed Apanpa. iyiFilime yafatiwe cyane cyane i Lagos. Iyifilime yabanje kwitwa \"Entangled\" ariko yahinduwe muntangiriro za 2019 kugirango yirinde gukoresha izinarisa ryakoreshejwe nundi mukinnyi wa firime. Irimo Wale Ojo Adebayo na Lilian Esoro mu nshingano zabo. Iyifilime yasohotse muri Mata 2019 kandiyakiriwe neza n'abagenzuzi\nInyandiko.\nivuga kumukobwa ukirimuto urengeje imyaka 30 akomeza ubufite agahinda mumutima kugezabonye umugabo mwiza murukundo rwe, gusa ugasanga ashobora kubamubi nkabandi bagabo bose. \nKurekura.\nAbakinnyi nabakozi bamenyesheje itangazamakuru kuya 11 Mata 2019, umunsi umwe mbere yisohoka ryafirime mukwerekana muburyo bwihariye filime yabereye muri Sinema ya Silverbird. "}
{"id": "20635", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20635", "title": "Karishika", "text": "Karishika ni filime iteye ubwoba yomuri Nigeriya yakozwe muri 1998. Irimo Becky Okorie nku mukinyi wingenzi.\nUmugambi.\nUmugabo abategereje hanze yicyumba cyokubyariramo ibitaro. Nyuma yiminota, umuforomo arasohoka akamubwira ko umugore we yibarutse ikirayi. Yahise ava mu bitaro afite uburakari. Ibi bikaba byamuviramo gutandukana hagati yenumugore we amaze gusohoka mubitaro. Nyuma yogutongana gukabije, amukubita umuti agwa hasi yapfuye. Karashika aragaragara amubwira ngoyimanike, arabikora, maze ajyanwa ikuzimu naKarashika.\nUmuhungu witwaga Divine murusengero agahaguruka agasoma Yohana 3:16 kugira ngoyumve itorero maze pasiteri (Joseph Okechukwu) abwiriza ibyerekeye igitambo cyimana kandi yerekana umuryango wabakristo wicyitegererezo Divine ariwe mwana wenyine.\nLusuferi atangira imyiteguro yokohereza abakozi bazatera abantu benshi gucumura bityobakongera umubare wabazajya ikuzimu. Bageze kwisi, i Lagos, muri Nijeriya. Bakirwa nitsinda ryabadayimoni. Barara murihoteri, bishyuye amafaranga yagaragaye hanzeyumuyaga. Mugihe abadayimoni baribafite inama uwakiriye hoteri yahagaze hanze yumuryango, kuneka abadayimoni banyuze murufunguzo. Umwemuribo arabura agaragara inyuma yabakiriye. Abadayimoni bashimuta Divine, nyuma yajegutaha yitwara ukundi. Abadayimoni bakora ibibari mukabari bivamo kurasa. Bashoboraga kandi gushaka umuyobozi wa banki yumuntu gukorana nabo, numupfumu, bakamusanganira inyuma yinyuma yubumaji bwe.\nTugarutse \"ikuzimu\" Lusuferi yatwaki umwe mubayoboke bekubera kutumvira nkumuburo kubandi.\nTugarutse kwisi, umugabo yirukanwa nimodoka kukoyarangaye umwe mubadayimoni babagore. Umwuka wabadayimoni muriDivine urabyuka. Abadayimoni basohoka mutubari two gutora abahohotewe. Abahohotewe baricwa kandi ubugingo bwabo bujyanwa ikuzimu.\nSewa Divine yamaganye Divine kubayaribye amafaranga, nyinawa Divine aramurwanirira.\nPasiteri ageragezwa numwe mubadayimoni babagore, Imana isezerana nasatani kubyerekeye ubwitangebwa pasiteri. Pasiteri yatsinze ikizamini \nNyina wa Divine akangukira munzozi mbi, Se wa Divine aramuturisha basubira kuryama ariko rerose wa Divine afite inzozi mbi. Pasiteri ageze murugo rwa Divine aramwirukana. Abadayimoni bose bagaragara hanze yumuyaga kandi bamushora kurugamba. Imana yakuyeho imbaraga za Lusuferi zokugirira nabi pasiteri, iha pasiteri intsinzi kandi irekura uburakari bwe kuri satani."}
{"id": "20636", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20636", "title": "Kasanova", "text": "Kasanova nifilime isetsa y\u2019urukundo yomuri Nijeriya yakozwe muri 2019 iyobowe na Oluseyi Asurf ikaba yarakozwe na Eddy Young hamwe na Kwizera Ojo nka Producer Executif. Filime yafatiwe cyane cyane i Lagos, muri Nijeriya. Irimo Wale Ojo Doyle na Toyin Abraham mu nshingano zabo. Iyifilime yerekanwe bwambere muri Sinema ku. Filime yaje gutsindira amafaranga menshi kandi niyo filime yinjije amafaranga menshi muri Nigeriya muri Nzeri 2019. Amajwi \u201cNtureke\u201d yakozwe n'umuhanzi w'Ubwongereza-Nigeriya Bwana DiL\nInyandiko.\nFemi (Wale Ojo), umupapa wibana yisanga murukundo na Jessica (Iri Doyle), umubyeyi wibana. Abashakanye bakundana binyuze mubana babo, kandi byemeza ko harintambara yurukundo, umuryango nubucuti. Mubyukuri, Jessica numwarimu wumuziki wumuhungu wa Femi Jason (Alvin Abayomi) kandi bitera amakimbirane yinyungu hagati ya se numuhungu. \nBox office.\nIyifilime yakiriye miliyoni 4.9 z'amapound mumpera zicyumweru mugatangira kandi yinjije miliyoni 7.9 zamapound mucyumweru gitangira kuva ahoyasohokeye. "}
{"id": "20637", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20637", "title": "Awakening (film ya 2013)", "text": "Awakening ni yakinywe kandi insohorerwa muri Nigeriya yijimye ya 2013 yayobowe na James Omokwe na Ethan Okwara ikinwamo OC Ukeje, Kehinde Bankole, Femi Brainard na Bryan Okwara. Yatowe mu cyiciro cya AMAA Awakening kuba yaragaragaye muraya matora ya AMMAA byagize Ingaruka Ziboneka mu bihembo bya 9 bya Afurika Movie Academy Awards. Iyi filime niyo filime kuri Nollywood Yongeye kugaruka mugihe cyo gusohoka, n'amanota 81%. \nUburyo yakiriwe.\nFilime yakiriwe neza cyane kandi yashimiwe cyane kubikorwa byayo byiza kandi byemewe. Nollywood Reinvented yayihaye amanota 81%, akaba ari yo filime yagize manota menshi ku rubuga icyo gihe maze avuga ati: \"Inkuru iri muri iyi filime irashimishije kandi iratangaje gusa, kandi ntabwo ari inkuru y\u2019ibanze ubwayo ahubwo ni uduce duto twose tugize byose. Umwanditsi w'ibitabo akora umurimo utangaje wo guhuza ibintu byose ku buryo nta kintu na kimwe kivuga ko nanditse ku buryo butagaragara. firime isaba ko uyitaho kandi iyo uhumye amaso hashobora kubura ikintu gikomeye \". Yashimye kandi ubuhanga bwo gukina Kehinde Bankole, agira ati: \"Kureba Kehinde Bankole kuri ecran nta kintu na kimwe kijyanye n'uburambe... agutegeka ibitekerezo byawe hose.\" \nAmashimwe.\n\"Awakening\" yahawe igihembo mu bihembo bya 9 bya Afurika Movie Academy Awards kubera icyiciro \"yagezweho mu mashusho agaragara\" (hamwe \"n\u2019indege iheruka yerekeza Abuja\" na \"Twin Sword\"). Yatowe kandi muri \"Filime yumwaka\" muri Afurika Magic Viewers Choice Awards 2014."}
{"id": "20638", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20638", "title": "Ayamma Film", "text": "Ayamma: Music in the Forest ni filime y\u2019umuco yasohotse mu 2016, yanditswe na Vivian Chiji, iyobowe na Chris Eneaji, ikorwa na Emem Isong. Filime yerekana umuco wa Afrika cyane, yerekana umuco wabaturage ba Ibibio bo muri Nijeriya. Igicu kirimo umuziki, imbyino no gusetsa. Inyenyeri zayo zitangaje cyane muri Adesua Etomi, Wale Ojo, Majid Michel, Ime Bishop Umoh, Theresa Edem, Moses Armstrong n'abandi. Inguzanyo yatanzwe na Banki yinganda kugirango itere inkunga film. \nUmugambi.\nIgikomangoma Daraima, umuragwa mwiza wa Obong Ikpaisong, yarose inshuro nyinshi Ihuoma, umukobwa wumukene ariko mwiza ufite uburanga bujyanye nijwi rye gusa. Mu nzozi za Daraima, indabyo zirabya kandi inyoni ziraterana iyo Ihuoma aririmbye. yaje gukundana nu umukobwa winzozi ze. Mu isi isanzwe, igikomangoma Daraima, yiteguye kurongora igikomangoma kazi Ama, umukobwa w\u2019umwami uturanye. Mu gitaramo cyo kubyina cyo guha ikaze Umuganwakazi Ama mu bwami, igikomangoma Daraima yatunguwe no kubona ko umwe mu bakobwa babyina ari Ihuoma-umukobwa, kugeza ubu abaho mu nzozi ze gusa. Ntabwo yari abizi, uyu ni Iko, umukobwa wumukene mucyaro akaba ari kopi nyayo ya Ihuoma kandi bidasanzwe afite ubuhanga bumwe bwo kuririmba. Umuganwakazi ntare Ama yitegereza umukwe we ushimishijwe na Iko maze yiyemeza kwikuramo iri terabwoba rigaragara mu gihuru. \nInsanganyamatsiko.\nFilime ibamo imiziki yujuje ubuziranenge, iririmbwa binyuze mu ijwi ryiza ry'umuntu wambere Iko. Baza kandi kumenya imbyino zumuco yabantu ishakisha. Umwanditsi Vivian Chiji avuga kuri firime, asobanura ko ari filime y\u2019umuco ya fusion. Ibi bisobanuro biva mubyukuri ko iyo Iko aririmbye mu nzozi za Muganwa Daraima, indabyo zirabya, inyoni ziraterana, bikajyana no kuba Iko ifite isano nubwenge nka Ihuoma mubuzima busanzwe. Iyi filime ivuga kandi ku ishyari, mu gihe uburakari bw'Umwamikazi Ama bwibasiye Ihuoma mu kureba umubano we n'igikomangoma. Insanganyamatsiko y'ingenzi muri iyi film itagomba kwibagirana ni urukundo ruhuza Ihuoma mu buryo butangaje igikomangoma.\nUmusaruro.\nEmem Isong yatangaje ku mugaragaro ko haje filime nshya yitwa Ayamma mu biganiro byabereye i Lagos. Mbere yicyo gihe, yatekerezaga gukora ikintu kigiye kwerekana umuco we, agira ati: \"Ndumva hari igihe dukeneye gusubira mu mizi yacu, bityo nicyo nkora.\" Kandi rero, igihe inyandiko yazaga, yarayifashe yiyemeza gukora ibintu byinshi muri yo. \nUmuziki.\nUmuziki watsindiye gukoreshwa muri filimi ya Ayamma wahimbwe na George Nathaniel na Eveazi, nabo bakaba barakoranye n\u2019isosiyete ikora ibicuruzwa mu gukora filime yabo yabanjirije \"Knocking ku Irembo ry\u2019Ijuru\" nayo ikinamo Adesua Etomi."}
{"id": "20639", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20639", "title": "Bachelor's Eve Film", "text": "Bachelor's Eve ni filime iri mubwoko bwa comedi ndetse yiganjemo n'urukundo yakorewe muri Nijeriya 2018 iyobowe na Rotimi Raji kandi yakozwe na Adefajo Ayobami munsi ya Juma Productions. Yatanzwe na Metro Classic Pictures. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Kehinde Bankole, Doris Simeon, Gbenro Ajibade, Frankincense Eche-Ben, Jumoke Odetola na Kehinde Olorunyomi. \nInyandiko.\nInkuru yerekeye ku umukinyi mwiza wumukino witeguye kurushinga. Ariko, yahisemo gutemberana nabagenzi be amasaha 24 yubukwe kandi haribibazo byinshi bidasubijwe bituma ishyingiranwa rishoboka. \nPremiere.\nIyi filime yasohotse ku ya 16 Gashyantare 2018 mu gihugu hose. "}
{"id": "20640", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20640", "title": "Bad Comments", "text": "Bad Comments ni film ya yakiniwe kandi inafatirwa amashusho mu gihugu cya Nigeriya 2021 ikinamo Jim Iyke ari nawe producer mukuru. 2 \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b \nInyandiko.\nIyi filime ishingiye ku ubuzima bwa Frank Orji, umukinnyi ufite umwuga ukomeye wo gukina wamamaye cyane nyuma yo gusohora amashusho yatunganijwe kumurongo. Ibi biganisha kumurongo kuri interineti ukoresheje troll kumurongo. Abifashijwemo na hacker, umuzamu we, n'umufasha we ku giti cye, ashobora gukurikirana izo troll no kubaha uburyohe bw'imiti yabo. "}
{"id": "20641", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20641", "title": "Badamasi Film", "text": "Badamasi: Igishushanyo cya Jenerali ni filime ya biopic ivuga ku wahoze ari umukuru w\u2019igihugu cya Nigeriya, Ibrahim Badamasi Babangida (IBB). Yayobowe na Obi Emelonye ikina na Enyinna Nwigwe mu mwanya wa mbere nka Babangida. Niyo biopic ya mbere ya politiki ya \nUmugambi.\n\"Badamasi\" ni filimi igaragaza kandi ikavuga amateka ya Babangida kuva aho akomoka mu mudugudu wa Wushishi mu majyaruguru ya Nijeriya kugeza igihe yinjiye mu gisirikare ndetse n'igihe abereye umukuru w'igihugu cya Nigeriya. Irerekana kandi ibintu by'ingenzi byabaye mu buzima bwa Babangida harimo n'igihe cy'intambara yo muri Nijeriya aho Babangida yakomeretse agerageza gutabara mugenzi we. Ubutegetsi bwa gisirikare bwakurikiyeho no gusesa amatora ya perezida yo muri Kamena 1993 nabwo bwerekanwe. \numusaruyo yagize nyuma yo gushyirwa Hanze.\nGutunganya \"Badamasi\" 2017 \u200b\u200b\u200b Umuyobozi wa firime yabwiye \"Pulse Nigeria\" yavuze ko byamutwaye imyaka 4 kugirango yumvishe Babangida kumwemerera gukora biopic. Iyi filime yabanje kwishyurwa ku italiki ya 29 Ugushyingo 2019 ariko itinda gusohorwa kubera impamvuza politiki bivugwa ko barwanyaga ikwirakwizwa rya filime. Hari impungenge z\u2019uko biopic ishobora kuba igerageza kwera inkuru ya Babangida kuko iseswa ry\u2019amatora ya perezida yo muri Kamena 1993 ryatumye Babangida yamaganwa. Shiloh Godson yakoresheje amajwi. Trailer yasohotse \"2019\".\nKwakira neza.\nIsuzuma rya \"The Guardian\" ryashimye iyi filime kuba yarakoze kandi yitaye ku makuru ya tekiniki avuga ko yakozwe ititaye kumiterere yaza filimi za Nollywood\" kandi ko yari ajyanye n'izindi filime za Obi Emelonye zirimo \"Umutima 2 Umutima\", \"Indorerwamo y'umuhungu\", \"Indege iheruka yerekeza Abuja\" na \"Onye Ozi\". "}
{"id": "20642", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20642", "title": "The Banker (film ya 2015)", "text": "Banker ni filime yikinamico yakiniwe kandi inasohokera mu gihugu cya Nigeriya 2015, yakozwe kandi iyobowe na Emem Isong na Ikechukwu Onyeka. Iyi filime yakinnye na Mbong Amata, Maureen Okpoko, Belinda Effah na Seun Akindele. Yerekanwe bwa mbere muri Civic Centre, Lagos ku ya 16 Gicurasi 2015. \ninkuru yiyi filimi ya The Backer ishingiye ku kuntu abanyamabanki b\u2019abagore bakoresha igitsina cyabo kugirango babone inyungu nziza kubakiriya babo. Irasura kandi ibihe nububabare bwamarangamutima banyuramo mugusohoza intego zamasosiyete, mugihe havugwa imyumvire itandukanye ya nyirabukwe, nabagore bafite abagabo bakorana nabanyamabanki b\u2019abagore muri Nijeriya.\nUmugambi.\nChinwe ni umugore wakoraga muri banki akaba yari umuhanga akaba kandi yarakoreshaga ubuhanga inzira zose zishoboka kugirango abakiriya babagabo kandi babakire bafungure konti zamafaranga, batitaye kubyo basaba. Uzaba sebukwe atekereza ko abanyamabanki bose b'abagore ari abasambanyi kandi ko batazemera gushyingirwa n'umuhungu we. Ibi bimutera kohereza inshuti nyinshi zabakire nkumukiriya ushobora kugerageza kumureshya ngo aryamane nabo, kugirango arebe niba azahagarara.\nKwakira.\nNollywood Reinvented yahaye iyi filime amanota 2.5 kuri 5, ayinenga ko idafite umwimerere kandi yitaweho cyane. Iyi filime yasobanuwe kandi ko idashoboka mu bihe bimwe na bimwe, ariko yavuze ko kumenyekanisha Seun Akindele mu gice cya nyuma cya filime byazanye ubuzima runaka. \nKu biganiro bya Filime nyafurika, urubuga rwo gusubiramo rushobora \"gusaba\" cyangwa \"gusohora\" film; \"Umunyamabanki\" \"yasabwe\", umwanditsi ashima uburyo \"bugororotse-ku-ngingo\". Ariko, byumvaga icyerekezo cyimyandikire kidahuye rwose nukuri. Yasabye kandi ko inkuru yari ikwiye kuba itandukanye, mu gihe ishima imikorere ya Seun Akindele. "}
{"id": "20643", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20643", "title": "Battle on Buka Street Film", "text": "Battle on Buka Street ni filime ikoze muburyo bwo gusetsa benshi bazi nka komedi ikaba yarakorewe nde yo muri Nigeriya 2022 iyobowe na Funke Akindele na Tobi Makinde. Filime yakozwe hamwe nkubufatanye hagati ya Funke Ayotunde Akindele Network (FAAN) na Studiyo ya FilmOne. Iyi filime yasohotse mu ikinamico ku Ukuboza 2022 kandi ifungura ibitekerezo byiza cyane by\u2019abanenga. Filime yabaye nziza cyane muri office. \nUmugambi.\nBattle on Buka Street (stall) ikunzwe cyane mumuryango wa Otanwa \"Buka Street\" abifashijwemo na nyina Asake hamwe nabana be. Ariko, murumuna we na murumuna we Awele yaguze iduka bari baturanye umunsi umwe atangira guhatana. Irushanwa ryabo ryatangiye mbere y'ubwana bwabo; ba nyina, Asake na Ezinne, bombi bashakanye na se Meduka, bari bafite ishyari kandi batongana, kandi ibyo byakomereje ku bana babo."}
{"id": "20645", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20645", "title": "Looking for Baami", "text": "Looking for Baami nifilime yinkinamico yakorewe muri Nigeriya 2019 yanditswe kandi yayobowe na Biodun Stephen. Murii yifilime hagaragaramo Femi Jacobs, Bimbo Ademoye, Akinde Seyi mu bakinnyi bambere. "}
{"id": "20646", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20646", "title": "Nation Under Siege", "text": "Nation Under Siege, izwi kandi kwizina rya Boko Haram, nifilime ya Nollywood yomuri 2013 yayobowe na Pascal Amanfo nishorwamo amafanga na Double D. \nInyandiko.\nIyifilime ivuga mpuguke mu kurwanya iterabwoba igerageza guhagarika itsinda ry iterabwoba rya kisilamu riteye ubwoba kandi ryica Abanyanijeriya.\nKwakira.\nIyifilime yakiriye ibitekerezo bitandukanye byatanzwe na Majid Michel, umukinnyi wa Gana, yerekana iterabwoba ryomuri Nijeriya, ndetse no kwerekana iterabwoba ryumutwe wiyitirira islam, bituma filime ibuzwa muri Gana. Inzu zerekana amafilime muri Nijeriya nazo zanze kwerekana iyo filimi kubera izo mpamvu kandi Amanfo yagombaga guhindura izina rya filime akava muri \"Boko Haram\" akayita \"Nation Under Siege\" mbere yo kuyisohora muri Nijeriya. "}
{"id": "20647", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20647", "title": "Hire a Woman (film)", "text": "KHire a Woman ni filime isetsa yomuri Nigeriya yakozawe muri 2019 yakozwe na Chinneylove Eze ikayoborwa hamwe na Ifeanyi Ikpoenyi, ikana kinwamo Uzor Arukwe, Nancy Isime, na Alexx Ekubo. Byagenze muribisi, filime yinjije amafaranga menshi muri Nigeriya muri Werurwe 2019.\nIncamake.\nJide yatumiwe muguhura ninshuti ze zomuri kaminuza. Kugira ngo uwahoze ari umukunzi weagirire ishyari kandi ngo bamwiryeho we hamwe nizindi nshuti zabakobwa, ahakazi inshuti ye magara, Teni, kugira ngo bifate nka bakunzi be. ariko bikarangira bakundanye byanyabyo \nukoyakozwe.\n\"Hire a Woman ni filime\" ishingiye kuyindi filimr yitwa \"Hire Umugabo\" wa 2017, nayo yakozwe na Eze ndetse ikinwamo na Isime; Eze yavuze ko atari urukurikirane, ahubwo kubucuti, mu gihe filime yabanje yibanze ku muryango. Kurasa byabereye muri Whispering Palms Resort i Badagry. \nKwakira.\nYasohotse mu gihugu hose kuya 29 Werurwe 2019, iyifilime yatsindiye amafaranga menshi, yinjije amapound 20.8\u00a0 "}
{"id": "20648", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20648", "title": "Outkast (film)", "text": "Outkast ni filime yakorewe muri Nigeriya yo muri 2001 yakozwe kandi ikayoborwa na Chico Ejiro. \nUmugambi.\nIyifilime igaragara mo itsinda ry'abakora imibonano mpuzabitsina bo muri Nijeriya birukanwa mu Butaliyani. Iyobasubiye i Lagos, bihindura abagizi nabi kugirango babone amafaranga. \nIhuza ryo hanze.\nOutkast at IMDb"}
{"id": "20649", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20649", "title": "God Calling", "text": "God Calling ni filime yinkinamico ya gikirisitu yomuri Nigeriya yakozwe muri 2018 yanditswe kandi iyoborwa na Bodunrin 'BB' Sasore. Muriyi filime hagaragaramo Zainab Balogun, Karibi Fubara, na Richard Mofe Damijo mubakinnyi bingenzi. Iyifilime yakoze amateka mu mwaka wa 2018 ibanziriza iyinjira rya sinema mugihugu hose imaze kurenga y\u2019icyayi cyayo kuva yasohoka ndetse ikanagaragara kuri CNN African Voices. \nInyandiko.\nNinkuru yogucungurwa ireba ubuzima bwa Sade, umuryangowe, hamwe nokwizera kwe binyuze mumurongo wo uhura bidasanzwe n'Imana muri ikigihe cya none. \nKurekura.\nYasohotse mumwaka wa 2018. "}
{"id": "20650", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20650", "title": "Nzambi Mpungu (film)", "text": "Nzambi Mpungu (film) nifilime yo mu Bubiligi 1928, yayobowe na Ernest Genval kandi yakozwe murwego rwa \"Misiyoni ya Sinema\". Intego ya \"Misiyoni ya Sinema ya Genval\" muri Kongo y'Ububiligi kwari ukugaragaza imirimo yubutumwa gatolika nimigenzo yaho. I Zugulu, umudugudu wo mukarere ka Kwango, umupfumu aburira N'Goma numugore weku kaga k '\"abapadiri b'Imana y'abazungu\". Yozefu, umwe mubagize ubwoko bumwe, abashishikariza guhinduka. Arabigisha gusoma no kwandika, kubara, ububaji bwibanze... no kumenya imana nyayo, Nzambi Mpungu. Ese N'Goma na Kaoulou bazemezwa?"}
{"id": "20651", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20651", "title": "Children of Mud", "text": "Children of Mud nifilime yinkinamico yakorewe muri Nigeriya mumwaka wa 2017 yanditswe kandi iyoborwa na Imoh Umoren. Muriyi filime hagaragaramo Liz Benson na Matilda Obaseki munshingano zabo mu gihe iyifilime yaranze umushinga wakane wubuyobozi bwa Imoh Umoren. Umugambi wafirime ushingiye kumpungenge zabana batagira muri Nijeriya. Iyifilime yasohotse muri Nijeriya muri Nyakanga 2017 kandi yakiriwe neza. Filime yatsindiye kandidatire nkemu birori byo gutanga ibihembo. \nInyandiko.\nKwirukanwa nanyirasenge, Emem na urumuna we wimpumyi Miracle bakisanga kumuhanda utababarira kandi ugoye, biruka urumuri rwicyizere."}
{"id": "20652", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20652", "title": "Red Island (film)", "text": "Red Island (French) nifilm yinkinamico yakozwe muri 2023 iyobowe na Robin Campillo. Yanditswe na Campillo na Gilles Marchand, yakinnyemo Nadia Tereszkiewicz, Quim Guti\u00e9rrez, na Charlie Vauselle. Bashyizweho mwitangiriro yaza 70 Madagasikari, aho Campillo yamaranye ubwana bwe, ikurikira umuhungu wimyaka umunani numuryango webari mu birindiro byingabo zubufaransa. \nUmusaruro.\nGufata amashusho byabaye kuva Kanama kugeza Ugushyingo 2021. Amazina yakazi arimo na. \nKurekura.\n\"Red Island\" yasohotse murisinema zomu Bufaransa kuya 31 Gicurasi 2023.Yashyikirijwe iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes mu 2023, iyifilime yahoze yitwa Campillo, \"BPM (Beats per Minute)\", yerekanwe bwambere kandi ihabwa Grand Prix mumwaka wa 2017, ariko ntiyatoranijwe. marushanwa mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya 71 rya San Sebasti\u00e1n muri Nzeri 2023.\nKwakira.\nkurubuga rwa review aggregator na Rotten Tomatoes, 86% 28 byabantu banenga ibyiza, nahoimpuzandengo ya 7.2 / 10. [9] Metacritic, ikoresha impuzandengo iremereye, yahaye iyifirime amanota 72 kuri 100, ishingiye ku banegura 7, byerekana ko \"muri rusange ari byiza\".[10]\nPeter Bradshaw asubiramo filime ya \"The Guardian\", yayihaye inyenyeri eshanu kurieshanu maze avuga koari \"umurimo ukomeye, kandi ugaragara neza.\" "}
{"id": "20653", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20653", "title": "Dolce Vita Africana", "text": "Dolce Vita Africana nifilm mbarankuru yomu Bwongereza yakozwe 2008 ifatiwe muri Mali\nInyandiko.\n\"Dolce Vita Africana\" ni filime mbarankuru ivuga kumafoto azwicyane yomuri Mali yafotora Malick Sidib\u00e9, amashusho yishusho kuva mu mpera za 1950 kugeza mumyaka yaza 70 yafashe umwuka utitaye kugisekuru cye ushimangira ubwisanzure bwabo nyuma yubwigenge ndetse kugeza igihe ubutegetsi bwa kisilamu bwatangiriye mumyaka yigitugu cya gisirikare. Uyumukinnyi wafilime yagiye muri sitidiyo ya Sidib\u00e9 i Bamako, muri Mali, kugira ngo abone umuhanzi ku kazi kandi ahure na byinshi mu mafoto ye ya mbere, inkuru zabo bwite nazo zivuga amateka ya Mali."}
{"id": "20654", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20654", "title": "Ikogosi", "text": "Ikogosi: The Last Turn on Left ni filime yinkinamico yomuri Nigeriya yakozwe muri 2015, yakozwe kandi iyoborwa na Toka McBaror. Irimo Chelsea Eze, IK Ogbonna, Lisa Omoriodon, Leo Orji, Didi Ekanem. Filime ivuga \"inkuru yomubiruhuko bigenda nabi bigahinduka urugendo rubi\". \nMurirusange filime yashimwe nabangenzuzi ba film.\nKwakira.\n\"Ikogosi\" yashimwe nabangenzuzi ba film. Ada wa Nollywood Reinvented yaha iyifirime 2 kuri 5 byinyenyeri, ashima igishushanyo mbonera, umuziki nimyambarire, ariko anenga inkuru namashusho, imikorere yabakinnyi, ndetse no kuyobora. Yashoje avuga ati: \"Nubwo harinkuru zihagije zerekeye umubano nubukwe byanze bikunze bigomba kubwirwa, byakozwe inshuro nyinshi. Harakenewe gukora firime hirya no hinoku ngingo zongeramo urwego kandi zivuga inkuru muburyo butandukanye kandi butunguranye. Hariho ibipimo bihagije kumugambi wa \"Ikogosi\" wo kwiteza imbere kandi imyanzuro yarikwiye rwose gushyirwaho. Ntabwo nakugira inama yogufata igihe cyo kureba iyi filime keretse urambiwe.\" Adenike Adebayo yanenze cyane intego ya film maze ayitondekanya inyenyeri 1 kuri 5. "}
{"id": "20655", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20655", "title": "Out of Luck (2015 film)", "text": "Out of Luckni filime yo muri Nigeriya yo muri 2015 yanditswe na Chinaza Onuzo ikayoborwa na Niyi Akinmolayan. Irimo Tope Tedela, Linda Ejiofor, Ishami rya Femi, Adesua Etomi, Sambasa Nzeribe, Wole Ojo hamwe na Jide Kosoko na Chigul. Yasohotse ku ya 4 Ukuboza 2015.\nUmusaruro.\nMu Kwakira 2015, hasohotse trailer yiyi firime. "}
{"id": "20656", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20656", "title": "Public Property (film)", "text": "Public Property ni filime yo muri Nigeriya 2017 iyobowe na Tope Alake na Ashionye Michelle Raccah. \nUmugambi.\nMuriyi firime hagaragaramo umusore ukina byihuse kandi arekuye hamwe nabagore mbere yo kubajugunya. Yabigerageje ku wundi mugore kandi yari mu bibazo kuko atari yarigeze ahura numudamu uzamuha ikibazo gikomeye mbere. "}
{"id": "20657", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20657", "title": "Your Excellency (film)", "text": "Your Excellency nifilime yo isetsa ya politiki yomuri Nigeriya yakozwe 2019 yomuri Nigeriya yanditswe kandi iyiborwa na Funke Akindele ku nshuro yeya mbere. Murifilime hagaragaramo Akin Lewis na Funke Akindele mu nshingano zabo. Iyifilime yasohotse mu nkinamico mu makinamico 50 ku ya 13 Ukuboza 2019 kandi ifungura ibitekerezo byiza byabanenga.] \nUmugambi.\nUmucuruzi wumukungu w\u2019umukandida mukuba perezida watsinzwe, Chief Olalekan Ajadi, ahangayikishijwe cyane na Perezida wamerika Donald Trump. Mugihe gusa kwiyamamaza kwekwa politiki bisa nkaho biri hafi yikindi cyago kibi, Ajadi yasizwe amavuta nishyaka ryinshi maze abamunywanyi ukomeye, wizewe abifashijwemo nimbuga nkoranyambaga zikomeye.\nBox office.\nIyifilime yinjije miliyoni 17.5 zamapound muminsi ibiri yambere yayo kandi yarifilime yakane yinjije amafaranga menshi muri Nollywood yakozwe muri 2019, hamwe na miliyoni 105.5. "}
{"id": "20658", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20658", "title": "A Promising Africa", "text": "Promising Africa ni filime yakozwe na 2014 yakozwe na Zuriel Oduwole. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nYasohowe mu Gushyingo 2014 muri Sinema ya Sinema i Lagos, Urukurikirane \"rw'Afurika Yizeza\" rwerekanwe mu bihugu bitanu mu myaka itatu. \"]\" Promising Africa yakozwe na Oduwole"}
{"id": "20659", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20659", "title": "Progressive Tailors Club", "text": "Progressive Tailors Club, ni filime yogusebanya ya politiki yo muri Nijeriya 2021 iyobowe na Biodun Stephen ikaba yarakoranye na Niyi Akinmolayan na Victoria Akujobi.] \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b \nFilime yafatiwe i Lagos nomuri Nijeriya nohafi yayo. Yerekanwe bwa mbere ku ya 29 Ukwakira 2021. \nUmugambi.\nAbagize urugaga rw'abadozi bateye imbere bateranira munama yogutora umuyobozi wabo mushya. Batanze ibitekerezo byinshi bitemewe kuri ibyo. Ariko, iyo umuyobozi umaze igihe kirekire kandi wizewe akuweho kubera ruswa, guhitamo biza kumusaza, ibishya, kandi bisekeje. "}
{"id": "20660", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20660", "title": "Survival of Jelili", "text": "Survival of Jelili yanje kwitwa Jelili Reloaded nifilm isetsa yomuri Nigeriya yakozwe muri 2019 yakozwe na Femi Adebayo ikayoborwa na Desmond Elliot. Filime ni urukurikirane rwa film isekeje ya \"Jelili\" 2011. Muriyi filime hagaragaramo Femi Adebayo mumwanya wa Jelili, mugihe anakinamo Toyin Abraham na Dele Odule mu bakinnyi ba mbere. Iyi filime yasohotse mu ikinamico ku Ukuboza 2019 kandi yakiriwe neza n'abayinenga. Yanyujijwe kandi kuri Netflix ku ya 8 Nyakanga 2020. \nInyandiko.\nIyifilime ishingiye kuri Jelili, umusore wifuzaga gushaka imibereho kandi agahindura akazi ke akava mu mukino w'iteramakofe akajya mukwerekana imideli. \nUkoyakozwe.\nMumwaka wa 2012, nyumayo gutsinda kwa bisi ya abashoramari \"bomuri Jelili\" akaba n'umukinnyi wa filime Femi Adebayo yatangaje ko hazakorwa filime ikurikira izitwa \"Jelili Reloaded\". Ariko, gufata amashusho yuruhererekane ntibyari byatangiye kandi bigenda bigaragara muri kiriya gihe. Nyuma yimyaka irindwi mumajyambere ikuzimu, ifoto nyamukuru yafirime yatangiye mu mpera za 2018.\nGahunda yambere yifirime yatangiriye Ibadan hanyuma gahunda yanyuma yafirime irangira muri Ilorin. Iyifilime ahanini yafatiwe ahantu hatandukanye mumajyepfo y'uburengerazuba bwa Nijeriya. Byagaragaye kogufata amashusho bimaze iminsi igera kuri 21. Umuyobozi wa filime Desmond Elliot na we yaragize uruhare runini muri iyifilime mu gihe Rachael Okonkwo yakinnye bwa mbere murifilime yo mururimi rwa Yoruba binyuze muri iyi filime. "}
{"id": "20661", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20661", "title": "President Kuti", "text": "President Kuti ni filime irwana yomuri Nigeriya 2021 yakozwe na Ibrahim Yekini. Yanditswe na Azeezat Sorunmu ikayoborwa na Tope Adebayo na Ibrahim Yekini. Filime yasohotse ku ya 14 Nyakanga 2021. \nInyandiko.\nPresident Kuti ni umuyobozi wumuhanda wubahwa nyamara ugatinywa na bose; ahura n'ibitero by'udutsiko duhanganye yagiye atsinda. \nKwakira.\nFilime yatanze ibitekerezo birenga miliyoni 2 mubyumweru bibiri byambere nyumayo koherezwa kuri YouTube. "}
{"id": "20662", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20662", "title": "Portrait of a Lone Farmer", "text": "Portrait of a Lone Farmer ni filime ya documentaire yomuri Danemarike ya 2013 yakozwe na Jide Tom Akinleminu, ivuga kubuzima bwo mu isambu y\u2019inkoko ya se muri Nijeriya. "}
{"id": "20663", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20663", "title": "A Place Called Happy", "text": "A Place Called Happy ni firime ya Nollywood yakozwe, iyobowe kandi yanditswe na Dolapo Adeleke. Ivuga inkuru y'abashakanye babiri baturutse muri Gana na Nijeriya bagize ibihe bitoroshye mumyaka yashize. "}
{"id": "20664", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20664", "title": "Oxford Gardens", "text": "Oxford Gardens ni film yakozwe muri 2015 yakozwe kandi iyobowe na Obi Emelonye. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nAmafoto yafatiwe i Londres, muri Amerika kandi yerekanwe muri Nijeriya ku ya 18 Ukuboza 2015, \"Oxford Gardens\" yarekuwe nk'umurimo ufatanya na Obi Emelonye na M-Net binyuze mur'Afurika Magic Original Films. Ni filime ifite insanganyamatsiko yoguterana amakofe ishingiye ku mahirwe, urukundo nogucungurwa. "}
{"id": "20665", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20665", "title": "Knockout Blessing", "text": "Knockout Blessing ni filime yomuri Nigeriya ya 2018 ishimishije yakozwe na Dare Olaitan ikaba yarakoranye na Olaitan hamwe na Olufemi Ogunsanwo, Bibi Olaitan, na Niyi Olaitan. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Ade Laoye hamwe na Bucci Franklin, Ademola Adedoyin, Linda Ejiofor, Meg Otanwa na Tope Tedela munshinganozabo. Filime ivuga kumukobwa, Mugisha ufite intego yokugera kunzozize mukurandura ubukene. Icyakora, mu buryo butunguranye yimukiye mu nsi y\u2019abagizi ba nabi maze buhoro buhoro agera muri politiki ya Nijeriya. \nFilime yakiriwahanini nabayinenga bashimwa kandi yerekanwa kwisi yose. "}
{"id": "20666", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20666", "title": "King Invincible", "text": "King Invincible ni filime yomuri Nigeriya yomuri 2017 yamamaye kandi yakozwe na Femi Adesina. Iyi filime yanditswe mu 2003, itangira ryatangiye mu 2015 ntirikorwa kugeza mu 2017. Iyi filime yahujije insanganyamatsiko y\u2019urukundo n\u2019intambara yakinnye n\u2019abakinnyi n\u2019abakinnyi bakomeye nka Omowunmi Dada, Segun Dada, Tope Tedela, Gabriel Afolayan, Bimbo Manuel, Peter Fatomilola, Jude Chukwuka. 1] [\nIgenamiterere.\nFilime yashyizwe mu Bwami bwakera bwa Yoruba. \nInyandiko.\nFilime irazenguruka intwazangabo yavumwe kubera gucumura imana. Umuvumo we ni buhoro buhoro mumpyisi. Filime yabaye ingorabahizi mugushaka igisubizo kuko abuzwa undi muntu ukomeye. \nGutanga ibihembo.\nYatowemuri AMVCA kumyambarire myiza. "}
{"id": "20667", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20667", "title": "Joba (film)", "text": "Joba ni filime ishingiye kukwizera kwa Nollywood 2019 yakozwe kandi iyobowe na Biodun Stephen. Ni firime yamarangamutima ishingiye kurukundo, imbaraga nokubaho kw'Imana. Muri filime hagaragaramo Blossom Chukwujekwu, Enado Odigie, Chris Ihuewa, Ronke Ojo, na Christine Osifuye. \nInyandiko.\nFilime izenguruka umuryango wagikristo urwanira kuringaniza hagati yubukwe bwabo nokwizera. Imyizerere yabo yageragejwe mugihe ibimenyetso byose byerekanaga ko umugabo ariwe nyirabayazana wibibazo. \nPremiere.\nIyi filime yerekanwe bwambere ku ya 5 Mata 2019, muri Genesis Cinemas, Maryland Mall, Lagos, muri Nijeriya. Iyi filime kandi yerekanwe bwambere muri Gana, Afurika y'Epfo, YouTube na BBNaija House. Imurikagurisha ryaranzwe nicyamamare nka Bisola Aiyeola, Woli Arole na Wole Oladiyun. "}
{"id": "20668", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20668", "title": "Jenifa", "text": "Jenifa ni filime yogusetsa-ikinamico yomuri Nigeriya 2008 yakinnye na Funke Akindele. Iyi filime yatsindiye Akindele umukinnyi wa filime mwiza mu bihembo byambere mu bihembo bya Afurika bya Movie Academy 2009. Abandi bahatanira AMAA harimo Filime Nziza ya Nigeriya, Umukinnyi mwiza munshingano zunganira, hamwe n\u2019amajwi meza yumwimerere. \nFilime nicyo gicecyambere mubyagiye bihinduka francise izwi cyane yomuri Nigeriya. Urukurikirane rw'ibiganiro, \"Kugaruka kwa Jenifa\", rwasohotse mu mwaka wa 2011 maze televiziyo yoroshye ya reboot, \"Jenary ya Diary\", mumwaka wa 2015. Urukurikirane rw'umwimerere rwakurikiwe n'ibikurikira bibiri, \"Umujyi wa Aiyetoro\" (2019) na \"Jenifa kuri Lockdown\" (2021). \",\" \"porogaramu\" y\u2019imyandikire yigisha yasohotse mumwaka wa Oniyemi, Urwenya Oshin, Muritala Salam n'ibindi "}
{"id": "20669", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20669", "title": "Jail (2018 film)", "text": "Jail ni filime yomuri Nigeriya 2018 iyobowe kandi ikorwa na Morris K. Sesay. \nUmugambi.\nIyi filime ivugamateka y'umuntu wafunzwe azira icyaha atakoze, mugihe uwakoze icyaha ari inshuti ye ahunga. "}
{"id": "20670", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20670", "title": "Iwalewa", "text": "Iwalewa ni filime yomuri Nigeriya 2006 yakozwe na Khabirat Kafidipe na mushiki we Aishat Kafidipe, iyobowe na Tunde Olaoye na Writing ya Aishat Kafidipe Khabirat. Filime yakinywe na Remi Abiola nishami rya Femi. \nIncamake.\nFilime ivugamateka yumukobwa ukirimuto, Iwalewa, wapfushije ababyeyi akirimuto, ariko byabaye ngombwa ko abana nububabare bwo kuba impfubyi. \nGutanga ibihembo.\nIyi filime yabonye kandidatire eshatu, ariko yatsindiye ibihembo bibiri nka Filime Nziza y'Abasangwabutaka hamwe n'amajwi meza y'umwimerere mubihembo bya 3 bya Afurika Movie Academy Awards byabaye ku ya 10 Werurwe 2007 mukigo ndangamuco cya Gloryland kiri i Yenagoa, muri Leta ya Bayelsa, muri Nijeriya. Uruhare Khbirat Kafidipe muriyi filime rwamuhesheje igihembo cya Afurika Movie Academy Awards cy\u2019umukinnyi w\u2019abakinnyi beza mu nshingano zikomeye. "}
{"id": "20671", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20671", "title": "Issakaba", "text": "Issakaba ni filime yomuri Nigeriya 2001 iyobowe na Lancelot Oduwa Imasuen. Bishingiye gusa kubyabaye, byerekana itsinda ry\u2019abamaso ryitwa Bakassi Boys barwanya ibyaha kimwe n\u2019umupfumu witwa Eddy Nawgu, wateye ubwoba umuryango wa Nawgu muri Leta ya Anambra. \nUmugambi.\nAbahunguba Issakaba bayobowe na Ebube bagombaga kurwanya abajura bitwaje imbunda bateraga ubwoba umuryango wabo. Abajura bitwajimbunda bafitimbaraga zamayobera bakoresha mubikorwa byabo byubujura. Kuberiyompamvu, Ebube nitsinda rye ryabahungu ba Issakaba nabo babonye imbaraga zabafasha kurwanya ubujura. "}
{"id": "20672", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20672", "title": "Invasion 1897", "text": "Invasion 1897 ni filime yomuri Nijeriya yongeye kwerekana amateka yarangiye muri Gashyantare 1897, gutera, gusenya no gusahura ubwami bwa kera bwa Afurika y\u2019iburengerazuba bwa B\u00e9nin; no gutwarwa no guhunga umwami wigeze gukomera. Iyi filime yakozwe kandi iyobowe na Lancelot Oduwa Imasuen yasohotse mu 2014 ikaba irimo abakinnyi benshi ba Nollywood barimo Segun Arinze, Paul Obazele na Charles Inojie. Umugambi winkuru watangiriye ku nkuru y\u2019umutware ukiri muto wa Benin, wafashwe akazanwa murukiko azirakwiba ibihangano by\u2019amateka munzu ndangamurage y\u2019Ubwongereza ndetse n\u2019urugendorwe mumateka kugirango yirwaneho. \nMuri BON Awards, \"Invasion 1897\" yatorewekuba cinematogarafinziza, umukinnyi mwiza, ingaruka zidasanzwe, gutunganya neza kandi yatsindiye film nziza, gushushanya amajwi meza hamwe n\u2019umuyobozi mwiza. "}
{"id": "20673", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20673", "title": "Introducing the Kujus", "text": "Introducing the Kujus ni filime yogusetsa-ikinamico yomuri Nigeriya 2020 iyobowe na Biodun Stephen ikorwa na Winifred Okpapi. Muri filime hagaragaramo Bisola Aiyeola, bafatanyije gukora iyi filime. Irimokandi Timini Egbuson, Femi Jacobs, Bimbo Ademoye, Sophie Alakija na Mimi Onalaja kandi yashyizwe i Badagry. Filime yibanze kurukundo rwumukobwa umwe ukunda umuryango we, nuburyo uru rukundo ruhuza umuryangowe bikarangiza amakimbirane Yasohoye ku ya 27 Ugushyingo 2020. Mucyumweru gitangira, iyi filime yinjije miliyoni 10 z'amapound. \"Kumenyekanisha Kujus\" birakwiriye kubireba umuryango ariko inama zababyeyi zirasabwa. \nUmugambi.\n\"Introducing the Kuju\" ivugamateka y'abavandimwe batanu bomuri Nigeriya bari mumasangano. Ntibashaka gusubira mu mujyi wabo i Badagry mu gihe cy'imyaka itanu yo kwibuka urupfu rwa nyina. Mausi Kuju, abifashijwemo na Maugbe Kuju, bategura gahunda yo guhuza barumuna babo. Kugirango gahunda igerweho, agomba gushuka barumuna be, ariko imiterere ihindagurika yumubano wabo bivuze ko atazi neza uko bizagenda."}
{"id": "20674", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20674", "title": "In the Cupboard (film)", "text": "In the Cupboard ni firime yikinamico yo muri Nigeriya yasohotse muri 2012, igaragaramo ibikorwa byinshi byo hejuru. Filime ivuga inkuru ivuga ku mugore wongeye guhura n'abana be nyuma y'urupfu rw'umugabowe. Ishaka ry'umugabowe rirasomwa kandi yizerako agiyegutakaza ikizere abanabe bamufitiye kubera ibanga afite. "}
{"id": "20675", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20675", "title": "In America: The Story of the Soul Sisters", "text": "In Amerika: The Story of the Soul Sister ni filime yabanyamerica baba Nijeriya 2010 iyobowe na Rahman \"Oladigbolu\" ikaba yarakinnye na Jimmy Jean-Louis na Roger Dillingham yatsindiye filime nziza y'umunyafurika uba mumahanga mubihembo bya 7 bya Africa Movie Academy"}
{"id": "20676", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20676", "title": "Ile Owo", "text": "Ile Owo ni filime yomuri Nigeriya yo mu 2022 yanditswe kandi ikayoborwa na Dare Olaitan, ikagaragaramo Immaculate Oko Kasum, Tina Mba, Efa Iwara, na Mofe Duncan. Ivugamateka yumuryango winjiye mumasezerano amazibinyejana byinshi - igitambo cyinkumi ikirinto kugirango ibungabunge ukudapfa.\nInyandiko.\nBusola (Immaculate Oko Kasum) - umuforomokazi ukirimuto ufitese utemewe kandi akaba n'umukunziwe wiyemeje-phobic - yavumbuye imana hanze mu nzira yerekeza ku kazi ibura mu buryo butangaje ubwo yahamagaye nyina w\u2019umwuka cyane (Tina Mba). Uwa nyuma yumva atamenyereye urugo, maze aha umukobwa we umugisha amavuta ya elayo asezeranya kujyana nawe ahantu hose. Amaze gutandukana n'umukunzi we Lanre, Busola asigaye acitse intege, cyane cyane nyuma y'itariki yakurikiyeho itameze neza, kugeza ubwo akunda Tunji (Efa Iwara), umurwayi ukize amufata urumuri. Bisola, umushumba we yari aherutse guhanura ko vuba aha azarongora umugabo ubereye muruwomwaka, aboniterambererye arikimenyetso, ariko nyinawe ntabyemera nubwo seyafashe uruhande rw'umukobwawe.\nAbifashijwemo n'inshutiye Jola (Bukunmi Adeaga-Ilori), Busola - witegura umunsiwogusangira - yakiriye marike, yambaye imitako Tunji yari yamuhaye mu rwego rw'itsinda rye. Mugihe cyo kurya mu bwato bwe, Bisola ahura nibintu bidasanzwe bifitanye isano numukufi we. Nyina abonye akaga, agerageza kurinda umukobwa we binyuze mu masengesho, ariko umugabo we, abitewe n'imyuka mibi, ahagarika amasomo ye amukubita ubwenge. Yahise ajyanwa mu bitaro, maze Tunji amwemerera kwakira Busola na se mugihe akize. Nyuma y\u2019inzozimbi zerekanibiza, yapfuye azize ibikomere nyuma yiminsi, maze Busola avunika umutima asaba ihumure Tunji, watumiye ubutumire bwoguhura n\u2019umuryangowe.\nIbintubyahindutse umwijima iyogusura umuryango wa Busola bihindutse ibintubibi cyane birimo imihango yo gutamba n'imbaraga ndengakamere, bikamuhatira kurwanira ubuzima bwe.\nKwakira.\n\"Afrocritik\" avuga ko iyi filime yakiriwe n'abayinenga, bamwe mu banenga amafilime bavuze ko \"iyi filime yari ifite ubushobozi bwo gutangiza impinduramatwara iteye ubwoba ariko ikabura ikimenyetso\". Ile Owo yashimiwe amashusho ya sinema ariko anengwa ko idafite ubujyakuzimu "}
{"id": "20677", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20677", "title": "Ijewuru", "text": "Ijewuru ni film yogusetsa yomuri Nigeriya ivuga amarushanwa y'ibiryo. Irimo abakinnyi Baba Tee na Eniola Badmus. Yakozwe na Babatunde Bernard Tayo. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nGutanga ibihembo.\nMubihembo bya 2012 bya Nollywood Awards (BON), filime yatowe muri Filime yogusetsa y'umwaka. Byongeye kandi, Badmus yatowe nk'umukinnyi mwiza wa Yoruba. Iyi filime kandi yatorewe igihembo cya Filime nziza yo gusetsa muri Yoruba Movies Academy Awards (YMAA) mu "}
{"id": "20678", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20678", "title": "Igodo: The Land of the Living Dead", "text": "Igodo: The Land of the Dead ni filime yomuri Nigeriya yomu 1999 yakozwe na Don Pedro Obaseki ikanayobora Andy Amenechi. \nUmugambi.\nFilime ivugamateka yumudugudu uhangayikishijwe nimyukamibi nubupfumu. Inzirimwe rukumbi yo guhagarika iyomyukamibi nukwabagabo bomumudugudu bajya mumashyamba mabi kugarura inkota ifite imbaraga zitangaje zo kurwanya imyuka mibi nububasha mumudugudu.\nIgodo yifatanije nububushakashatsi mwishyambaribi. Yagiyeyo hamwe nitsinda agaruka wenyine. Benshi muri bagenzi be bariciwe bahigwa n\u2019imyuka n\u2019ibisimba byo mu ishyamba ribi ryababujije kubona inkota yimbaraga zitangaje. \nAbakinnyi.\nAbakinnyi barimo:"}
{"id": "20679", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20679", "title": "I Am Nazzy", "text": "I Am Nazzy ni filime yambere ya 2022 ya Nollywood ya Chinonso Arubayi ikayoborwa na Kayode Peters muriyisosiyete ikora sitidiyo ya Arubayi ya City Studios hamwe na Blue Pictures Entertainment. \nFilime yahinduranyije abakinnyi Jidekene Achufusi, Jimmy Odukoya, Denrele Edun, IK Ogbonna, na Ada Jesus nabandi. \nUmugambi.\nI am Nazzy ni firime ishimangira kunyurwa. Byerekana kokumwenyura byose bidasobanura umunezero. Muri filime, superstar Nazzy yashakaga kuva mubuzima bwe bw'ibyamamare. Ubuzima bwuzuye kwiyitirira no gusebanya. Umukunzi we, wagombaga kumushimisha, yahisemo imbuga nkoranyambaga kuruta kumwitaho. Yahuye numuvuzi wamugiriye inama yo kuva mubuzima bwuzuye glitz na glamour. Kubw'amahirwe, yahuyenawe maze ahitamo kungurana ibitekerezo. Iyi filime yatumye abayireba bahagarika umutima ku buryo aba bombi bari guhangana n'imibanireyabo ndetse n'umwuga wabo \nPremiere.\nIyi filime yasohotse ku ya 1 Mata 2022 ikaba yerekanwe bwambere muri Sinema ya EbonyLife ku cyumweru tariki ya 27 Werurwe 2022 hamwe n'abantu bakomeye bishimira ibirori. Muribo harimo; Bolanle Ninalowo, Stan Eze na Mugisha Nze, Elozonam, Denrele Edun, Nons Miraj, Tomi Odunsi, Simi Drey n'abandi benshi "}
{"id": "20680", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20680", "title": "A Hotel Called Memory", "text": "A Hotel Called Memory ni firime ya Nollywood 2017 iyobowe na Akin Omotoso. Azwihokubura ibiganiro, yiswe \"Filime yambere ya Nigeriya ituje\". \nGushira no gukorerwa ahantu i Lagos, Cape Town na Zanzibar, iyi filime ivugamateka y\u2019umugore watanye n\u2019umugabo we i Lagos maze ahitamo kujya mubice bimwenabimwe by\u2019isi kugirango yivumbure. Yanditswe na Branwen Okpako, iyi filime yakozwe na Ego Boyo ikinamo Nse Ikpe-Etim. Yatsindiye igihembo cy'abari bitabiriye filime nziza yo kugerageza mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya BlackStar muri Philadelphia. "}
{"id": "20681", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20681", "title": "Hey You (film)", "text": "Hey Wowe ni film yogusetsa yurukundo yomuri Nigeriya 2022 yanditswe kandi iyobowe na Uyoyou Adia, Abosi Ogba yakozwe na Victoria Akujobi munsi ya Anthill Production Studio. Muri filime hagaragaramo Temitope Olowoniyan, Rotimi Salami, Miriam Peters na Seyi Awolowo. \nInyandiko.\nUbuzima bwa injeniyeri ukirimuto wa software burasenyuka iyamenyeko gukundwakwe ari moderi ya firime ikuze. \nPremiere.\nIyi filime yasohotse muri sinema hiryanohino muri Nijeriya ku ya 29 Nyakanga \nReba kandi.\nIMDb"}
{"id": "20682", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20682", "title": "Heaven on My Mind (film)", "text": "Heaven On My Mind ni filime yomuri Nigeriya 2018 yayobowe inandikwa na Nneka Ojor hamwe na Uche Jombo nk'umwanditsi. \nUmugambi.\nFilime ivugamateka yumusore witwa Ben Peters wafashubukwe nkubuzima bwubucuruzi kugeza ahuye numukinowe mwiza witwa Ijuru. "}
{"id": "20683", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20683", "title": "Head Over Bills", "text": "Head Over Bills ni filime y\u2019urukundo yomuri Nijeriya 2022 yerekanubuzima bwabashikibacu batatu n\u2019urugamba rwa nyina. Yakozwe na Dabby Chimere, muriyi filime hagaragaramo Shaffy Bello, Adesua Etomi, Uzor Arukwe, Racheal Okonkwo n'abandi. \nUmugambi.\nIyi filime ifite amasaha 2 n'iminota 30, ivuga imibereho ya bashikibacu batatu ndetse n'imirwano n'ububabare bya nyina wabo wenyine, wahuye n'ibibazo byinshi byo guha abakobwa be ubuzima bukwiye, ariko bafata amahirwe nk'ubusa. Muri ibyo byose, nyina yabasabye guhindura inzira zabo no kuba abantu beza cyangwa guhura n'ingaruka zikomeye. Mugukurikirana izi mpinduka, bashiki bacu bemera indangagaciro nshya, bagashaka urukundo, bakabura, amaherezo bakisubiraho ubwabo. "}
{"id": "20684", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20684", "title": "The Rise of Igbinogun", "text": "The Rise of Igbinogun ni filime y'ibikorwa yomuri Nijeriya 2021 yanditswe kandi iyobowe na Innocent Ideh kandi ifatanije na Tunde Aina na Innocent Chukwuma\u00a0Ideh. Muriyi filime hagaragaramo Shaffy Bello, Ishami rya Femi, Blossom Chukwujekwu, Ego Nwosu, Akin Lewis, Damilare Kuku, Tina Mba, na Enyinna Nwigwe. \nInyandiko.\n\"The Rise of Igbinogun\" ninkuru yumurwanyi wumukobwa ukiri muto ushaka gufunga amacakubiri abaho hagati yabatunzi nabatindi muri societe. Yiba abakire kugirango yite ku bakene. Ashakishwa n'abarinzi b'umwami, abakire, harimo na se, ariko yabayemesiya w'abatishoboye n'abakene. \nPremiere.\nIyi filime yerekanwe bwambere kugiticye mubinyamakuru, abakozi bazwi cyane ba Nollywood ndetse banenga firime muri Sky cinemas Sangotedo, muri Leta ya Lagos ku ya 15 Werurwe 2022 ku bufatanye na StarTimes. Nyuma yiminsi itatu, film yerekanwe muri sinema hirya no hino. "}
{"id": "20685", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20685", "title": "Rift (2019 film)", "text": "Rift ni filime yomuri Nigeriya ya 2019 iyobowe na Biodun Stephen yakozwe na Elizabeth Uhuegbu. \nUmugambi.\nFilime ivuginkuru yukuntu abashakanye babanye nezakugeza umugabo atangiye kwitandukanya numugore. Umugore yumvise umugabowe amushuka nuko ahitamo kumwiyegereza ariko biba iby'ubusa. Undimugabo yaje ku ishusho y'umugore, biganisha ku bibazo byinshi. "}
{"id": "20686", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20686", "title": "This Very Christmas", "text": "This Very Christmas nifilime yinkinamico ya Noheri yakiniwe muri Nigeriya mu mwaka wa 2024 iyobowe na John Osemeke, yanditswe na Eze Ogechi Patience. Irimo Patience Ozokwor, Uchechi Treasure Okonkwo, Chinaza Victoria Eze, Toosweet Annan, Fidelis Ogbonnaya, Victoria Eze, Prince Nebo, na Loveday Daniel.\nAbahoze bahanganye mwishuri Kathie na Biancay bongera guhurira munzu imwe mu biruhuko, bizeye Noheri y'umuryango ususurutse kandi wishimye. Filime yasohowe na African Magic ku ya 20 Ukuboza 2024.\nInyandiko.\n\"This Very Christmas\" ishingiye inkuru ya Kathie na Bianca, abakobwa bahoze bigana ndetse nabahanganye kuva kera, bahuriye mu buryo butunguranye kwa nyirakuru mugihe cyibiruhuko. Twizeye ko ari kuri Noheri ituje kandi bishimye, abo bagore bombi ahubwo bagirana n\u2019amakimbirane yo kuva kera. Mugihe amabanga yumuryango agaragaye no guhangana namarangamutima bigenda bigaragara, umwuka wibirori utanga inzira yamakimbirane no guhishurwa. Mugihe cy'imvururu, abo bagore bombi bavumbuye umubano utunguranye ubahuza muburyo bugoye kandi buvuye kumutima, bahakana imyumvire yabo kandi batanga amahirwe yo kwiyunga.\nUkoyakozwe.\niyiFilime yayobowe na John Osemeke inandikwa kubufatanye na Eze Ogechi Patience. Yakozwe na Chijioke Okonkwo munsi yasosiyete ye, BoldLine Entertainment. Umuziki wumwimerere wahimbwe na Uchechi Treasure. \nAmafoto nyamukuru yabaye mwi tangiriro ryu mwaka wa 2024. \nKurekura no kwakira.\nIyifilime yasohokeye kuri Magic Magic kuya 20 Ukuboza \nPleasure Okezie woku kinyamakuru \"Daily Times cyo muri Nijeriya\" yasobanuye ko \"This Very Christmas\" ari nziza yo mubiruko y'ibiruhuko, akerekana koari byiza gukina amakinamico, urwenya, nibihe by'amarangamutima. Mu gihe yabonaga kibintu bimwe na bimwe byasaga naho byavuzwe mbere, yashimye ubujyakuzimu bwa filime ndetse nimikorere ikomeye, cyane cyane agaragaza Patience Ozokwor, Ubutunzi bwa Uchechi Okonkwo, na Eze Victoria Chinaza. Okezie yahaye film amanota ane kuri batanu. \nUmwamikazi Onuoha yandikira \"ikinyamakuru The Guardian\", yashimye amashusho yiyi filime, avuga koari \"ibintu bikaze, amarangamutima, kandi byuzuyemo ibihe byabereye hafi yurugo.\" Yavuze ko igitandukanya \"This Very Christmas\" ari ubushobozi bwayo bwo guhuza ikinamico no gusetsa no kugira ubwuzu, bigatuma habaho uburambe bwo kureba. "}
{"id": "20687", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20687", "title": "Two Brides and a Baby", "text": "Two Brides and a Baby ni filime y\u2019inkinamico y\u2019urukundo yomuri Nijeriya yakizwe muri 2011 iyobowe na Teco Benson ikinwamo na Keira Hewatch, Kalu Ikeagwu, OC Ukeje, Chelsea Eze, Stella Damasus-Aboderin na Okey Uzoeshi. Yerekanwe bwa mbereku ya 17 [Yakiriye ibihembo ina hitwamo muri, and \nUmugambi.\nKeche (Keira Hewatch) na Bankole (OC Ukeje) bemeza ko umubano wabo wateguwe n'Imana. Barateganya gukora ibirori byubukwe butangaje kandi babizera ko gushyingiranwa kwabo ibazagerwaho mugihe. Ibintu bitunguranye biramenyekana bipima uburyo bafite ubushake bwo kwigomwa kugirango ubumwe bwabo bukore imyitozo.\nKwakira.\nIyifilime ifite amanota agera kuri 43% kuri Nollywood Reinvented ku mwanzuro ugira uti \"... ni filime yuzuye, ntabwo igenda mu buryo ubwo aribwo bwose. Icyakora, iyourebye kurufatiro runaka rwibyo twizeye mu bicuruzwa bya Nollywood noneho bituma firime ishimisha cyane.\" YNaija yashimye iyi filime maze asoza avugako \"filime [ishimwa] kuruta gukundwa. Irerekana ko namaboko y'iburyo, Nollywood ishobora gukora filime nziza, kandi iyi ni filime nziza rwose.\" Cyakora cyagaragaje imikorere yoruba ya Deji (Kalu Ikeagwu) nkibibi byonyine murifilm. Amarachukwu Iwuala wa \"Entertainment Express\" yanenze cyane kuyobora kandi yumva kotitaweho neza kubintu byinshi byingenzi bya firime. Dami Elebe wo muri \"Connect Nigeriya\" yashimye umugambi, gukina n\u2019umusaruro ariko yumva ko gutunganya no kuyobora byari bikwiye kuba byiza. "}
{"id": "20688", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20688", "title": "Don't Get Mad Get Even", "text": "Don't Get Mad Get Even ni firime ya Nigeriya ya 2019 yakozwe na Raphael Dedenuola kandi iyobowe na Wale Ojo. Yasohowe na RGD Media ikwirakwizwa na Silverbird Film Ikwirakwizwa. Filime yerekanitandukaniroririhagati yuburezi nubutunzi. Irimo Femi Jacobs, Yemi Solade, Deyemi Okanlawon, Kenneth Okolie, Toyin Abraham, Patience Ozokwor na Jide Kosoko. \nInyandiko.\nInkuru ikurikira abavandimwe babiri: umwe yize, undatize ariko arema. Umugambi uhindagurika iyo mukuru wawe, umwarimu, yagiye gucika kandi agomba guterwa na murumuna we, wabaye umucuranzi watsinze. \nPremiere.\nIyi filime yerekanwe bwambere muri Nijeriya na Gana ku ya 4 Ukwakira 2019. "}
{"id": "20689", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20689", "title": "Domitilla (film)", "text": "Domitilla ni filime yomuri Nijeriya yomu 1996 yakinwe na Anne Njemanze, Sandra Achums, Ada Ameh, na Kate Henshaw ivuga kumukobwa ukirimuto uharanira kwibeshaho nk'indaya ya Lagos. Urukurikirane, \"Domitilla 2\", rwasohotse mu 1999, naho remake isohoka mu 2023.\nUmugambi.\nUmunyamabanga w\u2019ibiro Ngozi ukwezi kumurika nkindaya nijoro munsi ya alias Domitilla, hamwe nabagenzi be Jenny, Anita, na Judith. Amafaranga yinjiza ntabwo yishyura amafaranga yo kubaho ndetse na fagitire ya se itemewe. Nyuma y\u2019urukundo rwe, John, ahamagarira umwanya mubucuti bwabo bumaze gukura amaze kumenya ubuzima bwe bubiri, Domitilla yitabira igiterane cyabantu benshi hamwe nabagenzi be aho ahurira numunyapolitiki ukize Lawson, wamugiriye neza. Icyakora, isi ye irahindukira iyumunyapolitiki basanze yapfiriye mucyumba cyabocya hoteri nyuma yijororyo kumukinisha, ibimenyetso byose bikaba byerekeza ku cyerekezo cya Domitilla."}
{"id": "20690", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20690", "title": "The Mayors", "text": "The Mayors ni filime y\u2019inkinamico yakozwe muri 2004 yomuri Nijeriya yanditswe, inakorwa kandi iyobowe na Dickson Iroegbu, ikinwamo na Richard Mofe-Damijo, Sam Dede, Segun Arinze na Mike Ezuruonye. Iyi filime yatsindiye ibihembo 5 kunshuro ya mbere yibihembo bya Afurika Movie Academy Awards mu 2005, harimo ibihembo byIshusho \"Nziza\", \"Amashusho meza\", \"Umuyobozi mwiza\", \"Umukinnyi witwaye neza mu bakinnyi bakomeye\" ndetse \"n\u2019umukinnyi witwaye neza\". "}
{"id": "20691", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20691", "title": "Dr. Mekam", "text": "Dr. Mekam ni filime ya Nollywood 2018 iyobowe na Ike Nnaebue, afatanyije na Oby Olebara Uzoukwu na Phil Erabie. \nUmugambi.\nInkuru niy'Umuganga witwa Dr. Mekam ugaruka murugo avuyehanze nyuma yumurimo wa muganga. Agaruka muri Nijeriya kuba perezida ariko nyuma amenyako inzira yokuba perezida atariyo yoroshye. \nAbakinnyi.\nUrutonde rw'abakinnyi "}
{"id": "20692", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20692", "title": "GriGris", "text": "GriGris ni filime y\u2019inkinamico yabafaransa na nya Tchad yakozwe muri 2013 yayobowe na Mahamat Saleh Haroun, yakinwe na Soul\u00e9mane D\u00e9m\u00e9, Mariam Monory, Cyril Guei na Marius Yelolo. umusore wimyaka 25 ufite ukuguru kwamugaye arota kuba umubyinnyi, agatangira gukorera agatsiko gakora magendu ya peteroli. Iyifilime yakozwe binyuze muri Pili Films kunkunga ifatanije na Chadian Go\u00ef Go\u00ef Productions. Yakiriye kandi inkunga ya Canal +, Cin\u00e9 +, TV5Monde, Canal Horizons na CNC. Gufata amashusho byatangiye ku ya 29 Ukwakira 2012. \nIyifilime yahiswemo muri Palme d'Or mw iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 2013 kandi yegukana igihembo cya Vulcan. Filime yatoranijwe nkuwinjira muri Tchad muri Filime Nziza Yindimi Zamahanga mu bihembo bya 86 bya Academy, ariko ntiyatowe. Iyifilime kandi yerekanwe mw' iserukiramuco rya Filime rya 36 rya Denver. [\"isoko yizewe?\"]"}
{"id": "20693", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20693", "title": "The Great White Man of Lambar\u00e9n\u00e9", "text": "The Great White Man of Lambar\u00e9n\u00e9(Le grand blanc de Lambar\u00e9n\u00e9) ni biopic ya Albert Schweitzer yakozwe muri 1995 ikorwa n'umukinnyi wa filime womuri Kameruni Bassek Ba Kobhio. Iyifilime yakorewe ku bitaro bya Schweitzer i Lambar\u00e9n\u00e9 ku ruzi rwa Ogoou\u00e9 muri Gabon, yitabiriwe cyane nk\u2019abakoloni bongeye kubazwa umugani wa Schweitzer. "}
{"id": "20694", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20694", "title": "Divorce Not Allowed", "text": "Divorce Not Allowed ni comedi y'urukundo yomuri Nigeriya 2018 yakozwe inayoborwa na Mike Ezuruonye. 2]\u200b \u200b\u200biyi filime ikemura ibibazo byumubano hagati yabashakanye \nInyandiko.\nFilime yibanda kubibazo byugarije abashakanye nuburyo ibisubizo byabo rimwe na rimwe biganisha kugutandukana. Filime ivuga amashusho binyuze mubasore batatu bubatse bahura nibibazo mububano bwabo bigatuma bifuza ko batazigera bubakana. Ntabwo bashizamanga bihagije kugirango batandukane, ahubwobakoreshubundi buryo bushobora kubabohora mubucakara. \nPremiere.\nIyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere muri Nijeriya nyuma izakwerekanwa bwambere muri Boleyn Cinemas, Umuhanda wa Barking, London, mu Bwongereza ku ya 23 Kamena 2018. "}
{"id": "20695", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20695", "title": "The Great Bazaar", "text": "The Great Bazaar ni film yinkinamico yakozwe mumwaka wa 2006 yanditswe kandi iyoborwa na Lic\u00ednio Azevedo. ivuga kunkuru yabahungu babiri bahurira kwisoko nyafurika. "}
{"id": "20696", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20696", "title": "Dinner (film)", "text": "Dinner ni firime yogusetsa yomuri Nigeriya 2016 ivugakubyerekeye urukundo, guhemukira no kubabarirana. Yakozwe na Jay Franklyn Jituboh na Chris Odeh. Umuyobozi mukuru wa firime ni David Jituboh. Yasohotse ku ya 11 Ugushyingo 2016 ikerekanwa bwa mbere muri Sinema ya IMAX i Lekki. Minisitiri \"w\u2019intebe\" yatewe inkunga na Amstel Malta yitabiriwe n\u2019ibyamamare mu nganda za sinema. Filime yakiriwe nabi, nubwo ibikorwa byayo byashimiwe. \nUmugambi.\nAdetunde George Jnr yatumiye inshutiye y'igituza, Mike Okafor ahoyarari kugirango amarane weekend hamwe n'umukunzi we Lola Coker babana na we gutegura gahunda y'ubukwe bwabo. Mike Okafor yazanye kandi n'umukunziwe Diane Bassey kumusaba. Ibintu byagiye mu majyepfo iyo amabanga yerekeye umubano wabo amenyekanye. "}
{"id": "20697", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20697", "title": "Golden Horseshoes", "text": "Ifarashi ya Zahabu ni filime yinkinamico yakozwe mu mwaka wi 1989 yomuri Tuniziya yayobowe na Nouri Bouzid. Yerekanwe mugice cya Un Certain Regard mw' iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 1989. \nUmugambi.\nYoussef Soltane, wimyaka 45 umunyabwenge wo muri Tuniziya, ni umusaruro w'igisekuru cyabayeho mu bihe bya euphoria n'ibitekerezo bikomeye muri za mirongo itandatu, no gutsindwa kwabo. Yarafunzwe kandi yicwa urubozo azira ibitekerezo bya politiki. Byongeye kandi, umubano we na Zineb, burugumesitiri ukirimuto, mwiza, bimuzanira ibibazo byinshi. Mwijoro rimwe rirerire, Youssef azerera ashakisha ahantu amarangamutima amuyobora, ahiga ibibazo byose bimwibuka."}
{"id": "20698", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20698", "title": "Diary of a Lagos Girl", "text": "Diary of a Lagos Girl ni film ya Nollywood 2016. Filime ivuga amateka yumukobwa wa Lagos ushakisha Mr. Right - umugabo ufite ibintubyose bimugendekera. "}
{"id": "20699", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20699", "title": "Diamonds in the Sky", "text": "Diamonds in the Sky ni film yikinamico yomuri Nigeriya 2018 iyobowe na Kunle Afolayan kandi yakozwe na Femi Adebayo. Muriyi filime hagaragaramo Femi Adebayo, Omowumi Dada, na Joke Silva hamwe na Ali Nuhu, Bolaji Oba, na Toyin Abraham mu nshingano zabo. Filime ivuga amatekayimiryango itatu irwanana kanseri yibasiye ubuzima bwabo. \nIyi filime yakiriweneza cyane n'abayinenga kandi yerekanwa ku isi yose. Filime yatorewe ibihembo 11 byiza bya Nollywood Awards harimo Umukinnyi mwiza munshingano zunganira, Umukinnyi mwiza (Icyongereza) n\u2019umuyobozi mwiza. "}
{"id": "20700", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20700", "title": "Golden Butterfly (film)", "text": "Golden Butterfly nifilime yinkinamico yo muri Tuniziya yakozwe muri 2021 iyobowe na Abdelhamid Bouchnak. Yatoranijwemuri Filime Nziza Mpuzamahanga Yerekana ibihembo muri 94 ibihembo bya Academy. "}
{"id": "20701", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20701", "title": "Devil in the Detail (film)", "text": "Devil in the Detail ni filime yomuri Gana yomuri 2014 - Nigeriya yerekana urukundo rwa Nigeriya iyobowe na Shirley Frimpong-Manso yakinnywe na Nse Ikpe Etim na Adjetey Anang. \nYerekanwe bwa mbere muri Sinema ya Silverbird, i Accra, muri Gana, ku ya 14 Gashyantare \nUmugambi.\nBafite byose mubuzimabwabo; amafaranga, icyamamare n'ibyishimo. Barabashakanyebeza ariko ibyifuzo byabobyo gukora imibonano mpuzabitsina no kuryamana nabandi byangije byose."}
{"id": "20702", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20702", "title": "Devil in Agbada", "text": "Devil in Agbada ni filime yogukina yomuri Nigeriya 2021 yanditswe kandikorwa na Chinneylove Eze iyobowe na Umanu Eliya. Muri filime hagaragaramo Erica Nlewedim, Linda Osifo, na Efe Irele. [iyi filime muri Werurwe 2021. Filime ihumekwa cyane nibintu bya Hollywood. \nAbakinnyi.\nShina Ogunjumelo nka Baba Alawo\nUmugambi.\nAbakobwa batatu bakiribato, Irene, Okikiola, na Tomi, bafatanya kugera kubutumwa bwo kumanura Otunda Shonibare umunyapolitiki utagira impuhwe. Inshingano zirimo gucengera mu nzu ye irinzwe cyane kandi itambuka. "}
{"id": "20703", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20703", "title": "The Girl from Carthage", "text": "The Girl from Carthage (izwi kurindi izina rya La fille de Carthage) ni filime yakorewe muri Tuniziya yomuwi 1924 yanditswe na Hayd\u00e9e Tamzali iyoborwa na Albert Samama Chikly. Iyifilime yahimbwe na Mark Smythe. Muriyi filime hagaragaramo Hayde Chikly, Ahmed Dziri, Abdelgassen Ben Taleb na Hadj Hadi Dehali mubakinnyi bingenzi. "}
