{"id": "20705", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20705", "title": "Detour (2021 film)", "text": "Detour ni filime yomuri 2021 yomuri Nijeriya yanditswe kandi iyobowe na Jide Okeke ikanakorwa na Jumafor Ajogwu inyujijwe muri sosiyete ya Afribold Capital Iyi filime yanditswe mu 2010 ikorwa nyuma yimyaka icumi. Osunde, Kanayo O. Kanayo, na Olumide Oworo, n'abandi. \nInyandiko.\nFilime izenguruka umunyamakuru n'umunyamuryango wa corps bahuye kubwimpanuka bagaragaza umugambimubisha. \nPremiere.\nFilime yasohotse muri Sinema mugihuguhose ku ya 12 Ugushyingo "}
{"id": "20706", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20706", "title": "Hand of Fate (film)", "text": "Hand of Fate nifilm ypmuri Gambiya yakozwe muri 2013 yibanda kubibazo byuburenganzira bwa muntu.ivuga kubyerekeranye nabakobwa bangavu bakoresha ubukwe nababyeyi babo batabanje kubiherwa uruhushya cyangwa ubumenyi ndetse nuburyo imyigire yabo nabatwara ejo hazaza bigira ingaruka munzira. Abana n\u2019umuganda ushinzwe iterambere ku bufatanye na Mandingmorry Foundation for Performing Arts (MANFOPA) yatumye iyi filime ishoboka. \nIyifilime yari ishingiye kugitabo cyo mu mwaka wa 2009 cyanditswe numwanditsi winkinamico womuri Gambiya akaba numuyobozi winkinamico Janet Badjan Young. Ibrahim Ceesay yakoze kandi ayobora film. \nUmugambi.\nFilime ivuga umukobwa ukiri muto wavukijwe ejo hazaza mu igihe yahatiwe gushaka umugabo adakunda. \nIbihembo.\n\"Hand of Faith ni film\" yatsindiye kuba ari filime nziza kavukire muri Nolloywood na African Film Critics Awards (Oscars nyafurika) yabereye i Washington, DC, ku ya 14 Nzeri 2013. "}
{"id": "20707", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20707", "title": "Dear Bayo", "text": "Dear Bayo ni filime yikinamico yomuri Nigeriya ya 2020 yanditswe kandi iyobowe na Imoh Umoren. Muriyi filime hagaragaramo Chimezie Imo na Tunbosun Aiyedehin mubakinnyi ba mbere mu gihe iyi filime yaranze umushinga wa gatanu w\u2019ubuyobozi bwa Imoh Umoren. Filime yafatiwe ahanini muri Delta ya Filime yasohotse ku ya 31 Mutarama 2020 ifungura ibitekerezo byiza.\nInyandiko.\nIyinkuru ikurikira urukundo hagati yumusore Bayo ukinuruhare rwicyubahiro na Ebipade, umukobwa wicisha bugufi. Bombi bakomoka mu kwicisha bugufi kandi bakubitwa ariko bagomba gutsinda inzitizi mubuzima bwabo bwite kugirango babane ibihe byose."}
{"id": "20708", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20708", "title": "Harga (film)", "text": "Harga (izwi nka \"La Br\u00fblure\") ni film mbarankuru yomuri 2010. \nIyifilime yerekanwe mw' iserukiramuco rya Filime zo kwisi ryabereye i Montreal mumwaka wa 2010 nomuri Festival de la Citoyennet\u00e9 muri Tuniziya muri 2011. \nInyandiko.\nHichem yarose \"harga\" kuvakiri umwana. Umunsi umwe, yerekeje kunyanja yerekeza i Burayi, murugendo rukomeye rwabujijwe mubwato bubi hamwe nabandi Banyatuniziya 27, bamwe muribo bakaba bari inshuti ze. Hichem niwewenyine wagarutse. Abandi bomuri Tuniziya batubwira impamvu bashaka kuva mu gihugu cyabo: Ubukene, ubushomeri, nta byiringiro by'ejo hazaza, baguye mu mutego wapfuye. Biteguye gukora ikintu icyo ari cyo cyose kugira ngo imibereho yabo irusheho kuba myiza, kandi ibyo bikubiyemo gushyira ubuzima bwabo mu kaga."}
{"id": "20709", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20709", "title": "Dead Serious (film)", "text": "Dead Serious ni 2024 Showmax yumwimerere yo gusetsa y\u2019urukundo yo muri Nigeriya, yasohotse ku ya 23 Gashyantare 2024.Yayobowe na Moses Inwang, ikorwa na David Rukeme. Irimo Sharon Ooja, Emmanuel Chukwuemeka Ejekwu, Nkem Owoh, Lilian Afegbai, Deyemi Okanlawon, Albert Oluwatoyin, Funky Mallam, Emem Inwang, Ryonne Razaq, na Lawal Nasiru. \nInyandiko.\nUmutimubabaye nyumayo gutakaza urukundo rwubuzimabwe, umusore akora urukurikirane rwo kugerageza kunanirwa kwiyahura. Iyi firime yerekana igitambo umuntuyiteguye kwishyura kubwurukundo.\nUmusaruro.\nYabonye.\nKu ya 10 Gashyantare 2024, umunyamakuru wa filime muri Nollywood, Matilda Adegbola, agira ati: \"Showmax yari yarabonye iyi filime\", nyumay\u2019inyandiko yakozwe n\u2019umuyobozi wa firime Moses Inwang kuri Instagram yerekanako iyi filime iteganijwe kuri sinema noneho izabari Umwimerere wa Showmax. Ku ya 14 Gashyantare 2024, filime yari iteganijwe gutangira kuri Showmax. \nPremiere no kurekura.\nKu ya 22 Mutarama 2024, trailer yemewe yasohotse hamwe numurongo wa Sharon Ooja, Sabinus, Nkem Owoh, Lilian Afegbai, Deyemi Okanlawon, Umukobwa Warri, Funky Mallam, Emem Inwang na Ryonne Razaq. Iyi filime yariteganijwe gutangira ku ya, muri sinema mugihugu hose. Ku ya 9 Gashyantare 2024, Dead Serious yerekanwe bwambere ubwoyatangizaga ku mugaragaro Showmax 2.0. 16 Gashyantare 2024, showmax yashyize ahagaragara amashushoyayo ya filime, maze iboneka ku ya 23 Gashyantare 2024."}
{"id": "20710", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20710", "title": "Heart of the Lion", "text": "Heart of the Lion (French) ni film ya Burkinab\u00e9 yakozwe 2008.\nInyandiko.\nIntare itera amatungo. Abantu benshi bagatangira kubirwa irengero. Abona umutware wumudugudu ntacyo akora, umwungeri ukirimuto, Samba, yahisemo gukurikira iyo intare wenyine. Ariko ntabwo umuntu uwoari we wese ashobora guhiga intare. Nubwo yarafite ubutwari, intare hafi kumwica. Kubwamahirwe, umuhigi ukiri muto aritambika yica inyamaswa. Ubuzima bwa Samba bwarakijijwe, ariko ntabwo ari icyubahiro cye. Arashaka gusubiza umugani w'intare mu mudugudu, ariko Tanko ntazamwemerera. Igikombe ni icye. Intare yarapfuye, nyamara abantu bakomeza kubura."}
{"id": "20711", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20711", "title": "The Heart's Cry", "text": "The Heart's Cry (French) ni filime yinkinamico ya Burkinab\u00e9 / Igifaransa yakozwe muri 1994 iyobowe na Idrissa Ouedraogo.\nUmugambi.\nMoctar aba ari umuhungu muto, wavukiye mu Bufaransa, agakurira muri Mali. Afite imyaka cumi n'umwe, yimukana n'umuryango wekuba muri Paris. Moctar irwana no kumenyera ubuzima mubufaransa, kandi irakumbuye Afrika. Atangira kubona iyerekwa ry'impyisi mumuhanda. Iyo abwiye abantu, ntamuntu numwe umwizera. Arasetsa nabanyeshuri bigana hanyuma yoherezwa psychologue wishuri. Yahuye numugabo mumuhanda witwa Paulo ufasha Moctar kumva ibyo yeretswe. \nKwakira.\nYatsindiye igihembo cya OCIC - inavugwa mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Venice 1994."}
{"id": "20712", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20712", "title": "Dead Expensive", "text": "Dead Expensive ni filime yogusetsa yomuri Nijeriya 2021 yakozwe na Isioma Muller ikayoborwa na Aniedi Awah Noba.]\u200b\u200b iyi firime irwanya imigenzo yakera y'Abanyafurika mukwizihiza abapfuye \nInyandiko.\nNyuma y'urupfu rw'umukire, abana be bagombaga kurwana n'umuryango wihishe inyuma y'imigenzo gakondo ya gakondo yo muri Afurika yo kugabana umutungo no kwita ku bapfuye bigatuma ubuzima butihanganira abazima. \nPremiere.\nIyi filime yerekanwe bwambere muri Hoteli ya Oriental, i Lagos kucyumweru, tariki ya 9 Gicurasi 2021, mbereyukwisohoka muri sinema mu gihugu hose ku ya 14 Gicurasi.Iyerekanwa rya mbere ryiboneye ibyamamare nka Ime Bishop (Okon Lagos), Melvin Oduah, Bolaji Ogunmola, Bryan Okwara, Mawuli Gavor, Djinee na Juliet Ibrahim. "}
{"id": "20713", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20713", "title": "Daughters of Chibok", "text": "Daughters of Chibok ni film ngufi yiminota 11 yomuri Nigeriya. Inyandiko yerekana ukuri ivuga amateka ya Yana Galang, umukobwa we, Rifkatu, yari mu bakobwa 276 bashimuswe na Boko Haram muri Mata 2014 avuye mu icumbi ry\u2019ishuri ryabo i Chibok, mu majyaruguru y\u2019amajyaruguru ya Nijeriya. Filime yakozwe murwego rwokwibuka isabukuru yimyaka itanu abakobwa ba Chibok bashimuswe. \nIbihembo.\nInyandiko yatsindiye \"Inkuru nziza ya VR\" mw'Iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Venice 2019. "}
{"id": "20714", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20714", "title": "Hidden Dreams", "text": "Hidden Dreams (French) ni filime yinkinamico yo muri Kameruni yo muri 2021 yayobowe na Ngang Romanus. Yatoranijwe muri Kameruni muri Filime Nziza Mpuzamahanga nziza muri 94 Awards Academy. "}
{"id": "20715", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20715", "title": "Hollow City (film)", "text": "Hollow City (\"Na Cidade Vazia\") (2004) ni filime ya mbere yuzuye yuzuye iyobowe n\u2019umuyobozi wavukiye muri Angola, Maria Jo\u00e3o Ganga. Iyifilime niimwe muzakozwe mbere muri Angola kuva intambara y'abenegihugu irangira, ndetse nafilime yambere yakozwe numugore wo muri Angola. Gufata amashusho byakorewe ahitwa Luanda, muri Angola. Impapuro mpuzamahanga za firime ziri mururimi rwigiportigale hamwe nicyongereza. \nUmugambi.\nIyifilime yibanze kubuzima bwimfubyi yitwa N'dala, bajyanwa mumujyi wa Luanda nyuma yurupfu rwababyeyi bemu ntambara yabenegihugu ya Angola. Ushaka gusubira mumujyi yavukiyemo wa Bi\u00e9, N'dala ahunga ababikira akajya mihanda yomumujyi. Azerera ahantu hamwe ahura nabantu batandukanye, nkumusore witwa Z\u00e9 ugerageza kumufasha kubona inzu. Nyuma mur firime N'dala ajyanwa munsi yibaba ryumugizi wanabi witwa Joka umukoresha wenyine."}
{"id": "20716", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20716", "title": "Mr. and Mrs. (2012 film)", "text": "Mr. and Mrs nifilime y\u2019ibkinamico y\u2019urukundo yomuri Nijeriya yakozwe muri 2012 yanditswe kandi ikorwa na Chinwe Egwuagu ikayoborwa na Ikechukwu Onyeka, yakinwe na Nse Ikpe Etim, Joseph Benjamin, Barbara Soky, Thelma Okoduwa na Paul Apel.\nItangazamakuru ryo murugo.\nIyifilime yasohokeye kuri DVD kuya 20 Kanama 2012. Nkuko Chinwe abitangaza ngoimikorere ya \"Mr. and Mrs.\" yashimiwe mumakinamico kandi yakiriye ibyifuzo byinshi bijyanye nogusohora DVD, bityo atekereza ko igihe gikwiye cyo gusohora DVD. Iyi filime yasohotse bwambere muri Gana icyumweru kimwe mbere yuko DVD isohoka kumugaragaro yakiriwe neza, hamwe n\u2019igurishwa ryishimiwe muri Gold Coast muri icyo cyumweru "}
{"id": "20717", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20717", "title": "Bawina", "text": "Bawina nifilm ngufi yabanya Togoliya yayobowe na Minza Bataba. isohoka muwi 1988 imara iminota 27. iyiFilime yibanze kurenjeniyeri mumudugudu mucyaro. "}
{"id": "20718", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20718", "title": "Rising Moon", "text": "Rising Moon ni film yikinamico yomuri Nigeriya 2005 iyobowe na Andy Nwakalor ikinwamo Onyeka Onwenu. Iyi filime yakiriye nomination 12 kandi yatsindiye ibihembo 6 muri Afrika Movie Academy Awards mu 2006, harimo ibihembo byamashushomeza, Ingarukanziza zerekanwa ndetse nogutunganya neza. \nInyandiko.\nUlomma (Onyeka Onwenu) yashakanye na Obasi (Justus Esiri). Kuberako Ulomma amazigihe kinini adashoborkubyara, ahura nogushinyagurirwa nogutukwa, bigatuma umuryango uzana umugore mushya wa Obasi. Hagati yiyi kinamico yumuryango, umutambyi mukuru wumudugudu arapfa. Ashaka ubuyobozi bwo mu mwuka, Ulomma ahindukirira umupadiri gatolika wera kandi asengera umwana, arahira ko umwana azakorera Yesu aramutse asubijwe. Hagati aho, Obasi yasuye urusengero gakondo rw'umudugudu kandi asezeranya ko umwana we azitangira iyo mana niba isengesho rye ryemewe. Amaherezo, Ulomma aratwita akabyara umuhungu, biganisha ku makimbirane hagati y'ababyeyi basezeranyijeko umwanawabo azubaha imana zitandukanye.\nReba.\nArthur Brooks numuhanga mubitangazamakuru, producer wa firime wa Nigeriya, umukinnyi uba muri Nigeriya"}
{"id": "20719", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20719", "title": "Bamunan", "text": "Bamunan nifilime yo mu bwoko bwinkinamico yo muwi 1990 iyobowe na Falaba Issa Traor\u00e9.\nInyandiko.\nmubuzima bwa buri munsi mumudugudu wa Mali mucyaro: gusarura, kwivanga, imikino yabana, ubukwe, ubujura, no gutabara kwa polisi. Imicihuza aya mashusho yose numubembe wasuzuguwe numudugudu wose, arakira agasubira mumujyi kandi yishimiye kugaruka mubantu be."}
{"id": "20720", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20720", "title": "Fugitive (2019 film)", "text": "Fugitive ni film yomuri Nigeriya 2019. Yayobowe kandikorwa na Andy Boyo. \"Uwahunze\" yari yibanze kumupolisi ushinjwa kwica umunyamakuru w\u2019iperereza. \nUmugambi.\nFilime ibera muri Reta zunzubumwe za Amerika, ahwibihugu bitandukanye by'Afrika byahurije hamwe mugihugu kimwe. Umupolisi aregwa kuba yarishe umunyamakuru w\u2019iperereza na syndicat. Filime iragaragaza kandi ingarukambi z\u2019abanyamahanga kandikanasesengura insanganyamatsiko ya ruswa. \nAbakinnyi.\nAbakinnyi ba filime barimo Kate Henshaw, Daniel K. Daniel, Keppy Ekpenyong, Frederick Leonard, ndetse n'abakinnyi baturutse muri Zambiya no mu Rwanda. "}
{"id": "20721", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20721", "title": "Fuelling Poverty", "text": "Fueling Poverty ni documentaire yomuri Nigeriya 2012 yakozwe na Ishaya Bako ivugibikorwa byumutwe wa Occupy Nigeriya igiheyarigeze kundunduro mu ntangiriro za Yatsindiye igihembo \"cyiza cya Documentaire\" mu bihembo bya 9 bya Afurika Movie Academy. \nKugenzura.\nGuverinoma ya Nijeriya ibinyujije mukigo cy\u2019igihugu gishinzwe kugenzura amafilime n\u2019amashusho (NFVCB) yabujije iyo videwo mu imurikagurisha rusange ivuga ko \"... ibikubiye muri iyi filime ari ubushotoranyi bukabije kandi bikaba bishobora guteza cyangwa gushishikariza imvururu rusange no guhungabanya umutekano w\u2019igihugu.\" Abatunganya iyi documentaire babinyujije mu munyamategeko wa NFVCB nabo \"\" bagiriwinama ikomeye yokudakwirakwiza cyangwa kwerekana firime ya documentaire. Inzegozose z\u2019umutekano z\u2019igihugu zibishinzwe ziri maso... \". "}
{"id": "20722", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20722", "title": "The Fruitless Tree", "text": "Igiti cyera imbuto (\"L'arbre sans fruit\") nifilime yerekana inyandiko ebyiri zomuri Nigeriya zanditswe kandi zikayobrwa na A\u00efcha Macky kunshuro yeya mbere. Umushinga washingiye kuti filime mbarirano igendeye kurupfu rwa nyina wumuyobozi wapfuye igihe umuyobozi yarafite imyaka itanu gusa. Iyifilime yegukanye igihembo cya Afurika Movie Academy igihembo cya Documentaire nziza mu bihembo bya 12 bya Afurika Movie Academy Awards muri 2016. \nInyandiko.\nUmuyobozi wumugore wubatse ariko udafite abana mubuzima busanzwe,yaje guhura nikibazo cyubugumba kikaba gihangayikishije muriNigeriya. aganiriza icyegeranyo cyinkuru zerekeye abagore nabagabo banze kwipimisha. "}
{"id": "20723", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20723", "title": "Foreign Body (2016 film)", "text": "Foreign Body nifilime yo mubwoko bwikinamico yomuri Tuniziya yakozwe muri 2016 iyobowe kandi yanditswe na Raja Amari.\nUmugambi.\niyifilimw ivuga kunkuru yumukobwa ukirimuto yatorotse murugo rwerwo muri Tuniziya maze kwimukira mu Bufaransa muburyo butemewe namategeko. Abona umunezero kandi arwana nurugendo rwe. "}
{"id": "20724", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20724", "title": "The Fool of Kairouan", "text": "The Fool of Kairouan (Icyarabu: \u0645\u062c\u0646\u0648\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0642\u064a\u0631\u0648\u0627\u0646; guhindura: Majnun al-Kairawen; French), yakozwe mumwaka wi 1939, nifilime ya y\u2019umuziki yakorewe muri Tuniziya, nifilime yambere yakozwe mucyarabu ikorewe muri Tuniziya. Yakinwe numuririmbyi Mohamed Jamoussi. Ifatwa nka imwe muri firime zingenzi mumateka yintambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose yasinema muri Afurika y'Amajyaruguru. "}
{"id": "20725", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20725", "title": "Forgetting June", "text": "Forgetting June ni filime yikinamico y\u2019urukundo yomuri Nijeriya 2013 iyobowe na Ikechukwu Onyeka, yakinwe na Majid Michel, Beverly Naya, na Mbong Amata. \nUmugambi.\nEddie na Kamena basangiye ibisa nkubukwe bwiza. Eddie yatangiye gutakaza ubuzima bwe igihe Kamena yagiraga impanuka ikomeye mu rugendo rwo kuva mu mujyi. Murumuna wa Eddie Tony yitabaje inshuti magara ya Kamena, Tobi, kugira ngo afashe Eddie gukira amarangamutima kubera urupfu rw'umugore we. Tobi yaje kwemeza Eddie kwinjira mu itsinda rye ryo kubyina, bituma habaho amarangamutima hagati yabo. Nyumay'amezi atarimacye, Eddie na Tobi bahisemo kurushinga nubwo Tobi yanze ubumwe. Nyuma yimyaka ibiri nyuma yimpanuka yo muri kamena, Tobi atwite umwana wa Eddie mugihe Kamena yatashye asubira murugorwabo rwabashakanye, asobanurukwimpanuka yabaye nuburyo Dr. George yamukijije.\nNyumayoguhangana nubutegetsi butandukanye hagati ya Kamena na Tobi, amaherezo Eddie yahisemo kugumana bombi nkumugore. Nyumayo kugiraninama na bagenzi be ba Eddie, Kamena yahisemo gusubira kwa George, amajyambere y'urukundo yari yaranze mbere.\nKwakira.\nNollywood Reinvented yahaye firime amanota 23% kandi yanenzibiganiro byayobidasanzwe hamwena storyline. Isubiramo ryasojwe rigirariti: \"Ntabwo nzahakana ko nishimiye cyane iyi filime igihe numvaga mbere. Kubera iki? Kubera ko nubwo nzi neza, igice cyanjye kiracyagereranya no kubona mu maso ha Majid Michel ku murongo w'abakinnyi bafite garanti yo kuba indashyikirwa no kwidagadura. Narinibeshye...\" "}
{"id": "20726", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20726", "title": "The Flower of Aleppo", "text": "The Flower of Aleppo ni filime yomu bwokp bwiinkinamico yakorewe muri Tuniziya 2016 yayobowe na Ridha Behi. Muntangiriro yatoranijwe nkuwinjira muri Tuniziya muri Filime Nziza Y\u2019ururimi rw\u2019amahanga mu bihembo bya 89 bya Osama, ariko ibi byahinduwe \"Nkimara gufungura amaso\" na Leyla Bouzid. \nKurekura.\nIyifilime yerekanwe bwambere mumuhango wogutangiza iserukiramuco rya sinema rya 27 rya Carthage kuya 28 Ukwakira 2016, noneho isohoka burigihe mu makinamico yomuri Tuniziya kuya 6 Ugushyingo 2016. "}
{"id": "20727", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20727", "title": "Os Flagelados do Vento Leste", "text": "Os Flagelados do Vento Leste (mugiporutugali bisobanura \"Abahohotewe n'Umuyaga w'Iburasirazuba\") ni igitabo cyasohowe mu 1960 numwanditsi wa Cape Verdean, Manuel Lopes. Hamwe na \"Claridade\", Baltazar Lopes yitabiriye Manuel Lopes na Jorge Barbosa hamwe nabashinze iryosuzumaizina ryari ihuriro mu baharanira inyungu zabo.\nicyigitabo cyahawe igihembo cya \"Meio Mil\u00e9nio do Achamento das Ilhas de Cabo Verde\". Igitabo cyahinduwe murifirime iyobowe na Ant\u00f3nio Faria mu 1987."}
{"id": "20728", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20728", "title": "The Fisherman's Diary", "text": "The Fisherman's Diary ni filime yo mubwoko bwikinamico yo muri Kameruni yakozwe muri 2020 yayobowe na Enah Johnscott. iyifilime yerekanwe bwambere muri 2020 Nzabwira Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga ryafirime. Yatoranijwe nkuwinjira muri Kameruni muri Filime Nziza Mpuzamahanga Yamamaye muri 93 Awards Awards, ariko ntiyatowe. "}
{"id": "20729", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20729", "title": "Finding Hillywood", "text": "Finding Hillywood ni film mbarankuru yakozwe muri 2013 yerekana gukura kwa firime mu Rwanda (ubu zizwi cyane nka Hillywood). \nInyandiko.\nIyifilime yereka abayireba mwitangiriro ryurunganda rwa firime mu Rwanda, abanyamuryango bingenzi ba Hillywood nka Ayuub Kasasa Mago, na Eric Kabera. hamwe ningaruka zabyo ku Rwanda. "}
{"id": "20730", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20730", "title": "Une Fen\u00eatre ouverte", "text": "Une Fen\u00eatre ouverte nifilm mbarankuru yomuri 2005.\nInyandiko.\nUbusazi bushobora gusobanurwa? Birashoboka kwerekana ububabare bukubiyemo? Muri 1994, ubwo yaragiye kugwa mumutego wuburwayi bwe, Khady Sylla yahuye na Aminta Ngom, wagaragaje ubusazi bwemu bwisanzure, adatinya ubushotoranyi. Mumyaka yababajwe, Aminta yari idirishya rye kwisi."}
{"id": "20731", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20731", "title": "The Grudge (2016 film)", "text": "The Grudge ni filime yomuri Nigeriya 2016 yakozwe na Funmi Holder ikayoborwa na Yemi Morafa. Filime ishingiye kumibanire n\u2019abashakanye Richard Mofe-Damijo (RMD), Iretiola Doyle, Odunlade Adekola na Jaiye Kuti. \nInyandiko.\nIyi filime irazenguruka kubashakanye babiri batandukanye mubashakanye babiri batandukanye ndetse n'umupfakazi mugihe barwanira gukemura inzikandende zishaje ziteramakimbirane muri bo. \nPremiere.\nIyi filime yerekanwe bwambere ku ya 23 Ukwakira 2016 ahitwa Radisson Blu, i Lagos. Nyumayogutsinda kwerekanwe bwambere, hakozwe premiere ya VIP kubakinnyi, ibyamamare nabantu bazwi nka Funlola Aofiyebi, Caroline King, Taiwo Obileye, Elvis Chuks na Hon. Otunba George Oladele muri Sojourner Hotel, GRA, Ikeja. "}
{"id": "20732", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20732", "title": "Faro, Goddess of the Waters", "text": "Faro, Goddess of the Waters ni film yakozwe mumwaka wa 2007.\nInyandiko.\nZanga, umwana uba waravutse atashyingiranywe, yirukanwa mu mudugudu we. Nyuma yimyaka myinshi, aragaruka kugirango amenye se uwoari we. Akimara kuhagera, harikintu kibaho abaturage basobanura nkumwuka wumugezi Faro uburakari bukaze bwokuza kwa kumwana utazi ababyeyi be bose"}
{"id": "20733", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20733", "title": "Family Meeting (film)", "text": "Family Meeting nifilm yakorewe muri Kenya mumwaka wa 2019 yakozwe na Betty Kathungu Furet kandi yanditswe inayoborwa na Simiyu Barasa. Iyifilime yamenyekanye cyane muri Kenya nyuma yuko abayikora binjije neza ingengo yimari binyuze kuri Facebook. \nInyandiko.\nJesse (Gitura Kamau), Moses (Abubakar Muindi) n'umukunzi we Alison (Maureen Koech) na Barbara (Akinyi Aluoch) bahurira murugo rwababyeyi babo (Raymond Ofula &amp; Florence Nduta), kwizihiza isabukuru yabo yimyaka 40 bamaze babana ariko ibirori bihinduka umukino wo kurwana wabavandimwe. Amabanga namabanga atavugwa akangisha gusenya umuryango wigeze kwishima. "}
{"id": "20734", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20734", "title": "Foreigner's God", "text": "Foreigner's God ni filime yikinamico yomuri Nigeriya 2019 yakozwe na Kelechi Freeman Ukadike ikayoborwa na Ifan Ifeanyi Michael binyuze kuri Ifan Micheal Productions. \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200bIbyamamare mugukina firime Henry Coxe, Ini Dima-Okojie, Toni Tones, Pete Edochie, Nkem Owoh, Bamike Olawunmi, Tope Adenibuyan (Teddy A), Eucharia Anunobi, Sam Dede, Toyin Abraham, Salma Mumin, among others\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b \nInyandiko.\nUmufotozi wicyongereza wamafoto yaje muri Igboland mugihe cyabakoloni ashakisha inkuru. Umurinziwe yaburiwirengero nyumayaje gukundana n\u2019umugore uregwa ubupfumu, utuyemu nkambi y\u2019abapfumu yitaruye mumashyamba mubihe bibi, bikavamo ingaruka zikomeye. \nUmusaruro no kurekurwa.\nIyi filime yakozwe mumwaka wa 2019 igurwa na Amazon Prime Video mu "}
{"id": "20735", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20735", "title": "The First Lady (film)", "text": "The First Lady ni filime yomuri Nigeriya yakozwe muri 2015 iyobowe na Omoni Oboli. \nUmugambi.\nIndaya, irambiwe akazikora, igakoribishoboka byosengo ihagarare kandi ireba umugabo kugirango imukize ibibazo. "}
{"id": "20736", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20736", "title": "Behind This Convent", "text": "Behind This Conventt nifilime mbarankuru ya jenoside yo mu Rwanda yakozwe muri 2008 yayobowe na Gilbert Ndahayo. Yerekanwe bwambere mu. \nInyandiko.\nKwitariki 10 Mata 1994, mumujyi muto wa Astrida mu Rwanda, G\u00e9nocidaires yageze mu kigo cy'ababikira. Barasahura bafata bugwate kumuhanda.bafata abatutsi 200 barabicira mu gikari cyababikira. Agaruka murugo afite imyaka 13, Ndahayo yavumbuye imirambo y\u2019umuryango weku mwobo urimu gikari cye. "}
{"id": "20737", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20737", "title": "Finding Mercy", "text": "Find Mercy ni filime yikinamico yomuri Nigeriya 2013 yakozwe kandi iyobowe na Desmond Elliot, ikinwamo na Rita Dominic, Blossom Chukwujekwu, Uti Nwachukwu na Chioma Chukwuka. \nKwakira.\nNollywood Reinvented yayihaye 56%, ishimumusaruro wayo kandi ikayobora. Isubiramo yasanze film ishimishije nubwo film yibanze kubibazo byubuzima bwa buri munsi. Efe Doghudje wa 360Nobs yayihaye amanota 5 kuri 10 yinyenyeri. Yamaganaga imyambarire idahagije bivuzeko nubwo abakinnyi bakomeye, abantu batavugwagaho. "}
{"id": "20738", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20738", "title": "El Icha", "text": "El Icha (Ubuzima) nifilm yakozwe muri 2010 yo muri Tuniziya.\nInyandiko.\nHavet numugore wo muri tuniziya wimyaka hafi mirongo ine.akaba umupfakazi kandi afite yari afite umuhungu w'imyaka makumyabiri wimukiye muri Canada. Yabanaga na nyina mu gace k'abakozi bakora muri Tuniziya kandi akora akazi kogucuruza itumanaho rya sosiyete yabafaransa yashyizwe muri Tuniziya. Buri gitondo, aragenda kukazi, akarohama cyane muri gahunda yoguhumeka. Murugo, ubuzima bwe ni bumwe kandi nta nyungu."}
{"id": "20739", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20739", "title": "Fincho", "text": "Fincho ni filime yomuri Nijeriya yomu 1957 yakozwe na Sam Zebba, na filime yambere yomuri Nijeriya amashusho yafashwe mwibara. Iyi filime ivuga ku buryo bw'inyangamugayo zagerageje kumvikanisha inganda zazanywe muri Nijeriya n'abakoloni b'Abanyaburayi, ubushyamirane buri hagati y'imigenzo n'udushya, ndetse no gukomeretsa imashini ku mirimo gakondo. \nNk\u2019uko Zebba yiyise ubwe yandika kubuzimabwe, iyi filime yafashwe n\u2019abakinnyi batari abanyamwuga bo muri Nijeriya, ndetse n\u2019ibiganiro bya Pidgin byiswe n\u2019abanyeshuri bo muri Nijeriya muri kaminuza ya Californiya, Los Angeles. Uyu muyobozi yavuganye n'umuririmbyi Harry Belafonte, wemera gufata amajwi y'iyi filime. Amanota yanditswe na Alexander Laszlo, harimo insanganyamatsiko \"ya Fincho Indirimbo\" - Zebba yanditse, hanyuma aririmba aherekejwe n'itsinda rito rya Mexico. "}
{"id": "20740", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20740", "title": "Emita\u00ef", "text": "Emita\u00ef ([\u025b.mi.ta.i], izina ryimana ya Diola) ni film yinkinamico yakozwe muri 1971 yomuri Senegali iyobowe na Ousmane Semb\u00e8ne. \nUmugambi.\nMu Ntambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose, guverinoma ya Vichy yatoranyije abagabo baba koloni bo mubufaransa. Imyivumbagatanyo yatangiriye mumudugudu wa Diola aho abagore bahisha umusaruro wumuceri aho gutanga umusoro wubufaransa. Abayobozi ba Diola bungurana ibitekerezo ku gisubizo cyiza kuri politiki yabafaransa ikarishye, kandi ibintu birihutirwa iyabafaransa ningabo zabo zabakoloni barasa ku barwanyi ba Diola. Diola igerageza kugisha inama imana zabo, harimo na Emita\u00ef, guhangana nabafaransa biriyongera. Bidatinze, ibyapa bya Charles de Gaulle bisimbuza ibyapa bya Marshal P\u00e9tain wa Vichy, byerekana impinduka zingana zubutegetsi muri Afurika y\u2019iburengerazuba bw\u2019Ubufaransa. Irihinduka rya politiki ritunguranye, ariko, ntabwo rihindura ukibintu bimeze kurwego rwumudugudu, kandi amaherezo ingabo zabakoloni zakoze ubwicanyi bwabagabo ba Diola. \nUmutwe.\n\"Emitai\" yahawe izina ryayo kumana yomuri Senegal, \"uhagarariye igice kiva mucyiciro kimwe cyubuzima kijya mu gishya kandi cyiza\". \nKurekura.\n\"Emitai\" yasohotse muri Senegali muwi 1971, nmu 1972 muri Amerika. Yagenzuwe imyaka itanu muri Afrika ivuga Igifaransa. Filime yinjiye mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya 7 rya Moscou aho yatsindiye igihembo cya silver. \nKwakira.\nMugitabo cye\"cyitwa Family Guide to Film on Video\", Henry Herx yanditse ko \"inkuru nyinshi zivugwa gusa binyuze mumashusho yerekana, aya mashusho ni imbaraga zikomeye za filime\". "}
{"id": "20741", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20741", "title": "En attendant les hommes", "text": "En attendant les hommes (\" \"Gutegereza Abagabo\" \") ni film mbarankuru yomuri 2007 yakozwe na Katy L\u00e9na N'diaye ivuga kubagore bashushanya amashusho muri Oualata, muri Mauritania. Muruyu mujyi uriku nkombe yakure y'ubutayu bwa Sahara, abagore batatu bakora imyitozo gakondo kunkuta zumujyi. \nUmugambi.\nOualata numujyi muto wa oasis muburasirazuba bwakure bw'ubutayu bwa Moritani. Muriki kirwa, inkuta zidasanzwe zirwanya umusenyi, abategarugori batatu basize amarangi bashushanya inkuta zitukura hamwe n\u2019ibishushanyo muri sosiyete bigaragara koyiganjemo imigenzo, amadini nabagabo, kandi bavuga mubwisanzure kumibonano mpuzabitsina. "}
{"id": "20742", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20742", "title": "L'enfant Roi", "text": "L'enfant Roi ni film ngufi yakozwe muri 2009.\nInyandiko.\nKera muri Afurika, umudugudu witwa Nidiobina washenywe numuriro. Babiri mubari bayituye Foudi Mamaya numugore we bahatiwe kuva mu mudugudu wabo bashaka ibiryo basiga umuhungu wabo w'ikinege, Bouba, barerwa na sekuru Wali. Wali yigisha umwuzukuru we uburyo bwo kuba umugabo, Bouba aba umunyeshuri ufite impano."}
{"id": "20743", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20743", "title": "La Femme Anjola", "text": "La Femme Anjola ni filime 2021 yanditswe na Tunde Babalola iyoborwa na Mildred Okwo. Ni firime noir psychologue yerekana Rita Dominic na Nonso Bassey. Yasohotse muri sinema ku ya 19 Werurwe 2021. \nInyandiko.\n\"La Femme Anjola\" azenguruka umunyamigabane wakundanye numugore udasanzwe. Anjola yashakanye numugiziwanabi ufite club ya nijoro ahwakora ibitaramo bya Live. \nUmusaruro no kurekurwa.\nAbabatatu ba Mildred Okwo, Tunde Babalola na Rita Dominic bongeye guhurira muruyumusaruro kuva hasohoka filime yabo 2012, \"Inama\".\nBivugwako iyi filime yakuwemuri Sinema ya Nijeriya kugirango ikore filime \"Umuhanuzikazi.\" Mu kiganiro yagiranye n\u2019ibinyamakuru The Cable, umuyobozi Okwo iki gikorwa cyatewe no kwiharira inganda za firime zo muri Nijeriya. Yavuze ko isosiyete imwe ya sinema yakuyeho filime ye \"Surulere ya 2015,\" mubihe bitavugwaho rumwe. Imyitwarire yarubanda nyumayokuvaho yemeje ko Okwo yafashe icyemezo, maze avuga ko ateganya kujya ku murongo wa interineti binyuze ku mbuga za interineti za interineti ndetse na serivisi zitanga amakuru. [\"citation ikenewe\"]"}
{"id": "20744", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20744", "title": "L'Esprit de Mopti", "text": "L'Esprit de Mopti ni filime mbarankuru yo muwi 1999 ivuga kumujyi wa Mopti, muri Mali, yayobowe na Moussa Ouane.\nInyandiko.\nMuri Mali rwagati, ahobutayu nu bwatsi buto bihurira, hari Mopti, umujyi ukomeye w\u2019abayisilamu n\u2019]amasangano yubucuruzi ku ruzi rwa Niger. Buri wa kane, abacuruzi bo mu moko atandukanye bahurira ku isoko. Indimi zose zivugwa muri Mali zikoreshwa muri Mopti aho guhinduranya biganje ukurikije imigenzo yakera. Ngiyo \"umwuka wa Mopti\", ugizwe no kwihanganirana, gusetsa, kubaha undi, guhana nogucuruza. Iyi filime mbarirano isobanura uyu mwuka binyuze mubantu batanu bahagarariye: Dogon, Bozo, umushumba wa Fulani, umworozi wa Tuareg, na Bella umuhungu wumujyi na carter. \nIhuza ryo hanze.\nL'esprit de Mopti at IMDb"}
{"id": "20745", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20745", "title": "False Flag (film)", "text": "False Flag ni firime ya Nigeriya 2017 yakozwe kandi iyobowe na Allwell Ademola. \nUmugambi.\nUmugabo wanzekurushinga, nyumagasanga urukundo kumugore wanduye virusi itera SIDA. Umuryango wumugabo ntabwo wishimiye umubano kandi barashaka ko ahagarika umubano. "}
{"id": "20746", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20746", "title": "Guilty Pleasures (2009 film)", "text": "Guilty Pleasures ni filime yikinamico yomuri Nigeriya 2009 iyobowe na Desmond Elliot na Daniel Ademinokan, yakinnye na Ramsey Nouah, Majid Michel na Nse Ikpe Etim. Yatowenk'umukino \"mwiza wa Sinema\" mubihembo bya 6 bya Afurika Movie Academy Awards.\nKwakira.\nNollywood Reinvented yayihaye amanota 3 kuri 5 yinyenyeri, ashimira abakinnyi ba filime kandi avuga ko uyu mugambi ufite ibintu bikomokaho ndetse numwimerere. Joy Isi Bewaji womuri \"Nijeriya Imyidagaduro Uyumunsi\" yashimye ibisobanuro by\u2019uruhare rw\u2019abakinnyi bakomeye kandi avuga ko uyu mugambi ari \"uguhishurwa muburyo bwihishe\". "}
{"id": "20747", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20747", "title": "Estas s\u00e3o as armas", "text": "Estas s\u00e3o as armas, \"Izi nimbunda\", ni film mbarankuru yomuri Mozambike yakozwe muwi 1978. \nYarashwe nitsinda ryabanyeshuri bomu kigo cyigihugu cya sinema (INC) iyobowe na Murilo Salles na Lu\u00eds Bernardo Honwana, ifi filime mbarirano \"Izi nizo mbunda\" zerekana amashusho yingabo za Rodeya zateye muri Repubulika yabaturage ya Mozambike. Muwi 1977, iyifirime yatangiriye i Maputo yerekeza mu ntara ya Tete gufata amashusho yibyangijwe nigitero cy\u2019indege mu cyaro."}
{"id": "20748", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20748", "title": "The Guest (2017 film)", "text": "The Guest ni filime yomuri Nigeriya 2017 yakozwe kandiyanditswe na Foluke Olaniyi kandi iyobowe na Christian Olayinka. \nUmugambi.\nFilime itangibisobanuro byukuntu abashakanye bishimiye ubukwebwabo bwiza kugezigihe inshuti yumudamu yirukanywe mubwongereza. Yabanyenabo kandi atezurugo rwabo mukuryamana nuwo mugabo. "}
{"id": "20749", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20749", "title": "Grey Dawn (film)", "text": "Gray Dawn ni Gana yomuri 2015 - Filime yikinamico yomuri Nigeriya, yakozwe hamwe na Shirley Frimpong-Manso. Irimo Bimbo Manuel, Funlola Aofiyebi-Raimi, Sika Osei na Marlon Mave. Iyi filime yibanze kubibazo bikomeye bijyanye n\u2019abinjira n\u2019abinjira, politiki, n\u2019imibereho ya sosiyete mu rwegorwa Gana, byerekana uburinganire hagati y\u2019ibibazo by\u2019umuntu kugiti cyen\u2019ibibazo by\u2019imibereho. \nUmugambi.\nIyinkuru ikurikira minisitiri wa guverinoma ya Gana, Bimbo Manuel, umwugawe wa politiki ukaba wugarijwe na sebukwe, umwimukira utemewe n'amategeko, ahura n\u2019ukoherezwa. Mugihe minisitiri ahanganyeno gukomezakuba inyangamugayo muri politiki arinako akomeza umubanowe mu muryango, agwa murugamba rw\u2019imyitwarire n\u2019amarangamutima. Ibisobanuro bivanaho insanganyamatsiko yubudahemuka, indangamuntu, nigiciro cyo kwifuza muri Gana ya none.\nIhuza ryo hanze.\nGrey Dawn trailer on YouTube"}
{"id": "20750", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20750", "title": "The Green Eyed", "text": "Green Eyed ni film yikinamico yomuri Nigeriya 2015, iyobowe na Blessing O. Uduefe. yakinywe na Nse Ikpe Etim, Kalu Ikeagwu, Tamara Eteimo na Blossom Chukwujekwu. amashusho yafatiwe muri Port Harcourt. "}
{"id": "20751", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20751", "title": "A Great Day (film)", "text": "A Great Day ni film ngufi ya Nigeriya 2015 yanditswe, yakozwe, kandi iyobowe na James Abinibi. Filime yerekanicyemezo cyubuzima bwumuntu ushaka akazi kandi inagaragaramo Whochay Nnadi, Kenny Solomon na Crystabel Goddy. \nInyandiko.\nFilime irazenguruka kumusore wahamagawe kubazwa. Murugendo, ahuranubwoko butandukanye bwibibazo byamutera gusubira inyuma arikoyariyemeje kandi akomezurugendo. \nPremiere.\nIyi filime yerekanwe bwambere muri Sinema ya Leisure Mall, Adeniran Ogunsanya i Surulere, i Lagos muri Nijeriya ku ya 27 Ugushyingo 2015. Imurikagurisha ryitabiriwe n\u2019ibyamamare birimo Funky Mallam, Shola Animashaun, Doris Simeon, Emmanuel Ilemobayo, Bunmi Davies n'abandi "}
{"id": "20752", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20752", "title": "Gone (2021 film)", "text": "Gone ni film ya 2021 yomuri Nigeriya amarangamutima kandi yikinamico yanditswe kandi iyobowe na Daniel Ademinokan. Yakozwe na Joy Odiete na Daniel Ademinokan hamwe na Asurf Oluseyi hamwe na producer wumurongo munsi yisosiyete ikora nogukwirakwiza Stidiyo ya Blue Pictures ifatanije na Index Two Studios. Muri firime hagaragaramo Ada Ameh, Sam Dede, Bimbo Manuel, Bimbo Ademoye na Emma Oh Mana yanjye. \nInyandiko.\nBikurikiranye ninkuru yumusore usizumugorewe utwite ashakisha ubuzima bwiza mumujyi wa New York. Yatawe muri yombi mu gatsiko k'abantu maze akatirwa igifungo cy'imyaka makumyabiri n'itanu. Yagarutse muri Nijeriya nyuma yo gufungwa, asanga umugorewe yarongeyegushaka. "}
{"id": "20753", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20753", "title": "Reloaded (2009 film)", "text": "Reloaded ni filime yikinamico yomuri Nigeriya yomu 2009 iyobowe na Lancelot Oduwa Imasuen &amp; Ikechukwu Onyeka, yakinwe na Ramsey Nouah, Rita Dominic, Desmond Elliot, Stephanie Okereke, Ini Edo na Nse Ikpe Etim. Yakiriye nomination 3 mubihembo bya 5 bya Afrika Movie Academy Awards. \nKwakira.\nNollywood Reinvented yayihaye amanota 3 kuri 5 yinyenyeri. Isubiramo yavuze ko nubwo amaze kubona filime inshuronyinshi, atigerarambirwa. \"NollywoodForever\" yayihaye amanota 93%. Isubiramo yashimye uko filime igenda igenda, kandiyishimira kubyina birangiye. "}
{"id": "20754", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20754", "title": "Gangs of Lagos", "text": "Gangs of Lagos ni film yakozwe mumwaka wa 2023 yomuri Nigeriya iganjemo aubigizi bwanabini nibyaha bitandukanye, yakozwe na Jadesola Osiberu. Irimo Tobi Bakre, Adesua Etomi, Chike, Iyabo Ojo, Chioma Chukwuka, Zlatan, Bimbo Ademoye, Yvonne Jegede, Yinka Quadri, Wasiu Alabi Pasuma, na Yhemolee. Iyifilime yerekana inkuru y\u2019inshuti eshatu Obalola, Ify, na Impano, zakuriye i \u00ccs\u00e0l\u1eb9\u0300 \u00c8k\u00f3, mugace kagenzurwa n\u2019udutsiko dufitanye isano na politiki. Mugihe imitwe ihanganye nabo itemeranya nabo ubwo urugomo rukaba ruratangiye, bakishora mu ntambara yagatsiko iba yagutse ityo.\nUmuyobozi ushinzwe udushya mumashusho akaba n'umwanditsi Jadesola Osiberu yubatse ikigitekerezo mugihe bakoraga uyumushinga wewa mbere, \"Gidi Up\", yashingiye kukureba ubuzima bwa buri munsi bwabaturage binyuze mumadirishya yinyubako zituranye. Amanota yahimbwe na Tolu Obanro, Chike yatanze umuzanzu mumagambo yindirimbo zimwe. Amafoto nyamukuru yakorewe kukirwa cya Lagos.\n\"Gangs of Lagos\" yerekanwe kuya 4 Nzeri 2022 mw' iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Toronto 2022. Yasohowe bidasubirwaho na Sitidiyo ya Amazone MGM ibinyujije kuri Video ya mbere kuya 7 Mata Iyifilime kandi yatsindiye ibihembo byinshi mumwaka wa 2023 Africa Movie Academy Awards.\nIyifilime yateje impaka nyuma y gusohoka inakomeza kuziteza kuva icyo gihe. Byasobanuwe kari \"ugusuzugura umuco wo muri Lagos\" hanyuma isabirwa guhagarikwa mu bitangazamakuru bya Nollywood na guverinoma ya Lagos. Oba ya Lagos numuryango wa Kosoko bamaganye iyifilime kubera koyerekanaga masikare ya Eyo nkudutsiko twabagizi ba nabi bagize uruhare mubwicanyi buteye ubwoba no gutera ubwoba abaturage binzirakarengane. \"Agatsiko ka Lagos\" gakomeje kuba umwe mu binjije amafaranga menshi muri Nigeriya muri sinema ya Nigeriya, yinjije miliyoni zisaga 230. Yamenyekanye kandi muri Prime Video mwi 10 za mbere kwisi ikurikiranwa cyane badakoresha ururirimi rw' Icyongereza, ishingiye ku mikorere yayo hanze y\u2019igihugu yakomokamo kugeza igihe yasohoye. \nIncamake.\nObalola,Gift, na Ify bari inshuti eshatu zavukiye zina kurira muri \u00ccs\u00e0l\u1eb9\u0300 \u00c8k\u00f3, umuryango wariwiganjemo ihohoterwa rikorwa na politiki, ubugizi bwa nabi, n\u2019agatsiko, ubujura, no guharanira ubutegetsi. Obalola, akiri umwana, abona se - wahoze ari umwami w\u2019umuryango - araswa mu buryo bubabaje na masike ya Eyo. Mugihe bari mumodoka, inshuti eshatu ziba umufuka wumugore, urimo amafaranga na pasiporo mpuzamahanga. Uyu mugore abimenyesha Alaye Bam Bam, umwami uyoboye imuhanda yo muri \u00ccs\u00e0l\u1eb9\u0300 \u00c8k\u00f3. kaze gufata Obalola, akabona igisubizo cye cy'ubutwari, akamushyira hamwe n'abandi mu kazi ke, kogukusanya ruswa n'ubujura.\nUbutwaribwa Obalola hamwe nabanyabwenge bomumuhanda bikurura Nino, umuyobozi w'agatsiko kiyongera kuba Eleniyan ukurikira (izina ry'umuyobozi w'agatsiko gakomeye muri \u00ccs\u00e0l\u1eb9\u0300 \u00c8k\u00f3). Nino, abonye ubushobozi muri Obalola, amujyana munsiy\u2019ibaba maze abumubyeyi urera, amuha guhunga by'agateganyo ihohoterwa ryanyina w\u2019idini ry\u2019idini rya Obalola. Urugo rwa Nino rutanga ihumure, kandi Obalola akunda cyane Teni, umuturanyiwa Nino n'umukobwa wa Kazeem.\nUrupfu rubi rwa Nino ruteza akaga gakomeye, rukanangiza ibyiringiro bya Obalola byozagira ubuzima bwiza. Nyuma y\u2019urupfu rwe, Obalola n\u2019inshuti ze basanga barushijwe imbaraga no gukorera Kazeem, umuyobozi w\u2019agatsiko kabanzi b\u2019ubuzima uzwiho inda nini n\u2019ubunyamaswa, kandi ufite imizi ikomeye muri politiki ya Lagos. Kazeem yifata nk\u2019aho ari se kuri Obalola, ariko ukuri ni uko uburiganya bwe n\u2019icyo akoresha mu bikorwa by\u2019ubugizi bwa nabi bisaba igiciro gikomeye.\nabobatatu bamazeguze, imiterere yabo irushaho kuba mibi,inzira zabo zigatandukana. Obalola yaje kuba uwo Kazeem yubahwa cyane, abitewe no gushaka gutunga umuryango we no kwihorera urupfu rwa Nino. Impano ikubiyemo ubuzima bw'agatsiko, kubona imbaraga n'irangamuntu mu kajagari, mugihe Ify akomera ku nzozi zo kuba umucuranzi, nubwo ubudahemuka ku nshuti ze bukomeza kumusubiza mu kuzimu.\nInshingano y'ingenzi yateguwe na Kazeem iteza amakimbirane akaze mudutsiko duhanganye no kugenzura politiki. Ntabishaka, Ify yinjiye mubikorwa kugirango ashyigikire inshuti ze. Ariko, ubutumwa buragenda nabi, bikaviramo kurasa akajagari aho Ify yiciwe. Urupfu rwe rutunguranye kandi rukabije rwangiza Obalola na Gift, bituma basigara bahanganye nigihombo kidazanzwe\nUrupfu rwa Ify ruteza andi maraso kumeneka muri Isale Eko, ubwo nyina, Mama Ify, yasabaga ko akwirukanwa. Mu byakurikiyeho, Obalola amenya ko ari Kazeem wagize uruhare mu kwicwa kwa Nino. Ibyo bituma ayobora urugamba rw\u2019amaraso rwo kwihorera kuri Kazeem. Kubera agahinda n\u2019inyota y\u2019ubutabera, intambara y\u2019udutsiko irarota, ikaba iy\u2019amaraso menshi. Mu iherezo ryaranzwe n\u2019urugamba rukaze, Obalola ahanganye na Kazeem, aramutsinda aramwica. Icyo gikorwa cy\u2019ukwihorera kiba nk\u2019aho cyuzuye urugendo rwa Obalola, kuko ahura n\u2019uruhererekane rw\u2019ubugome rwamuranze mu buzima bwe, agatangira gushaka inzira imukiza ibyo byiciro by\u2019amaraso.\nUkoyakozwe.\nUkoyakozwe no gufata amashusho.\nMugukora \"Gangs of Lagos\" byaatewe n\u2019uko Jade Osiberu yiboneye ubuzima i \u00ccs\u00e0l\u1eb9\u0300 \u00c8k\u00f3, Lagos. Mu gihe cyo gukora umushinga we, \"Gidi Up\", yiboneye ubuzima bwa buri munsi binyuze mu madirishya y\u2019inyubako zituranye. Umwe mu mashusho yingenzi, aho umubyeyi yari ategura ifunguro ry\u2019abanabe, niwo watumye yibaza byinshi ku buzima bw\u2019ihungabana ry\u2019ubukungu nimibereho murako gace. Iryotandukaniro ryabaye ishingiro ryinkuru yerekanye ubuzima bwabantu akenshi bumvwa nabi. Ibi birori byashizeho urwego rwo kuvuga abantu abantu batumva nabi. Yasuzumye insanganyamatsiko zo kwifuza, ubukene, nokubaho muburyo butandukanye na Lagos butandukanye no kwinezeza. Iyifilime yibanda ku ngaruka zubujura na politiki mbi mu buzima bwaburi munsi, bugamije kubyutsa impuhwe mugihe zishimishije. Mukiganiro na Al Jazeera, Osiberu yavuze ingaruka nka Martin Scorsese na Spike Lee, abahoze mumatsinda yagangster bagize uruhare mu kuvuga inkuru. Yasobanuye agira ati: \u201cNahoraga nzi ko nshaka kuvuga inkuru ivuga kumwana ukurira kuriyi si udashobora gusohoka,\u201d agaragaza ishingiro ry\u2019umuntu munkuru za filime. \n\"Gangs of Lagos y\"agaragaje intambwe ikomeye muri sinema yo muri Nijeriya kuko yabaye filime yambere ya Amazon Original yaturutse muri Afurika, igaragaza ko kwisi igenda yiyongera muri Afurika.] Iyi filime yayobowe na Jadesola Osiberu, uzwi mu bikorwa bye nka \"Isoken\" (2017), \"Sugar Rush\" (2019), na \"Brotherhood\" (2022). Yakozwe ku bufatanye na Kemi Lala Akindoju, ikaba yaravutse binyuze mu masezerano yimyaka itatu hagati ya Amazon Prime Video n\u2019inzu itunganya filime ya Osiberu, Greoh Studios. Osiberu yakoranye na Kemi Lala Akindoju ndetse na K. I. Jegede mu kwandika inyandikonyamakuru (screenplay) igaragaza by\u2019ukuri umuco w\u2019imibereho y\u2019abatuye muri Lagos.\nIshuho ngari ya \"Gangs of Lagos\" yatangiye mumwaka wa 2021 ikomeza amezi menshi. Benshi mubafata amashusho yabereye Eko, umuturanyi wo ku kirwa cya Lagos ahazwiho kubera amateka yaho ndetse n\u2019ikirere cyiza. Abakinnyi ba firime bagamije gufata ingufu zidasanzwe za Isale Eko, bakoresheje ahantu nyaburanga kugirango bashire inkuru mubuzima bwa buri munsi mubuzima bwa Lagos. Usibye Isale Eko, ibindibice byo muri Lagos byakoreshejwe mu kurasa, harimo uduce nka Lekki na Surulere. Ibibibanza byatanze amakuru atandukanye yerekanaga itandukaniro ry\u2019imibereho n\u2019ubukungu muri Lagos, kuva mu turere two hejuru kugera mu duce dutuwe cyane. \nGushaka Abakinnyi\nFilime yakoresheje abanyempano bo muri nigeria zaho yaba imbere n' imyuma ya kamera. Abagize itsinda, barimo Tobi Bakre, Adesua Etomi-Wellington, na Chike, bazanye ibikorwa byabo mubuzima, bashyigikiwe nitsinda ryababyaye ryerekana umujyi. Muri Kamena 2021, \"Pulse NG\" yatangajwe kourutonde rugufi rwagutse rugashyiramo Pasuma. Mu gihe cyo gukorana na firime, Osiberu yasobanuye icyemezo yafashe cyo kongera Pasuma na Zlatan mu bakinnyi, agira ati: \"Pasuma afite amateka maremare yo gukina. Kuva twarasa muri Isale Eko, ninde wundi ushobora guhura neza? Pasuma atunganye kuri iyi si.\" \nMukiganiro na Daily Post, Tobi yavuze ibitekerezo bijyanye nokwitegura uruhare rwenka Obalola mu \"gatsiko ka Lagos\". Yagaragaje ko bwari ubwa mbere akina umuntu uyobora kandi akishora mu buryo bwuzuye kugira ngo agire uruhare. Yatekereje kunzira ye mbere yogufata amashusho, yaravuze ati: \"Ku gatsiko ka Lagos, byari ingorabahizi kuko, ku nshuro ya mbere, naretse ndagenda rwose. Nari numvise umuziki ubabaje cyane kugira ngahuze n'amarangamutima yumuntu. Indirimbo imwe igaragara kuri njye nindirimbo ya Celia' ya Tiwa Savage, ntabwo ari amarangamutima cyane. \nIgishushanyo mbonera cy'umusaruro n'ibibazo.\nIgishushanyo mbonera \"cya Gang of Lagos\" cyerekana ubwiza bwumujyi. Iri tsinda ryibanze cyane kumakuru arambuye nka palette palette, ubwubatsi, nimihanda yo kumuhanda kugirango habeho kwerekana neza ubuzima bwumujyi wa Lagos. Amashusho yerekana sinema, yayobowe na Olumuyiwa Oyedele, yashimangiye kokamera igenda ifata ingufu n\u2019akajagari mu mihanda ya Lagos. Ububuryo bwakoreshejwe mugukora ubunararibonye, butuma abareba bumva ko ari bimwe mubidukikije bigenda bihindagurika byerekana ubuzima bwabantu. \nMugihe cyo gutunganya amashuho, abakora amafilime bahuye nibibazo mugihe bafataga amashusho mu duce twinshi twa Lagos, cyane cyane muma ghetto. Chioma Akpotha, umwe mubakinnyi bakomeye muri iyifilime, yatangaje kabo bakozi bagombaga kwishora mu \" bahungu bo mu karere \", ijambo rikunze gukoreshwa muriNijeriya kugira ngo risobanure amatsinda y\u2019abasore bakunze kugenzura ibikorwa mumijyi imwe nimwe, kugira ngo bafate amashusho neza. \nUmuziki.\nTolu Obanro yahimbye amanota yifilime, yasohowe na Studiyo ya Greoh. Umuziki ufungura umurongo wahawe amashimwe ni \"Ikinyamakuru kavukire\" kivuga ko ari \"igitangaza.\" Obanro atekereza ku byoyaremye, yaragize ati: \"Nashakaga gukora amanota yumvaga ari manini kandi manini.\" Amajwi nayo agaragaza indirimbo yinyongera ya Chike. \nKurekura no gukwirakwiza.\nYerekanwe bwambere \"mw\"' iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya 2022 rya Toronto ku ya 11 Nzeri nkimwe muri filime Nijeriya zasohotse kurubuga rwa interineti mu wego rwo gushora Amazone muri Nollywood. Isohora ryafilime ryagaragaje intambwe igaragara mubufatanye hagati yabakora amafilime yomuri Nijeriya na serivisi zitanga amakuru kwisi, bituma Nollywood igera ku bantu mpuzamahanga. \nKwakira.\nBox office.\n\"Gangs of Lagos\" yinjije miliyoni 230 z'amapound muriNijeriya. Muminsi 20 yambere igisohoka muri 2023, film imaze kubona abantu 15.000. \nIgisubizo gikomeye.\nSeyi Lasisi womuri \"Afrocritik\" yahaye iyifilime inyenyeri 3/5 maze aravuga ati: \" \"Gangs of Lagos\", kimwe na Brotherhood, ntabwo ari ibihimbano. Ni ubushakashatsi bwa sinema kumibereho yacu nkabanyanijeriya. Irerekana ibyangiritse imiryango ya Nigeriya ndetse n'Abanyanijeriya bahatirwa guhamya igihe guverinoma ititaye ku iterambere no gukemura ibibazo by'imibereho\". \nShola-Adido Oladotun wo muri \"Premium Times\" yashimye \"Gangs of Lagos\", avuga ko \" ikorwa rayamashusho riri mu rwego rwo hejuru, ku buryo ibintu bitandukanye bituma burigice gisa neza kandi gikwiranye nubwoko bwacyo.\" Yagaragaje kobahisemo ahantu heza, agira ati: \"Biratangaje kubona iyifilime yafatiwe amashusho ahantu nyaburanga muri Isale Eko.\" Icyakora, Oladotun yagaragaje kiyi filime ishobora kuba yarakoze neza nkuruhererekane rwa televiziyo, kuko yarigutuma habaho iterambere ryimbitse, atari kuri Obalola na Impano gusa ahubwo noku bantu bavugwa nka Kazeem. Yerekanye filime 8/10 inyenyeri. Emma Vine womuri \"Ready Steady Cut\" yavuze ko iyi filime ari \"ikinamico, iteye ubwoba izahita ushora imari mu nkuru n'imiterere yayo.\" Yashimye imirimo ya kamera, sinema, ndetse n\u2019imikorere y'abakinnyi. Vine yashimangiye ko imwe mu mitungo \"itangaje\" ya filime ari isano itangaje hagati yabakinnyi bakuze na bagenzi babo bato, ikintu gikunze kwirengagizwa ariko cyingenzi mugukora film byongera cyane kwizera. \nJohnny Loftus umunyamakuru wa \"Decider\" yashimye imikorere yabakinnyi bo muri\"Gangs of Lagos\", cyane cyane agaragaza Tobi Bakre, Adesua Etomi-Wellington, na Chike Ezekpeazu-Osebuka. Yagaragaje uburyo Chike yerekana Ify, umuntu wavutse mubuzima bw\u2019agatsiko nubwo yifuzaga cyane kunyura mubundi buryo, nkogukinira kuri stage nki ntumbero ye, Panama. Liam Lacey womuri \"Original-Cin\" yahaye iy filime amanota B, avuga ko \"ariyo bihebuje cyane iyo itandukanije umuco wa Scorsese-Coppola kugira ngo itange kunegura bikabije ikigo cya politiki cyo muri Nijeriya.\" \nAmashimwe.\n\"Gangs of Lagos\" katsindiye ibihembo byinshi ndetse nogushimwa, harimo kumenyekana nkafilime nziza yomuri Nijeriya ndetse ningaruka nziza zerekanwa mu bihembo bya 2023 bya Afurika bya Sinema. Adesua Etomi-Wellington yegukanye igihembo cyumukinnyi mwiza witwaye neza. \nImpaka.\nKugaragaza iyifilime no kuranga masike ya Eyo, ikintu cyingenzi mu muco womuri Lagos, byagaragaye ko bitavugwaho rumwe. Benshi mu babajijwe kumbuga nkoranyambaga bumvise kabakora amafilime bagaragaje kobatubaha ikigo gakondo ayomasikare arimo. Itsinda rimwe ry\u2019Abanya Lagos ryateye ubwoba urubanza rusubizwa, irindi rirakurikira maze bajyana ikibazo murukiko. \nReno Omokri yanenze iyifilime \"avuga ko isebanya,\" munyandiko yanditse ku ubuga rwa Twitter yanditse ko amashusho yayo atesha agaciro isura ya Nijeriya, aravuga ati: \"Kwamamaza igihugu cyawe ukoresheje filime nkiyi ni nko gukubita umwobo mu bwato urimo nku umugenzi. Ninde utsinzwe?\" \nMubanamaganye iyifilime kurizo mpamvu harimo guverinoma yaLeta ya Lagos, umuryango wibwami wa Kosoko womuri Lagos, Umuyobozi mukuru Adebola Dosunmu wo mu muryango w\u2019ibwami wa Dosunmu, hamwe numukambwe wikirangirire wa Nollywood, Jide Kosoko ukora muburyo bwihariye. umuyobozi wacyo yasobanuye ko bidahawe ububasha bwo kugenzura amafilime na televiziyo byerekanwe ku mbuga nkoranyambaga, nubwo ubugororangingo bwemewe n'amategeko bwo kubuha ubwo butegetsi Inteko ishinga amategeko. \nMuri Mata mumwaka wa 2023, guverinoma yaleta ya Lagos nabayobozi gakondo banenze filime \"Gangs of Lagos\" kubera kwerekana umurage ndangamuco wa leta. Guverinoma yamaganye umusaruro \"udasanzwe uyobya,\" yemeza ko ugaragaza umuco wa Lagos mu buryo bwo gusebanya. Uzamat Akinbile-Yussuf, Komiseri waLeta ushinzwe ubukerarugendo, ubuhanzi, numuco womuri Lagos, yatangaje ko ahangayikishijwe nimiterere yiyi filime, avuga ko yasebeje amateka n\u2019imigenzo ya Lagos kandi ko yarenganyije abaturage bayo ko ari ubugome. Yagaragaje imiterere yera y\u2019umunsi mukuru wa Eyo, ashimangira ko ari umuhango udasanzwe wo gutambuka ku banyacyubahiro bo muri Lagos. \nMuburyo nkubwo, Oba y'i Lagos, Rilwan Aremu Akiolu, yavuze kiyi filime isebanya kandi ko ari igitambo, anenga ivuga ko Eyo ari udutsiko twabagizi uruhare m bwicanyi nogutera ubwoba abaturage. Yasabye ko Amazon Web Services, Sitidiyo ya Greoh, hamwe n\u2019abatunganya iyifilime bakuraho amashusho yose ya Eyo muryii firime. \nAmazon Web Services yo muri Nigeriya, ishami rya Amazon Inc. akaba ari yashinze Prime Video Nigeriya, yatangaje koyasubije ihazabu ingana na miliyari 10 zamapound yaciwe kumusaruro wayo nubumwe bwabakozi ba Isale Eko. Amazon yemeje kifilime yayo, \"Gangs of Lagos\", ntacyo yangiza umuntu cyangwa itsinda. Isosiyete kandi yamaganye ubuyobozi bugenzura guverinoma ya Lagos muriki kibazo. "}
{"id": "20756", "revid": "16253", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20756", "title": "The Captain of Nakara", "text": "The Captain of Nakara ni filme iri mu bwoko bwa filme z'urwenya () yo muri Kenya yakozwe mu mwaka wa 2012. Ni Filme yakomotse ku mukino wo mu budage witwa \"\" wanditswe na, ifi filme ubwayo ishingiye ku nkuru y'ubuzima bwa, umugizi wa nabi w'igihe gito wigaragaje nka \"Hauptmann (Kapiteni)\" i Berlin mu 1906. \nInkuru ya Filme.\nUmugizi wa nabi w'igihe gito Muntu (Bernard Safari) yarekuwe muri gereza yo mu gihugu cyahimbwe Nakara cyo muri Afurika. Nyuma y'igihe gito, akunda umukobwa w'umuvugabutumwa gusa yanga kumubwira ubuzima bubi yanyuzemo ahubwo yigira nkaho ari umucuruzi ukomeye akajya yitwara nka nyiri isoko. Kubera ruswa yiganje cyane muri kariya gace, ukuri kwe gutuma ibinyoma bye bibe impamo. Mu myambaro ya gisirikare yibye, Muntu yigira \"Kapiteni wa Nakara\" kandi arengera neza uburenganzira bwe n'ibyishimo, bimuganisha ku mpinduka zitari kuri we wenyine, ahubwo no ku gihugu cyose amaherezo atsindira kuba perezida wa Kwetu!\nIbihembo yahataniye.\nIyi filime yahatanye mu bihembo bya (AMAA) byo muri 2012 yari mu kiciro cya Achievement in Costume Design.\nThe Captain of Nakara kandi yahatanye mu marushanwa ya Free Spirit muri yo mu 2012\nNyuma y'umwaka muri 2013, iyi filime yahatanye mu iserukiramuco rya Filime na Televiziyo bya Pan African Ouagadougou (FESPACO) mu cyiciro cy\u2019amarushanwa ya Digital Video Fiction. Icyiciro cyari gifite abantu 17 batoranijwe baturutse muri Afurika. Niyo nomination yonyine yaturutse muri Kenya muri iki cyiciro."}
{"id": "20757", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20757", "title": "Africa Movie Academy Awards", "text": "Ibihembo bya Afurika Movie Academy Awards ni ibirori ngarukamwaka by'imyidagaduro byo gutanga ibihembo, hagamijwe kwerekana indashyikirwa mu banyamwuga bo muri Afurika ndetse n'abatari Abanyafurika, bagize uruhare mu nyafurika. Ibi bihembo byashinzwe na gusa kuri ubu biyobowe na Africa Film Academy. Ibi birori bifatwa nka bimwe mu birori bikomeye muri Afurika byibanda kuri filme. ndetse rimwe na rimwe babjya babyitiranya nk'ibihembo bya \"Oscars byo muri afurika\". \nAmateka.\nIbirori bya mbere bya Africa Movie Academy Awards byabereye i Yenagoa, muri Leta ya Bayelsa, muri Nijeriya ku ya 30 Gicurasi 2005 ndetse uko myaka yakurikiyeho byagiye biba bibereye mu gace kamwe kugeza 2012, uretse mu mwaka 2008 ubwo yaberaga muri Abuja, FCT ku mpamvu z'umutekano. Mu mwaka wa 2012, ibirori byo gutanga ibihembo byabereye muri Eko Hotels na Suites, Ikirwa cya Victoria, Lagos muri Leta ya Lagos. Ku nshuro ya 9 n'iya 10 bisubira muri Yenagoa, mu gihe muri 2015 byabereye hanze ya Nijeriya ku nshuro ya mbere.\nByakiriwe mu migi itandukanye ya Nijeriya, cyane cyane i Lagos, ndetse rimwe biba ku rwego mpuzamahanga i Kigali mu Rwanda mu mwaka wa 2018. Ibi birori kandi byagiye bibera ahantu hatandukanye harimo inzu ya Jewel Aeida Hall, Eko Hotels na Suites, Centre ya Balmoral, hamwe na Landmark Event Centre i Lagos. Kandi kuva AMAA yatangira yaragutse igera kure ya Nijeriya. Nubwo amakuru arambuye yabigenewe ari make, ariko ibi birori byakuruye isi yose, binyuze mu mijyi yabyakiriye neza ndetse no ku murongo wa interineti cyane cyane mugihe cya COVID-19. Ubu buryo bugaragaza ubushake bwa AMAA bwo kwishyira hamwe no kugera ku mugabane wa Afurika ndetse no hanze yawo.\nIbyiciro.\nMuri 2017 ibihembo bya Africa Movie Academy Awards byari bifite ibyiciro 28 by'ingenzi, Harimo: \nIbyiciro byahagaritswe.\nIbyiciro byinshi byahinduriwe izina, ibindi birahagarikwa n'ibindi birahuzwa. Hasi hari urutonde rwa bimwe mu byiciro byakozweho.\nIngaruka.\nAMAA yashimangiye uruhare rwayo nk'umusemburo wa sinema nyafurika. Bituma filme zikozwe mu ndimi kavukire nazo zigaragaza, ishyigikira inkuru za diaspora, kandi iha umwanya ubuhanga buri tekinike. Ibihembo biteza imbere ubufatanye bwambukiranya imipaka, bikerekana impano nyafurika ku isi yose, kandi bigahugura n'abandi bashya bakizamuka bakora sinema."}
{"id": "20758", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20758", "title": "Jennifer Eliogu", "text": "Jennifer Eliogu (wavutse kuwa 30 Mata 1976) ni umukinnyi wa filime akaba n'umuririmbyi wo muri Nijeriya uzwi cyane mu kuba umukinnyi wa filme. Mu mwaka wa 2016, Eliogu yahawe \"igihembo cyihariye cyo kumenyekana\" muri kubera uruhare yagize mu ruganda rwa sinema rwo muri Nijeriya. Eliogu mu 2014 kubera uruhare yagize mu kongerera ubushobozi abagore, yahawe \"igihembo cy\u2019indashyikirwa\" mu nama nyafurika y\u2019abayobozi bayoboye abagore yabereye muri Amerika.\nUbuzima bwa mbere n'amashuri.\nEliogu akomoka mu mudugudu wa \u1ee4m\u1ee5az\u1ee5 muri muri, agace ko mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bwa Nijeriya ariko yakuriye muri iherereye mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bwa Nijeriya. Eliogu yabonye impamyabumenyi muri abona n'indi yakuye muri. \nUmwuga.\nEliogu mu 1997 yatangiye ku mugaragaro gukina filme ahereye ku yitwa \"House on Fire\". Eliogu yabaye ahagaritse ibya sinema yo muri Nijeriya igihe gito maze yinjira mu muziki mu buryo bw'umwuga mu mwaka wa 2012, maze asohora indirimbo ye ya mbere yise \"Ifunanya\" ndetse iza guhatanira n'igihembo cya Best R&amp;B Video muri \"Nigeria Music Video Awards (NMVA) mri uwo mwaka.\"\nMu bandi bantu bazwi muri yakoranye nabo harimo, Rich Tanksley, Kenneth Okolie, Susan Peters, Bolanle Ninalowo, Moyo Lawal, Desmond Elliot, Rukky Sanda n'abandi. ni umukinnyi ukunda gushishikariza abakinnyi ba filime bakiri bato ko impano ariyo izabageza kure atari ubwambure. \nIbihembo no kumenyekana.\nUmwuga wo gukina.\nEliogu yahawe \"igihembo cyihariye cyo kumenyekana\" muri \"City People Entertainment Awards\" mu 2016. \nAfite kandi igihembo cy'indashyikirwa mu nama Nyafurika y'Abayobozi b'Abagore 2014 yabereye muri Leta zunze ubumwe za Amerika kubera uruhare yagize mu guha ubushobozi abagore. \nUmwuga wa muzika.\nUmushinga w'umuziki wa Eliogu witwa \"Ifunanya\" watowe muri \"Video nziza ya R&amp;B\" muri \"Nigeria Music Video Awards (NMVA)\"\nUbuzima bwite.\nEliogu arubatse kandi afite abana babiri. "}
{"id": "20759", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20759", "title": "Fondasiyo ya Al Basar", "text": "Fondasiyo ya Al-Basar (\u0645\u0624 \u0b15\u0b3e\u0b28\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645\u064a\u0629) ni umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta udaharanira inyungu ukorera muri Arabiya Sawudite. Yashinzwe mu 1989 kugira ngo ikore mu rwego rwo gukumira no kurandura / kurwanya indwara z\u2019ubuhumyi &amp; impumyi. \nIkorana n\u2019ikigo cyita ku buntu n\u2019ubutabazi cya King Salman muri Yemeni, Bangladesh, Sudani, Nijeriya na Pakisitani mu kurwanya ubuhumyi n\u2019indwara z\u2019amaso. akanabaga muri Sudani \nMu bukangurambaga bwa 2019 bwatewe inkunga na King Salman Humanitarian Aid and Relief Centre ku bufatanye na Al Basar International Foundation, abakorerabushake b\u2019ubuvuzi baturutse muri Arabiya Sawudite bahuye n\u2019abarwayi 8000 b\u2019amaso ndetse banabagwa 800 kugira ngo bakure cataracte na glaucoma muri Ibadan, muri Nijeriya, ndetse no muri Lafia muri Leta ya Nasarawa, muri Nijeriya. "}
{"id": "20760", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20760", "title": "Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Abafite Ubumuga bo mu gihugu cya Irilande", "text": "Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Abafite Ubumuga bo mu gihugu cya Irilande (IWA) n\u2019ishyirahamwe ryita kubantu bafite ubumuga bw\u2019umubiri. Ryashinzwe Intego za IWA nuguharanira uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga bw\u2019umubiri binyuze muri politiki rusange, gutanga serivisi zitandukanye, no gutera inkunga abanyamuryango bayo.\nUmuyobozi wambere w\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abafitubumuga bomugihugu cya Irilande yari Fr. Leo Close CM, umukinnyi wamugaye numukoresha wabafitubumuga. \nIWA yatanze serivisi no kwegera abantu 2.064 ahantu 57. "}
{"id": "20761", "revid": "16253", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20761", "title": "Without Pity: A Film About Abilities", "text": "Without Pity: A Film About Abilities ni filme mbarakuri yo muri Amerika yakozwe mu 1996 ikaba iri mu majwi ya Christopher Reeve. Iyi documentaire igaragaza uruhare n'imbaraga abafite ubumuga bagira kugirango babeho ubuzima bwiza kandi butanga umusaruro. Yerekanwe bwa mbere kuri HBO kuwa 8 Ukwakira 1996.\nIncamake.\nAbareba iyi filme bazisanga mu nkuru yavuzweho n'abanyamerika. bazabona inkuru y'Umugore ukiri muto ufite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe wita ku mwana we, babone n'inkur y'umugabo nawe ufite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe umaze imyaka 40 yibana kandi abayeho neza mu mashuri ya colorado.\nIyi filime izatwereka urugendo rw'umwana w'umuhungu w'imyaka 6 utagira amaboko n'amaguru yagiriye ku ishuri aho yasuraga ibiro by'impuguke kuri mudasobwa ifite ubumuga bwo kutabona, ndetse ahahurira n\u2019umwarimu ufite indwara y\u2019igicuri wigisha amateka y\u2019ivangura ryakorerwaga abantu bafite ubumuga. \nNdetse tubona n'inkuru y'umusore uherutse kugira ubumuga atuganiriza uko yahanganye n'indwara y'agahinda gakabije (depression) yagize nyuma yo kumenya ko yagize ubumuga, uko yabyitwayemo, ingamba yafashe n'uko yaje kubinesha agakomeza ubuzima bwe. \nIyi filme igaruka cyane ku gushima abantu bafite ubumuga ku buryo bitwara, ubudaheranwa bwabo, ubushobozi n'uburyo bishakamo ibisubizo."}
{"id": "20762", "revid": "16647", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20762", "title": "Ururimi rw'amarenga rwo mu Rwanda", "text": "Ntabwo bugaragara niba ururimi rw'amarenga cyangwa indimi ziri mu Rwanda. Mu mwaka wa 2006, umushinga w'inkoranyamagambo watangiye guhuza ururimi rw'amarenga nyarwanda byatangajwe mu 2009.\nIcyakora, umushinga ntabwo wari wuzuye, kandi muri 2013 inkoranyamagambo yaje kongerwamo ibyaburaga, ishingiye ku marenga yarasanzwe akoreshwa mu gihugu hose. Ibisobanuro by\u2019umushinga byerekanye ko iyi ari imvugo y\u2019ururimi rumwe, ariko ibyo bitazwi. Gahunda yo gusemura iboneka muri Uganda; ntibizwi niba Ururimi rw'amarenga nyarwanda rufitanye isano n'ururimi rw'amarenga rwo muri Uganda. "}
{"id": "20763", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20763", "title": "Old Cayman Sign Language", "text": "Old Cayman Sign Language nururimi rw'amarenga rwokutumva rwa Grand Cayman mu birwa bya Cayman Islands. Irashobora kuba ifitanye isano nururimi rw'amarenga rwa Providencia. "}
{"id": "20764", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20764", "title": "Igipimo cyo gutesha agaciro", "text": "Igipimo cy'ubumuga ni ijanisha rigamije kwerekana urwego rw'umuntu uhoraho kumubiri cyangwa mumutwe. Ku bantu bagize impanuka cyangwa uburwayi bumara igihe kirekire cyangwa buhoraho mugukoresha igice cyumubiri wabo cyangwa imikorere y'umubiri, igipimo cy'ubumuga gishobora gukoreshwa mugupima ubushobozi bw'umuntu. Ubumuga busobanurwa nko gutandukana cyane n'ubuzima busanzwe bw'imikorere. Ubumuga busobanura neza gutandukana ku imiterere ihamye y'umuntu nubushobozi bwa muntu, hamwe n'ubuvuzi bundi bushya, ingaruka kubikorwa by'umuntu mu buzima bwe buri munsi ntibishobora guhinduka. Ibyo biba byarageze ku rwego aho bashobora gupimwa urwego rw\u2019ihungabana, kandi uwo murwayi aba ageze ku rwego rwitwa \u201cMaximum Medical Improvement (MMI) ni ukuvuga ko nta gukira kurenze ubwo bitegerejwe zitaziguye umuntu afite. nubwo ibyo bitandukanyirizo bitandukanijwe bikunze gukoreshwa nimiryango ya leta nk'igipimo cyubumuga, cyangwa kugena indishyi zikwiye kubera impanuka cyangwa igikomere. Gukoresha ibimenyetso byubuvuzi hamwe n\u2019impuguke zumvikanyweho murwego bizamura uburinganire nuburinganire murwego rwo guta agaciro. \nAmabwiriza ya AMA (American Medical Association) agerageza gushyiraho uburyo buhamye bwo gupima urwego rw\u2019ihungabana hashingiwe ku bipimo bifatika nk\u2019urugero rw\u2019ubumuga bwo kumva rugaragazwa na Decibel Sum Hearing Loss (DSHL) cyangwa ibizamini by\u2019ubushobozi bwo kubona neza (visual acuity tests). \nNubwo hari ubwo buryo bwo kugerageza gushyiraho ihame, amanota y\u2019ihungabana atangwa ku muntu umwe n\u2019abaganga batandukanye rimwe na rimwe aratandukana cyane, bikaba ikibazo kuko bituma haboneka kutajyana n\u2019uburinganire mu isuzuma ry\u2019ihungabana "}
{"id": "20765", "revid": "13361", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20765", "title": "Ikinyamakuru cya Politiki y\u2019ubumuga", "text": "Ikinyamakuru cya Politiki y\u2019abafite ubumuga ni buri gihembwe urungano rwasuzumwe n\u2019ikinyamakuru cy' amasomo gikubiyemo ibyerekeranye n\u2019ubushakashatsi bw\u2019abafite ubumuga, harimo ibibazo bijyanye n\u2019imyitwarire, politiki rusange, n\u2019amategeko yerekeye ababana n\u2019ubumuga. Abanditsi bakuru ni Mitchell Yell (Kaminuza ya Carolina yepfo) na James G. Shriner (Kaminuza ya Illinois). Yashinzwe mu 1990, ubu ikaba isohoka na SAGE Publications ifatanije n\u2019ikigo cya Hammill gishinzwe ubumuga.\nGukuramo no kwerekana.\n\"Ikinyamakuru cya Politiki y\u2019abafite ubumuga\" cyakuweho kandi cyerekanwe muri:\nNk\u2019uko \"ikinyamakuru Citation Reports kibitangaza\" ngo ingaruka zacyo zo mu 2017 1.104,ziza ku mwanya wa 47 mu binyamakuru 69 biri mu cyiciro cyo gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe. "}
{"id": "20766", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20766", "title": "Video:Cholera", "text": "Incamake.\nkolera ni infection y'amara mato na bagiteri \"Vibrio kolera\".\nIbimenyetso.\nIbimenyetso birashobora gutandukana ntanumwe, kugeza byoroheje, bikabije, ariko mubisanzwe harimo umubare munini w'impiswi z'amazi zimara iminsi mike.\nIbindi bimenyetso.\nKuruka no kurwara imitsi nabyo birashobora kubaho.\nUmwuma.\nImpiswi irashobora gukomera cyane, ku buryo itera umwuma ndetse n\u2019ubusumbane bwa electrolyte mu masaha runaka.\nIbimenyetso byo kubura umwuma.\nUmwuma ukabije ushobora guha umuntu amaso yarohamye, uruhu rukonje, kugabanuka kwuruhu, no gukuna amaboko n'amaguru. Umwuma urashobora kandi gutuma uruhu ruhinduka ubururu.\nIgihe cyibimenyetso.\nIbimenyetso mubisanzwe bitangira amasaha abiri kugeza kuminsi itanu nyuma yo guhura.\nImpamvu.\nKolera irashobora guterwa n'ubwoko butandukanye bwa \"kolera ya Vibrio\", hamwe n'ubwoko bumwe na bumwe butera indwara zikomeye kurusha izindi, zishobora gutuma indwara zimwe na zimwe zikomera kurusha izindi.\nGukwirakwiza.\nImpamvu nyamukuru itera kolera ni ukunywa amazi adafite umutekano, yandujwe n'umwanda w'abantu urimo bagiteri, cyangwa ibiryo bidafite umutekano byandujwe n'amazi yanduye.\nIbiryo bitetse nabi.\nIbiryo byo mu nyanja bidatetse ni isoko rusange y\u2019indwara kandi abantu ni bo nyamaswa yonyine yibasiwe.\nImpamvu zishobora guteza ingaruka.\nImpamvu zishobora guteza isuku nke, amazi meza yo kunywa adahagije, n'ubukene.\nIngaruka z'ubushyuhe bukabije ku isi.\nHari impungenge z'uko izamuka ry\u2019inyanja, riterwa n'ubushyuhe bukabije ku isi, bizongera umubare w'indwara.\nGusuzuma.\nKolera irashobora gupimwa mugupima amabyi.\nKwirinda.\nUburyo bwo kwirinda burimo kunoza isuku, kubona amazi meza, n'isuku nziza.\nUrukingo.\nInkingo za kolera zitangwa mu kanwa zitanga uburinzi bufatika bw\u2019indwara mu gihe cy\u2019amezi atandatu, kandi zifite inyungu zinyongera zo kwirinda ubundi bwoko bw'impiswi zatewe na \"E\u00a0coli\".\nUmuti.\nUbuvuzi bwibanze n'ubuvuzi bwo mu kanwa - gusimbuza amazi n'ibisubizo biryoshye kandi by'umunyu. Ibisubizo by'umuceri bi.\nZinc.\nKwiyongera kwa Zinc ni ingirakamaro mu bana.\nIV amazi na antibiotike.\nMugihe gikabije, hashobora gukenerwa amazi yimitsi, nka lactate ya Ringer, kandi antibiyotike irashobora kuba ingirakamaro. Kwipimisha kugirango urebe antibiyotike ya kolera ishobora kwandura irashobora gufasha kuyobora amahitamo.\nEpidemiologiya.\nKolera ifata igereranyo cya 1-point-3 kugeza 4\u00a0miliyoni z'abantu ku isi yose kandi itera 21000 kugeza 143000\u00a0impfu ku mwaka.\nIbihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere.\nNubwo ishyirwa mu ndwara y\u2019icyorezo, ni gake mu bihugu byateye imbere, kandi bigira ingaruka cyane cyane ku bana mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere.\nIndwara vs indwara zidakira.\nKolera ibaho nk'ibyorezo kandi bikurikirana mu bice bimwe na bimwe. Mu turere dufite ibyago byo kwandura indwara harimo Afurika na Aziya y'Amajyepfo y'Uburasirazuba aho usanga abantu hafi ya bose baboneka.\nIbyago by'urupfu.\nIbyago by'urupfu mu babangamiwe ni munsi ya 1%, ariko birashobora kugera kuri 5%. Kutabona uburyo bwo kwivuza byongera cyane ibyago byo gupfa.\nAmateka.\nIbisobanuro bya kolera tubisanga mu kinyejana cya 5 mbere ya Yesu muri Sanskrit. Ubushakashatsi bwa kolera mu Bwongereza bwakozwe na John Snow, hagati ya 1849 na 1854, bwatumye habaho iterambere rikomeye mu bijyanye na epidemiologiya. Indwara ndwi nini zabaye mu myaka 200 ishize, hapfa abantu babarirwa muri za miriyoni."}
{"id": "20768", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20768", "title": "Ibitaro bitanga ubuvuzi busubiza mu buzima busanzwe abarwayi (Dublin)", "text": "Ibitaro bitanga ubuvuzi busubiza mu buzima busanzwe abarwayi (Irish:) i D\u00fan Laoghaire, Dublin, ni ibitaro byatewe inkunga na Leta ya Irilande bitanga ubuvuzi busubiza mu buzima busanzwe abarwayi bafite ubumuga bw'umubiri cyangwa ubwenge kubera uburwayi cyangwa ibikomere. Nubwo biterwa inkunga na leta, ibitaro biri mu nshingano ry\u2019 idini Gatolika, umuryango witwa Bashiki bacu b'Impuhwe. \nAmateka.\nIbitaro byashinzwe igihe umuryango wa bashiki bacu b'Impuhwe babonaga umutungo uzwi ku izina rya \"The Ceders\" i D\u00fan Laoghaire mu 1916.. Ibitaro byashinzwe kubera impamvu yo kuvura igituntu byarangiye kubakwa muri Gashyantare 1918.\nInyubako yari izwi ku izina rya \" Mukobwa wacu w'ibitaro bya Lourdes\" nyuma bihindurwamo ibitaro bitanga ubuvuzi busubiza abantu mubuzima busanzwe muri 1961, muri 1994 bihiduka ibitaro by'igihugu bitanga ubuvuzi busubiza abantu mu buzima busanzwe.\nInkunga y' inyongera y'ibitanda 120 yemejwe mu mwaka wa 2015, Umuyobozi w\u2019Urwego rw\u2019Ubuzima yanenzwe kubura abakozi mu bitaro byatumye ibitanda cumi na bibiri bitaboneka muri Werurwe 2017 nubwo hari umurongo w\u2019 abarwayi bategereje barenga 200 bashaka kwinjira. Ibitaro bifite ibitanda byose hamwe 110 ariko bivugwa ko bidafite ibikoresho bihagije bigendeye k'umuryango ukora ubuvugizi wa \"An Soal\" kimwe n\u2019abakozi bakuru b\u2019ibitaro. "}
{"id": "20769", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20769", "title": "Ubumuga bugira ingaruka mu bushobozi bw'ubwenge", "text": "Hriho ubumuga bugiye butandukanye bugira ingaruka ku bushobozi bw'imitekerereze no kumenya kwa muntu.Iki ni igitekerezo cyagutse gikubiyemo defisit zitandukanye zubwenge cyangwa ubwenge, harimo ubumuga bwubwenge (bwahoze bwitwa \"retardation mental\"), deficits yoroheje cyane kuburyo itujuje ibisabwa nkubumuga bw' ubwenge, ibintu bitandukanye byihariye (nkubumuga bwihariye bwo kwiga), nibibazo byakuwe mubuzima nyuma yo gukomeretsa ubwonko cyangwa indwara zifata ubwonko nka d\u00e9m\u00e9e."}
{"id": "20770", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20770", "title": "Lebanon at the 2010 Asian Para Games", "text": "Lebanon yitabiriye imikino ya Para yomuri Aziya 2010 - Imikino yambere yomuri Aziya Para yabereye i Guangzhou, mu Bushinwa kuva ku ya 13 kugeza ku ya 19 Ukuboza 2010. Abakinnyi baturutse muri Libani begukanye imidari ibiri, barangiza ku mwanya wa 27 ku meza y\u2019imidari. "}
{"id": "20771", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20771", "title": "Zimbabwean sign languages", "text": "Indimi nyinshi z'amarenga zomuri Zimbabwe zateye imbere mubwigenge mubanyeshuri batumva bomumashuri atandukanye ya Zimbabwe kubatumva guhera mu 1940. Ntabwo byumvikana umubare windimi zabo, nkuko ubushakashatsi buke bwakozwe; Ikimenyetso cy'ishuri rya Masvingo kizwiho kuba gitandukanye n'ay'andi mashuri, ariko burishuri bigaragara korifite ururimi rw'amarenga rwihariye, kandi ibyo bitandukanye n'ururimi rusange cyangwa indimi zikoreshwa hanze y'ishuri. \"Ururimi rw'amarenga\", ntayandi mananiza, rwabaye rumwe mundimi zemewe za Zimbabwe hamwe n'Itegeko Nshinga rya 2013. "}
{"id": "20772", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20772", "title": "A Screaming Man", "text": "Umugambi.\nAdam (Youssouf Djaoro), wahoze ari nyampinga wo koga muri Afurika yo hagati, ni umukozi wa pisine muri hoteri nziza. Champ. Mu rwego rw'ubukungu Madamu We, umuyobozi yamumanuye ku izamu kandi umuhungu we Abdel agirwa umukozi wa pisine. Umuyobozi Mukuru waho ahatira Adam gutanga amafaranga kugira ngo urugamba rwa Tchad rurwanya ingabo z\u2019inyeshyamba, rumuhana ko atitabiriye inama yabiteye. Umutware abwira Adamu uburyo yohereje umuhungu we w'imyaka 17 ku rugamba. Abwira Adamu ko afite iminsi itatu yo kwishyura amafaranga kugira ngo ashyigikire. Kugira ngo agarure umwanya we Adam yatanze Abdel mu Ngabo za Chadian Ground Force, n'abasirikare baza murugo rw'umuryango bategura Abdel ku gahato. Adam yongeye akazi ko kuba umukozi wa pisine.\nUmukobwa w'imyaka 17, umukunzi wa Abdel wari utwite, ageze kwa Adamu arajyanwa amwitaho. Amakimbirane arakomera maze abatuye mu music barahunga. Adam abwira umukazana we ubuhemu bwe aravunika. Adam yongeye gutekereza ku mwanya we maze afata moto ye hamwe na sidecar mu Karere k'intambara kugira ngo azane Abdel murugo. Asanga Abdel yakomeretse cyane- ijisho, ijosi, ukuboko kw'iburyo n'inda. Muri iryo joro, Adam yakuye Abdel mu bitaro, amushyira mu kayira kegereye urugo. Mu rugendo Abdel avuga ko yifuza koga mu ruzi ariko Abdel apfa bageze kuruzi. Adamu areremba umurambo muruzi, utwara umurambo.\nAbakinnyi.\nIbiranga firime; \nInsanganyamatsiko.\nUmubano wa Adam na Abdel niwo wibandwaho cyane mu nkuru y\u2019iyi filime, kandi nk'uko umuyobozi abivuga bifitanye isano na Tchad yo muri iki gihe: \"Hagati ya se n'umuhungu ni ugutwara kwibuka, ingirabuzima fatizo, n'umuco. Ni ngombwa cyane hano kuko abagabo bayobora intambara muri Tchad. Imvururu zabereye muri Tchad zimaze imyaka 40 kandi nisewanduje umuhungu we umuco w'intambara, kuko bitabaye ibyo nta mpamvu iboneka.\" Mahamat Saleh Haroun yanze nkana kujya mu magambo arambuye kubyerekeye intambara y'abenegihugu muri Tchad na politiki: \"Filime ivuga uko iyi miterere imeze kandi ntabwo yabonye umwanya hamwe n'inyeshyamba cyangwa guverinoma; mu buzima bwe izo ngabo zombi ntizisobanutse bityo rero ntacyo byaba bitwaye aramutse abaye inyeshyamba cyangwa guverinoma kuko ibyo bitazahagarika intambara.\" \nUmutwe wa film ni amagambo yavuye mucyegeranyo cy\u2019imivugo \"Garuka mu Gihugu Cyanjye kavukire\" na Aim\u00e9 C\u00e9saire. Interuro yuzuye ni \"Umugabo utaka ntabwo ari idubu kubyina\". Haroun avuga ko umuntu nyamukuru Adamu \"avuza induru atuza Imana, ntabwo ari induru irwanya ingorane\". \nUmusaruro.\nIgitekerezo cya firime cyaje mu 2006 mu gihe cyo gutunganya \"Daratt\". Taliki ya 13 Mata ingabo z'inyeshyamba zinjiye muri N'Djamena, umurwa Mukuru wa Tchad, aho Haroun yakoreraga amashusho, maze umusaruro uhita uhagarikwa. Abakozi ba filime, barimo umusore ukina umukinnyi wa mbere wujuje imyaka 18 kuri uwo munsi, bafatiwe mu butayu nta buryo bwo gutumanaho. Ibi byashishikarije Haroun kugerageza gufata ibyiyumviro byo gufungwa yagize muri ibyo birori. \nIsosiyete y'Abafaransa Pili Films na Go\u00ef Go\u00ef Productions ya Tchad bakoze film hamwe. Inkunga y\u2019inyongera yatanzwe n\u2019isosiyete yo mu Bubiligi Entre Chiens et Loups. Mu ngengo y\u2019imari ingana na miliyoni ebyiri z\u2019ama euro harimo inkunga yatanzwe n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019igihugu cy\u2019Ubufaransa cy\u2019Ubukorikori, n\u2019ishoramari mbere yo kugurisha ryaturutse kuri Canal +, Canal Horizons, Cin\u00e9 Cin\u00e9ma na TV5Monde. \nGufata amashusho byabaye mu byumweru bitandatu aho biherereye muri Tchad, guhera 30 Ugushyingo 2009. Umuyobozi yavuze ko gufata amashusho muri N'Djamena ari nta shiti. Icyakora, igihe abo bakozi bafatiraga amashusho ahitwa Ab\u00e9ch\u00e9, ikigo gikomeye cy\u2019ingabo z\u2019inyeshyamba, burigihe wasangaga ubwoba buri muntu wese wagize uruhare mu bicuruzwa. Haroun yabonaga ko ari ikibazo cyo kurangiza filime mbere yuko hagira ikintu kibaho, mu gihe kandi yagerageje kwifashisha impagarara nyazo kuri seti. \nKurekura.\nA Screaming Man yerekanwe bwa mbere taliki ya 16 Gicurasi 2010 mu marushanwa mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya 63. Nyuma yaje kwerekanwa ahantu henshi habera ibirori harimo iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya filime rya Toronto. Ikwirakwizwa rya Pyramide ryasohoye mu ma kinamico yo mu Bufaransa taliki ya 29 Nzeri \nIgisubizo gikomeye.\nFilime yakiriwe neza n'abayinenga. Isubiramo ryegeranya Rotten Tomatoes ivuga ko 89% kuri 36 banegura umwuga bahaye filime isuzuma ryiza, naho impuzandengo ya 7.2 / 10. \nThomas Sotinel yasuzumye film ya \"Le Monde\". Yatekerejeko ifite ubwiza budashidikanywaho, ariko akomeza agira ati: \"Ubu bwiza nabwo buroroshye, kubera ko Mahamat Saleh Haroun atari afite ibikoresho byose nkenerwa kugira ngo yerekane neza icyerekezo cye. Birababaje cyane cyane ko uko ukurikirana kwimuka kw'abaturage ba N'Djamena byerekana neza ko umukinnyi wa filime ashobora guhinduka mu buryo bukomeye igihe isomo rye ribitegetse.\" \nJulien Welter wo muri \"L'Express\" yashimye uburyo Haroun yahisemo kutagira isesengura rinini ku makimbirane yabereye muri Tchad, cyangwa melodrama ivuga ku mibabaro yazanye. Icyifuzo cya Welter ni uko yatekerezaga ko ireme ry'inyandiko ryagabanutse mu gihe cyagatatu, ariko arangiza isubiramo atangaza ko Haroun ari \"umuhanzi wakurikira.\" \nUmunyamerika wanenze ama filime Roger Ebert yavuze ko yishimiye cyane iyi filime, agira ati: \"Ubwiza bwa filime ni ukureba ubuzima bwa Adam, uburyo aha agaciro akazi ke hafi y\u2019umuhungu we, ndetse n\u2019uburyo icyo aricyo yahawe na hoteri y\u2019iburengerazuba byaramurogeye.\" \nIbihembo;.\nFilime yahawe igihembo cya Cannes Film Festival. Ibi byatumye Haroun ataba umuyobozi wa mbere wa Tchad gusa ufite filime mu marushanwa akomeye, ahubwo yanabaye uwambere wegukanye kimwe mu bihembo by'umunsi mukuru. A Screaming Man yatsindiye Silver Hugo kubera amashusho meza mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya filime rya 46 rya Chicago. Youssouf Djaoro yahawe Silver Hugo nk'umukinnyi mwiza. Mu bihembo bya Lumi\u00e8re 2011, byemejwe n\u2019abanyamakuru b\u2019abanyamahanga bafite icyicaro i Paris, iyi filime yatsindiye igihembo cya Filime nziza y\u2019ururimi rw\u2019igifaransa yaturutse hanze y\u2019Ubufaransa. Filime yatorewe igihembo cya Magritte mu cyiciro cya filime nziza mu mahanga muri Coproduction mu 2012, ariko itsindwa na \"Romantics Anonymous\". \nAMASHAKIRO;"}
{"id": "20778", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20778", "title": "Ubumuga bwa antropropologiya", "text": "Ubusobanuro bwa Disability Anthropology(Ubumenyi bwa kinyamuntu ku bafite ubumuga).\n\"Disability Anthropology ni ishami ry'ubumenyi bwa kinyamuntu(anthropology) ryiga ku buryo abantu bafite ubumuga babaho, uburyo bashyikirana n'abandi, n'uko sosiyete ibabona kandi ibafata. Iri shami ntirishyira imbaraga gusa ku bushobozi cyangwa ku ndwara z'umubiri ahubwo rishishikajwe cyane n'imico, imyumvire,amateka n'imibanire y'abantu byose bifitanye isano n'ubumuga.\"\nUrwego rwa antoropologiya y'ubumuga rwibanda ku ngingo zijyanye no kugerwaho, gukora, kwita,eugene, kwerekana indwara n'ibindi byinshi. Intiti ziteza imbere kandi zigasuzuma uburyo bwo gukemura ibibazo cyangwa gufasha kuzana impinduka ku bantu bamugaye. Ingingo y'ubumuga muri antoropologiya yemeza abashakashatsi gukoresha lenzi(lens) ndangamuco hamwe n'uburyo bwa etinorogirafike(ethnolography) kugira ngo bamenye ikimenyane n'\"ubundi\" mu mico. "}
{"id": "20780", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20780", "title": "Omnibus Autism Ikomeza", "text": "Urubanza rwiswe Omnibus Autism Proceeding rwari rugizwe n\u2019imanza esheshatu z\u2019igerageza zaburanishijwe n\u2019abacamanza b\u2019inzobere mu rukiko rwa Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika rushinzwe ibirego by\u2019imari (United States Court of Federal Claims), hagamijwe gusuzuma niba hari isano ihamye hagati y\u2019inkingo na autism. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nKubera ko hari imanza nyinshi cyane zerekeye gahunda y\u2019igihugu yo gutanga indishyi ku bahungabanyijwe n\u2019inkingo (NVICP) zirega zemeza ko inkingo zateje autism zirenga 5000 by\u2019ukuri abavoka b\u2019abarega hamwe n\u2019abacamanza b\u2019inzobere bemeranyije gusuzuma imanza eshatu z\u2019igerageza kugira ngo bamenye niba hari ibimenyetso bihagije bishyigikira isano iri hagati y\u2019inkingo n'indwara y'autism. Bafashe iya mbere mu gusuzuma mu buryo butaziguye niba koko hari ibimenyetso bigaragaza impamvu n\u2019ingaruka hagati y\u2019inkingo na autism \nMu 2002, NVICP, abigiriwemo inama na komite nyobozi ishinzwe gusaba, yashyizeho Omnibus Autism Proceeding yo gukusanya izo manza. Bahisemo gusuzuma imanza esheshatu zipimishije zatanze kimwe cyangwa byinshi mu bikurikira bikurikira ku bijyanye n\u2019inkingo-autism ihuza: \n\u2022 Abavuga ko inkingo za MMR nizindi nkingo zirimo thimerosal zishobora guhuriza hamwe gutera autism.\u2022 Gusaba gushingira ku nkingo zirimo thimerosal zitera autism.\u2022 Kuvuga ko inkingo za MMR zonyine (tutiriwe tuvuga thimerosal) zishobora gutera autism.\nAbayobozi batatu badasanzwe basuzumye ibimenyetso kuri buri kirego. Mu 2009, batanze imyanzuro yabo. Kuri buri kirego, inzobere eshatu zidasanzwe zanzuye ko nta sano riri hagati y'inkingo na autism. "}
{"id": "20781", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20781", "title": "Sexual Assistance (Gufashwa mu gihe cyo gukora imibonano mpuzabitsina)", "text": "Sexual Assistance cg Gufashwa mu gihe cyo gukora imibonano mpuzabitsina ni ubufasha bugenewe Abamugaye kugirango bashobore gukora neza igikorwa cy' neza, bafite uburenganzira busesuye ku mibiri yabo ndetse nabo bakabasha kubikora nk'abandi.] \u200b Bamwe mu bantu bafite Ubumuga bashobora kuba batazi dexterity (ubuhanga bwo gukoresha ingingo z'umubiri) badashoboye kwinyeganyeza (mobility) cyangwa ukundi kwishyira ukizana (freedom) mu bikorwa bigendanye no gukora Imibonano mpuzabitsina ndetse badashoboye no Kwikinisha (masturbation) badafahijwe n'undi muntu cyangwa ikindi kintu kibibafashamo. Ubufasha butangwa rero, buhera mu kwitegura, aribyo birimo kubanza kumva abishatse muriwe kubikora (self grooming), harimo gushobora no kumenya uko bakoresha ibikoresho bijyanye n'icyo gikorwa (using sex aids) cyangwa kubona izo serivisi (sexual services) ndetse n'ubufasha bufatika nko kwihindukiza k'umubiri cyangwa kumufasha kwitenga neza (body movement and positioning) \nImyitwarire no kunegura.\nAbajyanama mu by'ubufasha bw\u2019imibonano mpuzabitsina bemeza ko izi servisi zijya zemerera ababana n\u2019ubumuga kugira nk'uko abandi bantu bose babikora, bityo bagashyira izi serivisi zo gufasha mu gihe cy'mibonano mpuzabitsina mu cyiciro kimwe n\u2019ubundi buryo bwo myiza ya buri muntu. Gusa hakaba hari n'ibindi bitekerezo biriho ko ari uburyo mu mboni zabo bakavugako ko uguharabika umuntu () kandi ibyo bigomba kurwanywa."}
{"id": "20782", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20782", "title": "Imikorere itandukanye (ubumuga)", "text": "uburyo butandukanye bw'imikorere ni ijambo rikwiye mu buryo bwa politike n\u2019imibanire myiza y\u2019ibikenewe basimbuza amagambo, nk'ubumuga, ubumuga n\u2019ubumuga, byatangiye gukoreshwa muri Esipanye mu nyandiko y\u2019ubumenyi, ku bushake bw\u2019abagize ingaruka ku buryo butaziguye, mu 2005. \nIkoreshwa.\nIri jambo rigamije gusimbuza ayandi hamwe na semantique ya pejorative. Itanga icyerekezo kijyanye n'amagambo atari meza, adasebanya kandi adashyigikiwe. Kwemeza iryo jambo murashobora kubisanga mu gitabo \"El Modelo de la Diversidad\" cyanditswe na Agustina Palacios na Javier Roma\u00f1ach, 2007.. Ingero zikoreshwa:"}
{"id": "20783", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20783", "title": "Ikipe y'igihugu ya Misiri y'abamugaye", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu ya Misiri y'abamugaye mu magare ni ikipe y'igihugu y'abamugaye mu magare ya Misiri kandi iyobowe na Federasiyo ya Handball yo mu Misiri. Igihugu cya Egiputa cyageze ku mwanya wa 1 mu nshuro ya gatatu ya Shampiyona y\u2019isi y\u2019ibimuga ya IHF Bane ku ruhande, cyabereye mu Misiri. \nIkipe.\nAmakipe mpuzamahanga yo muri Egiputa muri Shampiyona yisi 2022. \nUmutoza mukuru: Wael Abdelaaty "}
{"id": "20784", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20784", "title": "Ikaramu yerekana inoti", "text": "Ikaramu ikoreshwa mu kumenya impapuro mpimbano z'amafaranga ni ikaramu isiga wino irimo ayode(iodine)ku mpapuro z'amafaranga kugira ngo harebwe niba ari nyazo. Iyo wino ihuye n'ibinyabutaabire bya starch biboneka mu mpapuro zituruka ku giti, ihinduka umukara cyangwa ubururu. Ariko impapuro z'amafaranga nyazo ntizirimo ibinyamisogwe, bityo akamenyetso k'iyo wino kaguma kameze nk'uko kari gasanzwe.\nAyo makaramu akoreshwa mu kumenya impapuro z'amafaranga mpimbano akoreshwa kumenya inoti. Akoreshwa ku noti z'amafaranga y'u Busuwisi(Swiss franc),amayero(euro), n'amadolari y'America, n'izindi. Ubusanzwe impapuro zituruka ku myenda y'ipamba kandi ntizirimo ibinyabutabire by'ibinyabusogwe bihura na iyode(iodine).Iyo iyo karamu ishyizwe ku rupapuro rw'inoti nyayo, akamenyetso isiga kaba umuhondo cyangwa se ntikagaragare.\nIzo karamu zikoreshwa mu kumenya inoti mpimbano zikora neza cyane ku mpapuro z'inoti z'impimbano ziba zaracapwe ku mpapuro zisanzwe zicapa cyangwa zikoreshwa na fotokopi. \nImiterere y'imiti ikoreshwa ku noti z'Amerika zacapwe mbere ya 1960 ituma izo karamu zidatanga ibisubizo nyabyo, bigateza amakosa yo kwemeza ko inoti nyazo ari impimbano.\nUrugero rw'ibi rwabaye mu mwaka wa 2016, aho umunyeshuri w'imyaka 13 yafashwe na polisi nyuma yo kugerageza kwishyura ifunguro rya saa sita akoresheje inoti ya $2 yo muri \"red seal Series 1953\", nyuma y'uko ikaramu y'ishuri ishinzwe kumenya inoti mpimbano itabashije kugaragaza ko iyo noti ari iy'ukuri. \nKwakira.\nAbakora izo karamu bavuga ko izo karamu zibasha kumenya inoti mpimbano nyinshi kandi ko ari uburyo bworoshye bwo kumenya inoti mpimbano budasaba ibikoresho bihenze. Iyi karamu ya mbere yahimbwe n'Umunyabelijike(Belgian).\nAbantu benshi bahakana ubuziranenge bw'izi karamu n'ugukora neza kwazo. Bavuga ko abahanga mu gukora inoti mpimbano badakoresha inote zifite ibinyabusogwe bityo iyi karamu ikaba ishobora kuba yakwibeshya bigatuma badashobora kumenya amafaranga nyiganano ari mu ikirakwizwa. Umutarika n'umushakashatsi ukunda gusuzuma ibintu by'ubupfumu witwa James Randi yagiye yandika kenshi ku kudakora neza kw'izo karamu kandi akagenda azikoresha mu ngero z'inyigisho yavuze ko yigeze kuvugana n\u2019umukozi w\u2019iperereza rya Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika (United States Secret Service inspector) amubaza niba iyo karamu ikora nk\u2019uko bivugwa, maze uwo mukozi amusubiza ati: \u201cntabwo yizewe.\u201d\nUburyo izo karamu zikoramo bishobora kugirwaho ingaruka n'ibintu byo hanze. Urugero, iyo inoti yacishijwe mu isukura(laundry),bitewe n'isabune cyangwa umuti w'umweru(bleach)wakoreshejwe, ishobora kugaragara nk'impimbano kandi ari iya nyayo. \nByongeye kandi, byagaragaye ko iyo noti mpombano igiyeho umuti woroshye urimo vitamin C, ishobora gutanga igisubizo k'ikinyoma kiza(false negative);ni ukuvuga ko iyo karamu ifata iyo noti nk'aho ari impapuro nyazo z'inoti zemewe.\nNigute ushobora kugenzura amafaranga y'amiganano ukoresheje ikaramu?\nIrimo umuti wa ayodine(iodine)uhura n'ibinyabusogwe (biboneka mu biti)byahura bikabyara akamenyetso k'umukara, ubururu bwijimye cyangwa umutuku w'umukaraIyo uwo muti ushyizwe ku mpapuro zishingiye ku nsinga/inziga(fibre) zikoreshwa ku noti nyazo,ntihabaho guhinduka kw'ibara;akamenyetso gahinduka umuhondo woroshye. "}
{"id": "20785", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20785", "title": "Servise zirembo", "text": "Irembo ni urubuga ruriho serivise ziboneka mu Rwanda kandi rucyingerwaho izindi zibigo byubucuruzi zari zisanzwe zitangwa mu buryo bunyuranye birimo birimo guhamagara aba agents bibyo bogo kujya ku iro bikoreraho nubundi bwinshi butatanye."}
{"id": "20786", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20786", "title": "Imikino y'amabara n'ubumuga", "text": "Ikipe y'u Rwanda y'abakobwa yageze ku mukino wa nyuma mu mikino y'isi y'abantu bafite ubumuga bwo mumutwe (Special Olympics world summer Game) yaberaga mu Budage muri 2023, nyuma yo gutsinda Bahrat yo mu buhinde zari zanganije ibitego 2-2, kuri penaliti 4-3..\nU Rwanda rwitabiriye iyi mikino yabere Berlin kuva tariki 17kugeza 25 Kamena mu mikino itatu irimo Umupira w'amaguru, Bocce n'imikino ngorora mubiri mu gusiganwa metero 100"}
{"id": "20787", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20787", "title": "Ubumuga &amp; Sosiyete", "text": "Ubumuga &amp; Sosiyete ni ikinyamakuru cy\u2019ubushakashatsi gisuzumwa n\u2019inzobere mu rwego rw\u2019ubumenyi mubyerekeranye n'ubumuga. Cyatangijwe mu mwaka wa 1986 cyitwa Ubumuga, Uburema &amp; Sosiyete, hanyuma gihindura izina cyitwa Ubumuga \"&amp; Sosiyete\" mu mwaka wa 1994. Gisohorwa na Taylor &amp;amp; Francis naho umwanditsi mukuru ni Michele Moore (Kaminuza ya Essex). Nk\u2019uko \"ikinyamakuru Citation Reports kibitangaza\" ngo iki kinyamakuru gifite ingaruka z\u2019umwaka wa 2017 zingana na 1.212, kiza ku mwanya wa 42 mu binyamakuru 98 biri mu cyiciro \u201cUbumenyi bw\u2019imibereho buvanga ibyiciro bitandukanye\u201d ndetse ku mwanya wa 40 mu binyamakuru 69 byo mu cyiciro cya \"\u201cGusubizaho ubushobozi bw\u2019umuntu\u201d.\" "}
{"id": "20788", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20788", "title": "Ubumuga mu Burundi", "text": "Ababana n'ubumuga mu Burundi bagereranywa ku kuba bagera ku bantu bagera ku 350.000. \nAmateka.\nKuya 26 Mata 2007, u Burundi bwashyize umukono ku Masezerano yerekeye uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga maze bwemeza kuya 22 Gicurasi 2014. Yatangiye gukurikizwa kuya 21 Kamena 2014. "}
{"id": "20789", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20789", "title": "Ubumuga muri Boliviya", "text": "Ubumuga muri Boliviya bivuga ababana n'ubumuga muri Boliviya.\nAmateka.\nBoliviya yashyize umukono ku Masezerano yerekeye uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga ku ya 13 Kanama 2007 ayemeza ku ya 16 Ugushyingo 2009. Yatangiye gukurikizwa ku ya 16 Ukuboza 2009. \nImibare.\nKugeza ubu mu gihugu hari abantu 741,382 bafite ubumuga butandukanye mu gihugu, aho bugabanyijemo ubumuga bwo mu mutwe (abantu 222,410), ubumuga bw'umubiri (abantu 222,410), ubumuga bwo mu mutwe (abantu 259,480) n'ubundi bumuga (abantu 37,070). "}
{"id": "20790", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20790", "title": "Ubumuga muri Kambodiya", "text": "Kugeza mu mwaka wa 2019, abantu 4.9% bo muri Kambodiya bafite imyaka 5 kuzamura bafite ubumuga mu bipimo bitandukanye.\nAmateka.\nKambodiya yemeje amasezerano y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye y\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga n\u2019amasezerano ya VIP ya Marrakesh. \nUbukungu.\nMuri 2019, hari abantu 2,860 bafite ubumuga bakoreshwa na guverinoma ya Kambodiya. "}
{"id": "20791", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20791", "title": "Ubumuga muri Kosta Rika", "text": "Umubare w'abafite ubumuga muri Kosta Rika ni 10.5% by'abaturage. Iki gihugu kiri mu masezerano y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye y\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga kuva mu 2008.\nImibare y'abaturage.\nIbarura rusange ry\u2019igihugu rya 2011 ryerekana ko 10.5% by\u2019aba kosta Rica bafite ubumuga, 52% muri bo ni abagore n\u2019abagabo 48%. Ubumuga bwo kutabona budashobora gukosorwa nindorerwamo cyangwa lens nubumuga bukunze kugaragara (56%). \nAmategeko na politiki.\nKu ya 30 Werurwe 2007, Costa Rica yashyize umukono ku masezerano \"y\u2019umuryango\" w\u2019abibumbye y\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga kandi yemeza ayo masezerano ku ya 1 Ukwakira 2008. Mu rwego rw\u2019amategeko yitwa \"Itegeko ry\u2019ama\u00adhirwe angana\" (Ley de Igualdad de Oportunidades), nta muntu ushobora kubogamirwa cyangwa guhezwa kubera ubumuga, niba bafite ubushobozi bungana n\u2019ubw\u2019abandi. Iri tegeko rishimangira kandi ko ahantu rusange no gutwara abantu hagomba kugira ibikoresho bifasha ababana n'ubumuga kubageraho.\nUmuco.\nGicurasi 28 ni \"D\u00eda Nacional de la Persona con Discapacidad\" (Umunsi w\u2019abafite ubumuga ku rwego rw\u2019igihugu) hagamijwe guteza imbere kubaha abamugaye.\nSiporo.\nIki gihugu cyitabiriye bwa mbere imikino y'abamugaye mu mikino Paralempike yo mu 1992, cyabuze ku nshuro ya 1996, kigaruka mu 2000 kandi gihagarariwe mu mikino Paralympike yose kuva icyo gihe. Kosta Rika ntabwo yigeze yitabira mikino ya Paralympike yo mu gihe cy\u2019imbeho. \nPolitiki.\nIshyaka rya politiki Kuboneka nta guhezwa (\"Partido de Acceso Sin Exclusi\u00f3n\") rifite uburenganzira bw\u2019ubumuga nk\u2019imwe mu ntego zaryo zikomeye, perezida w\u2019ishyaka, kandi guhera mu matora rusange yo mu 2014, umwe mu bagize Inteko ishinga amategeko ni \u00d3scar L\u00f3pez."}
{"id": "20792", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20792", "title": "Ubumuga muri Eritereya", "text": "Ubushakashatsi bwakozwe ku baturage ba Eritereya n\u2019ubuzima muri Eritereya mu mwaka wa 2010, muri Eritereya hari abantu bagera ku 149,103 bafite ubumuga. \nIbyiciro.\nUmubare munini w\u2019abafite ubumuga mu gihugu ni abafite ibibazo byo kubona, ubumuga bwo mu mutwe no kutagenda. \nAmategeko.\nIngingo ya 14 (3), 41 (6) (C) na 51 (1) y\u2019Itegeko Nshinga rya Eritereya zivuga by\u2019umwihariko ku bibazo by\u2019ubumuga mu gihugu, zirimo ubuhezanguni ku bantu bafite ubumuga burabujijwe. Mu itegeko nshinga, guverinoma itegetswe guharanira imibereho myiza no guha abaturage bose, harimo n\u2019abafite ubumuga, umuco, uburezi, ubuzima n\u2019imibereho myiza y\u2019abaturage mu rwego rw\u2019umutungo w\u2019igihugu. \nPolitiki.\nIshami rishinzwe gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe no kwishyira hamwe mu ishami rishinzwe imibereho myiza ya Minisiteri y\u2019umurimo n\u2019imibereho myiza y\u2019abantu ni urwego rwa leta rushinzwe ibibazo bijyanye n\u2019ubumuga n\u2019abafite ubumuga mu gihugu. "}
{"id": "20793", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20793", "title": "Ubumuga muri Gabon", "text": "Ubumuga muri Gabon bivuga ababana n'ubumuga muri Gabon.\nAmateka.\nMu mwaka wa 1995, Gabon yashyizeho itegeko risaba inyubako zose n'imihanda nyabagendwa bigera ku bantu bafite ubumuga. Igihugu cyemeje burundu Amasezerano y\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga mu mwaka wa 2007. Muri 2014, cyemeza protokole y\u2019inyongera ajyanye n\u2019ayo masezerano.. \nImibare.\nKuva mu mwaka wa 2015, 2% by\u2019abaturage ba Gabon bari bafite ubumuga mu rugero rutandukanye, bingana n\u2019abantu 27,100. "}
{"id": "20794", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20794", "title": "Ubumuga muri Gineya-Bissau", "text": "Ubumuga muri Gineya-Bissau bivuga ibibazo bifitanye isano n\u2019abafite ubumuga muri Gineya-Bissau.\nAmateka.\nGineya-Bissau yemeje Amasezerano yerekeye uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga ku ya 24 Nzeri 2014. \nImibare.\nKugeza mu mwaka wa 2021, hari abantu 11,584 bo muri Gineya-Bissau bafite ubumuga butandukanye. "}
{"id": "20795", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20795", "title": "Ubumuga muri Indoneziya", "text": "Ikigereranyo cy\u2019ubwinshi bw\u2019ubumuga muri Indoneziya kiratandukanye cyane ukurikije ibipimo. Ibarura rusange rya Indoneziya ryo mu 2010 rivuga ko 4.29% gusa bo muri Indoneziya bafite ubumuga, aho 3.94% mu bagabo na 4.64% mu bagore. Amakuru akomoka ku bushakashatsi bwo mu ngo bwa Riskesdas bwo mu mwaka wa 2007, hashingiwe ku bisobanuro bivuga kugira ingorane nyinshi nibura mu rwego rumwe rw\u2019imikorere, agaragaza igipimo cy\u2019ubumuga cya 11.05%, aho abagabo bagize 9.40% naho abagore bakagira 12.57%. Ibyiciro byombi byerekana imibare yubumuga izamuka cyane uko imyaka igenda ishira.\nIndoneziya ni igihugu cyasinye ku masezerano y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye y\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga,aho yasinyiye ayo masezerano ku wa 30 Werurwe 2007 kandi iyemeza ku wa 30 Ugushyingo 2011. "}
{"id": "20796", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20796", "title": "Ubumuga muri Lesotho", "text": "Kuva mu mwaka wa 2001, hafi ya 4.2% by\u2019abaturage ba Lesotho bafite ubumuga, mu rugero rutandukanye, kandi kimwe cya gatatu(1/3) cyabo ni abana bari munsi y\u2019imyaka15. \nIbyiciro.\nAbantu bafite ubumuga benshi mu gihugu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona neza, kutumva, kutabasha kugenda neza, ibibazo byo kwibuka, kwifasha mu buzima bwa buri munsi, cyangwa mu itumanaho. \nAmategeko na politiki.\nIngingo ya 33 y'Itegeko Nshinga rya Lesotho iteganya ingingo yo gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe, guhugura no gutuza abantu bafite ubumuga. Lesotho yemeje Amasezerano yerekeye uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga bw\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ku wa 2 Ukuboza 2008. Politiki y\u2019Igihugu yerekeye Ubumuga n\u2019Isubiraho mu Buzima (NDRP) yo mu 2011 igamije gufasha guverinoma ya Lesotho mu gutegura gahunda n\u2019ingamba zireba by\u2019umwihariko abafite ubumuga. \nUbuvugizi.\nIhuriro ry\u2019igihugu ry\u2019amashyirahamwe y\u2019abafite ubumuga rya Lesotho (LNFOD) ryashinzwe mu 1989 nkurwego rwo hejuru rw\u2019imiryango y\u2019abafite ubumuga. Abayigize ni; Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019igihugu ry\u2019abafite ubumuga bw\u2019umubiri (LNAPD), Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe bwa Lesotho (IDAL), Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019igihugu ry\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona (LNLVIP) n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva muri Lesotho (NADL). \nAkazi.\nAbamugaye barenga 65% mugihugu batunzwe n'imiryango yabo ndetse n'abaturanyi kugirango babeho buri munsi. \nSiporo.\nLesotho yakoze imikino yayo y'abamugaye d\u00e9but mu mikino Paralempike yo mu 2000 yabereye i Sydney. Yagiye mu marushanwa yose ya Paralympique yo mu mpeshyi kuva icyo gihe, ariko ntabwo yigeze mu mikino Paralympike. Lesotho ntiratsindira umudari mu mikino Paralympique. "}
{"id": "20797", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20797", "title": "Ubumuga muri Macau", "text": "Ubumuga muri Macau bivuga ibibazo bifitanye isano nabafite ubumuga i Macau, mu Bushinwa.\nAmategeko.\nUbushinwa, harimo na Macau, bwashyize umukono ku masezerano y\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga. Amategeko ya Macau avuga ko kubuza ivangura rishingiye ku bumuga mu burezi, ku kazi, mu kwivuza cyangwa kugera ku zindi serivisi rusange. \nBije.\nGuhuza no gutera inkunga gahunda zifasha abaturage bafite ubumuga bashinzwe na Biro ishinzwe imibereho myiza. \nInyungu.\nKu ya 11 Ukwakira 2017, guverinoma yongereye umubare w'inkunga ebyiri z\u2019abafite ubumuga ku baturage bahoraho hiyongereyeho 6.67% ku nkunga isanzwe y\u2019ubumuga na 7.14% ku nkunga idasanzwe y\u2019ubumuga. \nIbikoresho rusange.\nUbwikorezi.\nIkibuga cy\u2019indege mpuzamahanga cya Macau n\u2019ibibuga by\u2019imodoka z\u2019amato biragerwaho n\u2019abantu bafite ubumuga bafashijwe n\u2019abakozi. Ibiro bishinzwe imibereho myiza itanga kandi ingendo zitishyurwa zijya ku bitaro n\u2019ibigo by\u2019ubuvuzi hifashishijwe bisi ya Rehabilitation. Gutwara abantu na serivisi z'ubukerarugendo ku bamugaye nazo ziraboneka na Macau Barrier Ubukerarugendo bwubuntu. Abanyamaguru muri rusange bafite ibimenyetso byumvikana kandi bazamutse-bakandagira. Aho abantu bafite ubumuga bashobora guhagarara hateganywa ahantu hatandukanye mu bibuga by\u2019imodoka rusange. "}
{"id": "20798", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20798", "title": "Ubumuga muri Mongoliya", "text": "Ubumuga muri Mongoliya bivuga ababana n'ubumuga muri Mongoliya.\nAmateka.\nItegeko rya Mongoliya ryerekeye uburenganzira bwa muntu bw\u2019abafite ubumuga ryashyizweho mu mwaka wa 2016 na Leta nkuru ya Khural. Gahunda y'igihugu ishinzwe uburenganzira, uruhare no kurengera ababana n'ubumuga yemejwe na guverinoma mu mwaka wa 2017 ishyirwa mu bikorwa nyuma. \nIsuzuma ryakozwe n\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubuzima ku isi mu mwaka wa 2018 ryerekanye ko, kimwe n\u2019ibihugu byinshi bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere, ababana n'ubumuga bafite ikibazo cyo gukoresha uburenganzira bwa politiki ndetse n\u2019abaturage, ndetse no kubona uburezi n\u2019akazi. \nImibare.\nKugeza mu mwaka wa 2024, muri Mongoliya hari abantu 115,000 bafite ubumuga butandukanye. Ubwoko bw\u2019abafite ubumuga mu gihugu ni ubumuga bwo kugenda (19.9%), ubumuga bwo mu mutwe (19.0%), ubumuga bwo kutabona (10,6%), kutumva neza (8.2%), kutavuga ururimi (4.0%), guhuriza hamwe (7.5%) n\u2019abandi (30.4%). Abagera kuri 11% muri bo ni abana. \nMu karere.\nMuri 2019 mu Ntara ya Govis\u00fcmber, hari abantu 742 bafite ubumuga, bangana na 4% by'intara. Mu Ntara ya Dornogovi, hari abantu 2,642 bafite ubumuga, bangana na 3.7% by'intara. \nUburezi.\nMu mwaka wa 2023, kaminuza nkuru ya Mongoliya yatangije isomero rifite ibitabo bifata amajwi ku banyeshuri bafite ubumuga. Isomero ryagenewe gusa abo bantu. "}
{"id": "20799", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20799", "title": "Ubumuga muri Namibiya", "text": "Nk\u2019uko Ikigo cy\u2019Igihugu cy\u2019Ibarurishamibare cya Namibia kibivuga, hashingiwe ku bushakashatsi bwo mu mwaka wa 2016 bwiswe Inter-censal Demographic Survey, 5% by'abaturage ba Namibiya bafite ubumuga mu rugero rutandukanye. \nAmateka.\nNamibia yashyize umukono ku Masezerano yerekeye uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga ku ya 25 Mata 2007 ayemeza ku ya 14 Ukuboza 2007. Yatangiye gukurikizwa ku ya 3 Gicurasi 2008. \nIbyiciro.\nKugeza mu mwaka wa 2001, mu bantu bose bafite ubumuga, 35% bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona, 27% bafite ubumuga bwo kugenda burimo amaboko n'amaguru, 21% bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva, 11% bafite ubumuga bwo kutavuga, 5% bafite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe. "}
{"id": "20800", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20800", "title": "Uburenganzira bw\u2019umwana mu Rwanda ku burezi n\u2019imibereho", "text": "Uburenganzira bw\u2019umwana mu Rwanda ku burezi n\u2019imibereho busobanura ihame ry\u2019uko buri mwana agomba kurindwa, kurindwa ihohoterwa, no kubona amahirwe angana yo kwiga no kugira imibereho myiza. Mu Rwanda, Leta, imiryango itegamiye kuri Leta ndetse n\u2019imiryango mpuzamahanga nka UNICEF Rwanda bafatanyiriza hamwe mu gushyira mu bikorwa politiki n\u2019amategeko agamije guteza imbere imibereho y\u2019umwana no kumurinda.\nAmategeko n\u2019ishingiro ry\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019umwana.\nUburenganzira bw\u2019umwana mu Rwanda bushingiye ku Itegeko nshinga rya Repubulika y'u Rwanda n\u2019amasezerano mpuzamahanga, harimo Convention on the Rights of the Child (CRC) yashyiriweho umukono mu 1989.\nAmategeko y\u2019u Rwanda arimo:\nAya mategeko ashimangira ko buri mwana afite uburenganzira bwo kubaho, kurindwa ihohoterwa, kwiga, kugira ubuzima bwiza, no kugira amahirwe angana n\u2019abandi bana bose mu gihugu.\nUburenganzira ku burezi.\nUburezi ni imwe mu nkingi z\u2019ingenzi mu burenganzira bw\u2019umwana mu Rwanda. Minisiteri y\u2019Uburezi (MINEDUC) yashyizeho gahunda yo kugeza uburezi kuri bose (Education for All) aho abana bose bagomba kubona amahirwe angana yo kwiga kuva ku rwego rw\u2019incuke kugeza ku rwego rwisumbuye.\nIreme ry\u2019uburezi.\nU Rwanda rwateye imbere mu kwandikisha abana mu mashuri abanza hafi ku gipimo cya 98%, nk\u2019uko byagaragajwe na UNICEF Rwanda mu 2023. Ariko, hari imbogamizi zikigaragara zirimo ubwinshi bw\u2019abanyeshuri mu ishuri rimwe, ibikoresho bike n\u2019ubuke bw\u2019abarimu bafite ubumenyi bujyanye n\u2019igihe.\nUburezi bw\u2019incuke (ECD).\nGahunda za Early Childhood Development (ECD) zashyizwe imbere kugira ngo abana bato babone serivisi z\u2019uburezi, ubuzima n\u2019imirire myiza mbere y\u2019uko batangira amashuri abanza. Izi gahunda zifatwa nk\u2019urufunguzo rwo kuzamura ireme ry\u2019uburezi ry\u2019umwana kuva akiri muto. Leta y\u2019u Rwanda n\u2019abafatanyabikorwa nka UNICEF n\u2019Imbuto Foundation bafatanya mu kubaka ibigo by\u2019incuke no guhugura abarimu b\u2019abana bato.\nUburezi burimo bose (Inclusive Education).\nMu rwego rwo kurengera abana bafite ubumuga, u Rwanda rwashyizeho gahunda y\u2019uburezi burimo bose, aho abana bose biga hamwe kandi bagahabwa ubufasha bukenewe. Ibi bikorwa birimo kubaka ibyumba by\u2019amashuri bifite uburenganzira kuri bose, gutanga ibikoresho byihariye, no guhugura abarimu mu kwigisha abana bafite ubumuga.\nImibereho y\u2019umwana.\nImibereho myiza y\u2019umwana mu Rwanda yibanda ku buzima, imirire, umutekano, n\u2019uburere mu muryango.\nUbuzima n\u2019imirire.\nLeta y\u2019u Rwanda yashyizeho gahunda yo gutanga ku bana bose, by\u2019umwihariko abaturuka mu miryango ikennye. Hari kandi gahunda za Isange One Stop Center zifasha abana bahohotewe kubona ubufasha bwihuse mu bijyanye n\u2019ubuvuzi, amategeko n\u2019ihungabana.\nUburinzi n\u2019iterambere.\nAbana barengerwa n\u2019amategeko igihe bahura n\u2019ihohoterwa, guta ishuri, cyangwa gukoreshwa imirimo ivunanye. Inzego z\u2019ibanze, ababyeyi n\u2019amashuri bifatanya mu gukurikirana abana bafite ibibazo, binyuze mu bayobozi b\u2019inzego z\u2019ibanze n\u2019abajyanama b\u2019ubuzima. National Commission for Children ikorana n\u2019amadini, amashuri n\u2019imiryango itegamiye kuri Leta mu bukangurambaga bwo kurengera abana.\nImibare n\u2019ibigaragara mu bushakashatsi.\nNk\u2019uko EICV7 Thematic Report: Education (2023/24) yabigaragaje, 47% by\u2019abana barangiza amashuri abanza badafite ubumenyi bw\u2019ibanze bukwiye mu gusoma no mu mibare. Ariko, ubwitabire mu mashuri y\u2019incuke n\u2019ayisumbuye bwiyongereye ku kigero cyisumbuye cyane ugereranyije n\u2019imyaka yashize, bigaragaza intambwe ishimishije mu rwego rw\u2019uburezi.\nImbogamizi zihari.\nUbuke bw\u2019ibikoresho n\u2019abarimu mu mashuri y\u2019ibanze.\nIbibazo by\u2019imibereho mibi bituma bamwe bata ishuri.\nAbana bafite ubumuga batarabona amahirwe angana n\u2019abandi.\nIhohoterwa rikorerwa abana rikitabirwa kugaragazwa n\u2019amategeko.\nInama n\u2019ingamba z\u2019iterambere.\nGukomeza gushora imari mu burezi bw\u2019incuke n\u2019ireme ry\u2019uburezi.\nGuhugura abarimu ku buryo bwo kwigisha abana bafite ubumuga.\nGukomeza gahunda z\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019umwana mu nzego z\u2019ibanze no mu miryango.\nGukoresha ubushakashatsi buhoraho mu gusuzuma ireme ry\u2019uburezi n\u2019imibereho y\u2019abana."}
{"id": "20805", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20805", "title": "Ubumuga muri Papuwa Niyugine", "text": "Ubumuga muri Papuwa Niyugine ni ikibazo kigihangayikishije gikomeje, aho ibikorwa remezo bidahagije bikunze kubuza abafite ubumuga kubona uburezi, serivisi z\u2019ubuvuzi, akazi, n\u2019izindi serivisi z\u2019ibanze. Kugerwaho ni ikibazo gikomeye, cyane cyane ku bana cyangwa ku bagore bafite ubumuga, bahura n'inzitizi zo kubona serivisi z'ubuzima, uburezi, ubwikorezi rusange, n'ibiro bya leta.. Guverinoma yemeye uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga, ariko kumenya ubwo burenganzira bisaba ko hashyirwaho uburyo bunoze bw\u2019amategeko n\u2019amabwiriza, gukusanya umutungo, hamwe n\u2019ubufatanye bukomeye n\u2019igihugu. \nIhame rya \"Ntihagire umuntu n'umwe usiga inyuma\", ingamba nka Loni \u2019Abagore zishyigikira guverinoma mu kuzamura uruhare rw\u2019abaturage mu bafite ubumuga, gushyira mu bikorwa amasezerano mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga, no guharanira gahunda y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye 2030 igamije iterambere rirambye. "}
{"id": "20806", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20806", "title": "Imibereho y\u2019ababana n\u2019ubumuga mu Rwanda", "text": "Imibereho y\u2019ababana n\u2019ubumuga mu Rwanda igaragaza uko abana bafite ubumuga babaho, uburyo Leta n\u2019abafatanyabikorwa babafasha, n\u2019imbogamizi bagihura nazo mu burezi, ubuzima n\u2019imibereho. Ubumuga bushobora kuba ubw\u2019umubiri, ubw\u2019ubwenge, ubw\u2019amarangamutima cyangwa ubuvukanwa. Abana bafite ubumuga bakeneye ubufasha bwihariye kugira ngo bagere ku burenganzira bwabo nk\u2019abandi bana bose. \nAmategeko n\u2019amabwiriza abigenga.\nItegeko n\u00b0 01/2007 ryo ku wa 21 Gicurasi 2007 rigena uburyo bwo kurengera abantu bafite ubumuga mu Rwanda. Rishyiraho uburyo bwo gutanga uburezi bukwiye no gushyigikira abantu bafite ubumuga mu buzima bwabo bwa buri munsi.\nNanone, Itegeko No 54/2011 ryerekeye uburenganzira n\u2019itegurwa ry\u2019umwana rifasha mu kurengera abana bafite ubumuga. Itegeko No 54/2011 rigena uburenganzira n\u2019itegurwa ry\u2019umwana mu Rwanda.\nLeta y\u2019u Rwanda yashyizeho politiki y\u2019uburezi burimo bose (\"Inclusive Education Policy\") kugira ngo abana bafite ubumuga babone amahirwe angana n\u2019abandi mu burezi no mu buzima.\nImibereho y\u2019abana bafite ubumuga.\nUburezi.\nMu mashuri y\u2019incuke n\u2019abanza, abana bafite ubumuga bakunze guhura n\u2019ibibazo byo kubona ibikoresho bibafasha cyangwa abarimu bafite ubumenyi mu burezi bwihariye. Leta yashyizeho gahunda y\u2019abafasha b\u2019amashuri (\"teacher assistants\") n\u2019amashuri y\u2019icyitegererezo yita ku burezi burimo bose.\nMu mashuri yisumbuye, hari ibigo bimwe na bimwe byashyizeho uburyo bwo gufasha abanyeshuri bafite ubumuga gukurikira amasomo, ariko ibikoresho n\u2019imfashanyigisho ziracyari nke.\nUbuzima n\u2019imibereho.\nAbana bafite ubumuga bahura n\u2019imbogamizi mu kubona serivisi z\u2019ubuzima, harimo kugenzurwa hakiri kare (\"screening\") n\u2019ibikoresho bibafasha mu mibereho ya buri munsi. Mu miryango itishoboye, ubukene butuma bamwe batitabwaho uko bikwiye.\nKurindwa no kwitabwaho mu muryango.\nAbana bafite ubumuga bamwe bahura n\u2019ihezwa rikomoka ku myumvire, cyangwa bagatereranwa n\u2019imiryango. Leta n\u2019imiryango itegamiye kuri Leta bakoze ubukangurambaga bwo guteza imbere imyumvire yo kwakira no kurengera abo bana.\nIngero z\u2019uturere.\nMu karere ka Musanze, umuryango \"Ubumwe Community Center\" utera inkunga abana bafite ubumuga babona ibikoresho n\u2019ubufasha bwihariye mu mashuri. \nMu mujyi wa Kigali, ikigo \"HVP Gatagara\" cyakira abana bafite ubumuga bw\u2019ingingo n\u2019ubw\u2019ubwenge, kikabafasha mu myigire n\u2019ubuzima.\nAbana bafite ubumuga mu karere ka Huye bafashwa ku bitaro bya Kabutare kubona ubuvuzi n\u2019ibikoresho byo kugenda biturutse ku bufatanye n\u2019umushinga nyarwanda Rwanda Resilience and Grounding Organization nk\u2019uko byatangajwe mu nkuru ya Igihe.com. \nMu karere ka Rutsiro, gahunda y\u2019uburezi burimo bose igenda ifasha abana bafite ubumuga kwinjizwa mu mashuri y\u2019ibanze, nubwo imbogamizi z\u2019imihanda n\u2019ibikoresho bigihari nk'uko bigaragara kurubuga rw'akarere ka Rutsiro.\nUmusozo.\nAbana bafite ubumuga mu Rwanda bafite amahirwe menshi yo guteza imbere imibereho yabo, ariko haracyari imbogamizi nyinshi. Imbaraga za Leta, imiryango n\u2019abaturage muri rusange zigomba guhurizwa hamwe kugira ngo buri mwana abone uburenganzira bungana n\u2019ubw\u2019abandi."}
{"id": "20807", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20807", "title": "Uburenganzira bw'Abagore mu Rwanda n'Iterambere ry'Umugore", "text": "Uburenganzira bw'Abagore mu Rwanda ni imwe mu ngingo zafashije igihugu kugera ku rwego rwo hejuru rw'uburinganire n'iterambere ry'imibereho myiza. U Rwanda rwabaye igihugu cya mbere ku isi rufite abagore benshi mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko, rugera kuri 63.3% by\u2019intebe mu mwaka wa 2024.\nMu myaka yakurikiye Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, Leta y\u2019u Rwanda yashyize imbere politiki n\u2019amategeko agamije kugarura uburenganzira bw\u2019umugore, kumurinda ihohoterwa no kumufasha kugira uruhare mu bukungu n\u2019imiyoborere y\u2019igihugu.\nIyi nyandiko isuzuma amateka y\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abagore, uko byagiye byiyongera, intambwe imaze guterwa, imbogamizi zisigaye, n\u2019uko iterambere ry\u2019umugore rifasha igihugu mu buryo bw\u2019imibereho, ubukungu n\u2019imiyoborere.\nAmateka y'Uburenganzira bw'Abagore mu Rwanda.\nMbere ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, abagore mu Rwanda bari bafite uruhare ruto cyane mu miyoborere n\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019igihugu. Imyumvire ya kera yashyiraga umugore mu rugo, ikamugabanyiriza amahirwe yo kwiga no kugira umutungo.\nNyuma ya 1994, gahunda zinyuranye zashyizweho, zirimo iyubahirizwa ry\u2019uburinganire mu mategeko, gushyiraho Ministeri y\u2019Uburinganire n\u2019Iterambere ry\u2019Umuryango (MIGEPROF), ndetse no kubaka inzego zishinzwe kugenzura ishyirwa mu bikorwa ry\u2019uburinganire nka Gender Monitoring Office.\nIbi byatumye umugore w\u2019Umunyarwanda ava mu rwego rwo kuba \u201cufasha mu rugo\u201d akajya mu rwego rw\u2019umuyobozi, umushoramari, umucuruzi cyangwa umuhinzi ufite uburenganzira busesuye bwo gucunga umutungo we bwite.\nAmategeko n'Amasezerano Mpuzamahanga ashingiye ku Burenganzira bw'Abagore.\nLeta y\u2019u Rwanda yashyizeho uburyo bw\u2019amategeko buha umugore uburenganzira bungana n\u2019ubw\u2019umugabo mu nzego zose. Ibi bigaragara cyane mu:\nMu rwego rw\u2019imbere mu gihugu, hashyizweho amategeko asobanutse yerekeye:\nImibereho n\u2019Imibare y\u2019Uburenganzira bw\u2019Abagore mu Rwanda.\nMu myaka ya vuba, imibare igaragaza ko abagore mu Rwanda bagenda bagira uruhare runini mu nzego zose z\u2019ubuzima \u2013 uburezi, ubukungu, ubuzima, n\u2019imiyoborere.\nUburezi.\nMu rwego rw\u2019uburezi, U Rwanda rwashyizeho gahunda yo gutuma abakobwa bagira amahirwe angana n\u2019abahungu mu mashuri yose. Kugeza mu mwaka wa 2023, abakobwa bigaga mu mashuri yisumbuye bari 59.3%, mu gihe abahungu bari 40.7%. Muri kaminuza, umubare w\u2019abagore wiyongereye ugera kuri 46.2% mu mwaka wa 2024. Leta yashyizeho porogaramu nka \u201cGirls\u2019 Education Policy\u201d n\u2019iyitwa \u201cSTEM for Girls\u201d igamije kongera ubwitabire bw\u2019abakobwa mu masomo y\u2019ubumenyi, ikoranabuhanga n\u2019imibare.\nUbuzima.\nMu rwego rw\u2019ubuzima, abagore bashobora kubona serivisi z\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019imyororokere, kuboneza urubyaro, no kuboneza gahunda y\u2019ababyeyi. 98% by\u2019abagore batwite bitabira nibura uruzinduko rumwe kwa muganga mbere yo kubyara. Indangamuntu y\u2019igihugu (Mutuelle de Sant\u00e9) yatumye abagore benshi bashobora kubona serivisi z\u2019ubuzima ku giciro gito, bituma urupfu rw\u2019ababyeyi rugabanyuka cyane kuva ku 1071 ku bana 100,000 bavuka (mu 2000) rugera kuri 210 mu 2023.\nUbukungu.\nAbagore bagira uruhare rukomeye mu bukungu bw\u2019igihugu. 68.9% by\u2019abaturage bakora ubuhinzi, kandi 94.8% by\u2019abagore bafite ubutaka butangwa n\u2019amategeko. Nubwo abagore bafite uruhare mu buhinzi, abashobora kubona inguzanyo mu mabanki baracyari 35% gusa ugereranyije n\u2019abagabo 65%. Leta yashyizeho gahunda \u201cWomen Guarantee Fund\u201d ifasha abagore kubona inguzanyo mu bikorwa by\u2019ubucuruzi no kwihangira imirimo.\nImiyoborere n'Ubutabera.\nAbagore mu Rwanda bafite uruhare runini mu miyoborere. Mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko, abagore bafite 63.3% by\u2019intebe, mu gihe mu Nama Njyanama z\u2019Uturere bari 49%. Mu rwego rw\u2019ubutabera, 52% by\u2019abacamanza ni abagore, ndetse 48% by\u2019abashinjacyaha bakuru ni abagore.\nIntambwe zimaze guterwa.\nU Rwanda rufatwa nk\u2019igihugu cy\u2019intangarugero muri Afurika mu gushyira mu bikorwa uburinganire n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019umugore.\nAmavugurura mu Mategeko.\nAmategeko yo kurwanya ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina, ayo ku mitungo, n\u2019ayo ku butaka yahawe imbaraga, bituma abagore bagira uburenganzira busesuye. Ibi byagize uruhare rukomeye mu kugabanya ihohoterwa no kongera umutekano w\u2019umugore mu muryango.\nPolitiki n\u2019Ubukangurambaga.\nPorogaramu nka HeForShe Rwanda yatumye abagabo nabo baba abafatanyabikorwa mu rugamba rwo guteza imbere uburinganire. Hari kandi gahunda za Leta ziteza imbere abagore mu bucuruzi n\u2019ubuhinzi nka \u201cHanga Umurimo\u201d, \u201cMade in Rwanda\u201d, na \u201cKuremera Program\u201d.\nUruhare rw\u2019Imiryango Mpuzamahanga.\nImiryango nka UN Women, USAID, na ActionAid yatanze inkunga mu bikorwa by\u2019ubukungu n\u2019uburezi bw\u2019abagore, ishyiraho amahugurwa n\u2019amikoro yo guteza imbere ubushobozi bw\u2019abagore mu cyaro.\nImbogamizi zisigaye.\nNubwo intambwe imaze guterwa ari nyinshi, haracyari imbogamizi mu nzego zimwe.\nImyumvire n\u2019Umuco.\nHari ibice by\u2019igihugu bigifite imyumvire ya kera igaragaza umugore nk\u2019udashobora gufata ibyemezo cyangwa kuyobora. Ibi bigira ingaruka ku bwisanzure n\u2019ubushobozi bwe mu miyoborere y\u2019aho atuye.\nIhohoterwa rishingiye ku Gitsina.\nNubwo amategeko ahari, ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina riracyabaho cyane mu ngo. 31% by\u2019abagore baracyavuga ko bahura n\u2019ihohoterwa ryo mu ngo. Gahunda zo gukumira ihohoterwa, nka Isange One Stop Centre, zafashije gutanga ubufasha bwihuse ariko zikenewe mu gihugu hose.\nUbukungu n\u2019Ikoranabuhanga.\nAbagore mu cyaro bafite amahirwe make yo kubona ikoranabuhanga. 64% gusa ni bo bafite telefone ngendanwa, mu gihe 32% gusa bafite interineti. Ibi bituma bagira uruhare ruke mu bucuruzi bushingiye ku ikoranabuhanga.\nIngaruka z\u2019Iterambere ry\u2019Umugore ku gihugu.\nIterambere ry\u2019umugore ryagize uruhare rukomeye mu kubaka ubukungu n\u2019imibereho myiza mu Rwanda.\nMu Bukungu.\nKongerera abagore ubushobozi byatumye ubukungu bw\u2019igihugu bwiyongera. Inyigo ya World Bank igaragaza ko uburinganire mu bukungu bwongereye umusaruro w\u2019igihugu ku gipimo cya 2% buri mwaka.\nMu Muryango n'Ubuzima.\nAbagore bafite ubushobozi n\u2019ubumenyi bafasha mu iterambere ry\u2019imiryango yabo, bakagira uruhare mu kurera neza, kubungabunga ubuzima no guteza imbere uburezi bw\u2019abana.\nMu Miyoborere.\nUbwitabire bw\u2019abagore mu miyoborere bwagize uruhare mu gukumira ruswa no kuzamura imikorere y\u2019inzego za Leta.\nKu rwego mpuzamahanga.\nU Rwanda ruri mu bihugu 10 bya mbere ku isi mu kigereranyo cy\u2019uburinganire, rukaba urutonde rwa 6 ku Isi muri Global Gender Gap Report 2024.\nAmayeri n\u2019Inama z\u2019Iterambere.\nKugira ngo iterambere ry\u2019umugore mu Rwanda rikomeze kugenda neza kandi rirambye, hashyizweho amayeri n\u2019inama mu nzego zitandukanye:\nImibereho y\u2019Abagore n\u2019Inkuru Zifatika.\nMu rwego rwo kugaragaza iterambere ry\u2019umugore mu Rwanda, hari inkuru zifatika z\u2019abagore bahinduye imibereho yabo n\u2019iy\u2019imiryango yabo. Izi nkuru zerekana uko amategeko, gahunda za Leta, n\u2019imikoranire y\u2019abagore mu bukungu n\u2019uburezi bihuriza hamwe.\nUmusozo.\nIterambere ry\u2019umugore mu Rwanda ryagaragaje ko uburinganire ari urufunguzo rwo kugera ku iterambere rirambye. Abagore bafite uruhare mu miyoborere, ubukungu, uburezi, ubuzima, n\u2019imibereho myiza y\u2019imiryango.\nNk\u2019uko imibare yerekana, u Rwanda ruri mu bihugu bya mbere ku isi mu gushyira mu bikorwa uburinganire, kandi politiki z\u2019igihugu n\u2019amategeko y\u2019imbere mu gihugu byahindutse intangarugero muri Afurika. Gukomeza gushyira imbere uburezi, ubushobozi, uburinganire mu butabera n\u2019ubukungu bizafasha umugore kugira uruhare rugaragara kandi rirambye mu iterambere ry\u2019igihugu."}
{"id": "20808", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20808", "title": "Ikipe yumupira wamaguru yigihugu yubwongereza", "text": "Itsinda ry\u2019u Bwongereza ry\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe (LD) ni imwe mu makipe umunani y\u2019ubumuga ashyigikiwe n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umupira wamaguru. Kugira ngo umukinnyi ajye muri iri tsinda, agomba kuba afite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe, afite IQ iri munsi cyangwa ingana na 70\u201375, nk\u2019uko bisobanurwa n\u2019 Ishami ry\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Abibumbye ryita ku Buzima (OMS). Nanone kandi, umukinnyi agomba kuba yarahawe uburezi bwihariye, cyangwa yaritabiriye akazi cyangwa serivisi z\u2019ituzanwa hagati y\u2019imyaka 0 kugeza kuri 18. \nItsinda ry\u2019u Bwongereza ry\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe (England LD team) ryatsindiye igikombe cy\u2019isi cy\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe mu mikino ya INAS mu mwaka wa 2002, ubwo ryatsindaga Ubuholandi (Netherlands) ibitego 2\u20131 kuri Stade Yokohama, mu Buyapani, muri Kanama 2002. Mu kwezi kwa Kanama 2003, bageze ku mukino wa nyuma w\u2019irushanwa rya Learning Disabilities European Championships, ariko batsindirwa ibitego 2\u20131 n\u2019Ubuholandi muri Portugal. Mu mwaka wa 2004, muri Kanama, babaye abanyarukiko b\u2019isi mu mikino ya mbere yiswe Global Games, batsinda Polonye ibitego 4\u20131 ku mukino wa nyuma wabereye i Bolln\u00e4s, muri Su\u00e8de (Sweden). Ariko, abari bafite igikombe cy\u2019isi batsinzwe mu mikino ya \u00bc cy\u2019irushanwa (quarter finals) y\u2019irushanwa rya INAS FID World Football Championship mu mwaka wa 2006, batsindwa ibitego 4\u20131 na Arabie Saoudite (Saudi Arabia) i Recklinghausen, mu Budage. "}
{"id": "20809", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20809", "title": "Uburenganzira bwo Gutanga Ibitekerezo", "text": "Uburenganzira bwo gutanga ibitekerezo ni kimwe mu burenganzira bwa muntu bw\u2019ingenzi kandi bwemewe n\u2019Itegeko Nshinga rya Repubulika y\u2019u Rwanda rya 2003. Ubu burenganzira burimo ubwisanzure bwo kuvuga, gucapa ibitabo, gukora itangazamakuru, no kugaragaza ibitekerezo mu ruhame.\nNubwo iri burenganzira ryubahirizwa ku mpapuro, mu Rwanda haracyagaragara imbogamizi zimwe zishingiye ku amategeko, umutekano w\u2019igihugu, n\u2019imyitwarire y\u2019abantu ku giti cyabo.\nUbwisanzure mu Itangazamakuru.\nMu Rwanda, itangazamakuru ryiyongera ku buryo bugaragara, haba mu binyamakuru byandika, amaradio, televiziyo, ndetse na internet. Ariko abanyamakuru bakunze guhura n\u2019ibihano mu gihe bavuze ibitangaje bitemewe cyangwa bavuze ku nsanganyamatsiko zifitanye isano n\u2019umutekano w\u2019igihugu.\nImbogamizi.\n1. Ibyemezo bishingiye ku mategeko: Amategeko akumira amagambo agira icyo ahungabanya ku butegetsi cyangwa ku mutekano w\u2019igihugu, rimwe na rimwe bikaba byangiza ubwisanzure bw\u2019abantu ku giti cyabo. \n2. Ihohoterwa ku batanga ibitekerezo: Hari abanyamakuru n\u2019abaharanira uburenganzira bw\u2019ikiremwamuntu bahohoterwa cyangwa bakorerwa ibihano kubera ibitekerezo byabo. \n3. Imyumvire y\u2019abaturage: Abantu bamwe baracyafite imyumvire yo gutinya kuvuga ibitekerezo byabo, cyane cyane ku nsanganyamatsiko zishingiye kuri politike.\nIbyagezweho.\n- Hariho gutanga amahugurwa ku bitangazamakuru n\u2019abaturage ku burenganzira bwabo bwo gutanga ibitekerezo. \n- Gahunda za Leta n\u2019imiryango mpuzamahanga zashyigikiye ikoranabuhanga rituma abaturage bashobora gutanga ibitekerezo ku mbuga zemewe n\u2019amategeko."}
{"id": "20810", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20810", "title": "Inkunga ya Dyslexia muri Amerika", "text": "Imiryango imwe n\u2019imwe y\u2019ubugiraneza, nk\u2019Ishingiro rya Scottish Rite Foundation, yafashe inshingano zo gukora ibizamini bisuzuma indwara yo kutabasha gusoma neza (dyslexia) no gutegura amasomo n\u2019ibikoresho byo kwigisha, akenshi bitangwa ku buntu, ku barimu n\u2019abanyeshuri. "}
{"id": "20811", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20811", "title": "Amasezerano mpuzamahanga ku burenganzira mu bukungu, imibereho myiza n\u2019umuco", "text": "masezerano mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ubukungu, imibereho myiza n\u2019umuco (ICESCR) ni amasezerano y\u2019ibihugu byinshi yemejwe n\u2019Inteko (GA) ku ya 16 Ukuboza 1966 binyuze muri GA. Icyemezo 2200A (XXI), gitangira gukurikizwa ku Mutarama 1976. Uburenganzira bukubiyemo uburenganzira bw'umurimo, uburenganzira ku buzima, uburenganzira bwo kwiga, n'uburenganzira ku mibereho ihagije. Kuva muri Kanama 2025, Amasezerano afite amashyaka 173. Ibindi bihugu bine, harimo na Leta zunze ubumwe z\u2019Amerika, byashyize umukono ku masezerano ariko ntibyemeza ayo masezerano.\nIncamake.\nAmasezerano akurikiza imiterere ya UDHR na ICCPR, hamwe nintangiriro ningingo mirongo itatu nimwe, igabanijwemo ibice bitanu. "}
{"id": "20812", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20812", "title": "Uburenganzira ku Rukiko Ruteza Imbere Ubutabera", "text": "Uburenganzira ku rukiko ruteza imbere ubutabera ni kimwe mu burenganzira bw\u2019ibanze bwa buri muntu. Buri wese mu Rwanda afite uburenganzira bwo kubona ubutabera butabogamye, bwihuse kandi bukurikije amategeko. Iri burenganzira ryubahirizwa n\u2019amategeko y\u2019igihugu, Itegeko Nshinga, ndetse n\u2019amasezerano mpuzamahanga u Rwanda rwasinye.\nUburyo Urukiko Ruteza Imbere Ubutabera Bukora.\n1. Inzira z\u2019Amategeko: Buri muntu ashobora kujya mu rukiko agashaka ubutabera igihe yahanganye n\u2019ikibazo cy\u2019amategeko cyangwa impapuro z\u2019amakosa. \n2. Uburenganzira bwo Guhabwa Umunyamategeko:Buri wese afite uburenganzira bwo kubona umwunganizi mu rukiko. \n3. Ubutabera bwihuse: Urukiko rufite inshingano zo gutanga ubutabera mu gihe gito kandi bukurikije amategeko kugira ngo abantu batagwizwa n\u2019akarengane."}
{"id": "20814", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20814", "title": "Inkunga ya Dyslexia muri Repubulika ya Irlande", "text": "Mu Gihugu cya Repubulika ya Irilande, abantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabasha gusoma neza (dyslexia), cyane cyane abana bo mu mashuri, bashobora gufashwa n\u2019uburyo butandukanye burimo: gufashwa kwigira ku giti cyabo n\u2019abarimu b\u2019inzobere mu myigishirize, gukoresha ibikoresho bya mudasobwa bifite ubushobozi bwo gusoma inyandiko (text-to-speech), gukosora inyuguti no guhanga amagambo (word prediction); ndetse no gukoresha amataratara afite amabara n\u2019izindi ngamba nyinshi zitandukanye. Uburyo buhitamo gufasha umuntu bushingira ku mimerere ye yihariye. Abantu bo muri Irilande y'Amajyaruguru bafashwa na serivisi zitangwa n\u2019imiryango ishinzwe gufasha abafite Dyslexia mu Bwongereza.\nUburezi bwibanze.\nImfashanyigisho.\nUkurikije urwego rwubumuga, abanyeshuri barashobora guhabwa inkunga nubufasha bwihariye akeneye.\nGusonerwa ururimi rwa Irilande.\nUrurimi rw\u2019Igihugu rwa Irlande (Irish) ni isomo ribanza kandi risabwa ku banyeshuri bose. Ariko, abanyeshuri bafite ubumuga bwo kutabasha gusoma neza (dyslexia) bashobora gusaba gusonerwa iri somo, kugira ngo bibande ku kwiga ururimi rw\u2019Icyongereza. \nIbizamini.\nAbanyeshuri bakeneye ubufasha mu gukora ibizamini bya leta (nk\u2019abandikira ibisubizo cyangwa abakoresha poroseseur yo kwandika ku mudasobwa) bashobora gusaba uburenganzira bwo koroherezwa binyuze muri gahunda yitwa Reasonable Accommodation in the Certificate Examinations (RACE). Mu mwaka wa 2015, abanyeshuri bagera kuri 9,000 ni bo bakeneye ubu bufasha. \nUrwego rwa gatatu.\nAbanyeshuri bafite ubumuga bahabwa ubufasha bwihariye ndetse n\u2019uburyo bwo kwinjira muri kaminuza n'amashuri makuru binyuze muri gahunda yitwa Disability Access Route to Education (DARE). Mu rwego rw\u2019iyi gahunda, dyslexia is recognized nka ubumuga bwihariye mu myigire (Specific Learning Difficulty \u2013 SLD). Amwe mu mashuri makuru na kaminuza ateganyiriza imyanya yihariye aba banyeshuri, ku buryo rimwe na rimwe ayo myanya ihabwa abatsindiye amanota make kurusha asabwa muri gahunda isanzwe ya CAO (Central Applications Office)."}
{"id": "20815", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20815", "title": "Uburenganzira ku Mirimo mu Rwanda", "text": "Uburenganzira ku mirimo ni kimwe mu burenganzira bw\u2019ingenzi bwa muntu, bukubiye mu Itegeko Nshinga rya Repubulika y\u2019u Rwanda rya 2003. Buri muntu afite uburenganzira bwo gukora, kubona akazi kagendanye n\u2019ubushobozi bwe, ndetse no guhabwa umushahara ungana n\u2019icyo akora.\nPolitiki n\u2019Ibikorwa.\n- **Gahunda yo guteza imbere urubyiruko:** Leta y\u2019u Rwanda yashyizeho amahugurwa n\u2019ubumenyi ngiro ku rubyiruko kugira ngo rube rufite ubushobozi bwo kubona akazi. - **Inkunga ku bagore n\u2019abashoramari bato:** Porogaramu nka \u201cWomen\u2019s Guarantee Fund\u201d na gahunda zo gufasha ba rwiyemezamirimo bato zifasha mu kongera amahirwe yo kubona imirimo. - **Iterambere ry\u2019imirimo y\u2019ubwenge n\u2019ikoranabuhanga:** Gahunda zo guteza imbere STEM na ICT mu rubyiruko zigamije kongera amahirwe yo kubona akazi mu mwuga w\u2019ubumenyi n\u2019ikoranabuhanga.\nImbogamizi.\n1. **Ubushomeri mu rubyiruko:** Nubwo habaye intambwe, urubyiruko ruracyahura n\u2019akazi gashobora guha imibereho myiza. 2. **Ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina:** Abakobwa n\u2019abagore mu bice bimwe by\u2019icyaro baracyahura n\u2019imbogamizi mu kubona imirimo y\u2019inyungu zingana n\u2019iz\u2019abagabo. 3. **Ubumenyi buke ku masoko y\u2019umurimo:** Abantu benshi ntibafite ubumenyi buhagije ku masoko y\u2019akazi cyangwa amahirwe yo kwihangira imirimo."}
{"id": "20816", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20816", "title": "Maria Dudycz", "text": "Maria Dudycz ni umunyamwuga mu by\u2019ubuzima wo muri Ositaraliya, akaba kandi umuvugizi w\u2019abafite ubumuga.\nDudycz azwi cyane kubera uruhare rwe mu gutegura no guteza imbere itegeko rya \u201cVictorian Disability Act 2006.\u201d \nMu mwuga we wose, uburambe bwa Dudycz mu by\u2019ubuvuzi bwamuhesheje imirimo myinshi yahawe na Guverinoma y\u2019Igihugu. Muri yo harimo kuyobora Itsinda Ngirakamaro rishinzwe kugenzura isoko ry\u2019amata y\u2019abana bato muri Ositaraliya kuva 2001 kugeza 2005, ndetse no kuyobora Ikigo cya National Health and Medical Research Council gishinzwe kanseri y\u2019amatako (Breast Cancer Centre) kuva 2001 kugeza 2003.\nDudycz yayoboye kandi Ishuri Rikuru ry\u2019Ubuvuzi mu by'amategeko rya Ositaraliya kuva mu 1998 kugeza 2003. \nMu mwaka wa 2018, Dudycz yashyizwe ku rutonde rw\u2019icyubahiro rw\u2019abagore ba Victoria (Victorian Honour Roll of Women). "}
{"id": "20817", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20817", "title": "Itegeko ryerekeye Ahaparikwa byihariye ku Bantu Bafite Ubumuga, Scotland 2009", "text": "Itegeko ry\u2019Ahaparikirwa byihariye ku Bantu Bafite Ubumuga (Scotland) rya 2009 ni itegeko ryatowe n\u2019Inteko Ishinga Amategeko ya Scotland rigena inshingano z\u2019inzego z\u2019ibanze ku bijyanye n\u2019ahaparikirwa h\u2019abafite ubumuga, ryemejwe n\u2019Inteko Ishinga Amategeko ku wa 26 Gashyantare 2009 kandi rikemezwa n\u2019Umwami ku wa 1 Mata 2009. "}
{"id": "20818", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20818", "title": "Komite Ngirakamaro y\u2019Abafite Ubumuga", "text": "Komite Ngirakamaro z\u2019Abafite Ubumuga zasabweho gushyirwaho mu Bwongereza n\u2019Itegeko ry\u2019Abafite Ubumuga mu Kazi rya 1944 (Disabled Persons (Employment) Act 1944). Iri tegeko ryari igerageza rya mbere ryagaragaje uburyo bwo guhangana n\u2019ikibazo cyo kubona akazi ku bantu bafite ubumuga ku rwego rusange. \nKomite imwe yashyirwaga kuri buri kigo gikuru gishinzwe guhuza abashaka akazi n\u2019akazi, zigizwe n\u2019abakozi n\u2019abakoresha bafite umubare ungana, hamwe n\u2019abanyamuryango bigenga n\u2019umuyobozi wigenga. Zagize uruhare mu kugenzura Igitabo cy\u2019Abafite Ubumuga (Disabled Persons Register) ndetse no mu gukoresha sisitemu y\u2019imyanya yihariye (quota system). Zari mu nshingano z\u2019Ikigo cy\u2019Igihugu gishinzwe Umurimo. \nHanashinzwe kandi Inama Nkuru Ngirakamaro y\u2019Igihugu ishinzwe Ibikorwa by\u2019Abafite Ubumuga mu Kazi (National Advisory Council on the Employment of the Disabled)."}
{"id": "20819", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20819", "title": "Komisiyo y\u2019Uburenganzira bw\u2019Abafite Ubumuga", "text": "Komisiyo y\u2019Uburenganzira bw\u2019Abafite Ubumuga (Disability Rights Commission \u2013 DRC) yashyirwagaho n\u2019ubuyobozi bwa British Labour mu mwaka wa 1999. Icyo gihe, DRC yari komisiyo ya gatatu ishinzwe uburinganire mu Bwongereza, iri kumwe na komisiyo ishinzwe uburinganire bw\u2019amoko na komisiyo ishinzwe amahirwe angana. Umuyobozi wayo kuva 2000 kugeza 2007 yari Bert Massie.\nDRC yashinzwe gusuzuma Itegekory\u2019Iribagiza Abafite Ubumuga rya 1995 gutanga inama ku byerekeye impinduka zaryo. Yagize uburenganzira bwo gukora iperereza no gushyira mu bikorwa amategeko arebana n\u2019ubumuga, kandi yari ishinzwe kugisha inama abakoresha ku buryo bwo kwakira no guha amahirwe angana abakozi bafite ubumuga mu kazi. DRC yasimbuye ikigo cyabanje kandi cyari gifite imbaraga nke, aricyo National Disability Council, cyashinzwe n\u2019abashinzwe politike ya Conservatives mu myaka ya 1990.\nItegeko ry\u2019Uburenganzira Bungana rya 2006 ryatumye mu kwezi kwa cumi 2007, DRC isimburwa n\u2019ikigo gishya cyitwa komisiyo nshya y\u2019uburinganire n\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu, gifite ububasha ku mategeko yose arebana n\u2019uburinganire, harimo ivangura ry\u2019amoko, igitsina, ubumuga, idini n\u2019imyemerere, uburyo bw\u2019imibonano mpuzabitsina n\u2019imyaka.\nDRC yari ikigo cya leta kitari mu nzego za minisiteri (NDPB) cyari gishyikirizwa Ishami ry\u2019Umurimo n\u2019Imisanzu. Ibiro byayo bikuru byari mu mujyi wa Manchester, kandi hari n\u2019ibindi biro i London, Cardiff, na Edinburgh."}
{"id": "20820", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20820", "title": "Imikino y\u2019Abafite Ubumuga mu mikino ya Lusofonia", "text": "Iri rushanwa ry\u2019imikino y\u2019abafite ubumuga ryatangiye kubera guhera mu mwaka wa 2009. Mu mikino ya 2009 ryari igikorwa cy\u2019igerageza, ari cyo guhiganwa ku metero 1,500 mu kinyagihagararo (wheelchair) ku bagabo, bityo uwatsindiye iri rushanwa ntiyabarwagaho mu ishusho y\u2019imidari ya nyuma y\u2019iyo mikino."}
{"id": "20821", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20821", "title": "Uburenganzira ku Miturire mu Rwanda", "text": "Uburenganzira ku miturire ni kimwe mu burenganzira bw\u2019ibanze bwa muntu, bukubiye mu Itegeko Nshinga rya Repubulika y\u2019u Rwanda, ndetse bukubahirizwa n\u2019amasezerano mpuzamahanga nka Universal Declaration of Human Rights (UDHR) n\u2019icy\u2019African Charter on Human and Peoples' Rights.\nBuri muntu afite uburenganzira bwo kugira aho atuye, mu buryo butangiza ubuzima, hakurikijwe amahame y\u2019umutekano, ubuzima bwiza, n\u2019imibereho myiza.\nInzego zishinzwe Miturire.\n1. Ministeri y\u2019Ubutegetsi bw\u2019Igihugu (MINALOC): igenzura gahunda za Vision 2020 Umurenge n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019imijyi. \n2. Ministeri y\u2019Ibikorwaremezo (MININFRA): ishinzwe igenzura ry\u2019amacumbi, inyubako n\u2019imihanda. \n3. Ibigo bya Leta n\u2019imiryango y\u2019abikorera ku giti cyabo: bikora ibikorwa byo kubaka amacumbi y\u2019ubucuruzi n\u2019amacumbi y\u2019abaturage bafite ubushobozi buke. 4. Imiryango mpuzamahanga: nka UN-Habitat, ikora imishinga ifasha mu guteza imbere amacumbi meza n\u2019imijyi irambye."}
{"id": "20822", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20822", "title": "Bibliografiya itumva", "text": "Deaf Bibliography(ubumuga bwo Kutumva) ni ububiko bwo kuri interineti bushobora gushakishwamo, bukubiyemo urutonde rw\u2019ibitabo n\u2019inyandiko zerekeye inyigisho ku bumuga bwo kutumva, bwatangijwe na kuva mu mwaka wa 1995. Ububiko bushobora gushakishwamo hakoreshejwe uburyo bwo gushakisha bwihuse, ndetse n\u2019uburyo bwo gushakisha hashingiwe ku byiciro. Ibiri muri ubu bubiko birimo ibitabo byanditswe ku giti cyabyo, ibice byanditse mu bitabo byahurijwemo inyandiko z\u2019abantu benshi, inyandiko zo mu binyamakuru bya siyansi, ndetse n\u2019impapuro z\u2019amamaza. Bukubiyemo ibyerekeye umuco w\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva ku isi yose, harimo n\u2019igihugu cya Ubuyapani. Indimi zirimo ni Icyongereza n\u2019Ikiyapani.\nIbyiciro bikubiyemo ni iby\u2019imibereho n\u2019ibidukikije, ubugeni n\u2019ubumuntu, hamwe n\u2019ibice bike by'ubuvuzi ubumenyi bw\u2019ibinyabuzima, n\u2019ubusanzwe. Buri kintu kiri muri ubu bubiko gishyirwa mu cyiciro hakurikijwe akarere, igihugu, n'insanganyamatsiko, kandi inyandiko nshya zongerwaho n\u2019amagambo y\u2019ingenzi yihariye"}
{"id": "20823", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20823", "title": "Inama mpuzamahanga ku cyongereza Braille", "text": "Inama mpuzamahanga ishinzwe Braille (ICEB) ni urwego rushinzwe gushyiraho amabwiriza ahuriweho ku buryo bw'inyuguti za braille zikoresha mu bihugu bikoresha icyongereza. ubu abanyamuryango barimo ibihugu umunani bikurikira: Ositaraliya, Kanada, Irilande, Nepal, Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande, Afurika y'Epfo, Ubwongereza, na Amerika.] "}
{"id": "20824", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20824", "title": "Ikipe y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019u Bwongereza y\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo mu myigire", "text": "Itsinda ry\u2019u Bwongereza ry\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe (LD) ni imwe mu makipe umunani y\u2019ubumuga ashyigikiwe n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umupira wamaguru. Kugira ngo umukinnyi ajye muri iri tsinda, agomba kuba afite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe, afite IQ iri munsi cyangwa ingana na 70\u201375, nk\u2019uko bisobanurwa n\u2019 Ishami ry\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Abibumbye ryita ku Buzima (OMS). Nanone kandi, umukinnyi agomba kuba yarahawe uburezi bwihariye, cyangwa yaritabiriye akazi cyangwa serivisi z\u2019ituzanwa hagati y\u2019imyaka 0 kugeza kuri 18. \nItsinda ry\u2019u Bwongereza ry\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe (England LD team) ryatsindiye igikombe cy\u2019isi cy\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe mu mikino ya INAS mu mwaka wa 2002, ubwo ryatsindaga Ubuholandi (Netherlands) ibitego 2\u20131 kuri Stade Yokohama, mu Buyapani, muri Kanama 2002. Mu kwezi kwa Kanama 2003, bageze ku mukino wa nyuma w\u2019irushanwa rya Learning Disabilities European Championships, ariko batsindirwa ibitego 2\u20131 n\u2019Ubuholandi muri Portugal. Mu mwaka wa 2004, muri Kanama, babaye abanyarukiko b\u2019isi mu mikino ya mbere yiswe Global Games, batsinda Polonye ibitego 4\u20131 ku mukino wa nyuma wabereye i Bolln\u00e4s, muri Su\u00e8de (Sweden). Ariko, abari bafite igikombe cy\u2019isi batsinzwe mu mikino ya \u00bc cy\u2019irushanwa (quarter finals) y\u2019irushanwa rya INAS FID World Football Championship mu mwaka wa 2006, batsindwa ibitego 4\u20131 na Arabie Saoudite (Saudi Arabia) i Recklinghausen, mu Budage. "}
{"id": "20825", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20825", "title": "Ubumuga muri Biyelorusiya", "text": "Ubumuga muri Biyelorusiya bivuga ababana n'ubumuga muri Biyelorusiya.\nAmateka.\nMu mwaka wa 2016, Biyelorusiya yemeje Amasezerano yerekeye uburenganzira bw'abafite ubumuga. Mu mwaka wa 2017, Guverinoma ya Biyelorusiya yashyizeho kandi yemeza gahunda y'igihugu ikwiye kugeza mu mwaka 2025 \nImibare.\nKugeza ubu muri Biyelorusiya hari abantu 570,000 bafite ubumuga, bangana na 6% by'abaturage. "}
{"id": "20826", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20826", "title": "Ubumuga muri Ukraine", "text": "Abantu miliyoni 2.7 muri Ukraine (6%) bavuzwe ko bafite ubumuga mu 2014. Uyu mubare ntiwarim 1.5% by\u2019abafite ubumuga bw\u2019igihe gito. Mu mwaka wa 2014, 35% by'abantu bafite hagati yimyaka 60-70 bafite ubumuga buterwa nimyaka. Ku bantu barengeje imyaka 80, uyu mubare wiyongereye kugera kuri 50%. \nUkraine izwiho \"kutita ku bantu bafite ubumuga\". Urugero, mu murwa mukuru Kyiv 4% gusa by\u2019ibikorwa remezo ni byo bifatwa nk\u2019ibyorohereza abantu bafite ubumuga.\nMu myaka ya 1990, igipimo cy\u2019ubushomeri mu bantu bafite ubumuga cyiyongereye cyane muri Ukraine (no mu bindi bihugu by\u2019Uburayi bw\u2019iburasirazuba) bitewe n\u2019ihungabana ry\u2019ubukungu.\nMu mwaka wa 2021, isosiyete ikora gari ya moshi yo muri Ukraine Ukrzaliznytsia yatangije gari ya moshi za mbere zorohereza abantu bafite ubumuga, zifite ahabugenewe h\u2019abantu bicara mu tugare tw\u2019abafite ubumuga. \nUkraine ni kimwe mu bihugu byatsinze kenshi mu mikino ya Paralympique. "}
{"id": "20827", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20827", "title": "Ubumuga muri Uganda", "text": "Ubumuga muri Uganda bivuga ababana n'ubumuga muri Uganda.\nImibare.\nMu mwaka wa 2002, 16% by'abaturage ba Uganda bari bafite ubumuga butandukanye. \nByemewe n'amategeko.\nItegeko Nshinga rya Uganda ribuza ivangura rikorerwa ababana n'ubumuga. Igihugu kandi cyemera ururimi rw\u2019amarenga rwa Uganda nk\u2019igice cy\u2019Itegeko Nshinga. "}
{"id": "20828", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20828", "title": "Ubumuga muri Tonga", "text": "Hashingiwe ku bushakashatsi bwakozwe na Sosiyete itabara imbabare Croix-Rouge ya Tonga na Komite Ngishwanama ku bafite ubumuga, muri Tonga hari abantu 2,782 bafite ubumuga butandukanye, bangana na 2.8% by'abaturage bose. \nAmateka.\nMu mwaka wa 2007, Tonga yashyize umukono ku Masezerano yerekeye uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga ariko akaba ataremeza kugeza ubu. \nIbyiciro.\nMu mwaka wa 1996, ubumuga muri Tonga bwari bugizwe na: ubumuga bwo mu mutwe (43.8%), ubumuga bwo mu bwenge (24,6%), ubumuga bw\u2019umubiri (14.5%), ubumuga bwo kutumva (8.9%), ubumuga bwo kutabona (5.4%) n'abandi (2.8%). "}
{"id": "20829", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20829", "title": "Ubumuga mu birwa bya Salomo", "text": "Ubumuga mu birwa bya Salomo bivuga ababana n'ubumuga mu birwa bya Salomo.\nAmateka.\nKu wa 17 Ugushyingo 2022, Guverinoma y\u2019ibirwa bya Salomo yemeje ku mugaragaro Politiki y\u2019Iterambere Rihuriweho n\u2019Abafite Ubumuga mu gihugu. Yatangiye gukurikizwa ku wa 2 Ukuboza 2022. \nImibare.\nKugeza ubu hari 14% by'abaturage bo mu birwa bya Salomo bafite ubumuga butandukanye. "}
{"id": "20830", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20830", "title": "Ubumuga muri Sudani y'Amajyepfo", "text": "Ubumuga muri Sudani y\u2019Epfo bureba ku rwego n\u2019ingaruka z\u2019ubuzima ku bantu bafite ubumuga muri icyo gihugu. Nk\u2019uko twabitangarijwe n\u2019umuryango mpuzamahanga wita ku bafite ubumuga \"Light of the World\", abantu bagera ku 250,000 bafite ubumuga baba muri Sudani y'Amajyepfo. \nAmategeko.\nMuri mwaka wa 2015, Sudani y'Amajyepfo yashyizeho itegeko rigamije gushyigikira uburenganzira n'abafite ubumuga. \nAmashirahamwe.\n\"Umuryango Mukuru w\u2019Imiryango y\u2019Abantu bafite Ubumuga (NUDPO)\" washinzwe muri Nzeri 2020 nk\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe ugamije kurengera no guteza imbere uburenganzira n\u2019inyungu z\u2019abantu bafite ubumuga bo muri Sudani Yepfo. NUDPO igizwe n\u2019imiryango umunani iyigize, harimo \"umuyoboro w\u2019abagore bafite ubumuga bo muri Sudani yepfo\" n\u2019ishyirahamwe \"ry\u2019igihugu ry\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva bo muri Sudani yepfo\". "}
{"id": "20831", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20831", "title": "Talha Ahmet Erdem \u2013 Umunyabigwi w\u2019umukino w\u2019abafite ubumuga", "text": "Talha Ahmet Erdem ni umutoza w\u2019umukino wa Judo w\u2019icyiciro cy\u2019isi wa Turukiya ufite ubumuga bwa Down. Akina mu cyiciro cya 81\u00a0kg mu rwego rwa T23 rw\u2019abafiteubumuga. "}
{"id": "20832", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20832", "title": "Ubumuga muri Somaliya", "text": "Ubumuga muri Somaliya bivuga ibibazo bifitanye isano nabafite ubumuga muri Somaliya.\nAmateka.\nKu wa 2 Ukwakira 2018, Somaliya yashyize umukono ku Masezerano yerekeye uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga maze iyemeza ku wa 6 Kanama 2019. Yatangiye gukurikizwa ku wa 5 Nzeri 2019. \nImibare.\nKugeza mu 2020, abaturage ba Somaliya bagera kuri 5% bafite ubumuga butandukanye. Ubwoko bw\u2019ubumuga buboneka muri Somaliya burimo: ubumuga bw\u2019umubiri (26%), kubona (15%), kumva (12%), mu mutwe (12%), kuvuga (6%), ubwenge (5%) nabandi (24%). "}
{"id": "20833", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20833", "title": "Ubumuga muri Seychelles", "text": "Kugeza mu mwaka wa 1996, muri Seychelles hari abantu 1,496 bafite ubumuga butandukanye. \nAmateka.\nSeychelles yashyize umukono ku Masezerano yerekeye uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga ku wa 30 Werurwe 2007 ayemeza ku wa 2 Ukwakira 2009. Yatangiye gukurikizwa ku wa 1 Ugushyingo 2009. \nImibare.\nMu mwaka wa 1981, habarurwaga abantu 2,908 bafite ubumuga nyuma y\u2019uko igihugu gikora ubushakashatsi bwo kumenya umubare w\u2019abantu bafite ubu bumuga. Mu mwaka wa 1991, umubare wari 732. \nIbyiciro.\nUbumuga muri Seychelles bugabanyijemo ibyiciro byinshi, birimo: ubumuga bw\u2019umubiri, ubumuga bwo mu mutwe cyangwa bwo mu bwenge, ndetse n\u2019icyiciro cy\u2019ubumuga bw\u2019amarangamutima y\u2019amarangamutima, harimo ubumuga bwo kumva, kuvuga no kubona. \nUbuvugizi.\nIshyirahamwe ry\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva (APHI) ryashinzwe mu 2005 mu guhugura abarimu bigisha abantu batumva no guteza imbere imyumvire y\u2019abaturage y\u2019ururimi rw\u2019amarenga rwa Seychelles. "}
{"id": "20834", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20834", "title": "Ubumuga muri Samoa", "text": "Dukurikije amakuru yakusanyijwe mu mwaka wa 2006, abantu bagera ku 2,100 babana n'ubumuga muri Samoa. Itegeko Nshinga ry\u2019iki gihugu ntirivuga cyangwa ngo ririnde byihariye uburenganzira bw\u2019abantu bafite ubumuga, kandi ntiribuza ivangura ribakorerwa. Samoa, nubwo kuri ubu itashyize umukono ku masezerano y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye y\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga, yagaragaje ko yifuza ko yakwinjira mu gihe kiri imbere. \nMu rwego rwo gukemura ibibazo by\u2019abantu bafite ubumuga, Guverinoma ya Samoa yashyizeho Itsinda rishinzwe ubumuga ku rwego rw\u2019igihugu (National Disabilities Taskforce). Iki kigo gifite inshingano zo gukora no gushyira mu bikorwa gahunda zigamije gufasha abantu bafite ubumuga. Itsinda rikora rigendeye ku mabwiriza yashyizweho n\u2019Itegeko Nshinga n\u2019Igitekerezo cya Gahunda y\u2019Igihugu ku Bafite Ubumuga byashyiriweho mu mwaka wa 2009. Byongeye, umuryango uyobora ibikorwa byo kurengera uburenganzira bw\u2019abantu bafite ubumuga mu gihugu, Nuanua O Le Alofa, washinzwe mu mwaka wa 2001. Uyu muryango wari wateguye kandi Inama ya 5 y\u2019Akarere ka Pasifika ku Bafite Ubumuga mu mwaka wa 2017. \nKu rwego mpuzamahanga rwa siporo, Samoa yagiye ihagararirwa muri buri gihe cy'imikino Paralympike yo mu mpeshyi kuva mu mikino Paralempike yo muri 2000, nubwo iki gihugu kititabira imikino y'abamugaye. "}
{"id": "20835", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20835", "title": "Ubumuga muri Rumaniya", "text": "Ubumuga muri Romania bureba ku buzima bw\u2019abantu hafi 900,000\u2014bingana n\u2019umwe mu 20 mu baturage bose\u2014bafite icyemezo cyemewe cy\u2019ubumuga, aho hafi igice cya gatatu cyabo ari abagore cyangwa abakobwa, kandi abantu bagera ku 77,000 muri bo ari abana.\nImibare.\nMu rwego rwemewe, muri Kamena 2023 habarurwaga abantu 898,349 bafite ubumuga bwemejwe, aho 8.6% babo baba mu bigo byita ku bantu bafite ubumuga, abandi bose bakaba mu miryango yabo. Ibarurishamibare rya Eurostat (EU-SILC) ryerekana ko muri 2023, 38.2% by\u2019Abanya-Romania bafite ubumuga bari mu kaga k\u2019ubukene cyangwa gukurwa mu muryango, ugereranyije na 27.5% by\u2019abatagira ubumuga, ikaba ari intera ya gatatu nini cyane mu Muryango w\u2019Ubumwe bw\u2019Uburayi. Kubura ibyo bakeneye mu mibereho n\u2019imibereho myiza kwagize ingaruka ku 28.4% by\u2019Abanya-Romania bafite ubumuga\u2014bingana inshuro ebyiri kurenza umubare w\u2019Uburasirazuba bw\u2019Uburayi\u2014mugihe gusa 17% byabo bafite hagati y\u2019imyaka 20 na 64 bari bafite akazi kishyurwa, ari ko gahigura mu Muryango. \nAmategeko na politiki ya leta.\nIngingo ya 50 y\u2019Itegeko Nshinga rya Rumaniya itanga \u201cuburinzi budasanzwe\u201d ku bantu bafite ubumuga, nk\u2019uko bigaragazwa n\u2019Itegeko Rishamikiyeho No 448/2006 ryerekeye Kurengera no Guteza Imbere Uburenganzira bw\u2019Abantu bafite Ubumuga, ryahinduwe inshuro nyinshi kuva Romania yinjiye mu Muryango w\u2019Ubumwe bw\u2019Uburayi kandi rikaba ritaraguzwa mu mategeko y\u2019igihugu ajyanye n\u2019ubumuga. Romania yashyize umukono ku Masezerano y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye y\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga (CRPD) mu mwaka wa 2010 maze ishyiraho \"ingamba z\u2019igihugu zita ku burenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga 2022\u20132027\", akaba ari yo cya mbere cyashyizeho amahame ya CRPD mu ntego zishobora kugerwaho. \nPolitiki.\nUbuvugizi bwa sosiyete sivile bushingiye ku nzego nk'Inama y'igihugu ishinzwe ubumuga no mu manza zifatika. Amahugurwa ya EIN 2023 yabereye i Bucharest yerekanye ko abantu badafite ubumuga mu by'amategeko, ibiro by\u2019itora bitagerwaho ndetse n\u2019ubundi buryo bwo gutora butandukanye, ibibazo guverinoma yatangiye kugerageza-gukemura muri Mata 2025 gusa binyuze mu buryo bwo gutora bwifashisha gukorakora no kumva amajwi ku baturage batabona. \nInyungu z\u2019abafite ubumuga.\nAbakuze bose bafite icyemezo cyemewe cy\u2019ubumuga bahabwa inkunga y\u2019ukwezi ku kwezi, igabanuka cyangwa yiyongera bitewe n\u2019uburemere bw\u2019ubumuga. Amakuru ya Guverinoma yashyikirijwe Ibarurishamibare ry\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Uburayi ku Mibereho agaragaza ko inkunga yo ku rwego rwo hejuru yazamutse iva kuri 350 RON mu 2021 ikagera kuri 368 RON mu 2023, mu gihe ingengo y\u2019imari yunganira abana bafite ubumuga bukomeye yazamutse kuva kuri 175 RON ikagera kuri 316 RON muri icyo gihe; kandi amafaranga yo ku rwego rwo hagati nayo yazamutse mu buryo bungana. "}
{"id": "20836", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20836", "title": "Ikigo cy\u2019Abatabona Ezenzeleni", "text": "Ikigo cy\u2019Abatabona Ezenzeleni yari ishuri ry\u2019abatabona riherereye i\nRoodepoort, hafi ya Johannesburg muri Afurika yepfo. Ryashinzwe mu mwaka wa 1939 na Arthur Blaxall, umupasiteri wa Anglican wavukiye mu Bwongereza, wakoranye n\u2019umugore we muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo guhera mu mwaka wa 1923. \nMu barimu b'iki kigo harimo Es'kia Mphahlele, wahakoreraga mu mwaka wa 1940. Nyina wa Desmond Tutu, Aletha, yakoraga nk\u2019umutekinisiye w\u2019ibiryo muri icyo gihe; ni ho Tutu yahuye na Trevor Huddleston. "}
{"id": "20837", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20837", "title": "Igipimo cyo Kwigenga mu Mikorere y\u2019Umubiri", "text": "Igipimo cyo Kwigenga mu Mikorere y\u2019Umubiri (FIM) ni igikoresho cyo gusuzuma kigamije kwerekana urwego rw\u2019imikorere y\u2019abarwayi mu gihe cyose cy\u2019ubuvuzi bwo kongera ubushobozi nyuma yo kugira stroke, ibikomere ku bwonko, ibikomere ku mugongo cyangwa kanseri.Igipimo gikoreshwa ahantu hatandukanye harimo ibigo byita ku barwayi bakeneye ubuvuzi bwihariye n\u2019amavuriro ahuza ubuvuzi bwihuse (acute), ubuvuzi bw\u2019igihe gito (sub-acute) n\u2019ubuvuzi bwo kongera ubushobozi (rehabilitation care). Gikorwa ku gihe cyo kwakira umurwayi no kuva mu bitaro by\u2019ubuvuzi bwo kongera ubushobozi, kikaba igikoresho gihoraho cyo gukusanya amakuru agamije kugereranya ibyavuye mu kuvura abarwayi mu rwego rw\u2019ubuzima rusange. FIM igamije kandi gufasha abaganga gukurikirana impinduka mu mikorere y\u2019abarwayi kuva batangiye kwakira ubuvuzi kugeza bageze ku gusohoka no gukurikirwa nyuma yaho.Igipimo cyerekana urwego rw\u2019ubumuga bushingiye ku manota umurwayi abona mu byiciro 18, byibanda ku mikorere y\u2019umubiri (motor function) no ku bwenge (cognitive function). Buri cyiciro gisuzumwa hakoreshejwe urwego rwa 7 aho 1 = gukenera ubufasha bwuzuye (&lt;25% kwigenga) naho 7 = kwigenga 100%. Bityo, amanota ya FIM ashobora gusobanurwa nk\u2019igaragaza urwego rw\u2019ubwigenga cyangwa uburemere bw\u2019ubufasha umuntu akeneye. Uru rugero rukoreshwa gusuzuma uburyo umuntu ashobora gukora ibikorwa by\u2019ibanze bya buri munsi, bityo hagamenyekana uko azaba akeneye ubufasha bw\u2019abandi. Ibindi bice bisuzumwa birimo imikorere y\u2019umubiri, nko kureba neza uburyo abarwayi bimuka kandi bagenda, ndetse n\u2019imikorere y\u2019ubwenge, nko kureba uko bafatanya n\u2019abandi, uko batumanaho, kandi bakamenya gutunganya amakuru. FIM yatekerejwe ku bantu bagize stroke, ariko ikoreshwa kandi mu gusuzuma ubumuga mu bindi bihe by\u2019uburwayi. "}
{"id": "20838", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20838", "title": "Ahazaza ni Abafite Ubumuga", "text": "Ahazaza ni Abafite Ubumuga: Ibyahanuwe, Inyandiko z\u2019Urukundo n\u2019Indirimbo z\u2019Agahinda ni igitabo kitari inkuru z\u2019imibereho (non-fiction) cyasohotse mu 2022, cyanditswe n\u2019umwanditsi ndetse n\u2019umurwanashyaka w\u2019Umunyakanada-Umunyamerika, Leah Lakshmi Piepzna-Samarasinha.] \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nPiepzna-Samarasinha yatangiye kwandika igitabo \u201cAhazaza ni Abafite Ubumuga\u201d mu mwaka wa 2018. "}
{"id": "20839", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20839", "title": "George Gallego", "text": "George Gallego (yavutse c.\u20091966) numunyamerika paratriathlete na rwiyemezamirimo. Niwe washinze kandi akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru wa Wheels of Progress akaba ari nawe washinze umushinga wa Axis. Binyuze kuri Access Initiatives, yafunguye siporo ebyiri zigamije gufasha ababana n'ubumuga: umwe i Brooklyn undi i Manhattan. Mu 2021, yafunguye resitora Contento muri East Harlem. Resitora yashyizweho ku buryo abantu bakoresha karekezi bashobora kuyinjiramo no kuyikoresha neza, kandi ku mafunguro ari ku menyu harimo QR codes kugira ngo abagize ubumuga bwo kutabona babashe kumva ayo mafunguro basomwe n\u2019icyuma cyabo. \nGallego yakuye impamyabumenyi ihanitse ya master mu buyobozi bw'inzego yakuye muri kaminuza ya Mercy. Yize kandi muri kaminuza ya Fordham na kaminuza ya Cornell kugira ngo arangize. \nGallego yamugaye kuva mu rukenyerero nko mu mwaka wa 1990 afite imyaka 23 nyuma yo kugwa mu idirishya rya etage ya gatatu ahazubakwa. Yahungabanye mu buryo bw\u2019umutima, yungutse ibiro byinshi nyuma y\u2019impanuka, maze atandukana n\u2019umugore we. Amaherezo, Gallego yatangiye imyitozo. Yinjiye mu irushanwa rye rya mbere ry\u2019amagare mu 2005 ndetse n\u2019umujyi wa mbere wa New York City Triathlon mu mwaka wa 2007. \nGallego yahuye n'umugore we, Julia Kahn-Gallego, muri Triathlon yo mu mujyi wa New York 2007; bashakanye mu mwaka wa 2009. Gallego afite abana batatu. "}
{"id": "20840", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20840", "title": "Gemma (Umuryango)", "text": "GEMMA ni ikinyamakuru n\u2019umuryango w\u2019imibereho rusange washinzwe mu 1976, ugamije gutanga \u201citsinda ry\u2019inshuti n\u2019ubufasha ku bagore bafite\nubumuga bari mu itsinda ry\u2019abakundana n\u2019abagore mu Bwongereza \". \nUyu muryango washinzwe n\u2019abanyamuryango b\u2019umuryango wa lesbiyani witwa Sappho n\u2019umuryango uvanze witwa Campaign for uburinganire bw\u2019abahuje ibitsina, barimo Elsa Beckett. Akanyamakuru k'abanyamuryango ba Gemma kasohotse mu icapiro risanzwe, mu nyandiko ya braille kimwe na cassette. \nMu nyandiko ye \"Yambuye amateka yacu: Kwishora hamwe n\u2019ubudasa mu Nzu Ndangamurage ya Londres\", Raminder Kaur asobanura urupapuro rwamamaza ibikorwa bya Gemma, biri mu bigize inzu ndangamurage ya Londres, nk'ingenzi mu gucukumbura insanganyamatsiko iranga abantu benshi cyangwa itandukaniro riri hagati\". "}
{"id": "20841", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20841", "title": "Neeraj George", "text": "Neeraj George, uzwi kandi ku izina rya Neeraj George Baby, ni umunyamahanga mu misozii w\u2019U Buhindi akaba n'umukinnyi wa para badminton ukomoka muri Aluva, muri Kerala. Joriji yurira Kilimanjaro ku George yakoraga nk'umukozi mu biro bikuru bya avoka muri Kerala, George yitabiriye amarushanwa menshi yo mu gihugu no ku rwego mpuzamahanga Para-Badminton. "}
{"id": "20842", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20842", "title": "Dan Habib", "text": "Dan Habib numuyobozi wa firime wumunyamerika, producer, n'umukinnyi wa cinemateri ufite icyicaro i Concord, muri New Hampshire. \"Filime ze zatsindiye ibihembo zirebana n\u2019ibibazo by\u2019ubumuga zirimo \u201cWho Cares About Kelsey?\u201d\", \"Harimo Samuel\", \"Ubuzima Bwenge,\" \"Kwifata no Kwihererana: Umva inkuru zacu\", hamwe na documentaire ngufi. Filime ze zatoranijwe na Emmy, zihindurwa mu ndimi 17, kandi zikoreshwa ku isi hose mu gushyigikira uburezi n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga. Habib aheruka kwerekana documentaire ngufi, \"My Disability Roadmap\", afatanije numuhungu we Samuel Habib. Iyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere ku isi muri Hot Docs Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya documentaire ryo muri canada ku wa 1 Gicurasi 2022, kandi ryerekanwe mu rwego rwa New York Times Op-Docs. Iyi filime igizwe n\u2019ibiganiro hagati ya Samuel n\u2019abaharanira ubumuga bakomeye bo muri Amerika, ikanagaragaza zimwe mu mbogamizi Habibs bahuye nazo mu gutemberera aho hantu. Filime ivuga kandi ku nyungu za Samuel mu gukundana nkumuntu wamugaye. \nHabib yatangiye umwuga we wo gutunganya amafoto ya \"Concord Monitor,\" mbere yo kugira uruhare mu guharanira uburenganzira bw'abafite ubumuga. Mu mwaka wa 2014, yagizwe umwe mu bagize komite ya Perezida w\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe n\u2019ubuyobozi bwa Obama. Habib yahawe ibihembo n\u2019icyubahiro bitandukanye, birimo Igihembo \u201cUbucamanza ku Bantu Bose\u201d cyatanzwe n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abanyamerika ry\u2019abafite ubumuga mu mwaka wa 2013, ndetse na Igihembo \u201cIntwari mu Burenganzira bwa Muntu n\u2019Uburenganzira bwa Civili\u201d cyatanzwe na Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Uburezi ry\u2019Igihugu (New Hampshire) mu mwaka wa 2012. "}
{"id": "20843", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20843", "title": "Umuryango mpuzamahanga urwanya igicuri", "text": "Umuryango mpuzamahanga urwanya igicuri (\"ILAE\") washinzwe mu mwaka wa 1909. Intego yaryo ni ukuzamura imibereho y\u2019abafite igicuri binyuze mu bushakashatsi. Uyu munsi ILAE ifite ibice birenga 150 byigihugu, nabanyamuryango barenga 26,000, cyane cyane inzobere mubuzima. Mu mwaka wa 1997 ILAE yifatanije n\u2019ikigo mpuzamahanga gishinzwe igicuri (IBE), n\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubuzima ku isi (OMS) gutangiza ubukangurambaga ku isi ku kurwanya igicuri (GCAE). \nILAE yasohoye \"2017 ILAE Itondekanya Igicuri\", n'impapuro zayo zirambuye zo gukurikirana, n'abaganga benshi b'inzobere, bose basohotse muri Epilepsia. Ibi bisimbuza ibyiciro byambere bya syndromes ya epilepsy yakozwe na ILAE. \nBakoresha ibinyamakuru byubuvuzi Epilepsia, \"Epilepsia Gufungura\", na \"Epileptic Disorders\". "}
{"id": "20844", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20844", "title": "Ella Harper", "text": "Ella Harper (5 Mutarama 1870 - 19 Ukuboza 1921), uzwi ku izina ry'Umukobwa w'Ingamiya, yavutse afite uburwayi budasanzwe bw'amagufwa butuma amavi ye yunama inyuma, bita \"genvital genu rehabvatum\". Uko yakundaga kugenda akoresheje amaguru n\u2019amaboko byatumye ahabwa izina ry\u2019akabyiniriro \u201cCamel Girl\u201d. Mu mwaka wa 1886, yagaragaye nk'inyenyeri muri WH Harris's Nickel Plate Circus, agaragara mu binyamakuru aho sirusi yasuye. Inyuma yikarita ye yikibuga yanditseho:\nHarper yakiraga amadorari 200 ku cyumweru ku buryo yagaragarizaga abantu (bingana na $7,000 muri 2024). Amafaranga yakiriye binyuze muri uru ruhare ashobora kuba yamuhaye amahirwe mu buzima atari kuba yabonye ahandi. \nHarper yashakanye n'umwarimu witwa Robert Savely mu mwaka wa 1905; yapfuye mu 1921 afite imyaka mirongo itanu n'umwe. Yashyinguwe mu irimbi rya Spring Hill i Nashville, muri Tennesse. "}
{"id": "20845", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20845", "title": "Hu Zurong", "text": "Hu Zurong (mu Bushinwa ; wavutse 1939 cyangwa 1940) ni umukinnyi w'imikino ngororamubiri w'umugabo w'umushinwa akaba n'umuyobozi mu by'imikino. Hu yatsinze rekodi z'igihugu mu mukino wo gusimbuka urukiramende, kandi yakomeje kugira rekodi y\u2019igihugu imyaka irenga 10. \nHu Zurong yize mu ishuri rya Nanyang Model High School, Shanghai, Ubushinwa, akaba ari mu itsinda ry\u2019abarangije mu mwaka wa 1960. Yegukanye zahabu mu mukino wo gusimbuka urukiramende muri GANEFO yo mu 1963, n'umuringa mu gusimbuka urukiramende muri GANEFO 1966. Yabaye champion w\u2019igihugu mu mukino wo gusimbuka urukiramende (pole vault) mu mwaka wa 1965 mu marushanwa y\u2019igihugu ya Repubulika y\u2019Abashinwa. Mu mwaka wa 1971, mu myitozo yakomeretse amaguru yombi maze amugara. Yanditse ibitabo \"Imyitozo ngororangingo: Ingero 1400\" (\u8eab\u9ad4\u8a13\u7df4 1400 \u4f8b) na \"Pole Vault\" (\u6490\u7aff\u8df3\u9ad8). [w'icyubahiro kubera umuco na siporo mu mwaka wa 1980. "}
{"id": "20846", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20846", "title": "ASL-phabet", "text": "ASL-phabet, cyangwa inyuguti ya ASL, ni uburyo bwo kwandika bwakozwe na Samuel Supalla ku rurimi rw'amarenga rw'Abanyamerika (ASL). Ishingiye kuri sisitemu yitwa SignFont, Supalla yahinduye kandi yoroheje kugirango ikoreshwe mumashuri hamwe nabana bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva neza. \nKimwe na SignFont na Stokoe inyandiko, ASL-phabet ni inyandiko ya fonemique, ariko yaroroshe mu gukoreshwa ndetse no kugeza ahoamakuru kubidasobanutse neza, ni ukuvuga, ikimenyetso kimwe gishobora kugereranya ibintu byinshi birenze fonemike (ishusho y'intoki, ahantu cyangwa kugenda). Kurugero, mugihe SignFont ifite inyuguti 25 zerekana ubwoko bwimikorere, naho inyandiko ya Stokoe ifite 24, ASL-phabet ifite 5. Gusa ibi bishobora kuvamo homografi (ibimenyetso birenze kimwe byanditse muburyo bumwe).\nByose hamwe, ASL-phabet ifite inyuguti 22 zo gushushanya, 5 ndanga hantu, na 5 zo kugenda. Byanditswe murutonde, ibumoso-iburyo, hamwe nibishoboka inyuguti nyinshi za buri bwoko, nkamabaruwa abiri yintoki kubimenyetso bibiri. Kimwe na Stokoe yanditse (ariko bitandukanye na SignFont), ASL-phabet ntabwo itanga ibimenyetso byerekana isura yo mumaso, umunwa, nibindi bice byimiterere yururimi rwamarenga, bishobora kugorana gukoresha inyandiko yagutse. Ariko, birahagije gushakisha amagambo ASL mu nkoranyamagambo ya ASL - Icyongereza. Icyitonderwa Hulst &amp; Channon ("}
{"id": "20847", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20847", "title": "Ganaian braille", "text": "Inyuguti nyinshi za braille zikoreshwa muri Gana. Ku mu rurimi rwi cyongereza, Icyongereza cyunze ubumwe Braille cyemejwe. Izindi ndimi enye zanditswe mu nyuguti: Akan (Twi), Ga, Ewe, na Dagaare. Inyuguti zose uko ari eshatu zishingiye ku shingiro ry'inyuguti ya braille y'inyuguti z'ibanze z'ikilatini:\nBraille imeze nki inyuguti zanditse zirenze izi zasobanuwe hepfo. Utumenyetso two mu cyongereza Braille dukoreshwa muri Gana no (dukurikije UNESCO 2013) Togo.\nBraille ntabwo ikoreshwa cyane muri Gana kururimi urwo arirwo rwose kereka icyongereza. Ariko, hano haribisohokayandikiro bishaje muriyi nyuguti zinyuguti.\nAkan (Twi) Braille.\nAkan afite inyuguti imwe yinyongera. \u282a \"\u0254\" ikaba nayo iteganijwe vuba kuva mumahame mpuzamahanga / Afrika ; \u283b \"\u025b\" yihariye Gana.\nEwe Braille.\nEwe yongeyeho inyuguti nyinshi ziyongera: \u282b \"\u0256\", \u2839 \"\u0192\", \u2823 \"\u0263\", \u282e \"\u028b\".\n\"\u0189\" na \"\u0263\" ni amahame mpuzamahanga / Afurika (reba na braille ya Nigeriya); \"\u0192\" na \"\u028b\" biva mu \"majwi\" y'Icyongereza, hafi na hafi muri urwo rurimi nyuma ya \"f\" na \"v\".\nBraille yindimi za Togol\u00e9e.\nEwe ni ururimi rwibanze rwa Togo, kandi biragaragara ko ikoreshwa muri Togo hamwe ninshingano za braille nko muri Gana. UNESCO (2013] bigaragara ko bakoresha umukoro wa Ewe wo muri Gana:\nIkindi kandi, UNESCO ivuga ko indimi zitandukanye zo muri Togoliya zifite \u2821 ku majwi y\u2019izuru, \u2838 ku majwi maremare, \u2818 ku majwi yo hagati, na \u2830 ku ijwi rito.\nIzi ndimi zose uko ari eshanu zivugwa muri Gana kimwe na Togo, ariko Unesco ntabwo ivuga ko yagabanijwe kuri braille."}
{"id": "20848", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20848", "title": "Ubumuga bukomatanije", "text": "Ubumuga bukomatanije ni igihe umuntu aba afite ubumuga burenze bumwe hari nk'ubumuga bwo kutabona, ubumuga bwo kutavuga ndetse n'ubumuga bwo kutumva.\nUko bahanahana amakuru.\nUbumuga bwo kutumva no kutavuga bufata ibice bibiri muri bitanu bigenga ibyiyumviro by'umuntu, ibyo bituma kuvuga kwe bidaturika nk'uko abadafite ubumuga basohora amajwi, igice cy'amatwi nacyo ntabwo kiba cyakira amajwi akenewe gutanga no kugarura ubutumwa, ku gice cy'inyuma cy'ubwonko(Hypophysis).\nKubera ko ibyo bice bibiri biba bidakora, abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva no kutavuga bakoresha ibimenyetso by'intoki n'ibiganza mu kuvugana, bakanakoresha umunwa bawunyegenyeza nk'abashaka kuvuga, ari amawi aba adasohoka, bakakoresha isura yabo yo mu maso. Iyo miterere ituma abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva no kutavuga bagira umuco wabo nk'uko n'abavuga bisanzwe banumva bafite umuco wabo, ari nayo mpamvu ibyo byiciro byombi bitumvikana kuko buri kimwe gifite uko cyitwara.\nUmuryango w'abagore bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva no kutavuga mu Rwanda(RNADW), Ugaragaza ko imwe mu mico y'abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva no kutavuga, ishingiye ku guhana amakuru cyangwa kuganira hagati yabo ubwabo, bakoresha ibimenyetso iyo hari urumuri. Ni ukuvuga ko amaso ari ingenzi cyane ku muntu ufite ubumuga bwo kutumva no kutavuga, kuko gukoresha ibyo bimenyetso bigomba gukora ku manywa cg nijoro ariko habona. Igihe nta rumuri ruhari abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva no kutavuga, icyo gihe ntabwo baba barebana bivuzeko ko na byabimenyetso batashobora kubigaragarizanya, ubwo ntibabashe kumvikana, icyo gihe bigasaba ko baganira bakoranaho.\nAndi makuru.\n(RNADW) Umuryango w'abagore bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva no kutavuga mu Rwanda, bagaragaza ko bigorana cyane iyo ufite ubumuga bwo kutumva no kutavuga ari kure ya mugenzi we, kuko icyo gihe bisaba ko afata nk'ibuye akamutera kugirango ahindukire barebane babone kuvugana hakoreshejwe bya bimenyetso, cyangwa kumumenaho amazi ngo ahindukire. Ubwo buryo ariko bukaba bufite ingaruka kuko iryo buye rishobora gukomeretsa uritewe cyangwa rigafata utariwe, gutera amazi umuntu nabwo ukamutosa nabyo bikaba bimubangamira.\nMu rwego rwo kunoza uburyo bwo guhanahana amakuru n'ubusabane ku bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva no kutavuga, hifashishwa ikoranabuhanga rya telephone mu kwandikirana ubutumwa bugufi kuri telephone, cyangwa guhamagarana iyo ufite ubumuga bwo kutumva aba yimvisha kimwe mu gihande cy'umubiri we.\nIkoranabuhanga rikaba ari kimwe mu byoroheje ubuzima bw'abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva no kutavuga, kuko babasha kwisomera ubutumwa bwakiriwe mu dusanduku twabo tw'ikoranabuhanga e-mail) no kubusubiza, no gukoresha imbuga nkoranyambaga bifashishije telephone zigezweho. Aba kandi bashobora no kwisomera inyandiko zisanzwe, kuko baba barize kuzisanisha n'ibimenyetso bishushanije bikoresha intoki n'ibiganza.\nAndi makuru wamenya kubafite ubumuga bukomatanije.\nMUSABYIMANA Joseph ni Umunyamabanga Nshingwabikorwa w'umuryango w'abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva,kutavuga no kutabona, Yagaragaje impungenge zo kuba nta n'umwe mu bafite ubumuga bukomatanije mu Rwanda ubasha kwiga.\nMusabyimana yagaragaje ko mu ibarura rusange ry'abaturage ryakozwe mu 2012 umubare w'abafite ubu bumuga utigeze ugaragara bikaba bishoboka ko ababufite bagiye babitiranya n'abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona cyangwa ubwo kutumva no kutavuga. Ati \"ni na byo turi gusaba Ikigo cy'ibarurishamibare kugira ngo mu ibarura rigiye gukorwa bazakore ku buryo tumenya imibare y'abafite ubu bumuga.\" Yanasabye Minisiteri y'uburezi gukora ibishoboka ngo abo bana na bo babone uburezi kuko bigaragara ko batigeze batekerezwaho naho Minisiteri y'ubuzima ayisaba gukora ubushakashatsi bujyanye n'ibitera ubumuga hirindwa ko ubumuga runaka bwabyara ubundi bitewe no kutitabwaho."}
{"id": "20849", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20849", "title": "Anusaaraka tool", "text": "Anusaaraka ni icyongereza kugeza ku gihindi kugera kuri software (ubusemuzi), ikoresha algorithm ikomoka kuri Ashtadhyayi ya P\u0101\u1e47ini (amategeko y'Ikibonezamvugo).] \u200b\u200b Anusaaraka ifatwa nkuruvange rwa shastras gakondo zo mubuhinde hamwe nikoranabuhanga rigezweho.\nAnusaaraka igamije kwemerera abayikoresha mu kubona inyandiko mu rurimi urwo arirwo rwose rwo mu Buhinde nyuma yo guhindurwa bivuye mu rurimi rwaturutse. Muri iki gihe cyamakuru menshi aboneka mucyongereza yaba amakuru y'ibizamini byo gupiganwa cyangwa gusoma muri rusange. abaturage benshi bo mu gihugu cyubuhinde bakoresha ururimi rwigi Hindi cyangwa urundi rurimi rwabahinde ntibashobora kubona amakuru mucyongereza. Anusaaraka igamije guca iyi mbogamizi yururimi yemerera umukoresha kwinjiza inyandiko yicyongereza muri Anusaaraka akayisoma mururimi rwabahinde bahisemo.\nAnusaaraka yakuye izina ryayo mu ijambo rya Sanskrit \"anusaran\" risobanura \"gukurikira.\" Byitwa cyane, nkuko bisobanurwa na Anusaaraka bisohoka kandi bigaragara mubice bimwe na bimwe ni ukuvuga urukurikirane rw'intambwe zikurikirana kugeza igihe ibisobanuro byanyuma byerekanwe kubakoresha.\nKugaragaza kwizerwa kwinyandiko mururimi rwinkomoko.\nMubice bitandukanye byasohotse Anusaaraka, hariho imbaraga zo kwemeza ko uyikoresha agomba kuba ashoboye kumva amakuru akubiye mu nteruro yicyongereza. izi mbaraga ziihabwa agaciro kuruta gutanga interuro nziza mu rurimi rw'igihinde, kuko byaba ari ubusa kugira ubusobanuro busoma neza ariko ntibufate neza amakuru yinyandiko yaturutse.\nAmabara mubisohoka yerekana ijambo icyiciro:"}
{"id": "20850", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20850", "title": "Porogaramu irinda imvune ziterwa no gukora ibintu kenshi.", "text": "Gukomereka inshuro nyinshi ;RSI mu mpine mu rurimi rw'icyongereza; ni ibikomere ku mitsi y'umubiri, ingingo, imitsi, ligaments, amagufwa, cyangwa imitsi biterwa no kugenda inshuro nyinshi. Ibikomere nk'ibi birashoboka cyane nk'iyo kugenda bisaba imbaraga cyangwa bikajyana no kunyeganyega,umunyegamo w'imitsi, kugororoka birenze urugero, cyangwa kubungabunga imyanya ihamye. Kumara igihe kinini ukoresha ibikoresho by'ikoranabuhanga nka mudasobwa bishobora gutuma umuntu arwara ingingo zo hejuru, cyane cyane mu ngingo z'ukuboko cyangwa umugongo. RSIs ni agace k'indwara ya sisitemu y'imikaya n'amagufwa(musculoskeletal system).\nPorogaramu zitandukanye ziboneka byoroshye kugira ngo zibashe gufasha abantu kwirinda imvune cyangwa ububabare bw'ako kanya / ibikomere biterwa no gukoresha mudasobwa.\nIbyiciro bya porogaramu.\nPorogaramu zo kurinda imvune ziterwa no gukora ibintu inshuro nyinshi (RSI) akenshi zikora mu byiciro by'akazi bikurikira.\nIbyibutsa gufata ikiruhuko.\nIbi bishobora kuba ibintu by'ingenzi ku banu benshi. Amahitamo yo guhitamo igikoresho harimo uburyo ibikoresho bikoreshwa mu guhitamo igihe, imenyesha ryo gufata ikiruhuko rikenewe, uburyo bwo kuruhuka, n'uburyo igikoresho cyoroshye kugikoresha.\nIbikoresho byinshi bikoresha amasaha yoshye (urugero, kwibutsa kuruhuka buri minota 60). Ibyo bishobora gukora neza niba akazi gakorerwa kuri mudasobwa gahoraho ariko gashobora kurangaza mu gihe ako akazi kadahoraho kuri mudasobwa. Ibindi bikoresho biteganya kuruhuka karemano no gutinza ibyifuzo byo kuruhuka bitewe n'impamvu zimwe na zimwe. Ibikoresho bimwe na bimwe byerekana imiterere mu bikorwa kandi bigatanga ibitekerezo byo kuruhuka vuba cyangwa nyuma bitewe n'ibikorwa ibyo ari byo. Ibi bikoresho bishobora kubabaza cyangwa kurakaza umuntu mu ihe akazi ka mudasobwa kavanzwe n'ibindi bikorwa mu umunsi wose."}
{"id": "20853", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20853", "title": "Inyandiko y'abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona(Braille)", "text": "Braille (/\u02c8 b r e\u026a l / BRAYL,) ni uburyo bwo kwandika bwitondewe bukoreshwa n'abantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona. Ishobora gusomwa haba ku mpapuro zometse ku bintu cyangwa ukoresheje disikuru ishobora kuvugururwa ihuza mudasobwa n'ibikoresho bya telefone. Braille ira\nshobora kwandikwa ukoresheje icyapa na stylus, umwanditsi w'impapuro, icyuma cya elegitoronike cyangwa ukoresheje mudasobwa ihujwe n'udushushanyo twa braille. Ku basomyi bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona, braille ni uburyo bwigenga bwo kwandika, aho kuba code y'imyandikire yanditswe. \nBraille yitiriwe uwayikoze, Louis Braille, Umufaransa wabuze amaso kubera impanuka yagize mu bwana bwe. Mu 1824, afite imyaka cumi n'itanu, yateje imbere code ya braille ishingiye ku nyuguti z'igifaransa nk'iterambere mu kwandika nijoro. Yasohoye sisitemu ye, nyuma y'aho harimo no kumenyekanisha umuziki, mu 1829.Ishyirwamo rya kabiri ryasohotse mu 1837 ni ryo ryabaye uburyo bwa mbere bw'inyandiko bushingiye ku mibare ibiri(binary)bwakozwe mu gihe cya none.\nInyuguti z'abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona zakozwe hakoreshejwe guhuza utudomo dutandatu twazamuye dutondekanye muri 3\u00a0\u00d7\u00a0Matrix 2, bita selile ya braille. Umubare na gahunda by'ududomo bitandukanya inyuguti n'indi. Kubera ko inyuguti zinyuranye za braille zatangiye nk'imyandikire yo kwandikwa yanditse, amakarita (ibice byerekana imiterere) aratandukanye bitewe n'ururimi, ndetse no muri rumwe; mucyongereza braille hari inzego eshatu:Inyandiko ya braille yuzuye \u2013 inyuguti ku yindi ikoreshwa mu gusoma no kwandika;inyandiko ya Braille yo ku rwego rwa gatatu, ikoresha uburyo bwihariye kandi butemewe mu rwego rusange, bukoreshwa n'abantu ku giti cyabo nk'uburyo bwo kwandika byihuse.\nIbyiyongera ku nyandiko ya braille (inyuguti, utumenyetso, impine), birashoboka kandi gukora amashusho ashushanyije ndetse n'imigaragire y'amakuru(graph), hamwe n'imirongo yaba ikomeye cyangwa ikozwe mu rukurikirane rw'ubudomo, imyambi, n'amasasu manini kuruta utudomo twa braille. Akazi ka braille kuzuye karimo utudomo dutandatu twazamuye dutondekanye mu nkingi ebyiri, buri nkingi ifite utudomo dutatu. Imyanya y'akadomo igaragazwa n'imibare kuva kuri umwe kugeza kuri itandatu. Hariho uburyo 64 bushoboka, harimo nta kadomo na gato ku mwanya w'ijambo. Utudomo twiboneza dushobora gukoreshwa duhagarariye inyuguti, imibare, akamenyetso, cyangwa ijambo. \nKwiga braille hakiri kare ni ingirakamaro mu gusoma no kwandika, uburezi n'akazi ku babana n'ubumuga bwo kutabona. Hatatiwe ku ihindagurika ry'ikoranabuhanga rishya, harimo na porogaramu isoma ecran isoma amakuru mu ijwi riranguruye, braille ifasha ababana n'ubumuga bwo kutabona kubona imyandikire, utumenyetso n'izindi ngingo z'ururimi rwanditse bitagerwaho binyuze mu majwi gusa.\nMu gihe bamwe basabye ko tekinoroji ishingiye kumajwi izagabanya gukenera braille, iterambere ry'ikoranabuhanga nka braille yerekanwe ryakomeje gutuma braille irushaho kuboneka no gukoresha byoroshye. Abakoresha Braille bagaragaza ko braille ikomeza kuba nk'ibyingenzi ku bareba. "}
{"id": "20854", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20854", "title": "Umusizi w'indimi", "text": "Umusizi w'indimi ni tekinoroji ya mashini (MT) hamwe na marike ya RWS. Izina ry'ikirango ryagarutsweho mu 2021 nyuma yo kugura SDL na Iconic Translation Machines Ltd no guhuza amakipe n'ikoranabuhanga bihwanye.Umusizi w'indimi(Language weaver) yahoze ari sosiyete yihariye yaguzwe na SDL mu 2010.\nLanguage weaver yari sosiyete ya Los Angeles, muri Californiya yashinzwe mu 2002 yashinzwe muri sosiyete yo muri kaminuza y\u2019amajyepfo ya California. Iyi sosiyete yashinzwe mu rwego rwo kumenyekanisha uburyo bw\u2019ibarurishamibare bwo guhindura ururimi rwikora no gutunganya ururimi karemano ruzwi ku izina ry\u2019imashini isobanura imibare (SMT). Izina ry\u2019iyi sosiyete ryerekeza ku umwe mu batangiye guhindura indimi bakoresheje imashini yitwa Warren Weaver watanze igitekerezo cya mbere cyo gukoresha mudasobwa muri 'decode' cyangwa 'decrypt' mu nyandiko za kera mu 1947.\nImibare y'ububiko bw'ururimi mu buryo bwo guhindura indimi hifashishijwe imashini yari igezweho muri kiriya gihe, kandi iterambere ryari ryinshi mu buryo bwabanje nka MT-ishingiye kuri MT. Abasizi b'ururimi bakomeje kwiyongera mu gihe cy'imyaka 8, aho abakozi bagera kuri 96 bakora mu biro byo muri Amerika, Uburayi, n'Ubuyapani. Iyi sosiyete yari ifite ubucuruzi bukomeye n\u2019imiryango ya Leta aho izina ryayo rikomeje kumenyekana cyane kugeza na magingo aya.\nMuri Nyakanga 2010, Language weaver yaguzwe na SDL plc kuri miliyoni 42.5 z'amadolari y'Amerika hanyuma iyi sosiyete ihindurirwa izina yitwa SDL Language Weaver. \nUmusizi w'indimi wa SDL.\nSDL Language weaver ni ubuhanga bw'ibanze bwo guhindura indimi hifashishijwe imashini muri SDL aho, uko igihe cyagiye gihita, yavuye kuri SMT ihinduka MT ishingiye kuri syntax, ihinduka Neural Machine Translation. Ikirangantego cy'ururimi rwasezeye muri 2015 kugira ngo SDL BeGlobal ikemurwe nigicu, hamwe na SDL Enterprises Translation Server kugirango ikemurwe mbere. Nyuma, ibyo bicuruzwa byongeye guhindurirwa izina byitwa SDL Machine Translation Cloud hamwe na SDL Machine Translation Edge.\nGutangiza bundi bushya muri 2021.\nIkirangantego cya Language weaver cyasubukuwe mu 2021 nyuma yo kugura SDL na RWS, hamwe no guhuza amakipe ya SDL MT na Iconic Translation Machines hamwe n'ikoranabuhanga. Tekinoroji ihuriweho n\u2019ibigo byombi, ishingiye ku buhanga bugezweho bwa Transformer ishingiye kuri Neural Machine Translation, ubu igurishwa nka \"Language Weaver\" guhindura indimi hakoreshejwe imashini bikorerwa mu ruyanja rw'ikoraniro(cloud)), na \"Language Weaver Edge\" kuri MT-mbere.\nIndimi zishyigikiwe.\nKuva Nzeri 2021, Language Weaver ikorana n'indimi zikurikira:"}
{"id": "20855", "revid": "13150", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20855", "title": "Uburenganzira bw\u2019impunzi n\u2019abimukira mu Rwanda", "text": "= Intangiriro =\nU Rwanda rwakiriye impunzi n\u2019abimukira benshi mu myaka yashize, rukaba rufite amateka akomeye mu guha ubuhungiro abantu bavuye mu bihugu bitandukanye kubera intambara, ihohoterwa, cyangwa ibibazo by\u2019ubukungu. U Rwanda rwashyizeho politiki n\u2019amategeko agenga kwakira impunzi n\u2019abimukira, harimo n\u2019amasezerano mpuzamahanga yashyizweho umukono, kugira ngo habeho kubakira impunzi no kuzibafasha mu mibereho myiza.\nImibare y\u2019impunzi n\u2019abimukira mu Rwanda.\nNk\u2019uko imibare ya UNHCR ibigaragaza, mu kwezi kwa Nyakanga 2025, u Rwanda rwakiriye impunzi n\u2019abimukira barenga 136,000, barimo impunzi 115,490 n\u2019abasaba ubuhungiro 14,950. Abenshi muri bo baturutse mu bihugu bya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (DRC) na Burundi. Ibi bituma u Rwanda ruba igihugu cya gatatu muri Afurika mu kwakira impunzi benshi, nyuma ya Ouganda na Etiyopiya.\nAmategeko n\u2019amasezerano agenga impunzi n\u2019abimukira.\nU Rwanda rwashyizeho amategeko n\u2019amasezerano agenga impunzi n\u2019abimukira, harimo:\nImibereho y\u2019impunzi n\u2019abimukira.\nImpunzi n\u2019abimukira mu Rwanda bahabwa serivisi zitandukanye:\nImbogamizi n\u2019ibibazo.\nNubwo u Rwanda rwakoze byinshi mu kwakira impunzi n\u2019abimukira, hari imbogamizi n\u2019ibibazo bikigaragara:\nIngamba n\u2019ibikorwa by\u2019iterambere.\nMu rwego rwo gukomeza guteza imbere imibereho y\u2019impunzi n\u2019abimukira, u Rwanda rukora ibi bikurikira:\nUmwanzuro.\nU Rwanda rwakoze byinshi mu kwakira impunzi n\u2019abimukira, rukabaha ubuhungiro, ubuzima, uburezi, n\u2019imibereho myiza. Ariko hari imbogamizi n\u2019ibibazo bikigaragara, bikaba bisaba ubufatanye bw\u2019inzego zose, harimo guverinoma, UNHCR, imiryango itegamiye kuri leta, n\u2019abaturage, kugira ngo habeho iterambere rirambye ry\u2019impunzi n\u2019abimukira."}
{"id": "20856", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20856", "title": "Uburenganzira bw'umugore n'umwangavu muri Qatar", "text": "= Intangiriro =\nQatar, igihugu giherereye mu Burasirazuba bwo Hagati, cyagiye kigaragaza ubushake bwo guteza imbere uburenganzira bw'umugore n'umwangavu mu myaka yashize. Nubwo hari intambwe zatewe, hakiri imbogamizi mu kubahiriza uburenganzira bwabo.\nUburenganzira bw\u2019Umugore muri Qatar.\nUburenganzira bwo Guhitamo Umugabo.\nMu mategeko ya Qatar, umugore asabwa uruhushya rw'umugabo we kugira ngo ashobore gushyingirwa. Ibi bituma umugore adafite ubwigenge mu guhitamo uwo azashakana na we.\nUburenganzira bwo Gukora.\nAbagore bo muri Qatar bafite uburenganzira bwo gukora, ariko hari imirimo imwe n'imwe basabwa uruhushya rwo kuyikora, cyane cyane mu nzego za Leta.\nUburenganzira bwo Kwiga.\nAbagore bafite uburenganzira bwo kwiga, kandi hari gahunda zitandukanye ziteza imbere ireme ry'uburezi bw'abagore, harimo no kubaha amahirwe angana n'abagabo mu mashuri makuru n'amakuru.\nUburenganzira bw\u2019Umwangavu muri Qatar.\nUburezi bw\u2019Abakobwa.\nAbakobwa bafite amahirwe angana n'abahungu mu burezi, kandi hari gahunda zihariye zo guteza imbere uburezi bw'abakobwa, harimo no kubaha amahirwe yo kwiga mu mashuri yisumbuye n'amakuru.\nIhohoterwa rishingiye ku Gitsina.\nNubwo Qatar yashyizeho amategeko arengera abakobwa, ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina rikigaragara mu muryango, rikaba rikeneye gukumirwa no guhanwa.\nUburinganire mu Mirimo.\nAbakobwa bafite amahirwe angana n'abahungu mu mirimo, ariko hakiri imbogamizi mu kugera ku myanya y'ubuyobozi n'ubushobozi bwo guhitamo imirimo bakunda.\nGahunda n\u2019Inzira zo Guteza Imbere Uburenganzira.\nGahunda za Leta.\nLeta ya Qatar yashyizeho gahunda zitandukanye zo guteza imbere uburenganzira bw'abagore n'abakobwa, harimo gahunda zo kubaha amahirwe angana mu burezi, mu mirimo, no mu nzego za Leta.\nInkunga z\u2019Imiryango Mpuzamahanga.\nImiryango mpuzamahanga nka UN Women, UNICEF, na Human Rights Watch ikorana na Leta ya Qatar mu guteza imbere uburenganzira bw'abagore n'abakobwa, binyuze mu bikorwa byo kubaha amahirwe angana no kurwanya ihohoterwa.\nImbogamizi n\u2019Inzira zo Kuzirwanya.\nNubwo hari intambwe zatewe, hakiri imbogamizi mu kubahiriza uburenganzira bw'abagore n'abakobwa, harimo ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina, imbogamizi mu kugera ku myanya y'ubuyobozi, no kutagira uburenganzira bwo guhitamo uwo bashakana.\nUmwanzuro.\nQatar yashyizeho amategeko n'amabwiriza agamije guteza imbere uburenganzira bw'abagore n'abakobwa, ariko hakiri imbogamizi mu kubahiriza ayo mategeko. Gukomeza gushyira mu bikorwa gahunda ziteza imbere uburenganzira bw'abagore n'abakobwa bizafasha kugera ku ntego yo kubaha amahirwe angana n'abagabo mu nzego zose."}
{"id": "20857", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20857", "title": "Uburenganzira bw\u2019Abakirisitu mu Bushinwa", "text": "= Intangiriro =\nMu Bushinwa, abakirisitu bahura n'ibibazo bikomeye bijyanye n'uburenganzira bwabo bwo gusenga no kwimakaza ukwemera kwabo. Nubwo itegeko nshinga rya Leta ya Repubulika y\u2019u Bushinwa rivuga ko abaturage bafite uburenganzira bwo kwemera imyemerere yabo, mu bikorwa usanga hariho igitutu gikomeye ku idini ryose ritemerewe n\u2019ubutegetsi.\nAmategeko n'Imyitwarire ya Leta.\nItangazo rya Leta ryo mu 2018 ryashyizeho amabwiriza agenga imyemerere, harimo no gukumira ibikorwa by\u2019idini byinjira mu buzima bw\u2019abana bato, ndetse no kubuza amashuri y\u2019idini. Ibi byatumye abakirisitu benshi bahura n\u2019imbogamizi mu gusenga no kwimakaza ukwemera kwabo mu buryo bwubahirije amategeko.\nAmadini yemewe n'ubutegetsi.\nMu Bushinwa, hari amadini yemewe n\u2019ubutegetsi, arimo:\nAbakirisitu benshi bakomeza gukorera mu nsengero z\u2019ibanga (underground churches) kubera kutemera gukorana n\u2019ubutegetsi mu bijyanye n\u2019imyemerere yabo.\nGukandamiza abakirisitu.\nAbakirisitu bakorera mu nsengero z\u2019ibanga bahura n\u2019ibibazo bikomeye, birimo:\nGahunda ya \"Sinicization\".\nLeta y\u2019u Bushinwa yashyizeho gahunda yo \"Sinicizing\" imyemerere, igamije guhindura imyemerere y\u2019amadini kugira ngo ijyane n\u2019imyemerere ya gisoshalizime y\u2019ubutegetsi. Ibi byatumye abakirisitu benshi bahura n\u2019imbogamizi mu gusenga no kwimakaza ukwemera kwabo mu buryo bwubahirije amategeko.\nInkunga n'ubufasha.\nHari imiryango mpuzamahanga itanga inkunga n'ubufasha ku bakirisitu bahura n'ibibazo mu Bushinwa, harimo:\nUmwanzuro.\nNubwo abakirisitu mu Bushinwa bafite uburenganzira bwo gusenga no kwimakaza ukwemera kwabo, mu bikorwa usanga hariho igitutu gikomeye ku idini ryose ritemerewe n\u2019ubutegetsi. Abakirisitu bakorera mu nsengero z\u2019ibanga bahura n\u2019ibibazo bikomeye, birimo gufungwa, gukorerwa iyicarubozo, no kwimurwa. Gahunda ya \"Sinicization\" yashyizweho na Leta igamije guhindura imyemerere y\u2019amadini kugira ngo ijyane n\u2019imyemerere ya gisoshalizime y\u2019ubutegetsi. Hari imiryango mpuzamahanga itanga inkunga n'ubufasha ku bakirisitu bahura n'ibibazo mu Bushinwa, ariko hakiri imbogamizi mu kubahiriza uburenganzira bwabo."}
{"id": "20858", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20858", "title": "Uburenganzira bw'umugabo", "text": "= Intangiriro =\nUburenganzira bw'umugabo, cyangwa \"Men\u2019s Rights\", ni igice cy'uburenganzira bwa muntu gishingiye ku burenganzira, inshingano, n'amahirwe abagabo bafite mu muryango, mu gihugu no ku rwego mpuzamahanga. Nk\u2019uko amategeko mpuzamahanga, imico, n\u2019amateka byabigaragaje, abagabo bagira inshingano zinyuranye mu muryango n\u2019ahandi, ariko hari igihe uburenganzira bwabo budahabwa agaciro cyangwa bukagorwa n\u2019imyitwarire y\u2019imiryango, leta, cyangwa sosiyete. Ubusanzwe, ibiganiro ku burenganzira bw\u2019umugabo bifitanye isano no gusuzuma uburyo abagabo bahabwa amahirwe angana n\u2019abandi mu nzego zose z\u2019ubuzima, harimo uburenganzira bwo kwiga, gukora, kugira imibereho myiza, no kugira uruhare mu buyobozi bw\u2019imiryango n\u2019igihugu.\nInkomoko n\u2019Amateka.\nInkomoko y\u2019inkuru ku burenganzira bw\u2019umugabo ishobora gusurwa mu mateka y\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019abantu n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019imico n\u2019amategeko. Mu bihugu byinshi by\u2019uburasirazuba n\u2019iby\u2019uburengerazuba, abagabo bagize uruhare rukomeye mu buyobozi, mu mirimo, ndetse no mu muryango, ariko nubwo bagize ubushobozi n\u2019imbaraga mu bikorwa bitandukanye, ntibahabwaga amahirwe angana mu bijyanye n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019umuntu wese mu bihe bimwe na bimwe.\nMu kinyejana cya 19 n\u2019icya 20, hagaragaye impinduka zikomeye ku bijyanye n\u2019imibereho y\u2019abagabo, aho imibereho y\u2019imiryango, intambara, ndetse n\u2019ihindagurika ry\u2019imyemerere y\u2019umuco byagize ingaruka ku burenganzira bwabo. Aha, hakenewe kureba uburyo abagabo bahuye n\u2019ibibazo bijyanye n\u2019ubuzima, uburenganzira bwo gutura, uburenganzira bwo kurengera ubuzima bwabo, ndetse no guhabwa amahirwe angana mu mashuri n\u2019akazi.\nMu mateka y\u2019isi yose, abagabo bakunze kugaragarizwa imirimo ikomeye ndetse no guhatanira amahirwe mu rwego rw\u2019ubukungu n\u2019imibereho myiza, ariko hakiri igihe imiterere y\u2019amategeko cyangwa imico yababuza kubona uburenganzira busesuye. Ibi byagaragaje ko nubwo abagabo bahabwa ubushobozi mu mirimo, hariho inzitizi ku burenganzira bwabo bwite, ndetse no mu bijyanye n\u2019imibereho, ubuzima, n\u2019imiryango.\nIby\u2019ingenzi by\u2019Uburenganzira bw\u2019Umugabo.\nUburenganzira bw\u2019umugabo burimo ibintu byinshi bigamije kurengera no guteza imbere imibereho myiza y\u2019abagabo, harimo:\nImpamvu Z\u2019ingenzi Zo Kwita ku Burenganzira bw\u2019Abagabo.\nHari impamvu nyinshi zituma uburenganzira bw\u2019umugabo bugomba kwitabwaho:\nUmwanzuro w\u2019Intangiriro.\nIntangiriro ku burenganzira bw\u2019umugabo igaragaza ko abagabo, kimwe n\u2019abandi bose, bafite uburenganzira busesuye bwo kugira imibereho myiza, uburenganzira bwo kwiga, gukora, no kurindwa ihohoterwa. Nubwo abagabo bahabwa inshingano nyinshi mu muryango no mu gihugu, hari igihe uburenganzira bwabo butubahirizwa cyangwa bukagorwa n\u2019imiryango, leta, cyangwa sosiyete. Kumenya no gusuzuma uburenganzira bw\u2019umugabo ni ingenzi kugira ngo habeho sosiyete yuzuye, itekanye, kandi itanga amahirwe angana ku bantu bose.\n= Amategeko n\u2019Uburenganzira bw\u2019Umugabo =\nUburenganzira bw\u2019umugabo bushingiye ku mategeko mpuzamahanga, ibihugu, n\u2019imiryango y\u2019ibanze. Mu rwego rw\u2019amategeko, abagabo bafite uburenganzira busesuye bwo kwiga, gukora, kugira imibereho myiza, no kurindwa ihohoterwa, kimwe n\u2019uburenganzira bwo kugira uruhare mu muryango no mu gihugu. Nubwo hari amategeko amwe atanga amahirwe angana ku bagabo n\u2019abagore, hari ibihugu cyangwa imico bimwe na bimwe aho uburenganzira bw\u2019umugabo bushobora kutubahirizwa cyangwa bukagorwa.\nAmategeko mpuzamahanga.\nAmategeko mpuzamahanga ku burenganzira bwa muntu arengera abagabo kimwe n\u2019abandi bose. Itegeko mpuzamahanga ry\u2019ibanze ni **Universal Declaration of Human Rights (UDHR)** yashyizweho mu 1948, rikagena ko umuntu wese afite uburenganzira bwo kubaho, kwigenga, no kugira imibereho myiza. Uburenganzira bw\u2019umugabo burimo:\nIbyo amategeko mpuzamahanga byibanda ku gutanga amahirwe angana, kurengera imibereho myiza, no guhangana n\u2019akaga kose gashobora guhungabanya ubuzima bw\u2019umugabo.\nAmategeko y\u2019igihugu.\nMu bihugu byinshi, amategeko y\u2019igihugu arengera abagabo mu nzego zose z\u2019imibereho. Ibi bikubiyemo:\nAmategeko menshi arengera abagabo ku bijyanye no kurindwa ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina. Ibi birimo ihohoterwa ryo mu miryango, ihohoterwa ryo ku kazi, n\u2019iyicarubozo ry\u2019ibindi bikorwa bibi bishobora guhungabanya imibereho yabo.\nUburenganzira mu kazi.\nAbagabo bafite uburenganzira bwo gukora no guhabwa amahirwe angana n\u2019abandi mu kazi, harimo:\nNubwo amategeko abibemerera, ubushakashatsi bwerekana ko abagabo benshi bakiriho ikibazo cyo kudahabwa uburenganzira buhagije bwo gufata ikiruhuko ku kazi cyangwa kwitabwaho ku buzima bwo mu mutwe.\nUburenganzira ku buzima n\u2019imibereho myiza.\nAbagabo bafite uburenganzira bwo kubona serivisi z\u2019ubuzima, harimo ubuvuzi bw\u2019ibanze, ubuvuzi bw\u2019indwara z\u2019ihungabana, no gukingirwa indwara zitandukanye.\nImibereho myiza y\u2019umugabo itegurwa no kurengera ubuzima bwe bw\u2019umubiri n\u2019ubw\u2019umutwe, guhabwa amahirwe yo kwitabwaho mu miryango, no kurindwa ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina.\nIbihugu byinshi byashyizeho gahunda zo gukangurira abagabo kwita ku buzima bwabo bwo mu mutwe, kurwanya ihungabana, no gutanga serivisi z\u2019ubuvuzi zihuse.\nUburenganzira bwo kwiga.\nAmategeko mpuzamahanga n\u2019ayo mu bihugu byinshi arengera abagabo mu kubona ubumenyi buhagije. Ibi birimo:\nNubwo amategeko abemerera aya mahirwe, imibare igaragaza ko abagabo bamwe bahura n\u2019imbogamizi zishingiye ku bukungu, imyitwarire y\u2019imiryango, cyangwa imico itabemerera kugera ku burezi buhagije.\nUburenganzira mu muryango n\u2019amategeko y\u2019imiryango.\nAbagabo bafite uruhare mu byemezo by\u2019ingenzi mu muryango harimo:\nMu mategeko menshi, abagabo bafite amahirwe angana mu byemezo by\u2019imiryango, ariko hari ibihugu aho amategeko atubahiriza uburenganzira bwabo mu guhabwa uburere bw\u2019abana cyangwa gusaranganya umutungo.\nUmwanzuro w\u2019Igice cy\u2019Amategeko n\u2019Uburenganzira.\nAmategeko y\u2019imbere mu gihugu n\u2019ayo mpuzamahanga arengera uburenganzira bw\u2019umugabo mu nzego zose z\u2019ubuzima. Uburenganzira bwabo burimo: gukora, kwiga, kugira imibereho myiza, no kurindwa ihohoterwa. Nubwo amategeko ariho, hagikenewe gukangurira sosiyete, leta, n\u2019imiryango gushyira mu bikorwa uburenganzira bw\u2019umugabo mu buryo bwuzuye kandi bwimbitse.\n= Imibare n\u2019Ibipimo (Statistics and Indicators) =\nMu rwego rwo gusobanukirwa neza uburenganzira bw\u2019umugabo, ni ngombwa kureba imibare n\u2019ibipimo bigaragaza uko abagabo babona amahirwe mu nzego zitandukanye z\u2019imibereho. Imibare igaragaza uko abagabo bahabwa amahirwe mu burezi, akazi, ubuzima, ndetse n\u2019ihohoterwa, ku isi hose no mu Rwanda.\nUburenganzira bw\u2019Umugabo mu Burezi.\nNk\u2019uko ubushakashatsi bwakozwe n\u2019Ikigo Mpuzamahanga cy\u2019Uburezi (UNESCO) bubigaragaza, ku isi hose abagabo bafite amahirwe yo kwiga amashuri abanza ku kigero cya 91%, amashuri ayisumbuye ku kigero cya 85%, na kaminuza ku kigero cya 43%.\nMu Rwanda, abagabo bafite amahirwe yo kwiga amashuri abanza ku gipimo cya 97%, amashuri ayisumbuye ku gipimo cya 78%, na kaminuza ku gipimo cya 33%.\nUburenganzira bw\u2019Umugabo mu Kazi.\nMu bijyanye n\u2019akazi, ubushakashatsi bw\u2019Ikigo Mpuzamahanga cy\u2019Umurimo (ILO) bwerekana ko ku isi abagabo bafite amahirwe yo kubona akazi ku gipimo cya 75%, ariko bafite ikibazo cy\u2019ubushomeri ku kigero cya 6.8%.\nMu Rwanda, abagabo bafite amahirwe yo kubona akazi ku gipimo cya 72%, mu gihe ubushomeri bwabo bungana na 7.2%.\nUburenganzira bw\u2019Umugabo mu Buzima.\nKu bijyanye n\u2019ubuzima, abagabo ku isi bafite amahirwe yo kubona serivisi z\u2019ubuzima ku gipimo cya 88%, ariko hari aho ubushakashatsi bwagaragaje ko abagabo batitabwaho mu bijyanye n\u2019ubuzima bwo mu mutwe.\nMu Rwanda, abagabo bafite amahirwe yo kubona serivisi z\u2019ubuzima ku gipimo cya 82%, ariko kubona ubuvuzi bw\u2019indwara zo mu mutwe bigera ku 35%.\nUburenganzira bw\u2019Umugabo ku Ihohoterwa.\nNk\u2019uko ubushakashatsi bw\u2019ISHAMI rya WHO bubigaragaza, ku isi abagabo 1 kuri 5 bahura n\u2019ihohoterwa ryo mu miryango cyangwa ku kazi.\nMu Rwanda, ubushakashatsi bwa NISR bwerekana ko 18% by\u2019abagabo bahuye n\u2019ihohoterwa mu miryango, naho 12% bahuye n\u2019ihohoterwa ku kazi.\nUmwanzuro.\nImibare n\u2019ibipimo bigaragaza ko abagabo ku isi hose n\u2019u Rwanda bafite amahirwe yo kwiga, kubona akazi, no kubona serivisi z\u2019ubuzima, ariko hakiriho icyuho mu bijyanye n\u2019ubuvuzi bwo mu mutwe, amahirwe ku mashuri yisumbuye n\u2019ayisumbuye cyane, ndetse n\u2019ihohoterwa rikorerwa abagabo.\nUko imibare igenda ihinduka, biragaragara ko hakenewe ingamba zihamye zo kongera amahirwe ku bagabo, kurengera uburenganzira bwabo, no kugabanya ihohoterwa rikorerwa abagabo mu muryango no ku kazi.\n= Ibibazo n\u2019Imbogamizi (Challenges and Barriers) =\nAbagabo bahura n\u2019imbogamizi nyinshi mu kubona no kubahirizwa kw\u2019uburenganzira bwabo, bishingiye ku mico, imitegekere y\u2019imiryango, amategeko, n\u2019imyumvire ya sosiyete.\nImbogamizi zishingiye ku muryango n\u2019imico.\nMu muryango, abagabo bashobora guhura n\u2019imbogamizi zo kudahabwa uburere bw\u2019abana, cyangwa gukemura amakimbirane mu buryo budakwiye bitewe n\u2019imico yaho.\nImico imwe n\u2019imwe ishobora gutuma abagabo batitabwaho mu bijyanye n\u2019ubuzima bwo mu mutwe, guhangana n\u2019ihohoterwa, no kubona amahirwe angana mu mashuri n\u2019akazi.\nImbogamizi zishingiye ku mategeko.\nMu bihugu bimwe na bimwe, amategeko ntahabwa agaciro bihagije ku burenganzira bw\u2019abagabo. Ibi birimo: kudahabwa uburere bw\u2019abana mu gihe cyo gutandukana n\u2019umugore, kutitabwaho mu bijyanye n\u2019ubuvuzi bwo mu mutwe, no kutabona amahirwe angana mu kazi.\nImbogamizi zishingiye ku sosiyete n\u2019imiryango.\nSosiyete imwe n\u2019imwe igaragaza imyumvire ko abagabo bakwiye kwihanganira ibibazo ku giti cyabo, bituma batabaza cyangwa batabona ubufasha mu gihe bahuye n\u2019ihohoterwa, indwara z\u2019ubuzima bwo mu mutwe, cyangwa ikibazo cyo kudahabwa amahirwe angana.\nIbyemezo n\u2019Inama (Recommendations).\nKugira ngo uburenganzira bw\u2019umugabo bubahirizwe mu buryo bwuzuye, hakenewe ingamba zihamye mu nzego zose.\nUmwanzuro (Conclusion).\nUburenganzira bw\u2019umugabo ni ingenzi mu guteza imbere sosiyete itanga amahirwe angana ku bantu bose, ikarengera imibereho myiza y\u2019abagabo mu muryango, ku kazi, no mu burezi.\nNubwo amategeko mpuzamahanga n\u2019ay\u2019ibihugu amwe arengera abagabo, hakiri imbogamizi zishingiye ku mico, amategeko, n\u2019imiryango. Kugira ngo hakemurwe izi mbogamizi, hakenewe ingamba zifatika zirimo amategeko, gahunda zo kwigisha sosiyete, gahunda z\u2019uburezi, gahunda z\u2019ubuzima, ndetse no kurwanya ihohoterwa rikorerwa abagabo.\nGushyira mu bikorwa izi ngamba bizafasha mu kugera ku sosiyete yuzuye, itekanye, kandi itanga amahirwe angana ku bagabo n\u2019abagore bose."}
{"id": "20859", "revid": "16645", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20859", "title": "Abafite ubumuga (Amahirwe angana, kurengera uburenganzira no kugira uruhare", "text": "Abafite ubumuga (Amahirwe angana, kurengera uburenganzira no kugira uruhare rwuzuye) Itegeko, 1995 ni itegeko ryo gushyira mu bikorwa Itangazo ryerekeye uruhare rwuzuye n\u2019uburinganire bw\u2019abafite ubumuga mu karere ka Aziya na pasifika.\nUbuhinde bwashyizeho umukono kwitangazo ryavuzwe kandi ni ngombwa gushyira mu bikorwa Itangazo ryavuzwe haruguru.\nREBA"}
{"id": "20860", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20860", "title": "Uburenganzira bw\u2019abafungwa mu Rwanda n\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu ku isi", "text": "= Intangiriro =\nUburenganzira bw\u2019abafungwa ni ihame ry\u2019ingenzi mu mategeko mpuzamahanga, rikaba rishingiye ku bwubahane bw\u2019ikiremwamuntu no kurengera agaciro k\u2019umuntu wese, haba ari uwafunzwe cyangwa utari mu buroko. Iri hame rigamije kurinda ihohoterwa, gukorerwa iyicarubozo, no guharanira ko abafungwa babaho mu buzima bwubahiriza uburenganzira bwabo bwa muntu. Mu Rwanda, nk'uko bigaragara mu itegeko nshinga, nta muntu ugomba guterwa ubwoba cyangwa guhohoterwa mu gihe cy'ubutabera, kandi abafungwa bagomba guhabwa agaciro n'uburenganzira bwabo nk'uko biteganywa n'amategeko mpuzamahanga n'ay'igihugu.\nAmategeko mpuzamahanga nk'itegeko mpuzamahanga ry\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ikiremwamuntu (International Covenant on Civil and Political Rights, ICCPR) n\u2019amasezerano mpuzamahanga arengera abafungwa, nk'Inama rusange ya Loni ku burenganzira bw\u2019abafungwa, bigena ko abafungwa bagomba kubaho mu buzima bwubahiriza uburenganzira bwabo bwa muntu. Ibi bisaba ibihugu kwirinda ibikorwa byose by\u2019ihohoterwa, iyicarubozo, cyangwa guhohotera abafungwa mu buryo ubwo ari bwo bwose.\nMu Rwanda, nubwo hari amategeko agenga uburenganzira bw\u2019abafungwa, harimo n\u2019amategeko mpuzamahanga igihugu cyashyizeho umukono, hari ibibazo bikigaragara mu ishyirwa mu bikorwa ry\u2019aya mategeko. Raporo zitandukanye zerekana ko abafungwa bakiri mu bibazo by\u2019ihohoterwa, iyicarubozo, no kutabona serivisi z\u2019ubuzima n\u2019ubutabera ku gihe. Ibi bibazo bigaragaza ko hakiri imbogamizi mu kubahiriza uburenganzira bw\u2019abafungwa mu Rwanda, nubwo igihugu cyashyizeho ingamba zo kubirwanya.\n= Amategeko Mpuzamahanga n\u2019Uburenganzira bw\u2019Abafungwa =\nUburenganzira bw\u2019abafungwa mu rwego mpuzamahanga bugenderwaho n\u2019ibyemezo n\u2019amasezerano yagiye ashyirwaho n\u2019Imiryango y\u2019Abibumbye (UN) n\u2019izindi nzego mpuzamahanga, byose bigamije kurengera agaciro k\u2019umuntu n\u2019ubuzima bwe mu gihe afungiwe, kurinda iyicarubozo, no kumwemerera amahirwe yo gusubira mu muryango n\u2019inyabutatu y\u2019ubuzima nyuma yo kurekurwa.\nIbyibanze: amasezerano n\u2019amabwiriza by\u2019ingenzi.\nAmasezerano mpuzamahanga y\u2019ingenzi agenga uburenganzira bw\u2019abafungwa harimo International Covenant on Civil and Political Rights (ICCPR), iyo Convention Against Torture (CAT), n\u2019Amabwiriza y\u2019Ibipimo Ngezwa (Standard Minimum Rules for the Treatment of Prisoners) azwi nka Nelson Mandela Rules ; aya yose ashyiraho amahame ngenderwaho yo kurinda abafungwa no gutanga ibisubizo bijyanye n\u2019imikorere y\u2019ahafungirwa abantu.\nICCPR, yashyizweho umukono mu 1966, igena ko abantu bose batabwa muri yombi bagomba kubahwa mu buryo buboneye, bagahabwa uburenganzira bwo kwiregura, kubona umwunganizi mu mategeko, no kubona imibanire n\u2019ababagana (visits) aho biboneka; by\u2019umwihariko ingingo yerekana uburyo abafungwa bagomba kubaho mu buzima bwubahiriza agaciro kabo nk\u2019abantu.\nKonvansiyo ya CAT (1984) isaba ko Leta zishyiraho amategeko kandi zikumira ibikorwa by\u2019iyicarubozo, zikanashyiraho inzego zibishinzwe zo gukurikirana no guhana abahohotera; iyi Konvansiyo yagiye inatanga umurongo ku buryo ibihugu bigomba gutanga raporo no kwakira inspeksiyo zishinzwe kurwanya iyicarubozo.\nNelson Mandela Rules, zabayeho nyuma yo kuvugurura Standard Minimum Rules, zigena ibisabwa ku mibereho y\u2019abafungwa: amacumbi ahagije, ibiribwa byujuje intungamubiri, serivisi z\u2019ubuzima, uburezi n\u2019amahugurwa, imirimo izabafasha kwisubiraho, hamwe no kurinda gufungwa mu bwigunge budasobanutse; aya mabwiriza anasaba gucunga neza amakuru ku byerekeye imfungwa n\u2019igenzura ridahungabana.\nIbyo aya mategeko asaba ku burenganzira bw\u2019abafungwa.\nMu by\u2019ingenzi amategeko mpuzamahanga asaba harimo: kurindwa iyicarubozo no guhohotera, uburenganzira bwo kubona ubuvuzi, uburenganzira bwo kubona ubutabera (access to justice), uburenganzira bwo gusurwa n\u2019imiryango, guhabwa amakuru ku mabwiriza y\u2019aho afungiwe, hamwe no kugira gahunda zigarura imfungwa mu buzima busanzwe (rehabilitation and reintegration).\nAmategeko asaba kandi ko habaho uburyo bw\u2019igenzura n\u2019ubutabera ku rwego rw\u2019igihugu n\u2019urwa mpuzamahanga: ibihugu bishobora kwakirwa n\u2019inzego z\u2019iperereza za UN, hakabaho igenzura ry\u2019imfungwa n\u2019abashyitsi bahoraho (mechanisms for monitoring detention facilities) nka OPCAT (Optional Protocol to CAT) isaba igikorwa cyo gushyiraho Visiting Bodies mu bihugu byemereye kuyishyiraho.\nImiterere y\u2019uburenganzira bwo kutavunywa no kurindwa iyicarubozo.\nIngingo z\u2019ibanze muri ICCPR na CAT zihanangiriza ko nta muntu ugomba guhura n\u2019ihohoterwa cyangwa gukorerwa inyuma y\u2019ubutabera; ibi bisobanura ko abayobozi b\u2019inzego z\u2019ifungwa bagomba kuba bakurikiza amategeko y\u2019uburinganire n\u2019ubuyobozi butabogamye, kandi abafungwa bagomba kugaragaza ibimenyetso byafashwe mu gihe habonetse imibonano y\u2019ihohoterwa.\nUbuvuzi mu mifungo ni uburenganzira bugaragara; Nelson Mandela Rules zisaba ko abafungwa bahabwa serivisi z\u2019ubuzima zihuse kandi zidahutaza imibereho yabo, harimo na serivisi z\u2019ubuzima bwo mu mutwe; ibi bikubiyemo gukurikirana ubuzima, gukingira indwara, no guhabwa imiti ikenewe biramutse bibonewe.\nUburenganzira bwo kubona ubutabera n\u2019amakuru.\nAmategeko mpuzamahanga asaba ko umuntu wese afunzwe ahabwa uburenganzira bwo kumenya impamvu zifunze, kubona umwunganizi mu mategeko, no kuburana mu rukiko rutabogamye mu gihe gikwiye; ibi ni inkingi ya mbere mu kurinda gufungwa nabi cyangwa gukorerwa ubutabera budakwiye.\nUburenganzira bwo kumenyeshwa amategeko n\u2019amabwiriza y\u2019ahafungirwa (information on prison regulations) ndetse no kubona dosiye ye (access to case file) nabyo byakomeje kugarukwaho mu mabwiriza ya UN, kuko bituma haba ubushobozi bwo gukurikirana imikorere y\u2019inzego z\u2019ubucamanza n\u2019iz\u2019ifungwa.\nIgenzura n\u2019izindi nzego zishinzwe kubahiriza amategeko mpuzamahanga.\nOptional Protocol to CAT (OPCAT) isaba ko habaho inzego zigenzura (national preventive mechanisms) zijya gusura no kugenzura imfungwa n\u2019ahafungirwa mu gihugu; ibi bigamije gukumira iyicarubozo, guha abafungwa uburyo bwo gutanga ibirego, no gukora raporo ku myitwarire y\u2019inzego zifunga.\nKu rwego rwa Komite (treaty bodies), ibihugu bisabwa gutanga raporo zigaragaza uko bishyize mu bikorwa ICCPR na CAT; komite z\u2019imirimo zireba ibyo byemezo zishobora gutanga observations na recommendations ku masoko y\u2019igihugu, ibi bikaba bisabwa kugira ngo habeho gukosora no kunoza imikorere y\u2019inzego zifata abafungwa.\nUko amategeko mpuzamahanga ashyirwa mu bikorwa mu Rwanda.\nU Rwanda rwemeye kandi rufite amasezerano n\u2019amabwiriza mpuzamahanga, rufite kandi amategeko y\u2019igihugu agena imikorere y\u2019ahafungirwa. Itegeko No 38/2006 ryo ku wa 25 Nzeri 2006 rigenga imfungwa n\u2019imikorere y\u2019amaprisons mu Rwanda rishyira imbere ibikubiye mu mabwiriza mpuzamahanga ku mibereho y\u2019abafungwa, ndetse n\u2019inzego nka Rwanda Correctional Service (RCS) zishinzwe ishyirwa mu bikorwa.\nRCS ikora ibikorwa byo gucunga amaprisons, gahunda z\u2019ubuvuzi, uburezi n\u2019ibikorwa byo gusubiza imfungwa mu buzima busanzwe; RCS kandi imenyekanisha raporo ku iterambere ry\u2019igororwa no kugabanya ubwinshi bw\u2019abari mu mifungo binyuze mu bwishywa no mu mihigo ya Leta.\nImbogamizi zigaragara mu ishyirwa mu bikorwa mu Rwanda.\nNubwo hari amategeko n\u2019ingamba, raporo z\u2019impuguke n\u2019iz\u2019imiryango ikora ubuvugizi zagaragaje ibibazo birimo imfungwa zihanamye cyane (overcrowding), imiterere y\u2019amacumbi atari meza, iyo hantu hari uburangare mu rwego rwa sanitation, hamwe n\u2019ibirego by\u2019ihohoterwa n\u2019iyicarubozo mu nzego zimwe na zimwe zifunga; Human Rights Watch na raporo za Minisiteri z\u2019amategeko zashyize ikibazo ku murongo mu 2024-2025.\nIngero z\u2019imfungwa zagaragajwe n\u2019abashakashatsi n\u2019itangazamakuru ku ihohoterwa no kudaha agaciro uburenganzira bwazo zatumye habaho gukangurira guverinoma gukora iperereza, kugaruza ababirimo mu manza, no gushyiraho gahunda zo kuvugurura imfungwa; kandi hari intambwe zo kugabanya ubwinshi bw\u2019abafungwa mu myaka ya vuba bitewe n\u2019ingamba zo kugabanya gutegereza imanza no gukoresha ibihano bidahuye n\u2019akarengane.\nIngaruka z\u2019imyitwarire mibi n\u2019icyo amategeko mpuzamahanga asaba.\nIyo amategeko mpuzamahanga atubahirijwe, ingaruka ku buzima bw\u2019abafungwa zirushaho kuba mbi: indwara ziterwa n\u2019imiterere mibi, ihungabana rikabije, kutabasha gusubira mu muryango igihe barekuwe, ndetse n\u2019ubushyamirane hagati y\u2019inzego zishinzwe umutekano n\u2019abaturage; bityo ni ngombwa ko ibihugu byubahiriza ICCPR, CAT na Nelson Mandela Rules kugira ngo harwanzwe izo ngaruka.\nInyunganizi z\u2019ingenzi: raporo, igenzura no gukorana mpuzamahanga.\nInzego mpuzamahanga n\u2019imiryango y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu (nka Amnesty International, Human Rights Watch, OHCHR) zikomeza gukurikiranira hafi imfungwa, zigatanga raporo, inama n\u2019ubufasha mu ishyirwa mu bikorwa ry\u2019amategeko; ibi bikaba bifasha mu gukora reforms no gushyiraho ingamba zigaragara zo kunoza imiterere y\u2019aho hafungirwa abantu.\nUmwanzuro w\u2019iki gice.\nAmategeko mpuzamahanga atanga umurongo uhamye wo kurengera uburenganzira bw\u2019abafungwa: ICCPR, CAT na Nelson Mandela Rules zishyiraho amahame akenewe. Gushyira aya mategeko mu bikorwa no gukurikirana imikorere y\u2019amaprisons ni ngombwa cyane mu kurinda iyicarubozo no guteza imbere ubuzima bw\u2019abafungwa, kandi u Rwanda rufite amategeko n\u2019ingamba bisaba ko akomeza kunozwa no gushyirwa mu bikorwa byimbitse.\n= Imibereho y\u2019Abafungwa, Ubuzima, Uburezi n\u2019Uburyo bwo Gusubizwa mu Muryango =\nImibereho y\u2019abafungwa mu Rwanda no ku rwego mpuzamahanga igaragaza uko amahame y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu ashyirwa mu bikorwa mu buryo bufatika. Gushyira imbere imibereho myiza y\u2019abafungwa ni igikorwa cy\u2019ingenzi mu kubafasha gusubira mu buzima busanzwe no kurwanya ihohoterwa rikorerwa mu magereza.\nUburenganzira ku Buzima n\u2019Ubuvuzi.\nUburenganzira ku buzima ni inkingi y\u2019ingenzi mu mibereho y\u2019abafungwa. Amabwiriza ya Nelson Mandela Rules agaragaza ko buri mfungwa igomba guhabwa serivisi z\u2019ubuzima zifite ireme, nk\u2019uko bigenerwa abaturage bose, kandi zigatangwa n\u2019abaganga bigenga batabogamye ku nzego z\u2019ifungwa.\nMu Rwanda, serivisi z\u2019ubuzima zifitwe na Rwanda Correctional Service (RCS) zikora binyuze mu bigo by\u2019ubuzima by\u2019imbere mu magereza. RCS ifatanya na Minisiteri y\u2019Ubuzima (MINISANTE) mu guha imfungwa ubwisungane mu kwivuza (Mutuelle de Sant\u00e9) no mu kubafasha kubona imiti y\u2019ibanze.\nRaporo y\u2019Ishami ry\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Abibumbye ryita ku Buzima (WHO) mu 2023 igaragaza ko 17% by\u2019imfungwa ku isi zigira indwara zifitanye isano n\u2019imiterere mibi y\u2019aho bafungirwa, harimo indwara z\u2019umwijima, za malaria, n\u2019izifata imyanya y\u2019ubuhumekero. Muri Afurika, ikibazo cy\u2019ubucucike (overcrowding) mu magereza gituma serivisi z\u2019ubuzima zidashobora guhaza abantu bose.\nImirire n\u2019Isuku.\nNelson Mandela Rules zisaba ko imfungwa ihabwa ibiribwa bihagije kandi byujuje intungamubiri, amazi meza yo kunywa, n\u2019isuku ku mubiri no mu macumbi. Ibi bigamije kurwanya indwara n\u2019imirire mibi ihoraho muri gereza nyinshi zo ku isi.\nMu Rwanda, RCS ifatanya n\u2019Ikigo cy\u2019Igihugu gishinzwe Ubuzima (RBC) ndetse na WFP (World Food Programme) mu rwego rwo kugaburira imfungwa indyo ifite intungamubiri. Ariko, raporo ya Human Rights Watch yo mu 2024 yagaragaje ko hari gereza zimwe zikigaragaramo ikibazo cy\u2019ikirere gike n\u2019imirire idahagije, cyane cyane mu gihe cy\u2019iyubakwa ry\u2019amagereza manini.\nUburenganzira ku Burezi.\nUburezi ni uburyo bw\u2019ingenzi bwo gufasha abafungwa kwisubiraho no kongera kwinjira mu buzima bw\u2019imibereho isanzwe. Nelson Mandela Rules zisaba ko buri gihugu gitanga amahirwe yo kwiga, kwihugura no guhabwa amahugurwa y\u2019imyuga imbere mu magereza.\nMu Rwanda, gahunda y\u2019uburezi mu magereza iyoborwa na RCS ifatanyije na MINEDUC na Rwanda Polytechnic, aho imfungwa zishobora kwiga imyuga itandukanye irimo ubudozi, ubukorikori, ubwubatsi, n\u2019ubuhinzi. Abarangiza aya masomo bahabwa impamyabumenyi zemewe n\u2019igihugu.\nMu mibare yashyizwe ahagaragara na RCS mu 2024, 32% by\u2019imfungwa ziri mu Rwanda zari zitabiriye gahunda z\u2019uburezi n\u2019amahugurwa y\u2019imyuga, naho 12% zari mu biganiro byo gusubizwa mu muryango (reintegration sessions). Ibi bigaragaza intambwe ishimishije mu kubaka uburyo bwo kongera gufatanya n\u2019imiryango.\nUburenganzira ku Mirimo n\u2019Ibyinjira.\nAbafungwa bemerewe gukora imirimo inyuranye itabangamira ubuzima cyangwa itarimo ibikorwa byo kubahohotera. Nelson Mandela Rules zisaba ko imirimo ikorwa mu buryo bwigenga kandi igatanga inyungu mu buzima bwabo nyuma yo kurekurwa.\nMu Rwanda, imfungwa zikora mu bikorwa by\u2019ubuhinzi, kubaka no gukora ibikoresho bitandukanye. Ibyo bikorwa bifasha RCS kubona ubushobozi bwo kwihaza mu biribwa no guha imfungwa amafaranga make yo kubika cyangwa yo gufasha imiryango yabo.\nUburyo bwo Gusubizwa mu Muryango (Reintegration).\nGusubizwa mu muryango ni gahunda y\u2019ingenzi mu buzima bw\u2019imfungwa. Umuryango w\u2019Abibumbye (UN) n\u2019amasosiyete y\u2019ubutabera basaba ko imfungwa zihabwa amahugurwa yihariye mbere yo kurekurwa, kugira ngo zishobore kwinjira mu muryango no mu buzima busanzwe.\nMu Rwanda, gahunda yo gusubiza abafungwa mu buzima busanzwe iyoborwa na RCS ifatanyije na MINIJUST n\u2019imiryango itegamiye kuri Leta (nka Prison Fellowship Rwanda). Aha, abafungwa bahabwa ibiganiro ku kwiyakira, gucunga umutungo, no kubaka imibanire myiza n\u2019imiryango yabo nyuma yo kurekurwa.\nInzitizi zikigaragara.\nNubwo hari amategeko n\u2019ingamba, ikibazo cy\u2019ubucucike, ibikoresho bike, n\u2019abakozi bake mu magereza biracyagaragara. Raporo y\u2019Ikigo cy\u2019Igihugu cy\u2019Uburenganzira bwa Muntu (NCHR Rwanda) yo mu 2025 yerekanye ko mu magereza menshi hakiri ikibazo cy\u2019imibereho y\u2019abafungwa idahagije, harimo amazi make n\u2019amacumbi mato.\nAbafungwa benshi bahura n\u2019ibibazo byo kubona uburenganzira bwo gusurwa, gukora imirimo yinjiza cyangwa kubona uburezi. Gusa, Guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda yatangiye gahunda yo kubaka gereza nshya zifite ubushobozi burenze, no gushyira imbaraga mu burezi n\u2019imirimo y\u2019abafungwa mu rwego rwo kugabanya ibyo bibazo.\nUmwanzuro w\u2019Igice.\nUburenganzira bw\u2019abafungwa ku buzima, uburezi, imirire n\u2019isuku ni inkingi z\u2019ingenzi mu kubaka ubutabera bwuzuye. U Rwanda, kimwe n\u2019ibindi bihugu, rwateye intambwe mu gushyira mu bikorwa ayo mabwiriza, ariko haracyari inzitizi zikwiye gukemurwa binyuze mu bufatanye bwa Leta, imiryango itegamiye kuri Leta, n\u2019inzego mpuzamahanga.\n= Ihohoterwa, Iyicarubozo n\u2019Uburyo bwo Kurwanya Amakosa Akorerwa Abafungwa =\nIhohoterwa n\u2019iyicarubozo mu magereza ni ikibazo gikomeye ku isi yose. Amategeko mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu, harimo ICCPR, CAT na Nelson Mandela Rules, asaba ko nta muntu ufungwa cyangwa ukurikiranwa mu mategeko akorerwa iyicarubozo cyangwa indi myitwarire mibi, kandi hakabaho uburyo bwo gukurikirana no guhana ababikora.\nIbyerekeye iyicarubozo n\u2019ihohoterwa.\nIhohoterwa rikorerwa abafungwa rishobora kugaragara mu buryo butandukanye: gukubitwa, guhohotera mu buryo bw\u2019igitsina, kubuzwa ibiribwa cyangwa ubuvuzi, gukorerwa ibikorwa bihutaza ubuzima cyangwa ihungabana. Raporo ya Human Rights Watch (2024) igaragaza ko mu Rwanda, naho uburenganzira bw\u2019abantu bubahirizwa ku rwego rw\u2019amategeko, hari aho habayeho amakosa ku bakozi b\u2019inzego z\u2019ifungwa bagakora iyicarubozo ku bafungwa.\nAmabwiriza ya Nelson Mandela Rules asaba ko abafungwa bagomba kuba bafite uburyo bwo gutanga ibirego no kugenzurwa n\u2019inzego zigenga (independent monitoring bodies), harimo na OPCAT (Optional Protocol to the Convention Against Torture), kugira ngo hirindwe ihohoterwa.\nUburyo bwo gukurikirana iyicarubozo.\nOptional Protocol to CAT (OPCAT) isaba ko ibihugu byose bigira \"National Preventive Mechanisms\" (NPMs) byajya bisura imfungwa kenshi, hakarebwa niba amategeko n\u2019amabwiriza agenderwaho. Mu Rwanda, NCHR (National Commission for Human Rights) ikurikirana ibikorwa byo kugenzura amashuri n\u2019amagereza kugira ngo hatezwe imbere uburenganzira bwa muntu.\nIbyakozwe ku rwego mpuzamahanga.\nImiryango nka UNODC, OHCHR, Amnesty International na Human Rights Watch ikora raporo zigaragaza aho amategeko atubahirizwa n\u2019aho hakwiye kunozwa. Mu bushakashatsi bw\u2019isi yose bwa UNODC (2023), 15% by\u2019imfungwa ku isi bavuga ko bahuye n\u2019iyicarubozo cyangwa guhohoterwa mu gihe cy\u2019imfungwa, naho muri Afurika yo hagati ni 21%.\nIngamba mu Rwanda.\nU Rwanda rwashyizeho amategeko n\u2019inzego zo kurwanya iyicarubozo, harimo:\nRaporo ya Human Rights Watch (2024) igaragaza ko izi ngamba zigenda zitanga umusaruro ariko hakiri inzitizi zituruka ku **ubucucike bw\u2019amagereza** n\u2019ubuke bw\u2019abakozi bashinzwe kugenzura imyitwarire y\u2019abafungwa.\nUmwanzuro w\u2019iki gice.\nIhohoterwa n\u2019iyicarubozo mu magereza bigira ingaruka zikomeye ku burenganzira bw\u2019abantu no ku mibereho yabo. Kugira ngo ibi birwanye, hakenewe amategeko akomeye, inzego zigenzura zigenzura imikorere y\u2019amaprisons, ubufatanye n\u2019imiryango mpuzamahanga, hamwe no gukomeza gutanga uburezi, ubuvuzi n\u2019imirimo ku bafungwa.\n= Umwanzuro rusange =\nUburenganzira bw\u2019abafungwa ku isi hose, harimo no mu Rwanda, ni urufunguzo mu kubaka ubutabera burambye no kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu. Ibice byose by\u2019iyi nkuru byagaragaje ko:\nMu Rwanda, hari intambwe ishimishije mu gutanga ubuvuzi, uburezi, imirire myiza, uburenganzira bwo gukora imirimo yinjiza, ndetse no gushyiraho gahunda zo gusubiza abafungwa mu muryango. Gusa, ubucucike mu magereza, ubuke bw\u2019abakozi b\u2019inzego zifungwa, n\u2019imibereho itanoze ikigaragara, bikwiye gukomeza guhangwa n\u2019ingamba nshya."}
{"id": "20861", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20861", "title": "Amategeko mpuzamahanga arengera uburenganzira bwa muntu", "text": "Amategeko mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu (IHRL) ni urwego rw\u2019amategeko mpuzamahanga agamije guteza imbere uburenganzira bwa muntu ku rwego rw\u2019imibereho, uturere, ndetse n\u2019imbere mu gihugu. Mu buryo bw\u2019amategeko mpuzamahanga, amategeko mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu agizwe ahanini n\u2019amasezerano, amasezerano hagati y\u2019ibihugu byigenga agamije kugira ingaruka zemewe n\u2019amategeko hagati y\u2019ababuranyi babyumvikanyeho; n'amategeko mpuzamahanga gakondo. Ibindi byemezo mpuzamahanga by\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu, nubwo bidakurikije amategeko, bigira uruhare mu ishyirwa mu bikorwa, kumva no guteza imbere amategeko mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu kandi bizwi ko ari isoko y\u2019inshingano \"za politiki\". \nAmategeko mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu, agenga imyitwarire y\u2019igihugu ku baturage bayo mu gihe cy\u2019amahoro asanzwe agaragara nkaho atandukanye n\u2019amategeko mpuzamahanga arengera ikiremwamuntu agenga imyitwarire y\u2019ibihugu n\u2019imitwe yitwaje intwaro itari iya Leta mu gihe cy\u2019amakimbirane, nubwo amashami yombi y\u2019amategeko yuzuzanya kandi mu buryo bumwe aruzuzanya. \nUburyo bunoze busobanura ko amategeko mpuzamahanga arengera ikiremwamuntu agaragaza imikorere y\u2019amategeko mpuzamahanga arengera uburenganzira bwa muntu; ikubiyemo amahame rusange akoreshwa kuri buri gihe cyose kimwe n\u2019amahame yihariye akoreshwa mu bihe bimwe na bimwe nk\u2019intambara yitwaje intwaro hagati y\u2019igihugu ndetse n\u2019igisirikare (ni ukuvuga IHL) cyangwa ku matsinda amwe y\u2019abantu barimo impunzi (urugero), abana (Amasezerano y\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019umwana), n\u2019imfungwa z\u2019intambara (Amasezerano y\u2019i Jeneve ya 1949).\nSisitemu y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye.\nInteko rusange y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye yemeje Itangazo na gahunda y'ibikorwa bya Vienne mu 1993, aho hashyizweho Komiseri mukuru w\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ushinzwe uburenganzira bwa muntu.\nMu 2006, hagamijwe kubahiriza. Ihinduka ryahanuye umuryango wubatswe hamwe n\u2019ibisabwa gusubiramo imanza z\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu buri myaka ine. zigamije iterambere rirambye kandi zigamije guteza imbere amategeko na politiki bigamije kugabanya ubusumbane.\nUmushinga mpuzamahanga w\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu.\nItangazo mpuzamahanga ry'uburenganzira bwa muntu.\n (UDHR) ni itangazo ry\u2019Inteko rusange y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ridashingiye ku mategeko mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu. Intiti nyinshi mu by'amategeko zivuga UDHR nk'ikimenyetso cy'amategeko mpuzamahanga gakondo.\nMuri rusange, UDHR yabaye uburenganzira bwemewe bwa muntu. Yatanze ishingiro ry\u2019amasezerano mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu akurikiza amategeko mpuzamahanga atubahiriza amategeko, ariko amaherezo yemewe\nAmasezerano mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu.\nUsibye kwemezwa mu 1966 mu masezerano abiri yagutse agize umushinga (ni ukuvuga ndetse n\u2019amasezerano), andi masezerano yemejwe ku rwego mpuzamahanga. Mubisanzwe bizwi nkibikoresho \"byuburenganzira bwa muntu\". Bimwe mubyingenzi harimo ibi bikurikira:\nKurinda akarere ninzego.\nSisitemu yo mu karere y\u2019amategeko mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu yuzuza kandi yuzuza amategeko y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu ku rwego mpuzamahanga no kurengera no guteza imbere uburenganzira bwa muntu mu bice bimwe by\u2019isi. Hariho ingingo eshatu zingenzi z\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu mu karere zashyizeho amategeko y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu ku karere:\nAmerika n'Uburayi.\nUmuryango w\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Amerika hamwe n\u2019Inama y\u2019Uburayi, kimwe na Loni, bemeje amasezerano (nubwo yaba afite uburyo buke bwo kuyashyira mu bikorwa) akubiyemo urutonde rw\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ubukungu, imibereho myiza n\u2019umuco, hiyongereyeho ayo masezerano yavuzwe haruguru yerekeye ahanini uburenganzira bw\u2019abaturage na politiki:\nAfurika.\nUmuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika Yunze ubumwe (AU) n\u2019ubumwe ndengakamere bugizwe n\u2019ibihugu 5 bya Afurika. [1] AU yashinzwe mu 2001, intego ya AU ni ugufasha guharanira demokarasi ya Afurika, uburenganzira bwa muntu, ndetse n\u2019ubukungu burambye, cyane cyane mu guca amakimbirane hagati y\u2019Afurika no gushyiraho isoko rusange kandi ritanga umusaruro. [2]\nAmasezerano y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu n\u2019abaturage n\u2019igikoresho cy\u2019ibanze cy\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu mu karere, cyagaragaye ku nkunga y\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika (OAU) (kuva cyasimbuwe n\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika). Umugambi wo gutegura Amasezerano Nyafurika yerekeye uburenganzira bwa muntu n\u2019abaturage watangajwe mu 1979.Amasezerano yemejwe ku bwumvikane n\u2019Inteko ya OAU yo mu 1981.\nHashingiwe ku ngingo ya 63 (aho yagombaga \"gukurikizwa nyuma y\u2019amezi atatu nyuma y\u2019iyakirwa n\u2019umunyamabanga mukuru w\u2019ibyemezo byo kwemeza cyangwa kubahiriza rubanda nyamwinshi\" y\u2019ibihugu bigize Umuryango wa OAU), Amasezerano nyafurika y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu n\u2019abaturage yatangiye gukurikizwa ku ya 21 Ukwakira 1986, mu rwego rwo kubahiriza ku ya 21 Ukwakira umunsi w\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu muri Afurika. \nKomisiyo Nyafurika ishinzwe Uburenganzira bwa Muntu n\u2019abaturage (ACHPR) ni urwego rw\u2019ubucamanza rw\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika, rufite inshingano zo guteza imbere no kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu n\u2019uburenganzira rusange (abaturage) ku mugabane wa Afurika, ndetse no gusobanura Amasezerano nyafurika y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu n\u2019abaturage, no gusuzuma ibirego ku giti cyabo ku ihohoterwa ry\u2019amasezerano. Komisiyo ifite ibintu bitatu byagutse: \nKugira ngo izo ntego zigerweho, komisiyo ishinzwe \"gukusanya inyandiko, gukora ubushakashatsi n\u2019ubushakashatsi ku bibazo bya Afurika mu bijyanye n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ikiremwamuntu n\u2019abaturage, gutegura amahugurwa, ibiganiro nyunguranabitekerezo n\u2019inama, gukwirakwiza amakuru, gushishikariza inzego z\u2019igihugu n\u2019inzego z\u2019ibanze zita ku burenganzira bwa muntu n\u2019abaturage kandi, nibiramuka bibaye, gutanga ibitekerezo cyangwa gutanga ibyifuzo kuri guverinoma.\" \nHashyizweho Urukiko nyafurika rw\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu n\u2019abaturage (hashingiwe ku masezerano y\u2019amasezerano yemejwe mu 1998 atangira gukurikizwa muri Mutarama 2004), komisiyo izaba ifite inshingano z\u2019inyongera zo gutegura imanza kugira ngo zishyikirizwe ububasha bw\u2019urukiko. Mu cyemezo cyo muri Nyakanga 2004, Inteko ya AU yemeje ko Urukiko ruzaza ku burenganzira bwa muntu n\u2019abaturage ruzahuzwa n\u2019urukiko nyafurika.\nUrukiko rw\u2019Ubutabera rw\u2019Ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika rugamije kuba \"urwego rw\u2019ubucamanza rw\u2019Ubumwe\". N'ubwo itarashyirwaho, igamije gufata inshingano za komisiyo nyafurika ishinzwe uburenganzira bwa muntu n\u2019abaturage, ndetse no gukora nkurukiko rukuru rw\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika, isobanura amategeko n'amasezerano yose akenewe. Amasezerano ashyiraho Urukiko nyafurika ku burenganzira bwa muntu n\u2019abaturage yatangiye gukurikizwa muri Mutarama 2004, ariko kwivanga n\u2019urukiko rw\u2019ubutabera byatinze gushingwa. Amasezerano ashyiraho Urukiko rw\u2019Ubutabera azatangira gukurikizwa igihe yemejwe n\u2019ibihugu cumi na bitanu. \nHariho ibihugu byinshi muri Afurika biregwa ihohoterwa ry'uburenganzira bwa muntu n'imiryango mpuzamahanga n'imiryango itegamiye kuri Leta.\nSisitemu yo muri Amerika..\nUmuryango w\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Amerika (OAS) ni umuryango mpuzamahanga ufite icyicaro i Washington, DC. Abanyamuryango bayo ni ibihugu mirongo itatu na bitanu byigenga-ibihugu bya Amerika\nMu myaka ya za 90, Intambara y'ubutita irangiye, kugaruka muri demokarasi muri Amerika y'Epfo, hamwe n'intego iganisha ku isi, OAS yashyizeho ingufu nyinshi kugirango yongere kwiyubaka kugirango ihuze n'imiterere mishya. Ibyashyizwe imbere ubu birimo ibi bikurikira: \nKomisiyo mpuzamahanga y'Abanyamerika ishinzwe Uburenganzira bwa Muntu (IACHR) ni urwego rwigenga rw\u2019umuryango w\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Amerika, rufite icyicaro i Washington, DC Hamwe n\u2019urukiko mpuzamahanga rw\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu, rufite icyicaro i San Jos\u00e9, muri Kosta Rika, ni rumwe mu nzego zigizwe na gahunda yo muri Amerika yo guteza imbere no kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu. IACHR ni urwego ruhoraho ruterana mu nama zisanzwe kandi zidasanzwe inshuro nyinshi mu mwaka kugira ngo zisuzume ibirego by\u2019ihohoterwa ry'uburenganzira bwa muntu mu gice cy\u2019isi. Inshingano z\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu zikomoka ku nyandiko eshatu: \nUrukiko mpuzamahanga rw\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu rwashinzwe mu 1979 hagamijwe kubahiriza no gusobanura ibivugwa mu Masezerano y'Abanyamerika y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu. Ibikorwa byayo bibiri byingenzi rero ni ugucira urubanza no gutanga inama:\nIbihugu byinshi byo muri Amerika, birimo Kolombiya, Cuba, Mexico na Venezuwela, byashinjwaga guhonyora uburenganzira bwa muntu.\nSisitemu y'Uburayi.\nInama y\u2019Uburayi yashinzwe mu 1949, n\u2019umuryango ushaje cyane ukorera mu Burayi. Numuryango mpuzamahanga ufite ubuzimagatozi bwemewe namategeko mpuzamahanga, kandi ufite indorerezi mumuryango w\u2019abibumbye. Icyicaro cy'inama ni i Strasbourg mu Bufaransa.\nInama y\u2019Uburayi ishinzwe amasezerano y\u2019i Burayi y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu n\u2019urukiko rw\u2019uburayi rw\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu. Izi nzego zihuza abagize akanama k\u2019amategeko y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu, nubwo akomeye, yoroheje kurusha ay\u2019amasezerano y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nIyi nama kandi iteza imbere Amasezerano y\u2019i Burayi agenga indimi z\u2019akarere cyangwa umubare muto n\u2019amasezerano y\u2019ibihugu by\u2019i Burayi. Kuba umunyamuryango byugururiwe ibihugu byose by\u2019Uburayi bishaka kwishyira hamwe kw\u2019Uburayi, kwemera ihame ryo kugendera ku mategeko, kandi birashoboka kandi byiteguye guharanira demokarasi, uburenganzira bw\u2019ibanze n\u2019ubwisanzure. \nAkanama k\u2019Uburayi gatandukanye n\u2019umuryango, ariko biteganijwe ko ka nyuma kazinjira mu masezerano y\u2019uburayi y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu. Akanama karimo ibihugu byose bigize Umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Uburayi. Umuryango w'ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Uburayi kandi ufite inyandiko yihariye y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu, Amasezerano y\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ibanze bw\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Uburayi. \nAmasezerano y\u2019uburayi y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu kuva mu 1950 yasobanuye kandi yemeza uburenganzira bwa muntu n\u2019ubwisanzure bw\u2019ibanze mu Burayi. Ibihugu 47 bigize Umuryango w\u2019Inama y\u2019Uburayi byashyize umukono kuri aya masezerano, bityo bikaba biri mu bubasha bw\u2019urukiko rw\u2019uburayi rw\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu i Strasbourg. rwo gukumira iyicarubozo n\u2019imiti itagira ubumuntu cyangwa itesha agaciro, hashyizweho gukumira iyicarubozo. \nInama y\u2019Uburayi yemeje kandi Amasezerano yerekeye ibikorwa byo kurwanya icuruzwa ry\u2019abantu muri Gicurasi 2005, mu rwego rwo kurinda icuruzwa ry\u2019abantu n\u2019ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina, Amasezerano y\u2019Inama y\u2019Uburayi yerekeye kurengera abana kwirinda ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina n\u2019ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina mu Kwakira 2007, n\u2019amasezerano yerekeye gukumira no kurwanya ihohoterwa rikorerwa abagore n\u2019ihohoterwa rikorerwa mu ngo muri Gicurasi 2011. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nUrukiko rw\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu n\u2019urukiko mpuzamahanga rukumbi rufite ububasha bwo gukemura ibibazo byazanywe n\u2019abantu ku giti cyabo aho kuba ibihugu. Mu ntangiriro za 2010, urukiko rwagize ibirarane by\u2019imanza zirenga 120.000 n\u2019urutonde rwategereje imyaka myinshi. Mu 2007, urukiko rwatanze imyanzuro 1.503. Ku kigero kiriho cyiburanisha, byatwara imyaka 46 kugirango ibirarane bishoboke. \nGukurikirana, kubishyira mu bikorwa no kubishyira mu bikorwa.\nKugeza ubu nta rukiko mpuzamahanga ruyobora amategeko mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu, ariko inzego z\u2019ubutabera zibaho mu masezerano amwe n'amwe ya Loni (nka komite ishinzwe uburenganzira bwa muntu muri ICCPR). Urukiko mpuzamahanga mpanabyaha (ICC) rufite ububasha ku cyaha cya jenoside, ibyaha by'intambara n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Urukiko rw\u2019Uburayi rw\u2019Uburenganzira bwa Muntu n\u2019urukiko bwa muntu rwubahiriza amategeko y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu mu karere.\nNubwo izo nzego mpuzamahanga nazo zifite ububasha ku manza zerekeye amategeko mpuzamahanga arengera ikiremwamuntu, ni ngombwa kumenya, nkuko byavuzwe haruguru, ko izo nzego zombi zigizwe n\u2019ubutegetsi butandukanye. \nInzego z'umuryango w\u2019abibumbye zita ku burenganzira bwa muntu zifite uburyo bumwe na bumwe bwo kubahiriza amategeko. Muri byo harimo inzego z\u2019amasezerano zometse ku masezerano arindwi akoreshwa muri iki gihe, hamwe n\u2019akanama gashinzwe uburenganzira bw\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye gashinzwe uburenganzira bwa muntu, hamwe na Universal Periodic Review hamwe n\u2019Umuryango w\u2019abibumbye wihariye (uzwi ku izina rya 1235 na 1503). \nGushyira mu bikorwa amategeko mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu ni inshingano z\u2019igihugu ; ni inshingano y'ibanze ya Leta kugira uburenganzira bw'ikiremwamuntu bw'abaturage.\nMu bikorwa, uburenganzira bwa muntu bwinshi buragoye kubahiriza mu buryo bwemewe n\u2019amategeko, kubera ko nta bwumvikane buke ku ikoreshwa ry\u2019uburenganzira bumwe na bumwe, kutagira amategeko y\u2019igihugu abigenga cyangwa inzego zahawe ububasha bwo gufata ibyemezo kugira ngo bishyirwe mu bikorwa. \nMu bihugu birenga 110, hashyizweho ibigo by\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu (NHRIs) mu rwego rwo kurengera, guteza imbere cyangwa kugenzura uburenganzira bwa muntu bifite ububasha mu gihugu runaka. Nubwo NHRIs zose zidakurikiza amahame ya Paris, umubare ningaruka zibi bigo biriyongera. \nAmahame y'i Paris yasobanuwe mu mahugurwa ya mbere mpuzamahanga y\u2019inzego z\u2019igihugu zishinzwe guteza imbere no kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu i Paris kuva ku ya 7 kugeza ku ya 9 Ukwakira 1991, kandi yemejwe n\u2019icyemezo cya komisiyo ishinzwe uburenganzira bwa muntu y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye 1992/54 yo mu 1992 n\u2019icyemezo rusange cy\u2019Inteko rusange 48/134 yo mu 1993. Amahame ya Paris agaragaza inshingano nyinshi za NHRIs. \nUbubasha rusange.\nUbubasha rusange ni ihame ritavugwaho rumwe mu mategeko mpuzamahanga, aho ibihugu bisaba ububasha bw\u2019inshinjabyaha ku bantu bakekwaho ibyaha byakorewe hanze y\u2019imbibi z\u2019ubushinjacyaha, hatitawe ku bwenegihugu, igihugu batuyemo cyangwa indi mibanire iyo ari yo yose n\u2019igihugu gikurikirana. Leta ishyigikiye ikirego cyayo hashingiwe ko icyaha cyakozwe gifatwa nk'icyaha kuri bose, igihugu icyo ari cyo cyose cyemerewe guhana. Igitekerezo cyububasha rusange rero gifitanye isano rya bugufi nigitekerezo kivuga ko amahame mpuzamahanga ari \"erga omnes\", cyangwa abereyemo umuryango wisi yose, hamwe nigitekerezo cya \"jus cogens\"\nMu 1993, bwatoye \"itegeko ry\u2019ububasha rusange\" kugira ngo inkiko zazo zibone ububasha ku byaha byibasiye inyokomuntu mu bindi bihugu. Mu 1998, Augusto Pinochet yafatiwe i Londres nyuma y'ibirego n'umucamanza wo muri Esipanye Baltasar Garz\u00f3n hashingiwe ku ihame ry'ububasha rusange. Adolf Eichmann wahoze ari umupolisi wungirije w\u2019Abanazi SS yashinjwaga kugenzura iyimurwa ry\u2019Abayahudi mu nkambi z\u2019urupfu rwa jenoside yakorewe Abayahudi na we yatotejwe muri Isiraheli mu 1961. Adolf yari atuye muri Arijantine nyuma y\u2019intambara. Ihame rishyigikiwe na Amnesty International n\u2019indi miryango iharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu, bemeza ko ibyaha bimwe na bimwe bibangamira amahanga muri rusange, kandi ko abaturage bafite inshingano zo gukora.\nAbandi, kimwe na Henry Kissinger, bavuga ko \"amasezerano akwiye avuga ko ihohoterwa ry'uburenganzira bwa muntu n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu bigomba gukurikiranwa byadindije gutekereza ku ruhare rukwiye rw'inkiko mpuzamahanga. Ububasha bw'isi yose bushobora guteza igitugu ku isi hose - cy'abacamanza\". "}
{"id": "20862", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20862", "title": "Amasezerano mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu", "text": "Amasezerano mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu ni amasezerano n\u2019andi masomo mpuzamahanga akora nk\u2019amategeko y\u2019amategeko mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu no kurengera muri rusange. Hariho ubwoko bwinshi butandukanye, ariko ibyinshi birashobora gushyirwa mubyiciro bibiri bigari: \"imenyekanisha\", ryemejwe ninzego nk\u2019Inteko rusange y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye, ibyo bikaba byemewe na kamere, bityo bikaba bitemewe n'amategeko nubwo bishobora kuba byemewe na politiki kandi byubahwa cyane n'amategeko yoroshye ;, kandi akenshi bikagaragaza amahame ngenderwaho; \"n'amasezerano\" ari amasezerano y\u2019amashyaka menshi yagenewe gukurikizwa mu buryo bwemewe n\u2019amategeko, ubusanzwe arimo imvugo yandika kandi yihariye, kandi ubusanzwe arangizwa nuburyo burebure busaba kwemezwa ninteko ishinga amategeko ya buri gihugu. Ntibizwi cyane ni \"ibyifuzo\" bimwe, nubwo bisa n\u2019amasezerano kuko byemeranijweho impande zombi, ntibishobora kwemezwa ahubwo bigashyirwaho kugirango bishyirireho amahame rusange. Hashobora kandi kubaho amabwiriza yubuyobozi yemeranijweho ibihugu byinshi, kimwe na sitati yinkiko cyangwa izindi nzego. Icyemezo cyangwa ihame ryihariye muri kimwe muri ibyo bikoresho mpuzamahanga mpuzamahanga birashobora, igihe, kugera ku rwego rwamategeko mpuzamahanga gakondo yaba yemerwa na leta cyangwa atemewe, gusa kubera ko azwi neza kandi agakurikizwa mugihe kirekire.\nAmasezerano mpuzamahanga arashobora kugabanywa mu \"bikoresho by\u2019isi yose\", aho igihugu icyo ari cyo cyose ku isi gishobora kuba ishyaka, hamwe \"n\u2019ibikoresho byo mu karere\", bigarukira ku bihugu byo mu karere runaka ku isi.\nAmasezerano menshi nibyifuzo (ariko amatangazo make) ashyiraho uburyo bwo kugenzura no gushyiraho inzego zishinzwe kugenzura ishyirwa mubikorwa ryazo. Rimwe na rimwe, izo nzego zishobora kuba zifite ububasha buke bwa politiki cyangwa inzira zemewe n'amategeko, kandi zishobora kwirengagizwa n\u2019ibihugu bigize uyu muryango; mu bindi bihe, ubwo buryo bufite inzego zifite ububasha bukomeye bwa politiki kandi ibyemezo byabo bishyirwa mubikorwa. Urugero rwiza rwanyuma ni Urukiko rwu Burayi Ruharanira Uburenganzira bwa Muntu.\nUburyo bwo gukurikirana nabwo buratandukanye ku rwego rwo kugera ku muntu ku giti cye kugira ngo agaragaze ibibazo by'ihohoterwa no kwinginga. Mu masezerano cyangwa ibyifuzo bimwe \u2013 urugero nk'amasezerano y\u2019uburayi y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu \u2013 abantu cyangwa ibihugu biremewe, hashingiwe ku bihe bimwe na bimwe, kujyana imanza ku rukiko rwuzuye ku rwego mpuzamahanga. Rimwe na rimwe, ibi birashobora gukorwa mu nkiko zigihugu kubera ububasha rusange.\n, n\u2019amasezerano hamwe n\u2019ibindi bikoresho mpuzamahanga by\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu rimwe na rimwe byitwa \" \". Amasezerano mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu agaragazwa na kandi menshi avugwa kurubuga rwa OHCHR.\nIntara: Uburasirazuba bwo hagati.\n (, 1990)\nAmasezerano.\nIsi yose.\nNk\u2019uko OHCHR ibivuga, hari amategeko 9 \"y\u2019ibanze\" mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu hamwe na protocole nyinshi zitemewe. \nIntara: Uburasirazuba bwo hagati.\nItangazo rya Kairo ry'uburenganzira bwa muntu muri Islamu (OIC, 1990)\nAmasezerano.\nIsi yose.\nNk\u2019uko OHCHR ibivuga, hari amategeko 9 \"y\u2019ibanze\" mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu hamwe na protocole nyinshi zitemewe. \nIbindi bikoresho byinshi byuburenganzira bwa muntu birahari. Ingero nke:\nIntara: Uburasirazuba bwo hagati.\nAmasezerano y'Abarabu ku burenganzira bwa muntu (ACHR) (22 Gicurasi 2004)"}
{"id": "20863", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20863", "title": "Itangazo ku burenganzira bw'abafite ubumuga", "text": "Itangazo ryerekeye uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga ni ry\u2019Inteko y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye, ryakozwe ku ya 9 Ukuboza 1975. Ni icyemezo cya 3447 cyafashwe n\u2019Inteko.\nNkicyemezo cyInteko, ntabwo igomba kubahiriza ibihugu bigize uyu muryango, ariko ikora urwego rushobora gushirwaho hagamijwe amategeko mpuzamahanga n\u2019imbere mu gihugu.\nIgizwe nintangiriro ndende, n'amatangazo cumi na atatu ateza imbere cyane uburenganzira bwabafite ubumuga\nMu 2007 hemejwe.\nAmatangazo.\nItangazo ritangaza amatangazo cumi n'atatu atandukanye:\n1.Igisobanuro cyijambo \"umuntu wamugaye\" nk \"\" umuntu uwo ari we wese udashobora kwishingira wenyine wenyine, byuzuye cyangwa igice, ibikenerwa mubuzima busanzwe bwumuntu cyangwa / cyangwa imibereho, biturutse kubura, haba mubyavutse cyangwa atari, mubushobozi bwe bwumubiri cyangwa ubwenge \".\n2.Kwemeza ko ubwo burenganzira bukoreshwa ku bamugaye bose \"nta na kimwe kidasanzwe kandi nta tandukanyirizo cyangwa ivangura rishingiye ku bwoko, ibara, igitsina, ururimi, idini, politiki cyangwa ibindi bitekerezo, inkomoko y'igihugu cyangwa imibereho, imiterere y'ubutunzi, ivuka cyangwa ikindi kibazo icyo ari cyo cyose kireba abamugaye ubwe cyangwa umuryango we\".\n3.Uburenganzira bwo kubaha.\n4.Uburenganzira ku burenganzira mbonezamubano na politiki nkabandi bantu.\n5.Uburenganzira ku ngamba zagenewe \n6.Uburenganzira bwo kuvurwa, imitekerereze n'imikorere nkuko bikenewe.\n7.Uburenganzira ku bukungu n'imibereho myiza y'abaturage, harimo n'uburenganzira ku.\n8.Uburenganzira bwo gusuzuma ibikenewe mu byiciro byose byubukungu n\u2019imibereho.\n9.Uburenganzira bwo kubana nimiryango yabo cyangwa nababyeyi barera no kwitabira ibikorwa byose byimibereho, guhanga cyangwa kwidagadura.\n10.Uburenganzira bwo gukingirwa gukoreshwa, ivangura, no guhohoterwa.\n11.Uburenganzira bwo gufashwa n'amategeko.\n12.Uburenganzira bwo kugisha inama amashyirahamwe yabamugaye kubibazo bireba.\n13.Uburenganzira bwo kumenyeshwa byimazeyo uburenganzira bwatangajwe mu Itangazo."}
{"id": "20864", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20864", "title": "Amasezerano yerekeye uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga", "text": "Amasezerano yerekeye uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga ni amasezerano mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye agamije kurengera uburenganzira n\u2019icyubahiro by\u2019abafite ubumuga. Abagize aya masezerano basabwa guteza imbere, kurengera, no guharanira uburenganzira bw\u2019ikiremwamuntu n\u2019abafite ubumuga no guharanira ko ababana n\u2019ubumuga bafite uburinganire bwuzuye mu mategeko. Aya masezerano ni umusemburo ukomeye mu muryango uharanira uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga ku isi hose ufasha guhindura abantu bafite ubumuga nk\u2019ibikorwa by\u2019urukundo, kwivuza no kurengera imibereho yabo babareba nk\u2019abanyamuryango buzuye kandi bangana, bafite uburenganzira bwa muntu. Amasezerano niyo masezerano ya mbere y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu yo mu kinyejana cya makumyabiri na rimwe. \nIyi nyandiko yemejwe n'Inteko rusange y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ku ya 13 Ukuboza 2006, ku ya 30 Werurwe 2007. Nyuma yo kwemezwa n\u2019ishyaka rya 20, yatangiye gukurikizwa ku ya 3 Gicurasi 2008. Amasezerano akurikiranwa na komite ishinzwe uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga aho inama ngarukamwaka z\u2019ibihugu by\u2019ibihugu bigize CRPD zashyizeho umurongo ngenderwaho kuva mu mwaka wa 2008.Iteraniro rya cumi na gatatu ry\u2019ibihugu by\u2019ibihugu byari biteganijwe guhurira i New York muri Kamena 2020, hanyuma ryimurirwa mu buryo bw'agateganyo kugira ngo rihure mu Kuboza 2020 kubera ikibazo cya COVID-19. \nAmateka.\nAmasezerano yerekeye uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga, kimwe n\u2019andi masezerano y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu, (nk\u2019amasezerano mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu mu bya politiki na politiki ndetse n\u2019amasezerano yerekeye guca burundu ivangura iryo ari ryo ryose rikorerwa abagore) yavuye mu bikorwa by\u2019imyaka myinshi aho amahame y\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019amatsinda yatangiraga kuva mu cyifuzo kugeza ku masezerano ahuza.\nInteko rusange y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye yemeje Itangazo ryo mu 1971 ryerekeye uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe hakurikiraho Itangazo ryerekeye uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga ku ya 9 Ukuboza 1975. 1981 ni umwaka mpuzamahanga w\u2019abafite ubumuga ; ibisubizo byumwaka ni Gahunda yisi y'ibikorwa yerekeye abamugaye. Umwaka wakurikiwe n'imyaka icumi y'abafite ubumuga, 1983\u20131992. Mu 1987, inama y\u2019impuguke ku isi yose yo gusuzuma iterambere ryasabye ko Inteko rusange y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye igomba gutegura amasezerano mpuzamahanga yerekeye guca ivangura rishingiye ku bumuga. Umushinga w\u2019ibishushanyo mbonera byasabwe n\u2019Ubutaliyani ndetse na Suwede nyuma, ariko nta bwumvikane bwumvikanyweho. Abahagarariye guverinoma benshi bavuze ko inyandiko z\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu zihagije. Umunsi mpuzamahanga w\u2019abafite ubumuga (3 Ukuboza) watangajwe mu 1992 icyemezo cy\u2019Inteko rusange 47/3. Inteko rusange y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye yemeje amategeko ngenderwaho adateganijwe ku bijyanye no kunganya amahirwe ku bafite ubumuga ku ya 20 Ukuboza 1993 (umwanzuro 48/96 umugereka). Abasesenguzi benshi bavuze ko inyandiko zabanjirije CRPD ari \"yoroshye\", bitandukanye n\u2019inshingano z\u2019amasezerano ya CRPD. \nMuri Werurwe 2000, abayobozi b'imiryango itegamiye kuri Leta itandatu y\u2019abafite ubumuga, hamwe n\u2019imiryango igera ku 20 y\u2019abafite ubumuga bo mu karere ndetse n\u2019igihugu, bemeje \"Itangazo rya Beijing ryerekeye uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga mu kinyagihumbi gishya\", bahamagarira leta zose gushyigikira Amasezerano. Mu 2001, Inteko rusange, nyuma y\u2019igitekerezo cyatanzwe na Mexico, yashyizeho komite idasanzwe y\u2019amasezerano mpuzamahanga yerekeye kurengera no guteza imbere uburenganzira n\u2019icyubahiro cy\u2019abafite ubumuga kugira ngo asuzume ibyifuzo by\u2019amasezerano yuzuye kandi yuzuye agamije guteza imbere no kurengera uburenganzira n\u2019icyubahiro by\u2019abafite ubumuga, bishingiye ku buryo bwuzuye. Imiryango iharanira uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga, harimo n\u2019abafite ubumuga mpuzamahanga, ihuriro ry\u2019abakoresha n\u2019abacitse ku icumu bo mu mutwe, ihuriro ry\u2019abacitse ku icumu rya Landmine (ubu ni Corps Survivor Corps), hamwe n\u2019umuryango mpuzamahanga w\u2019abafite ubumuga bagize uruhare mu gutegura. Ihuriro mpuzamahanga ry\u2019abafite ubumuga ryabaye umuhuzabikorwa w\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumuga mpuzamahanga w\u2019abafite ubumuga, wagize uruhare rugaragara mu gutegura, cyane cyane ushakisha uruhare rw\u2019abafite ubumuga n\u2019imiryango yabo mu ishyirwa mu bikorwa no gukurikirana icyahindutse. \nMu 2001, mu nama ya 56 y\u2019Inteko rusange y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye, Mexico yatangije imishyikirano, ku nkunga ya GRULAC (itsinda ry\u2019akarere ka Amerika y'Epfo). Igihe inkunga y\u2019amasezerano yatangizwaga mu 2002 kubera abatavuga rumwe na WEOG, Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande yagize uruhare runini mu kugera ku ntera y\u2019akarere. Yabaye umuhuza kuva mu 2002 kugeza 2003, Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande yaje gufata umwanya wa Perezida wa Komite ya Ad Hoc maze ayobora imishyikirano ku masezerano y\u2019ubwumvikane muri Kanama 2006, akorana cyane n\u2019abandi bagize Komite Yorodani, Kosta Rika, Repubulika ya Ceki, na Afurika yepfo, ndetse na Koreya na Mexico. Ababikurikiranira hafi benshi bagize icyo bavuga ku \"myitwarire yo gushaka icyubahiro\" ya guverinoma, ibigo by\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu, n\u2019imiryango itegamiye kuri Leta. \nAmasezerano yabaye kimwe mu bikoresho byihutirwa by\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu mu mateka, ku nkunga n\u2019imiryango yose yo mu karere. Ibihugu 160 byashyize umukono ku Masezerano amaze gufungura mu 2007 kandi ibihugu 126 byemeje ayo masezerano mu myaka itanu yambere. Mu rwego rwo gushimira uruhare yagize mu gushyiraho ayo masezerano, ndetse n\u2019ubuziranenge bw\u2019ingamba z\u2019igihugu z\u2019ubumuga bw\u2019igihugu cya Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande, Guverineri Mukuru wa Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande Anand Satyanand yahawe igihembo cy\u2019abafite ubumuga ku isi mu 2008 mu izina ry\u2019igihugu.\nMu mwaka wa 2015, ku nshuro ya mbere mu mateka magufi, Komisiyo ishinzwe uburenganzira bw'abafite ubumuga yatangije iperereza ku gihugu cyashyizeho umukono kubera kutubahiriza inshingano z\u2019amasezerano. Iperereza ryatewe n'ingingo ya 6 ya protocole itabishaka, iteganya ko iperereza rizakorwa iyo komite imaze kubona \"amakuru yizewe agaragaza ihohoterwa rikabije kandi rihamye\" ry'uburenganzira bwa muntu bw'abafite ubumuga. Hakozwe iperereza kuri guverinoma y'Ubwongereza, raporo ya nyuma isohoka mu \nAmerika ntiyigeze iboneka mu bihugu by\u2019ibihugu byemeje cyangwa byinjiye muri ayo masezerano. Ku butegetsi bwa Barack Obama, Amerika yabaye umukono ku masezerano yo ku Nyakanga 2009. Mu, amajwi muri Sena ya Leta zunze ubumwe z\u2019Amerika yagabanutseho amajwi atandatu ku bwiganze bwa bibiri bya gatatu bisabwa kugira ngo agirwe inama kandi yemererwe kwemezwa. Muri Nyakanga 2014, Komite ishinzwe ububanyi n'amahanga ya Sena yongeye kwemeza icyemezo cyo kugisha inama no kubyemera, cyemezo nticyagejejwe ku majwi ya Sena yuzuye.\nIncamake.\nAmasezerano akurikiza imigenzo y\u2019amategeko mbonezamubano, abanziriza ijambo, aho havuzwe ihame rivuga ko \"uburenganzira bwa muntu ari rusange, butagabanywa, bwuzuzanya kandi bufitanye isano\" bw\u2019itangazo rya Vienne na gahunda y'ibikorwa. Ijambo ry'ibanze 25 rivuga mu buryo bweruye iterambere rirambye, avuga ko \"ubumuga\" ari \"igitekerezo kigenda gihinduka\" kirimo imikoranire hagati y\u2019ubumuga n\u2019ibidukikije, kandi ivuga akamaro k '\"imyumvire y\u2019uburinganire\". Ijambo ry'ibanze rikurikirwa n'ingingo 50. Bitandukanye n\u2019amasezerano menshi y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye, ntabwo agabanijwemo ibice\nIngingo ya 1 isobanura intego y\u2019amasezerano:\nguteza imbere, kurengera no guharanira uburenganzira n\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu n\u2019ubwisanzure bw\u2019ibanze n\u2019abafite ubumuga bose, no guteza imbere kubahiriza icyubahiro kavukire;\nIngingo ya 2 itanga ibisobanuro byijambo ryibanze mu ngingo za CRPD: itumanaho, (harimo Braille, ururimi rw amarenga, ururimi rworoshye n\u2019itumanaho ritavuzwe), ivangura rishingiye ku bumuga, icumbi ryuzuye hamwe n\u2019ibishushanyo mbonera.\nIngingo ya 3 isobanura CRPD umunani \"amahame rusange\" yasobanuwe hepfo, naho ingingo ya 4 isobanura \"inshingano rusange z\u2019ababuranyi.\"\nIngingo ya 5\u201332 isobanura uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga n\u2019inshingano z\u2019ibihugu by\u2019ibihugu bibareba. Benshi muri ubwo burenganzira bw'indorerwamo bwemejwe mu yandi masezerano y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye nk\u2019amasezerano mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu mu bya politiki na politiki, Amasezerano mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ubukungu, imibereho myiza n\u2019umuco n\u2019amasezerano arwanya iyicarubozo, ariko afite inshingano zihariye zemeza ko zishobora kugerwaho byimazeyo n\u2019abafite ubumuga.\nUburenganzira bwihariye muri aya masezerano burimo uburenganzira bwo kugerwaho harimo n\u2019ikoranabuhanga mu itumanaho, uburenganzira bwo kubaho mu bwigenge no gushyirwa mu baturage (ingingo ya 19), kugendagenda ku giti cye (ingingo ya 20), gutura no gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe (ingingo ya 26), no kugira uruhare mu buzima bwa politiki n\u2019abaturage, ndetse n\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019umuco, imyidagaduro na siporo (ingingo ya 29 na 30).\nByongeye kandi, abari mu Masezerano bagomba gukangurira abantu uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga (ingingo ya 8), kandi bakareba niba umuhanda, inyubako, n\u2019amakuru (ingingo ya 9).\nIngingo ya 33\u201339 zigenga raporo no gukurikirana ayo masezerano n\u2019inzego z\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu (ingingo ya 33) na komite ishinzwe uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga (ingingo ya 34 kugeza 39).\nIngingo ya 40-50 igenga kwemeza, gutangira gukurikizwa, isano n \"imiryango ihuza uturere\", kubika, guhindura, no kwamagana ayo masezerano. Ingingo ya 49 isaba ko Amasezerano aboneka mu buryo bworoshye, kandi ingingo ya 50 iteganya ko ayo masezerano \"Icyarabu, Igishinwa, Icyongereza, Igifaransa, Ikirusiya n\u2019Icyesipanyoli\" ari \"ukuri kimwe\".\nIngingo z'ingenzi.\nN'ubwo Umuryango w\u2019abibumbye wemera \"ibihimbano byemewe\" nta \"burenganzira bushya\", ingingo za CRPD zivuga ku burenganzira butandukanye bw\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu, mu gihe hiyongereyeho inshingano za Leta ivuga ko ibihugu bitanga inkunga ku burenganzira bw\u2019ubwishingizi bishobora gukurikizwa. Abanditsi batandukanye babashyira mu byiciro bitandukanye; iyi nyandiko izasobanura ibyibanze nubukanishi, hanyuma isobanure ibyiciro bitatu hafi ya byose bihwanye nigitekerezo kivuguruzanya cyibisekuru bitatu byuburenganzira bwa muntu.\nHamwe no kwiyongera kwinshi, indorerezi zagize icyo zivuga ku guhuzagurika no gufashanya mu byiciro by\u2019uburenganzira. Mu 1993, Ihuriro ry\u2019isi y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu ' Itangazo rya Vienne ryateganyaga mu ngingo ya 5 ko kubera ko uburenganzira bwa muntu \"bwari rusange, butagabanywa kandi bwuzuzanya kandi bufitanye isano.\u00a0... Ibihugu bifite inshingano zo guteza imbere no kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu n\u2019ubwisanzure bw\u2019ibanze. \" Gerard Quinn ku kuba CRPD \"ifatanya n'uburenganzira bw'abaturage na politiki n'uburenganzira mu by'ubukungu, imibereho myiza n'umuco\". Ibi bigaragara cyane cyane muri CRPD aho uburenganzira bwa politiki bwabaye impfabusa nta nkunga mbonezamubano nubukungu byuburenganzira bwubukungu n\u2019imibereho ntacyo bivuze nta ruhare.\nIbyingenzi nubukanishi.\nBimwe mu ngingo za mbere za CRPD byagaragaje intego n'ishingiro; nyuma yo gutondekanya uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga (mu ncamake mu bice bikurikira), Ingingo zayo zanyuma zerekana urwego inzego zigomba guteza imbere uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga.\nAmahame ngenderwaho y\u2019amasezerano.\nHariho amahame umunani ayobora ashingiye ku masezerano, yasobanuwe mu ngingo ya 3:\nInyandiko.\nIngingo ya 2 (Ibisobanuro) ntabwo ikubiyemo ibisobanuro byubumuga. Amasezerano yerekana uburyo bwimibereho yubumuga, ariko ntabwo atanga ibisobanuro byihariye.\nUbumuga.\nIjambo ry'ibanze ry'amasezerano (igice e) risobanura ko Amasezerano yemera:\nko ubumuga ari igitekerezo kigenda gihinduka kandi ko ubumuga buturuka ku mikoranire hagati y\u2019abafite ubumuga n\u2019inzitizi z\u2019ibidukikije ndetse n\u2019ibidukikije bibangamira uruhare rwabo muri sosiyete mu buryo bungana n\u2019abandi.\nIngingo ya mbere (Intego) irongera itanga ko:\nAbabana n'ubumuga barimo abafite ubumuga bw'igihe kirekire ku mubiri, mu mutwe, mu bwenge cyangwa mu byumviro bishobora gukorana n'inzitizi zitandukanye bishobora kubabuza uruhare rwabo muri sosiyete mu buryo bungana n'abandi.\nIhame ry \"icumbi ryumvikana\".\nAmasezerano asobanura \" icumbi ryumvikana \" nk \"\" ibikenewe kandi bikwiye guhinduka no gukosorwa bidashyizeho umutwaro utagereranywa cyangwa udakwiriye, aho bikenewe mu rubanza runaka, kugira ngo ababana n\u2019ubumuga bishimire cyangwa bakore ku buryo bungana n\u2019abandi bafite uburenganzira bwa muntu n\u2019ubwisanzure bw\u2019ibanze \"mu ngingo ya 2 kandi babisaba mu bice byose by\u2019ubuzima harimo n\u2019uburezi burimo abantu bose.\nGukangurira.\nIngingo ya 8 y\u2019aya Masezerano ishimangira ubushake bw\u2019amashyaka mu gukangurira abantu kubahiriza uburenganzira n\u2019icyubahiro mu kurwanya ivangura ry\u2019abafite ubumuga. Amashyaka yiyemeje gukangurira abantu ubumuga muri sosiyete, harimo no ku rwego rw\u2019umuryango, kurwanya imyumvire, urwikekwe n\u2019imikorere mibi yerekeye ababana n\u2019ubumuga, harimo n\u2019iyongera ku gitsina n\u2019ivangura rishingiye ku myaka. Biyemeje ubukangurambaga bugamije gukangurira abaturage guteza imbere imyumvire myiza ku isoko ry'umurimo, itangazamakuru, n'ahandi.\nUburenganzira bw'abaturage na politiki.\nCRPD ikubiyemo \"ubwisanzure buturuka\", bugaragaza ibitekerezo by\u2019ubuntu n\u2019ubumuntu bikubiye mu itangazo ry\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ryita ku burenganzira bwa muntu, Amasezerano mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu na politiki, ndetse no mu nyandiko nyinshi z\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ibihugu byinshi nk\u2019amategeko y\u2019abanyamerika bafite ubumuga. Muri CRPD, ibihugu bikunze gufata inshingano zo gutanga uburenganzira mubikorwa.\nKuboneka.\nMu ngingo ya 9, Amasezerano ashimangira ko ababana n\u2019ubumuga bagomba kubaho mu bwigenge kandi bakagira uruhare mu mibereho yose. Kugira ngo ibyo bishoboke, ibihugu by\u2019ibihugu bigomba gufata ingamba zikwiye kugira ngo ababana n\u2019ubumuga babone uburyo bwo kugera, ku bidukikije, ku bwikorezi, ku ikoranabuhanga n\u2019itumanaho, ndetse n\u2019ibindi bigo na serivisi bifunguye cyangwa bihabwa abaturage. Kugerwaho birashobora guhurizwa mumatsinda atatu yingenzi:\nKumenyekana imbere y'amategeko n'ubushobozi bwemewe n'amategeko.\nIngingo ya 12 y\u2019aya Masezerano yemeza ko abantu bose bafite ubumuga bemewe n'amategeko ndetse n\u2019ubushobozi bwemewe n'amategeko. Iteganya ko Amashyaka (Ibihugu n\u2019Umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Uburayi agomba kongera kwemeza ko ababana n\u2019ubumuga bafite uburenganzira bwo kumenyekana ahantu hose nk\u2019umuntu imbere y\u2019amategeko; bemera ko ababana n\u2019ubumuga bafite uburenganzira bw\u2019amategeko ku buryo bungana n\u2019abandi mu nzego zose z\u2019ubuzima; gufata ingamba zikwiye kugira ngo abantu bafite ubumuga babone ubufasha bashobora gusaba mu gukoresha uburenganzira bwabo mu rwego rwo gukumira ihohoterwa ry\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu buteganywa n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu buteganywa n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ikiremwamuntu buteganywa n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ikiremwamuntu buteganywa n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ikiremwamuntu buteganywa n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ikiremwamuntu buteganywa n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ikiremwamuntu buteganywa n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ikiremwamuntu buteganywa n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ikiremwamuntu buteganywa n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ikiremwamuntu buteganywa n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ikiremwamuntu buteganywa n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ikiremwamuntu buteganywa n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ikiremwamuntu buteganywa n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ikiremwamuntu buteganywa n\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu;\nIyi ngingo yabaye ingenzi cyane cyane mumiryango iharanira uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga irwanya imikorere ya leta yo kurera no kurera.\nKugera ku butabera.\nIngingo ya 13 y\u2019aya Masezerano yemeza ko ubutabera bwubahirizwa bw\u2019abafite ubumuga, buvuga ko: Impande z\u2019ibihugu zigomba guharanira ubutabera bw\u2019abafite ubumuga ku buryo bungana n\u2019abandi, harimo no gutanga amacumbi ndetse n\u2019imyaka, kugira ngo byorohereze uruhare rwabo nk'abitabira, harimo n'abatangabuhamya, mu manza zose z\u2019amategeko, harimo no mu iperereza ndetse no mu bindi byiciro bibanza.\nMu rwego rwo gufasha guharanira ubutabera bunoze ku bafite ubumuga, ibihugu by\u2019amashyaka bigomba guteza imbere amahugurwa akwiye ku bakora mu butabera, barimo abapolisi n\u2019abakozi ba gereza. Iyi ngingo hamwe n\u2019ingingo ya 12 yavuzwe na \"Igitabo cyerekeye imfungwa zifite ibibazo byihariye\" n\u2019ibiro by\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye bishinzwe kurwanya ibiyobyabwenge n\u2019ibyaha. \nUruhare mubuzima rusange (harimo n'uburenganzira bwo gutora).\nIngingo ya 29 isaba ko ibihugu byose byagiranye amasezerano birengera \"uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo gutora bakoresheje amajwi rwihishwa mu matora na referendumu rusange\". Dukurikije iyi ngingo, buri gihugu cyagiranye amasezerano kigomba gutanga ibikoresho byo gutora byafasha abatora bamugaye gutora mu bwigenge kandi rwihishwa. Demokarasi zimwe na zimwe, urugero, Amerika, Ubuyapani, Ubuholandi, Sloweniya, Alubaniya cyangwa Ubuhinde byemerera abatora bamugaye gukoresha imashini zitora za elegitoronike cyangwa imfashanyo za elegitoronike zifasha abatora bafite ubumuga kuzuza impapuro. Mu bandi, muri bo harimo Azerubayijani, Kosovo, Kanada, Gana, Ubwongereza, ndetse n'ibihugu byinshi byo muri Afurika no muri Aziya, abatora bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona barashobora gukoresha amajwi mu nyandikomvugo cyangwa mu mpapuro. Benshi muribi kandi na demokarasi zimwe na zimwe, Chili kurugero, bakoresha ameza ashobora guhinduka kugirango abatora kumuga wibimuga babegere. Demokarasi zimwe zemerera gusa undi muntu gutora abatora batabona cyangwa bamugaye. Gahunda nk'iyi, ntabwo yemeza ibanga ry'itora\nIngingo ya 29 isaba kandi ko ibihugu byagiranye amasezerano byemeza \"uburyo bwo gutora, ibikoresho n\u2019ibikoresho bikwiye, byoroshye kandi byoroshye kubyumva no gukoresha\". Muri demokarasi zimwe, ni ukuvuga Suwede na Amerika, ahantu hose batora hashobora kuboneka byimazeyo abatora bamugaye.\nUburenganzira mu bukungu, imibereho myiza n\u2019umuco.\nCRPD ifite \"ubwisanzure\" bwinshi, yemeza ko ibihugu bizatanga amazu, ibiribwa, akazi, ubuvuzi, ndetse n\u2019ubufasha bwite, bivugwa mu Masezerano y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye y\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019ubukungu, imibereho myiza n\u2019umuco. Izi ninshingano nziza leta izakora, irenze amasezerano yabanyamerika bafite ubumuga. \nKubaha umuryango.\nIngingo ya 23 y\u2019aya Masezerano ibuza guhagarika abamugaye ku gahato kandi ikanabemerera uburenganzira bwo kurera abana\nUburenganzira bwo kwiga.\nIngingo ya 24 y\u2019amasezerano ivuga ko ababana n\u2019ubumuga bagomba guhabwa uburenganzira bwo kwiga mu nzego zose, hatitawe ku myaka, nta vangura kandi hashingiwe ku mahirwe angana. Irerekana ko abana bafite ubumuga bagomba kubona neza amashuri abanza nayisumbuye ku buntu kandi ku gahato; abantu bakuru bafite ubumuga bafite amahirwe yo kwiga amashuri makuru rusange, amahugurwa yimyuga, amashuri akuze no kwiga ubuzima bwabo bwose ; n'ibindi.\nAmashyaka agomba gufata ingamba zikwiye, nka: kwemeza imyigire ya Braille, iyindi nyandiko, uburyo bwo kongera ubundi buryo, uburyo nuburyo bwo gutumanaho no kwerekana icyerekezo, hamwe no korohereza urungano no gutanga inama; gushyigikira kwiga ururimi rw'amarenga no guteza imbere indimi z'umuryango w'abatumva; guharanira ko uburezi bwabantu, cyane cyane abana, impumyi na / cyangwa ibipfamatwi, butangwa mu ndimi zikwiye n\u2019uburyo bwo gutumanaho ku muntu; no gukoresha abarimu, harimo abarimu bafite ubumuga, bafite ubumenyi mu rurimi rw'amarenga na / cyangwa mu nyandiko ya Braille, no guhugura inzobere mu burezi n'abakozi ku bijyanye n'ubukangurambaga ku bumuga, gukoresha uburyo bwiyongera n'ubundi buryo bw'itumanaho, n'ubuhanga bwo kwigisha n'ibikoresho byo gufasha ababana n'ubumuga.\nKomisiyo ishinzwe uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga 'Igitekerezo rusange cya 4, cyemejwe muri Kanama 2016, yashimangiye akamaro ko kwigisha abantu bose kandi yamagana uburezi butandukanye. Iki gitekerezo cyarwanyijwe n\u2019imiryango irimo Umuryango w\u2019abatabona ku isi ndetse n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abatumva ku isi ryananiwe kuvuga ko \"bidasanzwe\" kugira ngo bamenye akamaro k\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019umuco n\u2019indimi. \nUburenganzira ku buzima.\nIngingo ya 25 isobanura ko \"ababana n'ubumuga bafite uburenganzira bwo kwishimira ubuzima bwiza bugerwaho kandi nta vangura rishingiye ku bumuga\". \nGutuza no gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe.\no ya 26 y\u2019aya Masezerano yemeza ko \"Ibihugu by\u2019ibihugu bizafata ingamba zifatika kandi zikwiye, harimo n\u2019urungano rw\u2019urungano, kugira ngo ababana n\u2019ubumuga bagere kandi bakomeze ubwigenge buhebuje, ubushobozi bw\u2019umubiri, ubw'ibitekerezo, imibereho myiza n\u2019imyuga, no kwinjiza no kugira uruhare mu mibereho yose y\u2019ubuzima. Kugira ngo ibyo bigerweho, ibihugu by\u2019ibihugu bizategura, gushimangira no kwagura serivisi zita ku buzima busanzwe, mu buzima ndetse no mu bikorwa by\u2019ubuzima, uburezi, uburezi ndetse n\u2019uburezi, cyane cyane mu nzego z\u2019ubuzima, umurimo, uburezi, uburezi, uburezi ndetse n\u2019uburezi; icyiciro, gishingiye ku isuzuma rinyuranye ryerekana ibyo umuntu akeneye n'imbaraga bye kandi ashyigikira uruhare no kwinjizwa mu baturage no mu bice byose bigize sosiyete, ku bushake, kandi birashoboka ku bafite ubumuga hafi yabo hashoboka aho batuye, harimo no mu cyaro. \" \nAmashyaka yiyemeje guteza imbere iterambere ry\u2019amahugurwa abanza kandi akomeje ku banyamwuga n\u2019abakozi bakora muri serivisi zita ku buzima no gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe kimwe no kuboneka, ubumenyi no gukoresha n\u2019ikoranabuhanga bifasha, bigenewe ababana n\u2019ubumuga, kuko bijyanye no gutura no gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe.\nAkazi n'akazi.\nIngingo ya 27 isaba ko ibihugu by\u2019ibihugu byemera uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga gukora, hashingiwe ku bandi; ibi bikubiyemo uburenganzira bwamahirwe yo kwibeshaho kumurimo watoranijwe kubuntu cyangwa kwemerwa kumasoko yumurimo hamwe nakazi keza kafunguye, karimo kandi korohereza ababana nubumuga. Iyi ngingo itegeka ibihugu by\u2019ibihugu kurinda no guteza imbere ishyirwa mu bikorwa ry\u2019uburenganzira, harimo n\u2019abafite ubumuga mu gihe cy\u2019akazi, bafata ingamba zikwiye, harimo binyuze mu mategeko, kubuza ivangura rishingiye ku bumuga ku bijyanye n\u2019ibibazo byose bijyanye n\u2019imirimo yose, gukomeza akazi, iterambere ry\u2019akazi ndetse n\u2019akazi keza kandi keza; no kurengera uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga, ku buryo bungana n\u2019abandi, ku, harimo amahirwe angana no, akazi keza kandi keza, harimo no gukorerwa, no ; \nyaka yemeye kwemeza ko ababana n\u2019ubumuga bashoboye gukoresha uburenganzira bwabo bw\u2019abakozi ku buryo bungana n\u2019abandi; gushoboza ababana n'ubumuga kubona neza gahunda rusange yubuyobozi bwa tekiniki n\u2019imyuga, serivisi zita ku myanya n\u2019amahugurwa no gukomeza; guteza imbere amahirwe yo kubona akazi no guteza imbere umwuga ku bafite ubumuga ku isoko ry'umurimo, ndetse no gufasha mu gushaka, kubona, kubungabunga no gusubira ku kazi; no guteza imbere amahirwe yo, guteza imbere amakoperative no gutangiza umushinga wawe bwite, kubona uburambe ku kazi, gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe imyuga n\u2019umwuga, kugumana akazi na gahunda yo gusubira ku kazi ku bafite ubumuga. \nAbaburanyi biyemeje ko amacumbi yuzuye ahabwa ababana n\u2019ubumuga ku kazi kandi ko ababana n\u2019ubumuga badafunzwe mu bucakara cyangwa mu bucakara, kandi bakarindwa, ku buryo bungana n\u2019abandi, ku. \nImibereho ihagije yo kurengera no kurengera imibereho.\nIngingo ya 28 isaba ko ibihugu by\u2019ibihugu byemera uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga ku yabo ndetse n\u2019imiryango yabo, harimo, ndetse no kurushaho kunoza imibereho, kandi igafata ingamba zikwiye zo kurinda no guteza imbere ubwo burenganzira nta vangura rishingiye ku bumuga. \nIbihugu bigize ibihugu byemera uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo no kubahiriza ubwo burenganzira nta vangura rishingiye ku bumuga, kandi bugafata ingamba zikwiye zo kubungabunga no guteza imbere ishyirwa mu bikorwa ry\u2019uburenganzira, harimo n\u2019ingamba; kuri gahunda zo kurengera imibereho na gahunda (cyane cyane ku bagore n\u2019abakobwa bafite ubumuga n\u2019abasaza bafite ubumuga); \nBy'umwihariko, amashyaka agomba kwemeza ko ababana n'ubumuga bagera kuri serivisi z\u2019amazi meza, kandi bakareba serivisi zikwiye kandi zihendutse, n\u2019ubundi mu bijyanye n\u2019ubumuga; kugera ku bafite ubumuga n'imiryango yabo ibaye mu bihe by'ubukene kugira ngo bafashe Leta ifite amafaranga ajyanye n'ubumuga, harimo amahugurwa ahagije, ubufasha bw'amafaranga no kwita ku buruhukiro; kubona gahunda, inyungu zizabukuru nibindi byinshi. \nKubaho byigenga, ubufatanye mpuzamahanga no gushyira mu bikorwa igihugu, ubunyangamugayo, kurinda ibiza.\nIbice bimwe bya CRPD byerekana \"igisekuru cya gatatu\" uburenganzira bwa muntu, rimwe na rimwe bisobanurwa nkuburenganzira bushya, \"ubwisanzure hamwe\", uburenganzira bw\u2019ubufatanye, cyangwa uburenganzira bwitsinda. Bagaragaza ko uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga buzakenera kuvangwa n\u2019abafite ubumuga, ubufatanye mpuzamahanga, no gushyira mu bikorwa igihugu.\nIbihe byugarije ibihe byihutirwa.\nIngingo ya 11 y\u2019aya Masezerano yemeza ko ibihugu by\u2019ibihugu bizafata, hakurikijwe inshingano zabyo mu mategeko mpuzamahanga, harimo amategeko mpuzamahanga arengera ikiremwamuntu n\u2019amategeko mpuzamahanga y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu, ingamba zose zikenewe mu rwego rwo kurinda umutekano n\u2019umutekano w\u2019abafite ubumuga mu bihe by\u2019amakimbirane yitwaje intwaro, ibibazo byihutirwa by\u2019ikiremwamuntu ndetse n\u2019ibiza byibasiwe n\u2019ibiza. \nKubaho wigenga.\nIngingo ya 19 ya CRPD, \" Kubaho mu bwigenge no gushyirwa mu baturage\", ifitanye isano rya bugufi n'ingingo ya 3 (Amahame rusange) n'ingingo ya 4 (Inshingano rusange). Nkuko rimwe na rimwe byagaragajwe muri Komite ishinzwe uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga 'Gusoza Indorerezi kuri raporo z\u2019ababuranyi buri gihe cyangwa mu gitekerezo rusange cyatanzwe na komite, ubumuga bitewe n\u2019imiterere yarwo burimo kwuzuzanya, ariko ibihugu birashobora gushishikariza cyangwa guca intege ubwigenge bw\u2019abafite ubumuga n\u2019imiryango y\u2019abafite ubumuga. \nUbufatanye mpuzamahanga no gushyira mu bikorwa igihugu.\nIngingo ya 32 ya CRPD ivuga ku bufatanye n\u2019amahanga, naho ingingo ya 33 ivuga ku ngorabahizi zishyirwa mu bikorwa ry\u2019igihugu kugira ngo byoroherezwe n\u2019ubufatanye mpuzamahanga.\nBy'umwihariko, ingingo ya 32 iteganya ko \"Ibihugu bigize ibihugu byemera akamaro k'ubufatanye mpuzamahanga\u00a0... kandi izakora ibikwiye kandi byiza\u00a0... ku bufatanye n\u2019imiryango mpuzamahanga ndetse n\u2019akarere bireba ndetse n\u2019imiryango itegamiye kuri Leta, cyane cyane imiryango y\u2019abafite \nUburenganzira n\u2019ubumuga byombi biterwa nubwitabire bwa rubanda, ubufatanye mpuzamahanga, no gushyira mubikorwa igihugu. Nkuko bigaragara mu ngingo ya 33 ya CRPD, amashyaka agomba kugira uruhare muri sosiyete sivile, kandi yashyizeho \" ingingo yibanze \", akenshi mubikorwa inzego zigihugu zita ku burenganzira bwa muntu. \nKubitsa.\nAmashyaka menshi yagiye yanga kandi asobanura ibisobanuro cyangwa itangazo ryerekeye gushyira mu bikorwa ayo masezerano. Izi ni zimwe mu ngero:\nAustraliya ntishobora kubona ko ihagaritse kuvura ku gahato abiyita abarwayi bo mu mutwe igihe ifatwa nk'uburyo bwa nyuma. \nEl Salvador yemera ayo masezerano ku buryo ihuje n'itegeko nshinga ryayo. \nUbufaransa ntibubona ko ayo masezerano yubahirizwa n'amategeko. \nUbuyapani buratangaza ko igika cya 4 cy\u2019ingingo ya 23 y\u2019amasezerano cyasobanuwe kudakurikizwa mu gihe umwana yatandukanijwe n\u2019ababyeyi be biturutse ku koherezwa hakurikijwe amategeko y\u2019abinjira.\nMalta isobanura uburenganzira ku buzima mu ngingo ya 25 y\u2019amasezerano ko bidasobanura uburenganzira ubwo ari bwo bwose bwo gukuramo inda. Ifite kandi uburenganzira bwo gukomeza gukurikiza amategeko yayo y\u2019amatora yerekeye kugerwaho no gufashwa. \nIbirwa bya Maurice ntibifata ko bigomba kubahirizwa n'ingingo ya 11 yo gufata ingamba zose za ngombwa zo kurinda ababana n'ubumuga mu gihe cy'impanuka kamere, amakimbirane yitwaje intwaro cyangwa ibyihutirwa by\u2019ubutabazi, keretse byemewe n'amategeko yo mu gihugu. \nUbuholandi busobanura uburenganzira bwo kubaho mu ngingo ya 10 mu rwego rw\u2019amategeko y\u2019imbere mu gihugu. Irasobanura kandi ingingo ya 25 (f), ibuza kwanga ivangura ivangura, nko kwemerera umuntu kwanga kwivuza, harimo ibiryo cyangwa amazi. \nPolonye isobanura ingingo ya 23 n'iya 25 ko zidafite uburenganzira bwo gukuramo inda. \nUbwongereza bufite ubushake bujyanye n'uburenganzira bwo kwiga, abinjira n'abasohoka, serivisi mu gisirikare ndetse no mu mategeko agenga ubwiteganyirize. \nMu yandi mashyaka yiyemeje kubyemera, kubyumva, cyangwa gutangaza ko byemejwe cyangwa kwinjira harimo Umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Uburayi, Azerubayijani, Kanada, Kupuro, Misiri, Irani, Repubulika y\u2019Abarabu ya Siriya, Venezuwela, n\u2019abandi benshi. Guhera ku ya 16 Kanama 2020, amashyaka 22 yari yatanze inzitizi zemewe n\u2019andi mashyaka yanga, ibyo yumva, cyangwa imenyekanisha.\nPorotokole idahitamo.\nAmasezerano atemewe ku masezerano y\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga ni amasezerano y\u2019amasezerano yemerera abayagiranye kumenya ubushobozi bwa Komite ishinzwe uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga gusuzuma ibibazo by\u2019abantu ku giti cyabo. Inyandiko ishingiye cyane ku masezerano atemewe y\u2019amasezerano yerekeye guca burundu ivangura iryo ari ryo ryose rikorerwa abagore\nPorotokole idahwitse yatangiye gukurikizwa n\u2019amasezerano yo ku ya 3 Gicurasi 2008. Guhera mu Kwakira 2023, ifite abasinya 94 n\u2019amashyaka 105. \nIcyiciro cya mbere ni Komite ishinzwe kwemeza ikirego. CRPD isaba \"umunaniro wimiti yo murugo\" (Ingingo ya 2 ya Protokole itabishaka). Komisiyo irashobora kandi gutegeka itumanaho ritemewe iyo ritazwi cyangwa ridafite ishingiro bihagije. Usaba arashobora gutanga ibimenyetso bifatika bivura imiti yo murugo byakongerwa bidafite ishingiro cyangwa bidashoboka\n ni amasezerano y\u2019amasezerano yemerera abayagiranye kumenya ubushobozi bwa Komite ishinzwe uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga gusuzuma ibibazo by\u2019abantu ku giti cyabo. Inyandiko ishingiye cyane ku.\nPorotokole idahwitse yatangiye gukurikizwa n\u2019amasezerano yo ku ya 3 Gicurasi 2008. Guhera mu Kwakira 2023, ifite abasinya 94 n\u2019amashyaka 105. \nIcyiciro cya mbere ni Komite ishinzwe kwemeza ikirego. CRPD isaba \"umunaniro wimiti yo murugo\" (Ingingo ya 2 ya Protokole itabishaka). Komisiyo irashobora kandi gutegeka itumanaho ritemewe iyo ritazwi cyangwa ridafite ishingiro bihagije. Usaba arashobora gutanga ibimenyetso bifatika bivura imiti yo murugo byakongerwa bidafite ishingiro cyangwa bidashoboka. \nIbiro by\u2019Umuryango w\u2019abibumbye bya Komiseri Mukuru w\u2019Uburenganzira bwa Muntu bikomeza kwandika ibirego byose ku giti cye byatanzwe hakurikijwe amasezerano abishaka. Benshi mu itumanaho ryemejwe ko ryemewe byavuyemo ibitekerezo byatanzwe n'ababunganira n'abasesenguzi ba leta.\nUmuryango w\u2019abafite ubumuga, Umuryango mpuzamahanga w\u2019abafite ubumuga, uvuga muri make kandi ugasobanura buri rubanza (imanza 37 guhera ku ya 30 Nyakanga 2020). Abantu baturutse muri Ositaraliya, Tanzaniya, Ubwongereza, Mexico, Lituwaniya, Ubudage, Espagne, Suwede, Otirishiya, Ubutaliyani, Burezili, Arijantine, Hongiriya, Ubugereki, na uquateur bazanye ibirego bya mbere. Itumanaho rimwe ryasuzumwe na komite ni \"X na Tanzaniya.\" Harimo umuntu ufite albinism yaciwe ukuboko. Kunanirwa kwa leta, kweretse komite, kwananiwe gukora iperereza cyangwa gukurikirana.\nAndi makuru y\u2019itumanaho CRPD yerekeranye n\u2019abaturage batuye muri Ositaraliya yari yarashyizweho n\u2019inzego, Umunyalituwaniya kugira ubutabera nyuma y\u2019impanuka yo mu muhanda, umunya Ositaraliya utumva kubona ubutabera, umunya Otirishiya kubona amakuru akenewe kugira ngo akoreshe ubwikorezi rusange, n\u2019akazi mu Butaliyani, Burezili, n'ahandi. \nKomisiyo ishinzwe uburenganzira bw'abafite ubumuga.\n ni urwego rw\u2019inzobere mu bijyanye n\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu zishinzwe gukurikirana ishyirwa mu bikorwa ry\u2019amasezerano. Nimwe mu nzego icumi z\u2019amasezerano zishyigikiwe n\u2019ibiro i Geneve. Mu ikubitiro yari igizwe n\u2019inzobere 12 zigenga z\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu, kimwe cya kabiri cyatowe manda y\u2019imyaka ibiri naho ikindi gitorwa manda y\u2019imyaka ine. Nyuma y\u2019abanyamuryango batowe manda yimyaka ine, kimwe cya kabiri cyabanyamuryango batorwa buri myaka ibiri. Kubera ko ayo masezerano amaze kwemezwa 80, komite yaguwe ku banyamuryango 18 mu \nImpuguke guhera ku ya 25 Nyakanga 2020, gukora kugeza mu mpera za 2020 cyangwa 2022 ni: \nbitekerezo Rusange byatanzwe na Komite hamwe n\u2019ubushakashatsi bwakozwe kuri buri raporo ya Leta kuri Komite bigaragaza aho amasezerano y\u2019ubwumvikane n\u2019ubwumvikane buke hagati y\u2019impuguke cumi n'umunani, urugero nko muri Rusange Rusange ku burezi burimo abantu bose no ku mibereho yigenga. [\"\"] Mu gihe gito, komite yatanze ibisobanuro birindwi rusange as of 19 Kanama 2020, hamwe n\u2019ibirenga ijana Kurangiza Indorerezi kuri raporo za leta.\nKunegura hamwe na caveats.\nAmasezerano na komite byatewe inkunga n\u2019ibihugu n\u2019imiryango itegamiye kuri Leta, ariko bamwe banenga. By'umwihariko muri Leta zunze ubumwe za Amerika, abasenateri bakomeye bo muri Repubulika n\u2019imiryango iharanira inyungu nk\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019amategeko arengera amategeko yo mu rugo bavuga ko CRPD yangiza ubusugire. Ibyo birego bivuguruzanya n'abunganira abize n'abashakashatsi.\nKu rundi ruhande, intiti nyinshi z\u2019ubushakashatsi bw\u2019abafite ubumuga zavuze ko CRPD idashoboka guteza imbere ubwoko bw\u2019impinduka zikenewe mu guteza imbere uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga hagamijwe gukemura ubusumbane. Ubushakashatsi bugaragaza kandi ko abantu bose bagize umuryango w\u2019abafite ubumuga bumva ko CRPD yabaye igikoresho cy\u2019ingirakamaro mu buvugizi: abavugizi n\u2019abarwanashyaka bo mu nzego z\u2019ibanze mu Bwongereza ndetse no muri Hongiriya bavuze ko batabonye CRPD n\u2019andi mategeko y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu agira ingaruka mu buvugizi bwa buri munsi kandi ko badakunda gukoresha ayo mategeko, kuko badakunze gukora mu bikorwa. Amatora yo mu 2016 muri komite ishinzwe uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga yatumye hatorwa umunyamuryango umwe w\u2019umugore n\u2019abagabo 17, [mu matora yo mu 2018. Ibi byabaye nubwo CRPD yahamagaye mu ngingo ya 34 kugira ngo hasuzumwe \"uburinganire bw\u2019umugabo n'umugore\" muri komite. \nUbufatanye bw'Umuryango w'Abibumbye ku burenganzira bw'abafite ubumuga.\nUbufatanye bw\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ku burenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga (UNPRPD) ni ubufatanye bwashinzwe mu 2011, hagati y\u2019imiryango myinshi y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye n\u2019indi miryango. Ubufatanye bugamije kongera imbaraga mu bikorwa by\u2019akazi n\u2019abafatanyabikorwa bayo mu kwinjiza ubumuga bijyanye na CRPD.\nInzego z'umuryango w'abibumbye zitabira UNPRPD ni ILO, ITU, OHCHR, UNDESA, UNDP, UNESCO, UNFPA, na. Abandi banyamuryango ba UNPRPD barimo n\u2019umuryango. \nInyandiko.\nManda zose zirangira ku ya 31 Ukuboza umwaka werekanye. \"Amatora 2012 (Umuryango w'Abibumbye Uburenganzira bwa Muntu)\". Umuryango w\u2019abibumbye. 14 Nzeri 2012."}
{"id": "20865", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20865", "title": "Amasezerano hagati y\u2019Abanyamerika yerekeye gukuraho uburyo bwose bwo kuvangura abafite", "text": "Amasezerano hagati y'Abanyamerika yerekeye gukuraho ivangura iryo ari ryo ryose rikorerwa ababana n'ubumuga\nYasinywe ku ya 8 Kamena 1999\nIkibanza Umujyi wa Guatemala, Guatemala\nGuhera ku ya 14 Nzeri 2001\nImiterere 6\nAbashyizeho umukono 20\nAmashyaka 19\nUbunyamabanga Bukuru bw\u2019Umuryango w\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Amerika\nIndimi Icyongereza, Igifaransa, Igiporutugali, n'Icyesipanyoli\nAmasezerano mpuzamahanga hagati y\u2019Abanyamerika yerekeye guca burundu ivangura iryo ari ryo ryose rikorerwa ababana n\u2019ubumuga ni mu karere, cyemejwe mu 1999 mu. Irahamagarira ibihugu koroshya kwinjiza ababana n'ubumuga muri sosiyete binyuze mu mategeko, gahunda z\u2019imibereho na gahunda z\u2019uburezi. Yatangiye gukurikizwa ku ya 14 Nzeri 2001.\nKugeza mu 2013, ibihugu 19 ayo masezerano. \nReba.\nOAS, Abashyizeho umukono no Kwemeza"}
{"id": "20866", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20866", "title": "Ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina", "text": "Ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina (nanone ryitwa ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina [a] cyangwa ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina) ni ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina mu bukungu n\u2019imibereho rishingiye ku gitsina ku bantu kubera igitsina cyangwa igitsina. Nuburyo bukoreshwa mugukoresha imyitozo yumubiri cyangwa amategeko kugirango yimure abantu kumyanya iyobowe. Intiti y\u2019abagore, Phyllis Chesler, umwarimu w\u2019imyororokere n\u2019ubushakashatsi bw\u2019umugore, asobanura ko iki kibazo ari \"imikorere yamagana abakobwa n\u2019abagore kubaho mu buryo butandukanye kandi butegekwa kandi bigatuma abahungu n\u2019abagabo babarinda burundu ubudakemwa bw\u2019abavandimwe babo\". Ingero zishingiye ku ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina ntiziganisha gusa ku mibereho n\u2019ubukungu by\u2019ubukungu ku bantu, ariko birashobora no kuviramo ingaruka mbi ku mubiri. \nEtymology.\nIjambo \"ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina\" rikomoka kuri Afurika y'Epfo ivangura rishingiye ku moko ryashyizeho gahunda yo kuba hejuru y'abazungu (Afrikaans) no gutandukanya abaturage benshi biganjemo abirabura n'abazungu. Abanyafurika bavuga \"gutandukana\" cyangwa \"gutandukana\", gukoresha ijambo \"ivanguramoko\" mu kwerekana uburinganire byerekana ihohoterwa ry'uburenganzira bwa muntu rikubiyemo gutandukana no gukandamizwa. Mu gusobanura ivanguramoko, Dr. Anthony L\u00f6wstedt yaranditse ati:\nIgitekerezo cyo gutandukana ubwacyo ntigisobanura byanze bikunze ko itsinda iryo ariryo ryose cyangwa rizashyigikirwa kurenza ayandi yose... Ikiranga umwihariko wa apartheid ndetse nubundi bwoko bw\u2019amacakubiri akandamiza ni uko politiki, ubukungu, imibereho, ndetse n\u2019imiterere y\u2019akarere byashyizweho ku bushake kandi kuri gahunda hagamijwe gutandukanya amatsinda ku gahato, buri gihe ku nyungu, byibuze, rimwe na rimwe, cyangwa inyungu, mu gihe gito, ariko ku nyungu z\u2019igihe gito, ariko ku nyungu z\u2019igihe gito, ariko ku nyungu z\u2019igihe gito, ariko zikaba ari inyungu z\u2019igihe gito, ariko zikaba ari inyungu z\u2019igihe gito, ariko zikaba ari inyungu z\u2019igihe gito, ariko zikaba ari inyungu z\u2019igihe gito, ariko ku nyungu z\u2019igihe gito, ariko zikaba ari inyungu z\u2019igihe gito, ariko zikaba ari inyungu z\u2019igihe gito. \nIvanguramoko rishingiye ku gitsina ni ibintu rusange kandi ntibigarukira mu gihugu runaka. Mu gihe raporo z\u2019ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina zagaragaye cyane mu rwego rw\u2019umuco wa kisilamu, ziriganje ku isi. Bamwe mu baharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu bavuze ko ibihano bifatirwa ibihugu bikoresha ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina, kimwe n'ibihano byafatiwe Afurika y'Epfo muri apartheid. \nMu idini.\nIngero zishingiye ku ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina zagaragaye mu nzego binyuze mu bikorwa by\u2019amadini n\u2019umuco. Kurugero, ingingo zijyanye no gufata abagore mubisobanuro byibanze byubuyisilamu, ubukirisitu, idini rya kiyahudi, n\u2019ababuda byasobanuwe ko ari ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina. Gukoresha kwizera, akenshi binyuze mu gusobanura byimazeyo amategeko y\u2019idini, kugira ngo ushimangire ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina ntivugwaho rumwe.\nGatolika.\nIjambo ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina n\u2019ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina ryakoreshejwe kandi mu gusobanura uburyo butandukanye bwo gufata abagore mu bigo nka Kiliziya y\u2019Ubwongereza na Kiliziya Gatolika ya Roma. Minisitiri wa Peresibiteriyeni akaba n'umwanditsi Patricia Budd Kepler yerekana urugamba rw\u2019abagore mu rwego rwo kwemerera abapadiri ndetse n\u2019ubuyobozi bw\u2019amadini nk\u2019urugero rw\u2019ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina. By'umwihariko, Kepler aranenga imyumvire gakondo y\u2019ubugabo n\u2019umugore igabanya ubutware bw\u2019umugore mu itorero, ashimangira ko ahubwo kwinjira mu bagore bidahungabanya gahunda z\u2019Imana. Mu buryo nk'ubwo, umwanditsi Susan D. Rose asobanura imiterere y'imiryango y'abakurambere b'amatorero ya gikirisitu y'ivugabutumwa muri Amerika nko gukomeza ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina. \nKiliziya Gatolika ya Roma yagaragaye ko ikomeje ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina bitewe na Vatikani yashyize ku rutonde rwa \"kugerageza kwera umugore\" nka \"graviora ya delicta\" - mu yandi magambo, icyaha cyo guhagararirwa kimwe no gusambanya abana bato, no \"gushaka, gutunga cyangwa gukwirakwiza porunogarafiya [y\u2019umwana] n\u2019umunyamadini\". [\nIslamu.\nIdini rya kisilamu ryanenzwe kubera ivangura ry\u2019imiterere bwite n\u2019amategeko ahana nk\u2019abagore. Indangagaciro z'abakurambere ba Islamu zikomeje kuba imwe mu mahame yarwanijwe cyane, ukurikije amashuri atandukanye. Mubisanzwe ariko, uburenganzira bwumugabo numugore buratandukanye cyane ukurikije amategeko yimiterere ya kisilamu. Urugero, abagabo b\u2019abayisilamu bemerewe kwishora mu gushaka abagore benshi no kurongora abadamu b\u2019abayisilamu mu gihe abagore b\u2019abayisilamu babujijwe kugira abagabo benshi no kurongora abagabo batari Abayisilamu, kandi umurage w\u2019abagore ni kimwe cya kabiri cy\u2019abo bavukana. [\"kandi\"] ukwemezwa n\u2019ubucamanza mpanabyaha bwa kisilamu kurushaho kuvangura abagore, kuko bishingiye cyane ku buhamya bw\u2019abatangabuhamya. Ubuhamya bw'umugore bwonyine bufatwa nk'ibidahagije kugira ngo ushinje umwicanyi, bisaba ubuhamya bw'umugabo kugira ngo bwemeze. \nKwubahiriza kwiyoroshya mu mibonano mpuzabitsina no kwambara neza ku bagabo n\u2019abagore b\u2019abayisilamu bigenwa n\u2019ubuvanganzo bwa \"\u1e25ad\u012bth\" na \"suna\" (ibikorwa n\u2019amagambo bitirirwa umuhanuzi wa kisilamu Muhammad na bagenzi be); imyitozo yo gutwikira ku gahato igaragara mu turere tumwe na tumwe nk'uburyo bwa apartheid. Imyitozo yo gutwikira ku gahato, nk'uko Shahrzad Mojab abivuga, ntabwo biterwa n\u2019amategeko ayo ari yo yose ya kisilamu; ahubwo, Shahrzad avuga \"imyitozo yazamutse mu bihe bitandukanye\". Imyambarire yashyizweho muri Afuganisitani ku butegetsi bw\u2019abatalibani n\u2019ishuri risaba abakobwa kwambara igitambaro cyatanzwe nkurugero rwo kwitwikira ku gahato. Mu mateka y\u2019imyaka itanu ya Emirate ya kisilamu ya Afuganisitani, ubutegetsi bw\u2019abatalibani bwasobanuye amategeko ya \"Shariya\" hakurikijwe ishuri rya Hanafi ry\u2019ubucamanza bwa kisilamu n\u2019amategeko y\u2019idini ya Mullah Omar. Abagore babujijwe gukora, abakobwa babujijwe kujya mu mashuri cyangwa muri kaminuza, basabwe kubahiriza \"purdah\" no kujyana hanze y\u2019ingo zabo na bene wabo b'abagabo; abarenga kuri aya mabwiriza barahanwe. Abagabo babujijwe kogosha ubwanwa kandi basabwa kubareka bagakura kandi bakagumana igihe kirekire nk'uko Abatalibani babishaka, no kwambara ibitambaro hanze y\u2019ingo zabo. \nUharanira uburenganzira bw'umugore, Mahnaz Afkhami yanditse ko imyumvire y'isi ya kisilamu \"itandukanya imiterere y'abagore n'imibanire ye na sosiyete nk'ikizamini gikomeye cyerekana ko gahunda ya kisilamu ari ukuri.\" Ibi bigereranywa ninzego za \"purdah\" (gutandukanya umubiri kubitsina) na \"awrah\" (guhisha umubiri imyenda). Kimwe no mu bihugu byinshi ku isi, ibigo bikandamiza abagore byagendaga bidakomera kugeza mu ntangiriro z'ikinyejana cya 20. \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200bYavuze ko andi madini na yo \"yiboneye intambara nk'izo.\" \nIdini rya Kiyahudi rya Haredi, rizwi kandi ku idini rya Kiyahudi ryitwa ultra-orotodogisi, ryanenzwe gushyiraho politiki n'imyizerere ishingiye ku gitsina. Igizwe n\u2019abantu bake ariko bakomeje kwiyongera mu muco w\u2019Abayahudi, idini rya Kiyahudi rya Haredi ryamamaye nk\u2019umuryango w\u2019intiti, aho umubare munini w\u2019abagabo bakomeza amashuri yabo muri yeshiva kurusha abagore bo mu iseminari. Abakurikira idini rya Kiyahudi rya Haredi na bo baratandukanye kubera imyambarire yabo ndetse n\u2019imiterere rusange: ubwanwa bwogosha, amakoti maremare yijimye, n'ingofero nini cyane ku bagabo; n'abagore bitwikiriye mu buryo bworoheje. Ibirego bishingiye ku ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina byerekana umuco wo gukandamiza umuco no gutandukanya igitsina, ndetse no kwerekana abadayimoni nk'igishuko. Byongeye kandi, amashusho rusange y\u2019abagore yandujwe mu baturage ba Haredi, kandi abakobwa b\u2019Abayahudi bakiri bato batewe amacandwe kandi bitwa indaya kubera kwambara imyenda ifatwa nk'iyiyubashye. Raporo zerekana ko ahanini abayoboke b\u2019ibanze ba Haredi aribo bashinzwe ibikorwa by\u2019ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina, kandi ko umuryango wa Haredi muri rusange udashyigikiye ibyo bikorwa. \nIbikorwa by'Abayahudi b'ibanze Haredi muri Isiraheli byiswe ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina. Mugihe abagore basanzwe bicara inyuma ya bisi mu bice bya Isiraheli, nta tegeko ryemewe ribishyira mu bikorwa. Icyakora, ikintu kimwe cyabaye mu Kuboza 2011 aho umugabo wa Haredi yasabye umugore wicaye imbere ya bisi kugenda yerekeza inyuma; nyuma yo kwangwa kwe kwateje igiterane kinini. Gutabara kwa polisi amaherezo byatandukanije guhangana. Ku bijyanye n'iki gikorwa, Minisitiri w\u2019intebe wa Isiraheli, Benjamin Netanyahu, yatangaje ko ashyigikiye ahantu rusange hahurira abantu bose n\u2019ubumwe mu baturage. Hari kandi amakuru avuga ko Abayahudi ba Haredi baciriye amacandwe ku bagore, bagaba igitero ku bakozi ba televiziyo, kandi bakigaragambya bafite ibyapa byigisha abagore kwambara no kwirinda kugenda mu masinagogi. \nidini rya kiyahudi.\nAmashuri amwe y'Ababuda bo muri Tibet bisaba abagore gutunganya mumaseminari nubundi buryo bwo gusenga nyuma yabagabo. [\"citation needed\"] Baratandukanijwe kandi nabagabo mugihe cyibi bihe nibindi bihe byinshi; kurugero, guterana kumugaragaro no gusangira, cyane cyane iyo ibyo bibaye imbere yumumonaki mukuru. Hariho] \"ibimenyetso\" [byerekana abagabo n'abagore, harimo n'abagabo n'abagore - bahatirwa gufata ubwikorezi butandukanye mu bihe bimwe na bimwe by'Ababuda. ndetse no gusabwa kuguma mubyumba bya hoteri bitandukanye iyo babitabye. \nInyigo.\nIbihugu byinshi ku isi byerekana ibikorwa by\u2019ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina, nubwo bikunze kugaragara mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere. Ibikurikira n\u2019ibihugu byavuzwe ko byakoresheje urugero runaka rw\u2019ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina.\nAfuganisitani.\nAfuganisitani, iyobowe n\u2019amadini y\u2019abatalibani, yaranzwe n\u2019amatsinda y\u2019abagore n\u2019abandi nka gahunda y\u2019ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina aho abagore batandukanijwe n\u2019abagabo ku karubanda kandi ntibashobora kubona ubwisanzure mu by'amategeko cyangwa amahirwe angana yo kubona akazi cyangwa amashuri. Bahagurukiye ku butegetsi mu mpera za 1996, abatalibani bashimangiye amahanga kubera gufata abagore, ashyiraho politiki yabuzaga ubwisanzure bw\u2019abagore bwo kugenda, akazi, n\u2019uburenganzira bwo kwiga. Ku butegetsi bw\u2019abatalibani, abagore bari mu kaga ko gufungwa no guhohoterwa ku mubiri baramutse bahamwe n\u2019icyaha cyo kuba barenze ku myambarire yashyizweho, hamwe n\u2019ihohoterwa ryarimo: kwerekana amaboko, ukuboko, ibirenge, cyangwa mu maso; kutambara burka; no kwambara ibintu bigaragara ko bibabaje, urugero amasogisi yera / inkweto, imyenda ya stilish, inkweto zitera urusaku mugihe ugenda. \nMuri Kamena 2023, Umunyamabanga wihariye w\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ku bijyanye n\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu muri Afuganisitani, Richard Bennett, yabwiye akanama k\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu i Geneve ku bijyanye n\u2019ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina muri Afuganisitani. \nIrani.\nMu mpera z'ikinyejana cya 20 no mu ntangiriro z'ikinyejana cya 21 muri Irani, uburenganzira bw'umugore bwarahagaritswe cyane, ugereranije n'ubwa mu bihugu byinshi byateye imbere. Raporo y\u2019Ihuriro ry\u2019Ubukungu ku Isi mu mwaka wa 2017 Raporo y\u2019Uburinganire ku Isi yashyize Irani 140, mu bihugu 144, kubera uburinganire. Muri 2017, muri Irani, igitsina gore cyari kigizwe na 19% gusa mu bakozi bahembwa, bikiyongera ku gipimo cya karindwi guhera mu 1990. Ugereranije n\u2019utundi turere two muri, abagore bo muri Irani bafite uburyo bwiza bwo kubona konti y\u2019imari, uburezi, na terefone zigendanwa.:\u200a16\u200aIrani yashyizwe ku mwanya wa 116, mu bihugu 153, mu bijyanye n'ivangura rikorerwa abagore.:\u200a16\u200a\nMaleziya.\nMu mwaka wa 2006, Marina Mahathir, umukobwa w\u2019uwahoze ari Minisitiri w\u2019intebe wa Maleziya akaba n\u2019umukangurambaga uharanira uburenganzira bw\u2019umugore, yavuze ko imiterere y\u2019abagore muri Maleziya isa n\u2019iy'Abirabura bo muri Afurika y'Epfo birabura ivangura. Amagambo ya Marina yavuzwe asubiza itegeko rishya rya kisilamu ryemerera abagabo gutandukana cyangwa gufata abagore bagera kuri bane. Amategeko kandi yahaye abagabo uburenganzira ku mutungo w'abagore babo. Amatsinda y\u2019aba conservateurs nk\u2019ihuriro ry\u2019abakozi b\u2019abayisilamu bo muri Maleziya yanenze amagambo ye yo gutuka Shariya no gutesha agaciro uruhare rukomeye rw\u2019abagore muri Maleziya ugereranije n\u2019ibindi bihugu by\u2019abayisilamu n\u2019iburasirazuba bwa Aziya. \nPakisitani.\nUmuryango wa Pakisitani wasobanuwe ko ukoresha ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina bitewe n\u2019imiterere y\u2019abagore mu nzego za politiki, ubukungu, n\u2019imibereho. Urugero, ribuza abagore bo muri Pakisitani bafite abagabo b\u2019abanyamahanga kubona ubwenegihugu bwa Pakisitani. Itandukaniro rishingiye ku gitsina mu bikorwa by\u2019ubukungu, uburezi no gusoma, no kugereranya imibonano mpuzabitsina mu baturage na byo byavuzwe nkikimenyetso cy\u2019ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina muri Pakisitani. \nUbushakashatsi bumwe bwerekana ko uruhare rw\u2019uburinganire muri sosiyete ya Pakisitani rwanduzwa binyuze mu bitabo by\u2019amashuri abanza n\u2019ayisumbuye, wirengagije gushyira abagore b\u2019ingenzi mu mateka n\u2019ubushakashatsi bw\u2019imibereho. Ivangura rishingiye rero rishyirwaho binyuze mu nyandiko n'amashusho aho abagore bakoreshwa imirimo yo mu rugo kandi ntibakunze kugaragara ko bakorera hanze y'urugo. Byongeye kandi, kubijyanye na kamere n'imiterere, igitsina gabo nigitsina gore kirangwa nkibihabanye bitandukanye: mugihe abagore \"ari ubusa, ibicucu nubucucu\", abagabo \"bafite ubwenge, intwari kandi bakomeye\". Kubera iyo mpamvu, uruhare rw\u2019uburinganire rwashimangiye kandi rukomeza ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina.\nImbaraga zo guhagarika ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina zakozwe binyuze muri politiki nk\u2019umushinga w\u2019itegeko abagore, washyizweho n\u2019Inteko mu Kuboza Mbere, Amategeko ya Hudood yari impaka zishingiye ku miterere yabo no kuvuga ko bagandukira abagore mu buryo bwemewe n'amategeko. Urugero, abahohotewe n\u2019abakobwa bashobora guhamwa n\u2019icyaha ko gufata ku ngufu ari ubusambanyi n\u2019ubusambanyi niba bitagaragaye ukundi. \nArabiya Sawudite.\nImikorere ya ku bijyanye n\u2019abagore yagiye ivugwa ko ari ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina. Abagore babujijwe gutwara kandi \"\" [] kugirango bagende. igenzura ishyirwa ry\u2019ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina mu mibereho y\u2019abaturage ba Arabiya Sawudite; kuvanga bitemewe hagati yimibonano mpuzabitsina bihanwa bikomeye. Gahunda y\u2019uburezi yo muri Arabiya Sawudite kandi ishyira mu bikorwa uruhare rw\u2019uburinganire mu kwigisha ko kugandukira abagore kuvuka ku bagore. Vuba aha, hashyizweho uburyo bushya bw\u2019ikoranabuhanga bugabisha abarinzi b\u2019abagabo binyuze mu nyandiko igihe abategarugori babo bava mu gihugu. Muri rusange, abagore bo muri Arabiya Sawudite bafite uburenganzira bwemewe n\u2019abana bato kandi ntibashobora gufata ibyemezo bikomeye, urugero nko mu burezi, mu kazi, no mu buvuzi, batabanje kubiherwa uruhushya na mwene wabo w\u2019umugabo. \nGutesha agaciro abagore muri societe yo muri Arabiya Sawudite byateje igitutu kinini haba mu gihugu ndetse no ku rwego mpuzamahanga. Iterambere rya vuba ryagaragaye bitewe n\u2019impeshyi n\u2019imyigaragambyo, nk\u2019umwami yahaye mu. Byongeye kandi, Arabiya Sawudite nayo yakuyeho amategeko abuza gukoresha moto n\u2019amagare n\u2019abagore; abategarugori barashobora noneho gutwara igare ahantu runaka niba bambaye neza muri kandi biherekejwe numurinzi wumugabo. \nImibereho.\nIntiti n\u2019abarwanashyaka bose banenze amategeko mpuzamahanga kubera ko adafite gahunda n\u2019ibikorwa rusange mu kumenya ibikorwa bimwe na bimwe by\u2019ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina no kugira ngo bikumirwe. Nk\u2019uko aba banegura babivuga, ryakunze kuba intandaro yo kurengera ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina, mu rwego rwo kurinda ihohoterwa rikorerwa abagore guhinduka no guhirika ubutegetsi. Imvugo ikikije ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina nayo yafashwe nabi nkuburyo bwa ikomeza imyumvire ya Islamu. Igisubizo cy\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ku ihohoterwa ry\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu bw\u2019abatalibani ryakorewe abagore muri Afuganisitani, cyaganiriweho cyane. Bamwe bavuga ko Loni \"itananiwe gukumira gusa, nyuma ikaza no kuba umuntu urwanya politiki y\u2019uburinganire bw\u2019ubutegetsi bw\u2019abatalibani, ariko ko mu by'ukuri yarimo ivangura rikorerwa abagore mu nkunga z\u2019ubutabazi no mu gushaka abakozi baho.\" \nMu 1997, (FMF) yatangije ubukangurambaga bwo guhagarika ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina muri Afuganisitani, ahamagarira abantu ihohoterwa ry'uburenganzira bwa muntu rikorerwa abagore bayobowe n\u2019abatalibani. Yamaganwe kuba yarateje imbere \"feminism feminism\" no kuba afite imvugo ikoreshwa yamagana Islam ko ari mbi. Nyuma y\u2019ubutegetsi bw\u2019abatalibani baguye, ubukangurambaga bwaragutse kandi buhindurwamo izina kugira ngo babe ubukangurambaga ku bagore n\u2019abakobwa bo muri Afuganisitani. Iyobowe na kandi igamije gukomeza gukangurira abantu ubusumbane muri Afuganisitani. \nUbukangurambaga bwa \"No Women, No Play\" bwatangijwe mu 2009 na gahunda ya Hadi Al Mutif ishinzwe uburenganzira bwa muntu mu kigo gishinzwe ibibazo by\u2019ikigobe hagamijwe gukemura ibibazo by\u2019umugore muri Arabiya Sawudite. Ubukangurambaga bugamije kubuza Arabiya Sawudite mu kugeza igihe izemerera abagore [\"muri\"] Sawudite kwitabira siporo. Mu gitabo cyayo, (IOC) itangaza ko kwitabira ibikorwa bya siporo ari uburenganzira bwa muntu. Usibye ubukangurambaga bwa \"No Women, No Play\", indi miryango nka yerekeje rubanda muri Arabiya Sawudite kubera ko \"\"] [. \nKu bijyanye n'ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina muri Gatolika y'Abaroma by'umwihariko, (RCWP) bashinze kugira ngo basuzugure imyanya y'itorero ryabuzaga ishyirwaho ry'abagore. Kuva iryo tsinda rimaze kubona ikindi cyifuzo cyo gusohora inyandiko \"\". "}
{"id": "20870", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20870", "title": "Ishuri ry\u2019Abakobwa Bafite Ubumuga bwo Kutabona rya Irente", "text": "Ishuri rya Irente ry\u2019abakobwa bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona ryashinzwe mu mwaka wa 1963 n\u2019Itorero rya Lutherani mu misozi ya Usambara i Lushoto, muri Tanzaniya. Nishuri rito / ishuri ryibanze. Amasomo arimo amahugurwa y'ubukorikori nubuhinzi.\nIhuza ryo hanze.\n&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;4\u00b048\u2032S 38\u00b017\u2032E\ufeff / \ufeff4.80\u00b0S 38.29\u00b0E\ufeff / -4.80; 38.29"}
{"id": "20871", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20871", "title": "Test of Ebert", "text": "Ebert test gipima niba ijwi rishingiye kuri mudasobwa rikoresha mudasobwa rishobora kuvuga urwenya rufite ubuhanga buhagije bwo gutuma abantu baseka. Byasabwe n\u2019abanenga amafilime Roger Ebert mu nama ya TED ya 2011 mu rwego rwo guhangana n\u2019abatunganya porogaramu kugira ijwi rya mudasobwa rikoresha amajwi mu, gutanga, igihe, n\u2019intangiriro z\u2019imvugo y\u2019abantu. Ikizamini gisa nikizamini cya Turing cyatanzwe na Alan Turing mu 1950 nkuburyo bwo gupima ubushobozi bwa mudasobwa bwo kwerekana imyitwarire yubwenge itanga umusaruro udatandukanye numuntu. \nEbert yaje kwangirika mu rwego rw'amajwi mu mwaka wa 2006 nyuma yo kubagwa bavura kanseri ya tiroyide. Yakoresheje isosiyete yo muri ottcosse yitwa CereProc, ikora porogaramu idoda inyandiko-ku-mvugo ku bakiriya bafite ubumuga rwo kutavuga ahubwo bagatangira kuba bakoresha amajwi yabo igihe kirekire mbere yo kuyatakaza, kandi yacukuye kaseti hamwe n'ibisobanuro bya DVD birimo Ebert kugira ngo akore ijwi ryumvikana nk'ijwi rye bwite. Yabanje gukoresha kumugaragaro ijwi bamutunganyirije ku ya 2 Werurwe 2010, agaragara kuri \"Show ya Oprah Winfrey\". \nAbari bateraniye aho TED ya Ebert yo mu mwaka wa 2011 bavuga ku bijyanye no gutanga urwenya n'amajwi akomatanya yaturitse aseka ubwo ijwi ryumvikanaga ryatangaga urwenya rukurikira: \"Umusore yagiye mu muganga w\u2019indwara zo mu mutwe. Umuganga w\u2019indwara zo mu mutwe ati:\" Urasaze. \" Umusore ati: 'Ndashaka igitekerezo cya kabiri.' Umuganga w\u2019indwara zo mu mutwe ati: 'Ni byiza, nawe uri mubi.' \" "}
{"id": "20873", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20873", "title": "Ubiquitous robot", "text": "Ubiquitous robot ni ijambo rikoreshwa muburyo busa na comptabilite hose. Porogaramu ifite akamaro ko \"guhuza tekinoroji ya robo hamwe nikoranabuhanga riva mu bice bya mudasobwa biboneka hose kandi bikwira hose, imiyoboro ya sensor, hamwe n\u2019ubwenge bw\u2019ibidukikije \".\nUkurikije uburyo telefone zikemura ibibazo byihuse, mudasobwa zishobora kwambarwa hamwe na mudasobwa ziboneka hose bituma bishoboka ko abantu bazaba mu isi iboneka hose aho ibikoresho byose bihurira. Kubaho umwanya uhari hose biva mubikorwa byiterambere rya mudasobwa na tekinoroji bizatanga imbaraga zo gutanga serivisi zifuzwa nigikoresho icyo aricyo cyose cya IT ahantu hose nigihe cyose binyuze mumikoreshereze yabakoresha hamwe na porogaramu zidafite intego. Ihinduka ryihutishije impinduramatwara ikwira hose, ikaba yarigaragaje cyane mu gice gishya cy\u2019ubushakashatsi butandukanye, robotics ahantu hose. Itangiza igisekuru cya gatatu cya robo gikurikira igisekuru cya mbere cyimashini yinganda nigisekuru cya kabiri cyimashini.\nImashini ya Ubiquitous (Ubibot) ni robot ikubiyemo ibice bitatu birimo robot software ya software cyangwa avatar, robot igendanwa kwisi yose hamwe na sisitemu ya sensor yashyizwe mubidukikije. Imashini na software mu isi isanzwe ishobora kuyobora robot nyayo nkubwonko kandi igakorana nabantu kandi muburyo bworoshye. Abashakashatsi ba KAIST, Koreya basobanura ibi bice bitatu nka Sobot (Software ya robot), Mobot (robot mobile), na Embot (Embedded robot)."}
{"id": "20874", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20874", "title": "Lekotek", "text": "Lekotek ni gahunda mpuzamahanga yo gutanga inguzanyo ya Assistive Technology, ibikinisho n'ubuhanga k'abana bamugaye. Lekotek ya mbere yafunguwe mu 1963 i Stockholm, muri Suwede. Kuva aho, igitekerezo cyakwirakwiriye mu bindi bihugu bya Scandinaviya, Uburayi ndetse no ku isi yose. Kurugero, muri Amerika hari lekoteks zirenga 50. Lekotek ya mbere y'Abanyamerika yafunguye i Evanston, muri Illinois mu 1980. Lekoteks ya mbere yo muri Amerika yashinzwe na Sally DeVencentis na Sharon Draznin.\nIzina ni uruvange rwijambo ryumuzi wo muri Suwede \"lek,\" risobanura igikinisho cyangwa imikino, hamwe n\u2019ikigereki \"tek\" gihuza isomero. \nIgitekerezo gishingiye.\nIgitekerezo cyibanze ni uko gutabara hakiri kare binyuze mu gukina ibikinisho n\u2019ikoranabuhanga byahujwe bishobora kwigisha abana bamugaye guhangana n'isi \"isanzwe\". Bimwe mubyibanzweho mubitekerezo bya lekotek biva mubikorwa byakozwe numuhanga mubya psychologue wubwongereza, Elizabeth Newson. Igitabo cye \"Ibikinisho n'imikino\", () ivuga ku ngaruka zo gukina ku mikurire yumwana.\nItangizwa rya AblePlay.\nMu Gushyingo 2005, Ikigo cy\u2019igihugu cya Lekotek cyatangije urubuga rwabo rushya rwa AblePlay kuri www.AblePlay.org rutanga uburyo bworoshye bwo kubona amanota yemewe ndetse n\u2019isuzuma rirambuye ry\u2019inzobere mu gihugu cya Lekotek ku mizigo myinshi y\u2019ibikinisho n\u2019ibindi bicuruzwa. Isuzuma ryihariye rya Lekotek ritanga amakuru y'ibicuruzwa yashyizwe mu byiciro by'abafite ubumuga kugirango arusheho koroshya uburambe bwo kugura ibikinisho. Ababyeyi nabahanga bashobora kungukira mu bitekerezo byimbitse by'imikino bijyanye na buri gikinisho cy'abana, ndetse no kumahuriro yo kumurongo kugirango babemere gusangira ubunararibonye no gutanga inama kugiti cyabo. Gutangiza AblePlay byari intambwe ikomeye mu gusobanura intego ya Lekotek yo kuba isoko nyamukuru y'amakuru n'imirimo yo gufasha ijyanye n'ibikinisho n'imikino y'abana bafite ubumuga. National Lekotek ni agace ka Anixter Centre itanga serivisi kubantu barenga 5.000 bakuze n'abana bafite ubumuga binyuze muri gahunda 70 ahantu 35 buri mwaka."}
{"id": "20875", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20875", "title": "Logitech Harmony", "text": "Logitech Harmony ni urukurikirane rw'ibikoresho byo kugenzura kure(remote controls) n'ibikoresho by'ikoranabuhanga ryo mu rugo (home automation) byakozwe mbere na Logitech. Umurongo urimo ibicuruzwa byitaruye bigenewe kugenzura ibice bigize sisitemu yimikino yo murugo (harimo tereviziyo, udusanduku twashyizwe hejuru, DVD na Blu-ray, imashini yimikino ya videwo) hamwe nibindi bikoresho bishobora kugenzurwa hakoreshejwe infragre, hamwe nibicuruzwa bishya byo mu rugo bya hub bishobora gukoreshwa mugucunga byongeweho interineti ishigikiwe nibintu (IoT) nibicuruzwa byo murugo bigenzura ibikoresho. Logitech yahagaritse gukora Harmony Remote mu 2021 kandi ihagarika inkunga ya moderi ishaje muri \nAmateka.\nHarmony remote control yatangiye gukorwa mu mwaka wa 2001 n'ikigo cyo muri Canada cyitwa Easy Zapper, kandi yagurishijwe bwa mbere mu Ugushyingo 2001. Nyuma yaho, icyo kigo cyaje guhindura izina cyitwa Intrigue Technologies kandi cyari giherereye mu mujyi wa Mississauga, muri Ontario, Canada.\nUruganda rukora ibikoresho bya mudasobwa rwitwa Logitech rwaguze icyo kigo mu kwezi kwa Gicurasi 2004 ku mafaranga agera kuri $29 miliyoni z'amadolari ya Amerika, bituma Harmony remotes ziba izikunzwe kw'isi yose. \nMuri Mata 2021, Logitech yatangaje icyemezo cyo guhagarika gukora kure ya Harmony. As of 2025 batangaje ko gushyigikira moderi zishaje zishingiye kuri software ya Harmony Remote bizarangira ku ya 28 Gicurasi, moderi ijyanye na porogaramu nshya ya MyHarmony iracyashyigikiwe.\nIbiranga.\nByose bya Harmony byashyizwe kumurongo ukoresheje software iboneza hanze. Kuri moderi zose ibi birashobora gukorwa ukoresheje mudasobwa ikoresha Microsoft Windows cyangwa MacOS bakeneye guhuzwa hakoreshejwe USB; moderi ya Elite na Ultimate irashobora kandi gushyirwaho bidasubirwaho ukoresheje porogaramu ya terefone ya Android cyangwa iOS.\nBuri kure ifite infragre (IR) ubushobozi bwo kwiga (moderi zimwe na zimwe zirimo inkunga ya RF), kandi irashobora kohereza amakuru kubyerekeranye na kure kure yububiko bwibikoresho byo kumurongo. As of 2012 5000+ ibirango byibikoresho byari bishyigikiwe.\nHarmony zose za kure zishyigikira ibikorwa-byo gukoraho-bishingiye kubikorwa, byemerera kugenzura ibikoresho byinshi icyarimwe. Kurugero, inzu yimikino yo murugo ishobora kuba irimo TV, sisitemu yo hejuru yububiko hamwe na sisitemu yamajwi yo murugo. Kanda kuri bouton yibikorwa ya 'Reba TV' kuri kure bizafungura TV, ufungure sisitemu yo hejuru ya sisitemu, ufungure sisitemu yijwi, uhindure iyinjizwa rya TV kuri sisitemu yashyizweho hejuru hanyuma uhindure ibyinjijwe muri sisitemu yijwi hejuru yisanduku yo hejuru. Mubyongeyeho, ingano yama buto yashushanyirizwa kuri sisitemu yijwi, utubuto twumuyoboro twashizwe kumurongo wa sisitemu ya top top box, hamwe nubundi bugenzuzi kubintu bikwiye bya sisitemu kubikorwa. Ikirangantego cyakwibuka ibikoresho byakoreshwaga kuri cyangwa kuzimya hamwe nibikoresho byinjiza byari byarahinduwe mbere, bikemerera kwimura ibikoresho kuva mubikorwa bikajya mubindi bitohereje amategeko arenze cyangwa atari yo.\nModeli ya kera ya Harmony ya kure yakoreshejwe software ya Harmony Remote, yemerera abakoresha kuvugurura iboneza rya kure, kwiga amategeko ya IR, no kuzamura porogaramu igenzura kure. "}
{"id": "20876", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20876", "title": "Icyegeranyo cya Xandria", "text": "Xandria yari umwe mubakwirakwije ibikinisho byimibonano mpuzabitsina na videwo zikuze, ibitabo nibintu bishya muri Amerika. Yatangiye nk'urutonde rw'imfashanyo zishingiye ku mibonano mpuzabitsina ku bafite ubumuga mu gihe umuryango uharanira uburenganzira bw'ababana n'ubumuga wari utangiye. Xandria kandi yari imwe mu masosiyete ya mbere yagurishije ibintu bijyanye n'imibonano mpuzabitsina kuri interineti. Ubucuruzi [\"mu\"]bwafunze muri 2016 ubwo Lawrence Research Group, Inc. yakoraga ubwo bucuruzi, yasabaga iseswa n\u2019umunyamabanga wa Leta wa Nevada.\nAmateka.\nXandria yashinzwe mu 1974 na Gaye Raymond, umwarimu w\u2019ubuvuzi bw\u2019umubiri wa San Francisco, n\u2019umugabo we, Roy Raymond washinze ibanga rya Victoria. Filozofiya ya yavugaga ko ababana n'ubumuga bagomba kwishimira ubuzima bushoboka bwose, harimo n\u2019ubuzima bwimibonano mpuzabitsina. Xandria yatangiye ari kataloge ikwirakwiza infashanyo yimibonano mpuzabitsina kubantu bafite ubumuga bwumubiri niterambere. \nIcyegeranyo cyumwimerere cya Xandria cyatanze cyane cyane amashusho n'ibitabo byabantu bakuru, hamwe na viboters n'ibikinisho byimibonano mpuzabitsina byari byoroshye kubyumva no kuyobora abantu bafite ubumuga bwumubiri kubera gucibwa cyangwa kurwara.\nIngwate y\u2019isosiyete y\u2019ibanga, ubwiza bw\u2019ibicuruzwa no kunyurwa ku giti cye byamufashije guteza imbere ibi bikurikira mu baturage muri rusange, cyane cyane mu batifuzaga ko binjira mu iduka ry\u2019urukozasoni. \nIbicuruzwa bya Xandria byoherejwe mumapaki by'ubwenge bitanditse izina ryisosiyete. Abakiriya barashobora gusaba gusubizwa muminsi 60 mugihe batanyuzwe nibikinisho byabo byimibonano mpuzabitsina kubwimpamvu. \nGaye na Roy Raymond bagurishije icyegeranyo cya Xandria mu 1984 kandi ibarura ry\u2019isosiyete ryaraguwe kugira ngo rishimishe rubanda. Usibye urutonde rw\u2019abantu bafite ubumuga, iyi sosiyete yatangiye kugurisha agakingirizo, erotika, dildos, amavuta yo kwisiga, impeta y\u2019inkoko, amakamba atatu, pompe yimboro, lingerie, imfashanyo zo kwikinisha, n\u2019ibindi bicuruzwa bijyanye n\u2019imibonano mpuzabitsina. Muri mwaka wa 1999, cyatangiye kandi gukwirakwiza amashusho yimibonano mpuzabitsina yakwirakwizwaga n'ikindi kigo cyafatanyaga na cyo cyitwa Sister company 1st Skin.\nBa nyir'isosiyete bashya banashyizeho akanama ngishwanama k'ubuzima n'inzobere mu mibonano mpuzabitsina. Abanyamuryango barimo abigisha imibonano mpuzabitsina, abaharanira inyungu n'umwanditsi Betty Dodson ; umunyamakuru n'umwanditsi Michael Castleman, wanditse Umujyanama w'ikinyamakuru Playboy kuva 1991 kugeza 1995; n'umuhanga mu by'imitekerereze ya muntu witwa Louanne Cole, ubu akaba ari impuguke ituye kuri WebMD \"Ibyerekeye Igitsina.\"\nXandria yabanje kuba ifite icyicaro i San Francisco. Yimukiye i Brisbane, muri Californiya mu 1993 no mu mwanya wanyuma mu kibaya cya Las Vegas mu 2005.\nMu 1997, isosiyete yatangije Xandria.com, imwe mu mangazini ya mbere yo kuri interineti yagenewe kugurisha ibikinisho by\u2019ibitsina na videwo zikuze. Urubuga hamwe nisosiyete ubwayo byatanze itangazamakuru ryiza mubitabo bizwi cyane nka Playboy, [[Hustler, na Fitness y'abagabo. \nMu cyiciro cyayo cya nyuma, abakiriya bashoboraga gutumiza ibintu binyuze mu iposita no guhamagara nimero itishyurwa, ariko ibyinshi mu byagurishijwe n\u2019isosiyete byakozwe binyuze ku rubuga rwayo. Xandria ntabbwo yari afite iduka risanzwe. Xandria.com yatwaye urutonde rurerure rwibintu bijyanye nigitsina, hamwe ningingo zerekeye ubuzima bwimibonano mpuzabitsina zanditswe nabanditsi bazwi.\nIbikinisho byinshi byimibonano mpuzabitsina byo mu cyegeranyo cya Xandria byagaragaye muri filime \"Stash\" yo mu 2007, comedi yo mu Buhinde yakinnye na Tim Kazurinsky na Marilyn Chambers. Iyi filime ivuga kuri \"Discreet Removals,\" isosiyete izakuraho abantu berekana amashusho yerekana porunogarafiya n\u2019ibikinisho by\u2019imibonano mpuzabitsina nyuma y\u2019urupfu rwabo, kugira ngo abashakanye ndetse n\u2019umuryango batabishaka bashobora \"kwibanda ku gahinda\". Stash yatsindiye igihembo cya Gold Remi 2007 cyo kuba indashyikirwa mu cyiciro cy\u2019abakuze berekana inkuru \" mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya WorldFest Houston."}
{"id": "20877", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20877", "title": "Ikibaho", "text": "Ikibaho cy'amagambo cyangwa itumanaho nuburyo bworoshye bufasha abantu batakaje ubushobozi bwo kuvuga. Ikibaho cy'itumanaho gishobora guhabwa umuntu uri gukira nyuma yo kurwara indwara yo guterwa n'amaraso y'ubwonko. Kuganira, umukoresha yerekana amagambo, inyuguti cyangwa ibimenyetso ku kibaho. Mubisanzwe harimo ibi bikurikira:\nYego | Oya | (\u263a) | | Ushaka | Ibyo\nABCD EFG\nHIJK LMNOP\nQRS \"X\" TUV\n&amp; WX ? YZ\nImpamvu | Niki | ryari | hehe\nHano hari ibikoresho bya elegitoroniki byifashishwa bya synthesis devices iboneka kubwiyi ntego."}
{"id": "20878", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20878", "title": "Ikipe y'igihugu ya Portugal y'abamugaye", "text": "Ikipe y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019u Portugal y\u2019umukino wa Wheelchair Handball ni yo ihagarariye igihugu cya Portugal muri uwo mukino, kandi iyoborwa n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino wa Handball rya Portugal (Portuguese Handball Federation).\nPortugal yabaye iya kabiri mu marushanwa abiri yonyine y\u2019Irushanwa ry\u2019ibihugu by\u2019u Burayi mu mukino wa Wheelchair Handball (European Wheelchair Handball Nations\u2019 Tournament). "}
{"id": "20879", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20879", "title": "Imeza ya Welner", "text": "Imeza ya Welner ni imeza yo ikoreshwa kwa muganga yagenewe mu gusuzuma abarwayi, igamije korohereza abafite ubumuga bw'umubiri ndetse n'abaganga. Yahanzwe n\u2019umuganga w\u2019umunyamerika wita ku ndwara z'abagore n'abana(Obstetrician- gynecologist) akaba ari mu baharanira uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga Sandra Welner.\nAkazi ka Welner hamwe n\u2019abarwayi b\u2019abagore bamugaye cyamuteye guhimba ameza ya Welner, imbonerahamwe y\u2019ibizamini igera ku isi yose kandi yagutse kuruta uko byari bisanzwe bigenda bihinduka mu mwanya no mu burebure, kugeza kuri hejuru yurwego rwo kwimura byoroshye kuva mu kagare k'abamugaye. Imbonerahamwe ikora kandi ibyifuzo mukwemerera imyanya myinshi yo gukora ibizamini. "}
{"id": "20880", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20880", "title": "Andika", "text": "WriteOnline ni ijambo ritunganya ijambo kumurongo kuva muri Crick Software ikubiyemo ibikoresho bifasha mu kwandika kandi yagenewe amashuri abanza,ayisumbuye na kaminuza.\nIbiranga.\nAndikaOnline ni WYSIWYG, urupapuro-reba ijambo gutunganya ijambo ririmo imvugo ya software, guhanura ijambo, Wordbars hamwe nuwashushanyije.\nWriteOnline ikubiyemo ibintu bigamije kuyigira ikoreshwa n'abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona, ndetse ikanagira keyboard yo ku ishusho ya ecran ishobora gukoreshwa n'abatabasha gukoresha keyboard isanzwe.\nKwandikaOnline ni porogaramu ya Java. Iraboneka m' Icyongereza cyo mu Bwongereza cg m'Icyongereza cyo muri Amerika."}
{"id": "20881", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20881", "title": "Icyicaro cyumusarani", "text": "ibikoresha byo kuzamura intebe, y'ubwiherero cg intebe z'ubwiherero cyangwa intebe z'ubwiherero zizamurwa, cyangwa intebe yubwiherero yazamuye ni ibikoresho by'ikoranabuhanga bifasha mu korohereza abantu bakuze cyangwa abafite ubumuga kubona ubwiherero.\nBirashobora gufasha mu kwimura abantu bava mu magare y'ubufasha, kandi bishobora gufasha mu kwirinda kugwa.\nAbantu bamwe bashobora gusanga ibyago bya plastike bidashimishije cyangwa bitwaje agasuzuguro. Bashobora kandi kubangamira ingeso zumusarani zabandi bakoresha. "}
{"id": "20882", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20882", "title": "Umukoresha", "text": "UserWay ni sosiyete igera kuri digitale ifite icyicaro i Wilmington, Delaware. Isosiyete ikoresha AI na automatisation mu rwego rwo gukemura ibibazo by\u2019amategeko ku masosiyete kugira ngo imbuga zabo zigerweho. \nAmateka.\nUserWay yashinzwe mu 2016 na Allon Mason. Mu 2021, Susan Bennett, umuntu watanze ijwi rya Siri, umufasha w'ikoranabuhanga wa Apple, yabaye umuvugizi w'iyi sosiyete kandi akaba umurwanashyaka 'uburenganzira bw'abantu bafite ubumuga mu gikorwa cyo kwamamaza cya UserWay, cyanagaragayemo Dr. Orna Guralnik. Mu Kuboza 2021, isosiyete yatanze umushinga wa mbere w'inyandiko y'amasoko (prospectus) ya IPO ku Isoko ry\u2019imigabane rya Tel Aviv. \nMuri Mutarama 2022, isosiyete yasohoye IPO yayo ku isoko ry'imigabane rya Tel Aviv ku gaciro ka miliyoni 120 NIS. Yakomeje gukusanya hafi miliyoni 30 NIS kubakiriya b'ibigo. UserWay yatangiye gucuruza ku isoko ryimigabane rya Tel Aviv ku izina rya UWAY. \nWidget ya UserWay iraboneka kumurongo wingenzi wa CMS kimwe nimbuga za HTML / CSS / JS. Ikoranabuhanga rya UserWay ryujuje amategeko yubahiriza ashingiye kuri WCAG 2.1 AA kandi nkuko bisabwa na ADA. \nMu Kuboza 2023, UserWay yatangaje ko izagurwa n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019Abanyamerika Level Access ku giciro cya miliyoni 98.7 z\u2019amadolari($) yo guhuza amafaranga n\u2019impaka zikomeje kuvugwa. Ubucuruzi bwarangiye muri Werurwe 2024, guhindura isosiyete akaba iy'abigenga bonyine. \nMu 2024, ikirego cy\u2019icyiciro cy\u2019ikirego cyaregewe UserWay, kivuga ko ibirego byinshi byakabije, ko widgets zayo zitubahiriza kubahiriza amategeko, ndetse rimwe na rimwe bigatuma imbuga za interineti zigora gukoresha ababana n'ubumuga.. Ikinyamakuru Financial Times cyatangaje ko imbuga za interineti zikoresha UserWay hamwe n\u2019andi masosiyete ya widget agera kuri interineti akiri kure yo kubahiriza amabwiriza yo kugerwaho, amwe muri yo akaba afite amakosa y\u2019ibanze mu bijyanye no kugeza ku bikorwa by'ikoranabuhanga. "}
{"id": "20883", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20883", "title": "Radiyo 1RPH", "text": "Radiyo 1RPH 1125 kHz Canberra (89.5FM Wagga Wagga, 99.5FM Junee) ni radiyo itanga amakuru kuri radiyo AM band kuri radiyo yo mu murwa mukuru wa Ositaraliya ikorera ACT yose hamwe n\u2019ibice bikikije NSW birimo Queanbeyan, Yass na Michelago, hamwe nabakunda kugaragara cyane FM kuri Wagga na Junee, hamwe n\u2019itangazamakuru ryandika kuri interineti. \nRadio 1RPH ni umunyamuryango wa Radio Icapiro ry'abafite ubumuga. Amagambo yacyo ni, amakuru yawe hamwe no Guhindura icapiro mumajwi, kandi igamije gukorera abantu bose, kubwimpamvu iyo ari yo yose, bafite ubumuga bwo gusoma ibikoresho byacapwe bizwi nkibinyamakuru bigendanwa muntoki. \nIbinyamakuru, ibitabo, nibindi bikoresho byacapwe bizwi kwizina rya news letter bisomwa kumurongo. 1RPH yahoze ifite frequency hanze ya AM band kuri 1620\u00a0kHz, nuko agira ikibazo cyo kwivanga gake, kandi yumvikanye kure nka Amerika. \nIngaruka za NDIS.\nMuri Gashyantare 2016, ubuyobozi bwa sitasiyo bwatangaje ko bwagiriwe inama ko amadolari 38.000 atazaboneka muri ACT ya Leta ya ACT y\u2019ubumuga guhera muri Nyakanga 2016, ubwo aya mafaranga azaba mu rwego rw\u2019amafaranga rusange y\u2019ubwishingizi bw\u2019abafite ubumuga (NDIS) ayobowe na guverinoma ya Commonwealth. Aya mafaranga yagereranyaga hafi kimwe cya kane cyingengo yimikorere ya sitasiyo. Minisitiri w\u2019abafite ubumuga Chris Bourke yanze gusezeranya inkunga y\u2019umutungo wa ACT, ariko avuga ko azakora iperereza kuri Minisitiri y'abafite ubumuga butandukanye. nko Kuyobora bashizemo imbaraga zo kumenyekanisha ibura ry'inkunga ni: Perezida, Lorraine Litster; Visi Perezida, n'abafite ubumuga Perezida wa ACT, Robert Altamore; n\u2019abakorerabushake batanga amakuru hamwe n\u2019inteko ishinga amategeko umutwe wa ACT, Umudepite wa Vicki Dunne. Litster yerekanye ko, muri gahunda ya miliyari 22 z'amadolari ya Amerika / umwaka, miliyoni 132 z'amadolari yonyine niyo yagenewe serivisi zirimo umuyoboro wa radiyo wandika ubumuga. Ikigo cy'igihugu gishinzwe ubwishingizi bw'abafite ubumuga (NDIA) cyatangaje ko kizasuzuma iki kibazo. "}
{"id": "20884", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20884", "title": "Inziga", "text": "bInziga zimenyereza, zizwi nka stabilisateur hanze ya Amerika y'amajyaruguru ni amapine abiri yongerwa ku gice cy'inyuma cy'igare kugirango rigire amapine ane, bifasha abigira gutwara igare ubwabo. Kuva ku mpera z'imyaka ya 1990, amagare yitwa balance bikes yatangiye gusimbura ayo y'uruziga, kuko afasha cyane kwiga kubungabunga umutuzo no gutwara igare neza. \nAmateka.\nIsosiyete y'Abanyamerika Huffy yazanye ibiziga by'amahugurwa mu 1949 hamwe ni gare ryayo 'Convertible'. Igishushanyo gisanzwe cy'amahugurwa yibiziga ntabwo cyahindutse kuva iki Zigizwe n'inziga ebyiri nto, imwe kuruhande rwuruziga rwinyuma rwamagare. Bifatanije kuruhande rwicyuma cyangwa ikadiri irambuye hanze yikigare, nibyiza kugumisha ibiziga byamahugurwa hejuru yubutaka. Utwugarizo tugenewe guhindurwa kugirango habeho uburebure butandukanye n\u2019impande z\u2019ibiziga byamahugurwa, bituma habaho kwihitiramo ukurikije ibyo uyigenderaho akeneye, ariko ibi biragoye kubigeraho mubikorwa. \nIgitekerezo cyo guhugura ibiziga gishobora kwerekanwa mu buryo bw'ikigereranyo mu Cyongereza ku nkunga iyo ari yo yose ya mashini, cyane cyane mu iterambere rya software. \nKoresha.\nImikorere y'iziga ry'imyitozo ishingiye kumyumvire yuko umutwara wiga ashobora gutezimbere buhoro buhoro uburinganire bwabo hamwe nubuhanga bwo guhuza imbaraga ashingiye kumfashanyo yibiziga byinyongera. Mugihe uyigenderaho agira ikizere nubuhanga, the training wheels izamurwa buhoro buhoro cyangwa bikurwaho, mubyukuri byemerera uwagenderaho kwimuka kugendera nta nkunga y'inyongera. \nImipaka.\nAbashakashatsi berekanye ko ibiziga by'amahugurwa (training wheels) bidindiza iterambere ryukuri hamwe nubuhanga bwo kuyobora. Kwishingikiriza kumuziga wamahugurwa birinda abayitwara kubona byimazeyo imbaraga zo gutwara igare kandi biganisha kubibazo byo kwimuka kugendana batabifite. \u200b \nInziga zamahugurwa(training wheels) cyane cyane ziba inzitizi yo kwiga niba zahinduwe nabi, kuko zibuza igare kunanuka niba ziri hasi cyane, kandi bikabuza gufata feri niba uburemere bwinshi bwakuwe kumuziga winyuma ukoresheje ibiziga byimyitozo biri hasi cyane. Guhindura ibiziga byamahugurwa neza, no kubizamura hejuru uko ubuhanga bwumwana bwiyongera, bifasha kugabanya ariko ntibikuraho burundu ibyo bibazo. \nGusimbuza amagare aringaniye.\nTugarutse ku nkomoko y'amagare mu ifarashi yijimye, amagare aringaniye yahise atoneshwa na pedagogy yo gusiganwa ku magare nyuma yo kuyitangiza mu Kwiga kugendana nigare riringaniye bitanga inyungu ndende ndende kubatwara bato kuruta ibiziga byamahugurwa. yatangiye gutanga ibiziga byamahugurwa kwisi yose mu myaka ya za 2010. "}
{"id": "20885", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20885", "title": "Rod Michalko", "text": "Rod Michalko ni umushakashatsi w\u2019Umunyakanada mu rwego rw\u2019ubumenyi bw\u2019abafite ubumuga.\nMichalko yabonye impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga ya Filozofiya muri sociologiya yakuye muri kaminuza ya British Columbia. Mu mwaka wa 2007, yakoraga muri New College, Toronto, aho yateguye amasomo y\u2019inyigisho z\u2019ubumuga. Nyuma yaho, yagiye mu kiruhuko cy\u2019izabukuru muri kaminuza ya Toronto. \nMichalko yatangiye gutakaza bushobozi bwo kubona akiri umwana none ni impumyi. Kugeza mu mwaka wa 2001, Michalko yafashijwe n'imbwa imuyobora yitwaga Smokie, akaba yarananditseho mu bitabo bye \"The Two-in-One\" (1999) hamwe \"na Letters with Smokie\" (2023). Kuva Smokie apfa, Michalko yatangiye gukoresha inkoni yera. \nMichalko ni umufatanyabikorwa wa mugenzi we wigisha Tanya Titchkosky. "}
{"id": "20886", "revid": "16886", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20886", "title": "Acces Key", "text": "Mucukumbuzi y'urubuga, cyangwa se key access cyangwa enterineti yemerera umukoresha wa mudasobwa guhita asimbuka cyangwa akajya kukingi gika cyo kurupapuro runaka akoresheje clavier.\nKwinjira muri mushakisha zitandukanye.\nAbantu benshi bakunda gukora ubushakashatsi kuri mudasobwa bamenya urufunguzo rwo kwinjira gusa iyo bakanze hamwe nurufunguzo rumwe cyangwa byinshi bihindura nka.\nKugaragaza urufunguzo rwo kwinjira.\nKugirango winjire mu bushakashatsi byemererwa muri HTML ukoresheje ikiranga accesskey. Agaciro ka element ya accesskey ikiranga nurufunguzo umukoresha azakanda (mubisanzwe uhujwe nurufunguzo rumwe cyangwa nyinshi, nkuko byasobanuwe na mushakisha) kugirango ubashe gukora cyangwa kwibanda kuri kiriya kintu. Nubwo ibiranga accesskey ishyiraho urufunguzo rushobora gukanda, ntabwo ihita imenyesha umukoresha urufunguzo rwinjira. Ihwaniro rimwe ni iryumwanditsi wurupapuro kugirango yerekane agaciro kingenzi koresha ukoresheje tagi &gt; &lt; kugirango ushire umurongo inyuguti mumyandiko ihuza ihuza na accesskey yashinzwe. Kumuhuza hepfo, umukoresha yakanda + kuri Internet Explorer, + kuri Mac (urufunguzo rw'itegeko rushobora gutanga ibisubizo utifuzaga) na + + kuri Opera kugirango yerekanwe kuri index.html.&lt;a href=\"index.html\" accesskey=\"h\"&gt;Home&lt;/a&gt;cyangwa gushimangira \u2039H\u203a:&lt;a href=\"index.html\" accesskey=\"h\"&gt;&lt;em&gt;H&lt;/em&gt;ome&lt;/a&gt;ubundi, CSS ikurikira irashobora gukoreshwa kugirango yerekane imiterere:\nntabwo ari ngombwa, ariko bishobora kugirira akamaro umukoresha. Irabafasha kumenya urufunguzo rwo gukanda kugirango bereke aho bashaka. Ubundi buryo bushoboka bwo kwerekana ibifasha gukora nibyo gukora page hamwe nibikoresho byose byerekanwe. Cyangwa webmaster ashobora gukora byombi. Ubundi buryo kubakoresha amaherezo ni ugushiraho inyandiko yumukoresha nka FireFox \"Access Bar\" ya GreaseMonkey.\nAmateka.\nUburenganzi bwo gutangira ubushakashatsi muri HTML muri 1999 kandi byihuse bigerwaho hafi yubufasha bwa mushakisha rusange.\nAmakimbirane na mushakisha hamwe na ecran yabasomyi.\nMucukumbuzi nyinshi zisobanura ama shortcuts ya clavier yabo, akoreshwa mugucunga mushakisha ubwayo: urugero, mushakisha nyinshi kuri Windows ALT + D kwibanda kuri URL umurongo. Bimwe mubikorwa byambere byakoresheje urufunguzo rumwe rwo guhindura urufunguzo rwo kwinjira: urugero, accesskey = \"D\" nayo yagenera ALT+D, bivamo kimwe cyangwa ikindi mubisobanuro bitaboneka.\nMu mpeshyi yo mu 2002, ubujyanama bw\u2019Abanyakanada bwinjira ku rubuga rwa interineti bwakoze ubushakashatsi butemewe kugira ngo harebwe niba gushyira mu bikorwa ibikoresho byateje ibibazo abakoresha ikoranabuhanga ry\u2019imihindagurikire y'ikirere, cyane cyane ikoranabuhanga ryo gusoma rya ecran rikoreshwa n'abakoresha impumyi kandi batabona neza. Aba bakoresha bakeneye ama shortcuts menshi ya clavier kugirango bagere kurubuga, nkuko \"kwerekana no gukanda\" imbeba ntabwo ari amahitamo kuri bo. Ubushakashatsi bwabo bwerekanye ko guhuza ibice byinshi byingenzi byerekanaga amakimbirane kuri kimwe cyangwa byinshi muri ubwo buhanga, kandi icyifuzo cyabo cya nyuma kwari ukwirinda gukoresha ibikoresho byose.\nIbikurikira, mushakisha yahinduye urufunguzo rwo guhindura kugirango birinde amakimbirane, nkuko bigaragara mumeza iri hejuru: mubisanzwe, ALT +SHIFT kuri Windows, naCTRY + OPT kuri Mac.\nIkintu.\nMuri XHTML 2, ururimi rwavuguruwe rwandika urubuga,rwa HTML rukora rwa World Wide Web Consortium rwatesheje agaciro ikiranga accesskey rushyigikira ikintu cya &lt;access&gt; cyasobanuwe muri Moderi ya XHTML. Ariko, XHTML 2 yasezeye kuruhande rwa HTML5, (guhera muri Kanama 2009) ikomeje kwemerera ibiranga accesskey, kandi ntibisobanura ubwoko bwibintu &lt;access&gt;. \nGukoresha uburyo busanzwe bwo gushushanya amakarita.\nMuri 2004, igipimo cyagaragaye ko ukoresheje imibare, iteza imbere guhuza abakoresha, kandi igafasha kongera guhanura kwihuta rya clavier kurubuga rutandukanye. Ibi birimo, kurugero, 1 kujya kurupapuro, 0 gushakisha, ndetse no kubonana, nabandi..\nNyuma yimyaka icumi, muri 2014, hasohotse ibipimo ngenderwaho kandi byuzuye hakoreshejwe inyuguti nimibare byombi hagamijwe guhumeka ubuzima bushya mubikorwa bya byimbitse kandi by'ingenzi."}
{"id": "20887", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20887", "title": "AnySurfer", "text": "AnySurfer ni umuryango w\u2019Ababiligi uteza imbere uburyo bwo kugera ku mbuga za interineti, porogaramu, n\u2019inyandiko za digitale ku bamugaye. Nizina ry'ikirango cyiza urubuga kandi ushobora kubona ndetse ukarugiraho uruhare rwuzuye. AnySurfer ni umushinga wigihugu ukorwa na Blindenzorg Licht en Liefde, umuryango udaharanira inyungu w\u2019Ababiligi utanga ubufasha ku batabona n\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona. \nKugenzura Urutonde rwa Anysurfer rukoresha mugihe rutanga ikirango icyo aricyo cyose gishingiye kumurongo wurubuga rwibanze (WCAG 2.0). \nAmateka.\nBlindSurfer yashinzwe mu 2001 na Rudi Canters, umupayiniya ushijwe kugenzura urubuga rwa interineti i. Yafashijwe mu bikorwa bye na Blindenzorg Licht en Liefde. Kubera inkunga y'amafaranga yatanzwe na Gelijke Kansen Vlaanderen, umushinga wahurijwe hamwe mu 2002. Nyuma y'urupfu rwa Canters ku ya 14 Mata 2003, umushinga ndetse n'ikirangantego cyacyo byakomeje kwiyongera. \nKu ya 1 Nyakanga 2006, BlindSurfer yahinduye izina ry'uru rubuga arwita AnySurfer. Ibi byakozwe mu rwego rwo kwirinda gushimangira imyumvire ivuga ko kwinjira ku rubuga bigirira akamaro abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona gusa, aho kuba ababana n'ubumuga muri rusange. \nUkuboza 2008, hasohotse ikiciro cya kabiri cyuru rubuga rwibirimo rwo kugerwaho. AnySurfer yagize uruhare mu guhindura aya mabwiriza agezweho mu Giholande, kandi ihuza urutonde rwabo kugira ngo ihuze na WCAG 2.0. "}
{"id": "20888", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20888", "title": "Tim Johnson (imikino ya rugby y\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo kugendera mu kagare)", "text": "Timothy Clarence Johnson MNZM (yavutse ku wa 4 Gashyantare 1976) ni umuyobozi wa siporo w\u2019abafite ubumuga muri Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande akaba yarahoze akina umikino wa rugby w\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo kugendera mu kagare. Yabaye kapiteni w\u2019ikipe Wheel Blacks, ikipe y\u2019igihugu ya Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande ikina rugby y\u2019abakoresha amagare y\u2019abafite ubumuga.\nJohnson yari umunyamuryango w\u2019amakipe ya Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande akina rugby y\u2019abakoresha amagare kuva mu 1998 kugeza mu 2010, harimo n\u2019ikipe yatwaye umudali wa zahabu mu mikino ya Paralympics yo mu mpeshyi ya 2004 yabereye Atenayi, ndetse n\u2019ikipe yatwaye umudali wa feza mu mikino ya Paralympics yo mu 2000 yabereye i Sydney. Mu mikino ya Paralympics yo mu 2008, yari umukinnyi n'umutoza wungirije mu ikipe ya Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande, yaje ku mwanya wa gatanu. Yatsindiye umudali wa feza mu marushanwa y\u2019isi yabereye i Toronto mu 1998 no muri Christchurch mu 2006, kandi yari kapiteni w\u2019ikipe yo mu 2006.\nYabaye perezida wa New Zealand Wheelchair Rugby kuva mu 2003 kugeza mu 2004, ndetse nanone kuva mu 2011 kugeza mu 2014. Yanakoreye iyo nzego nk\u2019umubitsi hagati y\u2019umwaka wa 2005 na 2006. Yanahagarariye abakinnyi muri Komite Olempike ya Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande kuva mu 2003 kugeza mu 2014. \nJohnson yize muri Kaminuza ya Canterbury no muri Christchurch College of Education, aho yasoje afite impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor of Engineering with Honours mu bijyanye n\u2019amashanyarazi, elektroniki n\u2019itumanaho mu 1998, Graduate Diploma mu Kwigisha no Kwiga (Secondary) mu 1999, ndetse na Master of Engineering mu 2004. Yanize kandi muri Victoria University of Technology i Melbourne ndetse no muri Auckland University of Technology. Yarangije amasomo ajyanye na Graduate Diploma mu Kwita ku Mirimo y\u2019Abakinnyi B\u2019abahanga mu 2005, kandi yasoje afite Graduate Certificate mu Buyobozi bw\u2019Ubucuruzi (Part MBA) mu 2015.Yahawe impamyabumenyi ya kaminuza ya Canterbury na Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande Blues mu mukino wa rugby y\u2019abakoresha amagare. \nKuri ubu akora nka Umuyobozi w\u2019Ishami rishinzwe amarushanwa muri ishyirahamwe mpuzamahanga rya rugby y\u2019abakoresha amagare (WWR), aho yamaze kuba umunyamuryango w\u2019ingenzi kuva mu 2007. Ni Umutoza wungirije w\u2019Ikoranabuhanga mu mikino ya Paralympics yo mu mpeshyi ya 2024 i Paris, kandi ni Umutoza w\u2019Ikoranabuhanga mu gikombe mpuzamahanga cya 2023 cya Rugby y'abakoresha amagare. Yanabaye Umutoza w\u2019Ikoranabuhanga mu marushanwa akurikira: 2023 WWR Asia-Oceania Championship, 2018 IWRF World Championships, ndetse na 2013, 2015 na 2019 IWRF Asia-Oceania Championships.\nYakoze imirimo myinshi muri sosiyete ishinzwe indishyi zimpanuka kuva mu mwaka wa 2006 kugeza mu mwaka wa 2019\nMu isabukuru y\u2019amavuko y\u2019umwamikazi wa 2015, Johnson yagizwe Umunyamuryango w\u2019icyubahiro cya Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande, muri serivisi z\u2019imikino y\u2019abafite ubumuga. "}
{"id": "20889", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20889", "title": "Bobby (software)", "text": "Umwimerere wa BobbySoftware yari igikoresho cyo kuri interineti gikoreshwa kubuntu, cyanditswe na Josh Krieger kandi gitangwa nikigo gishinzwe ikoranabuhanga ryihariye (CAST), ryakoreshejwe mukwemeza imbuga za WAI no kubahiriza 508. n' umushinga watangijwe mu mwakwa wa 1995, yamenyekanye cyane mugukoresha igishushanyo \"cyemewe cya Bobby\" abanditsi b'urubuga bashobora gukoresha kugirango berekane ko batsinze ikizamini cya Bobby kumurongo. Iterambere ryahujwe na Chuck Hitchcock, Umuyobozi mukuru wa CAST muri Politiki n\u2019ikoranabuhanga, kandi ryatejwe imbere na David Clark na Michael Cooper.\nIgikoresho CAST cyafunzwe ku mugaragaro ku ya 1 Gicurasi 2005. Icyakora, izina rya Bobby ryabayeho muri gahunda ya Watchfire Corporation ya Watchfire Bobby. Watchfire yatanze serivisi yubuntu CAST yakoranye naniri korana buhanga rya BobbySoft mubikoresho byabo bya Watchfire WebXACT. Itangwa rya Watchfire, ubu igice cya suite ya IBM yasobanuwe hepfo, igerageza paji yibirimo kurubuga kubwiza, kuboneka, nibibazo byihariye.\nIri koranabuhanga ryakoreshwaga kubuntu ryaje gafungwe ku mugaragaro na ba nyir'ubwite, IBM, ku ya 1 Gashyantare 2008. Ubu porogaramu iraboneka mu rwego rwa IBM Rational Policy Tester Accessibility Edition. \nKugeza ubu, Igikoresho cyo Gusuzuma Urubuga (WAVE) rutanga iyi serivisi yubuntu kuri wave.webaim.org."}
{"id": "20890", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20890", "title": "Ihuriro ry\u2019abafite ubumuga bw\u2019umubiri", "text": "Ihuriro ry\u2019abafite ubumuga bw\u2019umubiri yari ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abaharaniraga uburenganzira bw'abafite ubumuga mu mujyi wa New York mu ntangiriro z\u2019ikinyejana cya 20. Ryashinzwe mu kwezi kwa Gatanu 1935 hagamijwe kwamagana ivangura ryakorewe n\u2019ubuyobozi bushinzwe iterambere (WPA). \nBiro y\u2019Ubwunganizi bw\u2019Abaturage yo mu Mujyi wa New York yashiragaho akamenyetso \u201cPH\u201d ku busabe bw\u2019abasaba inkunga bari bafite ubumuga, aho \u201cPH\u201d risobanuraga \u201cphysically handicapped\u201d (ufite ubumuga bw\u2019umubiri). Aba bantu bashyirwaga ku rutonde rw\u2019\u201cabatabasha kubona akazi\u201d (unemployable), maze bakangirwa kubona imirimo yashyiriweho n\u2019WPA. Kugira ngo barwanye ibyo, abanyamuryango b\u2019Ihuriro ry\u2019Abafite Ubumuga bw\u2019Umubiri bakoreye sit-in muri Home Relief Bureau iminsi icyenda batangiriye ku wa 29 Gicurasi 1935, ndetse banakora sit-in y\u2019ikiruhuko cy\u2019impera z\u2019icyumweru ku biro bya WPA, nabyo mu Mujyi wa New York, mu kwezi kwa Kamena 1935. Izi ngamba zaje gutuma hashyirwaho imirimo 1,500 ku bakozi bafite ubumuga bw\u2019umubiri mu Mujyi wa New York mu mwaka wa 1936. Ihuriro ryari rimaze gusenyuka mu mwaka wa 1938. "}
{"id": "20891", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20891", "title": "Tekinoroji ifasha muri siporo", "text": "Ikoranabuhanga rifasha mu mikino ni urwego rw'iterambere ry'ikoranabuhanga riri kugenda rwaguka.. Tekinoroji yifashisha n'ibikoresho byinshi byakozwe kugira ngo bifashe abakunzi ba siporo bafite ubumuga mu mikino. Tekinoroji ifasha mu mikino ishobora gukoreshwa muri siporo y'ababana n'ubumuga, aho siporo ihari ihindurwa kugira ngo abakinnyi babana n'ubumuga bitabire; cyangwa, tekinoroji ifasha ababana n'ubumuga ishobora gukoreshwa mu guhimba siporo nshya rwose hamwe n'abakinnyi bafite ubumuga uretse mu bitekerezo.\nUmubare w\u2019abafite ubumuga bitabira siporo ugenda wiyongera, biganisha ku iterambere ry\u2019ikoranabuhanga rishya rifasha. Ibikoresho by'ikoranabuhanga bifasha bishobora kuba byoroheje, \"tekinoroji-nto\", cyangwa bishobora gukoresha ikoranabuhanga ryateye imbere cyane, ndetse bamwe bakoresha mudasobwa. Tekinoroji ifasha siporo nayo ishobora kuba yoroheje cyangwa yateye imbere. Ku bw'ibyo, tekinoroji ifasha ishobora kuboneka muri siporo kuva ku myidagaduro y'abaturage kugeza ku mikino ya Paralympique. Ibikoresho byinshi by'ikoranabuhanga byifashisha tekinoroji byatejwe imbere mu gihe, kandi ku bw'ibyo, siporo ku bantu bafite ubumuga \"yahindutse kuba igikoresho cyo kuvura(ivuriro) ihinduka ibikorwa bigamije amarushanwa\". \nIbikoresho bifasha.\nIbikoresho bifasha bishobora gukoreshwa imyitozo n'amahugurwa, usibye no kuba bifasha kwitabira siporo. Hano hari bimwe mu bikoresho bifasha kuri ubu biboneka ku bafite ubumuga:\nImikino ikoresha tekinoroji ifasha.\nSiporo ikoresha tekinoroji ifasha ikubiyemo iyi ikurikira:\nImikino myinshi yavuzwe haruguru yageze ku rwego mpuzamahanga rw'imikino ngororamubiri, ishyirwa mu mikino Paralympique.\nSiporo ikenera ikoranabuhanga rifasha.\nImikino imwe n'imwe yateye imbere ifite intego yo guteza ikibazo abakinnyi bafite ubumuga bashobora kwishimira. Iyi siporo isaba tekinoroji ifasha abakinnyi bose mu gice cy'imikino. Ingero zimwe ni: Umukino (Sled) umupira w'amaguru ; igare ry'ababana n'ubumuga ; ubwato bwo guhuza n'imiterere, hamwe n'ubwato bwagenewe cyane cyane abasare bafite ubumuga; Nordic (cross-country) skiing hamwe n'indobo \"sit-ski\"; n'amarushanwa yo gutwara amagare."}
{"id": "20892", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20892", "title": "Upasana Makati", "text": "Upasana Makati ni rwiyemezamirimo ukomoka mu mujyi wa Mumbai, washinze White Print, akaba n'umurwanashyaka w'abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona. Mu mwaka wa 2016, yatoranyijwe nka umwe mu 30 bafite impano cyangwa ibikorwa by\u2019indashyikirwa bari munsi y\u2019imyaka 30.\nUburezi.\nMakati yize itumanaho muri kaminuza ya Ottawa. \n\"Icapa ryera\".\nMu mwaka wa 2013, Upasana Makati yatekereje ku buryo abantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona batangiriraga umunsi wabo, bityo agahitamo gusura amashuri kugira ngo amenye neza. Nyuma yo kubona ko hari amahitamo make ku bantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona yo gusoma batagombye gufashwa n\u2019umu-soma-ecran, yashinze White Print, ikinyamakuru cya mbere cyo mu Bwongereza cyibanda ku buzima bw\u2019abantu mu Buhinde gisohoka mu Braille. Iki kinyamakuru gisohora impapuro 64 kandi gikubiyemo insanganyamatsiko zirimo ubugeni, siporo, politiki, n\u2019ikinamico/filime. \nIki kinyamakuru ni icyinjiza amafaranga, kikishyurwa hakoreshejwe uburyo busanzwe nk\u2019abasomyi biyandikishije n\u2019amatangazo y\u2019ibigo."}
{"id": "20893", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20893", "title": "BrowseAloud", "text": "BrowseAloud ni porogaramu yikoranabuhanga ifasha yongerera inyandiko-imvugo imikorere kurubuga. Yakozwe na Texthelp Ltd, isosiyete yo muri Irilande y'Amajyaruguru ishingiye ku buhanga bwo gukora ikoranabuhanga rifasha. BrowseAloud yongeraho ibikoresho byo gusoma kubikoresho kugirango wongere imbuga za interineti kubantu bakeneye gukoresha uru rubuga mu gusoma inkuru. Igikoresho cya JavaScript gishingiye kongeramo ibikoresho bireremba kurupapuro rwurubuga rusurwa. Serivisi yishyurwa nuwamamaza urubuga; kandi ni ubuntu kubasura urubuga. \nBrowseAloud yakoreshejwe mu Bwongereza n\u2019inama zimwe na zimwe z\u2019ibanze, hamwe n\u2019ibice bya serivisi y\u2019ubuzima. Porogaramu yatsindiye ibbihembo byinshi bishya by\u2019itangazamakuru muri Leta zunze ubumwe za Amerika \nImpaka.\nBrowseAloud yanenzwe naba technologiste ko bakeneye gukoresha Mouse kugirango bahitemo inyandiko mbere yuko BrowseAloud ayisoma. Ibi byasabye icyerekezo nubuhanga bwo gukoresha moteri, kugirango BrowseAloud itagerwaho mumatsinda ashobora gukoresha abandi basoma ecran, nka JAWS. Abatanga ibitekerezo bavuze ko BrowseAloud idasimbuye ibikoresho nkibi. \nMalware.\nKu ya 11 Gashyantare 2018, ku cyumweru, abakiriya ba BrowseAloud barenga 4.200 (amakuru amwe yavuze ko abantu barenga 5.000) imiyoboro yabo yanduye kode ya Coinhive nyuma yuko BrowseAloud, yakiriwe kuri Serivisi za Amazone, yibwe. Nubwo Coinhive itanga Monero, uburyo bwo gukoresha amafaranga -ifite imikoreshereze yemewe, kuyinjiza mu buryo muri icyo gitero byasobanuwe ko ari \"bibi\" n\u2019umwanditsi mukuru \"w\u2019ikinyamakuru\" mukuru, Chris Williams; kandi nka \"malware\" na Taylor Hatmaker, muri TechCrunch. \nSerivisi ya BrowseAloud yahagaritswe na Texthelp, kugirango yemere abashakasshatsi babo gukora iperereza ku guhungabanya umutekano no gukuraho code mbi. Kwiyandikisha byagereranije ko code yakoraga muri BroswseAloud mugihe cyamasaha cumi nagatatu. Yakoresheje mudasobwa zabashyitsi kugirango ibare ibarwa cyane, ishobora kudindiza imikorere ya mudasobwa yabo no kugabanya ubuzima bwa bateri cyangwa gukoresha amashanyarazi. Ikigo cy\u2019igihugu gishinzwe umutekano wa cyber cyavuze ko ibikorwa ari \"bitemewe\". \nMu bakiriya bafite bagezweho n'ingaruka ku mbuga za interineti harimo Komiseri ushinzwe amakuru mu Bwongereza (wafunze urubuga rwabo mu rwego rwo kwirinda), Ibiro by\u2019Ubuyobozi bw\u2019Inkiko z\u2019Amerika, na guverinoma z\u2019ibihugu bya Ositaraliya bya Victoria na Queensland. \nIki kibazo cyagaragajw na Scott Helme, umujyanama ushinzwe umutekano mu Bwongereza. Boyd buri wese yerekanye ko intege nke zikoreshwa muri icyo gitero zashoboraga gukoreshwa mu kwiba amakuru y\u2019abashyitsi yavugiwe muriyo nama. Helme na NCSC bombi basabye ko abategura urubuga bakoresha ubunyangamugayo bwa subresource mu rwego rwo kwirinda ibyo bitero. \nIgitero cyagereranijwe ko cyinjije gusa abagabye igitero kingana n\u2019amadolari 24 muri kode ya Monero. Bamwe mu batanze ibitekerezo, nka Chris Boyd wo muri Malwarebytes, bavuze ko icyo gitero cyari cyoroheje, kubera ko abagabye igitero bashoboraga kugerageza uburyo bwo gukoresha ejo hazaza. "}
{"id": "20894", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20894", "title": "Lorraine Mercer", "text": "Lorraine Mercer MBE ni Umwongereza wabashije kurokoka ingaruka za thalidomide, akaba umushushanyi, umudozi w\u2019imipira y\u2019imisumari n\u2019umushoferi w\u2019imodoka z\u2019abafite ubumuga muri RDA.\nMercer yari uhagarariye umuryango mpuzamahanga w\u2019abarokotse ingaruka za thalidomide ubwo yagendaga afata Itara rya Olympic mu mwaka wa 2012 ku bw\u2019igihugu cye. Imodoka ye yateguwe ku buryo yatwaraga Itara rya Olympic neza hejuru y\u2019umutwe we, itajya hafi y\u2019umwuka wa ogisijeni akeneye.\nMu mwaka wa 2015, Mercer yahawe icyubahiro MBE kubera serivisi ze mu muryango, by\u2019umwihariko ku bantu bonyine bo mu bitaro by\u2019aho atuye muri Mid-Sussex."}
{"id": "20895", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20895", "title": "Itegeko ribuza kuvangura abamugaye 1992", "text": "Itegeko rishingiye ku ivangura ry\u2019abafite ubumuga 1992 (Cth) ni itegeko ryemejwe n\u2019Inteko ishinga amategeko ya Ositaraliya aho ribuza abakora ivangura rikorerwa ababana n\u2019ubumuga butandukanye mu kazi, mu burezi, ahantu haboneka ku mugaragaro, gutanga ibicuruzwa na serivisi, amacumbi, clubs n\u2019amashyirahamwe, n\u2019ibindi bice. Ivangura risobanurwa harimo kunanirwa kugira ibyo uhindura kumuntu. Komisiyo ishinzwe uburenganzira bwa muntu muri Ositaraliya ihabwa kandi igasuzuma ibirego byatanzwe hakurikijwe iryo tegeko.\nAmavu n'amavuko.\nMu gihe iri tegeko ryashyizweho, hari hamaze kubaho amategeko atandukanye ivangura rikorerwa abantu bafite ubumuga mu mategeko ya leta zitandukanye, rimwe murayo mategeko akaba yaranakomokaga mu ntangiriro za 1980s.Leta zose n'intara zose usibye Tasmania and the Northern Territory zari zifite amategeko arwanya ivangura, naho izo ebyiri ziri gutekereza ku gudhyiraho ayo mategeko. hatanzwe impamvu eshatu zatumye hashyirwaho itegeko rya leta Nkuru:\nUmurage.\nMu 2004, ibyavuye mu iperereza rya komisiyo ishinzwe gutanga umusaruro ku itegeko ryashyizwe ahagaragara. Komisiyo yasanze mu gihe hakiri byinshi byo kunonosora, cyane cyane mu kugabanya ivangura mu kazi, muri rusange iryo tegeko ryagize akamaro gakomeye.\nByongeye kandi, Komisiyo yasanze ababana n'ubumuga bagifite amahirwe make ugereranije n\u2019abandi bantu barangiza amashuri, bafite impamyabumenyi ya TAFE cyangwa kaminuza, kandi bagahabwa akazi. Bishoboka cyane ko binjiza amafaranga ari munsi yikigereranyo cyangwa ajyanye nibyo baba bakoze, kuba kuri pansiyo, kuba mumazu rusange no muri gereza. Impuzandengo yinjiza ku bantu bafite ubumuga ni 44 ku ijana yinjiza abandi Banyaustraliya.\nKomite ya Olempike ya Maguire na Sydney.\nUru rubanza rwazanywe na Bruce Maguire, rwerekeye urubuga rw\u2019imikino Olempike ya Sydney 2000, ndetse n\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona byabafasha gukoresha neza urubuga."}
{"id": "20897", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20897", "title": "Easy Chirp", "text": "Easy Chirp nigice cya gatatu cyurubuga rushingiye kuri Twitter rwubatswe na Dennis Lembree. Ni urubuga rushobora kugera kuri porogaramu, bivuze ko rutezimbere kubakoresha ubumuga n\u2019abakoresha ikoranabuhanga rifasha. Chirp yoroshye nayo ifite akamaro kubafite tekinoroji yo hasi-nka Internet Explorer 9, umurongo wa interineti uhuza imbuga ndetse numurongo, no kubura inkunga ya JavaScript. Imigaragarire yoroshye nibyiza kubakoresha neza nibindi bishya kurumbuga nkoranyambaga, harimo na Twitter. Uru rubuga rwagaragaye bwa mbere mu ntangiriro za 2009, rwiswe Accessible Twitter, ruhindurwa izina ryitwa Chirp muri Kamena 2011. Hagati muri 2013, urubuga rwahagaritswe kubera amezi agera kuri atanu kubera ivugurura rikomeye ry\u2019ubuhanga. Urubuga rwakozwe numuntu ku giti cye wateguye urubuga nawe ukora blog kubyerekeranye nurubuga rwitwa Web Ax.\nKimwe mu bishya bya Chirp yoroshye mu gukoreshywa ubushobozi bwo kohereza tweet ihuza ishusho hamwe nibindi bisobanuro byombi bigufi kandi birebire. Nibwo bwa mbere porogaramu ya Twitter (kimwe na porogaramu imbuga nkoranyambaga) itanga ubundi buryo bwo gushushanya kuko usanga aribwo buryo byateye imbere cyane muri iki gihe, kubura ubundi buryo bwo gufata amashusho byari ikibazo cyo kugera kuri Twitter no ku mbuga nkoranyambaga muri rusange.\nEasy Chirp yahawe igihembo cy'umuyobozi wa FCC 2014 kubera iterambere iyi sisitemu imaze kugeraho, igihembo cya AFB cyo mu mwaka wa 2010 ndetse na 2009 IT IT @ web2.0. Urubuga rwatoranijwe \"Gukoresha API Nziza\" mu kinyamakuru.net cyo mu 2010 cyiza kurusha ibindi ku rubuga rwa interineti kandi gitangwa mu bihembo bya Blind Bargains Access Awards 2009 na 2010. nayo yari urubuga rwa RNIB rwagaragaye mu Kuboza 2011.\nKubera ikibazo cyimpinduka zikomeye za Twitter API muri 2018, igice cyohererezanya ubutumwa muri Chirp yoroshye gifite imikorere mike cyane."}
{"id": "20898", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20898", "title": "Mat", "text": "Mobility mat (izwi kandi nka mobi-mat) ni igikoresho cy\u2019ubufasha kigenewe abantu bakoresha amagare, kibemerera kugera ku nkengero z\u2019inyanja zifite umucanga, imihanda y\u2019ubutaka, cyangwa izindi nzira zishobora kugorana ku bantu bafite ubushobozi buke bwo kugenda, nko ku gitaramo cy\u2019imbaho cyegeranye n\u2019inyanja cyangwa ku nzira yuzuye ibice by\u2019imbaho.\nMobi-mats zakoreshwa muri Ostraliya ziba zifite ubugari bwa metero 1.5 kandi zishobora kugera ku burebure bwa metero 50.\" Iyi tekinoloji yita ku bantu bose ni mat yirinda gusibangana, rimwe na rimwe ifite imirongo cyangwa ibyuzuye, itanga umudendezo ku bantu bose bakoresheje amagare cyangwa ibinyabiziga byoroheje, harimo ababyeyi bafite strollers cyangwa wagons, ndetse n\u2019abantu bakoresha walkers. Ahanini mobility mats z\u2019inkengero z\u2019inyanja ntizigerera ku mazi kugira ngo zirinde kwangirika n\u2019amariba y\u2019inyanja, ariko zituma inkengero z\u2019inyanja zibasha kugerwaho n\u2019abakoresha amagare cyane kurusha uko byari bisanzwe. Bimwe mu sisteme z\u2019imyidagaduro ku nkengero z\u2019inyanja bishobora gutanga amagare yihariye yo ku mucanga abakoresha bashobora gukodesha umunsi umwe.\nAya mats ni yoroshye gutwara kandi ashobora kwimurirwa ahandi. Inkengero z\u2019inyanja nyinshi muri Florida na Californiya zimaze kuyashyiraho; amakuru ku kuboneka kwazo akwiye kugaragazwa ku mbuga za interineti z\u2019inkengero z\u2019inyanja cyangwa akajyanwa mu makuru aboneka kuri telefoni."}
{"id": "20899", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20899", "title": "Urwego rwo gupima imitsi ikomeye", "text": "Urwego rwa Modified Ashworth (MAS) rupima ubukana bw\u2019imitsi igihe ishyirwa mu myanya irambuye kandi rukaba rukoreshwa nk\u2019igipimo cyoroshye cya spastitike. Uko amanota atangwa (Bohannon na Smith, 1987):\n 2 Bohannon RW na Smith MB; 1987: Ubuvuzi bw'umubiri, 67 (2), 206\u2013207"}
{"id": "20900", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20900", "title": "Inzu Ndangamurage y\u2019Amahirwe", "text": "Inzu Ndangamurage y\u2019Amahirwe(Museum of Possibilities) ni inzu ndangamurage y\u2019abafite ubumuga iherereye i Chennai, Tamil Nadu. Ni igikorwa cyashinzwe na Minisiteri ishinzwe imibereho myiza y\u2019abantu bafite ubumuga ya Leta ya Tamil Nadu. Igaragaza ibikoresho byorohereza abantu bafite ubumuga, tekinoloji z\u2019ubufasha, ndetse n\u2019urugo rw\u2019urugero rwubatswe ku buryo bworohereza abantu bose kugera ku bice byarwo."}
{"id": "20901", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20901", "title": "Igihembo cy\u2019Igihugu cyo Guteza Imbere Abantu bafite Ubumuga", "text": "Igihembo cy\u2019Igihugu cyo Guteza Imbere Abantu bafite Ubumuga ni igihembo gihabwa abantu bafite ubumuga mu Buhinde, kandi gifatwa nk\u2019igihembo cy\u2019ingenzi cyane muri icyo cyiciro mu gihugu. Yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 1969, kandi ikaba iyoborwa na Minisiteri y\u2019Ubutabera n\u2019Iterambere ry\u2019Imibereho Myiza y\u2019Abaturage ya Leta y\u2019Ubuhinde. "}
{"id": "20902", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20902", "title": "Amashuri y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Abagore bafite Ubumuga", "text": "Umushinga w\u2019Igihugu wo Kuringaniza Amahirwe mu Burezi ku Bagore bafite Ubumuga washinzwe na Corbett O'Toole i Berkeley, muri Californiya, mu mwaka wa 1980. Byari umushinga w\u2019imyaka itatu wo gukora ubushakashatsi no kugaragaza ibyavuye mu bushakashatsi. Hashingiwe ku Ikigega cyo Kwigisha no Kurengera Uburenganzira bw\u2019Abafite Ubumuga (DREDF), Umushinga w\u2019Igihugu wo Kuringaniza Amahirwe mu Burezi ku Bagore bafite Ubumuga wakoze ubushakashatsi bwa mbere ku rwego rw\u2019igihugu ku bijyanye n\u2019ubumuga n\u2019imibereho y\u2019abagore. Yanakoze kandi Inama ya Mbere ku Rwego rw\u2019Igihugu ku Kuringaniza Amahirwe mu Burezi ku Bagore bafite Ubumuga, yabereye i Bethesda, Maryland. Yateje imbere kandi ibikoresho byanditse bigenewe abarimu n\u2019abajyanama, bijyanye n\u2019ibikenewe by\u2019abagore n\u2019abakobwa bafite ubumuga. \"Y\"anakoze kandi igitabo kivuga ku bahangayikishije abandi (role models) ku bakobwa bakiri bato bafite ubumuga cyitwa \"No More Stares.\" "}
{"id": "20903", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20903", "title": "Laboratwari y'ubuhanzi n'ubugeni ku Bafite Ubumuga", "text": "Open Style Lab (OSL) ni umuryango udaharanira inyungu watangijwe mu 2014, ku ikubitiro nk'umushinga wa serivisi rusange mu kigo cy'ikoranabuhanga cya Massachusetts. Umuyobozi mukuru n\u2019Umuyobozi w\u2019inama y\u2019ubutegetsi bw\u2019iri shyirahamwe ritagamije inyungu ni Grace Jun. Iri shyirahamwe rigena kandi rikora imyenda n\u2019ibicuruzwa byihariye byo gufasha abantu bafite ubumuga, bikorwamo hamwe n\u2019abantu bafite ubumuga ndetse kubagenewe. Iri tsinda ritumira abanyabugeni, abahanga mu by\u2019ikoranabuhanga (engineers), n\u2019abajyanama b\u2019imirimo (occupational therapists) baturutse impande zose z\u2019isi, kugira ngo bakorane mu gukemura ikibazo cy\u2019ukuri hifashishijwe imyenda yihariye yo gufasha abantu bafite ubumuga. Uwo mushinga wasubiwemo muri MIT International Design Centre ndetse no mu ishuri rya Parsons School of Design ku Ishuri Rishya. \nBuri mpeshyi, iri tsinda ryegeranya amakipe y\u2019abantu bafite ubumenyi butandukanye harimo abanyabugeni, abahanga mu by\u2019ikoranabuhanga, n\u2019abajyanama b\u2019imirimo, bakajyanwa hamwe n\u2019umukiriya ufite ubumuga. Amakipe aba afite icyumweru 10 cyo gukora ubushakashatsi, gushushanya no guteza imbere igisubizo cyo gufasha uwo mukiriya. Iri tsinda ryakoranye n\u2019abantu bafite ibikomere ku mitsi y\u2019inyuma (spinal cord injuries) n\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo mu bwonko (cognitive disability) mu gukora imishinga yabo, nk\u2019ibikoresho byihariye byo kudoda."}
{"id": "20904", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20904", "title": "Itegeko Nshingiro rya Paralympic", "text": "Itegeko Nshingiro rya Paralympic ni izina ryahawe urutonde rw\u2019amategeko n\u2019amabwiriza agenga imikorere y'imikino y'abamugaye. Rishyiraho Itegeko Nshingiro rya Komite Mpuzamahanga ya Paralympic n\u2019abandi bagize umuryango wa Paralympic, harimo komite za Paralympic z\u2019ibihugu n\u2019izindi nzego z\u2019imikino.\nItegeko Nshingiro rya Paralympic rihuye kandi rikurikira Itegeko Nshingiro rya Olympic.\nAbasesenguzi b\u2019iby\u2019ubumenyi bw\u2019imikino bagaragaje ko intego z\u2019umuryango wa Paralympic zigaragazwa mu Itegeko Nshingiro n\u2019ibindi nyandiko z\u2019ingenzi ari \u201czitomoye\u201d kandi zidahwitse neza nk\u2019uko byifuzwa ugereranyije n\u2019Itegeko Nshingiro rya Olympic. "}
{"id": "20905", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20905", "title": "Abamugaye mu ntambara yo kurwanya amategeko y'Abanazi", "text": "Abamugaye mu ntambara yo kurwanya amategeko y'Abanazi ni itegeko rya Isiraheli, ritanga ubufasha ku Bisirayeli barwanye mu ngabo z\u2019ibihugu byari mu muryango w\u2019abafatanyije cyangwa mu mashami y\u2019abarwanyi b\u2019abaharanira ubwigenge (partisan units) mu gihe cy\u2019Intambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose, kandi bafite ubumuga bw\u2019umubiri cyangwa bwo mu mutwe bwatewe n\u2019iyo ntambara. Byongeye, iri tegeko ritanga uburenganzira ku bashakanye basigaye ku bafashijwe, ku gihe gito cyangwa kugeza bashatse undi mugabo cyangwa umugore, bitewe n\u2019uburemere bw\u2019ubumuga bwemejwe ku mufashijwe wa mbere mbere y\u2019urupfu rwe. \nIri tegeko ryaje inyuma y\u2019akazi k\u2019ubukangurambaga bw\u2019amatsinda y\u2019abasirikare b\u2019intambara ya kabiri y\u2019isi, rikemezwa na Knesset mu mwaka wa 1954. Ariko, iri tegeko ntiritanga abasirikare ba Intambara ya Kabiri y\u2019Isi yose inyungu zingana n\u2019iza basirikare bamaze igihe mu ngabo z\u2019Igihugu cya Isiraheli. Inyungu zishingiye kuri iri tegeko zitangwa n\u2019Ikigo cy\u2019Imari, ntizitangwa na Minisiteri y\u2019Ingabo."}
{"id": "20906", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20906", "title": "Robert Perske", "text": "Robert Perske (1927 \u2013 14 kanama 2016) yari umwanditsi w\u2019Amerika, umuhanga mu by\u2019idini (theologian), ndetse n\u2019umurwanashyaka w\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga.\nYaharaniraga by\u2019umwihariko abantu bafite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe bashinjwe ibyaha batakoze. Yatekereje kandi igitekerezo cy\u2019agaciro ko gufata ibyago. Nk\u2019umupasiteri w\u2019umuryango wa Methodist, ibyo yanditse byagize uruhare rukomeye mu guhindura uburyo abantu bafite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe bitabwaho mu matorero n\u2019imiryango y\u2019idini. Igikorwa cye cyamamaye cyane, \"Deadly Innocence?\", gikurikirana inkuru ya Joe Arridy, \"wamenyekanye nka Umuntu Ushimishwa cyane ku ntebe y\u2019urupfu.\""}
{"id": "20907", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20907", "title": "Ishuri rya Patiala ry'abatabona", "text": "Ishuri rya Patiala ry'abatabona nishuri ryihariye ry'abana babana n'ubumuga bwo kutabona Patiala wa Panjab. \"Sosiyete ishinzwe imibereho y\u2019abafite ubumuga\" society for welfare kubabana nubwo bumuga1967. \nIshuri ntiryishyura abanyeshuri n'abakozi baherekeje abana kuva mu mashuri abanza kugeza mu mwaka wa 12. Iyi ishuri hamwe n'ishuri ry'abaragi rya Patiala hamwe bafite abana 200 barimo 140 bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva na 60 bafite ubumuga. Inzu y'amacumbi nayo itangwa ku buntu kandi muri iki gihe, abanyeshuri 180 baraye muri iryo cumbi. Nanone kandi, iryo shuri ritanga imyenda, ibikoresho byo kwandika, amafunguro n'ibindi bintu ntakiguzi"}
{"id": "20908", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20908", "title": "AMI-audio", "text": "AMI-amajwi ni serivisi yo gusoma radio yo muri Canada ikorwa na Accessible Media Inc. (AMI). Iyi serivisi yatangijwe mu mwaka 1990 nka VoicePrint, iyi serivisi igira gahunda zirimo gusoma ingingo ziva mu binyamakuru byandika ku nyungu z'abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona cyangwa batazi gusoma. Serivisi kandi igira AMI yakozwe ivuga ijambo porogaramu rivuga ku ngingo zijyanye n'ubumuga no kugerwaho.\nAMI-audio yemerewe na komisiyo ishinzwe amaradiyo na televiziyo yo muri Canada (CRTC) nka serivisi igomba gutangwa mu bushishozi; igomba gukoreshwa ku rwego rwo hasi rwa serivisi yemewe, televiziyo ya satelite, hamwe n'abatanga IPTV muri Canada. Serivise kandi itangwa binyuze muri serivise ya AMI +, hamwe na porogaramu imwe iboneka nka podcasts.\nIyi serivisi yatangijwe bwa mbere mu mwaka wa 1990 nka VoicePrint, nka serivisi y\u2019ikigo kidaharanira inyungu cyo gusoma no kwandika (NBRS). CRTC yabemereye nka serivisi \"igomba gutangira\" mu 2001, bivuze ko insinga zose nshya zijyanye n'igihe hamwe n'abatanga ibyogajuru bagomba gutanga serivisi. Porogaramu yayo nayo itangwa na AMI ya sisitemu nshya, harimo na serivise ya AMI +. "}
{"id": "20909", "revid": "12942", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20909", "title": "Nana technology", "text": "\"Nana\" Technology ni akuma kikoranabuhanga kateguwe, kagenewe, cyangwa gashobora gukoreshwa mu kuzamura imibereho y'abantu bakuru.\nIjambo gukina kubijyanye na siyansi yubumenyi bwa nanotechnology, \"Nana\" ikoranabuhanga ryerekeza ku kwerekana ikoranabuhanga kuri nyirakuru w'umuntu, cyangwa \"Nana\". Carle niwe muntu wa mbere wateje imbere ikoreshwa ryiyi nteruro hamwe nubusobanuro busanzwe, kandi umwe yibanze gusa kuri tekinoroji ya kuma kikoranabuhanga, hamwe nigisubizo cyo kwita izina igice gishya kandi gitandukanye cyinganda zikoranabuhanga. Ijambo rya Carle hamwe n\u2019ibisabwa byihariye byatangajwe bwa mbere mu gihugu mu kiganiro cyihariye muri Amerika kuri uyumunsi ku itariki ya 9 Kanama 2006. Kuva icyo gihe manda ya Carle na / cyangwa ibisobanuro byatangajwe, bisubirwamo, cyangwa byagaragaye mu bitangazamakuru byinshi ku isi harimo ariko ntibigarukira gusa: CNN, CNBC, Amakuru ya CBS, Amakuru ya Fox, PBS, NPR, Forbes, Amafaranga y\u2019ubwenge, BBC, Agence France-Presse, KYODO amakuru ya serivisi, na ikinyamakuru cya Australian, ndetse nibindi.\nKuva yasobanura urwego, Carle yabaye umwe m'ubajyanama bibigo byinshi byifuza guteza imbere ikoranabuhanga kubantu bakuze, barimo APPLE, Nintendo, Vigorous Mind, na GTX Corporation. Hamwe na GTX, yafashije guteza imbere inkweto ya mbere ya GPS kubantu barwaye Alzheimer ndetse no guta umutwe, bashobora kuba bafite ibyago byo kuzerera no kuzimira. Mu mwaka wa 2012, iryo koranabuhanga ryamenyekanye nk'imwe mu \"Ibintu 100 by'ingenzi byavumbuwe n'abantu\" n'Ingoro Ndangamurage y'Ubumenyi n'Ikoranabuhanga i Stockholm, muri Suwede. \nUsibye ijambo n'ibisobanuro, Carle yatangaje ibyiciro umunani kugeza ubu kubijyanye n'ikoranabuhanga rya \"Nana\", kandi bijyanye nibice bifitanye isano cyane nabantu barengeje imyaka 65:\nUbuzima n\u2019ubuzima bwiza: Harimo ikoranabuhanga nkiryo gucunga imiti, gukurikirana ibimenyetso byingenzi, cyangwa kuvura indwara zisanzwe zireba abantu bakuru.\nUmutekano: Harimo ikoranabuhanga ryo gukumira kugwa, gukurikirana cyangwa gusaba ubufasha bwihutirwa, cyangwa gukurikirana cyangwa gukumira inzererezi mubantu bafite ikibazo cyo guta umutwe Alzheimer.\nKumenya: Harimo ikoranabuhanga rigamije kunoza imikorere yubwenge muri rusange nkuko ryangijwe no gusaza bisanzwe, ubumuga bworoshye bwubwenge (MCI), cyangwa guta umutwe.\nItumanaho: Harimo ikoranabuhanga ryemerera abantu bakuze gutumanaho hakoreshejwe itumanaho ngendanwa, interineti, amashusho, cyangwa ubundi buryo bwitumanaho.\nIbyiyumvo: Harimo ikoranabuhanga rifasha abantu bakuze kugabanuka cyangwa gutakaza amaso, kumva, uburyohe, gukoraho, cyangwa umunuko.\nKwimuka: Harimo ikoranabuhanga rifasha abantu bakuze muri gahunda yo kwinjira no gusohoka, gutwarwa, cyangwa gutwara."}
{"id": "20910", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20910", "title": "Cartilage conduction", "text": "Imiyoboro ya Cartilage ninzira yerekana ibimenyetso byijwi byumvikana mumatwi yimbere. Mu 2004, Hiroshi Hosoi (Nara Medical University) yavumbuye iyi nzira ayita igikucangwa\u201d. Kumva ukoresheje imiyoboro y'igikucangwa itandukanye ninzira zisanzwe zitwara amajwi, nk'umwuka cyangwa amagufwa, kuko bigerwaho no gukora umuyoboro ku igikucangwa no kumva kandi ntabwo birimo kunyeganyega kw'amagufwa ya gihanga. Kubwibyo, imiyoboro ya karitsiye yitwa \"inzira ya gatatu yo kumva\".\nKuva mu myaka igera hafi kuri 450 ishize, inzira ebyiri zemerewe kohereza amajwi mu gutwi imbere: gutwara umwuka no gutwara amagufwa. Mu 2004, Hiroshi Hosoi, icyo gihe wari umwarimu muri kaminuza y\u2019ubuvuzi ya Nara (ubu akaba na perezida wacyo), yavumbuye ikintu cyo kumva akoresheje urusaku rw\u2019amatwi y\u2019inyuma. Muguhuza vibura no kumva, wasangaga ijwi ryanduzwa mumatwi yimbere. Yasabye igitekerezo cy'igitabo kivuga ko karitsiye ifite umutungo wihariye utuma ishobora kohereza amajwi. yiswe imiyoboro ya karitsiye. Kuva mu Kuboza 2022, impapuro 32 z\u2019amasomo zasohotse kuri iyi ngingo mu binyamakuru mpuzamahanga bya siyansi. Byongeye kandi, ibyuma bifata amajwi ya karitsiye, na terefone ngendanwa hamwe nogukusanya amajwi biri ku isoko kuva 2017, 2022 na 2023.\nUrwego rwo kwumva rugizwe n'ugutwi, hagati, n'imbere (cochlea). Ugutwi kwinyuma kugizwe na pinna kwumva hanze. Pinna ikozwe na karitsiye. Igice cyimbere ninyuma cyumuyoboro wunva winyuma ukorwa na karitsiye hamwe namagufwa. cya karitsiye hamwe nigice cyamagufwa bishobora gutandukanywa nigitutu cyoroheje nintoki. Iyo imiyoboro ishyizwe mugice cya karitsiye, ijwi rishobora kumvikana hifashishijwe imiyoboro ya karitsiye. Umwanya ukwiye wo guhuza neza ibyo bice kugirango ukorwe neza ni karitsiye ikikije ubwinjiriro bwumuyoboro wumva wo hanze, mugihe ibice biri kure yubwinjiriro (urugero, crus helicis) ntibishobora kugira uruhare runini mugutwara karitsiye."}
