{"id": "20912", "revid": "12942", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20912", "title": "IListen", "text": "iListen, yakozwe na MacSpeech, ni gahunda yo kumenyekanisha imvugo kuri Apple Macintosh. Mu mwaka wa 2006, iListen nicyo gice cya gatatu cya software yonyine- yemerewe kwinjiza inyandiko ukoresheje ijwi ryumuntu ukora kuri moderi nshya ya Macintosh. Abanywanyi bayo bari porogaramu yo kumenyekanisha imvugo ya Apple (yubatswe muri Mac OS X); Ikiyoka Mubisanzwe Tuvuze na Nuance, ikora munsi ya software ya Windows nka Parallels desktop ya Mac cyangwa VMware Fusion ; na gahunda yo guhagarika imvugo ya ViaVoice na Nuance / IBM."}
{"id": "20913", "revid": "12942", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20913", "title": "Imitext", "text": "Imitext ni bitmap subtitle yohereza uburyo bwihariye kuri sisitemu yo guhindura ibintu muburyo bwa mashusho cyangwa se ekara. Ikoranabuhanga ryahawe uruhushya rwa Scientific Atlanta kugirango rwinjizwe muri kodegisi ya PowerVu na decoders."}
{"id": "20914", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20914", "title": "Universal remote", "text": "A universal remote ni igenzura rya kure rishobora gutegurwa gukora ibirango bitandukanye by'ubwoko bumwe cyangwa bwinshi bw'ibikoresho bya elegitoroniki. Hafi yisi-ya kure ya kure irashobora kugenzura gusa umubare w'ibikoresho byagenwe nuwabikoze, mugihe hagati na-yohejuru-ya kure yisi yose yemerera uyikoresha progaramu muri code nshya igenzura kure. Remote nyinshi zagurishijwe hamwe na elegitoroniki zitandukanye zirimo ubushobozi bwa kure bw'ubushobozi bw'ubundi bwoko bw'ibikoresho, butuma igenzura ya Kure igenzura ibindi bikoresho birenze igikoresho yazanye. urugero: VCR ya kure irashobora gutegurwa kugirango ikore ibirango bitandukanye bya tereviziyo.\nAmateka.\nKu ya 30 Gicurasi 1985, Philips yerekanye icyambere cya kure (US Pat. # 4774511) ku izina rya Magnavox. Mu 1985, Robin Rumbolt, William \"Russ\" McIntyre, na Larry Goodson hamwe na Electronics Consumer Electronics yo muri Amerika y'Amajyaruguru (Magnavox, Sylvania, na Philco) bakoze uburyo bwa mbere bwo kugenzura kure.\nMu 1987, hasohotse porogaramu ya mbere ishobora gutegurwa ku isi hose. Yiswe \"CORE\" kandi yakozwe na CL 9, itangira ryashinzwe na Steve Wozniak, wavumbuye mudasobwa ya Apple I na Apple II. \nMuri Werurwe 1987, Steve Ciarcia yasohoye inkuru mu kinyamakuru cya Byte yise \"Wubake Trainable Infrared Master Controller\", gusobanura remote rusange ishobora kohereza cyangwa gukoporora imyanya yayo(settings) kuri mudasobwa, iki gikoresho cyari gifite ubushobozi bwa macro (bushobora gukora ibikorwa byinshi icyarimwe). \nImiterere n'ibiranga.\nHafi ya kure y'isi yose isangira umubare wibanze shusho w'ibiyigize:\nBimwe mubigabanijwe cyane nka TV-B-Gone cyangwa urufunguzo rungana kure rurimo buto nkeya gusa, nk'imbaraga n'umuyoboro/abatoranya amajwi.\nHejuru-ya kure ya ifite ibindi bintu byinshi biranga:\nKuzamurwa no kwiga kure.\nHafi ya kure kwisi yose yemerera kode urutonde rwateguwe muri kure kugirango ivugururwe kugirango ishyigikire ibirango bishya cyangwa moderi yibikoresho bidashyigikiwe na kure. Bimwe murwego rwohejuru rwo kwiga kwisi kure bisaba mudasobwa guhuzwa. Ihuza risanzwe rikorwa binyuze muri USB kuva kuri mudasobwa kugeza mini-USB kuri kure cyangwa sitasiyo ya kure. \nMu 2000, itsinda ryabakunzi bavumbuye ko kure yisi yose yakozwe na UEI ikagurishwa munsi ya One For All, RadioShack, nibindi bicuruzwa bishobora kongera gusubirwamo hifashishijwe interineti yitwa JP1.\nIR yiga kure irashobora kwiga kode ya buto iyariyo yose kuri IR igenzura kure. Iyi mikorere ituma kure yiga imikorere idashyigikiwe n'ibisanzwe k'ibikoresho runaka, bigatuma rimwe na rimwe bishoboka kugenzura ibikoresho iyo kure itari yabugenewe kugenzura. Ingaruka yubu buryo nuko kwigira kure bikenera kwigisha kure. Na none, ibikoresho bimwe by'imyidagaduro abakora ibikoresho bakoresha pulse y'umurongo urenze ibyo kwigira kure bishobora gutahura no kubika m'urwibutso.\nGukoraho-ecran ya kure.\nIzi kure zigaragaza ecran ya LCD ishobora kuba monochrome cyangwa ibara ryuzuye. \"Utubuto\" mubyukuri ni amashusho kuri ecran, iyo, iyo akozeho, azohereza ibimenyetso bya IR kubikoresho bigenzurwa. Moderi zimwe zifite ecran nyinshi zigerwaho binyuze muri buto yububiko kuri ecran-ecran naho izindi moderi zifite ihuriro rya touch-ecran na buto yumubiri.\nModeri zimwe zo gukoraho-ecran ya kure yateguwe hifashishijwe porogaramu ishushanya kuri PC, ituma uyikoresha ashobora guhitamo ecran, imiterere, buto ndetse na \"ibikorwa\" buto ikora. \"Umushinga\" wakozwe noneho ukururwa muri kure ukoresheje umugozi wa USB cyangwa, muburyo bwa vuba, bidasubirwaho na Bluetooth cyangwa Wi-Fi.\nBimwe mubikoraho-ecran ya kure, nka Logitech Harmony 900 na 1100, harimo imiyoboro ya RF kugirango yemere ibimenyetso kugera ahantu kure cyane kurenza intera isanzwe ya IR (hafi metero 6). RF nayo ntisaba umurongo wo kureba. Moderi zimwe, nka Ray Super Remote, zitanga ibyifuzo byibirimo. \nSmartphone na tablet kure ya bose.\nAmaterefone na tableti nkibikoresha Maemo ya Nokia (N900), iOS ya Apple hamwe na sisitemu y'imikorere ya Google ya Google nayo irashobora gukoreshwa nkigenzura rya kure.\nIbikoresho byinshi byabacuruzi nka Samsung, LG na Nokia birimo icyambu cyubatswe muri IR gishobora gukoreshwa nka kure, mugihe ibindi bisaba kwomeka kumubiri, cyangwa 'dongle', bihuzwa na terefone mugihe bikoreshwa nka kure. Dongle isabwa guhindura ibimenyetso byo kugenzura amashanyarazi kuva kuri terefone m'ibimenyetso bitukura bya infra bisabwa n'ibikoresho byinshi byo m'urugo byerekana amashusho kugirango bigenzurwe kure. Icyakora birashoboka kandi gushyira m'ibikorwa sisitemu idasaba dongle. Sisitemu nk'iyi ikoresha ibyuma byihagararaho byonyine byitwa 'irembo', ryakira ibimenyetso byo kugenzura amashanyarazi kuva kuri terefone m'uburyo bwa Bluetooth cyangwa wi-fi hanyuma ikohereza muburyo bwa infra red itukura kugeza ibice bigomba kugenzurwa."}
{"id": "20915", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20915", "title": "MEISTeR", "text": "Ibikoresho byo kubungabunga ibikoresho bya sisitemu ya robot ya Telecontrol (MEISTeR) ni robot yakozwe na Mitsubishi Heavy Industries (MHI). kugirango ifashe mu bikorwa byo gusana no gukora mu buryo bw'ikoranabuhanga. Yakozwe by'umwihariko kugirango ikorere ahangiritse cyane cyane mu ruganda rw'ingufu za nyukiliyeli rwa Fukushima Daiichi.\nYashyizwe hanze ku italiki ya 6 Ukuboza 2012. \nAmateka.\nNyuma y\u2019umutingito 9.0 na tsunami yakurikiyeho yibasiye Ubuyapani ku ya 11 Werurwe 2011, ndetse n\u2019irimbuka ry\u2019uruganda rukora ingufu za kirimbuzi Fukushima Daiichi, inganda zakomeje gushakisha guha robot zishobora gukora imirimo iteje akaga ku rugomero rw\u2019amashanyarazi. Kimwe muri ibyo bisubizo ni HAL exoskeleton. Ariko, HAL exoskeleton yasabye umuderevu wumuntu. Ku ya 23 Ugushyingo 2012, Toshiba yerekanye Tetrapod yananiwe kwerekana. \nKugeza vuba aha, MHI yari yakoze gusa robot yo gutumanaho murugo hamwe na robot ya MARS-D. Nkumwubatsi w\u2019inganda 20 za kirimbuzi mu Buyapani, byari ibisanzwe ko Mitsubishi Heavy Industries yakemura ikibazo hamwe na robot yabo bwite. \nIgishushanyo.\nMEISTeR (Ikidage kuri shobuja) ni robot ifite intwaro ebyiri zikurikirana. Ishingiye kuri robot ya Rabot na robot igerageza MARS-D, yakozwe nk'umugenzuzi w'inganda za kirimbuzi. Ihagaze, ni ubugari, ndende, n'uburemere muri. Amaboko ya robo afite impamyabumenyi zirindwi (= amashoka arindwi) nkukuboko kwabantu kandi irashobora kuzamura buri umwe. Bitandukanye na robot ya MARS-D MEISTeR irakomeye bihagije kugirango ihangane nibidukikije. Imashini igenzurwa na kure irashobora kwifashisha ibikoresho bitandukanye mumaboko yayo nko gukata no gukora imyitozo, inzitizi zisobanutse, no gucengera muri beto kugirango urebe urwego rw'imirase. Hakozwe igikoresho kidasanzwe gishobora gufata ingero ziva ku nkuta no hasi ahantu hahumanye hamwe n'uburebure bugera kuri. Ishobora kwimuka gushika kuri no kuganira k'ubutaka butaringaniye, harimo nintambwe zigera kuri kuri buri bigega bine byayo byigenga. Ifite igihe giteganijwe cyo gukora amasaha abiri."}
{"id": "20916", "revid": "10947", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20916", "title": "Lightwriter", "text": "Lightwriters ni ubwoko bwibikoresho bitanga imvugo. Umwanditsi ntashobora kuvuga ubwoko bw'ubutumwa ari kwandikira kuri clavier, kandi ubu butumwa bwerekanwa kumyerekano ibiri, imwe ireba uyikoresha naho iyerekanwa rya kabiri ryerekana abafatanyabikorwa cyangwa abafatanyabikorwa. Imvugo synthesizer nayo ikoreshwa mugutanga imvugo isohoka, kandi moderi zimwe zitanga uburyo bwo guhuza printer kugirango itange ibisohoka byanditse.\nkubantu badashoboye gukoresha clavier, moderi zimwe za Lightwriter zitanga kuri ecran ya ecran ishobora gukoreshwa na switch ikoresheje tekinoroji yo gusikana, hamwe no guhanura ijambo kugirango ugabanye urufunguzo.\nTekinoroji ifite Moderi ya SL40 ikubiyemo terefone igendanwa yohererezanya ubutumwa bugufi no guhamagara muburyo bw'amajwi, aho imvugo ikomatanya yoherezwa ku bahamagaye, kandi ubutumwa bwinjira buvugwa mu ijwi riranguruye binyuze mu ndangururamajwi. \nUmwanditsi wa tekinoroji ya Lightwriter ikaba ihagarariye Abilia. Abanditsi b'amatara baraboneka mu ndimi zitandukanye zo mu Burayi.\nAmateka.\nMu mwaka wa 1969, Toby Churchill yakoraga mu Bufaransa iyaje kurwara mugihe yo koga mu kiyaga cyanduye. Abaganga babanje kwizera ko afite izuba kandi ko ibimenyetso bizashira bidatinze, ariko barumirwa kuko yatangiye kwangirika vuba maze bahitamo kumusubiza mu Bwongereza vuba bishoboka kugira ngo akomeze kwivuza, maze yimurirwa mu bitaro bya Addenbrookes i Cambridge aho abaganga batashoboraga kumenya niba ikibazo ari imitsi cyangwa imitsi, kandi ibikoresho byabo byo kwisuzumisha bikaba bike cyane kuko ibyo byari mbere y\u2019umunsi wa CT na MRI.\nAbakoresha.\nAbanditsi ba Lightwriter ni ibikoresho byimvugo bityo bisaba urwego runaka rwo gusoma.\nAbanditsi bakoresha uburyo bwa Lightwriter bukoreshwa n'abantu benshi bafite ikibazo cyo kutavuga bakurikira laryngectomy, tracheostomy, stroke, gukomeretsa mu mutwe, cyangwa n'indwara zifata ubwonko zigenda zitera indwara nka moteri ya neurone (izwi kandi nka amyotropic lateral sclerose cyangwa ALS), indwara ya Parkinson, sclerose nyinshi (MS) cyangwa koreya ya Huntington.\nAbanditsi bakoresha uburyo bwa Lightwriter bukoreshwa kandi nabantu bafite ikibazo cyo kutavuga bavukana bafite imiterere nkubumuga bwubwonko nyuma yo gusoma no kwandika.\nDiane Pretty yari umwongerezakazi wasuzumwe indwara ya Motor Neurone Disease wagerageje guhindura amategeko y\u2019Ubwongereza kugira ngo ashobore kurangiza ubuzima bwe abifashijwemo n\u2019umugabo we atiriwe ashyirwa mu rwego rwo kwiyahura, bikaba bitemewe mu Bwongereza. Pretty yagiye mu Ngoro y\u2019Abadepite no mu Rukiko rw\u2019Uburayi ku burenganzira bwa muntu akoresheje umwanditsi we kugira ngo aburane ikibazo cye, ariko birananirana. "}
{"id": "20917", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20917", "title": "Level Access", "text": "Level Access ni isosiyete igera kuri digitale ifite icyicaro i Arlington, muri Virijiniya. \nLevel Access ni gahunda itanga porogaramu y'ubucuruzi yo kugerageza urubuga no gukora imbuga za interineti zemewe kandi zujuje ubuzimagatozi, porogaramu zigendanwa, software, hamwe n'ubunararibonye bwa digitale. \nAmateka.\nLevel Access yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 1999 n'abashakashatsi bafite ubumuga. Gahunda ya mbere y'ubucuruzi kubyabaye Urwego rwo Kwinjira kwari ukubaka urubuga rw'urugendo rworoshye kugirango ababana n'ubumuga bashobore kujya kurubuga, bakabona amakuru ajyanye nibibuga byoroshye kandi bateganya ibiruhuko byoroshye. \nMuri Gashyantare 2018, Level Access rwabonye Simply Accessible, Inc., isosiyete ikora ibikoresho bya digitale ifite icyicaro i Ontario, muri Kanada. \nMuri Kanama 2022, Level Access rwarangije guhuza hamwe na eSSENTIAL Accessibility, intangiriro ya Accessibility-as-a-Service. \nMuri Mutarama 2024, Urwego Level Access rwabonye UserWay hafi miliyoni 99 z'amadolari nubwo hari impaka zishingiye ku kugerwaho. \nMark Zablan yagizwe umuyobozi mukuru wa Level Access mu Kwakira "}
{"id": "20918", "revid": "10947", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20918", "title": "ESpeak", "text": "eSpeak ni ubuntu kandi bufungura-isoko, kwambukiranya urubuga, guhuza, guhuza imvugo ya software. Ikoresha uburyo bwa synthesis ni sisitemu igufasha kandi mugusobanukirwa cyane mukunva kuko ikoranye indimi nyinshi mubunini bwa dosiye. eSpeakNG (Igisekuru kizaza) ni ugukomeza umushinga wambere wabatezimbere hamwe nibitekerezo byinshi byabavuga kavukire.\nKubera ubunini bwayo n'indimi nyinshi, eSpeakNG ishyirwa muri NVDA isomeka rya ecran ya ecran ya Windows, hamwe na Android, Ubuntu nibindi bikwirakwizwa na Linux. Ikibanjirije eSpeak cyasabwe na Microsoft mu 2016 kandi yakoreshejwe na Google Translate mu ndimi 27 mu 2010; 17 muri byo byaje gusimburwa nijwi ryihariye. \nUbwiza bw'amajwi asohoka muriyi sisitemu ya EspeakNG buratandukanye cyane. Muri eSpeakNG yabanjirije eSpeak, verisiyo yambere yindimi zimwe yari ishingiye kumakuru aboneka kuri Wikipedia. zagize akazi cyangwa ibitekerezo byatanzwe n'abavuga ururimi kavukire kurusha izindi. Benshi mubantu bafashije kunoza indimi zitandukanye ni impumyi zikoresha inyandiko-mvugo.\n1. Intambwe - inyandiko yo guhindura foneme.\nHariho indimi nyinshi (cyane cyane icyongereza) zidafite amategeko ataziguye kumuntu umwe hagati yo kwandika no kuvuga; kubwibyo, intambwe yambere mugisekuru-ku-gisekuru kigomba kuba inyandiko-kuri-foneme.\nIndimi.\neSpeakNG ikora synthesis-y-imvugo-indimi zikurikira: "}
{"id": "20919", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20919", "title": "Vibratese", "text": "Vibratese ni sisitemu yo guhererekanya amakuru ikoresheje ihinda(vibration). yakozwe na FA Geldard mu 1957, igizwe n'ibice bitanu inyeganyega byashyirwaga ku gituza. Buri vibrateri yifashishwaga mu kohereza ubutumwa bwihariye, kandi ishobora gufasha abantu batumva cyangwa batabona neza.\nVibratese yatekerejwe nk'uburyo bushoboka bwo kohereza amakuru y'iperereza ku ngabo ziri ahantu habi cyangwa mu bihe bigoye. Nubwo mu nyandiko ya mbere ya Gerard bitavuzwemo cyane, byumvikanye ko iyi sisitemu ishobora no gufasha abantu batumva cyangwa abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona neza \u200b\u200b \nGeldard yerekanye ibipimo bitatu byoroheje bishobora gutahurwa byoroshye kandi byihuse numusemuzi: igihe bimara, ubukana, n'ahantu. Morse code ni urugero rwa sisitemu yo kwumva itanga amakuru yahinduwe n'igihe cyonyine, kandi irashobora gukoreshwa mu bikoresho by'ububiko. Geldard yasanze gukoresha ibyo bipimo byose, aho kuba kimwe gusa, byemewe ku ibiciro byohereza amakuru menshi. Ibikoresho byinshi byagenwe byagaragaye bishoboka, harimo ingingo zirindwi, ariko bitanu byafashwe nkibihagije. Geldard yemeje ko ibihe bitatu byerekana ibimenyetso (100 ms, 300 ms, 500 ms), hamwe n\u2019uburemere butatu bwo kunyeganyega kuri vibrateri yari sisitemu ifatika, kandi yemerera ibimenyetso 45 gushyirwaho hakoreshejwe vibatori eshanu. Ibimenyetso byagiye bitandukana n'igihe cyashyizwe hagati ya ms 50 hamwe na 100 ms hagati y'amagambo. Ibi byatumaga bishoboka ko ubutumwa bwohererezwa ku muvuduko wa amagambo 67 ku munota mu buryo bw'inyigisho, ugereranyije na Morse code yo ifite hafi amagambo 30 ku munota. \nKugirango ngo hirindwe urujijo, buri nyajwi yahabwaga icyuma gihinda cyiharije. Kunoza umuvuduko, imibare yashizwe kubimenyetso birebire kandi inyuguti zisigaye zahawe ukurikije inshuro. Bimwe mu bimenyetso byagenewe amagambo asanzwe y'Icyongereza. \nIbibazo byinshi byagaragaye hamwe na sisitemu. Ingano y'igihe cy'amahugurwa isabwa yagaragaye nk'ikirenga. Byavuzwe ko amasomo 30, angana n\u2019amasaha, yasabwaga kwiga sisitemu. Byongeye kandi, kudasobanuka ku murongo muto wigihe gito byari ikibazo. Igisubizo cyatanzwe kwari ukongeramo igihe cyigihe, mugihe ugabanya ubukana. Byongeye kandi, Geldard yasabye ko hashobora kubaho sisitemu ikoresheje vibrateri yegeranye cyane ishobora kwanduza icyerekezo, nko gutunga urutoki, kuriyi ngingo. Sisitemu nkiyi irashobora gukoreshwa nkinyuguti ya Lorm."}
{"id": "20920", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20920", "title": "FreeTTS", "text": "FreeTTS ni sisitemu ifunguye imvugo synthesis sisitemu yakorewe ku rubuga rwa Java. Ishingiye kuri Flite. FreeTTS ni ishyirwa mubikorwa rya Sun 's Java Speech API.\nFreeTTS ni sisitemu ifata icyemezo cyanyuma mu gutuma ishyigikira byo kuvuga. Gnopernicus ikoresha ibi ahantu henshi: kumenya igihe inyandiko igomba kandi idakwiye guhagarikwa, kugirango imvugo ihuze neza, hamwe nijambo rikurikirana mumajwi atandukanye. Ibipimo byakozwe na Sun mu 2002 kuri Solaris byerekanaga ko FreeTTS yirutse inshuro ebyiri kugeza kuri eshatu kurusha Flite icyo gihe. \nAmateka.\nKuva muri Kamena 2019, verisiyo nshya yuwo mushinga yatangiriye muri Mata 2017. Iterambere rikomeye ryarangiye muri Werurwe 2009 hasohoka 1.2.2."}
{"id": "20921", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20921", "title": "Gnuspeech", "text": "Gnuspeech nigikoresho cyagutse cyanditse -kuri- porogaramu ya mudasobwa ikora porogaramu itanga imvugo yubukorikori ishingiye ku gihe nyacyo cyo kuvuga imvugo ikoresheje amategeko. Nukuvuga ko, ihindura imirongo yinyandiko mubisobanuro bya fonetike, ifashwa ninkoranyamagambo isobanura, inyuguti ku majwi amategeko, hamwe ninjyana nziza mumatwi cyane ko ifasha nabafite ubumuga bwo kutumva neza; ihindura ibisobanuro bya fonetike mubipimo byurwego rwo hasi rwo kuvuga imvugo synthesizer; ikoresha ibi kugirango utware moderi yerekana inzira yijwi ryumuntu itanga umusaruro ukwiranye nibikoresho bisanzwe bisohora amajwi bikoreshwa na sisitemu zitandukanye zikoresha mudasobwa; kandi ibikora ku kigero kimwe cyangwa cyihuse kuruta imvugo ivugwa kumvugo yabantu bakuru.\nuburyo Gnuspeech yakozwemo.\nSynthesizer ni tube resonance, cyangwa waveguide, icyitegererezo cyerekana imyitwarire yinzira nyayo yijwi ryeruye, kandi mu buryo bushyize mu gaciro, bitandukanye na synthesizeri ikora yerekana mu buryo butaziguye imvugo. Ikibazo cyo kugenzura gikemurwa hifashishijwe icyitegererezo cy\u2019akarere ka Ren\u00e9 Carr\u00e9 gifitanye isano n\u2019imihindagurikire ya radiyo y\u2019ibice umunani birebire by\u2019igice cy\u2019ijwi hamwe n\u2019impinduka zijyanye n\u2019imiterere itatu y\u2019imiterere mu mvugo itanga amakuru menshi y\u2019imvugo. Uturere na two, dushingiye ku bikorwa byakozwe na Laboratoire y\u2019ikoranabuhanga ya Stockholm y\u2019Ikigo cy\u2019Ikoranabuhanga cy\u2019Ikoranabuhanga (KTH) kuri \"isesengura rishingiye ku bwiyumvo\" - ni ukuvuga uburyo imirongo ikora iterwa n\u2019impinduka ntoya kuri radiyo y\u2019ijwi ahantu hatandukanye mu burebure bwayo. "}
{"id": "20922", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20922", "title": "List of Teletext Services", "text": "Teletext ni serivisi yo gushakisha amakuru kuri tereviziyo yatejwe imbere mu Bwongereza mu ntangiriro ya za 70. Itanga urutonde rwamakuru ashingiye kumyandiko, mubisanzwe harimo amakuru yigihugu, mpuzamahanga na siporo, ikirere na gahunda za TV. Ibisobanuro (cyangwa gufunga ibisobanuro) amakuru nayo yoherezwa mubimenyetso bya teletext, mubisanzwe kurupapuro 888 cyangwa 777.\nSerivisi zitari nke ziboneka kuri tereviziyo zatejwe imbere mu bindi bihugu, zimwe muri zo zagerageje gukemura imbogamizi za sisitemu yatejwe imbere n\u2019Ubwongereza, hamwe n\u2019ibishushanyo byoroheje hamwe n\u2019ubunini bwa page.\nSerivise zikora kandi zidahagarikwa na teletext byigihugu.\nFinlande.\nUmuyoboro rusange ukoreshwa mu murwa wa Finlande Yle ufite Teletext (Yle Teksti-TV). yerekana amakuru, siporo na gahunda amakuru kumasaha. Urupapuro rwinsanganyamatsiko ku kirere, urujya n'uruza, akazi no kwidagadura. Teksti-TV nayo ifite amakuru mucyongereza kurupapuro rwa 190."}
{"id": "20923", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20923", "title": "Video magnifier", "text": "Video magnifiers ni ibikoresho bya elegitoronike bikoresha kamera na ecran yerekana kugirango ikore digitale y'ibikoresho byacapwe.ecran yerekana amakuru akenshi iba LCD cyangwa ikoranabuhanga rimeze nk'iry'ikirahure (nubwo ibikoresho byo gusobanura amashusho bya kera byakoreshaga za CRT) kandi mubusanzwe igikoresho kirimo itara ryo kumurika ibikoresho byatanzwe. Amashusho yerekana amashusho yagenewe gukoreshwa cyane cyane nabantu bafite icyerekezo gito kidashobora gufashwa gukoresha ikirahuri gisanzwe.\nIbyiza.\nUrwego rwo gukuza no kwerekana ingano.\nInyungu nyamukuru ya videwo yerekana amashusho hejuru yo gukuza gusa ni uko amashusho yerekana amashusho yemerera gukuza cyane murwego runini rwo kureba. Hamwe na optique ya lensike, umurima ufite ireme, murwego rwo kwibanda kugabanuka hamwe no kwiyongera. Rero, mugihe \"page yuzuye magnifier\" ishingiye kumurongo wa fresnel irashobora kumara 625\u00a0cm (A4), mubisanzwe igera kuri 1.4x gukuza (byamamajwe nka \"2x\" iyo bipimye mukarere aho kuba igipimo); igice kinini cyikiganza kinini gishobora kugera kubintu birenze bibiri (agace karenze bane) ariko mubisanzwe bipima bitarenze 10\u00a0cm \u00d7\u00a03\u00a0cm (3.9\u00a0in \u00d7\u00a01.2\u00a0muri), kandi ibintu byinshi byo gukuza bisaba lens zisanzwe zibanda kumwanya muto cyane. Gukwirakwiza amashusho ariko bigarukira gusa kubunini bwayo hamwe na electronics; amashusho yerekana amashusho ashobora guhinduranya inshuro 2 na 50 gukuza birasanzwe, kandi ibyerekanwa birashobora kuva kuri terefone -bunini kugeza kuri TV.\nGutunganya amashusho.\nAmashusho menshi yerekana amashusho arashobora guhita yibanda kumashusho, kandi moderi zateye imbere zishobora gukomeza gutunganya amashusho ya elegitoronike kugirango uhindure amabara, wongere itandukaniro, kandi / cyangwa ufashe mugukurikirana amashusho. Bimwe birashobora gutegurwa ngo bibike amafoto \"snapshots\" y'ibyashushanyijwe cyangwa amashusho yabonetse mbere.\nIbibi.\nIbisabwa imbaraga.\nGukwirakwiza amashusho bisaba imbaraga, haba mu amashanyarazi cyangwa kuri bateri. Ibi bishobora gutuma igihe bateri imara gikenerwa kiba ikibazo niba imashini y'ishusho ikenewe mugihe kirekire iri kure y'ahantu hashobora kubona amashanyarazi, mugihe igikoresho cyo gukuza gusa optique gishobora gukoreshwa igihe kitarinze gukenera guhuzwa n'imbaraga.\nKudashoboka kwicyitegererezo kinini.\nAmashusho manini cyane ya videwo ntabwo asanzwe yikururwa, ariko arashobora gukoreshwa mubikoresho byo murugo, amasomero ndetse n\u2019ibyumba by\u2019ishuri. Zimwe murizo moderi zitwa muburyo bwa CCTV.\nIgiciro.\nKugeza muri 2013, amashusho yerekana amashusho mubisanzwe ahenze cyane kuruta optique-gusa.\nPorogaramu yerekana amashusho.\nBitewe nigiciro kinini cyibikoresho byabigenewe byabigenewe, hari abantu bashishikajwe no gukuza amashusho ya software akoreshwa kuri terefone zigendanwa nka iPhone na Android, ibinini nka iPad, na mudasobwa zigendanwa zifite ibyuma bifata ibyuma bifata ibyuma bifata ibyuma bifata ibyuma bifata ibyuma bifata ibyuma bifata ibyuma bifata ibyuma bifata ibyuma bifata ibyuma bifata ibyuma bifata ibyuma bifata ibyuma bifata ibyuma bifata amashusho. "}
{"id": "20924", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20924", "title": "Antiope (teletext)", "text": "Antiope yari igipimo cyitumanaho cyakoreshwaga mu gihugu cy'ubufaransa mumyaka ya za 1980. Yashizeho kandi ishingiro ryerekana ibipimo bikoreshwa muri serivisi ya videwo yubufaransa Minitel. Iri jambo ngo ryasobanuraga Acquisition Num\u00e9rique et T\u00e9l\u00e9visualisation d'Images Organis\u00e9es en Pages d'\u00c9criture, rishobora guhindurwa mu buryo bworoshye nka \"Digital Acquisition hamwe no Kwerekana amashusho kure mu mashusho yanditse mu mpapuro zanditse\". \nAmateka.\nImirimo yo kurwanya Antiyopiya yatangiye mu 1972 muri CCETT, ikigo cy\u2019ubushakashatsi cy\u2019igihugu cy\u2019Ubufaransa gishya cyahujwe na televiziyo n\u2019itumanaho yakoreraga i Rennes, hakaba harageragejwe iyi sisitemu kunshuro yayo yambere mu 1975. Sisitemu yatangijwe ku mugaragaro mu 1976 i Vidcom i Cannes, kandi icyarimwe mu imurikagurisha rya \u0421\u041f\u041e\u0420\u0422 76 ryaberaga Moscou. Yemejwe mu rwego mpuzamahanga CCIR 653 (ubu ni ITU-R BT.653) yo mu 1986 nka CCIR Teletext Sisitemu A. \nkwamamaza ubucuruzi \"bwa\" Antiyopiya byatangiye kuri Antenne 2 mu TF1 na FR3 bombi batangiye no gutangaza Antiyopiya guhera mu ntangiriro ya za 1980. Kode ya Antiope yabanje gushyirwaho udusanduku twashyizwe hejuru na tereviziyo ya kabili ya SCART. Grundig ikorera mugihugu cy'ubufaransa bwatangiye kugurisha TV hamwe na decodeur ihuriweho kuva 1983, ikurikirwa nabandi bakora.\nIkoranabuhanga.\nAntiope yari ishingiye kuri gride ya 40 \u00d7 25 ikoresheje ISO 646 na ISO 2022, ikaba kandi ifite uburyo bwo kwandika mu rwego rw'amajwi. Itandukaniro ryibanze muri filozofiya ya tekiniki hagati ya Antiyopiya na sisitemu ya terefegitura ya Ceefax yatunganijwe na BBC byaturutse ku kuba Antiope yatejwe imbere n\u2019abashakashatsi mu itumanaho, naho Ceefax ikaba yarakozwe n\u2019abashakashatsi ba televiziyo. Ba injeniyeri ba tereviziyo bakoze sisitemu yuzuza ecran amakuru ku gipimo cyagenwe, giteganijwe; bitandukanye na Antiyopiya yubatswe nka sisitemu yo guhinduranya paki, hamwe nuburebure bwimpapuro zamakuru, nkuko byakoreshwa kumurongo wa terefone.\nMuri ibyo bihe byombi, amakuru ya tereviziyo yoherejwe mu gihe cyo guhagarikwa guhagaritse, igice cyagenwe kugirango urumuri rwa elegitoronike rugaruke ruva munsi ya ecran rusubira hejuru ya buri kintu cyerekana ishusho (gihuye nigihe cyo kohereza imirongo 25 muri buri gice cya PAL cyangwa SECAM), kandi buri murongo wakoresheje watangaga umubare uteganijwe wa byite buri cyiciro: 40 bytes kuri sisitemu yuburayi, 32 muri Amerika. Muri sisitemu ya BBC Ceefax buri tsinda rya 40 bytes ryahuye neza numurongo umwe winyuguti 40, buri byte igereranya imiterere numwanya wabyo kumurongo - sisitemu yo guhuza amashusho."}
{"id": "20925", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20925", "title": "JORDY", "text": "JORDY cyangwa Joint Optical Reflective Display ni igikoresho cyo kureba gishingiye ku ikoranabuhanga rya optique,cyatejwe imbere hakoreshejwe ikoranabuhanga rya NASA. gikoreshwa mu gufasha abantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona kubona no gusoma.\nIzina ryatewe ishyaka na Star Trek imiterere, Geordi La Forge. "}
{"id": "20926", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20926", "title": "Austext", "text": "Austext ni serivisi yahoze ari televiziyo ya ikorera mugihugu cya Ositaraliya ifite icyicaro i Brisbane, muri Queensland. Serivisi yatwarwaga kandi ikoreshwa na Network irindwi hamwe n\u2019ibigo biyishamikiyeho hafi ya Ositaraliya. Yatwaye amakuru, amakuru yimari, ikirere, ibisubizo bya tombora, umuyobozi wa TV hamwe nandi makuru, hamwe no gufunga ibisobanuro kuri porogaramu.\nSerivisiiboneke ku buntu kuri televiziyo iyariyo yose iyo ari yo yose, mudasobwa cyangwa ikindi gikoresho gifite televiziyo kandi ifite ubushobozi bwo kugera no kureba Umuyoboro wa karindwi, cyangwa kimwe mu bigo birindwi byo mu karere ka Prime, GWN cyangwa Cross Cross.\nAmateka.\nAbantu Barindwi batangiye kugerageza serivisi za Teletext mu mwaka wa 1979, batangira serivisi zisanzwe ku ya 4 Gashyantare 1980 amakuru yingirakamaro yatanzwe mu 1982 i Brisbane na Sydney. Austext yahagaritswe muri Nzeri \nMu myaka yambere wa Austext, hari serivisi ebyiri zitandukanye: 7-Inyandiko isohoka muri ATN muri Sydney hamwe na verisiyo itandukanye ya HSV-7 i Melbourne, no i Brisbane, SevenTel. Mu 1988, BTQ-7 yashinzwe umurimo wigihugu kandi yitwa Austext. \nIbirimo.\nAmakuru aboneka akanandikwa kurupapuro rwa Austext yarimo amakuru agezweho yibanda kungingo zikurikira, ikirere, gusiganwa, inyungu rusange hamwe nuyobora televiziyo. Haraboneka kandi amakuru arambuye ya Austext hamwe namashyirahamwe yabatumva.\nIpaji yamakuru yarimo ibishya mubucuruzi, amakuru yigihugu, amakuru mpuzamahanga, siporo, siyanse n'ikoranabuhanga, na showbiz. Ipaji yikirere ikubiyemo umunsi umwe iteganya ubushyuhe bwumujyi, ubushyuhe bwumunsi umwe nubushyuhe ntarengwa / ntarengwa hamwe nubushyuhe buriho, ubushuhe, aho ikime, umuvuduko wumuyaga, icyerekezo cyumuyaga, izuba rirashe nigihe izuba rirenze, hamwe nicyerekezo cyiminsi itanu iri imbere kubigo bikomeye muri Ositaraliya byose byatanzwe na Biro yubumenyi bwikirere. Amapaji yo gusiganwa yarimo indangagaciro yo gusiganwa ku rwego rwigihugu TAB yahagaritse gukora ku ya 4 Kanama 2009.Urupapuro rusange rushimishije rwarimo ibintu nkibisubizo bya tombora, horoscopes ya buri munsi hamwe n urwenya rwumunsi. Iyi serivisi kandi yatwaye umurongo wa tereviziyo hamwe n\u2019urutonde rw\u2019urusobe rurindwi mu masoko atanu ya metero nkuru, ndetse no ku rutonde rw\u2019indi miyoboro, haba mu mujyi ndetse no mu karere, kugeza mu 2007 igihe baburiwe irengero.\nGufunga.\nMuri Nyakanga 2009 abantu barindwi byatangaje ko Austext izahagarara ku Nzeri 2009. the seven bagaragaje ko haboneka ubundi buryo bwo gutanga amakuru ubu bugera kubareba nkurubuga rwa karindwi. Nubgo byafunzwe, serivise zanditse zifunze zakomeje kuboneka. \nMugaragaza kuri ecran ya ecran yafunzwe soma:"}
{"id": "20927", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20927", "title": "Infonet", "text": "Infonet ni serivisi ikorerwa ku kicyo gisakaza akazash ya tereviziyo ya Maleziya. Yahoze yitwa Beriteks (ikomatanya ryijambo rya Malayika \"Berita\", risobanura \"amakuru\", na \"Teks\", ni ijambo ryatijwe mu rurimi rwicyongereza risobanura \"inyandiko\"). Sisitemu ya teletext yatangijwe mu ntangiriro za 1985 na TV3, mbere yo gutangira kumiyoboro ya RTM nyuma yumwaka. Serivisi yatangijwe yakoreshwaga na New Straits Times. \nMu gihe RTM1 na RTM2 bari bagikwirakwiza Teletext, ibiri mu itumanaho byari bitandukanye n'ibyatanzwe na serivisi ya TV3, na byo bikaba byaratanzwe ku izina rya \"Beriteks\". Ku bijyanye na RTM1 mu mwaka wa mbere, yatwaye amakuru ku biciro by'ibiribwa n'amakuru ku biryo no guhaha. Nkuko Beriteks itwarwa kuri RTM na TV3, bafatwa \"nka serivisi\" ntabwo ari amarushanwa, ndetse na siporo nkuko byagaragajwe hejuru kuyandi ma shene \nRTM1 na RTM2 bahagaritse kohereza amashusho kuri televiziyo guhera mu 2000, kandi TV3 niyo televiziyo yonyine yo muri Maleziya yohereza Teletext. Nta sosiyete ya bashiki ba TV3, 8TV, TV9 na NTV7, itanga teletext.\nInfonet yahagaritse gukora guhera ku ya 1 Mutarama 2008. Kubwibyo rero, ubu nta miyoboro ya televiziyo, icyigo gisakaza amashusho kuburyo bwa sitasiyo bitanga Teletext muri Maleziya.\nInfonet ikoresha sisitemu ya televiziyo ya BBC Ceefax."}
{"id": "20928", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20928", "title": "Inhaler spacer", "text": "A spacer ni igikoresho gikoreshwa mu kongera ubworoherane bwo gutanga imiti ya aerosolize ivuye mu gipimo cya metero ihagije (MDI). Yongera umwanya muburyo bw'urusobe cyangwa \"chambre\" hagati y'akanwa n'ikigega cy'umuti. Ibyogajuru byinshi bifite valve y'inzira imwe ituma umuntu ahumeka imiti mugihe ahumeka kandi asohora bisanzwe; ibi bikunze kuvugwa amacupa afata umuti afite agasanduku kagenzura umwuka (VHC).\nAmazina menshi y'ikirango arahari harimo AeroChamber, InspirEase na Volumatic. Birashobora kandi gukorwa mumacupa ya plastike 500 mL, nayo ikora neza. \nIcyogajuru gifasha abadashoboye guhumeka cyane, kimwe n'abadashoboye guhuza umwuka wabo kuburyo bahumeka nkuko MDI ikora; ibi bizwi nko kudahuza neza gukoresha intoki n'umwuka w'ibihaha. \nAmagambo.\nIjambo spacer rikoreshwa kenshi kugirango ryerekane igikoresho icyo aricyo cyose kimeze nka MDI yongeyeho. Ibyogajuru bimwe (urugero, InspirEase) bifashisha igishushanyo mbonera cyaguye kugirango batange ibitekerezo byerekana ko guhumeka bigenda neza. Ubundi bwoko (urugero, Volumatike) ni plastike ibonerana mubice bibiri bisa na vase bihurira hamwe bikora ishusho ya barriel. Ibyumba bifata ibyumba (VHC) bakunze kwita \"icyogajuru\" kimwe.\nGukoresha.\nGukoresha akuma gafasha gufata umuti mu bihaha binyuze mu guhumeka\" inhaler\" kadafite spacer bisaba guhuza ibikorwa byinshi muburyo bwateganijwe (gukanda hasi kumuhumekero, guhumeka cyane imiti ikimara gusohoka, ufashe umwuka wawe, uhumeka), kandi ntabwo abantu bose bashoboye kumenya uru rutonde. Gukoresha icyogajuru, cyane cyane icyuma gifata icyumba, kirinda ibibazo nkibi. Ibyumba bifata ibyumba bifite akamaro kanini kubana, abantu bafite umwuka mucye, nabafite ubumuga bwo kutamenya, mu bwenge cyangwa mu mitekerereze. [3]\nNyuma yo gukuraho ingofero ya MDI, umunwa wa MDI winjijwe inyuma yumwanya. Igice cyimbere cyicyumba gifunzwe numunwa cyangwa mask itwikira umunwa nizuru. Gutanga imiti, MDI yihebye rimwe, bikavamo irekurwa ryimiti imwe. Imiti ivuye muri MDI noneho ihagarikwa mucyumba cya spacer mugihe umuntu ahumeka imiti ya aerosolize ahumeka no hanze. Umwuka uhumeka usohoka mugikoresho unyuze mumatara aho kwinjira mucyumba. Ibyogajuru bimwe bifite ifirimbi, byumvikana niba umuntu arimo guhumeka vuba.\nSpacers itinda umuvuduko wa aerosol ituruka kumuhumekero, bivuze ko bike mubiyobyabwenge bya asima bigira ingaruka kumunwa kandi nibindi byinshi bishobora kwinjira mubihaha. Kubijyanye na corticosteroide, ibisigara bike mumunwa bigabanya ibyago byo kurwara candidiasis yo mu kanwa, kwandura umusemburo. Kwoza umunwa nyuma yo gushiramo steroide ihumeka bigira ingaruka zisa. \nMugihe abantu barwaye asima bashobora gukomeza MDI hafi igihe cyose, ubwinshi bwibyogajuru bushobora kugabanya imikoreshereze yabyo hanze yurugo. Ubushakashatsi bumwe bwerekana ko ibyogajuru byakorewe mu rugo, ukoresheje amacupa ya pulasitike, bishobora kuba byiza nkibikorwa byubucuruzi, ariko ibyakozwe murugo bishobora kugira byinshi bihinduka. "}
{"id": "20929", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20929", "title": "JTES", "text": "JTES, Ubuyapani bwa Teletext Ibisobanuro, ni protocole ikoreshwa mugushiraho mu guhindura urupapuro muri sisitemu ya Teletext, kimwe nubundi bwoko bwamakuru ya digitale, mugihe cyahagaritse intera (VBI) yerekana ibimenyetso byerekana amashusho mubuyapani. Yemejwe mu rwego mpuzamahanga CCIR 653 (ubu ITU-R BT.653) yo mu 1986 nka CCIR Teletext Sisitemu D. \nIfasha kwerekana imiterere ya Kanji, Katakana na Hiragana. Serivisi ishobora gukoreshwa kugirango yerekane subtitles, cyclicale page cyangwa progaramu ya pseudo. ikaba ifite n'uburyo bwo kwerekana amafoto, geometrie cyangwa amajwi. \nAmateka.\nIterambere rya tereviziyo mu gihugu cyu Buyapani ryatangiye mu 1972, hakurikiraho itangazwa rya sisitemu ya mbere y\u2019itumanaho ku isi (Ceefax) na BBC mu Bwongereza.\nKubera ko inyuguti z'Abayapani zitandukanye cyane n\u2019inyuguti zo mu Burengerazuba, Ubuyapani bwakomeje gukora ubushakashatsi no gucukumbure mu buryo bwo guteza imbere uburyo bwihariye bwo kohereza bwitwa \"uburyo bw'icyitegererezo\", bwohereza ibimenyetso byo gusikana bisa na fax, ku kigero cyikubye inshuro 20 kurenza uburyo buriho, ariko bisaba generator y'inyuguti ifite nini (icyo gihe) 1- megabit ROM. Ubu buryo bwakoreshejwe mu 1982.\nIbisobanuro.\nMubimenyetso bisanzwe bya NTSC, hariho imirongo 525 yo gusikana ibimenyetso byo muburyo bw'amashusho. Ibi bigabanijwemo kabiri amashusho, azwi nka \" imirima \", yoherejwe buri 60th yisegonda. Aya mashusho ahuza kuri ecran cyangwa se akaranga mashusho, no mumaso, kugirango akore ikadiri imwe ya videwo ivugururwa buri 30 ya segonda. Buri murongo wa buri murima ufata 63.5 \u03bcs kohereza; 50.3 \u03bcs za videwo na 13.2 \u03bcs zingana n \"igihe cyapfuye\" kuri buri mpera yakoreshejwe mu kwerekana televiziyo ko umurongo wuzuye, uzwi nka intera itambitse (HBI). Iyo gahunda yo gusikana igeze kumpera ya ecran isubira hejuru mugihe cyahagaritse intera ihagaritse (VBI), nka, HBI isaba \"igihe cyapfuye\" kugirango ikore neza ibimenyetso kuri ecran. Muri iki kibazo, igihe cyapfuye kigaragazwa nimirongo idakoreshwa yikimenyetso cyamashusho, mubisanzwe imirongo 22 yambere yikadiri.\nJTES ikubiyemo amakuru mubimenyetso byo muburyo bw'amashusho nkurukurikirane rw'ududomo ku gipimo cyagenwe cya 5.727272\u00a0Mbit / s. Buri murongo wumurima ufite 50.3 \u03bcs yumwanya wa amashusho ushobora gukoreshwa mugukwirakwiza, bivamo 296 bits kumurongo. \nBishoboka guhindura inyuguti zashyizweho (JIS C 6226 Yinganda zubuyapani, ikubiyemo inyuguti 6879 zishushanyije zikwiye kwandika inyandiko, amazina y\u2019ahantu, amazina bwite, nibindi mu rurimi rwikiyapani, byasobanuwe mu 1978), kugirango ugaragaze inyuguti zikwiye cyangwa uzamura uburyo bwo kohereza. Niba inyuguti itaboneka muri Teletext yakira imashini itanga imashini, irashobora gushirwaho ukoresheje \"DRCS\" (Dynamically Redefinable Character Sets). \nInyuguti zishobora kwanduzwa nka mozayike yibintu bya semigraphic, hamwe na buri kintu gifite imiterere ya 8\u2009\u00d7\u200912 pigiseli. \nKode nyinshi zamakuru zirashoboka: "}
{"id": "20930", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20930", "title": "Tunstall Ubuvuzi", "text": "Tunstall Healthcare ni isosiyete yikoranabuhanga yashinzwe mu 1957 izobereye muri serivisi zita ku buzima n\u2019ubuvuzi. Icyicaro cyayo kiri i Doncaster. Ifite abakozi bagera ku 3.000 mu bihugu 19, na 5\u00a0miriyoni ihuje abakoresha kw'isi yose. Ifatwa nkumukinnyi wingenzi ku isoko rya serivisi z'ubuvuzi hakoreshejwe ikoranabuhanga telehealth. Umuyobozi mukuru ni Emil Peters. \nYabonye ikigo cy\u2019ubuvuzi cy\u2019Abanyamerika muri Ukuboza 2011. \nYagurishije Tunstall Amerika kugirango ihuze Amerika.com muri Mutarama 2019 murwego rwo kwerekeza kubikorwa byubucuruzi bikoreshwa na tekinoroji. \nIrimo ikorana na Telef\u00f3nica gutanga sisitemu na serivise zo gucunga abarwayi kure kugira ngo zongere ubushobozi bwayo mu kwita ku gukumira abantu bafite ibibazo bidakira. \nYasohoye raporo hamwe n\u2019abagiraneza hft yatangijwe cyangwa yasohotse mu Ngoro nshingamategeko(House Of Lords) mu mwaka wa 2019 igaragaza ubushobozi budakoreshwa bw\u2019ikoranabuhanga rifasha mu mibereho myiza yakiriwe n\u2019itsinda ry'abakoranabushake bafite ubumuga. \nMuri 2021 yaguze Secuvita, itanga ibisubizo byikoranabuhanga ikorera mu Buholandi hamwe n\u2019abakoresha 70.000. Mu 2022 yaguze BeWo Unternehmensgruppe, isosiyete yo mu Budage. "}
{"id": "20931", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20931", "title": "MediaCorp Teletext", "text": "MediaCorp Teletext yari serivise yo muri Singapuru itanga amakuru yatanzwe na MediaCorp. Yakozwe kuri MediaCorp's Channel 5, Umuyoboro wa 8 na Channel NewsAsia. Hejuru yamakuru asanzwe yatwawe nabashizwe serivisi ya teletext benshi, yatwaye kandi amakuru yihariye muri Singapuru, nkibiciro bya COE na ERP, amatangazo yatanzwe na minisiteri zatoranijwe muri Singapuru nibisubizo bya tombora.\nIyi serivisi kandi yaboneka kuri interineti kuva mu 1999 kugeza ihagaritswe muri 2013.\nUmuyobozi wa bisi yakuweho mu 1986 kubera imikoreshereze mike. \nIyi serivise yiswe INtv ku ya 18 Mutarama 1993. Simulcast kuri SBC 8 ntabwo yatangajwe kubera ivugurura rya tekiniki ryakozwe uwo munsi. Izina rishya kandi ryatangije imikorere ya Newsreel yo kuvugurura amakuru hamwe na amakuru y'ingenzi ya Fastext. Serivise ivuguruye yaje kumunsi umwe sosiyete yo mugihugu cya Singapore Telecom yatangije Teleview isa, abakozi bayo ntibari bazi rebrand ya SBCText. SBC yavuze ko idahiganwa na Teleview, ivuga ko serivisi zombi zitandukanye. Serivisi ziiki kigo cyikorera zaje guhagarikwa by'agateganyo ku ya 1993 nyuma y'imirongo ya INtv yaciwe nabi. Serivisi nyinshi zagaruwe nyuma yumunsi. verisiyo ya PC, Networked INtv, yakozwe n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019ubushakashatsi cy\u2019ikoranabuhanga cya kaminuza ya kaminuza ya tekinike ya Nanyang, yasohotse ku mugaragaro muri Mutarama 1994. \nNyuma yaje kwagurwa kugeza kuri News News Asia igihe umuyoboro watangizwaga ku ya 1 Werurwe 1999. Kuva mu mpera za Nzeri 2001, serivisi yabonetse 24/7. \nIbirimo.\nTeletext yatanzwe kumiyoboro itatu MediaCorp, hamwe numuyoboro wihariye muburyo bwisakaza amakuru. Teletext kumuyoboro wa 5 kabuhariwe mu myidagaduro nubuzima bwamakuru, Ibyiciro kuri Channel 8 namakuru yubucuruzi kuri News News Asia.\nTeletext Kumurongo wa mudasobwa.\nIyo serivisi yari ikiri kumurongo, verisiyo ya Teletext yimiyoboro uko ari itatu iboneka mugushakisha ukoresheje interineti kandi igaragaramo verisiyo igezweho ya Teletext yerekanwe kuri tereviziyo cyangwase isakazas mashusho (gutinda bishobora kuba iminota 10). Kimwe na Teletext kuri tereviziyo, ubu serivisi irahagaritswe."}
{"id": "20932", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20932", "title": "IBOT", "text": "IBOT ni igare rifite moteri rifasha umuntu ufite ubumuga kugenda rikoresha ikoranabuhanga rya giroskopi (gyroscopic) kugirango rigende neza ku butaka butandukanye imbere munzu no hanze.\nUbu buryo, iBOT\u00ae PMD, bwakozwe na Mobius Mobility kuva muri 2019.Iki gikoresho cyakozwe na DEKA Research &amp;amp; Development Corp. ya Dean Kamen ku bufatanye n\u2019ishami ry\u2019ubwigenge bwa Johnson &amp;amp; Johnson. Impapuro zambere zakozwe na Technology Technology yigenga kuva 2003 kugeza 2009.\nIbisobanuro.\nIBOT ikoresha tekinoroji ya giroskopi hamwe ninziga enye zikoresha moteri hamwe ninziga ebyiri za caster kugirango zitange uburyo butandukanye bwo gutwara. Muburyo bwibiziga 4, ifite ibiziga bine gusa byo gutwara hasi, bikabasha gukora ahantu h'inyuma nka curbs, umucanga, na urubura. ikoreshwa mu buryobusanzwe nka kagare afite moteri, ifite ibiziga bibiri b'imodoka hiyongereyeho ibiziga bya caster hasi, kandi ikora nk'ibisanzwe bisanzwe by'imodoka y'inyuma yimodoka. \nUbundi buryo burimo kuringaniza uburyo, buzamura umukoresha kurwego rwamaso murwego rwo kuringaniza ibiziga bibiri byimodoka, hamwe nuburyo bwintambwe, bufasha umukoresha watojwe kuzamuka no kumanuka. \nAmateka.\nIterambere.\nIterambere rya iBOT ryatangiye mu 1990 muri DEKA Ubushakashatsi &amp; Iterambere i Manchester, NH. Prototype ya mbere ikora yaboneka mu 1992,:\u200a21\u200ano muri 1994, DEKA yasinyanye amasezerano na Johnson &amp;amp; Johnson yo gukora icyo gikoresho. \nIBOT yahishuriwe rubanda kuri Dateline NBC mu gice na John Hockenberry ku ya 30 Kamena 1999.:\u200a53\u200aKugeza ubu, Johnson &amp; Johnson yari amaze gukoresha miliyoni 50 US $ muri uyu mushinga.:\u200a48\u200aKu gitaramo cya Art Bell 's Coast to Coast AM show (16 Werurwe 2001) umunyamakuru w\u2019iperereza Robert Steensen yaganiriye ku gihangano cya Dean Kamen, \"Umushinga Ginger\" cyangwa \"It\", nyuma uza gusohoka nka iBOT na The Segway. IBOT yahanaguwe na FDA nk'igikoresho cyo mu cyiciro cya III ku ya 13 Kanama 2003. \nSegway PT, igikoresho kitari ubuvuzi, yahagaritswe mugihe cyo guteza imbere ibicuruzwa bya iBOT, ikoresha ikoranabuhanga ryibanze. Mugihe cyiterambere, iBOT yitwaga Fred, mugufi kuri Fred Upstairs, igihano kuri Fred Astaire, mugihe Segway yitwaga Ginger, nyuma yumubyiniro wa Fred Astaire Ginger Rogers.:\u200a27\u200aSegway PT yarekuwe mu 2001.:\u200a20-30\u200a\niBOT 3000 na iBOT 4000.\nJohnson &amp; Johnson bashizeho Ikoranabuhanga ryigenga kugirango bazane iBOT ku isoko. Umwimerere wa iBOT 3000 winjiye mu 2003, usimburwa na iBOT 4000 mu 2005. \nBitewe na FDA yashyizwe mu byiciro, iBOT 3000 na iBOT 4000 ntibishobora kugira icyo bihindura ku bicaye cyangwa ku bagenzuzi, bivuze ko bidashobora guhindurwa ku bakoresha ku giti cyabo. Byongeye kandi, ubwishingizi bwari buke kuri ibyo bikoresho, byagurishijwe $ 25.000- $ 28,000. Haragurishijwe ibice 500 gusa, Johnson &amp; Johnson bahagarika umusaruro mu \niBOT PMD.\nMu mpera za 2014, Kamen yatangaje ko FDA yashyize mu majwi iBOT kuva mu cyiciro cya III ikajya mu cyiciro cy\u2019ubuvuzi cya kabiri. Uku kugabanya kugenzura kugenzura kwemerera DEKA kubyutsa iBOT isinziriye no gutangira iterambere kubicuruzwa bizaza. \nMuri 2019, igisekuru kizaza iBOT PMD (Igikoresho cyumuntu ku giti cye) cyasohowe ku isoko na Mobius Mobility i Manchester, NH. \nFDA yahaye iBOT PMD byombi IMK (Intebe Yabamugaye, Kuzamuka kuntambwe) hamwe na ITI (Intebe yimuga, ikora). "}
{"id": "20933", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20933", "title": "Iansyst", "text": "iansyst Ltd ni sosiyete itanga ibikoresho by'ikoranabuhanga bifasha abantu, itanga ibicuruzwa na serivisi bigamije gufasha abantu bafite ubumuga butandukanye nka: dyslexia, ubumuga bwo kutabona, dyscalculia, ihuzabikorwa ryiterambere ryiterambere, Gukomeretsa inshuro nyinshi.\nAmateka.\nIsosiyete yashinzwe i Londres mu ntangiriro za 1983 na Ian Litterick, byumwihariko bigamije gutanga porogaramu zo guhugura no kwigisha.\nKugeza mu 1995, ubu ubarizwa i Cambridge, Iansyst yakwirakwizaga inyandiko ya monologue kuri porogaramu ya Speech Synthesis, yabonaga ko ari ingirakamaro ku bantu barwaye dyslexia.\nMu 1996, iansyst yagize uruhare mu rwego rwa DSA-QAG (Itsinda ry\u2019ubwishingizi bw\u2019abanyeshuri bafite ubumuga bw\u2019abamugaye), ndetse no gutanga isoko ry\u2019ikoranabuhanga rifasha n\u2019amahugurwa ku banyeshuri bahawe igihembo cy\u2019abanyeshuri bamugaye (DSA). Uwashinze, Ian Litterick yabaye umunyamuryango ukomeye mu burenganzira bwo gusoma\u00a0 yatangijwe mu 2002.\nMuri 2009/2010 iansyst yafatanije na XMA gutanga gahunda yo kugera murugo muri leta kugirango itange abana bafite ubumuga bukomeye cyangwa ibikenewe by\u2019uburezi bwihariye, bw\u2019imiryango ikennye hamwe na Home Access ya mudasobwa, kwinjira kuri interineti n\u2019ikoranabuhanga rifasha. Ubufatanye hagati ya iansyst n'inzobere mu burezi XMA bwamenyekanye ubwo batsindaga igihembo cyo Gukorera hamwe muri 2012 muri Technology4Good. Ibi bihembo bidasanzwe byateguwe na AbilityNet na BT kandi yahuza hamwe amashyirahamwe n'ibikorwa by'ubugiraneza nibigo bitandukanye by'ubucuruzi, ibikorwa byabo bigafasha abantu kunoza cyangwa kuzamura imibereho yabo binyuze mu ikoreshwa ry'ikoranabuhanga IT.\nMu ntangiriro za 2012 iansyst yahawe inkunga na Jisc TechDis binyuze mu marushanwa yo mu kibaya cyo mu kibaya cyo guteza imbere MyDocStore. Ibi byakozwe ku bufatanye n\u2019ihuriro ry\u2019imiryango iyobowe na iansyst: barimo Software ya Raspberry na ECS\u00a0- Electronics na Computer Science yo muri kaminuza ya Southampton. Intego ya MyDocStore nugukora byihuse kandi byoroshye kohereza dosiye hagati yibikoresho mugihe icyarimwe kubihindura muburyo bworoshye kubakoresha; ni ukuvuga inyandiko kumajwi, inyandiko kumiterere nini no guhuza byombi. Muri 2013 umushinga watangijwe nka serivise y'urubuga azzapt.\nAbakozi.\nUmuyobozi mukuru, Ian Litterick ni umunyamuryango washinze ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abafasha mu ikoranabuhanga rya BATA mu Bwongereza. BATA yiyamamariza uburenganzira ninyungu zabakeneye ikoranabuhanga rifasha.\nUmuyobozi mukuru, Janine King ayoboye inkunga ya iansyst nkabagize ihuriro ry\u2019abafite ubumuga mu bucuruzi (BDF)."}
{"id": "20935", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20935", "title": "TrackR", "text": "TrackR yari igikoresho cyo gushakisha imfunguzo cyakoreshwaga mu bucuruzi, cyafashaga mu gukurikirana ibintu n'ibikoresho byatakaye. Trackr yakorwaga na sosiyete yitwa Phone Halo kandi yatewe inkunga nabashinze gutakaza imfunguzo zabo ku mucanga mugihe cyurugendo rwo kwiruka. \nAbashinze Terefone Halo batangiye gukora kuri TrackR mu 2009. Mu 2010, bashinze icyo kigo cyangwa isosiyete kandi bashyira ku isoko icyo gicuruzwa. Mu gihe cy'itumba 2018, TrackR yongeye kwisubiraho muri Adero, mu rwego rwo guhindura icyerekezo cyayo ku bindi bikoreshwa mu ikoranabuhanga ryayo ryo gukurikirana, ifata TrackR irenze fobs ya Bluetooth yari ishingiro rya serivisi zayo. serivisi zayo ikuraho porogaramu zayo muri Kanama 2021.\nIncamake.\nIgikoresho kirimo bateri ya lithium igomba guhinduka nka rimwe mu mwaka nuyikoresha. Iramenyesha aho iri ubu ikoresheje Bluetooth 4.0, kuri Android 4.4+ cyangwa iOS 8.0+ igikoresho kigendanwa porogaramu ya TrackR yashyizwemo kandi ikora. Iyi mikorere yitwa \"Imbaga y'abantu\", kubera ko buri gikoresho kizamenyesha aho giherereye ku bindi bikoresho byose bya TrackR biri mu ntera, harimo n'ibidafite cyangwa byanditswe n'umukoresha. Iyi mikorere ni ingirakamaro kuko porogaramu igomba gushyirwaho kandi igakorera ku gikoresho cyegereye Bluetooth cyegereye aho igikoresho icyo ari cyo cyose gishobora gutangwa.\nKugeza muri Kanama 2017, ibikoresho birenga miliyoni 5 bya TrackR byari bimaze kugurishwa. \nKuva muri Kanama 2021, urubuga rwemewe rwavuze ko uruganda rwahagaritse inkunga ya App ku bikoresho bya Apple na Android.\nAmakuru ya tekiniki.\nKuri \"Trackr Bravo\", producer yasohoye amakuru akurikira guhera muri Kanama 2017: "}
{"id": "20936", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20936", "title": "WordQ + SpeakQ", "text": "WordQ\u00ae ni porogaramu ifasha ikoranabuhanga yateguwe na Quillsoft Ltd hamwe n\u2019ibitaro bya Holland Bloorview Kids Rehabilitation Hospital. Intego nyamukuru ya WordQ ni ugufasha abantu bahanganye nogusoma no kwandika ndetse ikanafasha abafite ubumuga butandukanye. Akenshi urwo rugamba ruterwa n'ubumuga bw'umubiri cyangwa neurodivergence nka Dyslexia cyangwa ADHD. WordQ ikoresha ijambo ryubwenge guhanura kugirango yerekane amagambo umukoresha yandika muri buke 1.3. Ibi bifasha imyandikire, kandi bikana gabanya ingano yimikorere yumubiri umukoresha agomba gukora mugihe yandika. Ikoresha kandi ubuziranenge bwa Acapela inyandiko ndetse n'amajwi kugirango asome inyandiko yinyuma uyikoresha yinjiye, yemerera kugenzura no guhindura. Ikiranga imvugo ya WordQs, SpeakQ\u00ae, yashyizwe muri desktop ya WordQ ya Windows OS. Iyemerera abakoresha guhinduranya kuvuga no kwandika mugihe wandika. Ibiro bya WordQ biraboneka kuri Windows na Mac OS, iWordQ iraboneka kuri iPadOS, naho WordQ Chrome ya mushakisha ya Chrome iteganijwe gusohoka muri Mutarama 2022.\nIterambere.\nWordQ yatunganijwe bwa mbere mu mpera z'imyaka ya za 90 n'itsinda ry'ubushakashatsi riyobowe na Dr. Fraser Shein mu bitaro bya Holland Bloorview Kids Rehabilitation Hospital Toronto, Ontario, Kanada. Shein n'ibitaro bashinze isosiyete ifatanije, yitwa Quillsoft Ltd, kugira ngo bamenyekanishe WordQ ndetse no gushyigikira ubushakashatsi bwakorewe mu bitaro. Iterambere rya WordQ ryakurikiranye ibicuruzwa bya software byabanje kandi byatejwe imbere muri Holland Bloorview, KeyREP\u00ae na WiVox\u00ae, ibi byari ibikoresho byo gufasha abanyeshuri bafite ibibazo byo kwandika ndetse nubundi bumuga butandukanye. Porogaramu n'imikorere ya WordQ yarishyuwe kugirango bifashe abafite ikibazo cyo kwandika biturutse ku bumuga bwo kwiga kandi bagakoreshwa murwego runini mumashuri ya Ontario. Imikoreshereze yiyo sisitemu noneho yagutse cyane mumashuri yo mugihugu cya Kanada nahandi kwisi nyuma yiterambere, kuko itsinda kandi rikubiyemo SpeakQ na ThoughtQ\u00ae. Ikoranabuhanga rya SpeakQ ryakozwe ku bufatanye n\u2019ikigo gishinzwe iterambere ry\u2019uburezi (Newton, MA) ku nkunga ya Minisiteri y\u2019uburezi muri Amerika. Muri iki gihe, WordQ ikoreshwa n\u2019abaturage benshi b\u2019abanyeshuri, ntabwo ari abafite ibibazo byo kwiga gusa, urugero, abiga ururimi rwa kabiri hamwe n\u2019abanyeshuri hamwe n\u2019abakozi.\nIbiranga.\nWordQ ifite idirishya ritoya rigaragara hejuru yidirishya iryo ariryo ryose rikorwa kandi rikora hamwe na porogaramu iyo ari yo yose ukoresha. Nka tekinoroji ifasha, ibi byitwa transparent accessibility. Nkuko umukoresha wa sisitemu yandika, software igerageza kwerekana ijambo rikoreshwa, ukurikije inyuguti zambere namagambo yanditse mbere yukoresha. Nkuko bandika, uyikoresha ashobora gukoresha urufunguzo rwerekezo cyangwa urufunguzo rwumubare kugirango uhitemo ijambo wifuza. Umukoresha ashobora kandi gusaba porogaramu gusoma amajwi yabo yanditse mu ijwi riranguruye nkuko bandika, bigatuma impinduka zimyandikire nimbonezamvugo zifatwa mugihe wandika. Porogaramu irashobora gufungura no kuzimya uyikoresha nkuko bandika, kandi ikorana na progaramu zose zikoreshwa. WordQ kuri ubu irashobora gukoreshwa mucyongereza, Igifaransa, Icyesipanyoli &amp; Ikidage.\nIkoreshwa rya SpeakQ.\nWordQ ikoreshwa mumashuri menshi muri Amerika na Kanada kugirango ifashe abantu bafite ubumuga butandukanye. imyaka myinshi igurishwa muri Kanada, ariko itangiye kugaragara ku isoko ry\u2019Amerika. Muri Kanada, amashuri menshi yarayakoresheje kugirango akoreshwe muri sisitemu zabo. Mu mwaka wa 2010, OSAPAC, umuryango ushinzwe kugura software ku mashuri yo muri Ontario, yaguze uruhushya rwo gukoresha WordQ mu mashuri yose yo mu ntara yose. Porogaramu yakoreshejwe cyane cyane nkigikoresho cyabanditsi bahanganye nabafite ubumuga bwo kwiga bibabaza ubushobozi bwabo bwo kwandika. Ubushakashatsi bw\u2019abandi bantu bwerekana ko WordQ nayo ikora, niba atari nziza, kuruta izindi software zisa nazo mu gufasha aba banditsi bahanganye. Ubundi bushakashatsi bwigenga bwerekana ko WordQ yo guhanura ijambo hamwe nubushobozi bwo kwandika-kuvuga bishobora kugira ingaruka nziza kubuhanga bwo kwandika bwabanyeshuri bo mumashuri abanza bafite ubumuga bwihariye bwo kwiga. "}
{"id": "20937", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20937", "title": "Harrington Hump", "text": "Harrington Hump ni modular, yoroshye-kwishyiriraho uburyo uburebure bwa gari ya moshi bushobora kwiyongera ku giciro gito. Sisitemu yakuye izina ryayo muri gari ya moshi ya Harrington i Cumbria, mu Bwongereza, akaba ari naho hambere hambere hambere. Kuva mu 2011, Harrington Humps yashyizwe buhoro buhoro ku zindi gariyamoshi zo mu Bwongereza n'ahandi.\nAmavu n'amavuko.\nUburebure bwa platifomu mu Bwongereza bwa gari ya moshi ntabwo busanzwe kuko, mugihe cyo kubaka umuyoboro, amasosiyete atandukanye ya gari ya moshi yatuye ahantu hirengeye. Amahuriro yicaye hasi (ugereranije nurwego rwa gari ya moshi) yerekana ibibazo byinjira nogusohoka kubagenzi bafite ubumuga bwimodoka, harimo nabakoresha amagare. Kuzamura urwego rwuzuye rwuzuye rwa platiforme birahenze cyane kandi mu bihe byinshi birarenze ubushobozi bwa gari ya moshi (Network Nail) n'inzego z'ibanze. \nBivugwa ko icyateye iyi mpanuka,cyari umusozo w'ikiraro, bivugwa n\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019itsinda ry\u2019abakoresha gari ya moshi ya Copeland rivuga ko urubuga ruto ku murongo wa Cumbrian Coast rwateje abakoresha ikibazo cyo kwinjira no kuva muri gari ya moshi, rwakorewe mu itsinda ry\u2019abajyanama b\u2019ubwikorezi bw\u2019akarere ka Allerdale, komite ishinzwe komite y\u2019akarere ka Cumbria. Icyifuzo cyo kuzamura igice cyamahuriro cyatanzwe kugirango paruwasi ya gari ya moshi ivuga ko imirimo yo gukosora izatwara \"imibare itandatu\" kuri sitasiyo. \nUmusozo w'ikiraro.\nHarrington Hump nigisubizo cyigice cyikibazo kimaze igihe kinini cyo kubona abakoresha gari ya moshi ziva kumurongo ugereranije.]Ishobora gushushanywa ku buryo buhuza n'ibipimo by'ubugari n'uburebure by'ikibuga runaka kandiika ikashobora gushyirwaho mu minsi mike. Gushiraho Harrington Hump bihendutse cyane kuruta kuzamura uburebure bwose bwa platifomu - kugeza kuri 1/10 cyibiciro bisanzwe \u00a3 250.000. \nHump yateguwe na Network Rail Railway hamwe ninama Njyanama yintara ya Cumbria, ifatanije na Pipex Structural Composites, bwa mbere kuri gari ya moshi ya Harrington mu Kuboza 2008. Ubundi bizwi nka \"Byoroshye Kubona Ahantu\", Umuhanda wa gari ya moshi wemeje ko iyi nyubako izamenyekana guhera ubu ku izina ryayo, \"Harrington Hump\". \nHump ihagaze kugirango ihuze numuryango runaka muri gari ya moshi, mubisanzwe imwe yagenewe kwinjira mu kagare. Kubera iyo mpamvu, Hump ntabwo ikwiranye na platifomu ikorerwa muburyo butandukanye bwa gari ya moshi, nko kuri gari ya moshi ya Dalton, aho inzugi z\u2019ibimuga z\u2019ibimuga ziba ziri ahantu hatandukanye kuri gari ya moshi zitandukanye. \nHump ya kabiri yashyizwe kuri gari ya moshi ya St Albans Abbey naho iya gatatu kuri gari ya moshi ya Aberdovey. Izindi sitasiyo zakira Humps zirimo Northwich, Flixton, Bridge ya Whaley, Umubwiriza, Kents Bank na Hadfield. \nSisitemu ya Hump yatsindiye igihembo cyo gutanga serivisi kubakiriya muri 2009 \"abakozi ba leta batandukanye nuburinganire\". \nMuri Gashyantare 2019, hashyizweho Hump kuri gari ya moshi ya Marsden i West Yorkshire, izakemura ikibazo cya 45\u00a0cm kumanuka uva muri gari ya moshi ujya kuri platifomu \nIbice bishya.\nNk\u2019uko Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Ubufatanye bwa Gariyamoshi ribivuga, ibintu bishya bya Hump ni:"}
{"id": "20938", "revid": "10947", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20938", "title": "Virtual Keyboard", "text": "Mwandikisho isanzwe ni software ikora yemerera kwinjiza inyuguti bidakenewe urufunguzo rw'umubiri. Imikoranire na clavier y'ububiko ibaho ahanini ikoresheje interineti ikoraho, ariko irashobora no kubaho muburyo butandukanye mugihe mubyukuri cyangwa byongerewe ukuri.\nUbwoko.\nKuri mudasobwa ya desktop, clavier isanzwe ishobora gutanga ubundi buryo bwo kwinjiza kubakoresha cyangwa kubabana n' ubumuga butandukanye badashobora gukoresha clavier isanzwe, kubakoresha indimi nyinshi bahinduranya kenshi hagati yinyuguti zitandukanye cyangwa inyuguti zitandukanye, zishobora kuba urujijo mugihe, cyangwa kubakoresha badafite clavier gakondo.\nMwandikisho ya Virtual irashobora gukoresha ibi bikurikira:\nIbikoresho bigendanwa.\nVirtual Keyboards isanzwe ikoreshwa nkuburyo bwo kwinjiza cyangwa kwandika inyuguti zijya muri ecran mubikoresho bidafite clavier y'umubiri aho nta mwanya uhari, nka mudasobwa yo mu mufuka, umufasha wa digitale (PDA), mudasobwa ya tablet, cyangwa ecran ya terefone igendanwa. Inyandiko isanzwe yinjizwamo haba mukanda clavier ya virtual cyangwa kurutoki. Mwandikisho ya Virtual nayo igaragara muri software yigana sisitemu ifite buto nkeya ugereranije na mudasobwa yaba ifite.\nPDA.\nSisitemu ikora cyane igendanwa, Android na iOS, iha umuryango wabatezimbere amahirwe yo gutezimbere kugiti cyawe cyihariye.\nVirtual Keyboards ishobora gukoreshwa mubihe bimwe na bimwe kugirango ugabanye ibyago byo kwinjirira urufunguzo. Kurugero, serivisi ya banki ya interineti ya Westpac ikoresha clavier yuburyo bwo kwinjiza ijambo ryibanga, kimwe na TreasuryDirect (reba ishusho). Biragoye cyane kuri malware gukurikirana ibyerekanwa nimbeba kugirango ubone amakuru yinjiye ukoresheje clavier yububiko kuruta uko ukurikirana urufunguzo nyarwo. Ariko, birashoboka, kurugero mukwandika amashusho mugihe gito cyangwa kuri buri kanda. "}
{"id": "20939", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20939", "title": "FS Me", "text": "FS Me ni imyandikire / imyandikire yasobanuwe nkuwa mbere yateguwe hifashishijwe inama n'itsinda ry'abantu bafite ubumuga bwo kwiga kandi ryagenewe gukoreshwa n'abaturage. Yakozwe na Jason Smith asubiza komisiyo yatanzwe n\u2019abagiraneza Mencap mu 2008. Niyo myandikire yonyine yagaragaye muri D&amp;amp;AD Annual 2009 cyibanda ku buhanga bwo kwamamaza no gushushanya.\nVerisiyo ya digitale ya FS Me yashinzwe na YouView mu 2008, nk'igice cy'iby'ibanze by'ubushobozi bwo kugera ku rubuga byashyizweho na Gareth Ford Williams."}
{"id": "20940", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20940", "title": "TecAccess", "text": "TecAccess ni isosiyete y'Abanyamerika iherereye i Rockville, muri Virijiniya, ishushanya ibikoresho byo kwiga kumurongo hamwe nurubuga rwabafite ubumuga. Isosiyete itanga serivisi zubujyanama, guteza imbere software, kugerageza no gusuzuma, amahugurwa, kugenzura, kwemeza, no gusuzuma politiki. Yibanze ku gice cya 508 kubahiriza no kugera kuri IT kumiryango ya leta n\u2019abikorera. \nAmateka.\nMu 2001, Debra Ruh yashinze ikigo cya TecAccess (izwi kandi nka Strategic Performance Solutions). Ubucuruzi bwateye imbere nyuma y\u2019ingingo ya 508 y\u2019ivugururwa ry\u2019itegeko ryita ku buzima busanzwe ryo mu 1998, ryatangiye gukurikizwa ku ya 21 Kamena 2001, risaba ko ababana n\u2019ubumuga bafite itumanaho ryoroshye, imbuga za interineti, ndetse n\u2019ibikoresho bya mudasobwa. \nTecAccess yahawe akazi muri 2003 na Canon kugirango fotokopi igere kubantu badashobora gukoresha amaboko cyangwa bafite ikibazo cy'ubumuga bwo kutabona; bahimbye uburyo bwo kumenyekanisha amajwi murukurikirane rwa ImageRunner. Aba fotokopi batsindiye igihembo cyatanzwe na Fondasiyo y'Abanyamerika ishinzwe abatabona mu \nMu 2006, sosiyete yari ifite miliyoni 2.5 z'amadolari yo kugurisha ibigo bya leta n'ubucuruzi. Abakiriya bayo barimo Ishami ry\u2019Uburezi, Serivisi ishinzwe kwinjiza imisoro n\u2019imbere, Hewlett-Packard, hamwe n\u2019ibiro bishinzwe ipiganwa n\u2019ubucuruzi. Uyu muryango uherereye i Rockville, muri Virijiniya, ariko benshi mu itumanaho. Mu 2006, hari abakozi 25 na bagenzi be 60.) 80% by'abakozi bafite babana n'ubumuga, kandi bakora akazi kabo bakoresheje ikoranabuhanga rihuza n'imiterere kuburyo bakora akazi kabo neza. \nTecAccess yahujwe na SSB BART Group mu mwaka wa 2011. Ruh yagizwe umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe kwamamaza mu kigo cya SSB akomeza kuba umuyobozi mukuru wa TecAccess, ikora nk'ikigo cyihariye. Muri 2016, umuyobozi mukuru wa TecAccess yari Rich Belyea naho Ruh yari perezida. "}
{"id": "20941", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20941", "title": "Tazti", "text": "Tazti ni porogaramu yo kumenyekanisha imvugo yatunganijwe kandi igurishwa nikigo cya Voice Tech Group, Inc. kuri mudasobwa bwite ya Windows. Porogaramu iheruka ni verisiyo 3.2, ishyigikira Windows 10, Windows 8.1, Windows 8 na Windows 7 64-bit. Ubusanzwe verisiyo ya Tazti yashyigikiraga Windows Vista na Windows XP. Ibintu by'ibanze bya Tazti ni ugukina imikino ya videwo ya PC mu majwi, kugenzura porogaramu za PC mu majwi, no gushyiraho amategeko yo kuvuga kugira ngo ushakishe mugufungura urubuga, cyangwa gukurura sisitemu y'imikorere ya Windows kugira ngo ufungure dosiye, ububiko cyangwa porogaramu. Ubusanzwe verisiyo ya Tazti yarimo uburyo bwa Dictation bwakuweho muri verisiyo iheruka.\nIbiranga.\nikoranabuhanga rya Tazti Speech Recognition ifite ibice bine byibanze byimikorere:\nTazti ikoresha interineti ntyeya. kurugero, umukoresha avuga imvugo yamagambo agaragara muri kumurongo wumukoresha wa interineti nkuko byavuzwe byemerera umukoresha kwemeza nukureba ubuziranenge bwo kuvuga."}
{"id": "20942", "revid": "10947", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20942", "title": "Talking Tactile Tablet", "text": "Talking Tactile Tablet cyangwa T3 nigishushanyo mbonera gifite ubuso bwo gukoraho bushobora gukoreshwa nkigikoresho cyinjiza gikoresha impapuro zabyimba mugukora 3D hejuru kandi igahuza dosiye zamajwi nibice byuzuye. Igikoresho cyahujwe na mudasobwa kandi gikora hamwe na CD ya porogaramu, kandi gifite ubuso bwitondewe butanga amashusho akoraho atanga ibitekerezo byamajwi iyo akanze. Irashobora gukoreshwa kugirango ifashe ababana nubumuga gusobanura ibishushanyo, imbonerahamwe namakarita mugukora amashusho yoroheje, akoraho, hamwe nibitekerezo byamajwi. \nT3 cyangwa Talking Tactile Tablet yakozwe mu Ishuri Rikuru ry\u2019Ubwongereza ryita ku batabona i Hanoford ifatanije n\u2019isosiyete ikora software ikorera muri Amerika. Igikoresho cyambere cyakozwe muburyo bwo kwiga ariko kirahuza nibindi bikoreshwa. Mu 2005, Hanoford Museum and Art Gallery yabaye iyambere mu Bwongereza gushora imari mu ikoranabuhanga. Nyuma T3 yagurishijwe ku isoko mpuzamahanga hifashishijwe uruhushya mpuzamahanga y\u2019Ubucuruzi n\u2019ishoramari mu Bwongereza gahunda iha abinjira mu mahanga amahugurwa, igenamigambi n\u2019inkunga bakeneye kugira ngo batsinde ku masoko yo hanze. "}
{"id": "20943", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20943", "title": "Footmouse", "text": "A footmouse (cyangwa imbeba y'ibirenge) ni ubwoko bw'imbeba (mouse) ya mudasobwa ibi bituma abakoresha babasha kwimura umurongo w'inkomoko (cursor) nogukanda ku ma button y'imbeba (mouse) bakoresheje amaguru yabo.\nIkoreshwa cyane cyane nabakoresha ubumuga cyangwa bafite ibibazo byinyuma-mugongo cyangwa ijosi. Itezwa imbere kandi nkuburyo bwo gukumira ibibazo nkibi mu gihe kizaza kandi nkuburyo bwo kongera umusaruro utagomba kwimura ukuboko hagati ya clavier n'imbeba. \nUbwoko.\nHariho ubwoko icumi bw'ibirenge. Ntabwo bose baboneka mubucuruzi. Ibigo bimwe byihariye bishushanya imbeba yabyo igenzura kubantu bamugaye.\nItandukaniro nyamukuru hagati yu bwoko butandukanye bw ikirenge ni pedal iringaniye iranyerera cyangwa pedal ihengamye. Hariho kandi adaptate y'imbeba ihindura imbeba isanzwe mu kirenge cyanyerera kandi gitambitse kuruhande rumwe. Ikirenge gikoresha kunyerera kirashobora kunyerera hamwe nimbeba ihujwe nayo, cyangwa ikadiri idasanzwe aho pedal ishobora kuzenguruka. Na magneti ntoya cyangwa ikindi gikoresho gishobora gukoreshwa kuri tablet. a footmouse ikoreshwa n'ikirenge ikoresha pedal, zishobora kugoreka no guhindukirira ishobora kunyeganyega cyangwa kugororoka mu cyerekezo kimwe cyangwa byinshi.Udupine dushyirwaho igitutu n\u2019ikirenge ntidufatwa nka footmouse. \nKoresha.\nGukoresha ibirenge byihuta kuruta imbeba isanzwe (intoki), kubera ko abantu benshi badafite ubushobozi buke bwo kugenda neza nibirenge n'amaguru kuruta kubiganza byabo..\u200b\u200b\u200b\nNiba ikirenge cyakoreshejwe hamwe na clavier, indanga irashobora kwimurwa mugihe wandika, ntamwanya rero wataye wo kwimura ikiganza hagati ya clavier nimbeba. Niba umuntu adashobora gukoresha clavier, clavier isanzwe kuri ecran irashobora gukoreshwa mukwandika inyandiko ukanze buri nyuguti kuri clavier ya virtual. Abantu nabo badafite ubushobozi buke kubirenge byabo no kuguru kandi badashobora gukora ibirenge birashobora rimwe na rimwe gukoresha ibintu bike kugirango bashireho indanga mu cyerekezo runaka.\nNiba ikirenge cyakoreshejwe nabi igihe kirekire, kirashobora gutera imitsi amaguru, kandi gishobora kugira ingaruka mbi kubibazo byo hepfo. [\"kubera iki?\"]\nAmateka.\nIbirenge byaboneka ku isoko ryo muri Amerika guhera mu 1985.Uwabikoze yabatezimbere icyo gihe yitwaga Versatron."}
{"id": "20944", "revid": "10947", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20944", "title": "Tactile Device", "text": "Tactile nigikoresho nyacyo cyo guhindura inyandiko kuri braille ubu irimo gutezwa imbere mu kigo cy\u2019ikoranabuhanga cya Massachusetts. Yatekerejwe nitsinda ryabanyeshuri bishyize hamwe barangije icyiciro cya mbere, bahatana nka \"Team 100% Enthusiasm\", mugihe cyamasaha 15 MIT \"hackathon\". Tactile ifite umubiri unyerera hejuru yinyandiko yanditse kandi kamera ifata amashusho yamagambo ikayohereza kuri microcontroller. Amakuru yimura pin hejuru no hepfo, ahindura inyandiko muri Braille. Iyo bigeze ku isoko twizeye ko bihendutse cyane kuruta ibikoresho bihari.\nAbagize uruhare kuri tactile.\nItsinda ry\u2019abantu batandatu bihurije hamwe rigizwe na Chandani Doshi, Grace Li, Jialin Shi, Bonnie Wang, Charlene Xia, na Tania Yu, abanyeshuri bose biga mu kigo cya MIT igihe Tactile ifunguye. Ubufatanye bufatika mu bumenyi bwa siyansi, ubukanishi n\u2019amashanyarazi, na siyanse ya mudasobwa, Tactile yakunzwe cyane n\u2019itangazamakuru [wihuse w\u2019iterambere, ndetse n\u2019abayihimbye bose bakaba ari abagore bo mu mirima ya STEM bafite umubare muto w\u2019abagore bahagarariye. \nIterambere.\nTactile itanga ibisobanuro nyabyo byumwandiko biri mururimi r wicyongereza, byafashwe na kamera ihuriweho, muri braille ihindagurika kuburyo bugaragara. Igicuruzwa cyanyuma nukwerekana inyuguti 36 za braille icyarimwe kuri Imigaragarire [icyitonderwa 1] hamwe nigiciro cyagenewe kugurishwa hafi US $ 100. Hamwe nibikoresho bisanzwe byerekana braille bigurwa hagati y $ 1.500 kugeza $ 2,500, Tactile yaranzwe nk \"\" kwaduka kwinshi imbere y\u2019abatabona. \" \nItsinda rya Tactile ryahawe inkunga y'amadorari y'amafaranga ya Amerika 10,000 $ muri MIT IDEAS Global Challenge kandi yemerwa muri Porogaramu ya Microsoft Patent, ahabwa inkunga n'abajyanama mu by'amategeko na Microsoft kugira ngo basabe kurinda patenti muri Amerika. Gusaba kwatanzwe ku ya 16 Nzeri 2016, kuri ubu bikaba bifite ipatanti itegereje. "}
{"id": "20945", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20945", "title": "STS relay", "text": "Serivisi ya STS ni serivisi yo kuvuga imvugo itanga serivisi kubantu bose bahamagara kuri terefone cyangwa abahamagaye bafite ubumuga bwo kutavuga ndetse nabashaka kuvugana nabo. \nMuri Amerika.\n\"STS Relay\" iboneka binyuze kuri 711 muri Amerika binyuze muri Serivisi ishinzwe Itumanaho; muguhamagara kuri terefone, banza uhamagare 711, hanyuma ubaze STS. Umufasha witumanaho wamenyerejwe azakubaza numero ushaka guhamagara. uwakwakiriye azasubiramo ibyo umuhamagaye ufite ubumuga bwo kutavuga. Umuhamagaye ashobora gusubiza. Umufasha witumanaho \"azasubiramo\" ubutumwa bwumuhamagaye. Hamagara noneho yitaba muri ubu buryo butatu bwafashijwe kuganira kuri terefone.\nMu bindi bihugu.\nSerivisi iboneka mu gihugu cya Ositaraliya, na Suwede, no mu bindi bihugu hashingiwe ku igeragezwa. STS Itanga kuri PSTN (umuyoboro wa terefone uhinduranya rubanda) irahari kubakeneye ubufasha bwo guhamagara kuri terefone kubera ubumuga bwo kutavuga.\nAmateka.\nSTS Relay yabonetse bwa mbere muri Amerika muri Californiya, mu 1997; serivisi yabonetse ku rwego rw'igihugu ku ya 1 Werurwe 2001.\nKu ya 12 Gicurasi 2006, kaminuza ya Wisconsin - Madison yahaye Robert Z. Segalman, impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga (UW 1972), impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga y'icyubahiro kubera umurimo yakoze mu guhanga Speech To Speech."}
{"id": "20946", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20946", "title": "Systems Figaro", "text": "Figaro Systems, Inc. nisosiyete y'abanyamerika itanga icyicaro hamwe na sisitemu yo kwitwa titre hamwe na sisitemu yububiko bwa opera hamwe nibindi bibuga byerekana imiziki ku isi. Isosiyete ifite icyicaro i Santa Fe, muri New Mexico. Yashinzwe mu 1993 na Patrick Markle, Geoff Webb, na Ron Erkman kandi ni yo sosiyete ya mbere yatanze ikoranabuhanga ryifashisha rituma abantu ku giti cyabo, icyarimwe, bavuga indimi nyinshi ndetse no gusoma- libretto -basomera abumva. \nAmateka.\nSisitemu ya Figaro yakuze mu kiganiro mu 1992 hagati ya batatu bakorana na opera: Patrick Markle, icyo gihe Umuyobozi w\u2019umusaruro wa Santa Fe Opera, Geoffrey Webb, Umushakashatsi w\u2019ibishushanyo mbonera bya Metropolitan i New York, na Ronald Erkman, wari umutekinisiye wa Met. Muri kiriya gihe, amazu ya opera yari afite uburyo bubiri bwo kwerekana libretto hamwe na subtitles y'ibiganiro: projection kuri ecran nini hejuru ya stage cyangwa kuri ecran ntoya muri theatre. Ubusanzwe, ubusobanuro bwayo bwari mu rurimi rumwe. \nItegeko ry\u2019Abanyamerika bafite ubumuga ryo mu 1990 ryari rimaze gushyirwaho; Markle yagerageje gukemura ikibazo cy'ahantu hatandukanye hatabaga hagenewe kwakira abantu bafite ubumuga, harimo nabatumva neza. Markle, Webb, na Erkman bakoze igishushanyo mbonera (prototype) cya mbere cy\u2019icyicaro cy\u2019umuntu ku giti cye maze John Crosby, icyo gihe wari Umuyobozi mukuru wa Santa Fe Opera,yabonye ko icyo gitekerezo cyagira akamaro kubantu bareba opera. Markle, Webb, na Erkman barushijeho gushimangirwa no gusobanukirwa uruhare rw\u2019ikoranabuhanga mu gukemura inzitizi z\u2019umubiri abantu bahura nazo, ku isi hose, zibabuza cyangwa zikabangmira uburyo babona ibikorwa by'ubugeni n'imyidagaduro ibonwa n'amaso. Markle, Webb, na Erkman basabye kandi bahabwa patenti kubyo bahimbye. \nUmugiraneza n'umushoramari Alberto Vilar yabaze sisitemu ya Figaro mubigo yari afite abanyamigabane benshi. Yatanze sisitemu ya elegitoroniki ya libretto yikigo muburayi harimo na Royal Opera House i Londres, Teatro degli Arcimboldi ya La Scala i Milan mu Butaliyani, Gran Teatre del Liceu i Barcelona, Espanye, na Wiener Staatsoper i Wien muri Otirishiya. Kubera kunanirwa kwishyura impano yasezeranijwe, amenshi muri ayo masosiyete yatakaje amafaranga.\nMu 2005, Met yashinjaga isosiyete ya New Mexico gukoresha izina ryayo mu buryo butemewe n'amategeko mu kwamamaza \"Simultext, sisitemu uregwa avuga ko ishobora kwerekana icyarimwe cya opera kuko kibera kuri stage kandi ko uregwa yari ahagarariye ko sisitemu yayo yashyizwe kuri Met.\" \nIbicuruzwa n'ikoranabuhanga.\nIbicuruzwa by'asosiyete bizwi muburyo butandukanye nkicyicaro cyinyuma, surtitles, sisitemu ya libretto ya elegitoronike ya opera, amazina ateganijwe, hamwe nubusobanuro bwa libretto.\nIbibuga bya Opera byakoresheje sisitemu yo kwerekana librettos mucyongereza, Igifaransa, Ikidage, Ubutaliyani, Ikiyapani, Ikimandare, Ikirusiya, n'Icyesipanyoli nubwo porogaramu ituma gusoma libretto mu rurimi urwo ari rwo rwose rwanditse. Ubusobanuro butangwa na ecran imwe na sisitemu yo gutanga kuri buri muntu. \nMubisanzwe, ariko ntabwo mubihe byose, sisitemu yashizwe burundu inyuma yumurongo wintebe. Buri ecran ihagaze kuburyo inyandiko igaragara neza kuri buri muntu uyikoresha. Iyerekanwa ryabanje kuboneka muri vacuum fluorescent yerekana (VFD) hanyuma, mu 2000, ikoreshwa rya flux-kristu (LCD). Mu 2004 ibyerekanwe byabonetse hamwe na ecran ya diode (OLED). Buri bwoko bwerekana amakuru amwe hamwe na progaramu ya annotasiyo kumirongo umunani icyarimwe, ishobora kuzimya uyikoresha, kandi ikoreshwa nabakoresha na buto imwe. Porogaramu ishoboye gushyigikira ibibuga 'sisitemu zihari kimwe na sisitemu ya Figaro' \"Simultext\". Porogaramu ituma umurongo wa buri murongo uko uririmbwa, kandi igaragara ako kanya kuri ecran. \nIsosiyete yubaka sisitemu yuzuye harimo na ecran yayo idafite intoki kubakoresha badashobora gukoresha sisitemu yo kwicara, urugero abantu bari mu magare y\u2019ibimuga, bashobora kuba bareba opera mu bice bidafite aho bicara, cyangwa abantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona.\nIbibuga.\nMuri Amerika, sisitemu y\u2019isosiyete ikoreshwa mu nzu ya Opera Caulkins [Kolorado, Opera ya Santa Fe muri Santa Fe, Des Moines Metro Opera muri Des Moines, Iowa, na Lyric Opera yo mu mujyi wa Kansas, Missouri. \nMu Bwongereza no mu Burayi, sisitemu zashyizwe mu bibuga birimo Royal Opera House i Londres, Teatro alla Scala na Teatro degli Arcimboldi ya La Scala i Milan mu Butaliyani, Gran Teatre del Liceu i Barcelona, Espanye, na Wiener Staatsoper i Wien, Otirishiya. \nIbihembo.\nMu 2001, isosiyete yatsindiye igihembo cya Los Alamos Laboratories 'Technology Commercialization Award kubera sisitemu ya Simultext. \nMu mwaka wa 2008, porogaramu y\u2019isosiyete yari umwe mu bane bahatanira igihembo cy\u2019indashyikirwa muri porogaramu z'ubucuruzi zatanzwe na New Mexico Technology Technology and Software Association. [\"citation ikenewe\"]"}
{"id": "20947", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20947", "title": "JP1 kure", "text": "JP1 ya kure ni ubwoko bwa kure ya rusange, mubisanzwe hamwe na pin-esheshatu ihuza interineti yanditseho \"JP1\" mubice bya batiri, byakozwe na Universal Electronics Inc. Imiterere ya JP1 yemerera kure gusubiramo porogaramu, ukongeraho urutonde rushya r'wimikorere. Abakunzi b'imikino yo murugo bakoresha JP1 kugirango birinde ubusaza.\nHafi ya JP1 ishobora gukora ibikorwa byiterambere nko gusubiramo urufunguzo na macros. Moderi zimwe zishobora kuvugururwa ukoresheje terefone kugirango wongereho urutonde rushya. \nJP1 Igenzura rya kure.\nJP1 zose zikozwe na Universal Electronics, Inc.\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200bzicuruza modeli zitandukanye binyuze muri One For All izina ryubucuruzi kandi igakwirakwiza remote kuba koresha elegitoronike nka Radio Shack,Sony, na Sky hamwe na North American cables TV batanga na Comcast, Rogers, Cox, Shaw, Charter na Time Warner.\nKu mbaho zicapye zanditseho ikimenyetso \"JP1\" ni impfunyapfunyo ya \"Jumper 1\", ni ukuvuga uwambere (kandi kuri kure cyane, \"wenyine\") usimbuka ku kibaho. Nyuma moderi yanditseho \"JP1.x\", aho \"x\" ari 1, 2, 3 cyangwa 4 bitewe n'ubwoko bwa processor yakoreshejwe. Kubireba bishya, ikirango \"JP2\" cyakoreshejwe.\nMbere JP1 yumuzunguruko wibishushanyo ukoresha chip ya memoire ya EEPROM. Nyuma ibishushanyo bikoreshwa bitunganya hamwe na flash yibuka.\nImigaragarire.\nUmugozi wa JP1 uhuza JP1 ya kure na PC, ifasha PC gusoma no kwandika kububiko bwa kure bwabakoresha. Igishushanyo cyo guhuza icyambu kibangikanye, icyambu cyangwa USB ihuza imiyoboro itandukanye ya JP1 iboneka kubuntu, kandi abacuruzi benshi batanga insinga zubatswe mbere. JP1.x na JP2 bya kure ntibishobora gutegurwa hamwe nuburyo bwa kera bwa JP1, izi remote zishobora gutegurwa hifashishijwe insinga za FTDI ziteguye, aho hagomba gusimburwa gusa umuhuza. \nKuvugurura JP1 Remote ukoresheje interineti.\nAmakuru na software muri JP1 igenzura kure bishobora kuvugururwa no kwagurwa ukoresheje umugozi wa interineti uhujwe na PC ukoresheje porogaramu ya software yitwa RemoteMaster, cyangwa RMIR. Kuvugurura no kwaguka birimo amakuru mashya ya code yamakuru, protocole nshya ya IR, kanda yambere, na macros. \nNicola Salmoria yavumbuye uburyo bwo kongeramo imirimo mishya yandika software \"Abaguzi\" (protocole isimbuza JP1 ya kure yo gutunganya ibintu). Abaguzi bashobora guterwa nubushobozi bwa JP1 bwa kure bwibikoresho. bisanzwe byo kwagura ibintu birimo uburebure bwa macro; kubahiriza byihuse; macros; na urufunguzo rurerure kanda (LKP) - aho urufunguzo rukora ibikorwa bitandukanye bitewe nigihe rumaze.\nPorogaramu.\nHari software zitandukanye. Porogaramu yibanze muburyo bworoshye yemerera imikorere yibanze ya kure kuvugururwa hifashishijwe PC. Iremera kandi gushiraho ibikoresho bishya, protocole hamwe no kwaguka, nubwo ibi byakozwe bitandukanye kandi bigasubirwamo muri pake yibanze. Iyemerera kandi iboneza rya kure ryose kugenzurwa no kubikwa nkamadosiye kuri PC kugirango agabanye cyangwa \"cloni\" igenzura kure.\nPorogaramu zuzuzanya na pake y'ibanze ikubiyemo imikorere nko gukora ibikoresho bishya, gukora protocole nshya, guteranya indimi ziteranirizo zabatunganya mugucunga kure, no gusesengura ibimenyetso byize kubigenzura bya kure kugirango bishoboke inkunga ya protocole yubatswe kugirango igenzure ibikoresho bishya.\nMu Kwakira 2000, mu nama ya \"Rusange Yumuguzi Rusange\" \"ya kure\", abakunzi ba elegitoroniki Dan \"HW Hackr\" Nelson na Rob Crowe bakoze uburyo umuhuza wa JP1 wakoreshwa mugusuzuma no guhindura icyo gice cy'ibikoresho byigenzura rya kure birimo amakuru yimiterere yabakoresha nibikoresho bigezweho. Hobbyist bashoboye guhindura injeniyeri imiterere yaka gace ko kwibuka, hanyuma bavumbura uburyo bwuko bakoresha ibishya. Ihuriro rya JP1 rya kure ryagutse kuri uwo murimo, kandi rikomeza kuba umwanya wambere wubuvumbuzi bwo gukoresha imikorere mishya ya JP1. \nKode y'imikorere yaguye (EFC).\nMbere kwisi yose igenzura yakoresheje igikoresho kode / protocole nimero hamwe nimibare itatu yaguye yimikorere ya kodegisi ya porogaramu ikoresheje kure yonyine, cyangwa binyuze muri JP1. Ibi rimwe na rimwe bifasha kugenzura kure kwisi yose bitegurwa kugirango ikoreshe imirimo yinyongera ishobora kuba itaraboneka no kubikoresho byumwimerere byakozwe nabashinzwe kugenzura kure. Mugenzuzi nyuma, iyi code yimikorere yaguwe kugeza muburebure bwimibare itanu.\nHariho igikoresho gifasha mugushakisha aya ma code yashizweho kurubuga rwa JP1, kandi kode yinyongera nayo irashobora kuboneka mubisanzwe bigenzurwa nabashinzwe kugenzura kure hamwe no kubitanga.\nKera UEI Igenzura rya kure.\nYamamoto Inc. Yatanze kandi urukurikirane rwambere rwo kugenzura kwisi yose, bigaragazwa nubugenzuzi bwiburayi bwitwa 'Big Easy'. Igenzura rishobora gukora ibikoresho bigera kuri bine byabaguzi, hamwe na protocole hamwe na code zisanzwe zigarukira kuri TV, satelite analogue na VCR. Nyamara, bamwe mubakira kwisi hamwe nabakinnyi ba DVD bakoresha protocole ishaje hamwe na code ya code, mubisanzwe iyakoreshwaga mbere muri analogue yakira. Ibi bivuze ko igenzura rya kera rishobora kuba ingirakamaro. Igenzura rya kure muri iki gicuruzwa rishobora kumenyekana mubusanzwe hariho amaso atatu yo gutangiza porogaramu muri bateri. Kode yo gusubiramo porogaramu ya kure irashobora gushyirwaho muburyo bwa algorithm, ishobora gukururwa kubuntu kandi igakoreshwa mugushakisha uburyo bwagutse bwo kugenzura. \nKanda.\nJP1 yamenyekanishijwe ku Itangazamakuru ryigenga rya Detroit n'ikinyamakuru Nuts na Volts. "}
{"id": "20948", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20948", "title": "Induction loop", "text": "Induction cyangwa inductive loop ni itumanaho rya elegitoroniki ya magnetiki cyangwa sisitemu yo gukoresha rukuruzi cyangwa umuyagankuba uhinduranya kugirango utere amashanyarazi mumashanyarazi yegeranye. Induction izenguruka ikoreshwa mugukwirakwiza no kwakira ibimenyetso byitumanaho, cyangwa mugushakisha ibyuma muribimwe mubyuma byerekana ibinyabiziga bihari. Ikoreshwa rya kijyambere mugukoresha induction ni ugutanga ubufasha bwo kumva kubakoresha agakoresho kabafasha kumva kitwa bumva.\nPorogaramu.\nKumenya ibinyabiziga.\nIbinyabiziga byerekana ibinyabiziga, byitwa \"indective-loop traffic detector\", birashobora kumenya ibinyabiziga byanyuze cyangwa bigera ahantu runaka, urugero nko kwegera itara cyangwa mumodoka. Ikizunguruka, gikoresha amashanyarazi gishyizwe muri kaburimbo. Igice cya elegitoroniki gikoresha imbaraga zumuriro wamashanyarazi kumurongo kuri 10\u00a0k Hz kugeza 200\u00a0kHz, bitewe nurugero. Sisitemu ya inductive-loop yitwara nkumuzunguruko w'amashanyarazi uhuza aho insinga ya loop na lead-in insinga ari ibintu byinjira. Iyo ikinyabiziga kinyuze hejuru yumuzingo cyangwa gihagaritswe mumuzingo, bimwe mubikoresho byikinyabiziga byongera ubudahangarwa bwumuzingo, nko gushyiramo icyuma murayomashanyarazi. Nyamara, icyuma cya periferique yikinyabiziga kigira ingaruka zinyuranye kuri inductance kubera imigezi ya eddy zikorwa. Kugabanuka kwa inductance kuva kumurongo wa eddy kuruta guhagarika kwiyongera kuva mubwinshi bwa moteri ya moteri, kandi net ni igabanuka rusange muri inductance ya loop wire. Kugabanuka kwa inductance bikunda kugabanya inzitizi zamashanyarazi zinsimburangingo. Kugabanuka kwa impedance ikora ibikoresho bya elegitoroniki bisohoka cyangwa ibintu bikomeye bitandukanijwe neza, byohereza kumugenzuzi wibimenyetso byumuhanda bisobanura kunyura cyangwa kutanyura bitewe nuko kuba hari ikinyabiziga. \nImiterere ya parikingi yimodoka ishobora gukoresha ibizunguruka kugirango ikurikirane urujya n'uruza (imyanya) yinjira cyangwa isohoka cyangwa ishobora gukoreshwa namarembo yinjira cyangwa sisitemu yo kugurisha kugirango umenye ibinyabiziga mugihe abandi bakoresha ubuyobozi bwa parikingi hamwe na sisitemu yamakuru. Gari ya moshi ishobora gukoresha induction kugirango imenye inzira ya gari ya moshi zanyuze ahantu runaka, nk'inzira ya elegitoroniki.\nImiterere itagaragara ya loop isobanura ko ibyuma bito bito bidashobora gukurura relay. Nibyiza kuberako umuzingo udatanga umusaruro mwinshi cyane \"ibinyoma byiza\" (vuga, kurugero, numunyamaguru wambukiranya umufuka wuzuye impinduka zicyuma). Nubwo bimeze bityo ariko, rimwe na rimwe bisobanura kandi ko amagare, ibimoteri, na moto bihagarara aho bihurira bishobora kutamenyekana (bityo rero ibyago bikaba byirengagizwa na switch / signal). Imirongo myinshi ishobora guhindurwa nintoki kugirango ihore imenya ahari ibimoteri na moto. Ibihugu byinshi byo muri Amerika byashyizeho amategeko \"yapfuye atukura\" yemerera izo modoka kunyura mu \"kimenyetso\"] [yigihe runaka iyo loop itabimenye. \nIbyiciro by'ibinyabiziga.\nInductance loop nayo yakoreshejwe mugushira ubwoko bwimodoka. Gutoranya ikizunguruka kumurongo mwinshi bivamo umukono wihariye kuri buri kinyabiziga cyemerera gutondekanya ubwoko bwumubiri. \nIcyuma.\nUbundi bwoko bwa \"induction loop\" bukoreshwa mubyuma byerekana ibyuma, aho igiceri kinini, kigize igice cyumuzunguruko, gishobora \"gutandukanwa\" nuburyo igiceri cyegereye ikintu kiyobora. Ikintu cyamenyekanye gishobora kuba icyuma (icyuma na kabili cyerekana) cyangwa kiyobora / ubushobozi (studio / cavity detection). Ibindi bikoresho byibi bikoresho bikoresha ibiceri bibiri cyangwa byinshi byakira, kandi ikintu cyamenyekanye gihindura guhuza inductive cyangwa bigahindura inguni ya fonction ya voltage yatewe mumashanyarazi yakira ugereranije na coil oscillator.\nIkimenyetso cyerekana anti-submarine n'igikoresho cyakoreshwaga mu kumenya ubwato bw\u2019amazi n\u2019ubwato bwo hejuru hifashishijwe insinga zashizwe mu mazi zidasanzwe zahujwe na galvanometero. \nIjwi.\nIjwi ryinjiza amajwi, rizwi kandi nka loop yo kumva, ritanga ubufasha kubakoresha ubufasha bwo kumva. Sisitemu ifite imirongo imwe cyangwa myinshi mukarere umukoresha wumva yaba ahari. Induction loop yakira mubisanzwe ni ntoya cyane ya inductor (telecoil). Sisitemu isanzwe ikoreshwa na analog power amplifier ihuye na impedance yo hasi yo kohereza. Ihererekanyabubasha risanzwe aho kuba hejuru cyangwa guhindurwa kubitwara, nubwo sisitemu y'imiyoboro myinshi yashyizwe mubikorwa hakoreshejwe modulation. Ibikoresho byinshi byumva birimo itumanaho ryemerera uyikoresha kwakira no kumva umurima wa magneti no gukuraho ibimenyetso bisanzwe byamajwi byatanzwe kurubuga rwa mikoro yo kumva. \nKubera ko nta \"tuning\" ihari, nkuko itumanaho rifata mu buryo butumvikanisha amajwi yose ya magnetiki yumurongo wa magneti, hakenewe igishushanyo mbonera cya sisitemu aho hakoreshwa inshuro zirenze imwe zikoreshwa mu nyubako kugirango bifasheb kurushaho; kurugero, inzu yimikino ya firime yegeranye cyangwa salle yigisha cyangwa ahandi hose hafunganye. Itumanaho rishobora kandi gufata urusaku ruvuye ahantu hatari amajwi nkumurongo wamashanyarazi, amatara, cyangwa monitor ya CRT."}
{"id": "20949", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20949", "title": "Switch adapted toys", "text": "Switch adapted toys ni ibikinisho cyangwa ibikoresho byahujwe kuburyo bahinduye umwimerere berekejwe kuri nini nini yo hanze yorohereza uyikoresha. Abana benshi n'abakuze bafite ubumenyi buke mikorere y'imikino n'ingingo, ntibashobora gukina n'udukino dukoresha amabuye y'amashanyarazi. \nKu bana cyangwa urubyiruko rufite ubumuga bukomeye kandi bubangamiye cyane mu mikorere y\u2019umubiri no mu mitekerere, gukoresha igikinisho cyahinduriwe uburyo bwo kugenzura n' akabuto bishobora kuba ari cyo kintu cya mbere bakora ku giti cyabo. Ibi bibubakira icyizere, bibaha ibyishimo, kandi bigatuma batekereza ko bigira ubushobozi bwo kwiga ibintu bishya.\nIbiranga Guhindura Ibiranga.\nUkurikije ubushobozi bwumukoresha, ibintu bitandukanye birahari kubikorwa bitandukanye, harimo: guhinduranya urutoki, guhinduranya ibirenge no guhinduranya buto y'ubunini butandukanye. Abahindura bamwe bafite ibifuniko byihariye - imyenda yoroshye, \"squishy\" latex, pom pom, cyangwa \"bump\" ishushanyije kubantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona. Gukoresha ibintu byahinduwe biterwa n'imikoreshereze y'imitsi y'umukoresha, kwihuta, ubushobozi bwo kubona, imikorere yubwenge n'inyungu. Ibikinisho bihinduwe kugira ngo bikorwe n'udufunguzo byihariye bishobora gutanga amatara amurika cyangwa ahindagurika ndetse n'umuziki, kuvuga, kunyeganyega, urusaku, abafana, aromatherapy, massage, indirimbo zifite nimero, inyuguti cyangwa pepiniyeri injyana yinjyana ndetse no gufata amajwi no gukina.\nHindura ibikinisho byahujwe muri Amerika.\nHafi ya byose byahinduwe bikinisha ibikinisho nibikoresho ni ibintu bishobora kugurwa mububiko kandi bigahuzwa nyuma yisoko nabantu nimiryango. Abantu bamwe bagurisha ibyo bintu byahinduwe kumurongo binyuze kubacuruzi nka Etsy, Amazon, na Shopify. Ibigo bimwe binini nabyo bigurisha ibyo bikoresho kimwe nibikoresho byihariye bigenewe kuvura.\nHindura ibikinisho byahujwe muri Ositaraliya.\nAbatanga ibicuruzwa benshi babaho muri Ositaraliya ariko bakoresha ibikinisho bitumizwa mu mahanga byahinduwe bivuze ko ibikinisho bihenze kugura. Amasomero y'ibikinisho nk'isanduku ya Nowa i Perth, Uburengerazuba bwa Ositaraliya ibitse ibikinisho byinshi byahinduwe kugirango imiryango ishobore kuguza kugirango ishakishe ubwoko bwiza bwa switch hamwe nibikinisho bishimishije kubana babo.\nAmasomero y'ibikinisho atumiza ibintu byahinduwe bikinishwa cyangwa bifite abafasha bitangiye imirimo bashoboye gufata bateri isanzwe ikoreshwa kandi ikayihindura kugirango ihindurwe. Ibikinisho bifite imikorere imwe gusa birahagije kugirango bihindurwe ariko biragoye, ibikinisho byinshi bikora ntibishobora kuba byoroshye. Guhuza igikinisho cya batiri murugo birashobora kugerwaho ukoresheje umubare muto wibikoresho.\nUrupapuro rwo gutera inkunga imbaga Ibikinisho kuri Tots binyuze muri Cerebral Palsy Alliance ibaho kugirango itange amafaranga akenewe mugutanga ibikinisho byahinduwe byahinduwe kugirango bikoreshwe mumasomero menshi yabigenewe yo muri Perth, atangiza gahunda itanga ibikinisho kubana bujuje ibisabwa ahantu hegereye amazu yabo.\nKwiga uburyo bwo guhindura imiterere.\nImfashanyigisho yo guhindura imihindagurikire y'ikirere yashyizweho na Greg Nakata, AIA yitwa \"Reka duhuze na bose!\". Umwanditsi ni umubyeyi wumwana ufite ubumuga kandi yize uburyo bwo kubahindura ibikinisho bya adapt. Guhindura uburyo bwo guhuza ibikorwa byerekana ibikoresho byose hamwe nibikoresho umuntu yakenera gutangira guhuza ibikinisho nibikoresho kimwe ninyigisho zirambuye kubwoko bwibikinisho kugirango ahuze. Nakata ashyira kandi amashusho ahuza amashusho yinyandiko kumurongo wa Instagram: AdaptedDesign aho intego ye ari iyo gutuma imenyekanisha ryoroha kubantu bose mugusangira ubumenyi no kwerekana inzira.\nHariho kandi umurongo wa interineti werekana uburyo bwo guhuza ibikinisho kugirango uhindure ibintu, nka TheLaserguy2 ya \"Santa's Switch Adapted Toys\". "}
{"id": "20950", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20950", "title": "Switch access scanning", "text": "Switch access scanning ni tekinike cyangwa uburyo guhitamo butaziguye bukoresha buto bwihariye, bwifashishwa n'abakoresha ikoranabuhanga ribafasha kuvuga cyangwa kuganira. (AAC), kugirango bahitemo ibintu bivuye mu rwego rwo guhitamo. Igipimo cyo gusikana kinyura mu bintu werekana buri kintu kuri ecran (ni ukuvuga, scanning visual), cyangwa mugutangaza buri kintu ukoresheje amajwi asohoka (nukuvuga, gusikana amajwi), hanyuma uyikoresha agakora switch kugirango ahitemo ikintu. Umuvuduko nuburyo bwo gusikana, kimwe nuburyo ibintu byatoranijwe, byashyizwe mubushobozi bwumubiri, amashusho nubwenge bwumukoresha. Mugihe hashobora kubaho impamvu zitandukanye zo gukoresha scanne, ibisanzwe ni ubumuga bwumubiri bigatuma igabanuka rya moteri kugirango uhitemo neza. Itumanaho mugihe cyo gusikana riratinda kandi ridakorwa neza kuruta guhitamo no gusikana bisaba ubuhanga bwo kumenya (urugero, kwitondera). Gukoresha ikoranabuhanga rishingiye ku buryo bwa \"scanning\" bifasha umuntu kugira ubwigenge mu gukoresha ibikoresho bimufasha, cyane cyane ku bafite gusa igice kimwe gishobora kugenda ku bushake. \nUburyo bwo Gusikana.\nA scanning pattern yerekana uburyo ibintu biri mu itsinda rihitwamo bishyirwaho imbere y'umukoresha. Bituma guhitamo ibintu byoroha kuko uburyo bwo gusaka bukorwa mu buryo butunganye kandi bworoshye gusobanukirwa. Uburyo butatu bwo gusikana burahari ni:\nUbuhanga bwo kugenzura.\nIgenzura rya scan hamwe nibintu byatoranijwe bibaho binyuze muri enterineti muburyo butatu:"}
{"id": "20951", "revid": "10947", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20951", "title": "Stenomask", "text": "Stenomask ni mikoro ifatwa muntoki ikaba yarashyizwe mugikuta mwimbere kugirango itangire amajwi, ihuza umunwa cyangwa izuru n'umunwa. Impapuro zimwe zoroheje zishobora gushyirwaho umukandara wo mu ijosi kugirango ufate umwanya mugihe urekura amaboko yumukoresha kubindi bikorwa. Intego ya stenomask nukwemerera umuntu kuvuga atumviswe nabandi bantu, no kurinda urusaku rwimbere kure ya mikoro.\nStenomask ni ingirakamaro mu kumenyekanisha imvugo, kubera ko itanga amajwi. umumaro wayo munini nuko igabanya amajwi kugirango atabangamira abantu bahegereye nkurukiko cyangwa ishuri. Umukoresha arashobora kuvuga mumvugo, kwerekana ibimenyetso nibisubizo bitavuzwe, no gusobanura ibikorwa uko bikorwa. \nUkoresha stenomask ashobora gutozwa kongera jwi ibyo bumvise byose muri stenomask ihujwe na sisitemu yo kumenyekanisha imvugo, kugirango yandike inyandiko nyayo yibintu byose byavuzwe. Ibi bituma \" umwanditsi wijwi \" atanga ibyokurya byihuse mukibanza cyurukiko kandi akabikwirakwiza muburyo bworoshye bwanditse nyuma yo gukomeza. Ibikoresho birashobora kandi guhuza na software yo gucunga imanza.\nAmateka.\nStenomask yakozwe na Horace Webb na bagenzi be babiri mu ntangiriro ya 1940. Yari umuhanga mu magambo ahinnye ya Gregg, ariko yashakishije uburyo bunoze kandi bwihuse bwo kwandukura abantu, kubera amagambo make kandi azimije ashobora gucungwa n'abavuga vuba cyangwa imvugo igoye. Byongeye kandi, kugeza porogaramu yo kumenyekanisha imvugo ibaye impamo bihagije kugirango ikoreshwe buri munsi hagati ya za 90, abanyamakuru bigufi bavugaga mu magambo amagambo yanditsemo inyandiko mvugo yandikwa, bikavamo amasaha agera kuri abiri yandika kuri buri saha.\nRero, Webb yatekereje ko ashobora \"kubisubiramo nijwi ryanjye aho gukoresha ikaramu\". Nyuma yubushakashatsi bwinshi yari yarakoranye na bagenzi be yabanje gukoresha agasanduku k'itabi hanyuma akoresha n'umutobe w'inyanya urashobora - yageze ku gisubizo akoresheje mikoro imbere ya masikeri ya ogisijeni ya gisirikare ya rubber ya ogisijeni, ahujwe n'inkono ya kawa yuzuyemo ibintu bikurura amajwi. Igisubizo cyaje gufatwa n\u2019ingabo z\u2019Amerika zirwanira mu mazi ko ari bwo buryo nyabwo bwo kwandukura abantu muri \"sisitemu zose zizwi zo gutanga raporo mu magambo\", hanyuma zemezwa gukoreshwa muri raporo z\u2019urukiko. "}
{"id": "20952", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20952", "title": "Switch access", "text": "Switch access ni uburyo bwo gukoresha buto imwe cyangwa nyinshi mu gutunganya mudasobwa nibindi bikoresho, kandi bikoreshwa ahanini n'abantu bafite ubumuga bukomeye bw'umubiri cyangwa bw'imitekerereze. Guhindura ni igikoresho cyikoranabuhanga gifasha gisimbuza icyifuzo cyo gukoresha clavier ya mudasobwa cyangwa imbeba. Irashobora kwemerera abakoresha kugenzura mudasobwa, intebe y\u2019ibimuga, umukino wimikino ya videwo, tablet, terefone, igikinisho, nibindi bikoresho bitandukanye bya elegitoroniki.\nUbwoko bwa switch.\nSwitches tuza muburyo butandukanye bw'imiterere n'ingano, bitewe n'uburyo dukorwamo kugira ngo dukore (nka sip-puff, gusunika, gukurura, gukanda, guhumbya cyangwa gukanda). Guhindura(switches) nabyo biratandukanye mumabara yabyo hamwe nubwiza. Kubisunika cyangwa gukanda kuri switch, ingano yingufu zisabwa kugirango zikoreshe ziratandukanye cyangwa mubihe bimwe na bimwe birashobora guhinduka. Guhindura bimwe bishobora gusaba gukoraho gusa (ntanubwo ari imashini), bimwe bishobora kuba byarateguwe gukubitwa imigeri. Ihindura irashobora gukoreshwa nigice cyumubiri gishobora kubyara kugenda kandi kubushake. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nGuhuza icyuma.\nIhindura ntishobora gucomeka muri mudasobwa. Ahubwo, Guhindura Interineti birasabwa gukemura icyuho kiri hagati ya switch na USB ya mudasobwa, serial, cyangwa icyambu cya PS / 2. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nNiki gishobora kugerwaho hamwe na switch.\nGuhindura birashobora kuba byiza kubantu bafite ibibazo byubwenge, gutinda kwiterambere no kugarukira kumubiri. Muburyo bworoshye gukoresha ni inzira isobanutse kandi yoroshye yo kwerekana ibikorwa / reaction bakunze kwita nkimpamvu n'ingaruka. Mugukoresha cyane, birashobora kuba uburyo bwo kugenzura kugenda cyangwa gukorana nibidukikije. Hariho ibikorwa bitandukanye byo guhinduranya ibikorwa bishobora gukoreshwa mugusuzuma no guteza imbere imyumvire yumuntu guhitamo nigihe.\nGuhindura birashobora guhuzwa nibikoresho bitandukanye, kurugero: Ibikoresho byogutumanaho nubundi buryo bwitumanaho, guhinduranya ibikinisho byahujwe, guhinduranya interineti kugirango ubone mudasobwa, iDevices, Ikoranabuhanga rya SMART, ibikoresho byibyumba byumviro nibikoresho bigenzura ibidukikije. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nHindura ubwoko.\nUmubare muto wimikoranire ishobora gutangwa na switch ni binary switch yinjiza, kuko gufata hasi kumwanya mugihe runaka bishobora kuba bidashoboka kubikoresho byo guswera no guswera cyangwa kubabaza umuntu urwaye rubagimpande. Abakoresha bamwe bazahitamo gukoresha switch imwe, abandi bahitamo gukoresha bibiri rimwe na rimwe birenze. Kubakoresha bakoresha sisitemu zabo kugirango bagere kubikorwa byoroheje byongeweho bizana amahitamo yo guhitamo. Iyemerera kandi abakoresha babiri gukorera hamwe cyangwa gukina hagati yabo. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nUrebye uburyo bwinshi bwo guhinduranya ni ngombwa kubakoresha kugera kubikorwa byinshi byiterambere binyuze muri scan yogusuzuma. Ibi mubisanzwe bigenwa nubushobozi bwabo bwumubiri. Guhindura kimwe bisaba kugenzura bike kumubiri kandi mubisanzwe birarambiranye kubigeraho ariko bigabanya uburyo bwo gusikana kandi mubisanzwe biganisha ku gipimo cyihuta cyo kwinjiza. Gusikana inshuro imwe bisaba kandi kwibanda cyane. Ibice bibiri-bisikana bishoboza urutonde rwo gusikana, harimo umurongo-na-nkingi na overcan. Ibi birashobora kongera cyane umuvuduko wo kwinjiza amakuru kandi bigatuma gukoresha mudasobwa cyangwa ibikoresho by'ikoranabuhanga bifasha biba byoroshye kandi byihuse. [\"citation ikenewe\"]"}
{"id": "20953", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20953", "title": "Standing Wheelchair", "text": "Standing Wheelchair ni igare kandi rikaba rizwi nkintebe kuko ifasha abafite ubumuga mukuba bajya ahantu hatandukanye inafite abamni tekinoroji ifasha, isa n'ikadiri ihagaze, ituma umukoresha w\u2019ibimuga azamura intebe kuva yicaye kugeza aho ihagaze. Intebe yimuga ihagaze ishyigikira umuntu mumwanya uhagaze kandi igafasha imikoranire nabantu nibintu kurwego rwamaso.\nimiterere ni mikoreshereze ya Standing Wheelchair.\nMugihe bose bafite imikorere yibanze, hari byinshi bitandukanye kuriyi ntebe cyanga igare ryitwa Standing Wheelchair. Nibikoresho bifasha, intebe zihagaze zakozwe mbere na mbere ukurikije ibyo abakoresha baryo bakeneye. Uburyo bwo guterura bwinjizwamo bushobora gukoreshwa nintoki cyangwa gukoreshwa nibikoresho bya hydraulic bigereranya imbaraga. Ibiziga birashobora kandi gukoreshwa nimbaraga cyangwa intoki. Amavuta akoreshwa mubyuma bikoreshwa mubikorwa kugirango habeho kuringaniza kuramba, imbaraga, guhinduka no kumurika, icyakora hariho ibyuma biremereye kandi byoroshye birahari. Moderi yihariye yubatswe kugirango ikoreshwe buri gihe mugihe izindi zifasha gusa mubikorwa byihariye. z\u2019ibimuga zihagaze zishobora no kwirukanwa aho zihagaze, icyakora hari impungenge z\u2019ubuvuzi zerekana ko ibyago byinshi byo kuvunika amagufwa mugihe utwaye imodoka kubera amaguru ari umutwaro uremereye. \nGusuzuma no kubakoresha.\nIntebe z\u2019abafite ubumuga zigaragara zikoreshwa n\u2019abantu bafite ubumuga bworoheje kandi bukabije harimo: gukomeretsa uruti rwumugongo, gukomeretsa ubwonko bwubwonko, ubumuga bwubwonko, spina bifida, dystrofi yimitsi, sclerose nyinshi, stroke, syndrome ya rett, syndrome ya polio nibindi byinshi.\nIntebe zabafite ubumuga ziri mubyiciro bitandukanye muburyo zihagaze zikoreshwa nabantu bafite paraplegia na quadriplegia, kubera ko uburyo butandukanye bwo guhagarara burahari kugirango bakire ubumuga bworoheje bukabije.\nInyungu zubuzima.\nUbushakashatsi bwinshi bwerekana ibimenyetso byintebe zintebe zihagaze zitanga inyungu zubuzima kurenza bagenzi babo badafite imashini. Zimwe muri izo nyungu zirimo kuzenguruka neza, ubwinshi bwamagufwa, hamwe ningaruka nke zo kwikuramo no guhindura skelete. Abashakashatsi benshi n\u2019abakoresha bavuga ko inyungu atari umubiri gusa - uburyo bwinshi bwo kugenda butangwa n\u2019ibimuga by\u2019ibimuga bihagaze bituma abakoresha babaho ubuzima bwigenga, bigatuma ubuzima bwo mu mutwe butera imbere ndetse n\u2019ubuzima bwiza. \nIntebe z'ababana n'ubumuga zihagaze bazishyize kubiciro abantu benshi batekerezagako bitageraho kuko kurubu kuzikoresha bihagaza, hamwe na verisiyo zikoreshwa kuva $ 10,000- $ 15,000. Uku kutagerwaho kwatumye ibigo byubwishingizi byinjiza ikoranabuhanga muri gahunda zabo zisanzwe. Mu 2020, Ubwigenge Binyuze mu Kongera Ubuvuzi na Medicaid (ITEM) bwiyambaje Ikigo gishinzwe ubuvuzi na Medicaid (CMS), busaba intebe z\u2019ibimuga zihagaze hamwe n\u2019ibimuga by\u2019ibimuga bifite intebe zashyizwe hejuru zifite imbaraga zishyirwa mu nyungu z\u2019ibikoresho by\u2019ubuvuzi biramba. Icyo cyifuzo cyatanzwe igice muri Gicurasi 2023, kubera ko CMS yashyizemo intebe y\u2019ibimuga ifite intebe zashyizwe hejuru n\u2019inyungu kandi bakavuga ko mu gihe kiri imbere hazasuzumwa intebe z\u2019ibimuga. \nKugeza ubu, ubwishingizi bushobora gufasha mu gutera inkunga igice cyintebe, mugihe inkunga ya Medicaid itandukanye bitewe na leta zitandukanye muri Amerika Amasosiyete menshi yubwishingizi, imiryango ishinzwe gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe imyuga, hamwe n\u2019abashinzwe ibibazo by\u2019ubuvuzi bagenda batera inkunga intebe z\u2019ibimuga zihagaze kubera ubuzima bw\u2019igihe kirekire n\u2019ubuzima bwiza buturuka ku guhagarara neza.\nInyandiko nziza.\nInkunga inkunga ya leta itanga mu bwishingizi kubikoresho bihagaze birashoboka, ariko mubisanzwe bisaba gutsindishirizwa mubuvuzi hamwe nibaruwa ikenera ubuvuzi (ibisobanuro birambuye) byanditswe numuvuzi wumubiri cyangwa inzobere mubuvuzi.\nInkomoko y'inkunga.\nMuri Amerika hari uburyo butandukanye bafashamo inkunga aribwo bwo gutera inkunga kugura ibikoresho byubuvuzi biramba (DME) nkintebe zintebe zihagarara:"}
{"id": "20954", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20954", "title": "Spanish Flowes", "text": "Spanish Flower ni ubwoko bwibiceri flan. Igizwe nuruhande rworoshye rutandukanijwemo ibice bingana nibice birindwi. Nibura Umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Uburayi na Fiji, bavuze mu buryo bweruye ko imiterere y\u2019indabyo zo muri Esipanye zatoranijwe kugira ngo zifashe abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona. Nyamara, igiceri cyo kwibuka cyo muri Polonye gifite ibisobanuro bitandukanye bya tekiniki bitandukanye muburyo bakozemo umuzenguruko wacyo kiceri, bigatuma bidashoboka mu mikoreshereze ya buri munsi. Kubwibyo, imiterere yindabyo zo muri Espagne zifite agaciro gashya kuri iki giceri.\nInkomoko.\nIgiceri cya Espagne cya mafaranga 50 peseta cyatanzwe hagati ya 1990 na 2000 nicyo cyambere cyagaragaje imiterere yindabyo za Espagne. [\"citation ikenewe\"]"}
{"id": "20955", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20955", "title": "Elly Savatia", "text": "Elly Savatia (wavutse 2001) ni rwiyemezamirimo wo muri Kenya akaba anahanga udushya mu ikoranabuhanga, uzwi cyane nk'uwashinze gutangiza ikoranabuhanga Signvrse ndetse n'umuhanzi wa Terp 360, porogaramu ikoresha ubwenge bw'ubukorano (AI) isobanura ijambo n'inyandiko mu rurimi rw'amarenga hifashishijwe avatars za 3D.Mu 2025, yatsindiye igihembo cya Royal Academy of Engineering 'Africa Africa for Engineering Innovation kubera ibikorwa yakoze kuri uwo mushinga. \nUmwuga.\nSavatia yashinze ikigo cya Nairobi cyatangije Signvrse mu ntangiriro ya za 2020 kugirango igere ku buryo bwa digitale ku baturage batumva kandi batumva muri Afurika. Afite imyaka 24 yatangije Terp 360, isobanurwa ngo \"Google Translate for language sign.\" uru rubuga rukoresha ubwenge bw'ubukorano (AI) hamwe n'amakuru afashwe mu kugenzura imyitwarire (motion- captured dat) kugira ngo atange ibisobanuro nyabyo by'ururimi rw'amarenga mu gihe nyacyo hifashishijwe avatar ya 3D zisa nizo mubuzima nyabwo. \nIyi porogaramu yakozwe ku bufatanye n\u2019Abanyakenya batumva, yandika ibimenyetso birenga 2.300, harimo interuro n\u2019amagambo asanzwe mu rurimi rw\u2019amarenga rwo muri Kenya (KSL). Nk\u2019uko Savatia abivuga, AI yatojwe hakoreshejwe ibyuma bifata ibyuma bifata umukono n'ibimenyetso mu mwanya w\u2019ibice bitatu. \nHagati mu 2025, Terp 360 yari imaze kugera ku bakoresha barenga 2000 kandi yari igeragezwa mu mashuri, mu bitaro, no ku kazi kugira ngo ifashe itumanaho hagati y'abatumva n'abumva. Kuri ubu urubuga rushyigikira ubusobanuro bw'icyongereza n'igiswahili muri KSL, ruteganya kwaguka mu rurimi rw\u2019amarenga mu Rwanda, Uganda, Afurika y'Epfo, Abongereza n'Abanyamerika. \nKumenyekana.\nMu Kwakira 2025, Savatia yahawe igihembo cya Afurika cyo guhanga udushya mu buhanga bwa Royal Academy of Engineering mu muhango wabereye i Dakar, muri Senegali. Yakiriye amapound 50.000 yo gutsinda iri rushanwa, ryubaha ba rwiyemezamirimo bo muri Afurika bakoresheje ubwubatsi n\u2019ikoranabuhanga mu gukemura ibibazo byaho. "}
{"id": "20956", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20956", "title": "Abafite ubumuga mwiterambere", "text": "Abafite ubumuga mu Rwanda nabo bafite uburenganzira nkabandi bose mwiterembere binyuze mugukora bahabwa amahirwe angana nkayandi bose.\nAbafite ubumuga Mubuyobozi.\nMu Rwanda abafite ubumuga bahabwa amahirwe yo kwiyamamaza bahabwa imyanya ibiri yabahagararira mu nteko ishinga amategeko.\nAmatsinda yo kuzigama no kugurizanya afasha abafite ubumuga kwiteza imbere.\nMu rwego rwo guteza imbere imibereho y'abafite ubumuga, hashyizweho amatsinda yo kuzigama no kugurizanya abafasha kubona igishoro cyo gutangira ibikorwa bibateza imbere.\nAya matsinda yabafashije kuva mu bwigunge, kwigira ku bandi no gutangiza imishinga irimo ubworozi, ubuhinzi n'ubucurizi. Binyuze muri ayo matsinda, benshi babashije kongera ubushobozi bwabo mu bukungu, bamwe ndetse bagera ku rwego rwo gutanga akazi no kugira uruhare mu iterambere ryi'gihugu. 3 \nIbirushijeho.\nhttps://www.kigalitoday.com/amakuru/amatora/article/imigabo-n-imigambi-y-abakandida-depite-bafite-ubumuga-yabaye-umukoro-ncpd"}
{"id": "20957", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20957", "title": "SlWiki", "text": "SlWiki ni sisitemu ifunguye ishingiye kuri OpenCourseWare sisitemu ifasha mukwandika. Ifasha kwiga kwandika ibyanditse hamwe nubuyobozi (harimo kubahiriza SCORM 2004) nibikoresho byubufatanye / amasoko-mbonezamubano, guhindura, itumanaho, gushyigikira itangazwa ryuburezi bwuguruye \nIgitekerezo.\nSlWiki ni Urubuga rworoshya ubufatanye ndetse no muri sisitemu yuburezi. Hamwe nabakoresha SlideWiki barashobora gukora no gufatanya kumurongo no gutondekanya amashusho mubitekerezo. Ibiganiro birashobora gutegurwa muburyo bukurikiranye, kugirango ubitondere neza ukurikije ibikubiyemo. Kugeza ubu ubufatanye bunini (nanone bwitwa imbaga-soko) hafi yuburezi (usibye inyandiko) bushyigikiwe gusa muburyo buke. Amashusho, kwerekana, igishushanyo, ibizamini byo gusuzuma nibindi byakozwe ahanini nabarezi, abarimu, abarimu nabarimu kugiti cyabo cyangwa mumatsinda mato cyane. Ibivuyemo birashobora gusangirwa kumurongo (urugero ukoresheje Slideshare, OpenStudy, Google Docs). Ariko, ubufatanye bukwiye bwabaturage, kwandika, guhindura, gushinga amashami, kongera gukoresha no kongera guteganya ibintu byuburezi nkuko tubizi kuva kumasoko afunguye-isoko ya software ntabwo ashyigikiwe.\nSlWiki ni urubuga, aho bishoboka ko abaturage benshi bigisha, abarimu, abize bahabwa imbaraga zo gukora ibintu byubumenyi buhanitse muburyo bwo gufatanya. Kubushakashatsi bushya bugaragara, kurugero, ikigo cyubufatanye nka SlideWiki cyemerera gukwirakwiza ibirimo no kwigisha abanyeshuri ba PhD nabashakashatsi bangenzi byihuse, kubera ko umutwaro wo guhanga no gutunganya urwego rushya ushobora gukwirakwizwa mumuryango mugari. Inzobere mubice bitandukanye byurwego rushya zishobora kwibanda mugushiraho ibintu byuburezi mubice byabo byubuhanga kandi nyamara ibirimo birashobora guhuzwa byoroshye nibindi bikoresho, byongeye kubakwa no kongera kubigambirira. Ikintu cyihariye, cyoroherezwa na SlideWiki ni indimi nyinshi. Kubera ko ibirimo byose byahinduwe kandi byubatswe neza, biroroshye guhinduranya igice mu buryo bworoshye guhinduranya ibirimo no gukomeza gukurikirana impinduka muburyo butandukanye bwindimi nyinshi zikoreshwa mubintu bimwe.\nImiterere.\nSlWiki yibanda cyane cyane kubantu benshi bafite aho bahurira n'ubwanditsi, inkunga yo guhindura no gutunganya ibintu byuburezi hamwe nibibazo byo kwisuzuma. Ibiranga harimo:\nUmushinga wa SlWiki H2020.\nIterambere rya SlideWikis ryashyizweho mu ntangiriro z'umwaka wa 2016 nk'umushinga uterwa inkunga nikigo cya EU. Yongeye gushyirwaho muburyo bushya bw'ikoranabuhanga kandi igaragara ku rubuga rwa interineti rwa SlWiki.org mu 2017. Ibigo 17 by\u2019abafatanyabikorwa baturutse mu Burayi bwose ndetse na Amerika y'Epfo bifatanya mu rwego rwo kunoza SlWiki no gushyira mu bikorwa ibintu byinshi bishya no kuzamura ubunararibonye bw\u2019abakoresha kugira ngo bibe ihuriro rikuru ry\u2019uburezi bwuguruye, cyane cyane ibiganiro."}
{"id": "20958", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20958", "title": "Electropalatography", "text": "Electropalatography (EPG) n'ubuhanga cyangwa uburyo bwo kureba aho ururimi ruhura n'imberey'akanwa, cyane cyane mugihe umuntu avugira amagambo. \nAgahimba k'akanwa kauguruye(artificial palate) gakozwe muburyo gahura neza n'imbere y'akanwa k'umuntu. Ako gahimba gafite utwuma tw'amashanyarazi (electrodes) tuzajya duhura n'ururimi. Iyo guhura bibaye hagati yururimi na electrode iyo ari yo yose, cyane cyane hagati y'uruhande rw'ururimi n'imbibi za palate ikomeye, ibimenyetso bya elegitoronike byoherezwa mubice bitunganya hanze. EPG itanga imbaraga-nyayo-nyayo yibitekerezo byerekana ahantu hamwe nigihe cyo guhuza ururimi hamwe na palate ikomeye.\nIbisobanuro birambuye byururimi mugihe cyo kuvuga byanditswe, bitanga amakuru ataziguye umuntu ashobora gukoresha mubuvuzi kugirango akurikirane kandi atezimbere uburyo bwabo bwo kuvuga. Ibitekerezo biboneka ni ngombwa cyane mugutsinda kuvura abana batumva.\nElectropalatography yabanje gutekerezwa kandi itezwa imbere nkigikoresho cyubushakashatsi bwa fonetika kugirango tunononsore uburyo gakondo bwa palatografiya. Abashakashatsi mu ndimi za gisirikari n\u2019amasomo bakoresheje ibikoresho bya elegitoroniki ya elegitoroniki kugira ngo babone amakuru nyayo yerekeye guhuza ururimi n\u2019indimi mu ndimi nyinshi z\u2019amahanga.\nIbikoresho bya mbere bya EPG byakoreshaga amashanyarazi ataziguye kugirango akoreshe ibyuma bifata ibyuma bifata ibyuma bifata ibyuma bifata ibyuma byifashishwa. Umunwa (electropalates) mubusanzwe wasaga cyane nicyapa cyerekana amenyo agezweho. Mouthpiece yarushijeho guhindurwa mugihe, ibyo bikaba byemerera ubushakashatsi bunoze. Igishushanyo 1 kirerekana amashanyarazi asanzwe muri sisitemu yo Gusoma.\nEPG yongeyeho ubushishozi muburyo bwo gusobanukirwa amasomo ya fonetika. Mu myaka ya za 1960 na 1970 abantu benshi bigenga hamwe n\u2019amasosiyete bamenye ubushobozi bwa EPG bwo kwigisha no kuvura. Nubwo inshuro nyinshi zagerageje guhindura ibikoresho bya injeniyeri EPG yo kuvura imvugo, ibigo byinshi byananiwe gucuruza EPG neza. Ibikoresho bya EPG bikomeje kuba ibikoresho bihenze cyane byo kuvura imvugo nubushakashatsi bwa fonetika, nubwo amakuru batanga biragoye kuyabona ukoresheje ubundi buryo bwo gutanga ibitekerezo byerekana neza. \nMu bushakashatsi bwa fonetike.\nNubwo byinshi mu iterambere rya EPG byeguriwe amavuriro, yakoreshejwe mu iperereza ryinshi rya laboratoire. Kibuye (1997) urutonde rwibice bitatu byingenzi byubushakashatsi:\nIyo electropalatografiya ikoreshwa mubushakashatsi bwijambo, amakuru avuye mururimi-palate yatoranijwe na mudasobwa igenzura kuri frame 100 kumasegonda. Mu minsi ya mbere (mugihe ibyerekanwe bya digitale bitari hose kandi bigarukira), amakuru yacapishijwe kumpapuro kugirango asesengurwe. Urugero rwo gucapura rushobora kuboneka ku gishushanyo cya 2, aho urukurikirane ruva hejuru kugeza hasi, kandi aho ikimenyetso cya 'O' cyerekana guhuza na '.' yerekana ko ntaho ahurira. Imvugo yerekanwe ni 'catkin' /k\u00e6t.k\u026an/; icyitegererezo gifite nimero 344 yerekana mugihe / t / gufunga birangiye, no kumurongo wa 350 hariho gufunga byuzuye. Gufunga alveolar irekurwa kuri 351. Guhuza ingingo ya articulatory (itumvikana) birerekanwa neza. Amakadiri yihariye yamakuru ya EPG arashobora gukoreshwa mugusobanura ibisobanuro byerekana amajwi, kandi ibi bikorwa na Cruttenden kubantu bose bavuga icyongereza (RP). Mu bushakashatsi bumwe na bumwe, gusubiramo inshuro nyinshi birashobora gukusanyirizwa hamwe kugirango bitange ibishushanyo mbonera byerekana ururimi-mu buryo bugabanya ingaruka ziterwa no guhindagurika ku kimenyetso kimwe. Ibi byakozwe na Farnetani mubushakashatsi bwerekeye coarticulation yubutaliyani nigifaransa. \nAbatanga.\nAbakora ibintu bitatu byibanze bakora ibikoresho bya EPG barahari: ByuzuyeSpeech muri Amerika, Ibikoresho byerekana neza, na icSpeech mubwongereza. Completespeech nisosiyete yigenga kabuhariwe mu kuvura imvugo yerekanwe ibikoresho bya EPG, byiswe Sisitemu ya SmartPalate. Sisitemu ya SmartPalate ikoresha urupapuro rusanzwe rwerekana sensor hamwe na sensor 126 zashyizwe kumurongo wihariye. Ibikoresho bisobanutse bitanga ubuvuzi bw'amagambo hamwe n'ubushakashatsi bwerekeranye na EPG umunwa, byiswe Gusoma Palate na The Articulate Palate. Igikoresho cyerekana ibyuma bya EPG ni ahantu hamwe n'intoki kubakoresha kugiti cyabo. IcSpeech, yiswe LinguaGraph, ikoresha kandi Palate yo gusoma.\nMu kuvura.\nElectropalatography yakozweho ubushakashatsi mu baturage batandukanye, barimo abana bafite amagage, abana barwaye syndrome de Down, abana bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva, abana batewe na cochlear, abana bafite ubumuga bw\u2019ubwonko ndetse n'abantu bakuru bafite indwara ya Parkinson. Ubuvuzi bwagaragaje ko bwatsinze mubantu bapimwe. Ubushakashatsi [] \"nubunini\" Hakenewe ubushakashatsi burambye (Longitudinal studies) bukorwa kubantu benshi (sample sizes) kugirango hamenyekane neza gahunda y'ubuvuzi izatanga umusaruro mu gihe kirekire."}
{"id": "20959", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20959", "title": "Sitecues", "text": "sitecues ni Urubuga rushingiye kuri software ni igisubizo cyubakanye ikorana buhanga bwa zoom no kuvuga imvugo kurubuga. Igicuruzwa cyongerera ubushobozi no gukoreshwa kubasura urubuga bahura nibibazo byo kubona no gucapa. Urubuga rwatangijwe na \"Ai Squared\", abakora ZoomText na software ifasha. Sitecues ikorera abakiriya barenga 100, muribo harimo kaminuza nyinshi za leta ya Californiya, kaminuza nini namasomero yo muri Amerika, ndetse ninzego zimwe na zimwe za leta na leta. \nIncamake.\niyi sofutiwaye itanga kandi uburenganzira bwo kuyikoresha kumurongo wo hejuru wa mushakisha kandi irashobora gukoreshwa nabakoresha bafite ibibazo byo kubona no gucapa bigoye zoom / gukuza cyangwa kumva inyandiko yatoranijwe mugihe ushakisha. \nUbufatanye.\nMuri Gicurasi 2014, Ai Squared, ukora sitecues na ZoomText, na GW Micro, uwashizeho Window-Eyes, bishyize hamwe mu kigo kimwe. Ibigo byahurije hamwe bihuza ibikorwa remezo nubutunzi kugirango bifashe bikoreshe abakoresha mudasobwa bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona cyangwa bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona. "}
{"id": "20960", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20960", "title": "Spoken (app)", "text": "Ikivugwa (kizwi kandi nka Spoken - Kanda kuri Talk AAC AAC) ni porogaramu igendanwa kandi igikoresho cyo kongera no guhinduranya itumanaho (AAC) cyatangijwe mu mwaka wa 2019. Iyi porogaramu yakozwe kugira ngo ifashe abantu bafite ikibazo cyo kuvuga cyangwa gukoresha ururimi nk'abafite aphasia cyangwa autism adashobora kuvuga (nonverbal autism), ikoresheje ibimenyetso, inyandiko, n'ijwi.\nAmateka.\nMichael Bond yatangiye iterambere rya Spoken mu 2015, abitewe n'icyifuzo cyo kubona ibikoresho bigezweho kandi byorohereza abantu mu buvuzi bwo kuvuga, kuko uburyo gakondo butari bwarahindutse cyane mu myaka 50 ishize. Uyu mushinga wateye imbere cyane kubera uruhare muri gahunda yihuta ya Start-Up Chili, aho wafashe umwanya wa mbere mu bahatanira umwanya wa cumi n'umunani batangiye ku munsi wa 13 wa Demo Day mu Gushyingo 2015. Iyi porogaramu yatangijwe ku mugaragaro muri 2019.\nByinshi mu bimenyetso byumwimerere bya Spoken byatijwe muri The Noun Project, byatoranijwe hakoreshejwe imbaga nyamwinshi ishingiye kubantu kugirango hamenyekane amashusho meza kumagambo. [\"citation ikenewe\"] Nubwo amashusho menshi yizina y'umushinga aracyakoreshwa muri Spoken, hashyizweho ingufu kugirango uhindure amashusho yihariye kugirango tunonosore uburyo bwo guhuza no kumenyekanisha ijambo byihuse. \nIkoreshwa ryukuri rya tekinoroji ya Spoken ryongerewe mu buryo butunguranye mugihe cyorezo cya COVID-19, gifasha abarwayi gukira gukoresha umuyaga. Muri Werurwe 2021, porogaramu imaze kubona ibicuruzwa birenga 10,000 kandi ikavuga ko izamuka rya 20% buri kwezi. 2022, yagereranyaga izindi 1.000 zo gukuramo buri cyumweru. \nMuri Gashyantare 2022, Spoken yinjiye muri AlphaLab Health, yihuta yo gutangiza na Allegheny Network Network hamwe nudushya two gukora. Ibi byahaye isosiyete uburyo bwo kubona ibikoresho by'ubuvuzi, inkunga, hamwe ni nama, bikarushaho gutera imbere. Yitabiriye kandi izindi gahunda nka Multiple Autism yihuta na AI ya Slalom Ventures ya AI yihuta. \nMuri Nzeri 2025, porogaramu yerekanye guhuza na ElevenLabs, iha abakoresha ibikoresho byo gukora clone yijwi hamwe nijwi ryihuse ryihuse muri porogaramu. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nSpoken yiyemeje kwagura itangwa ryikoranabuhanga mu ndimi nyinshi, ishaka gukemura ibibazo by\u2019abaturage batishoboye no kwitegura kwiyongera ku isi. \nIgikorwa.\nSpoken yitandukanije nizindi porogaramu za AAC binyuze mugukoresha urugero runini rwururimi rutanga ubushobozi bwimyandikire iteganijwe, bisa nibikorwa bya terefone byikora. Iyi mikorere yigira kumvugo yukoresha, itanga ibitekerezo byihariye mugihe runaka. Abakoresha barashobora kwagura amagambo ya porogaramu muburyo butatu: mu gukoresha inshuro nyinshi amagambo mashya mumirongo kugirango Spoken yige imiterere yabyo, mu kongeramo amagambo ku bwinshi binyuze mu mahitamo \"Ongeramo Amagambo\" kugirango uhanure shingiro, cyangwa ukoresheje uburyo bwa \"Private Prediction\", busaba ibibazo bigamije kwemeza ko amagambo mashya ahita ahanurwa muburyo bukwiye. Byongeye kandi, Spoken irashobora guhuza ibyo iteganya ukurikije aho uyikoresha iherereye, itanga ibitekerezo bijyanye muburyo bwihariye nka resitora cyangwa ibitaro.\nPorogaramu ikubiyemo guhitamo amajwi-karemano, guhuza amajwi hamwe no guhitamo uburyo bwo guhitamo ikibanza, umuvuduko, nubunini, bigafasha abakoresha guhitamo ijwi ryerekana neza umwirondoro wabo cyangwa ibyo bakunda. Amajwi yose yashyizwe muri Spoken yitiriwe ibimera aho kuba abantu kugirango bagaragare ko badafite uburinganire cyangwa unisex. \"Ingero\"] [, Bottlebrush, na Dandelion. Muri 2025, Spoken yaguye kugirango yemere abakoresha kubona amajwi aturuka hanze nka Acapela. Ivugurura rimwe ryongeyeho ibikoresho byo kubyara amajwi mashya ukoresheje ElevenLabs, haba ukoresheje ibisobanuro byanditse cyangwa ijwi rya cloni.\nImvugo ishigikira uburyo butandukanye bwo kwinjiza kugirango uhuze ibyifuzo bitandukanye byabakoresha nibyifuzo byabo. Kurenga imyandikire isanzwe hamwe ninyandiko ziteganya, izi inyandiko zandikishijwe intoki ndetse nigishushanyo cyoroshye, gihindura inyongeramusaruro mumagambo yavuzwe. Amakuru yakoreshejwe mugutoza ibishushanyo mbonera bya Spoken byakomotse kumukino Byihuse, Kurura!, kubemerera kumenya ibishushanyo mbonera cyane kandi byukuri. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nSpoken itanga kandi interuro yabitswe iranga, yagenewe abakoresha bahora bakoresha interuro cyangwa imvugo yihariye. Iyi nteruro irashobora kugarurwa mugukanda kabiri gusa, koroshya itumanaho mubihe byihuse cyangwa byihutirwa.\nIkindi kintu kiranga Spoken ni \"buto yo kwitondera.\" Iyi miterere yateguwe mugusimbuza amagambo nko gukuramo umuhogo. Kanda kamwe kamwe kamwe kano kantu kenshi gahanagura itara ryigikoresho kandi rigakina amajwi yihariye, akurura ibitekerezo. Abakoresha AAC barashobora gukoresha iyi mikorere kugirango bamenyeshe abandi ko bagiye kuvuga, cyangwa kugirango umuntu yitabweho byihuse mugihe cyihutirwa.\nKubindi byongeweho kuboneka, Spoken ikubiyemo ibintu nkibicapiro binini, uburyo bwijimye, hamwe nogutandukanya ijambo kugirango umenye neza ko porogaramu ikoreshwa kandi yoroheye kubantu bafite ibyo bakeneye bitandukanye. \nAbakoresha barashobora kandi kwerekana interuro zabo murwego rwuzuye rwa ecran kugirango bavugane ahantu harehare cyane cyangwa mubihe badashaka gutera urusaku.\nIbindi bice birimo ubushobozi bwo gusangira byihuse ibyanditse cyangwa amashusho y amajwi avuye muri porogaramu ukoresheje inyandiko cyangwa imeri hamwe nuburyo bwo guhagarika amagambo amwe atagaragara mubyahanuwe, bitanga urwego rwihariye rwihariye."}
{"id": "20961", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20961", "title": "Sip-na-puff", "text": "Sip-na-puff cyangwa sip 'n' puff (SNP) nubuhanga bufasha bukoreshwa mu kohereza ibimenyetso kubikoresho ukoresheje umuvuduko wumwuka \"kunyunyuza\" (guhumeka) cyangwa \"guhumeka\" (guhumeka) kumyatsi, umuyoboro cyangwa \"umugozi.\" Ikoreshwa cyane cyane nabantu bafite ubumuga butandukanye gukoresha amaboko yabo. Bikunze gukoreshwa mugucunga intebe yimuga ya moteri na quadriplegics ifite ibikomere byinshi cyane kumugongo cyangwa abantu bafite ALS. \nGuhindura no gushiraho.\niyi sisitemu ifite tekinoroji ya SNP bisaba umubare wihariye wumuvuduko wumwuka kugirango ushire cyangwa uhindurwe numukoresha. Ingano yumuvuduko mubisanzwe igaragazwa nkibisumizi bikomeye / puff ikomeye cyangwa yoroshye sip / yoroshye puff, icyakora andi magambo ashobora kubaho. Menya ko amagambo akomeye na yoroshye ugereranije numukoresha kandi biterwa nubushobozi bwabo bwo guhumeka. Mubisanzwe, umuvuduko wumuyaga ujyanye no guswera / guswera no guswera byoroshye / puffs bishyirwaho binyuze muburyo bwa kalibrasi yambere ya sensor sensor yarangiye mbere yuko uyikoresha atangira gukoresha ibikoresho bya SNP. Hifashishijwe imfashanyo cyangwa umutekinisiye, uyikoresha azategura igikoresho cya SNP kugirango amenye ubushobozi bwumubiri wabo kubyara sip / puffs hamwe na sipi yoroshye / puffs. Iyo gahunda yo guhitamo imaze kurangira, igikoresho cya SNP kizamenya gusa umukoresha ibiryo byihariye na puffs zabitswe mubikoresho bya SNP.\nKugenzura ibimuga bifite moteri.\nPorogaramu isanzwe yibikoresho bya Sip-na-Puff ni ukugenzura ibimuga bifite moteri. Igenzura mubisanzwe rigizwe ninyandiko enye zitandukanye uhereye kumukoresha. Intangiriro yambere puff izafasha igare ry'ababana n'ubumuga butandukanye gutera imbere, mugihe sipi ikomeye izahagarika igare ryibimuga. Ibinyuranye, icyambere cyokunywa kizafasha intebe yimuga gusubira inyuma, mugihe puff ikomeye izahagarika igare ryibimuga. Gukomeza guswera byoroshye cyangwa puff yoroheje bizafasha igare ryibimuga kugenda ibumoso cyangwa iburyo ukurikije igihe umukoresha akubita muri tube, ibyatsi cyangwa \"umugozi\".\nIgikoresho cyo kwinjiza mudasobwa.\nKugenzura umwanya wunganira ububiko bwa mudasobwa abakoresha uburyo bworoshye kandi bwiza bwo kugenzura imbeba. Kwimuka nigikorwa cyiyi joystick isa niy'inkoni yo mu kanwa. Imbeba ya buto yo gukanda irangizwa hifashishijwe siporo cyangwa puffs imikorere ya joystick.\nIgikoresho cya mudasobwa kitiriwe sip-na-puff cyinjijwe hamwe na software igera kuri mudasobwa bivuze ko clavier nyinshi imikorere ishobora gukoreshwa hamwe niki gikoresho."}
{"id": "20962", "revid": "18416", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20962", "title": "Abafite ubumuga mwikoranabuhanga", "text": "Abafite ubumuga kuri Murandasi.\nAbafite ubumuga biga hifashishijwe ibitabo biba kuri murandasi arinaho hakubiyemo ibisobanuro n'imikoro ibafasha kumenya no gusobanukirwa neza.\nInyungu Ry'ikoranabuhanga kubafite ubumuga.\nAbafite ubumuga nkubwo kutabona ubu bashobora kujya kwisoko kujya guhaha kandi bakamenya nayo babagaruriye abafite ubwingingo ubu bashobora gutwara imodoka n'ibindi, bashobora kwifashishwa nka telefone cyangwa bindi bikoresho \nIbirushijeho.\nhttps://www.kigalitoday.com/amakuru/mu-rwanda/article/abafite-ubumuga-ntibasigaye-inyuma-mu-kwigishwa-hifashishijwe-ikoranabuhanga\nhttps://mobile.igihe.com/amakuru/muri-afurika/u-rwanda/article/ishimwe-ry-abafite-ubumuga-ku-rwanda-rukomeje-guteza-imbere-ikoranabuhanga"}
{"id": "20963", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20963", "title": "Subvocal recognition", "text": "Subvocal recognation (SVR) ninzira yo gufata subvocalisation no guhindura ibisubizo byagaragaye kubisohoka muburyo bwa digitale, aural cyangwa inyandiko ishingiye. Imvugo yo guceceka ni igikoresho cyemerera itumanaho kidakoresheje amajwi yakozwe mugihe abantu bavuga amajwi yabo. Ikora na mudasobwa igaragaza fonema umuntu ku giti cye atangaza avuye kumasoko adafite amakuru yerekeye uko bavuga. Ibi noneho bikoreshwa mugusubiramo imvugo ukoresheje synthesis. \nUburyo bwinjiza.\nSisitemu sa Silent speech interface zakozwe hifashishijwe ultrasound and optical camera input of tongue and lip movements. ibikoresho bya elegitoroniki nabyo nindi nzira ikoreshwa mu gukurikirana imigendere y'ururimi n'imirebebe"}
{"id": "20964", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20964", "title": "Abafite ubumuga b'imusanze", "text": "Abafite ubumuga b'i Musanze barishimira iterambere bamaze kujyeraho binyuze mu Kwibumbira hamwe (cooperative) Zitandukanye. \nKwibumbira muri Cooperative.\nAbafite ubumuga b'imusanze basanga intambwe ya mbwere ishimishije aruko wegera abandi mugakorera hamwe kuko aribwo mugera kure. Iyo mufatanije buri wese atanga igitekerezo cy'iterambere rigera kuri buri munyamurwango.\nAmashakiro:.\nhttps://www.kigalitoday.com/amakuru/mu-rwanda/article/musanze-abafite-ubumuga-bigishijwe-ikoranabuhanga-bitezweho-guhanga-udushya#:~:text=Come%20Ndemezo%2C%20Umukozi%20w'umushinga,Urubyiruko%20cy'Akarere%20ka%20Musanze."}
{"id": "20965", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20965", "title": "Cooperative Y'abafite ubumuga b'imusanze (Dukomezubuzima Mudende)", "text": "Ababana n\u2019ubumuga bo mu karere ka Musanze bitabiriye amahugurwa amaze ukwezi abera mu kigo cy\u2019urubyiruko cy\u2019akarere ka Musanze, Yego Center Musanze, abagera kuri 20 babana n\u2019ubumuga bwo mungingo n\u2019ubwo kutabona. Mu kuyasoza, batahanye ingamba zo kubakira ku bumenyi bungukiyemo bakarushaho kongera ireme ry\u2019umusaruro w\u2019ibyo bakora.\nIkoranabuhanga.\nIkigo cy'ubwishingizi cya BK insurance cyahaye inkunga ya mudasobwa ababana n'ubumuga muri cooperative ikorera mu Karere ka Musanze izwi nka Dukomezubuzima. Mudasobwa zigera kuri eshatu n'imashini icapa impapuro n'ibikoresho bibafasha mu kubona murandasi kuburyo bworoshye.\nUmusaruro.\nUbumenyi kuri mudasobwa:Umwe yavuze ko kumenya gukoresha ikoranabuhanga bizabafasha kumenyekanisha ibyo bakora kubigeza kubakiriya bashya, gukoresha serivisi z\u2019ikoranabuhanga bitiriye jya kure bityo bakazabona inyungu nyinshi mu byo bakora.\nAmashakiro.\nhttps://www.kigalitoday.com/amakuru/mu-rwanda/article/musanze-abafite-ubumuga-bigishijwe-ikoranabuhanga-bitezweho-guhanga-udushya#:~:text=Come%20Ndemezo%2C%20Umukozi%20w'umushinga,Urubyiruko%20cy'Akarere%20ka%20Musanze."}
{"id": "20966", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20966", "title": "SIGACCESS", "text": "ACM SIGACCESS ni Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019imashini zidasanzwe zo kubara imashini zita kuri mudasobwa ziboneka, itsinda rinyuranye ry\u2019abashakashatsi mu masomo n\u2019inganda, abaganga n\u2019abakozi bashinzwe gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe abafite ubumuga butandukanye, abafata ibyemezo, abakoresha amaherezo, n\u2019abanyeshuri kugira ngo bateze imbere ikoranabuhanga rikoreshwa n\u2019abafite ubumuga. \nAmateka.\nMu 1964, Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019imashini zibara mudasobwa ryatangije komite ishinzwe ibikorwa ku babana nu bumuga ku batabona, yasohoye akanyamakuru imyaka ine kandi itegura inama mu 1969. Intego ya komite yari iyo guteza imbere no gutera inkunga impumyi nkaba programmes babishoboye. Komite yaguye ibitekerezo byayo kugira ngo ishyiremo abandi bantu bafite ubumuga \"Itsinda ry\u2019inyungu zidasanzwe kuri mudasobwa n\u2019abafite ubumuga bw\u2019umubiri\" (SIGCAPH) mu 1971. Mu 2003, SIG yiswe SIGACCESS. \nInama.\nIhuriro rya ACM SIGACCESS ryabereye kuburyo bwa online kuri mudasobwa no kugerwaho (ASSETS) ninama ngarukamwaka. Intererano zose zinama zirasuzumwa nurungano na komite mpuzamahanga ya gahunda, kandi impapuro zemewe, ibyapa n'imyiyerekano bibitswe mububiko bwibitabo bwa ACM. Abanditsi bose b'impapuro zemewe bazatumirwa gutanga impapuro zagutse z'impapuro zabo ku kibazo cyihariye cya \"Transaction ya ACM kuri Computing Computing\" (\"TACCESS\").\nSIGACCESS itera inkunga muburyo nutandukanye kandi andi mahugurwa ya ACM n'inama ku buryo busimburana. \nIkinyamakuru.\n\"Ihererekanyabubasha kuri comptabilite\" ni ikinyamakuru ACM buri gihembwe gisohora inyandiko zisobanuraimyitwarire zerekeye kubara byoroshye. Ikinyamakuru gishimangira imisanzu hamwe nibisubizo byubushakashatsi, ariko kandi byakira impapuro zifite ubushishozi bushya cyangwa imyanya. \nIbihembo.\nASSETS Impapuro Impinduka Igihembo.\nASSETS Paper Impact Award ihabwa abanditsi impapuro cyangwa se impamya bumenyi zabo. Impapuro zigomba kuba zifite nibura imyaka icumi kugirango zisuzumwe.\nUmusanzu udasanzwe muri comptabilite na Accessibility Award.\nIgihembo cyindashyikirwa gitangwa mumyaka yabanje kandi abayihawe batanga ikiganiro nyamukuru mu nama ya ASSETS ikurikira. "}
{"id": "20967", "revid": "10947", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20967", "title": "Self Voicing", "text": "Porogaramu ya Self Voicing ni porogaramu itanga intera ya aural idasaba umusomyi wa ecran yihariye. Kwiyandikisha wenyine birashobora kuba uburyo bwingenzi bwikoranabuhanga rifasha, bifasha abafite ikibazo cyo gusoma cyangwa kubona.\nItsinda rikomeye ryakoze porogaramu ya Self voicing zivuga kurubuga. Ubusanzwe, kuvuga imbuga za interineti byakozwe byumwihariko, nkuko byari bimeze kuri:\nIcyerekezo cya vuba cyabonye ubushobozi bwa Self Voicing bwongewe kumurongo wambere wurubuga rwongewe kubuntu. Muri 2004, Opera Software yashyizeho uburyo bwo kwivuga no kumenyekanisha imvugo kuri verisiyo ya Windows ya mushakisha yabo. Kandi muri 2005 Charles L. Chen yateguye Fire Vox, umugereka wongerera ubushobozi bwo kuvuga kuri mushakisha y'urubuga rwa Mozilla Firefox kuri Mac, Windows, cyangwa Linux. \nIcyiciro cya kabiri cyingenzi ni porogaramu yagutse yo kwifashisha ikora nka TV Raman yita \"desktop yuzuye amajwi\", harimo guhindura, gushakisha, ndetse n'ubushobozi bwo gukina. Harimo kuzamura Rama wenyine Emacspeak kuzamura Emacs."}
{"id": "20968", "revid": "10947", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20968", "title": "Screen Magnifier", "text": "Screen Magnifier ni software ihuza ibishushanyo mbonera muri mudasobwa kugirango yerekane ibinini byagutse. Mugukuza igice (cyangwa byose) bya ecran, abantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona barashobora kubona neza amagambo namashusho. Ubu bwoko bwa tekinoroji ifasha ni ingirakamaro kubantu bafite icyerekezo gikora; abantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona kandi icyerekezo gike cyangwa ntagikorwa gikunze gukoresha umusomyi wa ecran.\numukoresha.\nUburyo bworoshye bwo gukuza bwerekana igice kinini cyibigize ecran yumwimerere, mu kwibanda, kuburyo gikubiyemo bimwe cyangwa byose byuzuye bya ecran. Igice cyagutse kigomba kubamo ibikubiyemo byinyungu kubakoresha no kwerekana cyangwa indanga, nabyo byagutse neza. Nkuko umukoresha yimura icyerekezo cyangwa indanga ya ecran ya magnifier igomba gukurikirana nayo kandi ikerekana igice kinini cyagutse. Niba uku gukurikirana ari akajagari cyangwa guhindagurika bishoboka guhungabanya umukoresha. Na none, icyerekezo cyangwa indanga ntizishobora kuba ibikubiye mu nyungu: kurugero, niba umukoresha akanze shortcut ya clavier ifungura menu, igice kinini kigomba gusimbuka kuri menu. Windows-pop-up hamwe nimpinduka muburyo bwa sisitemu birashobora kandi gutuma iyi ihinduka ryihuta.\nIbiranga.\nImpinduka zo gukuza inshuro 1 kugeza kuri 16 zirasanzwe.yo gukuza inini ni ntoya igipimo cyibikoresho byumwimerere bishobora kugaragara, bityo abakoresha bazakunda gukoresha ubunini buke bashobora kuyobora. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nMugukwirakwiza ecran mubusanzwe bitanga ibindi bintu byinshi kubantu bafite ibibazo by'ubumuga byo kutabona:"}
{"id": "20969", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20969", "title": "Same Language Subtitling", "text": "Same Language subtitling (SLS) bivuga imyitozo yo gukuramo porogaramu kuri TV mururimi rumwe n'amajwi. Ku ikubitiro ryatangijwe mu ntangiriro ya za 70 nk'uburyo bwo kugeza serivisi ku bantu bafite ubumuga bwo tumva neza, amagambo afunze nk'uko byamenyekanye yari asanzwe akoreshwa mu nyuguti z'ikilatini mu masezerano yo mu 1976. Serivisi zitari Ikilatini zashyizweho nyuma, kandi zikoreshwa mu Buhinde, no mu Bushinwa mu gufasha no gusoma no kwandika.\nMu myaka ya za 1980 rwagati, Pioneer yerekanye imashini zitandukanye za Laserdisc zishingiye ku mashini ya Karaoke, hamwe n\u2019izina rya muzika yerekana amashusho ya muzika ihujwe na sisitemu yerekana amashusho buzwiho nka ya Karaoke PA, icyo gitekerezo cyahinduwe nyuma y\u2019indirimbo nyinshi za Disney Sing-Along Indirimbo zo mu 1986, nyuma zimurirwa muri PlayStation 2, n\u2019imikino yakurikiyeho, cyangwa mu buryo bwa interineti hamwe n\u2019inyandiko zanditswemo na videwo. Igikorwa cyo gusoma.\nGuteza imbere gusoma no kwandika.\nIki gitekerezo cyazanywe na Brij Kothari, wemeraga ko SLS ituma imyitozo yo gusoma itabaho, mu buryo bwikora, ndetse no mu bwenge bw\u2019imyidagaduro ikunzwe kuri televiziyo, ku giciro gito ku muntu kugira ngo umubare w\u2019abatazi gusoma no kwandika mu Buhinde. \nHanze y'Ubuhinde.\nGahunda zikoreshwa mu gishinwa zikunze kwitwa, kubera ko abavuga ubundi bwoko bw'igishinwa bashobora gusoma Igishinwa cyanditse, nubwo badashobora kumva imvugo ivugwa. iyi sisiteme yabashyiriyeho Porogaramu y'ururimi rw'igiheburayo nayo yitwa, cyane cyane porogaramu zitumizwa mu mahanga nka Arutz Heyalim."}
{"id": "20970", "revid": "10947", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20970", "title": "Rotating Cone Tactile Device", "text": "A Rotating cone tactile Device ni igikoresho cyiza gikoreshwa kumatara yumuhanda ugenzurwa n\u2019abanyamaguru mu Bwongereza. Ikoreshwa nk'ikimenyetso cyerekana abanyamaguru bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona kugirango berekane ko ari byiza kwambuka umuhanda. \nIgitekerezo gushiraho ibi bikoresho cyatangiriye muri kaminuza ya Nottingham mu myaka ya za 1980. "}
{"id": "20971", "revid": "10947", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20971", "title": "Reciprocating gait orthosis", "text": "Geciprocating gait orthose (RGO) ni amaguru orthose aho ingingo zombi zifatanije zifatanije no gusunika - gukurura umugozi cyangwa akabari ku buryo guhinduranya ikibuno kimwe bitanga kwaguka kurindi, bikabyara uburyo bwo guhinduranya icyarimwe muburyo bwo gukumira ikibuno icyarimwe. Igikoresho kigizwe n'imigozi y'amaguru ihujwe na pelvic band, ituma abayikoresha bafite amaguru yamugaye kugirango bagere ku kugenda bahindura ibiro byabo kuruhande. \nInyungu zo kuvura.\nUbuvuzi, igihe gito cya buri munsi cyo guhagarara no kugenda muri RGO bishobora gufasha kurwanya ikoreshwa rya osteoporose, kugabanya ibyago byo kurwara ibisebe, kubyutsa ibikorwa byumutima ndetse no kuzamura imibereho myiza yimitekerereze yemerera imikoranire kurwego rwamaso ndetse nizindi ngingo. \nAmahugurwa no kuyashyira mubikorwa.\nAmahugurwa ya protocole mubisanzwe iteza imbere ahagarara muburyo bwo gusubiranamo cyangwa se busobetse tubangikanye, hanyuma akajya hejuru yubutaka hamwe na lofstrand inkoni yimbere yintoki hamwe na cuff; guhuza neza no kubungabunga ni ngombwa, nkibikwiye cyangwa uburemere bwibikoresho bikabije bizwi ko bihanura gutererana. Kubera iyo mpamvu, isuzuma ryiki gihe riratanga inama yo guhitamo neza abarwayi bafite ubumuga butandukanye, kuvura physiotherapie no kwishyiriraho intego zifatika kugirango barusheho kuvura agaciro ka RGOs mugihe bemera imikorere yabo mike nkuburyo bwo kwigenga kure. "}
{"id": "20972", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20972", "title": "Rear Window Captioning System", "text": "Rear Window Captioning System (RWC) nuburyo bwo kwerekana, binyuze mumutwe, inyandiko mvugo yigice cyamajwi ya firime mumikino yabantu bafite ubumuga bwo batumva kandi batumva. Sisitemu yatunganijwe na WGBH na Rufus Butler Seder.\nMu nzira binjira mu ikinamico, abayireba bafata ikibaho cya pulasitike cyerekana cyashyizwe ku gihingwa cyoroshye. Ikibaho giteye mubikombe cyangwa hasi yegeranye nintebe. LED nini yerekana yashyizwe kurukuta rwinyuma rwerekana inyuguti zanditse mumashusho yindorerwamo. Abareba bimura panne mumwanya mubusanzwe munsi ya ecran ya firime kugirango basome ibisobanuro byanditse buzwi mundimi zamahanga nka subtitles kandi barebe firime. Rimwe na rimwe birakenerwa kwicara mukarere runaka ka theatre kugirango tubone inguni nziza yo kwerekana inyandiko yinyuma yasohotse inyuma yikinamico ku kibaho ndetse tunabasha kureba firime icyarimwe.\nRear Window Captioning yanditseho nubundi buryo bwo gufungura ibisobanuro, aho inyandiko igaragara burundu. Gufungura ibisobanuro byanditse ntibyakoreshejwe cyane kubera gutinya ko byinjiye cyane kandi bigaragara kubumva ndetse nabafite ubumuga bwo kutumva. Ariko, nta bushakashatsi bwakozwe kugirango abantu bumve ibitekerezo byukuntu bazahuza nibisobanuro byanditse kuri ecran. Inyuma ya Window yanditseho nuburyo bwo gufunga ibisobanuro kuko abareba bagomba guhitamo kureba ibisobanuro.\nKubantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona, ibisobanuro byamajwi (Serivise yerekana amashusho, DVS) bishobora kandi mubisanzwe byoherezwa hamwe nibisobanuro. Abareba bumva ibisobanuro bakoresheje na terefone idafite umugozi.\nMu matangazo menshi ya firime na sinema runaka, incamake ya \"RWC\" ikoreshwa cyane, nkuko incamake ya CC ikoreshwa kugirango yerekane ko hari ibisobanuro byafunzwe kuri televiziyo. Akenshi, inyandiko ya \"RWC / DVS\" ikoreshwa, byerekana ko haboneka Byombi Byerekana rear window captioning system ryanditse hamwe na Serivise ya Video isobanura."}
{"id": "20973", "revid": "10947", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20973", "title": "PB / 5 pedestrian crossing button", "text": "PB / 5 pedestrian crossing button cyangwa amajwi ya tactile yabanyamaguru ni uburyo bwo kwambukiranya abanyamaguru bufasha abumva no kutabona neza.\niyi sisitemu yakorewe mu gihugu cya Ositaraliya mu 1984 kandi igaragara ahantu nyabagendywa muri Ositaraliya, Irilande, Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande, Singapore na Amerika. ryari riyobowe nuwashushanyaga inganda David Wood, injeniyeri acoustique Louis Challis, n\u2019umuhanda n\u2019ubuyobozi bw\u2019umuhanda (RTA) Frank Hulscher. \nBitewe no kuvuza amajwi menshi yo kuburira abantu, hamwe na majwi ya tactile yiri sisitemu yerekana amajwi, ni urugero rwingaruka zo kugabanya: igishushanyo mbonera cy\u2019ubumuga nacyo kigirira akamaro abandi bakoresha. Muri iki gihe, beeping ituma abantu baba maso kandi bakamenya umutekano wumuhanda. PB / 5 yagaragaye mu ngoro ndangamurage za Ositaraliya [] \"binyamakuru\" byigisha. \nPB / 5 pedestrian crossing button yagenewe gufasha abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona no kutumva. Isohora amajwi aranguruye kandi yinjyana ihindura amajwi n'umuvuduko byerekana uko ibimenyetso byambukiranya: amajwi atontoma atinda ngo \"ntugende\" (bisobanurwa muri patenti nk \"ijwi rya locator\") hamwe na \"tick-tock-tick-tock\" byihutirwa byerekana igihe cyo kwambuka. \"Kapow!\" menyesha abumva impinduka muri leta. hifashishijwe mikoro ikurikirana buri gihe urusaku rwumuhanda, kugirango ikomeze kumvikana hejuru yacyo. \nIfite kandi umwambi munini ushushanyijeho kumwanya wambere werekana icyerekezo cyo kwambuka. Imiterere ya tactile yo gushushanya igamije gukora ifatanije na pave ya tactile kugirango birinde urujijo. [\"Ibisobanuro bikenewe\"] Yateguwe kandi mu gufasha abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva kuko umwambi ushushanyijeho ku rubaho rw'imbere uhinda umushyitsi hamwe na injyana ya injyana, bigatuma abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva berekana ibimenyetso byihuse kandi byoroheje byerekana igihe bagomba kwambuka. \nMu muco uzwi.\nIbimenyetso byo mumuhanda byerekana amajwi ya PB / 5 byakorewe mu ndirimbo nyinshi, harimo nka \" Bad Guy \" ya Billie Eilish na \"Gucana amatara\" ya Giuseppe Ottaviani. "}
{"id": "20974", "revid": "17987", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20974", "title": "Kells Crozier", "text": "Kells crozier cyangwa \"Ingoro Ndangamurage y'Ubwongereza Crozier\" ni Crozier niyo muri Irlande yo hambere. Bizwi cyane nka \"Kells Crozier\", byerekana gufatanya na Abbey ba Kells, nubwo nta kimenyetso kibigaragaza kibaho, kandi abahanga mu by'amateka benshi bemeza ko ari ibimenyetso bidashidikanywaho. Crozier ntago yuzuye, nubwo bimwe mubisharizo bimeze nabi.\nInkomoko yabyo mbere yuko igaragara mu kugurishwa i Londres mu 1850 iyaje kubura ratakara, kandi iri mu bigize icyegeranyo cy\u2019ingoro z'umurage w'u Bwongereza kuva mu 1859. \nIbisobanuro.\nKells Crozier yakozwe nabanyabukorikori batandukanye mu byiciro bitatu bitandukanye hagati yikinyejana cya 9 na 11 nyuma ya Yesu. Mugihe intandaro ya crozier ari igiti gikozwe mu ifeza kandi abakozi bapfundikijwe mu rupapuro ruvanze n'umuringa nyuma yaje gutwikirizwa ifeza cyangwa udusimba twuzuyemo intera y'inyamaswa zisanzwe muri kiriya gihe. mugihe umutwe wumuntu ushyirwa kumatonyanga kumpera ya crook. Aha niho crozier yaba yarigeze gufata ibisigisigi byera. Isahani yamanutse yigeze gufata igice cyigiciro cyagaciro ubu cyatakaye. \nUburebure bwuzuye bupima nka 133\u00a0cm. \nInkomoko n'ibimenyetso.\nMunsi yigitereko cyanditseho handitsweho ikilatini kivanze n\u2019ururimi rwa kera rwo muri Irilande: \"ordo conduilis ocius do mel finnen\", bisobanuwe hafi, isaba abasaba gusengera C\u00faduilig na Maelfinn\u00e9n bagize uruhare runini cyane mu kuyivugurura. Intiti zerekanye aya mazina n'abantu ku giti cyabo bari bafitanye isano n\u2019imiturire ikomeye yo muri Irilande i Kells, County Meath. Nyamara, ubushakashatsi buherutse gutera gushidikanya kuriyi sano.\nCrozier yabonetse nta bisobanuro mu kabati k'ibiro by'abunganizi ba Londere mugihugu cy'ubwongereza hagati mu kinyejana cya cumi n'icyenda. Yari iy'aba nyirayo benshi, barimo Cardinal Wiseman (1802\u20131865), mbere yo kugurwa n'inzu ndangamurage y'Ubwongereza akaba ariyo iri kureberera Kells crozier. "}
{"id": "20975", "revid": "10947", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20975", "title": "Ray Super Remote", "text": "Ray Super Remote nigikoresho gikora kuri ecran ya kure igenzura ibyo kureba no kugenzura urugo rwawe mu rwego rw'umutekeno. Igicuruzwa kigizwe na touchscreen ya kure na stand yo kwishyuza. Ikirangantego gishobora kugenzura TV, agasanduku k'insinga, imashini zakira, abakinyi ba Blu-ray, imashini yimikino hamwe namatara yubwenge hamwe na thermostat.\nRay Super Remote yashinzwe na Ray Enterprises iherereye mu mujyi wa New York itangira mu Kwakira 2015. Muri Gashyantare 2017, Ray Enterprises yirukanye abakozi bose ihagarika ubucuruzi bwayo."}
{"id": "20976", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20976", "title": "Lightning Switch", "text": "Lightning Switch ni sisiteme ya tekinoroji idafite amashanyarazi kandi idafite amashanyarazi ikoreshwa na PulseSwitch Systems, umunyamuryango wa The Face Companies Group of Norfolk, Virginia. Irakoreshwa cyane nkumucyo utagira umugozi.\nGusarura ingufu.\nImashanyarazi ikwirakwiza ntisaba isoko y'amashanyarazi. Igihe cyose kanda ya transmitter, imashini itanga imbaraga zi mashini zitangwa nurutoki rwumukoresha mumashanyarazi kugirango itange radiyo kubakira / kwifashisha generator ya piezoelectric (izina ryikirango: Umurabyo) yahimbwe nubuyobozi bwigihugu gishinzwe indege n\u2019ikirere. Iri koranabuhanga ryasobanuwe mu nomero ya 2005 yikinyamakuru NASA \"Spinoff\". \nIkoranabuhanga.\nLightning Swith muri Concept Home 2007 i Omaha, muri Nebraska, igice cyubufatanye mu guteza imbere ikoranabuhanga mu miturire (PATH) cyahujwe n\u2019ishami ry\u2019Amerika rishinzwe imiturire n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019imijyi.\nLightning byizwe numujyanama wa HUD Newport Partners, LLC ya Davidsonville, Maryland muri Amerika.\nLightning Switch yatsindiye igihembo cya NOVA 2006, icyubahiro mpuzamahanga mpuzamahanga cyo guhanga udushya mubikorwa byubwubatsi.\nMu Kwakira 2007, NASA yavuze ko akazi ka generator y\u2019umurabyo piezoelectric muri Lightning Switch ari bumwe mu buhanga 20 bwa mbere bwa spinoff bwakozwe mu myaka itanu ishize, bushingiye ku bintu nk\u2019ubuzima bwiza, inyungu z\u2019ubukungu, n\u2019agaciro byagarutse kuri NASA. \nMuri Werurwe 2008, Umurabyo wahinduwe kandi utoranijwe nkuwatsindiye igihembo cya SPIE Smart Structures Award 2008. \nMuri 2012, Umurabyo wahinduwe Umwanya wemejwe na Space Foundation. "}
{"id": "20977", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20977", "title": "Extron Electronics", "text": "Extron, yahoze yitwa Extron Electronics, ni uruganda rukora ibikoresho byamajwi byumwuga. Ifite icyicaro i Anaheim, muri Californiya. Extron ikora ibiro birenga 30 hamwe namahugurwa yo mukarere hamwe n\u2019ibikorwa byo kwerekana ku isi.\nIbicuruzwa bya Extron bikoreshwa muguhuza amashusho na nikorana buhanga rya mudasobwa, guhinduranya, no gukwirakwiza ibimenyetso kubigaragaza byumwuga hamwe na umushinga. Isosiyete ni ISO 9001: 2015 yemejwe \nMuri 2004, Extron yinjiye muri sisitemu yo kugenzura isoko. Ubu itanga uburyo bwo kugenzura ndetse no gutunganya amajwi, buto ya buto, gukoraho, hamwe nibisubizo byinshi bya software. Muri 2010, Extron yaguze igabana ryibicuruzwa bya Electrosonic. \nMuri 2012 Extron yafunguye amagorofa yo gukoreramo yayo atandatu, metero kare 200.000 icyicaro gikuru ku isi muri Anaheim; harimo ikigo cyamahugurwa, inkunga ya tekiniki n'ibiro byo kwamamaza, hamwe na resitora yitwa Ubworozi. \nMuri 2014, Extron yinjiye mwisoko ryo gufata amasomo hamwe nibikoresho byuma bifata ibimenyetso bya videwo. "}
{"id": "20978", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20978", "title": "Universal Receiver", "text": "Universal Receivel mubisanzwe ni radiyo yakira kandi ishoboye gukorana na transmitter zitandukanye.\nMugihe habayeho Automation cyangwa uburyo bwikora, ibi byerekana imashini yakira radio ikorana nigenzura rya kure hafi yisoko mubisanzwe, ikoreshwa mugukingura amarembo, inzugi za garage, inzitizi zumuhanda, inzugi zinjira, nibindi. Muyandi magambo, uwakiriye kwisi yose arashobora kumenya code yoherejwe nubundi buryo busanzwe kandi butari busanzwe bwa kure, kandi birakwiriye gusimbuza iyakirwa ryemerera kongeramo ibishya kandi bitandukanye bigenzura kuri sisitemu yo gutangiza.\nAmavu n'amavuko.\nGufungura urugi rwa mbere rwamashanyarazi rwakozwe mumwaka wa 1921 na CG Johnson. Yatahuye ko hari ikibazo cyuko inzugi za garage ziri munzira mugihe bikenewe gukingurwa agashaka igisubizo cyahindura uburyo abanyamerika bazamura inzugi za garage ubuziraherezo. Yayise \"umuryango wa garage uzamura hejuru.\" Mugihe iki gihangano cyakozwe abantu benshi bahanahana amafarashi kandi amabisi basabiraga uburyo bunoze. Kubwibyo, CG Johnson yaremye \"urugi rwo hejuru rwo kuzamura urugi rwa garage\" rwazamuye kandi ruva mu nzira rwose kandi ntirwatwara umwanya kuko rwazamutse aho kuba uruhande rumwe. \nKoresha.\nHamwe nimikoreshereze ya \"Universal Receivers\" irashobora gukoreshwa mubuzima bwa buri munsi ifasha nyirurugo usanzwe kuzamura inzugi za garage. Ibi bikoreshwa mugukingura gufunga cyangwa gufungura kuzimya ibikoresho cyangwa ibice binini byimashini. Naho amasosiyete manini ibi nabyo birakenewe mugihe cyo gutumiza cyangwa kohereza ibicuruzwa hanze bigiye bitandukanye. Byasaba akazi kenshi kugirango uzamure intoki inzugi nini za garage no gufungura amarembo aremereye. Urundi rugero ni abafungura amarembo y'amashanyarazi. Ibi birashobora gukoreshwa kubafungura amarembo yumuriro murwego rwabaturanyi kubwumutekano. Aho kugira ngo umuntu atware intoki imbere yabaturanyi iyo umushyitsi ageze kode irashobora gutangwa kuburyo burigihe burigihe kode yinjijwe imiryango y amarembo irakingura byikora."}
{"id": "20979", "revid": "10947", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20979", "title": "Braille Magazine", "text": "Ikinyamakuru Braille nikinyamakuru cyimpapuro cyanditse muburyo bwa braille.\nIbinyamakuru byinshi bisanzwe bitanga ibipapuro zahinduwe, zacapwe muburyo rimwe na rimwe bita \"Kanda Braille\". \nIbisohokayandikiro.\nMuri Amerika, serivisi yigihugu y'ubuntu ikwirakwiza ibinyamakuru bya braille nibindi bitabo bitandukanye. "}
{"id": "20980", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20980", "title": "Communication access real-time translation", "text": "Communication access realtime translation (CART), byitwa kandi gufungura ibisobanuro cyangwa kwandikirwa igihe cyangwa kwandikirwa igihe nyacyo, ni izina rusange ry'imikorere ikoreshwa n'abandika amagambo y'ibiganiro (stenographe) n'abandi mu bahindura ijwi cyangwa amagambo yauzwe mu nyandiko. Umukoresha watojwe yandika amagambo nyayo yavuzwe akoresheje clavier idasanzwe ya fonetike, cyangwa uburyo bwa stenografiya, atanga ibisobanuro byizewe kandi by'ukuri byerekanwa kubakira kuri ecran, mudasobwa igendanwa, cyangwa ikindi gikoresho. Abanyamwuga ba CART bafite ubumenyi bwo kongerera ubumenyi (umuvuduko nukuri) ugereranije nabanyamakuru binkiko nabandi ba stenographe.\nPorogaramu imvugo-y-inyandiko ikoreshwa nabanditsi bijwi kugirango batange CART.\nCART ni ingirakamaro mu gutuma itumanaho rigera kubantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva cyangwa kutumva neza,kuko igihe cyo kuvuga-ku-gihe gikora benshi bafite ikibazo cyo kutumva no kutumva. Ibisobanuro byateganijwe n\u2019amategeko y\u2019abanyamerika bafite ubumuga (ADA) nkimfashanyo cyangwa serivisi zifasha. Mu ishuri rifite abanyeshuri batumva cyangwa batumva neza, CART nuburyo bwiza bwo gukoresha bufatanije cyangwa aho gusobanura ururimi rw amarenga, icyakora, icyemezo cyafashwe kijyanye nigikoresho kigomba gukoreshwa kigomba gushingira kubyo abantu bakeneye serivisi bakeneye. Igiciro cya serivisi CART kiri hagati ya $ 60 kugeza 200 $ kumasaha. Kubera iyo mpamvu, abantu bamwe bareba Automatic Speech Recognition (ASR) nka serivisi ihendutse. Ariko, ASR ntabwo isobanutse neza kandi irashobora gutinda kubisubizo, bigatuma bidafite akamaro mubihe byishuri. CART ishobora kandi gufasha abantu ururimi rwabo rwa mbere rutandukanye n'ururimi rukoreshwa, kugirango basobanukirwe n'abavuga bafite amajwi n'imivugire itandukanye mu bihe byinshi by'amatsinda (mu kazi, mu mashuri, mu bikorwa by'umuryango) kugira ngo babone \" inyandiko y'ibivuga\" kandi ibafashe no kwiga indimi.\nCART ya kure ikorwa hamwe nu mukoresha wahuguwe ahantu kure. Ihuza ry'ijwi nka terefone, terefone igendanwa, cyangwa mikoro ya mudasobwa ikoreshwa mu kohereza ijwi kubakoresha, kandi inyandiko nyayo yoherejwe inyuma kuri modem, interineti, cyangwa andi makuru ahuza.\nMu bihugu bimwe, CART irashobora kwitwa Palantype, Velotype, STTR (kuvuga-inyandiko-mvugo)."}
{"id": "20981", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20981", "title": "ColorADD", "text": "ColorADD ni uburyo bw'amarangamutima cyangwa ibimenyetso bigenewe gufasha abantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona kumenya amabara, ubu buryo bwashyizweho n'umunyabugeni w'umunyaPorutugali akaba n'umwarimu muri kaminuza ya Minho,witwa Miguel Neiva. Igizwe na geometrike ishushanya amabara hamwe namabara. Porogaramu yatsindiye icyiciro cya Vodafone Foundation Mobile 2013 Ibihe byiza byu Burayi. \nKode.\nKode ishingiye ku bimenyetso bitanu shingiro: inyabutatu ebyiri (imwe izengurutse hejuru indi ijya hepfo), umurongo umwe wa diagonal, agasanduku kamwe kare kare hamwe nagasanduku kare kare karimo umukara, umweru n'amabara y'ibanze yerekana ibara rya RYB: umutuku, ubururu, n'umuhondo. Amabara akomoka ku yandi mabara afite ibimenyetso byamabara ahuriweho, arema amabara akomoka (orange, icyatsi, umutuku nubururu) nijwi ryijimye cyangwa ryera. Amabara y'icyuma nka feza cyangwa zahabu yerekanwa hamwe n'ibumoso ibumoso ku bimenyetso.\nGukoresha no kumenyekana.\nKuva yashingwa, ColorADD yakoreshejwe muri serivisi zitandukanye, cyane cyane muri Porutugali:\nYamenyekanye kandi na kaminuza ya Buenos Aires na TEDx Porto.\nMuri Nzeri 2017, Mattel yashyize ahagaragara amabara meza ya Uno akoresha ColorADD. \nAmafaranga no kugabanya imikoreshereze.\nSisitemu ifite uburenganzira ; ntabwo iri murwego rusange, ntanubwo yabiherewe uburenganzira. Imikoreshereze igomba gutangirwa uruhushya na sosiyete yigenga yunguka \"Miguel Neiva &amp; Associados - igishushanyo mbonera cya gr\u00e1fico, Lda.\" n'amafaranga ntabwo ari rusange. Ukurikije ColorADD \"amafaranga yimpushya ahindurwa kumwirondoro wa mugenzi wawe\". Hariho moderi ya bono gusa kumashuri makuru na kaminuza bicungwa na ONG idaharanira inyungu \"ColorADD.\" \"Imibereho\". \nKunegura.\nIcyerekezo.\nKimwe mu bintu nyamukuru binenga sisitemu ya ColorADD ni uko bimwe mu bimenyetso by'amabara bishobora kwitiranya iyo bihinduwe, bisa nuburyo imibare yicyarabu 6 na 9 ari amashusho yindorerwamo. Kurugero, ibimenyetso bihagarariye umutuku n'ubururu byombi bikoresha umuzenguruko (triangle) usa, ariko werekejwe mubyerekezo bitandukanye, naho ibimenyetso by'icyatsi na orange bikaba bisa nk'ishusho y'indorerwamo (mirror image) y'ubundi.\nMu mikoreshereze imwe n'imwe, iki kibazo cyakemuwe hiyongeraho umurongo ngenderwaho kugirango werekane hepfo yikimenyetso, muburyo busa nuburyo imibare itandatu nicyenda yicyarabu ishobora gusobanurwa. Ibi byongera urusaku kubishushanyo kandi birashobora kugabanya umuvuduko wo kumenya ibimenyetso bimwe na bimwe bya ColADAD. Mugihe imibare yicyarabu yabayeho hashize ibinyejana byinshi, sisitemu ya vuba ya ColADADD yashoboraga kuba yarakozwe mubitekerezo.\nAmabara akoreshwa nka code.\nMubihe byinshi, amabara akoreshwa nka code yikindi kintu. Muri ibi bihe, guhitamo ibara akenshi uko bishakiye. Gukoresha ibimenyetso byamabara birashobora kongeramo urwego rutari rukenewe rwo kwerekera hamwe nibindi bimenyetso bitaziguye ni amahitamo meza.\nKurugero, amabara yashizwe kumurongo kurikarita yo gutwara abantu uko bishakiye. Nka ibara, akenshi bahabwa ibaruwa cyangwa umubare. Aho gusubiramo ibimenyetso bya ColorADD, byaba byiza usubije inyuguti cyangwa umubare kurikarita cyangwa ugahitamo ibara ryiza-palette. Urundi rugero ni amabara ya code ya [gutandukanya imyanda]. Murugero, ibimenyetso byerekana ibishobora gushyirwa muri buri bin byaba byiza cyane."}
{"id": "20982", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20982", "title": "Cognitive orthotics", "text": "Cognitive orthotics ni sisitemu zishingiye kuri porogaramu (software) zifasha abantu bafite ubumuga bwo mumitekerereze, nk'abibagirwa,zibibutsa ibintu by'ingenzi mu buzima bwa buri munsi.\nUbumuga bwo mumitekerereze burashobora gutera ibibazo mu bushobozi bwo kwigenga, harimo n'ibikorwa by'ubuzima bwa buri munsi. Abafite ubumuga bworoheje bw\u2019ubwenge barashobora kubona ubumenyi bwigenga buhagije, mu gihe abashyizwe mu majwi nk\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe budakunze kugera kuri urwo rwego rw'ubwigenge. Mugihe gahunda za mahugurwa zishobora kuba uburyo bwo gucengeza no gushyigikira ubuzima bwigenga, izo gahunda zerekanye intsinzi zitandukanye, bitewe n'umuntu uvugwa nimirimo ashinzwe. Umubare w'intambwe cyangwa ibintu bigoye by'imirimo isanzwe ya buri munsi birashobora gutuma bigora umuntu ufite ubumuga bwo kutamenya, kandi ikosa mubyiciro byose rishobora kuganisha kubisubizo bitemewe. \nIbikoresho nka mudasobwa byakoreshejwe mu gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe abantu bafite ibikomere mu bwonko. Guhera kuri \"prostothique memoire\" no mu myaka ya za 1980 yerekeza ku gukemura ikibazo cy'ubwonko bukorwa binyuze mu myitozo isubiramo, abahanga mu by'imitekerereze ya muntu ni bo bonyine bakoraga porogaramu ku barwayi bakomeretse mu bwonko, bigatuma porogaramu zihari. Inzobere mu gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe zahisemo imikino yo kuri mudasobwa iboneka mu bucuruzi ishimishije cyane, ishishikaje, isubiramo, kandi ishimishije, yerekana ingaruka zishobora gukosorwa ku mikorere mibi ya neuropsychologue. Ibyavuye mu bikorwa bya mbere byo gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe mudasobwa byagabanijwe kandi, mu bice byinshi, ntibyari byitezwe. Mugihe imyitozo isubiramo yatezimbere imikorere mubikorwa byihariye byakorwaga, iyi ngaruka ntabwo yageze no mubindi bikorwa. \nAbantu bashobora kungukira mur cognitive orthotics barimo abasaza cyangwa abakuze, abantu bagize impanuka z'ingenge(TBI), abantu bafite ibibazo byo kwibagirwa, cyangwa ufite ubundi bumuga bwo mu mitekerereze cyangwa mu mikurirre. Porogaramu irashobora kuba ikubiyemo ibintu byo kwiga imashini, ubwenge bwubukorikori, hamwe no kumenya imiterere kugirango ihuze ibyifuzo byabantu muburyo bukwiye. "}
{"id": "20983", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20983", "title": "Ikiranga ifaranga rya Kanada", "text": "Ikiranga ifaranga rya Kanada kiranga urutonde rwinoti zo muri Kanada Urugendo na Frontier inoti zo muri Kanada kugirango zifashe abantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona kumenya inoti. Icyo kimenyetso cyerekana agaciro k'urupapuro rw'ifaranga cyangwa inoti mu gice cyo hejuru ibumoso ku ruhande rwo imbere rw'ifaranga, hakoreshewje urukurikirane rw'utudomo twazamuwe. Byasabwe na Bruno Th\u00e9riault, umuyobozi w'ikigo cy'igihugu cya Kanada gishinzwe abatabona, kandi cyateguwe na Susan Lederman, umwarimu w\u2019imyororokere muri kaminuza ya Mwamikazi. \nNubwo bisa nkaho bigaragara kuri braille, biratandukanye kuko Braille isanzwe yabonaga ko ikabije. Ifaranga ry'ifaranga rigomba kumenyekana byoroshye, bityo inoti zikoresha blille yuzuye (cyangwa selile) y'utudomo 6 \u27e8 \u27e8 \u27e9 Umushinga w'amadolari 5 ufite selile imwe, hamwe n'amadorari 10, $ 20, na $ 50 buri umwe afite selile imwe kurenza iyambere. Amadolari 100 $ afite selile ebyiri zitunganijwe kuburyo hari umwanya wa selile ebyiri zubusa hagati yabo: \u27e8\nSisitemu isa cyane n'iyo y'utudomo twumva ukozwe muburyo buzamuwe iri gushyirwa mu bikorwa mu rupapuro rushya rw'amafaranga rwa col\u00f3n ya Costa Rican. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nIsanduku ya Leta zunze ubumwe za Amerika yatangaje ko inoti nshya $ 10 nayo izaba ifite uburyo bworoshye. \nInyandiko.\nIkiranga tactile kigizwe n'ibimenyetso bitandatu bizamuye (inkingi ebyiri za eshatu) bitandukanijwe n'ubuso bworoshye. Umubare n'umwanya by'ibi bimenyetso bitandatu biratandukana ukurikije amadini: "}
{"id": "20984", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20984", "title": "Cambium Learning Group", "text": "Cambium Learning Group nisosiyete ikora ibijyanye n\u2019ubumenyi n\u2019ikoranabuhanga muri Amerika ikora porogaramu ya mudasobwa n\u2019ibikoresho bikoresha abanyeshuri kuva mu ishuri ry\u2019incuke kugeza ku bakuze. Kwiga kwa Cambium nisosiyete ya portfolio ya Veritas Capital, ikigo cyigenga cyigenga cya New York. \nAmateka.\nIsosiyete Dallas, Texas ishingiye kuri Texas yashinzwe mu 2003. \nAmashami y'iyi kompanyi y'ubucuruzi yitwa Learning AZ, Learning Lexia, VoyagerSopris, ExploreLearning, Cambium Assessment, Kurzweil Education, na VKidz.\nNyuma yimyaka irenga 18 akorana niyi sosiyete, Umuyobozi mukuru John Campbell yasezeye muri Gicurasi 2022, asimburwa na Ashley Anderson Zantop. \nKugura.\nUburezi bwa Kurzweil (ahahoze ari Kurzweil Educational Systems) bwaguzwe muri Mata 2005. \nUkuboza 2009,Cambium Learning na Voyager Sopris Learning (yahoze yitwa Voyager Learning Company) byahujwe na sosiyete nshya yashinzwe Cambium Learning Group, Inc. \nIsosiyete yaguze Class.com mu 2011 ku mafaranga miliyoni 4.5 y\u2019amadolari. \nVKidz Holdings, Inc. yaguzwe mu Kuboza \nKwiga kwa Cambium byabonye Ikigo cy\u2019Abanyamerika gishinzwe Ubushakashatsi (AIR) K-12 cyo gusuzuma muri Mutarama 2020. \nMuri Nzeri 2020, mu masezerano y\u2019amafaranga yose, Cambium yaguze Rosetta Kibuye ifite agaciro ka miliyoni 792 z'amadolari. Umwaka wakurikiyeho muri Gashyantare 2021, isosiyete yagurishije imigabane yayo ya Rosetta Stone muri IXL Learning. \nIyi kompanyi yaguze Lexia muri Ukwakira 2020, naho mu 2021, Lexia ifatanya cg ihuzwa na Voyager Sopris ngo habeho Lexia Learning. \nMu 2021, Blackstone Group Inc yafashije gutanga inkunga ingana na miliyari 2.15 z'amadorali yo kwiga Cambium Learning Group. "}
{"id": "20985", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20985", "title": "Butler in a Box", "text": "Butler in a Box yari igikoresho cya hambere cyo murugo cyagenzura n'amajwi, cyakozwe mu 1983 cyakozwe n'umupfumu Gus Searcy hamwe na Franz Kavan umuporogaramu. Igikoresho cyemereye abakoresha kugenzura ibikoresho bya elegitoroniki byo murugo, nk'amatara na terefoni, bakoresheje amategeko y'ijwi. Byabanjirije abavuga ubwenge bigezweho hamwe nabafasha basanzwe mumyaka mirongo. \nAmateka.\nIgitekerezo cya Butler in a Box cyatangiye mu 1983 ubwo Searcy yabazwaga n'inshuti impamvu adashobora gutegeka gusa amatara gucana no kuzimya niba ashobora gukuramo inkwavu mu ngofero, bitewe n'amateka ye nk'umupfumu wabigize umwuga. Searcy yafatanije nu wahoze ari programu wa IBM Kavan guteza imbere icyo gikoresho, prototype yabo ya mbere yiswe \"Sidney\". Butler in a box yahujije tekinoroji yo kugenzura kure hamwe no kumenya amajwi kugirango igenzure ibikoresho byo murugo. Nyamara, yahuye n\u2019ibibazo bitewe n\u2019ikoranabuhanga rigezweho muri iki gihe hamwe n\u2019igiciro cyayo cyo hejuru cy\u2019amadolari 1.500 (ahwanye n\u2019amadolari 3.700 muri 2021). \nIbiranga n'imikorere.\nAbakoresha barashobora gukora Butler in a box bavuga ijambo kubyuka, mubisanzwe izina rya butler gakondo, kandi igikoresho cyabwira umukoresha nka \"shobuja\". Yashoboye gukora imirimo nka:\nAriko,icyo gikoresho cyasabaga imyitozo myinshi y'amajwi ku muntu wese wagikoresheje, kandi icyo gikorwa cyari kizamura igihe cyane ugereranyije n'uburyo bugezweho bwo kumenya amajwi. Byongeye kandi, igenamigambi hamwe namabwiriza yatojwe yatakara mugihe ingufu zashize mumasaha arenga 3 kubera tekinoroji yo kwibuka ihindagurika yakoreshejwe icyo gihe. \nKwakira n'umurage.\nNubwo guhanga udushya mugihe cyacyo, Butler mu Isanduku ntabwo yageze ku ntsinzi y\u2019ubucuruzi kubera igiciro cyayo kinini ndetse n\u2019ubushobozi bwa tekinike yo mu myaka ya za 1980. Nubwo bimeze bityo, cyabaye intambwe y'ingenzi mu mateka y'iterambere ry'ikoranabuhanga ryo mu ngo, kandi cyagaragaje uburyo ikoranabuhanga rigenzura n'amajwi rishobora gutuma ibintu byoroha kandi bigatanga uburyo bworoshye bwo gukoresha mu rugo. Nyuma y'igihe, Amazon Alexa, Google Home, na Siri byatumye ibikoresho byo mu rugo bigengwa n'amajwi biba bisanzwe kandi bihendutse, byubakiye ku Butler in a box [\u200b\u200b "}
{"id": "20986", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20986", "title": "Rehabilitation Engineering and Assistive Technology Society of North", "text": "The Rehabilitation Engineering and Assistive Technology Society of North America(RESNA) ni ihuriro ry'abantu bafite inyungu mu bijyanye n'ikoranabuhanga rifasha abantu bafite n'ubumuga. Inshingano zayo zerekana ko intego ya RESNA ari ukuzamura ubushobozi bw\u2019abafite ubumuga kugera ku ntego zabo hifashishijwe ikoranabuhanga binyuze mu guteza imbere ubushakashatsi, iterambere, uburezi, ubuvugizi no gutanga ikoranabuhanga; no mugushyigikira abatanga serivise yikoranabuhanga itanga ibikorwa.\nRESNA yatangiye muri Kanama 1979. Mu 1993 RESNA yabaye umuryango wigenga. RESNA ifite abanyamuryango barenga 1.000, igice kinini cyabo kikaba cyibanze muri Amerika na Kanada.\nGuhera mu 1995, RESNA yateguye gahunda yo gutanga impamyabumenyi kubanyamwuga bakora nkabatanga serivise zikoranabuhanga. Mu Kuboza 2015, Sosiyete ishinzwe gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe Rehabilitation Engineering Assistive Technology Society yo muri Amerika y'Amajyaruguru (RESNA) yavuguruye ibipimo bya WC18 ku bipimo by\u2019ibimuga hamwe na sisitemu yo kubuza abayigana (WTORS) ibipimo by\u2019ibimuga hamwe na sisitemu yo kubuza abantu (WTORS). RESNA iyobowe n'Inama y'Ubuyobozi igizwe n'abantu 14. Perezida ni Roger O. Smith, PhD, OT, FAOTA, Mugenzi wa RESNA"}
{"id": "20987", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20987", "title": "Smart Device", "text": "Smart Device nigikoresho cya elegitoronike, muri rusange gihujwe nibindi bikoresho cyangwa imiyoboro ikoresheje protocole itandukanye (nka Bluetooth, Zigbee, itumanaho hafi y\u2019umurima, Wi-Fi, NearLink, Li-Fi, cyangwa 5G) ishobora gukora ku rugero runaka mu buryo bwikora kandi bwigenga. ndetse n'ubwoko butandukanye bwibikoresho byubwenge ni terefone zigendanwa, abavuga rikoresha ubwenge, imodoka zifite ubwenge, amakarita yubwenge, thermostat yubwenge, inzogera zumuryango, gufunga ubwenge, firigo zikoresha ubwenge, fableti na tableti, amasaha yubwenge, bande yubwenge, urufunguzo rwubwenge, ibirahuri byubwenge, TV yubwenge, nibindi byinshi. Ijambo rishobora kandi kwerekeza ku gikoresho cyerekana ibintu bimwe na bimwe byo kubara hose, harimo - nubwo atari ngombwa - kwiga imashini.\nIbikoresho byubwenge bishobora gushushanywa kugirango bishyigikire ibintu bitandukanye byuburyo butandukanye, ndetse n'ibintu bitandukanye bijyanye na comptabilite ahantu hose kandi bigakoreshwa muburyo butatu bwa sisitemu yibidukikije: isi yumubiri, ibidukikije bishingiye kubantu, hamwe nogukwirakwiza mudasobwa. Amazu yubwenge yerekana ko hari sensor hamwe nibikoresho bimwe na bimwe byerekana, ibikoresho, hamwe nububikoshingiro bwo kubigenzura. \nImiterere.\nMu 1991, Mark Weiser yagaragaje uburyo butatu bwibanze bwibikoresho bya sisitemu ahantu hose: tabs, padi na kibaho. \nUbu buryo butatu bwagaragajwe na Weiser burangwa na macro nini, ifite formari planar hamwe no gushiramo amashusho yerekanwe. Ibi kandi byarebwaga byinshi nkibikoresho byamakuru. Niba buri kimwe muri ibyo biranga cyoroheje, uru rwego rushobora kwagurwa muburyo butandukanye kandi bushobora kuba ingirakamaro mubikoresho byo kubara hose. \nIbiranga.\nIbikoresho byubwenge mubusanzwe bigizwe nicyuma (harimo na radio itanga ibimenyetso), urwego rwumuyoboro (unyuzamo ibikoresho bivugana nka telephone n'ibindi), hamwe nurwego rusaba (abakoresha amaherezo batanga amategeko). Izi nzego akenshi zirimo ibintu bikurikira:\nUbwoko busanzwe bwibikoresho byubwenge birimo:\nIbikoresho byose bibarwa.\nIcyerekezo cya Weiser kubijyanye no kubara hose bishobora gukusanyirizwa hamwe muburyo bubiri bwibanze:\nIcya kabiri, ijambo \"ibikoresho byubwenge bidukikije\" bishobora kandi kwerekeza kumyumvire yibidukikije byubwenge byibanda cyane cyane kubidukikije byumubiri. bifite ubwenge kuko byashizwemo cyangwa bitatanye nibikoresho byubwenge bishobora kumva no kugenzura igice cyacyo."}
{"id": "20988", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20988", "title": "Tictile Alphabet", "text": "Tactile Alphabet ni uburyo bwo kwandika ndetse no gusoma bukoreshwa n'abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona. Mugihe kuri ubu sisitemu ya Braille niyo izwi cyane kandi ibikoresho bimwe byateguwe muburyo bwukwezi, mumateka, izindi nyuguti nyinshi zifite ubundi buryo bwinshi bwo kugirango uzisobanukirwe:\nIhuza ryo hanze.\nAmashakiro"}
{"id": "20989", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20989", "title": "ATutor", "text": "ATutor ni sisitemu yo ku rubuga rwa interineti ishingiye ku bumenyi bwo kwiga (LMS) ifunguye ku bantu bose (open source).\nKoresha.\nATutor ikoreshwa mu buryo butandukanye, harimo gucunga amasomo ku murongo, gukomeza iterambere ry'umwuga ku barimu, guteza imbere umwuga, n'ubushakashatsi bw'amasomo. Porogaramu ivugwa ko idasanzwe kubera uburyo bwo kuyigeraho, (ingirakamaro ku bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona); hamwe n'uburyo bukwiye bwo gukoresha uburezi ukurikije ibipimo ngenderwaho byo gusuzuma sofutiweya(software) byashyizweho na Sosiyete y'Abanyamerika ishinzwe Amahugurwa n'Iterambere (ASTD). ATutor ikoreshwa ku rwego mpuzamahanga kandi yahinduwe cyangwa yashyizwe mu ndimi zirenga cumi n'eshanu, ifite kandi inkunga y'izindi ndimi zirenga mirongo ine ziri mu bikorwa byo gutezwa imbere muri iki gihe. \nKuboneka.\nATutor niyo LCMS yambere yubahirije byimazeyo ibisobanuro bya W3C WCAG 1.0 kurwego rwa AA +, yemerera kugera kubintu byose bikubiye muri sisitemu murwego rwose rwabakoresha-uburenganzira, harimo na konti zabayobozi. Kuba ATutor yujuje ibisabwa na XHTML 1.0 bigamije kwemeza ko igaragarira neza kandi igakora kimwe ku ikoranabuhanga ryose ryemewe.\nAbashinzwe iterambere rya ATutor bemeza ko ari yo yonyine igera kuri porogaramu ya LCMS ku isoko, harimo amafaranga yishyurwa kandi ifunze isoko. Iyi ngingo ya ATutor yemejwe byibuze muri kaminuza imwe yatangajwe na software. ATutor avugwa kandi mubisobanuro byinshi bya tekiniki hamwe nubumenyi; nibindi byinshi byiyongera mugice cya gatatu byateguwe kandi bikwirakwizwa kugirango bikoreshe hamwe na software. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nATutor yarekuwe bwa mbere mu mpera z'umwaka wa 2002.Byaje bisubiza ubushakashatsi bubiri bwakozwe na rwiyemezamirimo mu myaka yashize bwarebaga uburyo bwo kwiga kuri interineti ku bafite ubumuga. Ibyavuye mu bushakashatsi byerekanaga ko nta na kimwe muri gahunda yo Kwiga yo Kwiga ikunzwe muri kiriya gihe ndetse yatanze ibisobanuro bike hamwe n'amabwiriza yo kugerwaho. Icyo gihe impumyi urugero, ntishobora kwitabira byimazeyo amasomo yo kumurongo. \nIbiranga ibintu.\nBabiri, muri benshi, ibiboneka muri sisitemu ni inyandiko isimburana kubintu byose biboneka, hamwe na clavier igera kubintu byose bya porogaramu. Hamwe nibi bintu, umuntu wimpumyi arashobora kumva ibice byose bya sisitemu abifashijwemo numusomyi wa ecran, kandi arashobora kugera kuri sisitemu adakeneye imbeba. Ibi biranga kandi byemerera ATutor guhuza tekinoloji zitandukanye zirimo terefone ngendanwa, abafasha mu makuru yihariye (PDAs), hamwe n\u2019urubuga rushingiye ku nyandiko, kuvuga amazina make. \nATutor ikubiyemo ibikoresho byandika bikubiyemo abategura gukora ibikoresho byo kwiga byoroshye. Ibisobanuro nkibi bishishikariza abanditsi kongeramo inyandiko iyindi niba bibagiwe gushyiramo imwe mugihe wongeyeho ishusho, kurugero. Igikoresho cyo kwandika kirimo na serivisi y'urubuga rusuzuma uburyo ibintu byemewe byemewe n\u2019ibipimo mpuzamahanga bitandukanye. Usibye gukora ibintu byoroshye, igikoresho ubwacyo kiragerwaho, cyemerera umukoresha wimpumyi gukora ibirimo ubwabo.\nIbiranga imiterere.\nATutor nayo yashizweho kugirango ihuze na kimwe mubintu byinshi byo kwigisha no kwiga. Hariho ibice bine byingenzi byerekana iri hame ryishusho: insanganyamatsiko, uburenganzira, ibikoresho byifashishwa, hamwe nitsinda. \nSisitemu y'insanganyamatsiko ya ATutor yemerera abayobozi guhitamo byoroshye isura n'imiterere ya sisitemu kubyo bakeneye byihariye. Insanganyamatsiko zikoreshwa muguha ATutor isura nshya, gutanga ibyiciro byamasomo uko basa, cyangwa gutanga verisiyo nyinshi za ATutor kuri sisitemu imwe, aho abakoresha bashobora guhitamo imwe nkigice cyo guhitamo.\nSisitemu yuburenganzira (privelage system) yemera abigisha guha abanyeshuri b'itsinda ry'ishuri uburenganzira bwo gucunga ibikoresho by'ishuri. Abigisha barashobora gukora abafasha cyangwa abarimu bigisha bari bafite ubushobozi buke kuri kimwe mubikoresho byandika cyangwa ubuyobozi. \nE-kwiga impaka za patenti.\nATutor ni bumwe mu buryo butatu bwo gucunga imyigishirize y\u2019amasoko yitiriwe ikibazo cy\u2019ingutu ku buryo bwa e-kwiga bwatanzwe na Blackboard Inc. muri Nyakanga 2006. Ikigo cyita ku bwisanzure bwa software cyatanze icyifuzo cyo kongera gukora ibizamini mu izina rya ATutor, hamwe n\u2019abandi bakiriya babiri mu mpera za 2006. Mu ntangiriro za 2007 icyifuzo cyo kongera gukora ikizamini cyatanzwe n\u2019ibiro by\u2019Amerika bishinzwe ubucuruzi n\u2019ubucuruzi (USPTO). Niba bigenze neza, icyifuzo kizageraho gihagarike ibirego 44 byose byasabwe na patenti. \nMu rwego rwo gushyigikira imbogamizi kuri patenti ya Blackboard, abakorerabushake kurubuga rwa interineti basanze ingero za porogaramu zishaje zakoresheje ibitekerezo byavuzwe na patenti. Aba bakorerabushake bafatanije gukora inyandiko ya Wikipedia ku mateka y\u2019ibidukikije byigamo, itanga ingero nyinshi zubuhanzi bwambere. \nByongeye kandi, Greg Gay, umuyobozi w\u2019umushinga wa ATutor yashimangiye ko ashyigikiye icyifuzo cyo kongera gukora ibizamini: \"Patenti ku gitekerezo cy\u2019uburezi - ni isano iri hagati y\u2019abanyeshuri, abigisha, n\u2019abayobozi - ntabwo byumvikana. Ibitekerezo nkibi ni ibya rubanda kandi byakorwaga mu binyejana byinshi; ntabwo ari ibisubizo by\u2019ubushakashatsi n\u2019iterambere.\""}
{"id": "20990", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20990", "title": "Assistive Technology Industry Association", "text": "The Assistive Technology Industry (ATIA) n\u2019umuryango udaharanira inyungu, ugizwe n'abakora, abacuruza n'abatanga serivisi cyangwa ibikoresho by'ikornabuhanga bifasha abantu bafite ubumuga. ATIA ihagarariye inyungu zabanyamuryango bayo mubucuruzi, guverinoma, uburezi, ninzego nyinshi zikorera ababana nubumuga. Intego imwe ya ATIA ni \"kuvugana nijwi rusange\" kubutumwa bwayo ni ugukora nk'ijwi rusange ry'inganda zita ku ikoranabuhanga (AT) kugirango ibicuruzwa na serivisi nziza bigezwa ku bafite ubumuga. \nATIA yashinzwe mu 1998, iyobowe n'Inama y'Ubuyobozi igizwe n'abantu 10. ATIA ifite abanyamuryango barenga 120 kugiti cyabo no mubigo. Ibiro byayo biherereye i Chicago, muri Illinois.\nKuva mu 1999, ATIA yakoresheje inama ngarukamwaka zitanga amahuriro y'uburezi n\u2019itumanaho kubimenyereza umwuga bakorera ubumuga. Inama ngarukamwaka irakingurwa kandi ku bafite ubumuga, abarezi babo, abo mu muryango wabo, ndetse n\u2019abaturage muri rusange. Muri 2009, ATIA yatangiye gutanga urubuga rwa interineti rwigisha kugirango rukorere ayo matsinda. ATIA yakoze kandi inama ku bufatanye n\u2019umushinga uhuza akazi hamwe n\u2019umushinga w\u2019ubucuruzi muri Amerika (USBLN). Ibisubizo byatangajwe muri imwe muri iyo nama ni \"Ikarita yo Kuzamura Akazi k'abafite ubumuga binyuze mu ikoranabuhanga ryoroshye\".\nIbisohokayandikiro.\nATIA itanga ikinyamakuru gifasha ikorana buhanga hamwe n'inyungu Ikinyamakuru (ATOB) m'ubufatanye bw'ubumenyi n\u2019ikigo cyihariye gishinzwe ubufasha bw\u2019ikoranabuhanga (Centre SEAT) muri kaminuza ya Leta ya Illinois. ATOB itangaza ingingo zijyanye n'ibisubizo n'inyungu z'ikoranabuhanga rifasha ababana n'ubumuga ubuzima bwabo bwose. ATOB ni urungano rwasuzumwe buri mwaka, rwatangajwe bwa mbere mu 2004.\nInganda zisanzwe.\nATIA igira uruhare mubikorwa bisanzwe byinganda binyuze muri Accessibility Interoperability Alliance (AIA). AIA yatangijwe mu 2007 nk\u2019umuryango wigenga nitsinda ryambere rikoresha ikoranabuhanga (IT) hamwe n\u2019ikoranabuhanga rifasha (AT), abatanga ibikubiyemo, n\u2019indi miryango ikomeye y\u2019ubuhanga. Kuva icyo bagiye bakora ibishoboka byose kugira ngo bateze imbere ibipimo ngenderwaho no gufatanya mu gushakira igisubizo ibibazo bimaze igihe bibangikanya bibangamira iterambere ry\u2019ibisubizo by\u2019abafite ubumuga. Muri 2010 AIA ihinduka ishami rya tekiniki n'ubuhanga muri ATIA.\nAbafatanyabikorwa.\nATIA ifatanya n\u2019indi miryango mu bijyanye n\u2019ikoranabuhanga no mu bijyanye n\u2019ubumuga mu rwego rwo kuzamura gukoresha no kumenya uburyo ikoranbuhanga rishobora kungura abantu babana ubumuga. Abafatanyabikorwa ba Alliance ni:"}
{"id": "20991", "revid": "10947", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20991", "title": "Charles Barbier", "text": "Charles Barbier de la Serre (; 18 Gicurasi 1767 - 22 Mata 1841) nibwo yaje guhimba inyandiko ya bafaransa uburyo butandukanye bwo kwandika no gukoresha ubundi buryo bwo kwandika, bumwe muri bwo bukaba bwarahumekeye Braille.\nKwandika ingingo.\nAmahame.\nYasabye uburyo bworoshye bwo kwandika bushingiye kuri gride kandi bwakorohera n'ababana n'ubumuga, yariho muburyo bubiri. Iya mbere ni inyuguti zisanzwe muri gride ya 5x5 (icyo gihe, inyuguti ya W yakoreshwaga gake mu rurimi rwigifaransa).\nHariho na verisiyo ya fonetike, yavugurwagaho amajwi y'ururimi rw'igifaransa. Mu gitabo cya 1815, hari amajwi 30 muri gride y'imirongo itanu n'inkingi esheshatu, ariko Barbier yaje kwagura umubare kugeza kuri 36, muri gride ifite imirongo itandatu n'inkingi esheshatu. Barbier yahisemo verisiyo ya fonetike, avuga ko kwiga amategeko yimyandikire byatanze indi mbogamizi kubatazi gusoma no kwandika. \nNyuma yimyaka, Barbier na Braille bombi bapfuye, Alexandre Ren\u00e9 Pignier yanditse ubuzima bugufi bwa Louis Braille. Muri yo, yasabye ko Braille, akiri muto cyane, yerekanye inenge za sisitemu ya Barbier. Nyuma abanditsi bashushanyije kuriyi nkuru kugirango basobanure guhura kwangwa hagati ya Barbier na Braille akiri muto cyane. Mubyukuri, bombi ntibabonanye kugeza mu 1833, igihe Braille yari mukuru kandi hashize imyaka ine asohoye sisitemu ye. Barbier na Braille babaye inshuti. Amabaruwa hagati yabo bombi yari meza. Mellor arimo imwe mu mabaruwa yanditse mu gitabo cye kivuga kuri Louis Braille. \nBarbier yamaze ubuzima bwe bwose agerageza kumenyekanisha ibitekerezo bye kuburezi rusange. Yanditse ibindi bitabo byinshi kandi agerageza kwinjiza mubantu ibyubu uburyo bwe bwo kwandika kandi bworoshye bwo kwandika arinako abushira mu mumashuri y'incuke, ariko ntibyagerwaho. Ariko, Braille yahinduye sisitemu nibikoresho bya Barbier yabaye sisitemu ikoreshwa kwisi yose muri iki gihe."}
{"id": "20992", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20992", "title": "Decapoint", "text": "Decapoint, cyangwa Raphigraphy, yari uburyo bworoshye bwimyandikire yikilatini yahimbwe na Louis Braille ni sisitemu ikoreshwa mu buryo bw'imyandikire kandi igafasha cyane abantu bafite ibibazo by'ubumuga butandukanye ishobora gukoreshwa nimpumyi nabatabona. Yasohowe mu 1839, nyuma yimyaka icumi nyuma yinyuguti esheshatu zitondetse. Inzandiko zagumanye imiterere yazo, kandi rero byasomwaga nta mahugurwa abareba, ariko imirongo yari igizwe nududomo dushushanyijeho nkayakoreshejwe muri braille. \"Decapoint\" bivuga sisitemu yo kwandika, mugihe \"raphigraphy\" ni ugukoresha imashini ya raphigraph kugirango itange inyandiko.\nBuri baruwa yari ifite utudomo icumi tureture n'uduto buhinduka, niyo mpamvu izina decapoint. Byanditswe mbere byanditseho icyapa na stylus ; Kugirango inyandiko isomeke neza imbere yurupapuro, yakandagiye inyuma nkishusho yindorerwamo. Iyi nzira yari igoye kandi yatwaraga igihe, kandi inyandiko yari nini idasanzwe.\nMu rwego rwo koroshya inzira yo kwandika inyandiko ya decapoint, Pierre-Fran\u00e7ois-Victor Foucault, munyandiko zakundaga gukoreshwa cyane ikifashishwa, yahimbye igishushanyo mbonera (umwanditsi w'urushinge) mu 1841. \nMugihe decapoint yari ifite inyungu zo kuba abantu basomerwa badafite imyitozo, ntabwo byari byiza cyane kandi bikora neza. Kuba umubare wimyandikire wino wamamaye mu myaka ya za 1880 no guhimba umwanditsi wa braille mu 1892 byagize uruhare mu gucika intege no gushushanya bidakoreshwa. Decapoint rimwe na rimwe yakoreshwaga uko byagenda kose muri 1930. "}
{"id": "20993", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20993", "title": "Moon Type", "text": "Moon System ikoreshwa mu Gusoma Ibishushanyo (bakunze kwita ukwezi kwandikwa, Inyuguti zukwezi, inyandiko yukwezi, ubwoko bwukwezi, cyangwa code yukwezi) nuburyo bwo kwandika bwimpumyi, ukoresheje ibimenyetso bishushanyije ahanini biva mumyandikire yikilatini (ariko byoroshe). Bivugwa n'abayishyigikiye ko byoroshye kubyumva kuruta braille, nubwo ikoreshwa cyane cyane nabantu bataye amaso nkabantu bakuru, bityo bakaba bafite ubumenyi bwimiterere yinyuguti.\nAmateka.\nIyi nyandiko yitiriwe Moon Type yakozwe na William Moon (1818\u20141894), umwongereza w'impumyi uba i Brighton, mu burasirazuba bwa Sussex. Nyuma yo kugira umuriro utukura, Moon yabuze amaso afite imyaka 21 aba umwarimu wabana batabona. Yabonye ko abanyeshuri be bagize ikibazo cyo kwiga gusoma uburyo buriho bwo gusoma kodegisi yo gusoma, maze ategura sisitemu ye bwite \"izakingurwa kandi isobanutse neza.\" \nMoon type yatangijwe mu 1843 William kandi asohora gahunda muri 1845. Ukwezi ntabwo kuzwi nka braille, ariko nubundi buryo bw'agaciro. gukoraho gahunda yo gusoma kubantu batabona cyangwa batabona igice cyimyaka yose."}
{"id": "20994", "revid": "10947", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20994", "title": "New York Point", "text": "New York Point (Ingingo ya New York:.\u200b\u200b Sisitemu yakoresheje imwe kugeza kuri ebyiri zingingo zashyizwe kumurongo, buri kimwe kirimo utudomo tumwe cyangwa tubiri. (Inyuguti imwe kugeza kuri ebyiri, buri imwe ifite utudomo tubiri, yaba \u27e8: \u27e9 \u27e8:: \u27e9 \u27e8::: \u27e9 \u27e8::::) Inyuguti zisanzwe zanditswe hamwe ningingo nkeya \u27e9 ingamba nazo zikoreshwa na Braille y'Abanyamerika ubu bwoko bw'imyandikire yashyizweho kugirango ifashe abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona.\nInyuguti nkuru zari zigoye muri iyi sisitemu yitiriwe New York Point, buri imwe yari utudomo tune, kandi ntabwo yakoreshejwe muri rusange. Mu buryo nk'ubwo, muri rusange hashyizweho utudomo tune twagutse na apostrophe. Iyo, inyuguti nkuru, cyangwa intumwa byakoreshwaga, rimwe na rimwe byatezaga ibibazo byemewe, kandi ikimenyetso cyihariye ntigishobora kumvikana. Helen Keller akomeza avuga ko ibyo byateje ibibazo byo gusoma no kwandika mu bana bafite ubumuga bwo kutamenya, kandi ni imwe mu mpaka zikomeye zashinjaga New York Point ndetse no gushyigikira imwe mu nyuguti z\u2019inyuguti.\nInyuguti.\nIyi sisitemu yitiriwe New York Point ntabwo yakorewe mu buryo bwa Unicode, nkuko verisiyo ya 14.0. Kimwe na braille, hariho kwikuramo: inyuguti imwe muri New York Point ihuye nurutonde rwinyuguti zacapwe. \nIngingo ya New York isomwa uhereye ibumoso ugana iburyo. Ikimenyetso kigizwe na selile imwe kugeza enye zikurikiranye buri ngingo ebyiri hejuru hamwe nubugari bumwe. Inyuguti nkuru zose zigizwe na selile enye, mugihe minuscules ihagarariwe numwe kugeza kuri batatu. Buri nyuguti nkuru yakomotse ku nyuguti ntoya ihuye ninyongera ingirabuzimafatizo imwe kugirango inyuguti nkuru igire ubugari bune. Utugingo ngengabuzima twose ni ingingo yo hasi niba selile yanyuma yinyuguti ntoya ifite gusa ingingo yo hejuru. Bitabaye ibyo, selile ziyongera zose ni ingingo yo hejuru gusa.\nUtumenyetso.\nNko muri braille, hari ikimenyetso cyumubare uhindura inyuguti kumibare. Imibare icumi ni imwe ine yerekana utudomo dusanga muri braille, ariko hamwe gusa zose ntago zinganya agaciro:\nUtumenyetso twonyine twerekana utudomo dutatu twagutse ni ikimenyetso cyumubare uri hejuru hamwe nikimenyetso cyatanzwe, gifite imiterere imwe ninyuguti \"q\". Dash, hyphen, na apostrophe ni utudomo tune twagutse. \nInyandiko y'umuziki.\n\u27e8:::: \u27e9 is thus a whole C note, \u27e8\".: \u27e9 a quarter D note, etc. In chords, the length is only given for the first note mentioned.\nIbi birashobora kubanzirizwa na \u27e8 '\u27e9 \u266f,b \u27e8: \u27e9 Or, cyangwa \u27e8' \u27e9 And, kandi byongeweho na \u27e8 \u27e9 (uburebure \u00d7 1\u00bd). Ibi birashobora gukuba kabiri, nkuko biri mu icapiro.\nInyandiko ibanzirizwa na octave yayo, yanditswe nkumubare wongeyeho akadomo ko hejuru: \u27e8':' \u27e9 5 8va, \u27e8 \u27e9 2 8va, nibindi\n 4th-8va C-whole 5th-inv'l with 5th-8va E\nReba ibitabo bya Tegereza kumasezerano yinyongera. "}
{"id": "20995", "revid": "17987", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20995", "title": "Nigt Writing", "text": "Night Writting ni izina ryahawe uburyo bwo kwandika bwagenewe abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona kandi bunakireshywa n'abantu batandukanye bwaritondewe cyane kuko bwahimbwe na Charles Barbier de la Serre (1767\u20131841). Nuburyo bumwe muburyo butandukanye bwo kwandika bwatanzwe mugitabo cyasohowe mu 1815: \"Essai sur divers proc\u00e9d\u00e9s d'exp\u00e9ditive fran\u00e7aise, contenant douze \u00e9critures diff\u00e9rentes, avec une planche pour chaque proc\u00e9d\u00e9\" (Inyandiko ku nzira zitandukanye z\u2019urugendo rw\u2019Abafaransa, ikubiyemo inyandiko cumi na zibiri zitandukanye, hamwe n'isahani kuri buri nzira). Ijambo (mu gifaransa: \"\u00e9criture nocturne\") ntiriboneka mu gitabo, ariko nyuma ryakoreshejwe ku buryo bwerekanwe ku cyapa cya VII cy'icyo gitabo. Ubu buryo bwo kwandika hamwe nududomo twazamuye dushobora gusomwa no gukoraho byemejwe mu kigo Royale des Jeunes Aveugles (Ikigo cy\u2019umwami cy\u2019urubyiruko rutabona) i Paris mu 1821.\nImikorere.\nIhame ryiyi sisitemu ryitiriwe Night Writing rikoreshwa mu kwandukura ukoresheje amajwi 36 atandukanye ya fonetike, buri kimwe kigereranwa nuburyo bwazamuye utudomo muri 2\u00a0\u00d7\u00a0Imiyoboro 6. \nFoneme \"t\" ihagarariwe gutya:"}
{"id": "20996", "revid": "10947", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20996", "title": "Was Sceptre", "text": "Uwiteka Was Sceptre (Abanyamisiri \"w\ua723s\" \"imbaraga, ubutware\") ni ikimenyetso cyagaragaye cyane cyane mubisigisigi, ubuhanzi, ndetse na hieroglyphs bifitanye isano n\u2019idini rya kera rya Misiri. Bigaragara nkumutwe winyamanswa hejuru yumutwe muremure, ugororotse ufite impera.\n\"was Sceptre yaje gu\"koreshwa nk'ikimenyetso cy'imbaraga cyangwa ubutware, kandi yari ifitanye isano n'imana zo mu Misiri za kera nka Set cyangwa Anubisi kimwe na farawo. \"Wari\" septres nayo igereranya inyamanswa cyangwa Khnum. Mugukoresha nyuma, cyari ikimenyetso cyo kugenzura imbaraga zakajagari Set ihagarariye.\nMu rwego rwo gushyingura,inkoni yitiriwe \"Was Sceptre\" yari ifite inshingano zo kumererwa neza kwa nyakwigendera bityo rimwe na rimwe ikaba yarashyizwe mu bikoresho byo mu mva cyangwa mu gushushanya imva cyangwa isanduku. Inkoni nayo ifatwa nk'impumyi. Abanyamisiri babonaga ikirere gishyigikiwe n'inkingi enye, zishobora kugira ishusho \"ya\". Iyi nkoni kandi yari ikimenyetso cya nome ya kane yo mu Misiri yo hejuru, izina rya Thebes (ryitwa \"w\ua723st\" mu Misiri). \ninkoni byaje kugaragaza ko yatwawe nimana, farawo, ndestse na bapadiri. kuko Bikunze kugaragara mubishushanyo, gushushanya, no gushushanya imana, kandi akenshi bigereranywa nibimenyetso nka \"ankh\" na \"djed\" -inkingi. Ibisigisigi byumubiri \"byari\" sceptres byabonetse. Zubatswe muri faience cyangwa ibiti, aho umutwe numurizo wumurizo winyamanswa ya Set bigaragara. Ingero za mbere zanditswe ku ngoma ya mbere."}
{"id": "20997", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20997", "title": "Ubushobozi Scotland", "text": "Capability scotland ni umuryango w'ubugiraneza wo muri scotland washinzwe mu 1946. uherereye i Edinburgh kaandi ukorera mu gihugu hose cya scotland utanga ubafasha, inkunga,n'uburezi ku bantu babana n'ubumuga.Uyu muryango utanga amazu y'ubuvuzi ubafasha mu rugo,inkunga y'ubucuruzi n'uburezibwihariye binyuze mu mashuri abiri\nAmateka.\nUbushobozi Scotland yashinzwe ku ya 31 Ukwakira 1946 nitsinda ryababyeyi ninzobere mu by'ubuzima. Intego yayo ya mbere yari ugufasha abana bafite.\nIshuri rya mbere ryafunguwe mu Corstorphine, Edinburgh mu 1948, muri Edinburgh. Mu ntangiriro ya z'imyaka ya 1960, umuryango utabara imbabare watangiye gutegura amahirwe ya akazi kubantu babana n'ubumuga, kandi mu 1973 hashyirwaho inzu ya mbere y\u2019abakuze. \nMu gihe ishuri rya Westerlea rifite icyicaro cya Edinburgh ryafunzwe mu 2016, Ubushobozi bwa Scotland bukora andi mashuri abiri y\u2019ubumenyi bw\u2019inzobere; Inzu ya Stanmore muri Lanark na Corseford School i Kilbarchan.\nUmushinga mushya washyizweho mu 2021 wo kubaka inzu nshya yita ku baturage mu iterambere rishya ry\u2019abaturage muri Perth ryitwa Bertha Park. Abagiraneza bagamije kurangiza ibi mu 2026.\nUbufatanye.\nUbushobozi Scotland ni umunyamuryango wa Scotland Afite ubumuga hamwe na Sense Scotland, ENABLE Scotland, RNIB Scotland, Igikorwa cyo Kumva Loss Scotland, hamwe n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019ubuzima bwo mu mutwe rya Ecosse. "}
{"id": "20998", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20998", "title": "Shelley Lynn", "text": "Shelley Lynn Tremain n'umufilozofe qwe wibanda ku bumuga, feminism, bioethics, na. Yanditse igitabo \"Filozofiya y\u2019abafite ubumuga ya Foucault na femisiti\" (2017), yatsindiye igihembo cya Tobin Siebers 2016 cy\u2019ubushakashatsi bw\u2019abafite ubumuga mu bumuntu, ubuyobozi bw'ababana n'ubumuga (2005/2015). \nTremain yahawe impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya II cya kaminuza izwi nka PHD muri. Muri 2016, yatsindiye igihembo cya Tanis Doe kubera Kwiga amasomo ajyanye n'ubumuga n\u2019umuco muri Kanada. [\"isoko itari iyambere ikenewe\"]"}
{"id": "20999", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20999", "title": "Tanya Titchkosky", "text": "Tanya Titchkosky (Yabonye izuba 1966) ni ni impuguke yiga ubumuga. Kuva muri Mutarama 2025, ni umwarimu w\u2019ubushakashatsi bw\u2019ubumuga mu kiga cya Ontario gishinzwe ubushakashatsi mu burezi(Ontario Institute for study in Education) \nTitchkosky yabonye impamyabumenyi y\u2019ubuhanzi muri sociologiya yakuye muri ikiciro cya mbere cya mubuhanzi kaminuza (master of arts) muri Kanama (1988), impamyabumenyi y\u2019ubuhanzi muri sociologiya yakuye muri kaminuza ya York (1992), na Dogiteri wa Firozofi yakuye muri kaminuza ya York (1997). \nTitchkosky ni dyslexic. "}
{"id": "21000", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21000", "title": "Key Finder", "text": "key finders, zizwi kandi nka key locators, key locators, cyangwa electronic finders, ni udukoresho duto tw'ikoranabuhanga dushyirwaho ku bintu kugira ngo bifashe kubibona iyo byibwe cyangwa byaburiye aho nko ku imfunguzo, imizigo, isakoshi, igikapu, amatungo, mudasobwa zigendanwa, abana bato, telefoni zigendanwa, ibikoresho, cyangwa ibikoresho, no kohereza imenyesha, urugero, ko ameza ya resitora yiteguye cyangwa umuforomo akenewe. Bimwe muri ibyo bikoresho bitanga amajwi cyangwa bigatanga urumuri rw'amatara igihe ibisabwa.\nUbwoko.\nIjwi.\nIcyitegererezo cya mbere cy' ibanze cyabashakishaga cyari gishingiye kumajwi, kandi cyunvaga amashyi cyangwa ifirimbi (cyangwa urukurikirane rumwe), hanyuma bikoreshwa kugirango umukoresha abibone. Kumenya icyakubise agashyi cyangwa ifirimbi byagaragaye ko bigoye, bivamo imikorere mibi no gutabaza. Kubera ubwo bwiza buke kandi butizewe, Ibi bikoresho bya mbere byo gushakisha urufunguzo byaje gutereranywa vvuba kandi ntibyamenyekana cyane mu bikorwa bifite akamaro kenshi.\nRadiyo.\nMugihe ibikoresho bya elegitoroniki byabaye bito kandi bihendutse, kandi ubuzima bwa bateri bwateye imbere, radio yabaye ingirakamaro kugirango ibone imfunguzo, zashyizwemo imashini ntoya. Ikwirakwiza ryihariye rikoreshwa mugukora kimwe cyangwa byinshi byakira. Abashakisha urufunguzo bose badafite umugozi bagomba \"gutega amatwi\" kugirango bashakishe, bikavamo gusimbuza bateri intera kuva kumezi atatu kugeza kumwaka. Gukoresha ibimenyetso cya radio bikuraho ibyago byo gutanga impuruza z'ibinyoma.\nBamwe mu bakwirakwiza harimo serivisi ihendutse-igaruka rya serivise ifasha mugusubiza urufunguzo baramutse babuze muri tagisi, bisi cyangwa ahandi hantu hahurira abantu benshi, mugihe umukiriya yanditse ibikoresho byabo hamwe n'amakuru. Ikwirakwiza rishobora kandi kubamo amakuru yo gufasha kuyasubiza nyirayo.\nUrungano rwawe.\nUrungano rwurungano rwibanze ntirukeneye \"ishingiro\" ryihariye; byose birasa kandi bishingiye kuri sisitemu yitumanaho aho buri gikoresho gishobora kubona ibindi byose kugiti cye. Umukoresha arashobora, kurugero, gukoresha ikotomoni ya digitale kugirango abone urufunguzo rwimuwe naho ubundi, cyangwa terefone igendanwa kugirango abone televiziyo yatakaye cyangwa amadarubindi. Byongeye kandi, kubera ko urufunguzo rwibanze rufite imiyoboro yabyo, barashobora gusubiza kuri radiyo kimwe no kuvuza no gucana urumuri kugirango bakurure ibitekerezo. Igice cyo gushakisha gishobora gukurikira itara kugirango ubone nurufunguzo rwashyinguwe. Kugira transmitter muri buri gice bisobanura kandi ko, bitandukanye nibisekuru bya kabiri, gutakaza imashini imwe ntabwo bivamo gutakaza rwose ubushobozi bwo kubona ibindi bintu bikurikirana.\nBluetooth ingufu nkeya.\nAmatara maremare ya Bluetooth (BLE) ningirakamaro mumikorere yabashakisha. Izi beacons, zirangwa no gukoresha ingufu zazo neza, zisohora ibimenyetso bishobora gutahurwa nibikoresho bihujwe, mubisanzwe telefone zigendanwa, kugirango bigerweho. Abashakashatsi bingenzi hamwe na tekinoroji ya BLE beacon ifasha cyane cyane mugushakisha ibintu byihariye. Itara ryometse ku kintu kimeze nk'urufunguzo rutanga ibimenyetso byerekana ko, iyo biri mu ntera, bigaragazwa na porogaramu ya terefone, byerekana aho ibintu biherereye.\nBLE beacons yohereza ibimenyetso byamenyekanye nigikoresho kibangikanye, bigafasha igikoresho kumenya aho itara riherereye. Iri koranabuhanga rikoreshwa cyane mubashakisha urufunguzo, aho itara rifatanije nibintu nkurufunguzo cyangwa igikapu, byorohereza aho biherereye ukoresheje porogaramu ya terefone. \nIbyiza.\nIbikoresho byo gukurikirana byagize uruhare mubikorwa byubugizi bwa nabi, nko guhiga no kumenya igihe imitungo irimo ubusa. Umutekano wubatswe mubikoresho bimwe na bimwe byo gukurikirana kugirango umenyeshe umuntu mugihe arimo gukurikiranwa, birahungabana kubera ko ibikoresho bishobora kuzimya iyo gukurikirana bimaze gukorwa bihagije, birashobora guhindagurika cyangwa guhishwa bitagaragara, cyangwa bigasaba porogaramu yo kumenyesha gukurikirana bitemewe, bidakunze gukoreshwa nuwahohotewe. "}
{"id": "21001", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21001", "title": "3Play Media", "text": "3Play Media ni urubuga rutanga serivisi zifasha abantu kubona no kumva neza ibinyamakuru n'amashusho, rukorera i Boston, muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu ntara ya Massachusetts, rutanga serivisi zo kongeraho amagambo yanditse ku mashusho, no gusobanura amajwi, hamwe na serivisI zanditse kuri tereviziyo, ibiri kuri videwo, na podcast. Icyo kigo yashinzwe na Josh Miller na Chris Antunes mu mwaka wa 2007.\nAMATEKA.\n3Play Media yashinzwe mu 2007, yashyizeho uburyo butandukanye bwo kugera ku nzego zirimo itangazamakuru n'imyidagaduro, uburezi, ibigo, guverinoma, na e-learning. Isosiyete yaguze Captionmax, itanga amakuru ku b'itangazamakuru, muri Gashyantare 2022 yaguye itangwa rya 3Play Media mu magambo yanditse neza na serivisi zitanga amakuru. Kugura byatumye Captionmax yisubiraho nka 3Play Media ku ya 21 Nzeri 2022. \nCaptionmax yashinzwe mu 1993, yatanze ibisobanuro mu mashusho ya videwo, hamwe n\u2019inyandiko zamamaza ku bakiriya barenga 450(magana ane mirongo itanu), harimo imiyoboro minini ya televiziyo na radiyo, situdiyo, ibigo by\u2019uburezi, ndetse n\u2019amasosiyete. Kuba Captionmax yaguze National Captioning Canada muri Werurwe 2021 yarushijeho kwagura serivisi zayo zo kugera ku itangazamakuru. \n3Play Media ikoresha ikoranabuhanga rya cloud, machine Learning, n'abantu basuzuma kugira ngo itange serivisi zizewe zorohera abantu kubona no kumva ibirimo. "}
{"id": "21002", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21002", "title": "Hanger, Inc.", "text": "Hanger, Inc. Ni kompanyi iyoboyeku rwego rw'igihugu mu gutanga ibicuruzwa na serivisi bifasha mu kongera cyangwa gusubizaho ubushobozi bw'umubiri bw'abarwayi bafite ubumuga cyangwa bakomeretse,ifite icyicaro gikuru i Austin,Texas (former Bethesda, Maryland) za orthotic na prostothique (O&amp;P), ikwirakwiza ibikoresho bya O&amp;P nibigize, ikayobora imiyoboro ya O&amp;P, ikanatanga ibisubizo bivura abarwayi nubucuruzi mubihe bikomeye, nyuma yuburakari, nubuvuzi. Hanger, Inc. ikora ibice bibiri: Kwita ku barwayi n'ibicuruzwa &amp; serivisi.\nIgice cyibanze cy\u2019ishami ryita ku barwayi ba Hanger, Inc. ni Hanger Clinic (yahoze yitwa Hanger Prosthetics na Orthotics) mu gushushanya, guhimba, no gutanga ibikoresho byabigenewe O&amp;P binyuze mu mavuriro 677 yita ku barwayi, hamwe n\u2019ibicuruzwa 109 byogajuru mu bihugu 44, ndetse n\u2019akarere ka Columbiya ku ya 30 Nzeri 2018. Miliyari 4 z'amadorali buri mwaka. Ivuriro rya Hanger ryerekana hafi 20 ku ijana by'iri soko. Isosiyete ikoresha abantu bagera ku 4,600, harimo abakora prostate na orthotic bagera ku 1.500. \nAbarwayi ba Hanger bazwi barimo:\nAmateka.\nJames Edward Hanger, waciwe bwa mbere mu mpapuro z\u2019intambara z\u2019Abanyamerika, yashinze isosiyete muri Virginie mu 1861. \nAmagambo yanditse mu nyandiko ya Ambrose Bierce nyuma y'intambara avuga ko \"Twarashe ukuguru kwa Confederate i Philippi\" bivuga Hanger. Ku ya 2 Kamena 1861, ku y'amavuko, Hanger yinjiye mu mafarasi y\u2019ingabo z\u2019Abanyamerika i Philippi, muri Virijiniya. Imvune yasabaga gucibwa ukuguru kwa Hanger hejuru y'amavi; yaciwe ku rugamba rwa mbere ku rugamba, abifashijwemo n'abaganga b\u2019ubumwe. Hanger yasubiye mu rugo rw'ababyeyi be kugira ngo akire yambaye proth\u00e8se yari inkoni y'ibiti. Kuba atishimiye imikorere n'imikorere yo gusimbuza ingingo byatumye Hanger ashushanya kandi yubaka proth\u00e8se nshya iva mu biti byera byera, reberi n'ibiti, ifite impeta ku ivi no ku birenge. Igikoresho cyakoraga neza, kandi inteko ishinga amategeko ya leta yamusabye gukora \u201cHanger Limb\u201d ku bandi basirikare bakomeretse. \nIbikorwa byo gukora JE Hanger, Inc., byashinzwe mumijyi ya Staunton na Richmond. Ku Werurwe 1863, Hanger yahawe ipatanti ye ya mbere ku gihimba cy\u2019ubukorikori, nomero 155, avuye ku biro bishinzwe ipatanti ya Confederate Patent ku ya 23 Werurwe 1863. Mu myaka ishize, Hanger yakoze kandi ibandikisha uburenganzira ku bicuruzwa bishya bigenewe abasirikare bahoze ku rugamba n'abandi babuze ibice by'umubiri.\nMu 1906, Hanger yimuye icyicaro gikuru i Washington, DC. Mu 1915, yagiye mu Burayi gufasha abaterankunga b'Intambara ya Mbere y'Isi Yose no kwigira ku ndaya zo mu Burayi.\nAbahungu batanu ba Hanger bagize uruhare mu gukora ubucuruzi bw'umuryango. Mu 1915, bagabanije JE Hanger, Inc., mu masosiyete ane atandukanye, buri wese akorera mu karere kamwe mu gihugu. Igihe Hanger yapfaga mu 1919, amasosiyete yari afite amashami i Atlanta, St. Louis, Philadelphia, Pittsburgh, London na Paris. \nMu myaka yabanjirije Intambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose, nta terambere ryagaragaye ryabaye mu nganda zo muri Amerika. Umuhengeri mushya w\u2019abahoze mu rugamba rwasabye uburyo bwiza bwo gukora prostate, maze mu 1946, guverinoma ihuriweho na leta itangira gutanga amafaranga y\u2019ubushakashatsi n\u2019iterambere muri prostate. JE Hanger Inc.\nMuri iki gihe, inganda za orthotics zashakaga guhuza n'inganda za prostate. Mu 1950, hashyizweho ishyirahamwe ry\u2019imyororokere n\u2019imyororokere y'Abanyamerika, ryibanze cyane ku burezi no gutanga ibyemezo by\u2019abakora amavuriro. Mu myaka ya za 1950 rwagati, JEHanger, Inc., yariyongereye serivisi za orthotic mu bucuruzi bwayo, kandi yariyongereye igera ku biro 50 muri Amerika na 25 mu Burayi. \n1960 na 1970 byagize iterambere rito ugereranije nubuhanga, ariko 1980 yaranze intangiriro yigihe cyiterambere ryiterambere ryiterambere rikomeza kugeza na nubu. Mu 1986, isosiyete y'itumanaho ikorera muri Colorado, Sequel Corporation, yagurishije ubucuruzi bwa terefone ngendanwa maze itangira gushora imari mu nganda za orototike na prostate. Mu 1989, Sequel yaguze JE Hanger, Inc, i Washington, DC. Mugihe cyo kugura, JE Hanger, Inc., yari ubucuruzi bwa miliyoni 8 zamadorali hamwe n\u2019ibiro mu mijyi 11 na leta umunani. Nyuma gato, Sequel yahinduye izina ryisosiyete yitwa Hanger Orthopedic Group. Ivan Sabel, perezida akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe ibikorwa, yibanze ku guhuza ibishushanyo mbonera no gukora ibikoresho bya prostate na orthotic by\u2019isosiyete no kubikwirakwiza mu gihugu. \nMu 1996, isosiyete yaguze JE Hanger, Inc., yo muri Jeworujiya. Uku kugura gukubye kabiri ingano y\u2019isosiyete, ubu ikaba yari ifite ibigo byita ku barwayi 175, ibibanza bitandatu byakwirakwijwe, inganda enye zikora n\u2019abakozi 1.000 muri leta 30. Hanger yakomeje kugura ibigo bito kandi mu 1998, yakoraga ibigo byita ku barwayi 256. Mu 1999, Itsinda rya Hanger Orthopedic ryaguze umunywanyi waryo ukomeye n\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019inganda, ishami rya orthotics na prostothique ishami rya NovaCare. Ibi byongeyeho ibigo 369 byita ku barwayi. Nyuma yo kugura NovaCare, isosiyete yakomeje kwagura ibikorwa byayo hamwe nubucuruzi bwihariye bujyanye nayo. Mu 1999, Ikinyamakuru Fortune cyashyize Hanger Orthopedic Group ku mwanya wa 79 kurutonde rwamasosiyete ijana yihuta cyane. \nUkwakira 2022, Umurwa mukuru w\u2019abarwayi, LP. yaguze Hanger \nInkunga.\nHanger, Inc. ikora imirongo irindwi y'ubucuruzi mubice bibiri: Kuvura abarwayi n'ibicuruzwa &amp; serivisi.\nHanger, Inc. Igice cyo Kwita ku barwayi kigizwe na Hanger Clinic na Linkia.\nLinkia ni kompanyi icunga imiyoboro ikorera by'umwihariko mu ruganda rukora ibikoresha byunganira umubiri (orthotics) n'ibisimbura ibice by'umubiri (prosthetics).\nIbicuruzwa na serivisi byacyo birimo Kwihutisha Kwitaho Byongeyeho, Umuyoboro wa Hanger (wahoze ari Laboratwari yigihugu), Neurotronics udushya, Gutanga Prosthetic yo mu majyepfo (SPS), na SureFit.\nAmajyepfo ya Prosthetic Supply afite ibigo byo gukwirakwiza muri leta eshanu, bikwirakwiza ibicuruzwa birenga 400.000. Binyuze mu ishami ryayo rya SureFit, SPS ikora kandi ikagurisha inkweto zo kuvura abarwayi ba diyabete ku isoko rya podiatric. Binyuze muri Hanger Fabrication Network, ni uruganda rukora ibikoresho bya O&amp;P byifashishwa n'amavuriro yita ku barwayi batishyuwe ndetse n'ayandi mavuriro y'abahanganye mu bucuruzi.\nInnovative Neurotronics, Inc., izobereye mugutezimbere no gucuruza tekinoroji ya neuromuscular ikora. Neuromuscular bivuga gukoresha imbaraga zo gukurura amashanyarazi kugirango tunoze imikorere yibice byangiritse.\nUbushakashatsi.\nAbakozi b'ikigo ni abanditsi kandi batanga umusanzu w'abanditsi b'ibitabo nka \"Prosthetics no gucunga abarwayi: Uburyo bwuzuye bwo kuvura\", \"Kugarura imikorere y'abakuze n'abana bafite ububobere bukabije\", \"n'ubuvuzi bw'umubiri no gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe: Amahame n'ibikorwa\". \nIbibazo byemewe n'amategeko.\nMu 2004, ibirego by\u2019uburiganya bwo kwishyuza byakorewe iyi sosiyete igihe umuyobozi w\u2019ibiro yamenyesheje abakozi ba Hanger i New York ko bahimbye imiti ku barwayi badahari. Urubanza rw\u2019icyiciro rwashyikirijwe Hanger kubera gukekwaho gukoresha uburiganya mu kuzamura ibihimbano. N'ubwo ibiro 14 byavuzwe amazina muri uru rubanza, Hanger yavuze ko ahantu hamwe gusa hagize uruhare muri ubwo buriganya. "}
{"id": "21003", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21003", "title": "Canine Companions for Independence", "text": "Canine Companions for Indepandence ni umuryango ukorera muri Amerika 501 (c) (3) udaharanira inyungu uhugura kandi utanga imbwa zifasha. Kuva, yashyize imbwa zirenga 6.000 zifasha abayihawe nta kiguzi. \nUrufatiro.\nCanine Companions for Independence yashinzwe ubwigenge yashinzwe i Santa Rosa, muri Californiya, muri Nyakanga 1975 na Bonnie Bergin nka gahunda ya mbere nk'iyi. Igihe yigishaga muri Aziya, yari yarabonye abamugaye bakoresha burros maze atekereza ko imbwa zishobora gukora imirimo nk'iyi muri Amerika. Kuva icyo gihe, yakuze iba umuryango wigihugu. Kugeza mu 2024, ifite ibigo birindwi by'imyitozo hamwe n'ibiro by'akazi mu murwa mukuru wa Washington, California, Texas, Ohio, New York, na Floride. Hari kandi amashami menshi, buri rimwe ryunganira abafasha mu kurera imbwa ntoya (volunteer puppy raisers) ndetse no gutegura ibikorwa byo gukusanya inkunga (fundraising).\nUwo muryango uhuza ababana n'ubumuga n'imbwa zitojwe cyane zifasha,kandi ugatanga ubufasha buhoraho ku buntu ku muntu uzibonera. akoreshwa mu bworozi, korora, no guhugura imbwa aterwa inkunga n\u2019impano bwite zitangwa n\u2019amasosiyete, abantu ku giti cyabo, n\u2019indi mishinga, ndetse n\u2019imishinga yo gukusanya inkunga. Bigereranijwe ko buri mbwa ifasha hamwe nubuzima bwose bwo gukurikirana imbwa igura $ 50.000. Umushinga w'Intare Club ku basangirangendo ba Canine ku bwigenge (LPCCI), washinzwe mu 1983 nk'umuntu utanga inkunga ikomeye mu bijyanye n'amafaranga n'ubwitange ku basangirangendo ba Canine, watanze miliyoni 3 z'amadorali. Muri 2015, Abasangirangendo ba Canine bafatanije n\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019amatungo ya Henry Schein, utanga ibikomoka ku buzima bw\u2019amatungo ku baveterineri, utanga aborozi b\u2019ibibwana ibicuruzwa byita ku buzima ku buntu. \nPorogaramu idasanzwe, \"The Veterans Initiative\", itanga imbwa za serivise zahuguwe ku bamugaye n\u2019abakomeretse. Porogaramu yakiriye inkunga kubufatanye bwa PetSmart na Canine Basangirangendo. Mu, uyu muryango winjiye mu ishami rishinzwe ibibazo by\u2019abasirikare muri Leta zunze ubumwe z\u2019Amerika mu bushakashatsi bwakozwe kugira ngo hamenyekane niba imbwa za serivisi zitezimbere imibereho y\u2019abasirikare bafite ibibazo by\u2019ihungabana nyuma y\u2019ihungabana. \nMu mwaka 2017, uwo muryango wakoranye n'ikirango Chrysler ku gikorwa gishya cyo kuri interineti kigamije kongera kumenyekanisha no gushyigikira ibikorwa by'umuryango Canine Companions. Igikorwa cyiswe \"Give a Dog a Job\" cyemerera abantu gukurikirana imyitozo y'imbwa yitwa Foley,no kugirana ubufatanye na we hamwe n'abamutoza ku rubuga Facebook, Instagram na Twitter.\nImbwa.\nAbasangirangendo ba Canine bahugura ubwoko butandukanye bwimbwa zikora: imbwa za serivise (urugero, imbwa zifasha kugendagenda, imbwa za serivise kubarokotse bafite ikibazo cy\u2019ihungabana nyuma y\u2019ihungabana), abasangirangendo babahanga batojwe gukorana n\u2019umuntu mukuru cyangwa umwana ufite ubumuga bayobowe n\u2019umuhugura, kumva imbwa z\u2019abatumva n\u2019abatumva, n\u2019imbwa z '\u201camatsinda y\u2019ibigo.\u201d Amatsinda yibikoresho agizwe nimbwa numufatanyabikorwa wumuntu, ubusanzwe ni inzobere mu gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe, umurezi, cyangwa inzobere mu buvuzi. Izi mbwa zitwara ubuhanga bwimbwa za serivise kimwe nubuhanga bwihariye kuberako serivisi zimbwa zizashyirwa muri gahunda na serivisi.\nUbworozi no kurera.\nAbasangirangendo ba Canine bakoresha gahunda yo korora kugirango batange imbwa zabo. Bakoresha Retrievers na Labrador Retrievers, hamwe numusaraba wubwoko bubiri. \nIbibwana byororerwa nabakorerabushake biyemeje kubika imbwa amezi 16 kugeza 18, kugeza igihe cyo kwinjira muri gahunda y'amahugurwa. Muri aya mezi 16 kugeza 18, abakorerabushake b'imbwa bitangiye imirimo yo kwigisha ikibwana amategeko yacyo 30 yambere. Amenshi muri aya mabwiriza azakoreshwa mugihe cy'amahugurwa yo hejuru. Kurugero, ikibwana cyize kizashyira amaguru yacyo imbere kubintu bitandukanye, harimo inkuta n'inzitiro. Mugihe cyamahugurwa yambere, abahugura babigize umwuga barashobora kubaka iryo tegeko hamwe nimyitwarire ijyanye nubuhanga nko kuzimya urumuri no kuzimya. Ibibwana bikunze guherekeza ibyana byimbwa zabo ahantu hose burimunsi nkishuri cyangwa akazi kubategurira ubuzima nkimbwa ya serivisi.\nAmahugurwa.\nAmahugurwa y\u2019amezi ane kugeza ku icyenda atangira iyo imbwa isubijwe n\u2019abakorerabushake b\u2019imbwa ku bushake muri kimwe mu bigo birindwi by\u2019amahugurwa bya Canine Companions muri Amerika. Amezi atatu yambere yimyitozo asubiramo ibyo imbwa zize. Amahugurwa yumwuga arimo gusuzuma ubuzima bwimbitse nubushakashatsi, kandi buri mbwa yiga amategeko arenga 40 yo kongera ubwigenge harimo gukurura intebe y\u2019ibimuga, kugarura ibintu byataye, no gufungura imiryango. Imbwa zirashobora gutozwa nkimbwa zumva zimenyesha abatumva batumva amajwi yibidukikije kandi bikayobora uwabitwaye kumasoko yijwi. Muri 2018, abasangirangendo ba Canine batangiye gahunda yicyitegererezo yo guhugura imbwa za serivise zo gufasha abahoze mu rugerero bafite ikibazo cy\u2019ihungabana nyuma yo guhahamuka batanga buffer yoroheje mu bantu, bazimya amatara kandi bahagarika inzozi n\u2019imyitwarire yo guhangayika.\nAbantu batumiwe guhuzwa nimbwa bagenda mukigo cyamahugurwa gikorera leta yabo mumasomo y'ibyumweru bibiri yigisha abahawe uburyo bwo gukorana nabagenzi babo bashya. Ibi bikubiyemo kwiga ibijyanye na psychologiya yimbwa, gutunganya imbwa no kwitaho, hamwe namategeko imbwa izi. Guhuza imbwa numuntu bikorwa neza kugirango barebe ko ibikorwa byabo bihuye. Mugusoza, abantu banyura mubizamini hanyuma bakitabira umuhango wo gutanga impamyabumenyi. \nAmakipe ya Canine Basangirangendo bagaruka kubikurikirana bisanzwe mugihe cyo gushyira. Abakoresha imbwa Canine Basangirangendo nabo barashobora kugaruka mugihe cyo guhura cyangwa imyitozo yinyongera yo gukurikirana igihe icyo aricyo cyose. Igihe mu murimo ni imyaka umunani kugeza ku icumi. "}
{"id": "21004", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21004", "title": "Fourier (sosiyete)", "text": "Fourier (Chinese, Pinyin) ni uruganda rukora amarobo mu Bushinwa rufite icyicaro i Shanghai.\nUhereye kuri robotike zifasha abarwayi, kompanyi yagiye inagura ibikorwa ikora robo zisa n'abantu.\nAmavu n'amavuko.\nFourier yashinzwe mu 2015 na Alex Gu. Gu yarangriije muri kaminuza ya Shanghai Jiao Tong kandi mbere yari umuyobozi ushinzwe kugurisha muri National Instruments. Izina ry\u2019isosiyete ryitiriwe Joseph Fourier kandi ryashinzwe mu mujyi wa Zhangjiang hagamijwe gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe umubiri. \nFourier ishyigikiwe n'abashoramari nka IDG Capital na Arabiya Sawudite. \nKugeza muri 2019, Fourier yari yazanye ibikoresho byayo byubwenge nka exoskeletons mubitaro amagana n'ibigo nderabuzima byo mu bihugu birenga 10 maze aba umukinnyi ukomeye mu nganda. Gu yari asanzwe arota gukora robot imera nka muntu, kandi muri uwo mwaka, Fourier yatangije umushinga mushya wo gukora robot zisa n'abantu (humanoid). \nMuri Kamena 2020, Fourier yaguze Zhuhai RHK Healthcare (RHK), itanga serivisi zita ku buzima busanzwe ikorera mu bitaro birenga 200 mu Bushinwa. Kugura RHK byaha Fourier uburyo bunini bwabakiriya n\u2019ibitekerezo byinshi ndetse no gufasha guteza imbere urusobe rw\u2019ibidukikije hafi y\u2019ikoranabuhanga rya Fourier. Imwe mu mbogamizi Fourier yahuye nazo ni igiciro gihenze cyibicuruzwa byacyo. Igiciro kinini cyibicuruzwa byacyo byagabanywa igice binyuze mu kugura RHK itanga serivisi zita ku barwayi bo mu bitaro by\u2019abaturage bagerageje guhaza icyifuzo cya tekinike yo kuvura ikorana buhanga. RHK yagi inafite uruhare mu gukodesha no gutera inkunga ibikoresho by'ubuvuzi, ibyo bikazafasha Fourier kubona ubufasha mu kwamamaza no kugera ku bitaro bifite ingengo y'imari n'abakozi bike mu mujyi mito. \nUkuboza 2023, umuyobozi w\u2019Ubushinwa Xi Jinping yahuye n\u2019abayobozi ba Fourier mu ruzinduko rw\u2019ubugenzuzi i Shanghai. Xi yari yabajije niba bishoboka kuvugana na robot ebyiri kandi ikabona gukora imirimo yibanze. Ibi byafatwaga nk'ikimenyetso ko guverinoma y'ubushinwa yari ifite inyota ku ikoranabuhanga rya robot. \nAmateka y'ibicuruzwa.\nFourier yibanze cyane ku gukora robot zifasha abarwayi bafite ubumuga bw'umubiri buterwa n'ibibazo by'ubwonko kugira ngo basubirane ubushobozi bwo kwimuka. \nKu ya 20 Werurwe 2017, Fourier yashyize ahagaragara Fourier X1, igenda ifasha exoskeleton. \nKu ya 21 Mutarama 2019, Fourier yatangije urubuga rwa Fourier Exoskeleton &amp; Robotics Gufungura (EXOPS) rwakozwe ku bufatanye n\u2019ibikoresho by\u2019igihugu. N'uburyo bwa Android busa na sisitemu ifunguye ikoreshwa mu gutezimbere exoskeletons. \nMuri 2019, Fourier yatangiye imirimo yo guteza imbere imashini yambere ya robot ya kimuntu GR-1 yavukiye muri laboratoire nto ku igorofa rya mbere ry\u2019icyicaro gikuru cya Fourier. Intambwe ikomeye yagezweho mu 2022 ubwo moderi ya GR-1 ya metero 1.65 yashoboye guhaguruka ku maguru yombi no kugenda. Fourier yasohoye videwo yayo igenda yakira ibisubizo bitandukanye kuko bamwe mubari mu mahanga batekerezaga ko iyi videwo yakozwe na mudasobwa. Muri Nyakanga 2023, GR-1 yashyizwe ahagaragara mu nama mpuzamahanga y\u2019ubutasi y\u2019ubukorikori yabereye i Shanghai yakunzwe cyane. Kuri ubu GR-1 yari imaze kugezwaho bike muri kaminuza zimwe na sosiyete za AI kugirango ubushakashatsi niterambere. Hateguwe gahunda yo gutangira umusaruro mwinshi mu mpera za gutanga ibihumbi n\u2019ibihumbi mu 2024. \nMu Gushyingo 2023, Fourier yatangije MetaMotus \u2122 Galileo, isesengura ry\u2019ibinyabuzima hamwe na platform ya rehab, ihuza ibintu bifatika ndetse na robo. \nMu mpera za Nzeri 2024, Fourier yashyize ahagaragara moderi ya GR-2 yari kuzamura GR-1. Yahagaze kuri metero 1.75, ipima kg 63, ifite dogere 53 z'ubwisanzure na 3\u00a0kg ubushobozi bumwe bwo gutwara ibintu. GR-2 yari ifite bateri itandukanijwe kandi yashoboraga gukora imirimo igoye. Ibikoresho byo guteza imbere software nabyo byari byatejwe imbere. "}
{"id": "21005", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21005", "title": "Kuzamura intebe", "text": "Lift chairs, zizwi kandi nka lift recliners cyangwa armchairs, ni intebe zifite mekanizime y'ikoranbuhanga izamura intebe yose iva ku nkingi zayo, bityo ikanafasha umuntu uyicanye guhagarara.\nMuri Amerika, intebe zo kuzamura zujuje ibyangombwa byubuvuzi biramba munsi ya Medicare Igice B. \nMuri raporo yo muri Gashyantare 1989 yashyizwe ahagaragara n'Umugenzuzi Mukuru w\u2019ishami ry\u2019ubuzima n\u2019ibikorwa by\u2019Amerika muri Amerika, byagaragaye ko: intebe zo kuzamura zidashobora kuba zujuje ibyangombwa bya Medicare ku bikoresho by\u2019ubuvuzi biramba (DME) kandi ibyifuzo by\u2019intebe bigomba kongera kugenzurwa. Raporo yatewe kwiyongera kw'intebe zo kuzamura intebe hagati ya 1984 na 1985 ziva kuri 200.000 zikagera ku 700.000. Ikinyamakuru \"New York Times\" cyavuze ko amatangazo yamamaza kuri televiziyo yatumaga abakiriya babaza ibyerekeye intebe zo kuzamura kandi, abaguzi bamaze guhamagara, bohererezwa urupapuro kugira ngo abaganga babo basinyire. Bimwe mu bigo byoherezaga intebe zizamuka (Lift Chairs) mbere yo kubona umukoro w'umuganga, bityo bigatuma abaganga basabwa gushyiraho umukono, bitabaye ibyo umurwayi akaba aryozwa intebe. \nMedicare irashobora kwishyura gusa ikiguzi cya lift-mechanism aho kuba intebe yose. Mbere yuko Medicare isuzumwa kugirango yishyure ikiguzi, abarwayi bazakenera gusurwa na muganga wabo kugirango baganire kubikenewe byibi bikoresho. Utanga DME noneho azasaba urupapuro rwerekana icyemezo cyubuvuzi (CMN). Ubusanzwe CMN ikubiyemo ibibazo bitanu umuganga agomba gusubiza. Mubisanzwe, ibibazo nibibazo: Niba hari ikibazo cyashubijwe \"OYA\", birashobora gutuma uhakana ikirego.\nMubisanzwe, abatanga DME basaba kwishura byuzuye intebe yo kuzamura kandi bazatanga ibyishyu byemejwe na Medicare. Abatanga DME ntibashobora kwishyuza Medicare batabanje gutanga ibikoresho.\nIntebe zo hejuru zirashobora kandi kuza hamwe numubare winyongera wongeyeho na addons. Harimo ubushyuhe na massage, umusego wumutwe ushobora guhindurwa, guhindagurika kwinyuma, kugarura bateri, hamwe nigitambara cyiza cyane. "}
{"id": "21006", "revid": "10599", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21006", "title": "Inkoni yera ibera amaso kubafite ubumuga bwo kutabona", "text": "Amateka yinkoni Year.\nMuri 1921 Umwongeraza James Biggs uvuka mu mujyi wa Bristol city wakoraga umwuga wo gufotora, yakoze impanuka ikomeye imusigira ubumuga bwo kutabona.\ninkoni yera igizwe nibice bitatu(3).\n1.ikirindi \n2. Uruti \n3. Ijisho\nIbisobanuro bwibice bwi nkoni yera.\n1.Ikirindi nigice cyo hejuru kunkoni yera arinacyo ufite ubumuga afata \n2.Uruti nigice cyo hagati cyangwa mu ngingo zinkoni yera\n3.ijisho nigice gifasha ufite ubumuga mubryo bubiri icyambere nikimenyetso mpuzamahanga kigaragaza umuntu ufite ubumuga bwo kutabona, hamwe no gutuma agenda neza.\nIbirushijeho.\nhttps://www.kigalitoday.com/ubuzima/urusobe-rw-ubuzima/article/ni-gute-inkoni-yera-ibera-abafite-ubumuga-bwo-kutabona-amaso\nhttps://mobile.igihe.com/amakuru/muri-afurika/u-rwanda/article/abafite-ubumuga-bwo-kutabona-bahawe-inkoni-zibamenyesha-ko-bwije-cyangwa\nhttps://mobile.igihe.com/amakuru/muri-afurika/u-rwanda/article/abafite-ubumuga-bwo-kutabona-bahawe-inkoni-zibamenyesha-ko-bwije-cyangwa"}
{"id": "21007", "revid": "15375", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21007", "title": "Abafite ubumuga b'ingorero", "text": "Abafite ubumuga b'ingororero barishimira inkunga bahabwa na Karere mu rwego rwo kwiteza imbere.\nIMBOGAMIZI.\nAbibumbiye mu ihuriro ry'abafite ubumuga bo mu karere ka Ngororero, baragaragaza imbogamizi bahura nazo za bana batagana ishuri kubera imyumvire ndetse imiterere ya Karere ka Ngororero hakiyongeraho ko biterwa no kwivuza \nAMASHAKIRO; \nhttps://www.kigalitoday.com/amakuru/mu-rwanda/article/abafite-ubumuga-bo-mu-karere-ka-ngororero-bishimiye-ko-akarere-katangiye"}
{"id": "21008", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21008", "title": "Cybathlon", "text": "CYBATHLON, umushinga wa ETH Zurich, ikora nk'urubuga rutera imbogamizi amakipe aturutse impande zose z'isi guteza imbere ikoranabuhanga rikoreshwa buri munsi nabafite ubumuga. Imbaraga zitera CYBATHLON ni amarushanwa mpuzamahanga nibirori, aho amakipe agizwe nabateza imbere ikoranabuhanga baturutse muri za kaminuza, amasosiyete cyangwa imiryango itegamiye kuri leta zose, hamwe numuntu ufite ubumuga (umuderevu) aho bakemura imirimo ya buri munsi nikoranabuhanga rigezweho kugirango ribafashe mubijyanye no kwiteza imbere. Usibye amarushanwa nyirizina, CYBATHLON itanga urubuga ngenderwaho rwo guteza imbere ubushakashatsi kuri sisitemu zifasha mu guhangana n\u2019ibibazo by\u2019ubuzima bwa buri munsi ndetse nizindi mbogamizi zarizo zose bahura nazo, no guteza imbere ibiganiro n\u2019abaturage hagamijwe kwinjiza ababana n\u2019ubumuga muri sosiyete. Uruhare rwumuderevu rufatwa nkibyingenzi haba mumarushanwa ndetse no mubikorwa byiterambere, kugirango harebwe niba ibyifuzo byabakoresha ba nyuma bisuzumwa kandi bikemurwe. \nCYBATHLON ya mbere yateguwe n\u2019ishuri rikuru ry\u2019ikoranabuhanga ry\u2019Ubusuwisi mumujyi wa i Zurich (ETH Zurich) yabereye mu kibuga cy\u2019Ubusuwisi i Kloten mu majyaruguru ya mumujyi wa Zurich mu Busuwisi ku italiki ya 8 Ukwakira 2016 kandi ni ryo rushanwa mpuzamahanga rya mbere ryabayeho ry\u2019ubu bwoko. Abapilote(abadederevu) 66 baturutse mu bihugu 25 barushanwe imbere yabarebaga 4600. \nCYBATHLON 2020 \"Global Edition\" yabaye ku italiki ya 13 kugeza14 Ugushyingo 2020. Nyuma yo gusubikwa bwa mbere kubera icyorezo cya COVID-19 cyari cyateye isi yose muri rusange yongeye gushyirwaho kugira ngo ikorwe kure, amakipe ashyiraho ibikorwa remezo by'amarushanwa ku birindiro byabo ndetse n'amasiganwa, akurikiranwa n'abayobozi ba Cybathlon, abera kuri videwo. \nCYBATHLON 2024 yabaye kuva ku italiki ya ya 25 kugeza ku ya 27 Ukwakira 2024. Amakipe mpuzamahanga 67 yaturutse ku isi yose harimo za kaminuza ninganda yarushanwe mumarushanwa adasanzwe. \nUbushakashatsi bwakozwe nabaderevu nubuhanga bwa tekiniki kuva mu mwaka wa 2020 bwerekana ko kuba abaderevu barashyizwe mu bikorwa byubushakashatsi hari byinshi byagezweho mugushyiramo abaderevu mubikorwa byubushakashatsi. Imibereho ya buri munsi ikoreshwa rya tekinoroji nshya ifasha ntiyari kenshi. Byombi imikoreshereze yubuzima bwa buri munsi hamwe nigihe kinini cyabakoresha babisanze bifitanye isano nimikorere yubwoko mumarushanwa. "}
{"id": "21009", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21009", "title": "Stair lift", "text": "Kuzamura ingazi ni ibikoresho by'i mashini yo guterura abantu, cyane ababana ubumuga, hejuru no hasi. Ku ngazi zagutse bihagije, gari ya moshi ikinyabiziga gitwara abantu ishyirwa kuntambwe. Intebe cyangwa urubuga rwo guterura bifatanye na gari ya moshi. Umuntu yicara ku ntebe cyangwa kuri platifomu hanyuma akazamurwa hejuru cyangwa hasi ku ngazi n'intebe igenda kuri gari ya moshi.\nKuzamura ingazi bizwi muburyo butandukanye nka stairlifts, glider glider, lift-lift, lift intebe (ariko itandukanye na chairlift ikoreshwa nabakinnyi) hamwe nandi mazina. Ijambo kuzamuka kuntambwe rishobora kwerekeza kuri lift, cyangwa cyane cyane mubikoresho by'imyitozo ku izina rimwe.\nBimwe mu byiciro byambere byatejwe imbere byakozwe mubucuruzi byamamajwe kandi bigurishwa muri Amerika mu mwaka w'i 1930 na Inclinator Company yo muri Amerika. Abayikoresheje benshi icyo gihe bahitanywe n\u2019igicuri. "}
{"id": "21010", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21010", "title": "James C. Marsters", "text": "James Carlyle Marsters (5 Mata 1924 - 28 Nyakanga 2009) yari umu ortodontiste ufite ubumuga bwo k'utumva i Pasadena, muri Californiya, mu mwaka w'i 1964 akaba yarafashaga mubijyanye no guhimba igikoresho cya mbere cyandika gishobora gukoreshwa n'imirongo ya terefone. Igikoresho cyatumaga itumanaho kuri terefone rishoboka kubatumva. Nubwo Robert Weitbrecht yakoze byinshi mubikorwa byo gushushanya, Marsters yazamuye imikoreshereze yicyo gikoresho.\nMarsters yavutse ku ya 5 Mata 1924, avukira i Norwich, mu mujyi wa New York, avukira ku umuyobozi mukuru wa farumasi Guy Marsters n'umugore we Anna Belle, umuforomo. \nIgihe yari akiri muto cyane, Marsters yabuze kumva kubera umuriro utukura n'iseru. Ariko, yize kuvuga no gusoma iminwa. Yarangije mu ishuri rya Wright Oral School ry\u2019abatumva mu mujyi wa New York mu 1943, niho yahuriye na John Tracy, umuhungu wa Spencer Tracy. Mu 1947 Marsters yabonye impamyabumenyi ya bijyanye nutabire yakuye muri Union College i Schenectady, muri New York.\nMarsters yashakanye na Joan Tausik, umuhanzi na we wari ufite ubumuga bwo kutumva (nyuma baza gutandukana), ajya gukora mu ruganda rwa karuvati rwa se. Se wa Tausik ni we wasabye ko agomba kuba umuvuzi wa amenyo. Nubwo amanota y'ibizamini bya Marsters yari menshi, amashuri y amenyo yaramwanze kubera kutumva. Nyuma yimyaka ibiri nigice yo gusaba, kaminuza ya New York yemeye kumwakira by'agateganyo yumva ko nta mfashanyo yihariye yari kubona. Yarangije muri kaminuza ya New York mu 1952.Yakundaga kuvuga ko ashobora kumva bamwe, kugira ngo afashe gutuza ubwoba bwa bamwe mu barimu be b'ishuri ry'amenyo. Yatwaye kandi indege hagati y'imijyi ibiri yakoreragamo imyitozo, akavuga ko radiyo ye idakora neza agasaba abashinzwe umutekano mu kirere gukoresha amatara kugira ngo bamuyobore.\nJohn Tracy, izina rye riri ku ivuriro rya Los Angeles ry\u2019abana bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva yashishikarije Marsters kuba ortodontiste, maze mu 1954, nyuma yo kwiga muri USC, atangira imyitozo ya Pasadena. Nyuma yaho gato, yashakanye na Alice Amelia Dorsey, umuyobozi w'iryo vuriro ryababana nubumuga ku ishuri ry\u2019incuke rya John Tracy Clinic. Marsters yari afite abana batatu - James Marsters Jr., umuhanga mu by'ubutabire ndetse n'imiti; Jean Marsters, umuganga; na Guy Marsters, umucuranzi. Alice yapfuye mu 2003. Abashakanye bari bafite abuzukuru babiri. Marsters yapfuye ku ya 28 Nyakanga 2009, azize indwara y'umutima. \nIgihe Marsters yakiraga terefone, yishingikirije ku bandi kwitaba telefoni no kumunwa amagambo kugira ngo asome kuminwa yabo ibyi bavuga hanyuma agenekereze, nyuma asubiza kuri telefoni. Muri kiriya gihe, hari umuyoboro wa TTY wubucuruzi, ariko byari bihenze cyane kubantu. Marsters yegereye Robert Weitbrecht umuhanga mu bya fiziki wabanaga nubumuga bwo kutumva w\u2019ikigo cy\u2019ubushakashatsi cya Stanford maze amusaba ko yareba uburyo bwo gukora igikoresho cyemerera abadafite ubumuga bwo kutumva kuvugana n\u2019abanditsi ba televiziyo ku murongo wa telefone."}
{"id": "21011", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21011", "title": "Amplifon", "text": "Amplifon SpA ni isosiyete yo mu Butaliyani ikorera i Milan kandi ni yo icuruza ibyuma by'amatwi by'abantu bafite ubumuga bwo kumva ku rwego rw'isi yose. \nAmateka.\nAmplifon yashinzwe mu 1950 i Milan na Algernon Charles Holland, wahoze ari umuyobozi w\u2019ingabo zidasanzwe z\u2019Abongereza, wagize uruhare mu mutwe w\u2019Abataliyani barwanya Resistance. Intambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose irangiye, yatangije isosiyete igamije gutera inkunga abafite ikibazo cyo kutumva kubera amakimbirane, ashyiraho abantu benshi kandi yubaka umubano ukomeye n'inzobere mu kwita ku matwi. \nMu myaka ya za 1960 na 1970, Amplifon yafunguye amaduka muri buri karere ko mu Butaliyani, aba umuyobozi w\u2019isoko mu gutanga, kugurisha, no gushyira no guhuza icyuma cy'amatwi ku buryo gikora neza ku muntu. Mu 1971, ikigo cya Amplifon gishinzwe ubushakashatsi n\u2019ubushakashatsi (CRS) cyashinzwe: umuryango wigenga ugamije gukwirakwiza ubumenyi mu bice by\u2019amajwi na otologiya, binyuze mu mutungo n\u2019ubushakashatsi. \nMu myaka ya za 90, Amplifon yatangiye guhindurira serivisi abakiriya ku giti cyabo, itangira ibyuma by'amatwi bya digitale bya mbere mu Butaliyani mu mwaka 1996. Muri icyo gihe, isosiyete yungutse isoko rirenga 40%. \nMu 1992, isosiyete nshya yashinzwe muri Espagne, Amplifon Iberica, yaguka muri Porutugali nyuma yimyaka mike. 1998 na 2000, Amplifon yinjiye mu Busuwisi, Otirishiya, Ubufaransa, Ubuholandi no ku masoko yo muri Amerika binyuze mu kugura ibintu. \nUmugabane watangiye gucururizwa muri Borsa Italiana muri. Mu 2002, Amplifon yaguze isosiyete ya Sonus muri Amerika, nyuma mu 2003 ifata ikigo cy\u2019igihugu gishinzwe kumva, isosiyete ifite amaduka aherereye cyane cyane mu masoko manini y\u2019ubucuruzi. \nMu myaka yakurikiyeho, Amplifon yakomeje ingamba zo kugura mu Buholandi, Ubudage, Ubwongereza, Irilande n'Ububiligi. Mu mwaka wa mu byukuri, isosiyete yaguze 100% y\u2019ubuvuzi bw\u2019igihugu (NHC) muri Ositaraliya, Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande no mu Buhinde. \u200b Burezili yakurikiranye mu 2014 Amplifon igura 51% by'imigabane muri sosiyete yo muri Berezile Direito de Ouvir. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nMu 2016 isosiyete yashoye miliyoni 80 z'amayero (\u00a3) kugirango igure amaduka 170, harimo imirongo ibiri y'ubucuruzi mu Budage n'indi muri Canada. Muri 2017, Amplifon yashoye andi miriyoni 110 yo kugura amaduka 300, harimo imirongo ibiri y'ubucuruzi mu Bufaransa na Porutugali. \nUmwaka umwe, Amplifon yarangije kugura byinshi, igura GAES yo muri Espagne kuri miliyoni 528. GAES ifite amaduka 600 (hafi 500 muri Espagne, naho ayandi asigaye anyanyagiye muri Porutugali no muri Amerika y'Epfo), abakozi 1.800, na miliyoni 210 zinjiza. \nKuva mu 2015, igiciro cy\u2019imigabane ya Amplifon cyikubye gatatu, kiruta FTSE MIB, urutonde rw\u2019amasosiyete 40 ya mbere yashyizwe ku rutonde muri Borsa Italiana. Kuva 2018, igiciro cy\u2019imigabane cyazamutse hafi 1.000% kuva IPO yacyo. \nUyu muyobozi ni Susan Carol Holland, umukobwa wa Algernon, ufite 44.9% ya Amplifon abinyujije mu kigo cy\u2019umuryango we. \nUbucuruzi n'ibikorwa.\nAmplifon ifite imigabane ku isoko rya 11% ku isi, kandi iri mu bihugu 29, mu turere twa EMEA, Amerika, na APAC. \nIsosiyete ikora binyuze mu rusobe rw\u2019ibicuruzwa bigera ku 5.150, ibicuruzwa 4000 mu maduka no mu mfuruka hamwe n\u2019ububiko 1.800 bufitanye isano n\u2019uru rubuga, bukoresha abakozi 16.000 muri rusange. Ubucuruzi bwibanda cyane cyane kugurisha no guhuza ibyuma byumva. "}
{"id": "21012", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21012", "title": "Extended-wear heading aid", "text": "An extende-wear hearing aid n'ubwoko bw'icyuma cy'amatwi gishyirwa cyane mu mfunzo y'amatwi cyane kandi gishobora kumererwa amezi menshi kitavanwaho. Ubu bwoko bw'imfashanyo yo kwumva irakwiriye cyane cyane kubantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva bworoshye. Iki gitekerezo gishya cyo gufasha kwumva cyahimbwe na Adnan Shennib washinze InSound Medical, Inc. \nKuba ibi byuma by'amatwi bishyirwa mu mfunzo y'amatwi ubwabyo bitanga umusaruro mwiza mu kugabanya urusaku ruturutse ku kirere, kuvugana kw'imbere mu matwi, gusubiramo urusaku no gutanga amajwi mu buryo bwiza, ndetse bigatanga uburyo bwiza bwo kumva aho amajwi aturuka n'ubwiza bw'amajwi ugereranyije n'ibindi byuma by'amatwi. \nKoresha no gukora.\nExtended-wear hearing aids bikorwa mu kintu cyoroshye kigenewe gukurikira imiterere y'imfunzo y'amatwi y'umuntu, kandi zigira ubugari butandukanye bw'imfunzo kugira ngo zihuze n'ingano y'amatwi y'abantu batandukanye. Umuganga wa ENT, inzobere mu majwi cyangwa inzobere mu gufasha kumva ntabwo ari kubaga yinjiza igikoresho mu gutwi, agishyira mu gice cyamagufwa cyumuyoboro w ugutwi ~ 4\u00a0mm uhereye kuri tympanic membrane, cyangwa ugutwi. Gushyira muburyo bwihariye mumatwi yamatwi bivugwa ko bitanga ubwiyongere rusange mubyunguka nibisohoka, icyumba kinini cyumutwe, kugabanya ingaruka zifatika, kugabanya ibitekerezo no kunoza icyerekezo. Iyo bimaze kwinjizwamo, abakoresha barashobora guhindura amajwi nigenamiterere bakoresheje igikoresho cyo guhindura ibintu.\nBirakurikirana ko umuganga w'inzobere mu matwi akuraho imfashanyo ndende yo kumva iyo bateri ipfuye cyangwa igihe icyuma kigoma gusimburwa, ariko abahanga benshi mu by'amatwi batanga igikoresho cyihariye cyo kugikuramo(removal loop) kugira ngo umuntu abikore wenyine igihe bibaye ngombwa.\nBirakwiriye.\nKimwe n'ibindi bikoresho byumva, guhuza bishingiye ku matwi y'umuntu ku giti cye, ingano y'ugutwi n'uburyo, imiterere y'ubuvuzi, n'ubuzima. Ibi birashobora kugenwa no gusura inzobere mu gufasha kumva.\nKuramba.\nIbikoresho byunvikana byunvikana byubatswe kugirango bihangane nubushuhe na cerumen (ibishashara byamatwi) kandi birashobora kwambarwa mugihe ukora siporo, kwiyuhagira, nibindi. Kuramba kwimashini ndende yunvikana bigira ingaruka kumikoreshereze, itandukaniro ryibidukikije, nubuzima bwa buri mukoresha."}
{"id": "21013", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21013", "title": "Hearing-Aid Speech Quality Index", "text": "Indangantego yo Kumva-Imfashanyo Yerekana Indangagaciro (HASQI) ni igipimo cy'ubwiza bw'amajwi cyashyizweho mu rwego rwo gusuzuma ubwiza bw'ijijwi ry'abantu bafite icyuma cy'amatwi. Byerekanwe kandi ko bishobora gupima ubuziranenge bw'amajwi ku majwi atavuga ndetse n'ababumva nta kubura kumva. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nMugihe imyumvire yubwiza bwamajwi ishobora gupimwa hifashishijwe ibipimo byo gushishoza, ikizamini gitwara igihe kinini gukora. Kubera iyo mpamvu, ibipimo byinshi byateguwe kugira ngo amajwi asuzumwe bitabaye ngombwa ko abantu bumva. Ingero zisanzwe ziva kuri terefone zirimo PESQ, POLQA, PEVQ na PEAQ. HASQI yashyizweho bwa mbere na Kates na Arehart kugira ngo basuzume uburyo imyitwarire mibi yinjizwa n'ibyuma by'amatwi igabanya ubwiza bw'amajwi Basohoye kandi verisiyo nshya muri 2014. \nKressner na al. yagerageje kuvuga imvugo itandukanye na dataset yakoreshejwe mugutezimbere HASQI kandi yerekana ko indangagaciro rusange neza kubayumva nta gutakaza kumva hamwe nibikorwa bigereranywa na PESQ. Kendrick n'abandi. \nUburyo.\nHASQI hamwe nisubiramo ryayo 2014 n'uburyo bubiri bwarangiye busaba ibyerekezo bisukuye hamwe n'ibimenyetso bitesha agaciro kugirango bisuzumwe. Iki gipimo kigerageza kugaragaza ingaruka z'urusaku, kwivanga kudakwiye kw'amajwi (nonlinear distortion), kuyungura ku murongo (linear filtering) n'impinduka z'umurongo w'amajwi (spectral changes) binyuze mu kubara itandukaniro cyangwa isano hagati y'ingenzi mu biranga amajwi.Ibi bikorwa mugusuzuma ibahasha yerekana ibimenyetso byigihe gito kugirango hamenyekane iyangirika ryatewe nurusaku no kuyungurura umurongo, hamwe namabahasha yigihe kirekire kugirango agereranye ingaruka zo kuyungurura umurongo. Verisiyo ya 2 ya HASQI ikubiyemo icyitegererezo cyo gufata ibintu bimwe na bimwe bya sisitemu yo kumva ya periferique kubantu basanzwe kandi bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva.\nKendrick n'abandi. yateje imbere uburyo buhumye (bumwe-bumwe), bHASQI, ukoresheje kwiga imashini. Ibi bifasha ubwiza bwamajwi gusuzumwa uhereye kubimenyetso byangiritse gusa udakeneye ibisobanuro bisukuye. "}
{"id": "21014", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21014", "title": "Sonotone 1010", "text": "the Sonotone 1010 hearing aid yagiye hanze taliki 29 Ukuboza 1952. Icyo cyari igicuruzwa cya mbere cy\u2019ubucuruzi gukoresha transistor, zari zaravumbuwe imyaka itanu mbere ya 1947.\nByari igishushanyo mbonera, ukoresheje miniature ya vacuum ebyiri nkicyiciro cyo kwinjiza hamwe na tristoriste imwe nkibisohoka; ibi byasabwaga kuko tristoriste icyo gihe yabyaye urusaku rw'amashanyarazi cyane. Ndetse ukoresheje transistor imwe yongerewe cyane igihe cya bateri, kugabanya igiciro cy'imikorere y'ikigo. Mugihe transistor yateye imbere, ubu bwoko bw'icyuma cy'amatwi bwasimbujwe n'ibyuma by'amatwi byose bikoresha transistors. \nIsosiyete ya Sonotone yari ifite icyicaro cyayo mu mujyi wa New York kandi yashinzwe mu 1929. Isosiyete yaguzwe n\u2019andi masosiyete atandukanye kandi ntiyari ikiri mu bucuruzi mu 2005."}
{"id": "21015", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21015", "title": "Personal sound amplification product", "text": "Personal Sound Amplification Products, izwi kandi ku izina rya \"Ibikoresho by\u2019amajwi bwite,\" cyangwa mu magambo ahinnye ya PSAP, bisobanurwa n\u2019ubuyobozi bw\u2019ibiribwa n\u2019imiti muri Amerika nk\u2019ibikoresho bya elegitoroniki byambarwa bigamije kongera amajwi ku bantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutavuga cyangwa batumva. Ntabwo ari ibikoresho byo kumva, FDA isobanura ko bigamije gusimbura cyangwa gukosora igihombo cyo kutumva neza. Ku bwa Dr. Mann wo muri FDA, guhitamo PSAP nk'igisimbuza imfashanyo yo kumva bishobora kugutera kwangirika kwumva. \nItandukaniro.\nByombi PSAP hamwe nibikoresho bifasha kumva nibikoresho bito bya elegitoronike bihuye mumatwi kandi byongera amajwi. PSAPs ahanini ni ibyuma byongera amajwi bisanzwe bigenewe abantu bumva neza, ariko bakeneye kongererwa imbaraga nkeya mu bihe bimwe na bimwe (nko guhiga no kureba inyoni). Imfashanyigisho zumva zirimo urwego rwisumbuyeho rw'ikoranabuhanga rwashyizweho kugirango ruvure ikibazo cyo kutumva neza. PSAP ntabwo igengwa n\u2019amategeko agenga ibiryo, ibiyobyabwenge n\u2019amavuta yo kwisiga kuko atagenewe kuvura, gusuzuma cyangwa gukiza ubumuga bwo kutumva kandi ntabwo ahindura imiterere cyangwa imikorere y'umubiri. Nk'igisubizo, nta tegeko ngenderwaho, kode y'ibicuruzwa cyangwa ibisobanuro kuri ibyo bicuruzwa. Nyamara, FDA igenga PSAP hashingiwe ku ngingo zimwe na zimwe z\u2019amategeko agenga imirasire y\u2019ubuzima n\u2019umutekano yo mu 1968, akubiyemo ibicuruzwa bya elegitoronike nkibikoresho byongera amajwi asohora vibrasiya ya sonic. \nPSAP.\nKuberako badakenera kwandikirwa kwa muganga no guhuza umwuga, PSAP zasobanurwa nk'ubwoko bwa amaso gusoma mu bijyanye n'amajwi. Nkibyo, PSAP irasabwa gukoreshwa nabahiga bumva umuhigo, kureba inyoni, ubufasha kumva ibiganiro bya kure cyangwa ibitaramo no kongera amajwi ya tereviziyo mucyumba gituje, urugero. Icyitonderwa, ndetse ibirahuri byo gusoma bigengwa na FDA. \nModeri zitandukanye za PSAP ziva mubakora inganda zitandukanye ziratandukanye kubiciro, imikorere, uburemere, uburambe bwabakoresha hamwe na software ya algorithms yo kuzamura no kudoda kumva. Mugihe moderi zimwe zongerera amajwi gusa, izindi nigishushanyo mbonera, gitanga mikoro yicyerekezo hamwe noguhuza kuringaniza ibimenyetso byamajwi kugirango bikureho urusaku rudasanzwe cyangwa rudasanzwe. \nPSAP yagiye ikundwa cyane n'abantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva neza, cyane cyane kubera ko zihendutse ugereranyije n'udupfapfa twabugenewe dukorwa ku giti cy'umuntu, nubwo kutitabira ubutumwa, kutagira umumaro no kugena gahunda yo kubonana nabashinzwe amajwi nabyo byavuzwe nkimpamvu zituma abafasha kumva batumva neza. Kubera ko badakenera kwisuzumisha kwa muganga kandi bikwiye, PSAPs iri hagati y\u2019amadolari 50 kugeza ku magana menshi y\u2019igiciro, mu gihe ibikoresho byo kwumva byatwaye amadorari 1400 ku kigereranyo kandi ntabwo bikubiye muri Medicare na gahunda nyinshi z\u2019ubwishingizi. \nNk\u2019uko ikigo cy'igihugu gishinzwe ubumuga bwo kutumva n'izindi ndwara zitumanaho kibitangaza, muri miliyoni 36 z'Abanyamerika bashobora kungukirwa n'imfashanyo yo kumva, abagera kuri 20 ku ijana ni bo bonyine bakoresha imwe. Icyakora, ubushakashatsi bwakozwe mu mwaka wa 2010 bwerekana ko munsi ya 18 ku ijana bya PSAP byakoreshejwe mu gusimbuza ibyuma bifata amajwi kandi bikanzura ko benshi mu bakoresha PSAP baba barabaye bafite ikibazo cyo kutumva kubera igiciro kinini cy\u2019ibikoresho byumva. \nPSAP nyinshi zigurishwa kubaguzi binyuze mububiko bwa interineti, muri farumasi no mumaduka menshi yimiti no kugurisha.\nAmashanyarazi ya PSAP.\nUbushobozi bwa PSAP mu busanzwe n'ibikoresho bito byoroshye. Bongera amajwi kandi batanga ibisubizo kumatwi (s) y'umukoresha. Ibice nyamukuru ni mikoro, amplifier, disikuru, umugenzuzi w'ijwi n'inkomoko y'imbaraga.\nMikoro ifata amajwi (igitutu) imiraba ikayihindura ikimenyetso cyamashanyarazi. Amplifier (umuzunguruko wa elegitoronike) yongerera amplitude yikimenyetso cyamashanyarazi ukoresheje isoko yingufu (bateri). Umuvugizi ahindura ibimenyetso byamashanyarazi byongerewe imbaraga mumajwi. Ijwi (inyungu) igenzura rikoreshwa muguhindura ingano ya amplification ikoreshwa ku kimenyetso cyamashanyarazi bityo, mu buryo butaziguye, igenzura amajwi.\nIbikoresho biratandukanye mubunini uhereye kumasanduku mato (hamwe numutwi wometseho) wambarwa mwijosi cyangwa umanikwa kumukandara - hasi kugeza - igikoresho gito gifunze gihuye numuyoboro w ugutwi. Ibi bikoresho bito bisa nkibikoresho byumva ariko biroroshye cyane kandi ntibikosora kunanirwa kwumva."}
{"id": "21016", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21016", "title": "Foldimate", "text": "FoldiMate yari companyi ikorera muri Californiya yashinzwe muri 2012, ikora imashini y'ikoranabuhanga ishobora gufunika imyenda mu buryo bwikora. Imashini yabo yo gufunga imyenda yari igamije kwinjira ku isoko mu mpera za 2019. Mu 2021, isosiyete yarahagaritse. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nAmateka.\nFoldimate yashinzwe na Gal Rozov, injeniyeri wa software muri Isiraheli wafashe umwanzuro ko kumesa imyenda ari akazi katoroshye gashobora gukorwa neza na robo. Mu mwaka wa Rozov yaretse akazi ko gutunganya porogaramu no gucunga ibicuruzwa maze amara imyaka ibiri akora ibikoresho byo kumesa. Mu mwaka wa 2012, yimukiye muri Amerika gukorana n'ikipe ya robo mu kibaya cya Silicon. Kugeza mu 2013, yari afite ikoranabuhanga ryemewe. Muri 2016, nyuma yicyiciro cya mbere cyishoramari, yakoze prototype yambere. Porotype yatanzwe muri CES 2017 yabyaye inyungu nyinshi. \nIsosiyete yerekanye prototype igezweho ya Foldimate muri CES 2018. \nMuri Mutarama 2018, BSH Hausger\u00e4te yagaragaje ubushake bwo gufatanya na Foldimate. \nKu ya 30 Kanama 2021, isosiyete yohereje imeri ku bakiriya bari baratanze ingwate ya amadolari 85$ ibamenyesha ko iyi sosiyete yahombye kandi ibasaba kuzuza impapuro zisaba gusubizwa ayo mafaranga $85. \"ifite\" [] ngo \"Guhagarika ubucuruzi - ITANGAZO ryo kubitsa\" kandi ryatangiranye n'umurongo \"Ndakumenyesha ko FoldiMate, inc. (\" FOLDIMATE \") yahagaritse ibikorwa byayo by'ubucuruzi\". Abakiriya basabwaga gutanga ifishi bitarenze ku ya 1 Gashyantare 2022, amafaranga yatanzwe guhera nyuma y'itariki ya 1 Gashyantare 2022.Umukiriya yasabwe gutanga amafaranga yo kubitsa n'itariki. Kwishura byatanzwe hakoreshejwe PayPal cyangwa ikarita y'inguzanyo.\nIncamake.\nFoldiMate nini cyane kuruta imashini imesa. Nk\u2019uko abashinzwe iterambere babitangaza, irashobora kuzinga neza mu minota itarenze 4. \nUmukoresha akata umwenda kumyenda ibiri hanyuma ikintu gikururwa mumashini. Noneho urukurikirane rw'ibizunguruka n'amaboko bigenda mu byerekezo byose kugirango bigorore kandi bikubye. Imashini irashobora kuzinga amashati, hejuru, ipantaro n imyenda ntabwo ari imyenda mito y'imyenda y'imbere cyangwa ibintu binini nk'impapuro. Ibintu byiziritse bisubizwa mu murongo unyuze mu madirishya hepfo yimashini. \nImpapuro zabanjirije iyi zirimo tekinoroji yo kurwanya inkari n'ibiranga impumuro nziza, ariko ibicuruzwa byarahinduwe kandi byoroshya hagamijwe kubitegura ku isoko mu mpera za 2019. "}
{"id": "21017", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21017", "title": "Amazone Astro", "text": "Amazon Astro ni robot yo mu rugo yakozwe na Amazon.com, Inc. Igamije kugenzura umutekano w'urugo, kwita ku bageze mu zabukuru b'iwacu bari kure,no gukora nka mufasha w'ukuri ushobora gukurikira umuntu ava mu cyumba kimwe ajya mu kindi. \nIbiranga.\nUbuyobozi bwa Tom bwise igikoresho \" Alexa ku ruziga \" kandi ibintu byose biboneka kuri Amazon Echo Show 10 biri kuri iki gikoresho gishya. Astro ifite indangamuntu igaragara kandi igomba kuba ishobora kumenya abo mu miryango itandukanye kandi ikohereza integuza niba igikoresho kibonye umuntu atazi murugo. \nMu 2022, Amazon yatangaje gahunda y'icyitegererezo ihuza Astro na sisitemu y'umutekano ya Ring, yemerera abakozi bo mu kigo cya kure guhamagarira kugenzura Astro gukora iperereza ku bijyanye n'umutekano. \nKwakira.\nMark Gurman wo mu makuru ya Bloomberg avuga ko, nyuma y'amezi atandatu asohotse, ku buryo umuntu uwo ari we wese yavugaga kuri Astro kuri interineti, kandi ko Amazon yohereje ibice magana make gusa, cyane. David Padiri wo muri CNET abona ko \"Kugeza ubu, iyi robot ikomeje kuba ikintu cyiza, ku bantu bafite amafaranga menshi yo kugerageza ikoranabuhanga rigezweho kugeza na n'ubu ridafite ikibazo gikomeye cyo gukoresha.\" Lauren Goode wo mu kinyamakuru Wired yanditseho Astro nka \"robot kubera robo\" na \"robot nta mpamvu, byibuze kuri ubu\". \nItangazo ryashyizwe ahagaragara muri Nzeri 2022 rivuga ko Astro izakora nka umurinzi w'umutekano ihuzwa n'ibikoresho bya Ring Security byo mu ngo no bigo bito by'ubucuruzi ryatumye Gizmodo ivuga ku buryo Astro igenda iba igitangaje kandi iteye ubwoba kurushaho. "}
{"id": "21018", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21018", "title": "Aeotec", "text": "Aotec ni ikigo gikomeye mu ikoranabuhanga mu gukoresha ingufu mumazu agezweho hifashishijwe uburyo bwa smart thingsZ-Wave, Zigbee na Matter. Vumbura ibikoresho byacu byihariye byagenewe ubunararibonye bwa SmartThings, bitanga ikoranabuhanga rigezweho no guhuza neza kugira ngo ubuzima burusheho kuba bwiza. Aeotec, ikirango cy\u2019Abadage, Ubuziranenge bw\u2019Abadage.\nIbicuruzwa.\nIbicuruzwa bya Aeotec byateguwe gukorana n'abashinzwe kugenzura ibintu nka Matter, Assistant Home, openHab, SmartThings, na Wink hamwe n'abashinzwe kugenzura itsinda AutoPilot na Smart Home Hub. "}
{"id": "21019", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21019", "title": "Wheelchair fencing at the 2010 Asian Para", "text": "Imikino yo gusinganywa mu nkingi z'amaguru (wheelchair fencing) muri Asian Para Games ya 2010 yabereye muri Gymnasium ya Guangda, Guangzhou, mu Bushinwa kuva ku ya 14 kugeza ku ya 16 Ukuboza 2010.\nIncamake y'umudari.\nImeza y'imidari.\nYakuwe muri Aziya Para Imikino Yurubuga 2010. "}
{"id": "21020", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21020", "title": "Alarm.com", "text": "Alarm.com, Inc. nisosiyete yo muri Amerika ikora mu ikoranabuhanga, itanga serivisi zishingiye ku bicu (cloud-based) zo gucunga kure, gucunga ibikorwa by'amazu, no kugenzura alarme.\nSerivisi zo kugenzura zishobora gukorwa hakoreshejwe amasezerano n'abakora ku giti cyabo (third-party contractors) nka ADT. Serivisi zirimo umutekano woguhuza, kugenzura amashusho, gucunga ingufu no gukoresha urugo, kandi birashoboka binyuze muri ecosystem yibikoresho byahujwe nubufatanye bwibikoresho.\nAmateka.\nAlarm.com yashinzwe mu 2000 mu rwego rw\u2019ubushakashatsi n\u2019iterambere rya MicroStrategy kandi itangiza gahunda y\u2019umutekano itangiza ibikorwa byafashaga kurebera kure no guha intwaro gahunda y\u2019umutekano wambuwe intwaro mu 2002. Isosiyete yateje imbere urubuga rwayo ikubiyemo porogaramu zikoresha ibikoresho by\u2019urugo n\u2019ubucuruzi bikubiyemo gukurikirana amashusho, gucunga ingufu ndetse n\u2019ubushobozi butandukanye bwo gukoresha urugo. Muri Gashyantare 2009, Alarm.com yaguzwe n\u2019ishoramari ry\u2019ishoramari ABS Capital Partners kuri miliyoni 27.7. Muri 2015, Alarm.com yatanze icyifuzo cya mbere gitangirwa ku mugaragaro maze ijya ku mugaragaro muri kamena. \nAlarm.com itanga igicu gishingiye kubicu kuburugo bwubwenge hamwe na sisitemu y'ubucuruzi. Ihuriro rifasha abafatabuguzi kurinda no kugenzura imitungo yabo binyuze ku mbuga za interineti na porogaramu zigendanwa, ndetse no mu guhuza na Apple TV, Amazon FireTV, Google Home na Amazon Alexa. Isosiyete yatangiye gutanga imicungire y\u2019ingufu mu ntangiriro za 2010, yemerera abakoresha kugenzura kure ubushyuhe no gukonjesha ku mutungo wabo bakoresheje porogaramu zigendanwa cyangwa babinyujije ku rubuga rw\u2019isosiyete. \nAlarm.com yatangaje ko yinjije miliyoni 167.3 z'amadolari y\u2019Amerika n\u2019abakoresha b\u2019abafatabuguzi barenga miliyoni 2.3 muri 2014. Muri 2018, isosiyete yatangaje ko yinjije miliyoni 291.1. \nMuri 2015, Alarm.com yatanze IPO kumadorari 14 kumugabane. ABS Capital Partners and Technology Crossover Ventures, yashoye miliyoni 136 z'amadolari muri sosiyete, yagumye kuba abanyamigabane benshi. \nMuri 2016, Alarm.com yahujije urubuga rwayo rushingiye ku bicu hamwe na Amazone ya Echo idafite ibyuma bifata amajwi hamwe n\u2019ibikoresho byifashisha amajwi, ndetse na TV ya Apple ya HomeKit. \nMuri 2020, Alarm.com yaguze Shooter Detection Sisitemu kumafaranga ataramenyekana. \nMuri 2023, Alarm.com yaguze EBS. Icyicaro gikuru cya EBS kiri i Warsaw."}
{"id": "21021", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21021", "title": "IAccessible2", "text": "IAccessible2 ni API igerwaho na sisitemu ndetse na porogaramu ya Microsoft Windows. Ku ikubitiro yatunganijwe na IBM munsi ya codename Project Missouri, IAccessible2 yashyizwe munsi yitsinda ryitsinda ryubusa, ubu rikaba rigizwe na Linux Foundation. Yashyizwe mubindi bisobanuro bya Microsoft bishya UI Automation API.\nMugihe UI Automation yavuzweho nk \"\" ubwami butagira ubwami \", IAccessible2 ivuga ko\" ifunguye \".\nIntego.\nMugihe UI Automation itandukanye cyane na Microsoft Active Accessibility (MSAA) Kugirango ikore API yorohereza abafite Ubumuga kandi ifite uburyo bwagutse IAccessible2 yo yuzuzamo ibyo MSAA yari ibuze kugirango ijyane n'java Assistive Technology Service Provider Interface (AT-SPI). Muburyo bwo kugura MSSA aho kuyisimbura IAccessible2 ituma abahanga mu gukora porogaramu bashobora gukomeza gukoresha ibyo bashoyemo muri MSAA, ariko kandi bagatanga uburyo bwo kugerwaho n'ikoranabuhanga rifasha abafite ubumuga (AT) mu buryo bwo kubona inyandiko zo mu buryo buhambaye \nUmushainga wa Missouri watangiye ubwo State of Massachusetts, yari mu nzira yo kwemera gukoresha adopting the OpenDocument format mu nyandiko zayo za leta ariko isaba ko umurongo ugomba kuba worohereza abafite Ubumuga. kongera accessibility of dynamic web applications, urugero nk'aho bagaragaza ibikoresho byihariye nk'ikoranabuhanga rifasha abafite ubumuga butandukanye assistive technology ndetse no gutoranya amakuru mashya hashingiwe ku buryo bwayo no ku kamaro kayo byabaye intego ya kabiri ikomeye y'uwmushinga.\nIAccessible yatangiye gushyigikirwa muri LibreOffice muri verisiyo ya 4.2. iri mu bikorwa byo guteza imbere umushinga wa Apache OpenOffice, Mozilla Application Suite, NonVisual Desktop Access ndetse no muri Opera web browser. Nubwo IAccessible2 yatangijwe urubuga nka API y'uburyo bwo korohereza abafite ubumuga kuri Windows accessibility API, Qt Development Frameworks ruri gufasha IAccessible2 nkuburyo bushobora gusimbura AT-SPI no kuri Linux, kandi ruri guteganya kongeramo uburyo bwo kuyishyigikira bwa mbere muri Qt 4.3.\nguhera mu mwaka wa 2019, Qt ikoresha MSAA na IAccessible2 kuri Windows, kandi ikomeje gukoresha AT-SPI for Unix/X11 systems."}
{"id": "21022", "revid": "10947", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21022", "title": "Soft input Panel", "text": "Panel Yoroheje Yinjiza (nayo yitwa SIP) nuburyo bwihariye kuri ecran yinjiza amagambo udakoresheje clavier cg impuzanyuguti isanzwe yibikoresho. SIP isanzwe ikoreshwa muri Microsoft Pocket PC na PC ya Tablet PC, aho nta mwanya wa clavier yibikoresho. Muri Microsoft Windows hari clavier isa na ecran ikoreshwa nka Microsoft Active Accessibility (MSAA) nayo ifite ubushobozi bwo guhindura imiterere ukurikije imvugo ya clavier iriho nimiterere yingenzi. Yahawe patenti na Microsoft mu Gushyingo 2004 munsi ya patenti nimero 6819315. "}
{"id": "21023", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21023", "title": "Auditory Display", "text": "Kwerekana amajwi ni ugukoresha amajwi kugirango utangaze amakuru kuva avar muri mudasobwa bityo bikaba ari uburyo bwiza ngo kumenyekanisha kubafite ubumuga butandukanye. Ihuriro ryibanze ryo gucukumbura ni Umuryango mpuzamahanga wo kwerekana amajwi (ICAD), washinzwe na Gregory Kramer mu 1992 nk'ihuriro ry\u2019ubushakashatsi muri urwo rwego.\nInyungu n'imbibi.\nAuditory display ni uburyo byerekana ubushobozi bwo gukoresha amajwi asohoka muri mudasobwa kubakoresha abantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona (ukoresheje umusomyi wa ecran) kimwe nabakoresha kureba bakoresha amaso yabo kubindi bikorwa. Kumenya byihuse ibimenyetso bya acoustic hamwe nibintu byose biranga imyumvire yo kumva birashobora kugira uruhare mubikorwa byo kwerekana amajwi nubwo iyerekwa rihari. Kurundi ruhande, amajwi asohoka arashobora kubangamira ibindi bimenyetso bya acoustic, nko gutumanaho kuvuga. Ibi bigora gukoresha ikoreshwa ryerekana amajwi kuri porogaramu zimwe. Byongeye kandi, umusaruro wa acoustic urashobora kutubabaza cyangwa kurangaza. "}
{"id": "21024", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21024", "title": "Daniel Borel", "text": "Daniel Borel (wavutse 14 Gashyantare 1950) ni umucuruzi w\u2019umusuwisi akaba ari nawe washinze ikigo cy\u2019ikoranabuhanga Logitech.\nUburezi.\nMu 1973, Daniel Borel yabonye impamyabumenyi y\u2019ubuhanga muri Physique yakuye muri \u00c9cole Polytechnique F\u00e9d\u00e9rale de Lausanne mu Busuwisi, naho mu 1977 ahabwa impamyabumenyi ya Master of Science muri Computer Science yakuye muri kaminuza ya Stanford. Muri uwo mwaka yasubiye mu Busuwisi. \nUbucuruzi.\nBorel yashinze Logitech mu isambu ya sebukwe mu 1981 na Pierluigi Zappacosta na Giacomo Marini. Umuyobozi wa Logitech 1982 kugeza 2008, anaba umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019isosiyete kuva 1982 kugeza 1988, 1992 kugeza 1998. mu 1988, yashyize Logitech ku isoko ry'imigabane rya Suisse, ndetse no kuri Nasdaq mu 1997. ubu akora nka Perezida Emeritus mu nama y'ubuyobozi ya Logitech. \nIbindi bikorwa.\nBorel yari umwe mu bagize Inama y'Ubuyobozi ya Nestl\u00e9 kuva mu 2004 kugeza 2016. Anakora kandi mu nama y'ubuyobozi ya Dofitech, yashinzwe na we hamwe n'umugore we mu 2001, ari yo muryango ugera ikoranabuhanga rta IT ku bantu bafite ubumuga Byongeye kandi, yashinze akaba n'umuyobozi wa swissUP, umusingi ugamije guteza imbere uburezi mu Busuwisi.\nMuri Nzeri 2010, Borel, ushyigikiye ubufatanye bwa Logitech na \u00c9cole Polytechnique F\u00e9d\u00e9rale de Lausanne, yafunguye ikigo gishya cyo guhanga udushya cya Daniel Borel ku kigo cya kaminuza \"Quartier de l'Innovation\". \nMuri 2019, Borel yitabiriye gahunda yo gukusanya inkunga yo gukusanya inkunga Unibuddy yakusanyije miliyoni 5 z'amadolari y'Amerika mu cyiciro cyayo cy'ishoramari. Kuva ubwo, Borel yakomeje gushora imari mu byiciro by'ishoramari bya Unibuddy, kandi isosiyete imaze gukusanya miliyoni 32 z'amadolari kugeza ubu, harimo miliyoni 20 z'amadolari y'Amerika mu cyiciro cya 2021.\nUbuzima bwite.\nBorel arubatse, afite abana batatu n'abuzukuru barindwi. "}
{"id": "21025", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21025", "title": "Audification", "text": "Audification nubuhanga bwo kwerekana uburyo bwo kwerekana urutonde rwagaciro nkamajwi. Mubisobanuro, bisobanurwa nk \"ubusobanuro butaziguye bwo guhinduranya amakuru kuri domaine yumvikana.\" ibinkandi bigafasha cyane abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona amakuru akurikirana kandi mubisanzwe ibihe bikurikirana, nkamajwi yerekana amajwi aho amakuru yinjizwa yashizwe kumurongo wumuvuduko wijwi. Uburyo butandukanye bwo gutunganya ibimenyetso bikoreshwa mugusuzuma ibiranga amakuru. Tekinike ituma abumva bumva ibice byigihe nkinshuro. Ubugenzuzi busanzwe busaba amakuru manini hamwe nibice byigihe. \nIgitekerezo cyo kugenzura cyatangijwe mu mwaka wa 1992 na Greg Kramer, mu ntangiriro yafashijwemo nu buhanga bwa sonification. Iyi yari intangiriro yubugenzuzi, ariko niyo mpamvu abantu benshi kugeza na nubu bagifata ubugenzuzi ubwoko bwa sonification.\nIntego yubugenzuzi ni ukwemerera abumva kumva amajwi ndetse n'ibipimo bya siyansi cyangwa ibigereranyo.\nUbushakashatsi bwakozwe mu 2007 na Sandra Pauletto na Andy Hunt muri kaminuza ya York bwagaragaje ko abakoreshaga iyo sisitemu babashaga kumenya ibiranga urusaku, ibintu bisubiramo, guhindagurika buri gihe, guhagarika umutima, hamwe n\u2019imbaraga zerekana ibimenyetso mu kugenzura amakuru y\u2019ibihe ku rwego ugereranije no kugenzura amashusho ya porogaramu. \nPorogaramu.\nMubisabwa harimo kugenzura amakuru yimitingito hamwe nibimenyetso bya neurofsiologiya by'abantu. Urugero ni esophageal stethoscope, yongerera ijwi risanzwe ridatanga impinduka zidasanzwe zidafite urusaku nkibisubizo byisesengura rya gaze. \nUbuvuzi.\nGuhindura ultrasound kumajwi yumvikana nuburyo bwo kugenzura butanga uburyo bwa echolocation. Ubundi buryo bukoreshwa mubuvuzi harimo stethoscope hamwe nubugenzuzi bwa EEG. "}
{"id": "21026", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21026", "title": "Garageio", "text": "Garageio ni igikoresho cy'ikoranabuhanga cyo kugenzura umuryango wa garaje mu rugo, cyakozwe na Alottazs Labs, LLC icyi cyumba cyayo giherereye i Columbus, Ohio. Alottazs Labs, LLC ni isosiyete ifite abikorera ku giti cyabo yashinzwe mu Kwakira 2012. Garageio ni interineti y'ibintu itanga igaraji icungwa ndetse n'irembo ryinjira binyuze kuri terefone n'ibindi bikoresho bifasha urubuga. \nGarageio igizwe na WiFi ishoboye kugenzura ihuriro ryugurura urugi rwa garage kandi rigenzurwa binyuze muri Garageio mobile cyangwa porogaramu ya desktop. Igenzura rishobora guhuza inzugi zigera kuri eshatu zitandukanye nigikoresho kimwe. \nPorogaramu ya Garageio iOS na Android yemerera uyikoresha gucunga kure buri rugi rwa garage rwigenga. Umukoresha arashobora kandi gutanga no kwemera kugera kumiryango yandi ya garage kubandi bakoresha Garageio. \nAmateka.\nIgitekerezo cya Garageio cyatangiye mu 2012 ubwo uwashinze umushinga Zak Dziczkowski yavumbuye urugi rwe rwa garage rwabuze. Zak yahise amenya ko igiciro cyo gusimbuza icyuma gishya cyari gihenze cyane kandi atekereza uburyo bwiza bwo kugenzura umuryango wa garage. Muri iryo joro nyene, Zak yahamagaye uwashinze Dave Reif maze batangira gukora kuri prototype ya Garageio. \n2012.\nMu Kwakira 2012, Garageio yabaye ibicuruzwa bya Alottazs Labs, LLC izana abandi bashinze imishinga, rwiyemezamirimo Greg Colarich, umuhanga mu guhanga udushya Jess Boonstra, n\u2019umucuruzi Zach Cochran. \n2013.\nGarageio yamaze igice cya mbere cy'umwaka yibanda ku gukora porogaramu no gushushanya ibicuruzwa. Garageio yahawe igihembo cy'igitekerezo gishya (Cool Idea) Igihembo cyatanzwe na Minnesota gikora plastike Proto Labs yatanze progaramu ya prototype yubusa hamwe nibikorwa byakurikiyeho. Mu Gushyingo 2013, Garageio yatangije gahunda yo gutera inkunga imbaga y'abantu binyuze muri Fundable ikusanya $ 30.000 yo kugurisha mbere. \n2014.\nGarageio yatangiye kohereza mu ntangiriro za 2014 kubaterankunga bayo baterankunga kandi akomeza gufata ibicuruzwa abinyujije kurubuga rwayo. Garageio yasohoye verisiyo ivuguruye ya porogaramu kandi itangaza ko hiyongereyeho porogaramu nka IFTTT (niba irenze iyo), ituma abayikoresha bakora resept zikurura ibintu byabigenewe. Garageio yongereye imiyoboro ikora kandi ikomeza kohereza muri Amerika ya ruguru.\n2015.\nGarageio yari umwe mu nshuro za mbere yakiriyeinkunga ya Alexa, umushiga wa Amazon.com ugamije gushyigikira amasosiyete atangira (starups) akora ku ikoranabuhanga ryo kugenzura amajwi. "}
{"id": "21027", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21027", "title": "Amaryllo", "text": "Amaryllo Inc. ni isosiyete mpuzamahanga yashinzwe i Amsterdam, mu Buholandi. Ikora nka platform ishingiye ku bicu (cloud service platform) itanga ububiko bw'ibicu (cloud storage) ndetse na serivisi zo gutunganya amakuru mu bicu (cloud computing services) ku masosiyete n'ibigo by'ubucuruzi. Amaryllo yatangiye ubucuruzi hamwe na Skype IP kamera yiterambere mugutezimbere tekinoroji ya robotique ya biometrike, umuyoboro wa P2P uhishe, hamwe no kubika ibicu.\nAmaryllo yashinzwe n\u2019umunyamuryango wa Band of Angels, Marcus Yang kugira ngo ateze imbere patenti y\u2019ubwoko bushya bwa kamera za robo zitwa \"kuvuga, kumva, guhumurirwa, kumenya isura y\u2019abantu, no gukurikirana abinjira\". Ivuga kandi ko yakoze robot ya mbere y\u2019umutekano ku isi ishingiye kuri protocole ya WebRTC, Icam PRO FHD, kandi yegukana igihembo cya CES Best of Innovation Award 2015 mu cyiciro cya Embedded Technology.] Ibicuruzwa bigurishwa mu bihugu birenga 100 byo ku migabane 6. \nAmateka.\nAmaryllo yerekanye ibicuruzwa byayo bya mbere by'ikoranabuhanga ryo mu rugo byo gucunga umutekano muri Internationale Funkausstellung Berlin (IFA) 2013 hamwe na kamera ya IP ya Skype yitwa iCam HD. Amaryllo yatangaje ibicuruzwa byayo bya kabiri byemewe na Skype, iBabi HD, muri CES 2014. Isosiyete yatowe nka \"Cool Vendor \" muri Connected Home 2014. Imashini za kamera za kamera, ATOM AR3 na ATOM AR3S, zatangijwe mu mpera za 2016. Yibanze ku ikoranabuhanga ry\u2019insinga kandi ridafite umugozi rishingiye kuri serivisi za AI.\nIgicu cya Serivisi.\nAmaryllo itanga mbere yo kwishyura ibicu mububiko bwa digitale no mumakarita yimpano yatanzwe na InComm Payments. Itanga serivise nziza yo kubara ibicu binyuze mubufatanye bwa Rescale. Amaryllo atanga kamera z'ubuntu ku bantu basinye ububiko bw'ibicu bw'umwaka wose (annual cloud storage subscription) ku rubuga rwayo."}
{"id": "21028", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21028", "title": "Arlo Technologies", "text": "Arlo Technologies ni sosiyete yo muri Amerika ikora kamera z'iperereza zidafite insinga (wireless surveillance cameras). Mbere yo gutangizwa ku mugaragaro (IPO) ku Isoko ry'imigabane rya New York muri Kanama 2018, Arlo yari ikirango cy'ibicuruzwa nk'ibyo na Netgear, byagumije kugenzura benshi nyuma ya IPO. \nNk\u2019uko iyi, yohereje ibikoresho miliyoni 21,6, ifite konti miliyoni 5.82 ziyandikishije, kandi ifite konti 877.000 yishyuwe, guhera muri Mutarama 2022.\nAmateka.\nKu ya 6 Gashyantare 2018, Netgear yatangaje ko inama y'ubutegetsi yemeje ko itandukanyirizo ry'ubucuruzi bwa Arlo na Netgear. Mu gihembwe cya kabiri cy'umwaka wa 2018, ishami rya Arlo rya Netgear ryabaye ikigo cya Arlo Technologies, Inc. Netgear yatanze munsi ya 20% by'imigabane rusange ya Arlo muri IPO, bituma igumana ubwiganze bwa benshi. \nUmuyobozi mukuru wa Arlo ni Matthew McRae. McRae yinjiye muri Netgear mu Kwakira 2017 ubwo yahawe akazi nka visi perezida mukuru w\u2019ingamba. \nIbicuruzwa.\nArlo ikora ibicuruzwa nka Kamera yumutekano ya Arlo (Arlo security camera), ndetse na kamera zishobora gutwarwa n'izo gukurikirana abana. kamera za Arlo zateguwe ku buryo zigabanya ikoreshwa ry'ingufu hakoreshejwe uburyo bwo gucomeka buke (low-power standby mode). \nGukora.\nGukora Arlo byoherezwa muri Foxconn na Pegatron. "}
{"id": "21029", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21029", "title": "August Home", "text": "August, Inc. ni sosiyete yo San Francisco, ikora mu bijyanye no gucunga ibikorwa bw'amazu (home automation),yibanda ku byuma bifunga imiryango bihuzwa na WI-FI. Isosiyete yashinzwe mu Gushyingo 2012 na Yves B\u00e9har na Jason Johnson.\nKu ya 19 Ukwakira 2017, uruganda rukora ibicuruzwa rwo muri Suwede Assa Abloy rwatangaje kugura urugo rwa Kanama. Amasezerano yarangiye mu Kuboza 2017. \nKugeza muri Nyakanga 2018, August Home yari imaze kugurisha miliyoni imwe zifunga ubwenge na kamera. \nIbicuruzwa.\nMuri Gicurasi 2013, Kanama yasohoye ubwenge bwabo bwa mbere. bifite ikariso yicyuma kandi yagenzurwaga hakoreshejwe Bluetooth 4.0 hamwe na porogaramu ya terefone. ku zindi nzugi zifunga urugi rwo muri Kanama, igikoresho gifata kuri deadbolt ihari ku gice cyimbere cyumuryango, iracyemerera gukoresha urufunguzo gakondo. Nyuma yaho, hagiye hanze igikoresho cya Wi-Fi bridge cyemerera gufungura umuryango hifashishijwe kure (remote access) no gukoresha mufasha wa Virtual (Virtual assistant) (nka Amazon Alexa). \nMu Kwakira 2015, isosiyete yatangije urutonde rwibicuruzwa bishya birimo igisekuru cya kabiri gifunga ubwenge, inzogera yo mu muryango, hamwe na kanda ya kode kubakoresha badafite terefone. Isosiyete yatangaje kandi Kanama Access, urubuga rwo kureka abatwara ubutumwa ba Postmates, Handy, nizindi serivisi babasha kugera kumugozi binyuze kode imwe. Serivisi kugirango ishyire Walmart ku masoko yatoranijwe yo muri Amerika. HomeKit verisiyo ijyanye no gufunga nayo yasohotse umwaka ukurikira. \nVerisiyo ihendutse yo gufunga ubwenge yasohotse muri 2017, hamwe na Z-Wave ihuza igenewe kwishyiriraho umwuga. Ifunga rishya kandi ryongeyeho ibyuma byerekana ibyuma kugirango umenye niba umuryango ufunguye cyangwa ufunze. \nPorogaramu yo muri Kanama yagutse igera ku gufunga Yale na Emtek muri Mutarama \nIbibazo by'umutekano.\nMuri Kanama 2016, hacker yingofero yerekana intege nke hamwe na kode yo muri Kanama inshuro imwe yemerera umuntu kuyikoresha igihe kirangiye muri DEF CON. Isosiyete yakemuye ikibazo nyuma yuku kwezi. MIT yakoze ubundi bushakashatsi ku ntege nke zishobora kubaho mu mutekano wigikoresho. Bagerageje kugera ku gikoresho bakoresheje uburyo bwinshi, nta na kimwe cyatsinze. Uburyo bagerageje ni ubu bukurikira: igitero cyibanga, \"Ntabwo ndimo ndumva\" ibitero, guhindura itariki nigihe cyagenwe, gutondekanya paki ya Bluetooth, gusenya porogaramu, guhumura udupaki twa TCP, ibitero byabantu hagati, no kugarura uruhushya rwa nyirubwite urufunguzo rwa interineti. Muri ibyo bigeragezo byose, kimwe gusa cyari gifite ishingiro. Mugukata paki ya Bluetooth, abantu bafite umugambi mubisha barashobora kugerageza uburyo bwa \" brute force \" bakeka ciphertext ikenewe kugirango bakingure umuryango. Nubwo bimeze bityo ariko, amahirwe yo gukeka ko aya matsinda ari imwe muri miliyoni zirenga 18.4, kandi igihe giteganijwe byose (all sequence) cyitezweho kurenga imyaka ine. "}
{"id": "21030", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21030", "title": "Blink Home", "text": "Immedia Semiconductor LLC, ikora ubucuruzi nka Blink, nisosiyete yo muri Amerika ikora mu bijyanye no no gucunga ibikorwa by'amazu(home automation) ikaba ikora kamera zu'mutekano murugo (home security cameras). Isosiyete yashinzwe mu 2009 na Peter Besen, Don Shulsinger, Dan Grunberg, Stephen Gordon, na Doug Chin. Isosiyete yatangijwe bwa mbere nka Immedia Semiconductor Inc mu 2009, ariko yinjira mu isosiyete ikora ibikoresho bya elegitoroniki. Muri, isosiyete yagize ubukangurambaga bwa Kickstarter kuri kamera y\u2019umutekano yo mu nzu, yakusanyije miliyoni zisaga 1 US $. Nyuma yaho, Blink yaje gutangaza kamera yumutekano wo hanze, sisitemu yumutekano murugo, hamwe ninzogera ya videwo. \nAmazon yatangaje mu Kuboza 2017 ko baguze iyi sosiyete. Immedia Semiconductor, LLC ikomeje gukora nk'ishami ry'igenga. Biteganijwe ko tekinoroji ya Blink izakoreshwa muri serivisi ya Amazone.\nUkuboza 2019, Amazon yashyizeho ibikozwe byo gukosora (patches) mu rwego rwo gukemura ibibazo by'umutekano (Vulnerabilities),byagaragajwe mu sisteme za kamera z'umutekano za Blink XT2, byabonetse n'ikigo Tenable gikorera mu guhishura no gupiama ibyuho by'umutekano (vulnerability detection firm). \nIbicuruzwa byinshi bya Blink bikorerwa mubushinwa, mugihe ibindi bikozwe muri Maleziya na IoT Manufacturing Sdn Bhd.\nIbicuruzwa.\nBlink Video Doorbell.\nThe blink video doorbell ni igikoresho cy'ubwenge gihujwe na terefone cyemerera amashusho n'amajwi kureba hakoreshejwe ikindi gikoresho. Ikora kimwe na inzogera yo kumuryango, harimo mubushobozi bwayo bwo guhuza Amazon Alexa hamwe nogutanga \"plus\" abiyandikisha, itanga ubushobozi bwo kubika ibicu no guhuza ibikoresho byinshi. \nBlink Dog Camera.\nThe Blink Dog camera n'igikoresho cy'ubwenge cyagenewe guha ba nyiri amatungo uburyo bwo kugenzura amatungo yabo mugihe ba nyirayo bataba murugo. Kamera irimo ibisobanuro bihanitse 1080p videwo nubushobozi bwo kureba nijoro. "}
{"id": "21031", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21031", "title": "Earcon", "text": "EARCON, yerekana ibyabaye cyangwa bitanga andi makuru. Earconi iranga sisitemu y'imikorere ya mudasobwa hamwe na porogaramu, uhereye kuri beep yoroshye kugirango werekane ikosa, kugeza kuri majwi yihariye ya sisitemu y'imikorere igezweho yerekana gutangira, guhagarika, nibindi byabaye. \nEarxon ni kumagambo asanzwe amenyerewe mumashusho ya mudasobwa. Agashusho gasa nk ijisho con kandi ni amashusho, yashishikarije DA Sumikawa guhimba gutwi nk'ijwi ryumvikana mu ngingo yo mu 1985, 'Amabwiriza yo guhuza ibimenyetso byerekana amajwi mu mbuga zikoresha mudasobwa. \nIri jambo rikoreshwa cyane kuri Earcon yerekana amajwi muri interineti, ariko ingero z'igitekerezo ziboneka mu bitangazamakuru byamamaza nka radiyo na televiziyo:\nEarcons muri rusange asanisha amajwi cyangwa amajwi. Ijambo risa naryo ryumva ryerekana amajwi ya buri munsi akora intego imwe.\nKoresha muburyo bwa tekinoroji ifasha.\nTekinoroji ifasha kubikoresho bya mudasobwa nk'abasomyi ba ecran harimo ChromeVox ya ChromeOS, TalkBack ya Android na VoiceOver ya Apple - koresha ugutwi nk'uburyo bworoshye kandi bwihuse bwo kugeza kubakoresha impumyi cyangwa bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona amakuru ajyanye na interineti bayobora. Amatwi mu basomyi ba ecran ahanini akora nkibimenyetso byo kumva kugirango amenyeshe umukoresha ko bahisemo ubwoko bwihariye bwibintu, nka buto, hyperlink cyangwa inyandiko yinjiza. Bashobora kandi gutanga imiterere kubyerekeye inyandiko cyangwa uburyo bugezweho, nkaho urupapuro rwurubuga rurimo gupakira.\nEarcons itanga ibyongerwaho mugukoresha abasomyi ba mudasibwa mugukoresha bitewe nubugufi bwabyo nubwitonzi, ibyo bikaba bizan a iterambere mugukoresha ibimenyetso birebire byavuzwe kugirango utange imiterere: gukoresha beep ngufi, itandukanye mugihe buto ya interineti yatoranijwe irashobora kwihuta cyane bityo rero byoroshye kubyumva kuruta gukoresha synthesis imvugo kugirango uvuge ijambo \"buto\". \nAbantu bakoresha Earcon, abakoresha bagomba kwiga guhuza gutwi nibisobanuro byabo kugirango babashe kubyungukiramo byuzuye. Gufasha mukwiga amashyirahamwe nkaya, abasomyi ba ecran bamwe nabo bazavuga ibisobanuro byamatwi yabo, nubwo bigana kumpera yubusobanuro bwabo bwuzuye bwibintu. Birasabwa ko gutwi byamenyekana hakiri kare mugihe wiga gukoresha umusomyi wa ecran kugirango urebe ko bihinduka (kandi amaherezo, subconsciously) bifitanye isano no gukoresha bisanzwe. "}
{"id": "21032", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21032", "title": "Ecobee", "text": "ecobee ni sosiyete ikorera iToronto, muri Canada, ikora ibijyanye no gucunga ibikorwa by'amazu (home automation),ikora thermostats z'ikoranabuhanga (smart thermostats),sensor z'ubushyuhe n'izigaragaza ko hari umuntu mu cyumba (temperature and occupancy sensors), switch z'amatara z'ikoranabuhanga(smart light switches),kamera z'ikoranabuhanga (smart camera) ndetse na sensor z'ubwitonzi cyangwa aho ibintu bihurira (contact sensor). Baguzwe na sosiyete y'Abanyamerika Generac Holdings mu 2021.\nThermostats igenzurwa no gukoresha ibyuma byubaka, ibyuma byurubuga, cyangwa porogaramu iboneka kuri iOS, Android, na Apple Watch. Ibindi bikoresho bigenzurwa gusa binyuze muri porogaramu cyangwa urubuga.\nThermostat cyangwa kamera ikora nkurugo rwubwenge rwibikoresho byabo. Guhindura urumuri ntibisaba thermostat cyangwa kamera ariko ntibitanga imikorere ya hub (hub functionalty)\necobee itanga urutonde rwa serivisi zo kwiyandikisha.\nAmateka.\n Ecobee yshinzwe na Stuart Lombard mu 2007, kandi Thermostat yayo ya mbere yasohotse mo 2008. Yagiye ihabwa ibihembo bitandukanye, birimo Deloitte Tecnology Green 15 Award ihabwa amasosiyete y'ikoranabuhanga ryita ku bidukikije byo muri Canada, ndetse na AHR Expo Innovation Award 2011 mu cyiciro cy building automation. \u200b \nMuri Werurwe 2018, ecobee yakusanyije CA miliyoni 80 z'amadorari y'uruhererekane C inkunga. \nMu Gushyingo 2021, ecobee yatangaje ko izagurwa na Generac Holdings kuri miliyoni 770 z'amadolari. Igurisha ryarangiye ukwezi gukurikira. \nIbicuruzwa.\nAmashanyarazi meza.\necobee yaremye ubwenge bwayo bwa thermostat, ecobee Smart, muri 2008. \neco +.\necobee yatangiye gusohora eco + muri 2019 kugirango yimenyekanishe thermostat kugiti cye murugo.\nGuhindura urumuri rwubwenge.\nEcobee Switch + ni urumuri rwubwenge rwashyizwe ahagaragara ku ya 26 Werurwe 2018 Switch+ ifite mikoro (microphone) irimo Amazon Alexa, ndetse ikagira sensor zigaragaza ko hari umuntu (occupancy sensors) n'izipima urumuri rw'amatara y'amanywa (daylight sensors) \nSmartCamera.\nEcobee SmartCamera yasohotse ku Mata 2020 Ifite amashusho ya 1080p. ubugari bwa Camera bwa dogere 180, guhindura icyerekezo no kuzamura (auto pan-tilt), gushyigikirwa na Amazon Alexa, ikiganiro cy'impande zombi (two-way talk) ndetse no kureba nijoro (night vision). \nContact sensor.\nIbyuma bifata amajwi bya ecobee SmartSensor byasohotse ku ya 15 Mata 2020 hamwe na SmartCamera. \nSmart doorbell.\nKamera ya ecobee Smart Doorbell yasohotse mu Kwakira 2023. Abakoresha bafite ecroste ya Ecobee barashobora kureba ibiryo bizima bivuye kuri kamera yumuryango wabo kuri thermostat. \nIbyingenzi bya Smart Thermostat Byashyizwe ahagaragara muri Mutarama \nSmart security.\necobee Umutekano wubwenge ni abiyandikishije-bishingiye kuri sisitemu yo kugenzura urugo ihuza sensor mu bicuruzwa byayo byose muri sisitemu yumutekano murugo. \nAir Filters.\necobee Air Filters ihita yohereza uyikoresha itanura mugihe iyungurura ryayo rigomba gusimburwa. "}
{"id": "21033", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21033", "title": "Eufy", "text": "eufy ni ikirango cy'ibikoresho by'ikoranabuhanga byo mu rugo (smart home) cyatangijwe na Anker Innovation mu 2016. Icyicaro cyacyo kiri i Shenzhen mu Bushinwa. Ibicuruzwa byayo byingenzi birimo kamera zo kugenzura umutekano, gusukura robot vacuum, kumurika ubwenge, nibindi bicuruzwa byo murugo IoT. Ibicuruzwa bya eufy bigurishwa cyane cyane kwisi yose binyuze kumurongo wa interineti no kubicuruza kumurongo nka Amazon na Buy Buy nziza. \nAmateka.\neufy yinjiye mu isoko ry'ubwenge mu rugo m'umwaka wa 2016. eufy yabanje gushyira ahagaragara robot vacuum isukura, cyane cyane serivise ya RoboVac, irushanwa n'ibirango bizwi nka iRobot. Kugeza muri 2020, ikirango cyariyongereye muri sisitemu yumutekano murugo, itara ryubwenge, nibikoresho byubuzima nkibipimo byubwenge. Ibicuruzwa birimo icapiro rya 3D ryihariye UV printer EufyMake E1 yatangijwe binyuze muri Kickstarter, sisitemu yumutekano ya NVR S4 Max, na eufy SpaceView. \nAmabanga no Kurinda.\nMu 2022, eufy yahuye n\u2019igenzura nyuma yuko bigaragaye ko amakuru y\u2019amafoto y\u2019umutekano yashyizwe kuri seriveri y\u2019ibicu, ibyo bikaba bivuguruza ibyo sosiyete ivuga ko yabitse. Ikirango cyasabye imbabazi kandi kivugurura politiki yacyo, ariko ibibazo byo kwizerana biracyahari. Uwo murundikano w'ibibazo washyize ahagaragara imbogamizi z'umutekano w'amakuru (data security challenges) zibangamiye ibikoresho by'ikoranabuhanga byo mu rugo,kandi byatumye abagenzuzi b'amasoko (regulators) babikurikirana by'byimbitse. Ivugurura ryurubuga rwa eufy ryongeye gushimangira ubwitange bwibanga, ryibanda kububiko bwaho no gushishoza kugeza ku ndunduro. "}
{"id": "21034", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21034", "title": "Itegeko ry\u2019Abafite Ubumuga (ryerekeye Amahirwe Angana, Kurengera Uburenganzira no Gushyira mu bikorwa byuzuye), ryo mu mwaka wa 1995", "text": "Itegeko ry\u2019Abafite Ubumuga (ryerekeye Amahirwe Angana, Kurengera Uburenganzira no Gushyira mu bikorwa byuzuye), ryo mu mwaka wa 1995 ni itegeko rigamije gushyira mu bikorwa itangazo ryerekeye uruhare rwuzuye n\u2019uburinganire bw\u2019abafite ubumuga mu karere ka Aziya na pasifika.\nUbuhinde bwashyize umukono ku Itangazo ryavuzwe kandi ni ngombwa gushyira mu bikorwa Itangazo ryavuzwe haruguru. "}
{"id": "21035", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21035", "title": "Abafite Ubumuga nabo barashoboye", "text": "Abafite Ubumuga Bo mu karere ka Gasabo.\nTaliki 03 Ukuboza n'umunsi mpuzamahanga wabafite ubumuga mukarere ka Gasabo. Abafite ubumuga kandi berekanye impano zitandukanye harimo kubyina, gukina ikinamico, imikino ngorora mubiri nka sitball, kudoda n'ibindi bitandukanye abafite ubumuga bamaze kugeraho.\nIbyo kwishimira.\nKumunsi mpuzamahanga w'abantu bafite ubumuga kurwego rw' Akarere ka Gasabo. Nu munsi urangwa nimurikabikorwa byakozwe n'abafite ubumuga bo Mukarere ka Gasabo. Hanabayeho gushyigikira cyangwa se gutera inkunga buri muntu umwe mumirenge 15 igize Akarere ka Gasabo ndetse hanatazwe amagare(wheelchairs) agera kuri 12 kubafite ubumuga bw'ingingo."}
{"id": "21036", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21036", "title": "Ntitwifuza impuhwe", "text": "\"Ntitwifuza impuhwe\" ni intero y\u2019ihuriro ikoreshwa n\u2019abaharanira ishyirwamwo ry\u2019abantu bafite ubumuga mu bya politiki by\u2019isi. Akenshi ikoreshwa mu myigaragambyo y\u2019amashyirahamwe y\u2019ubugiraneza akusanya inkunga yifashishije kugaragaza abafite ubumuga nk\u2019imitwaro cyangwa abatagira icyo bashobora kwikorera. Iri jambo ryatangiye kugaragara ku myenda (T-shirts), rijyanye n\u2019andi magambo y\u2019iterabwoba nk\u2019\u201cKuhumizwa no Kudindizwa n\u2019Indwara Iteye Agahinda.\u201d \nInkomoko y\u2019amagambo.\nIri jambo rishobora kuba ryarahimbwe n'umucuranzi wa rubanda, umusizi, n'umurwanashyaka uharanira uburenganzira bw'abafite ubumuga Alan Holdsworth (izina ry'icyiciro: Johnny Crescendo) usanzwe wishingikiriza ku bugome n'amagambo ashize amanga mu buhanzi bwe bwo kwigaragambya. \nAmateka.\n\u201cIhora ku mbabazi\u201d (Piss On Pity) yakoreshejwe bwa mbere mu myigaragambyo yo mu 1990 no mu 1992 yiswe Block Telethon, yabereye imbere ya sitidiyo ya ITV mu Bwongereza, aho abaharanira uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga bageragezaga guhagarika ko icyo gikorwa cyo gukusanya inkunga gitambutswa kuri televiziyo. Iryo jambo ryasohowe ku myenda (T-shirts) maze ibihumbi byinshi biragurishwa. Iyo myigaragambyo yatanze amahirwe akomeye ku baharanira uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga kugira ngo bagaragaze ibitekerezo byabo, birimo ukuntu abafite ubumuga batagaragazwa neza ndetse n\u2019ukuntu bakurwaho mu biganiro birebana n\u2019inyungu zabo. Ahubwo ku ishyirwa ry\u2019inkunga mu mashyirahamwe y\u2019abagiraneza, abaharanira uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga bashakaga kugaragara no kwinjira mu muryango nyarwanda ku buryo bwabo bwihariye.\nNk\u2019uko abashyigikiye iri jambo babivuga, icyo risobanura ni uko impuhwe, n\u2019ubwo zisa n\u2019amarangamutima meza kandi afasha, zishobora kuba igihombo ku ishema ry\u2019umuntu. Nk\u2019uko babivuga, iri jambo rishingiye ku kwanga ku bushake cyangwa kutabizi abantu bafite ubumuga, ndetse n\u2019ubushobozi bushingiye ku kwikunda no kutita ku bafite ubumuga ubwo kwanga kugaragaza ku bushake cyangwa kutabizi. Nkuko Barbara Lisicki, umwe mu baterankunga b\u2019imyigaragambyo ya Block Telethon, yabivuze muri gahunda ya BBC yitwa Network mu 1989, yagize ati \"\"Niba ukoresha umuntu ufite ubumuga nk\u2019ikintu cyo gufashwa mu buryo bw\u2019ubugiraneza, ntabwo uzamubona nk\u2019umwe mu banganya nawe\".\"\nUmurage.\n\u201cIhora ku mbabazi\u201d (Piss on Pity) yari izina ry\u2019imurikagurisha ry\u2019abahanzi bafite ubumuga, ryabereye i Wakefield, mu Bwongereza, mu mwaka wa 2019. Ibihangano byabo byagaragazaga ubwanga bw\u2019urugendo rw\u2019abantu bafite ubumuga ku bikorwa by\u2019ubugiraneza. Iyo imurikagurisha yerekanye abahanzi bafite ubumuga bahanganye n\u2019icyifuzo gisanzwe cyo kumva ko ibikorwa by\u2019ubugiraneza ari byiza gusa. \n\u201cIhora ku mbabazi\u201d (Piss on Pity) ni izina ry\u2019album yo mu 2013 ikubiyemo ibihangano bya Johnny Crescendo hamwe na mugenzi we Ian Stanton, bombi bakoresheje umuziki kugaragaza ibitekerezo bishingiye ku bunararibonye bwabo, kimwe n\u2019iby\u2019abandi baharanira uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga. "}
{"id": "21037", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21037", "title": "Bashir Ramathan", "text": "Bashir Ramathan ni umukinnyi w\u2019ubutaka w\u2019umunya-Uganda umaze kuba umureba kugeza ku myaka 17. \nBashir ni umunyamurongo w\u2019ama filime magufi abiri y\u2019amateka nyayo: \"Eveready\" iyobowe na Paul Szynol na \"Bashir's Vision\" iyobowe na Daniel Roher."}
{"id": "21038", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21038", "title": "Uburenganzira bwo Kugenzura (Abantu bafite ubumuga, Ubwongereza, 2010\u20132013)", "text": "Hagati ya 2010, hari ahantu hatandukanye hatangirwagaho inkunga mu Bwongereza no mu Wales, ishobora gutangwa ku bantu bafite ubumuga kugira ngo bahaze ibyifuzo byabo bitandukanye mu rugo no ku kazi, ariko rimwe na rimwe izi nkunga zagiranaga ikibazo cyo kutubahirana. Igitekerezo cya \u201cUburenganzira bwo Kugenzura\u201d cyari ukugerageza guhuza izi nkunga no gushyira umuntu ufite ubumuga hagati mu migambi ye y\u2019inkunga.\nIbice birindwi by'icyitegererezo.\nNk\u2019igice cy\u2019Itegeko ry\u2019Isubiramo ry\u2019Imibereho Myiza rya 2009, Amabwiriza y\u2019Uburenganzira bwo Kugenzura ku Bantu bafite Ubumuga (Icyerekezo cy\u2019Ibigeragezo) (Ubwongereza) 2010 yagerageje gushyiraho uburenganzira ku bantu bafite ubumuga bwo gusaba guhitamo no kugenzura uburyo bw\u2019ikoreshwa ry\u2019amafaranga ya rubanda akenewe kugira ngo bafashwe kubaho mu bwigenge mu muryango.\nUrwego rw\u2019izi mishinga rwari harimo inkunga za Access to Work zatangwaga na JobCentre Plus, ikigo cya leta y\u2019icyitegererezo, hamwe na ubwishyu butaziguye ku giciro cy\u2019ubuzima bwigenga, harimo no gukoresha abafasha ku giti cy\u2019umuntu, byishyurwaga ku bantu bafite ubumuga n\u2019ibigo bishinzwe serivisi z\u2019imibereho y\u2019abaturage mu turere. Icyiciro cya mbere cy\u2019ibi bigeragezo cyakomeje kuva Ukuboza 2010 kugeza Ukuboza 2012.\nManchester United.\nUmwe muri abo baderevu yitwaga Ubufatanye bwa Manchester Area, bwari bugizwe na batanu mu bayobozi icumi bo mu nzego z'ibanze (njyanama) muri Greater Manchester:\nHaje kwemerwa kongera igihe cy\u2019amezi 12 ku bigeragezo mu mwaka wa 2013 nyuma yo kuganira, ariko Inama y\u2019Umujyi wa Oldham yaje kwemeza ko izakuramo uruhare rwayo maze isohoka ku 12 Ukuboza 2012."}
{"id": "21039", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21039", "title": "Sosiyete y\u2019Ubwami y\u2019Abana Bafite Ubumuga bwo Kutabona", "text": "Sosiyete y\u2019Ubwami y\u2019Abana Bafite Ubumuga bwo Kutabona (RSBC) yahuye na Sosiyete y\u2019Ubwami yo mu Bwongereza y\u2019Abafite Ubumuga bwo Kutabona (RLSB) ku 1 Mutarama 2017. Ibi byagize ishyirahamwe rimwe ry\u2019ubugiraneza ryo mu Bwongereza no Wales. Intego y\u2019iri shyirahamwe ry\u2019ubugiraneza ni ukwemeza ko abana bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona cyangwa bafite ikibazo cyo kubona, kuva ku myaka 0 kugeza 25, bakura bafite ubumenyi n\u2019ubushobozi bukenewe kugira ngo babashe kubaho ubuzima bwuzuye kandi bushimishije."}
{"id": "21040", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21040", "title": "M\u00e9lanie de Salignac", "text": "M\u00e9lanie de Salignac (1741-1763) yari umuhanga mu muziki w\u2019umufaransa utabona, kandi ibyo yagezeho n\u2019ubwo yari afite ubumuga byavuzwe mu nyandiko za Diderot.\nYavutse i Ch\u00e2teau de Mons (Charente-Maritime)\u00a0[fr], ari umukobwa w\u2019umushoramari Pierre Vallet de Salignac na Marie-Jeanne \u00c9lisabeth Volland, wari mushiki wa Sophie Volland. Musaza we mukuru yari umunyapolitiki Nicolas-Th\u00e9r\u00e8se Vallet de Salignac [fr].\nYavukiye atabona amaso, kera cyane mbere y\u2019uko Braille ivumburwa mu 1829, ariko yize kwiyigisha gusoma akoresheje inyuguti ziri ku makarita yatemwe, kandi yageze ku bintu byinshi akoresheje kumva no gukoraho. Yatekereje uburyo bwo gukoresha ibimenyetso by\u2019umuziki bishobora kumvwa no gukorwaho, yakoresheje gusoma ibihangano by\u2019umuziki no guhanahana ubutumwa n\u2019inshuti.\nDiderot yanditse ku byo yagezeho mu nyandiko ye yitwa \u201cAddition to the Letter on the Blind\u201d. Yagaragaje ko yize algebra, jiometri, ubumenyi bw\u2019isi n\u2019inyenyeri. Yandikaga akoresheje umuneke ku rupapuro rwagutse kandi yasomaga ibitabo byanditswe byihariye ku buryo byamufashaga. Yanacanaga imyenda kandi akina imikino y\u2019amakarita. Yafashe ibyigisho n\u2019ubuhanga bwe nk\u2019ishyushyo kandi yemeza ko abantu batabona bagomba kwigishwa hashingiwe ku bushobozi bwabo busanzwe, aho kwibanda ku kutabona kwabo.\nUmurage.\nValentin Ha\u00fcy yatangiye kwigisha abanyeshuri batabona mu myaka ibiri gusa nyuma y\u2019uko \u201cAddition to the Letter on the Blind\u201d ya Diderot yasohotse. Bifatwa nk\u2019uko yashishikajwe n\u2019ibyagezweho na De Salignac ndetse n\u2019undi muhanga mu muziki utabona,Maria Theresia von Paradis."}
{"id": "21041", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21041", "title": "Santos FC Golbol", "text": "Santos Futebol Clube (; \"Ikipe yumupira wamaguru ya Santos\"), izwi kandi nka Santos ndetse n\u2019akazina ka gikundiro Peixe (bivugwa nka [\u02c8pej\u0283i]), ni ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umwuga ry\u2019umukino wa goalball ryo muri Bresil yabigize umwuga, ifite icyicaro i Santos, Bresile. Nk\u2019umwe mu batangije umukino wa goalball ku rwego rw\u2019igihugu, Santos FC yashyizeho ikipe ya goalball mu mwaka wa 1999, maze mu ntangiriro za 2006 iba ishyirahamwe rya mbere ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru muri Bresile ryahindutse klub ya Paralympike. Kuva icyo gihe, binyuze mu bufatanye na Lar das Mo\u00e7as Cegas de Santos (LMC), Santos FC ifite umukino wa Goalball, hamwe n\u2019amakipe y\u2019abagabo n\u2019abagore, nka kimwe mu mikino yayo. Uyu mukino uragenda urushaho gukundwa. Mu mikino iheruka, ikipe y\u2019igihugu ya Bresile yari ifite abakinnyi baturutse muri Santos."}
{"id": "21042", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21042", "title": "Ubuvuzi bwa Salutem", "text": "Salutem Healthcare ni isosiyete itanga serivisi z\u2019imibereho myiza iikorera i\nWindsor yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 2016. Ikoresha abakozi barenga 3.000. John Godden, umuyobozi mukuru, yahawe igihembo cya MBE mu birori by'icyubahiro by\u2019umwaka mushya 2021. \nSalutem itanga serivisi z\u2019ubuzima bwo gutura no kwigisha ku bantu bakuru n\u2019abana barenga 1,350 bafite ubumuga bwo kwiga n\u2019ibindi bibazo bifitanye isano, harimo n\u2019abafite imyitwarire igoye gucunga. Mu Mata 2017, Salutem yafashe Pathways Care Group na Modus Care, ari bo batanga serivisi zihariye zo kwita ku bana n\u2019abantu bakuru bafite ubumuga bwo kwiga, ibibazo by\u2019ubuzima bwo mu mutwe, autism n'imyitwarire igoye gucunga. Icyo gihe yari ifite amazu 55 akaba yarakwirwagaho n\u2019abaturage bagera ku 400. Kugura Clearwater Care mu Ugushyingo 2017 byongeraga serivisi 20. Mu Kwishyura 2019, yari ikora serivisi 130 mu Bwongereza no Wales.\nMu Mata 2018, Salutem yaguriye serivisi 51 zavuye muri Scope, zirimo ishuri ryihariye 3, amazu yita ku bantu 38, n\u2019ahakorerwa serivisi z\u2019iminsi 10.Iyo mpinduranya yagize abakozi 1,598, bingana na ibice bibiri bya gatatu by\u2019abakozi bose b\u2019iri shyirahamwe ry\u2019ubugiraneza, bahinduranyirijwe bava muri Scope bajya muri Ambito Care &amp; Education, ishami rya Salutem. Scope yabonye miliyoni 3 z\u2019amapawundi kuri iyo mpinduranya.\nItanga ibirori bya buri mwaka bisaba imyambaro y\u2019icyubahiro (black-tie), bizwi nka Kudos Ball, bibera Rainton Meadows Arena, Houghton-le-Spring aho abakoresha serivisi 300 baturutse impande zose z\u2019igihugu bitabira.\nSerivisi.\nCraig y Parc ni ishuri riri i Cardiff, ryashinzwe mu 1955, ryita ku bana bafite ubumuga bukomeye, ubwonko n\u2019ubwiyongere bw\u2019ubumuga bwinshi, ryari ryari riyobowe na Scope mbere. T\u0177 Cwtch Residential Children Home iri hafi yaryo. Mu Mata 2020, abapolisi bo mu gace bateje imbere ikigaragaza ku isabukuru y\u2019imyaka 14 y\u2019umwe mu banyeshuri. Iri shuri rikoresha Dragon Dictate mu gufasha abanyeshuri.\nUmuyobozi wa filime nyayo, Mei Williams, yahawe igihembo cya BAFTA mu 2019 kubera filime ye yerekeye umuturanyi wa Lewis Martin Court, aho isosiyete itanga serivisi zita ku bantu bakiri bato bafite ibyifuzo bikomeye ku masaha 24 ku munsi.\nBull Point ni ikigo cyita ku bantu batuye mu rugo i Plymouth, kigenewe abantu 5 bafite uburwayi bwo ku rwego rwa Autistic Spectrum Disorder. Mu mwaka wa 2019, cyateguye igitaramo cy\u2019imbwa kugira ngo hizihirwe isabukuru y\u2019imyaka 8 y\u2019imbwa y\u2019umuturanyi umwe."}
{"id": "21043", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21043", "title": "Ishuri rya Sri Rakum ry\u2019Abatabona", "text": "Ishuri rya Sri Rakum ry\u2019Abatabona ni ishuri ryita ku bantu bafite ikibazo cyo kubona riherereye i Bangalore, mu Buhinde. Ritanga uburezi bw\u2019ubuntu ku banyeshuri batabona kuva mu mashuri y'inshuke kugeza ku rwego rwo hejuru. Amahugurwa atangwa arimo gusoma no kwandika hakoreshejwe Braille hamwe na amahugurwa yo kugenda ku bana batabona burundu. Abanyeshuri bato bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona bahugurwa hakiri kare mu mashuri y\u2019inshuke kugira ngo bitegure kuzuza amashuri, kaminuza, n'amahugurwa y\u2019umwuga. Iki ni Ishyirahamwe ryanditswe ritari irya Leta.\nUwashinze.\nIri shuri ryashinzwe na Acharya Sri Rakum mu Kamena 1998. Yaretse akazi ke mu mikino y\u2019intambara (martial arts) mu Buyapani no mu Buhindi kugira ngo ateze imbere iri shuri. Ubu ni umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019iri shuri."}
{"id": "21044", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21044", "title": "Richard Mutagatifu Denis", "text": "Richard St. Denis ni umwunganizi mu by\u2019amategeko ukomoka muri Colorado, umwe mu Bafashwe nk\u2019Abakorerabushake 10 ba mbere na CNN ymu 2011, ndetse ni umushinga wa World Access Project. Uyu mushinga kuva mu 2008 watangiye gutanga amapine y'intebe ku bantu bafite ubumuga mu byaro byo muri Mexico. \nYakomeretse akina ski i Lake Tahoe, California mu 1976, kuva icyo gihe akoresha imodoka y\u2019amaguru (wheelchair). Umushinga we wa World Access Project ukusanya amapine akoreshwa (used wheelchairs) ava mu bitaro, amazu yita ku barwayi, amasosiyete atanga ibikoresho by\u2019ubuvuzi, ndetse n\u2019abaterankunga ku giti cyabo baturutse mu Bwongereza bwose. "}
{"id": "21045", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21045", "title": "T61-64 (gushyira mu byiciro)", "text": "T61-64 ni ibyiciro by\u2019ubumuga mu mikino ya paralympik, bikoreshwa mu mikino yo kwiruka no gusimbuka mu marushanwa ya mumikino Paralympique. Ibi byiciro birimo abakinnyi bafite ubumuga ku kuguru cyangwa ukuboko (biterwa n\u2019ivuko ryihariye impanuka, cyangwa gukurwaho kw\u2019igice cy\u2019umubiri mu buryo bwa kirurigi) cyangwa abafite itandukaniro ry\u2019urebure rw\u2019amaguru rirenze santimetero 18 (inches 7 cyangwa zirenga). "}
{"id": "21046", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21046", "title": "T71-72 (gushyira mu byiciro)", "text": "T71-72 ni siporo yimikino yabamugaye kuri para-siporo, by\u2019umwihariko ku bakinnyi bakoresha igare ryihariye ryo kwiruka. Ibi byiciro birimo abakinnyi bafite ibibazo byo guhagarika no kugenzura imyanya y\u2019umubiri, nk\u2019hypertonia, ataxia na athetose. Imikino y\u2019ibi byiciro irimo metero 100 na metero 400.\nAmateka.\nKwiruka kumurongo byasabwe kunanirwa kwinjizwa mumikino Paralympike ya 2024. Igikorwa cya T71 cyabaye ku nshuro ya mbere mu marushanwa ya 2025 World Para Athletics Championships. Imikino ya T72 Imikino ya 100 metres T72 y\u2019abagabo n\u2019abagore izaba ikina ku nshuro ya mbere mu marushanwa yo mikino Paralympike ya 2028. "}
{"id": "21047", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21047", "title": "Ishuri rya Ahmadi ry\u2019Abafite Ubumuga bwo Kutabona, Kaminuza ya Aligarh Muslim", "text": "&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;27\u00b055\u2032N 78\u00b004\u2032E\ufeff / \ufeff27.91\u00b0N 78.06\u00b0E\ufeff / 27.91; 78.06\nIshuri rya Ahmadi ry\u2019Abafite Ubumuga bwo Kutabona ni ishuri ryigenga muri Kaminuza ya Aligarh Muslim University (AMU), i Aligarh, mu Buhindi, ryiyemeje gutanga uburezi no gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe abanyeshuri bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona. Ishuri ritanga uburezi bw\u2019amashuri n\u2019ubw\u2019umwuga kugira ngo ryongere ubushobozi bw\u2019abanyeshuri, ubwigenge, n\u2019amahirwe yo kubona akazi.\nIri shuri ryashinzwe na Nyakwigendera Sahebzada Aftab Ahmad Khan mu 1927. Kaminuza ya Aligarh Muslim yatangiriye gutanga inkunga y\u2019imari ku ishuri mu 1947, maze mu 1949 ifata ubuyobozi bwaryo burundu. Iri shuri ryagiye ritera imbere buhoro buhoro rikaba ikigo cy\u2019icyitegererezo ku bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona, kandi ni ryonyine mu bwoko bwarwo ryubahirizwa na Kaminuza Nkuru. Ryashinzwe rigamije kwita by\u2019umwihariko ku bana bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona, bikaba byaragiye rigira uruhare mu gutangiza uburezi burimo bose (inclusive education) muri AMU. Mu myaka ishize, ryagutse mu bikorwa n\u2019ibikorwaremezo kugira ngo abanyeshuri barusheho gukura no gutera imbere mu buryo bwuzuye.\nIshuri rya Ahmadi ritanga uburezi kuva ku rwego rw\u2019ibanze kugeza hejuru, rikurikiza amasomo ahinduwe kugira ngo ahuze n\u2019ibyifuzo by\u2019abanyeshuri bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona. Ishuri ryemeza ko abanyeshuri babasha kugera ku masomo neza binyuze mu bitabo bya Braille, ibikoresho by\u2019amajwi byo kwiga, n\u2019ikoranabuhanga ry\u2019ubufasha. Ishuri kandi rifite laboratwari zitandukanye zirimo Science Lab, Computer Lab, Mathematics Lab, Language Lab, na PHE Lab.\nLaboratwari ya Siyansi yashyizweho kugira ngo abanyeshuri bige binyuze mu bikorwa bifatika bakoresheje ibimenyetso n\u2019ibikoresho. Laboratwari ya Mudasobwa ifite porogaramu zisoma ku ishusho (screen reading software) nka JAWS ndetse na Braille Embosser, kugira ngo abanyeshuri bigishwe ubumenyi mu ikoranabuhanga. Laboratwari ya Matematiki yashyizweho hamwe na ibimenyetso bishobora gukorwaho n\u2019ibikoresho by\u2019imfashanyigisho, bigafasha abanyeshuri gusobanukirwa ibitekerezo bya matematiki. Ishuri kandi ritanga amasomo y\u2019umuziki, haba mu njyana y\u2019instrumenti no mu kuririmba, bifasha abanyeshuri kugaragaza impano zabo mu buhanzi. Hari kandi icyumba cyo kwidagadura ku bana bato, kirimo ibikoresho bitandukanye byo gukina, televiziyo n\u2019ibindi. Inzu y\u2019ibitabo y\u2019ishuri itanga ibitabo byinshi bya Braille hamwe na amasomo n\u2019ibikoresho byorohereza abanyeshuri mu myigire yabo.\nUretse amasomo asanzwe, ishuri ryibanda ku myigire ishingiye ku bumenyi bw\u2019imyuga kugira ngo abanyeshuri bagire ubwigenge. Amasomo y\u2019umwuga arimo: kwandika ku mpapuro n\u2019ikoreshwa rya mudasobwa (Typing), kuboha ku bikoresho by\u2019intoki (weaving of handlooms), gusana intebe (chair-recaning), kudoda, kudoda mu buryo bwa knitting, guteka n\u2019ibindi. Ishuri rigamije gutanga ibikorwa by\u2019imikino birimo cricket n\u2019indi mikino, bigamije guteza imbere ubuzima bwiza no gukorana n\u2019abandi. Ishuri kandi ryategura gahunda z\u2019umuco n\u2019uburezi kugira ngo hizihirwe iterambere ryuzuye ry\u2019umuntu.\nIri shuri ryibanda ku gutura mu kigo (residential) ritanga icumbi, ibiribwa n\u2019imyambaro ku buntu. Rifite amahosteli abiri, rimwe ku bakyara n\u2019irindi ku bagabo. Serivisi z\u2019ubuvuzi ku buntu nazo ziratangwa n\u2019ishuri.\nIri shuri ryakira abanyeshuri bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona nta vangura ku gitsina, ubwoko, imyemerere, ibara ry\u2019uruhu, icyiciro cyangwa idini.\nAmateka.\nYashinzwe na Sahibzada Aftab Ahmad Khan byumwihariko kubanyeshuri bafite ibibazo. Iri shuri ryibanda ku gutura mu kigo (residential) rifite ibikorwa byo gutanga icumbi n\u2019ibiribwa ku buntu. "}
{"id": "21048", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21048", "title": "Muhammad Akram (umukinnyi w\u2019umupira w\u2019amakipe w\u2019utabona)", "text": "Muhammad Ahmed Akram ni umukinnyi w\u2019umupira w\u2019amakipe w\u2019Umupakistani utabona, wavukiye ku wa 10 Nzeri 1974 i Islamabad, wakiniye igihugu cye mu gice cya mbere cy\u2019amarushanwa y'igikombe cy\u2019isi cya Blind T20 2012 aho ikipe ye yarangije ku mwanya wa kabiri. Muri iyo World Cup, yashyizeho ikibaho cy\u2019isi ku manota menshi umuntu umwe ashobora kubona mu mukino wa T20I ndetse no mu mateka y\u2019igikombe cyisi cya Blind T20 (264) "}
{"id": "21049", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21049", "title": "Ishuri rya Al-Nibras ry'abafite Ubumenyi Bwihariye", "text": "\u00a0Ishuri rya Ideal rya Al-Nibras ni ishuri ryashinzwe muri Nzeri 2004 rigamije kwita ku bana bafite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe buto kugeza ku rugero ruringaniye, kuva ku myaka 4 kugeza 21.\nIshuri ritanga serivisi zaryo zose mururimi rwicyarabu ukoresheje imvugo ya Koweti. Ishuri ritanga ubuvuzi, kuvura umubiri, kuvura akazi, umukozi ushinzwe imibereho myiza, umujyanama, umuforomo no kwisuzumisha kwa buri kwezi."}
{"id": "21050", "revid": "17987", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21050", "title": "Igihembo cya Barbellion", "text": "Igihembo cya Barbellion ni igihembo cy\u2019ubuvanganzo cyo mu Bwongereza, \"cyiyemeje guteza imbere amajwi y\u2019abarwaye n\u2019abantu bafite ubumuga mu mwandiko\". Gitangwa buri mwaka ku mwanditsi wese, mu njyana iyo ari yo yose, ufite indwara ikomeye cyangwa utuye afite ubumuga. Iki gihembo cyashinzwe mu 2020 na Jake Goldsmith, ufite cystic fibrosis, kandi ibitaramo bye byanditswe \u201cNeither Weak nor Obtuse\u201d (2022: ISBN 978-1952386398) na \u201cIn Hospital Environments: Essays on Illness and Philosophy\u201d (2024: ISBN 978-1952386930) byasohowe na Sagging Meniscus Press. Iki gihembo cyitwa ku izina rya W. N. P. Barbellion (1889\u20131919; izina rye nyakuri Bruce Frederick Cummings), umwanditsi w\u2019igitabo \u201cThe Journal of a Disappointed Man\u201d, wabaye ufite multiple sclerosis kandi apfuye afite imyaka 30. \"\u200b\"Mu mwaka wa 2023, Goldsmith yatangaje ko iki gihembo \u201ckizashyirwa ku kiruhuko kitazwi\u201d kandi ko igihembo cya 2023 kitazatangwa, ariko \u201cdushobora gukomeza mu 2024 mu buryo bwiza kurushaho\u201d. Kuva muri Gicurasi 2025, urubuga rw\u2019iki gihembo rwavuze ko \u201cNyuma y\u2019ikiruhuko cyacu, Igihembo cya Barbellion kizagaruka mu mwaka ushize. Ibindi bizatangazwa muri Nzeri 2025.\u201d \nIki gihembo ni mpuzamahanga kandi cyakira ibitabo bishya byahinduwe mu Cyongereza, ndetse n\u2019ibyanditswe n\u2019abanditse ubwabo (self-published), ariko ntikireba ibitabo bitarasohotse. Ubusabe bushingiye ku kuba umwanditsi agaragaza ubuzima afite indwara ikomeye cyangwa ubumuga bw\u2019igihe kirekire... bushobora kugena ubuzima bwe ku buryo bugaragara, kandi abanditsi\u2014nk\u2019abari mu mwanya w\u2019abita ku bandi\u2014batagize ubumuga bashobora gusuzumwa niba igihangano cyabo ari cy\u2019igitangaza mu kugaragaza ubuzima n\u2019indwara, ariko bazahabwa umwanya muto mu guhatanira igihembo. Uwatsindiye iki gihembo ahabwa \u00a31,000, igikombe cy\u2019ikirahure (glass trophy), ndetse n\u2019igitabo cya Barbellion cyitwa \u201cThe Journal of a Disappointed Man\u201d. "}
{"id": "21051", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21051", "title": "Lewis (robot)", "text": "Lewis (yitiriwe Meriwether Lewis) ni robot yigenga ikora akazi ko gufotora mu bukwe: ijya mu birori by'abantu, igatembera, kandi igafata amafoto y'ikoranabuhanga y'abantu. Ni umushinga w'ubushakashatsi muri Laboratwari y'Itangazamakuru n'imashini muri kaminuza ya Washington muri St. \nLewis yagaragaye kuri slashdot, kurubuga rwa CNN, no mubinyamakuru bitandukanye byo muri Amerika y'Amajyaruguru.\nMu 2002, Lewis yakiriye - hanyuma yanga - ubutumire mu birori byo kwizihiza isabukuru yimyaka 24 ya Nelly."}
{"id": "21052", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21052", "title": "XAP Home Automation protocol", "text": "xAP ni sisitemu ifunguye ikoreshwa murugo rwimikorere ishyigikira guhuza telemetrie hamwe nibikoresho bigenzirwa cyane cyane murugo. y'itumanaho irimo RS-232, RS-485, Ethernet na simsiz. Porotokole ya xAP ikoresha ubutumwa bwamamaza gusa. abakira xAP bumve ubutumwa bwamamaza kandi basoma kugirango barebe niba ubutumwa bufite inyungu. Porotokole ya xAP ifite ibyiza byingenzi bikurikira: "}
{"id": "21053", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21053", "title": "Looj", "text": "Looj yari robo yo murugo isukura imiyoboro y'amazi (eavestrough) yakozwe kandi igurishwa na companyi ya iRobot.\nLooj ntabwo yari robot yigenga, ahubwo yari robo igenzurwa n'uyikoresha hakoreshejwe kure, ifite imiterere isa n'iy'igare ry'igikinisho,kandi ifite imashini isongora(power drill) ishyizwe imbere.\nInyandiko.\nLooj yari muremure na robot yagutse ikwiranye mu myanda myinshi kugirango isukure imyanda yabayemo, nk'amababi n'inshinge za pinusi. Ryari rifite ibirenge birebire ku ruhande rwaryo ryemerera kugenda imbere mu muyoboro, hamwe na auger ifatanye imbere. Auger, izunguruka ibintu byoroshye kuri 500 RPM, yajugunye kandi ikuraho imyanda imbere mu muyoboro uyijugunya mu kirere. Igikoresho kandi cyari gifite icyuma gitandukanya / cyitaruye, cyakoreshwaga mu gutwara no gukoresha robot.\nModeri ya mbere ya Looj yakoreshejwe na bateri yimbere 7.2 V NiCad ishobora kwishyurwa, igomba gukurwaho kugirango yishyure. Nyuma moderi ikoresha bateri ya Li-ion yishyurwa aho.\nLooj yahagaritswe muri 2017. \nKwakira neza.\nLooj yakiriwe neza n'ababisuzuma mbere yo kurekurwa. Crunch Gear yagize ati \"Niba ushyize urwego rwawe mu mfuruka y'inzu - kandi imyanda yawe yagutse bihagije - urashobora guhanagura byoroshye impande ebyiri zinzu muminota mike.\" \nLooj yatsindiye igihembo \"cyiza cya CES Innovations Award: Ibikoresho byo mu rugo\" muri "}
{"id": "21054", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21054", "title": "Toyota Partner Robot", "text": "Imashini za Toyota Partner ni urukurikirane rwa za robo zifite ishusho imeze nk'abantu (humanoid) zakozwe na Toyota. Zatangiye kwerekanwa bwa mbere zicuranga ingoma n'impanda mu imurikagurisha mpuzamahanga ryabereye muri Aichi, mu Buyapani mu mwaka wa 2005. Hano hari robot 5, zose zifite sisitemu zitandukanye. Imashini 5 ni: verisiyo ya 1 (robot ya bipedal), verisiyo ya 2 (Segway -like wheels), verisiyo ya 3 (Segway -like wheels), verisiyo ya 4 (sisitemu y'insinga idasanzwe) na i-Foot (ishobora gushyirwaho amaguru 2). Muri Nyakanga 2009, Toyota yashyize ahagaragara amashusho y'ubuhanga bwo kwiruka no guhagarara kwa robot mugenzi wabo. Imashini igera kuri 7\u00a0km / isaha, icyakora kugenda no kwiruka birashobora kugerwaho gusa hejuru yuburinganire. Muri 2017, Toyota yasohoye igisekuru cyayo cya gatatu cyimashini za robo, T-HR3, izakoreshwa mu ngendo zo mu kirere."}
{"id": "21055", "revid": "10947", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21055", "title": "WEMO", "text": "WEMO, ni ishami rya kampanyi ya Belkin, akaba ri urukurikirane bw'ibicuruzwa byaBelkin bakoresha control home electronics remotely. The product suite includes electrical plugs, motion sensors, light switches, cameras, light bulbs, and a mobile app.\nibicuruzwa.\nWemo Switch ishobora gucomekwaho mumurongo uwo ariwo wose akayikoresha murugo kugirago arinde umutekano bwibiza byaterwa n'amashanyarazi, ushobora noneho kugenzurwa na terefone ya iOS cyangwa Android ikoresha Wemo App, ukoresheje urugo rwa Wi-Fi cyangwa umuyoboro wa terefone igendanwa.\nSensor ya Wemo Motion ishobora gushyirwa ahantu hose, mugihe ishobora kugera kumurongo umwe wa Wi-Fi nkibikoresho bya Wemo igenewe kugenzura. Ishobora kuzimya no kuzimya igikoresho icyo aricyo cyose cya Wemo gihujwe numuyoboro wa Wi - Fi mugihe abantu bahanyuze.\nPorogaramu ya Wemo igenzura ibikoresho bya Wemo aho ariho hose ku isi igihe cyose umuyoboro wa Wemo cyangwa se ibikoresho bya Wemo bihujwe na interineti. Ibikoresho bya Wemo bishobora kandi kugenzurwa ukoresheje tekinoroji ya IFTTT. Ibikoresho bya Wemo birashobora kandi kugenzurwa nijwi binyuze muri Amazon Echo, Umufasha wa Google, na Siri ya Apple (binyuze mu gukoresha ikiraro cya Wemo). \nKutagira umutekano muke.\nGuhindura Wemo bigenzurwa hakoreshejwe imiyoboro ya IP; bityo, kugirango uhindurwe kugenzurwa kuva kure, igomba kuba ifunguye kugirango yakire imiyoboro iva kuri enterineti. Muri Mutarama 2013, byagaragaye ko Wemo yari ifite inenge z'umutekano udahagaze neza mu ishyirwa mu bikorwa rya UPnP bityo bikaba bya kwemerera umukoresha utabifitiye uburenganzira kugenzura icyuma. Ibi birashobora kwemerera ibitero bibi, nko guhinduranya ibintu ku buryo bwihuse cyane, bishobora kwangiza ibikoresho bimwe ndetse bikanatera umuriro w'amashanyarazi. \nIyi ntege nke yakemuwe no gusohora porogaramu igezweho. \nKu ya 10 Nyakanga 2025, Belkin yatangaje icyemezo yafashe cyo guhagarika inkunga ya tekiniki ku bicuruzwa bya Wemo bishaje, guhera ku ya 31 Mutarama 2026. Nyuma yiyi tariki, ibicuruzwa byinshi bya Wemo ntibizongera kugenzurwa binyuze muri porogaramu ya Wemo kuko inkunga izaba yarahagaze. Ibintu byose bishingiye kubicu bihuza, harimo kugera kure hamwe nijwi ryunganira amajwi, ntibizongera gukora. "}
{"id": "21056", "revid": "10947", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21056", "title": "OpenWebNet", "text": "OpenWebNet ni protocole y'itumanaho yakozwe na Bticino mu mwaka wa 2000.\ntekinoloji ya OpenWebNet yemerera urwego rwohejuru imikoranire hagati yikigo cya na Bus SCS ya MyHome domotic sisitemu. Ubwihindurize bwa protocole iheruka kunozwa kugirango yemere imikoranire hamwe na sisitemu izwi cyane yo gukoresha urugo nka KNX na DMX512-A, ukoresheje amarembo akwiye.\nPorotokole ya OpenWebNet yashyizwe ahagaragara kumuryango wa MyOpen.\nOpenWebNet Porotocol.\nAbayobozi batekerezaga ko yigenga ku ikoranabuhanga ryakoreshejwe. Kurugero, bishoboka gukoresha software yubugenzuzi ihujwe na Ethernet, ukoresheje serial RS-232 cyangwa ukoresheje USB kugera kumarembo ahujwe na sisitemu ya domotic. Umuntu arashobora kwagura ubutumwa bwa protocole. Birahagije gusaba RFC yabo. Bizasuzumwa kandi bishyirwe ahagaragara niba byubaha syntax \"ya OpenWebNet\".\nUbutumwa.\nHariho ubwoko 4 bwubutumwa bwa OpenWebNet:\n\"Itegeko / Ubutumwa\"\n * NINDE * NIKI * AHO # AHO ##\n\"Ubutumwa busaba ubutumwa\"\n * # NINDE * AHO ##\n\"Gusaba / Soma / Andika Ikigereranyo Ubutumwa\" busaba:\n * # NINDE * AHO * DIMENSION ##\nSoma:\n *#NINDE* AHO * DIMENSION * AGACIRO1 * \u2026 * AGACIRO ##\nAndika:\n *#NINDE* AHO * # DIMENSION * AGACIRO1 * \u2026 * AGACIRO ##\nIrembo GufunguraWebNet.\nBishoboka guhuza na bisi yo gutangiza urugo rwa SCS ukoresheje amarembo yihariye.\nHariho uburyo bubiri bwamarembo yemerera guhuza bisi yo kukibuza ukoresheje protocole isanzwe:\nIrembo rya Ethernet.\nGushyira mubikorwa ubu buryo bwa na BTicino nayo yashyizwemo seriveri. Ikora nkumusemuzi hagati yubutumwa bwa OpenWebNet binyuze kuri TCP / IP nubutumwa bwa SCS bwatanzwe kuri bisi ya SCS.\nGateway USB cyangwa RS-232.\nGateway ni igice gikora nkumusemuzi hagati yubutumwa bwa OpenWebNet bwoherejwe kuri USB cyangwa serial hamwe nubutumwa bwa SCS bwatanzwe muri bisi ya SCS ibyo bigafasha cyane abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona kuko iyi serivici ikoresha amajwi."}
{"id": "21057", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21057", "title": "Zenbo", "text": "ASUS Zenbo ni robot yo mu rugo ikomoka muri Tayiwani yakozwe na kompanyi ya Asus, yashyizwe ikerekanwa ku nshuro ya mbere mu imurikagurisha ahagaragara rya Computex 2016. Igiciro cy\u2019amadorari agera kuri 599 US $, ASUS Zenbo isa na mugenzi muto uzunguruka ufite ibara ryerekana amabara \u201cisura\u201d hamwe n\u2019uruziga ruzengurutse rufite ibiziga. Byakozwe na Intel itunganya Intel hamwe na Intel RealSense ubujyakuzimu - kamera kamera, byatejwe imbere nka \"mudasobwa ya robot kuri buri rugo\". Izina ryahumetswe no guhuza \" Zen \", \"robot\" na \"umuhungu\". \nZenbo yagenewe gutanga ubufasha,gususurutsa, hamwe nubusabane cyangwa umufasha w'abantu bo mu byiciro byose by'imyaka. kubantu bakuze, itanga ubutumwa bubibutsa imiti n'inama z'ibikorwa, kumenya igihe umuntu aguye, ndetse n'amatangazo y'akanya k'amage. Abagize umuryango barashobora kugenzura kure kamera ya Zenbo kugirango bagenzure. Irashimangira kandi guhuza ibisekuruza - gushoboza guhamagara kuri videwo, ijwi - gutwara imbuga za interineti, no kugenzura ibikoresho byo mu rugo bifite ubwenge nk'amatara, televiziyo, hamwe n'ubukonje. \nMu ngo zifite abana, Zenbo arashobora kuba umwanditsi w'inkuru, umufasha w'uburezi, hamwe n'imyidagaduro, afite imikino yo guhuza ibitekerezo, indirimbo, hamwe n'ibisubizo byerekana mumaso yayo. \nKurekura no kwakira.\nZenbo yatangije gahunda yo gutumiza muri Tayiwani ku ya 1 Mutarama 2017, ishyigikiwe n\u2019ubufatanye mu nzego za guverinoma, uburezi, ndetse n\u2019umutekano - harimo porogaramu yihutirwa ihujwe n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019igihugu cya Polisi. \nMu gihe isuzuma ryambere ryashimye ubushobozi bwaryo, ugereranije na terefone zigendanwa zidasanzwe, hamwe n\u2019imiterere yaryo ikomeye, abanenga bagaragaje imbogamizi mu kumenyekanisha imvugo no kugendagenda neza. ASUS yagaragaje icyizere ko Zenbo izaterwa imbere binyuze mugutanga umusanzu kwa ba developers no mu gukura k'uburyo bw'imikorere n'ibidukikije byayo.\nUmurage.\nUkuboza 2017, ASUS yazamuye Zenbo mu rwego rw\u2019ubuvuzi, iyishyira hamwe n\u2019ubuvuzi kugira ngo ikoreshwe mu bitaro by\u2019ubwenge bifite ubwenge hamwe n\u2019isosiyete itanga amakuru yo mu Busuwisi Clinerion. Mu mpera za 2023\u20132024, ibitekerezo by\u2019abaturage - harimo ibibazo bya tekiniki ndetse no guhagarika ivugurura - byavugaga ko Zenbo yaguye mu cyiciro gito cy\u2019inkunga, ariko nyuma byemezwa ko ari ukutumvikana. "}
{"id": "21058", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21058", "title": "Electric eye", "text": "Ijisho ry'amashanyarazi ni igikoresho cyo gutahura urumuri gikoreshwa mu kumenya igihe urumuri ruvanywe cyangwa ruciye mu kintu. Urugero ni sisitemu y'umutekano y'umuryango ikoreshwa k'umuryango wa garage ikoresha umucyo woherezwa n'uwakira uri ku mpera y'irembo kugira ngo rihagarike gufunga igihe hari ikintu gihari cyacika ku rucyuruzo rw'urumuri. Igikoresho ntabwo gitanga ishusho; gusa kuba hari urumuri biragaragara. Umucyo ugaragara urashobora gukoreshwa, ariko imirasire yimirasire ihisha imikorere yigikoresho kandi mubisanzwe ikoreshwa muri sisitemu zigezweho. Ubusanzwe, sisitemu yakoreshaga amatara akoreshwa numuyoboro utaziguye cyangwa umurongo w'amashanyarazi uhinduranya inshuro zigezweho, ariko sisitemu ya kijyambere ya fotodetector ikoresha diode ya infrarafarike itanga urumuri rwahinduwe kuri kilohertz nkeya, ituma disiketi yanga urumuri rwazimiye kandi igateza imbere urwego, ibyiyumvo, numutekano wibikoresho.\nIngero.\nImodoka yo mu muhanda\nIgice cya mbere cyubucuruzi\nImashini zipfunyika\nGufungura umuryango byikora\nSisitemu yo gutabaza\nKamera zikoresha"}
{"id": "21059", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21059", "title": "Intentional radiator", "text": "An Intentional radiator n'igikoresho icyo ari cyo cyose cyateguwe ku bushake kugira ngo gihabwe imibara ya radiyo (radio waves).\nImiyoboro ya radiyo y'ubwoko bwose, harimo gufungura urugi rwa garage, terefone idafite umugozi, terefone ngendanwa, wohereje amashusho adafite umugozi, mikoro idafite umugozi, n'abandi benshi bari muri iki cyiciro.\nMuri Amerika, imirasire yabigambiriye igengwa na 47 CFR Igice cya 15, Igice C. "}
{"id": "21060", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21060", "title": "OpenPicus", "text": "OpenPicus yari isosiyete ikora ibyuma ikomoka yatangijwe mumwaka wa 2011 yateguye kandi ikora sisitemu ya Internet yibintu kuri module yitwa Flyport. Flyport ni ibyuma bifunguye kandi urwego rwa OpenPicus na IDE ni software ifunguye. Flyport ni sisitemu ikomeye yonyine kuri module, kuko ntamuntu uturuka hanze ukenewe kugirango agokere porogaramu za IoT. Isosiyete yahagaritse imirimo muri 2018.\nAmateka.\nOpenPicus yashinzwe na Claudio Carnevali na Gabriele Allegria mu mwaka wa 2011.Igitekerezo cyari ugushiraho ibyuma na porogaramu bifungura sisitemu kugira ngo byihutishe iterambere ry\u2019ibikoresho na serivisi by\u2019umwuga IoT. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nUmwaka wa 2018 urangiye, OpenPicus Wiki hamwe namakuru yose afitanye isano na Hardware yamakuru yabuze kuri enterineti kuko abashinze OpenPicus ubu bamenyekanisha izina rya IOmote bahindura ubumenyi bwabo mubucuruzi nyabwo. Amwe mumakuru ashaje agaragazwa na (wiki, inyigisho, nibindi) kubibaho bya OpenPicus birashobora kugarurwa ukoresheje Internet Archive Wayback Machine. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nFlyport ni sisitemu yubwenge kandi ihujwe kuri module ya enterineti. Flyport ikoreshwa nimbaraga zikomeye kandi zoroheje zifungura isoko (ishingiye kuri FreeRTOS) icunga porogaramu ya TCP / IP, porogaramu y'abakoresha hamwe na \"seriveri\" ihuriweho. Flyport iboneka muri 3 pin ihuza: \nSisitemu ya Flyport kuri module ishingiye kuri Microchip Technology PIC24 itunganya ingufu nke. Ikoreshwa muguhuza no kugenzura sisitemu kurubuga rwa murandasi binyuze muri enterineti yashyizwemo cyangwa seriveri isanzwe ya TCP / IP. Microcontroller ihuriweho ikora abakiriya, ntabwo rero umukiriya yakenewe. Pinout iroroshye cyane kuva ishobora guhindurwa na software.\nFlyport ishobora guhuzwa na seriveri nyinshi yibintu nka Evrthng, Xively, ThingSpeak nibindi byinshi.\nUruhushya.\nIbyuma: Imibare irekurwa munsi ya CC BY 3.0 Porogaramu: Framework yasohotse munsi ya LGPL 3.0"}
{"id": "21061", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21061", "title": "GreenPeak Technologies", "text": "GreenPeak Technologies yari Utrecht, mu Buholandi ishingiye kuri fabless ikora ibicuruzwa na semiconductor hamwe na software ya IEEE 802.15.4 na Zigbee igice cyisoko ridafite umugozi. Ikoranabuhanga rya Zigbee rikoreshwa itumanaho ry'amakuru mu ngo zigezweho Smart Home no korohereza interineti yibintu (loT), ijambo rikaba risobanura ibikoresho byagenewe gukorerwa no gucungwa n'ibikoresho cyangwa sisitemu zigenzurwa n'itumanaho tya internet.\nIbipimo nganda.\nPorogaramu z'ibyuma by'amaradiyo bidakoresha insinga (wireless sensor applications) akenshi zishingiye ku bipimo ngenderwaho by'inganda, bishyiraho ibisabwa ku mikoranire y'ibikoresho (interoperability)kandi bigatuma ibice bitandukanye byavuye ku bacuruzi batandukanye bikora hamwe mu nzego nk'iyubakwa ry'amazu no mu bwikorezi bw'inganda (industrial automation).\nIterambere rya GreenPeak rishingiye ku nganda zifunguye hiyongereyeho IEEE 802.15.4. GreenPeak ni umunyamuryango wa Global Semiconductor Alliance kandi ishyigikira amahame afunguye yisi yose ya Zigbee. \nIbicuruzwa.\nGreenPeak ikubiyemo ibyuma bigenzura itumanaho rya Zigbee Smart Home hamwe na IoT ya IEEE 802.15.4. \nKugurwa na Qorvo.\nKu ya 17 Mata 2016, hatangajwe ko GreenPeak yemeye kugurwa na Qorvo. Nyuma yo kugura, GreenPeak yakomeza gukorera mu Buholandi, mu Bubiligi no muri Hong Kong nk'ishami ry\u2019ubucuruzi rya \"Low-power Wireless Systems\" mu bucuruzi bw\u2019ibikorwa Remezo n\u2019Ingabo (IDP) bya Qorvo. Cees Links, wahoze ari umuyobozi mukuru wa GreenPeak Technologies, yatangaje ko azatangira kuba umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019ishami ry\u2019ubucuruzi rya Wireless Connectivity."}
{"id": "21062", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21062", "title": "RoboBraille", "text": "RoboBraille ni serivise y'urubuga ndetsa na imeri ishoboye guhindura inyandiko muburyo butandukanye kandi bworoshye nka Braille, mp3, e-ibitabo na Daisy. Serivisi ishobora kandi gukoreshwa muguhindura ubundi buryo butagerwaho nkamashusho ya skaneri na dosiye ya pdf muburyo bworoshye. RoboBraille yatangiye gukora kuva mu mwaka wa 2004 kandi kuri ubu itanga ibyifuzo byabakoresha ibihumbi buri kwezi kubakoresha ku isi. Serivise iraboneka kubuntu kubantu kugiti cyabo, badakoresha ubucuruzi. Gukoresha ibigo byamasomo birahari binyuze muri SensusAccess.\nSerivisi ya RoboBraille yateguwe ku bufatanye n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019igihugu cya Danemark gishinzwe ubumuga bwo kutabona ku bana n\u2019urubyiruko hamwe n\u2019ibarura rya ApS. RoboBraille iboneka kubuntu kubantu kurubuga rwa murandasi, ndetse nabadakoresha ubucuruzi kandi ntibakeneye kwiyandikisha kugirango bakoreshe serivisi. Gukoresha ubucuruzi muburyo ubwo aribwo bwose birabujijwe. Iterambere n'imikorere bya RoboBraille byatewe inkunga na Guverinoma ya Danemark, Komisiyo y\u2019Uburayi ndetse n\u2019imiryango yigenga. Amashyirahamwe menshi yagize uruhare mu iterambere rya serivisi ya RoboBraille harimo na Royal National College for Blind ifite icyicaro i Hanoford, mu Bwongereza, Ishuri rya St Joseph ry\u2019abatabona, Irilande, Inama y\u2019igihugu y\u2019abatabona bo muri Irilande, Repubulika ya Irilande, Associazione Nazionale Subvedenti, Ubutaliyani, CIDEF, Porutugali, Hilfsgemeinschaft der Blinden und Sehschwachen \u00d6ster. w'impumyi n'abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona, Lituwaniya, Ishyirahamwe Valentin Ha\u00fcy, mu Bufaransa, n'Umuryango Pancyprian w'impumyi, Kupuro.\nMu Gushyingo 2012, serivisi ya RoboBraille yahawe igihembo cya WISE 2012 na Qatar Foundation mu rwego rwo gushimira uruhare rwayo mu burezi butarangwamo inzitizi. Muri Mutarama 2010, serivisi za RoboBraille zabonye igihembo cyiza cya BETT. Iyi serivisi yabanje kubona igihembo cya BETT kubera igisubizo cyiza gikenewe mu burezi bwihariye (2010), Igihembo cya IT cyo Kwiga ku gisubizo cyiza cya eL kwiga (2009), Igihembo cy\u2019igihugu cya eWell-Kuba \u201cKugera kuri Digitally Exclude\u201d (2009), Igihembo cya Komisiyo y\u2019Uburayi eInclusion Award for e-Accessibility Award (2008), Igihembo cya Well-Tech cyo gutanga udushya (Sosiyete Sosiyete Sosiyete Sosiyete Sosiyete Sosiyete Sosiyete Sosiyete Sosiyete Sosiyete Sosiyete Sosiyete Sosiyete Sosiyete Sosiyete Sosiyete Sosiyete Sosiyete Sosiyete Sosiyete Sosiyete Sosiyete Sosiyete).\nRoboBraille itanga ibyiciro bine byingenzi bya serivisi:\nUsibye imeri twakita nka gakondo, RoboBraille iboneka binyuze kumurongo wurubuga kuri http://www.robobraille.org/.\nAmateka.\nRoboBraille yahimbwe mu mwaka wa 2004 na Lars Ballieu Christensen, umuhanga mu bya mudasobwa na rwiyemezamirimo ndetse na Svend Thougaard, inzobere mu itangazamakuru. Sisitemu yakorewe mugihugu cya Danimarike ibifashijwemo na Royal National College for Blind ifite icyicaro i Hanoford, mu Bwongereza. Sisitemu yatangijwe muri Kamena 2006 kandi yegukanye igihembo cy\u2019umushinga w\u2019imishinga yo gutanga imisanzu mu Bwongereza mu Bwongereza mu "}
{"id": "21063", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21063", "title": "Optical braille recognition", "text": "Optical Braille Recognition ni tekinoroji yo gufata no gutunganya amashusho ndetse n'inyuguti ya brile karemano. Ikoreshwa muguhindura inyandiko za braille kubantu badashobora kuyisoma mumyandiko, no kubungabunga no kubyara inyandiko.\nAmateka.\nMu mwaka wa 1984, itsinda ry\u2019abashakashatsi bo muri kaminuza y\u2019ikoranabuhanga ya Delft ryateguye igisate cyo gusoma cyo mu bwoko bwa braille, aho umutwe wo gusoma ufite selile zifotora zimuriwe hamwe n\u2019abategetsi kugira ngo bafate inyandiko y\u2019inyandiko umurongo ku murongo ubu buryo kandi bufasha cyane abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona. Mu 1988, itsinda ry\u2019abashakashatsi b\u2019Abafaransa muri kaminuza y\u2019ubumenyi n\u2019ikoranabuhanga ya Lille bakoze algorithm, yitwa Lectobraille, yahinduye inyandiko za brile mu nyandiko isanzwe. Sisitemu yafotoye inyandiko ya braille hamwe na kamera ntoya ya CCD, kandi ikoresha tekinoroji yo kuyungurura umwanya, kuyungurura hagati, isuri, no kwaguka kugirango ikuremo braille. Inyuguti za braille zahinduwe mururimi karemano hakoreshejwe kumenyekanisha imiterere. Tekinike yari ifite ikosa rya 1%, kandi ifata igihe cyo gutunganya amasegonda arindwi kumurongo. Mu mwaka wa 1993, itsinda ryabashakashatsi bo muri Katholieke Universiteit Leuven ryashyizeho uburyo bwo kumenya braille yari yarabisikanye hamwe na scaneri iboneka mubucuruzi. ariko, ntabwo yashoboye gukemura ikibazo cyubumuga buri muri gride ya braille, kubwibyo byasabwaga ibyangombwa bya braille byakozwe neza. Mu 1999, itsinda ryo muri kaminuza ya Hong Kong Polytechnic ryashyize mu bikorwa tekinike yo kumenyekanisha ku bafite ibumuga bwo kutabona ikoresheje impande zombi kugira ngo ihindure braille mu nyandiko y'Icyongereza cyangwa Igishinwa. Mu 2001, Murray na Dais bakoze sisitemu yo kumenyekanisha intoki, isikana ibice bito byinyandiko icyarimwe. Kubera agace gato kasikiwe icyarimwe, guhindura gride ntabwo byari ikibazo, kandi hakoreshejwe algorithm yoroshye, ikora neza. Mu 2003, Morgavi na Morando bakoze sisitemu yo kumenya inyuguti za braille bakoresheje imiyoboro yubukorikori. Sisitemu yari izwiho ubushobozi bwo gukemura ibibazo bitesha agaciro kurusha ubundi buryo. \nInzitizi.\nByinshi mubibazo byo gutunganya neza inyandiko ya braille bituruka kumiterere yinyandiko za braille. Ubusanzwe Braille yacapishijwe kumpapuro zikomeye, ndetse na wino itanga itandukaniro hagati yinyuguti yazamuye nimpapuro zinyuma. Ariko, ubusembwa kurupapuro bushobora kugaragara muri scan cyangwa ishusho yurupapuro.\nInyandiko nyinshi zacapishijwe \"inter-point\", bivuze ko zifite impande ebyiri. Nkibyo, kwiheba kwa braille kuruhande rumwe bigaragara ko bifatanye hamwe na braille igaragara kurundi ruhande ibi bigafasha cyane abafite ubumuga bwo kutabona kuko biborohera cyane mugusoma izini nyandiko za Braille. \nUbuhanga.\nBumwe mu buryo bwa optique bwo kumenyekanisha braille bugerageza gukoresha amatara ya oblique na kamera kugirango igaragaze igicucu cya depression no gusohoka kwa braille. Abandi bakoresha ibikoresho biboneka mubucuruzi. "}
{"id": "21065", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21065", "title": "Invoxia", "text": "Invoxia ni isosiyete yo mu Bufaransa ikora ibikoresho by'ikoranabuhanga by'abakiriya (consumer electronics), izwi cyane mu gushushanya no guteza imbere ibikoresho by'ubwenge (smart devices) bikoresha ubwenge bw'ubukorikori (AI), nk\u2019umuntu wa mbere wa GPS ukurikirana ku isoko wakoresheje ikoranabuhanga rya LoRa (ryatangijwe mu 2017), umuvugizi wa mbere uhuza hanze y\u2019ibinyabuzima bya Amazone yakoresheje sisitemu y\u2019amajwi ya Alexa n'umurongo w'abakurikirana GPS mu gukumira ubujura bw'amagare no gukurikirana ibikorwa by'amatungo. Ku isoko rya B2B, itanga serivisi zo gukurikirana no gucunga umutungo. Itanga kandi serivisi za IoT inganda zirimo gushushanya ibyuma niterambere hamwe namahugurwa no guhuza imiyoboro yimitsi.\nInvoxia yashinzwe mu 2010 na rwiyemezamirimo udasanzwe w\u2019Abafaransa \u00c9ric Careel (na Withings, Sculpteo na Zoov) na Serge Renouard.\nInvoxia yashyigikiwe na Newfund kuva mu 2012. Mu mwaka 2013, Invoxia yafashe ubuyobozi bw'isosiyete ishinzwe gukora telefoni gakondo ya Swissvoice. \nMu Kwakira 2015, Amazon iratangaza Invoxia nku wahawe ikigega cya Alexa kugirango yinjize serivisi zijwi rya Alexa muri Triby."}
{"id": "21067", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21067", "title": "Marata Vision", "text": "Marata yari ikirango cyari cy'iyobowe na Polaron Controls, igice cya Cooper Controls. Akazi nyamukuru ka Marata kwari ugucuruza no gukwirakwiza ibikoresho byo kwerekana amashusho (video display), kubihuza no kubigenzura, bigenewe gukoresha mu ngo ndetse no mu bucuruzi. \nMarata Vision yari ifite icyicaro i Watford, Herts, mu Bwongereza, hafi y'icyicaro gikuru cya Polaron ndetse mbere y'uko igice cyagurishwa kuri Palaron, byari biherereyr mu Majyaruguru ya London.\nAmateka.\nMarata Vision yaguzwe burundu na Polaron Controls muri Nyakanga 2004, mu gihe isosiyete y'ababyeyi Polaron Plc yatangizwaga ku isoko ry'imigabane. Muri Werurwe 2007, Polaron Plc yaguzwe na Cooper Controls (UK) Ltd, ishami rya Cooper Industries Ltd,\nNyuma, itsinda ryaguzwe na Eaton Igenzura no Kumenyesha.\nNyuma y\u2019ifungwa rya Vutec muri Floride mu 2020, kubera ko Marata Vision yari umugabuzi w\u2019Ubwongereza kuva mu myaka ya za 90, ubucuruzi bwarangiye muri Mata 2021."}
{"id": "21068", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21068", "title": "Muzzley", "text": "Muzzley ni porogaramu ikoreshwa mu kugenzura ibikoresho bya interineti y'ibintu (loTdevices). Porogaramu iboneka kuri iOS, Android na Windows 10 yemerera kugenzura ibyo bikoresho. Baha ubushobozi bwo guhuza ibikoresho by'abandi bakoresheje API na SDK zabo, kugira ngo abakora ibikoresho babishyiremo mu buryo butaziguye muri microcontrollers zabo. \nAmateka.\nMuzzley yashinzwe muri Werurwe 2012 na Domingos Bruges na Eduardo Pinheiro. \nNyuma y'uwo mwaka, batangiye kwipimisha beta testing hanyuma bazamura icyiciro cya mbere cy'ishoramari ry'ingemwe [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nMuri 2013, ikipe ya Muzzley yimukiye muri Amerika. Bagura kandi itsinda ryabo kandi bafatanya na Intel. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nMuri Gashyantare 2014, Muzzley yakiriye miliyoni 2.5 z'amadolari y'Amerika mu gutera inkunga imishinga y'ishoramari, iyobowe na Portugal Ventures. inkunga na Esp\u00edrito Santo Ventures na Plug na Play Tech Centre. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nBatoye kandi Jon Castor nk'Umuyobozi w'Inama y'Ubutegetsi kandi basohora isohoka rya kabiri rikomeye rya porogaramu, Muzzley V2.0. [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nKu ya 1 Gicurasi 2018, Habit Analytics yaguze Muzzley kumafaranga ataramenyekana. [\"citation ikenewe\"]"}
{"id": "21069", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21069", "title": "Roborock", "text": "Beijing Roborock Technology Co. Ltd, yiswe Roborock, ni isosiyete yo mu Bushinwa ikora ibkoresho by'abakiriya (consumer goods), izwi cyane ku bikoresho byayo bya robo bisukura (sweeping and mopping robots) ndetse n'amasuka y'amashanyarazi adafite insinga (handheld cordless stick vacuums) Xiaomi yagize uruhare runini mu ishingwa ry\u2019isosiyete. \nAmateka.\nBeijing Roborock Technology Co. Ltd yashinzwe mu 2014 i Beijing mu Bushinwa. ryashyigikiwe ahanini na Xiaomi. yakusanyije miliyoni 640 z'amadolari muri IPO yayo yo muri Gashyantare 2020, kandi isosiyete yinjije buri mwaka hafi miliyari 4.5 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda guhera muri Kanama 2021.\nRoborock yagiye ahagaragara ku isoko rya STAR rya Beijing mu 2020. \nIbicuruzwa.\nVacuum cleaners.\nUmurongo wa \"S\" wa robot vacuum, watangijwe muri 2018, ufite gahunda ihuriweho yo kwirinda inzitizi kugira ngo tumenye ibintu kugeza kuri 5\u00a0cm ubugari kuri 3\u00a0cm z'uburebure. Mugihe abasukura bagenda hafi y'umwanya bakora ikarita ishushanya, bagaragaza ibintu bigomba kwirindwa nyuma.\nRoborock ivuga ko ibikoresho byabo byoza cyangwa bisukura hasi bitabika amashusho cyangwa ngo bayashyire muri cloud, ndetse ko amashusho yose afatwa ahita asibwa ako kanya nyuma yo kuyatunganya. \nReactiveAI 2.0 yatangijwe no gusohora Roborock S7 MaxV. Ifite kamera ya RGB hamwe na 3D yubatswe yumucyo \nUsibye kamera zabo zashyizwe imbere, ibikoresho bishya bikoresha LIDAR-hejuru hejuru yicyumba. Ukoresheje porogaramu, abayikoresha barashobora gushiraho imipaka kugirango barebe ko igikoresho kidasukuye aho. Abakoresha barashobora kandi gushiraho \"oya-mop\" aho igikoresho gishobora gukurura ariko ntigice. \nRoborock Q7 Max, yasohotse mu 2022, irashobora kugenzurwa na Alexa, Siri, cyangwa Assistant Google. \nMu 2023, Roborock yasohoye S8, S8 Plus, na S8 Pro Ultra. Itandukaniro nyamukuru hagati yicyitegererezo ni docking station buri wese arimo. S8 ifite ibiciro bisanzwe byo kwishyuza mugihe S8 Plus ikubiyemo icyuma gisiba cyikora. S8 na S8 Plus zifite brushrol ebyiri ariko ntizamura. Moderi zose zibanziriza S8 zifite brushroll imwe.\nRoborock S7 MaxV Ultra ikubiyemo kamera yerekana neza. Roborock S7, yatangiriye kuri CES Umukungugu wacyo upima 460 mL mubushobozi bwuzuye. Irashobora guhumeka metero hagati yishyurwa. Moderi ya S4 ntabwo ihindagurika.\nMuri 2022, Roborock yasohoye Q5 isimbuza moderi S, kandi isa na S4 Max na S5. Q5 ifite imbaraga zo gukurura cyane, ariko ikabura imiterere ya mop. 2025, Roborock yerekanye moderi yayo ya Saros 10. \nImashini imesa.\nMu 2023, isosiyete yazanye imashini yambere yo kumesa, Roborock Zeo One hamwe na firime yumye. Kimwe na Zeo One, moderi ikurikira irashobora kugenzurwa na porogaramu ya terefone ya Roborock. "}
{"id": "21070", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21070", "title": "Somfy", "text": "Somfy ni itsinda ry\u2019ibigo byo mu Bufaransa ryashinzwe mu 1969, rikaba rimwe mu bikomeye mu gukora no gutanga ibyuma bigenzura n'imashini zifungura no gufunga imiryango y'inyubako, amadirishya y'impumyi (window blinds) n'ibyuma by'izuba (awnings). Bakora kandi n'ibindi bicuruzwa byikora murugo nk'ibikoresho by'umutekano. \nSomfy ni umunyamuryango w'akanama k'ubwenge bw'ingo (home automation) committees for Matter,thread ndetse n'ishyirahamwe ry'ibipimo by'itumanaho (Connectivity Standards Alliance). Somfy yatangaje ko afite intego yo gushyira mu bikorwa icyiciro cya mbere akoresheje Materi hejuru ya Zigbee binyuze mu kiraro, kandi ko \"moteri ya Zigbee itazahinduka Matteri binyuze mu kuzamura porogaramu\". Kuva mu nta bicuruzwa byemewe bya Somfy byatangajwe."}
{"id": "21071", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21071", "title": "Unity Systems", "text": "Unity Systems yari isosiyete ikora ibikoresho by'ubwenge bw'ingo (home automation) ikorera i Redwood City, muri California, muri Amerika, yashinzwe mu 1983 Muri 1985 Unity Systems yashyize kw'isoko Unity Home Manager,imwe muri sisitemu za mbere z'ubwenge bw'ingo (home automation) ndetse ikaba yari imwe mu zisanzwe zikora neza cyane.Yagaragaje icyatsi kibisi cya monochrome yerekana ibyerekanwe hamwe n'ubushyuhe, igorofa yo hasi, kugenzura amatara, sisitemu ya spinkler, kugenzura HVAC, umutekano hamwe nuburyo rusange bwo kubungabunga. The Unity Home Manager yagurishijwe n'umuyoboro w'abacuruzi wari ugizwe na masosiyete mato, kandi yitanze, hamwe n'abacuruzi bagera kuri 90 muri Amerika mugihe kimwe. Sisitemu yubumwe yafunzwe mu1999 "}
{"id": "21072", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21072", "title": "Wyze Labs", "text": "Wyze Labs, Inc.\u200b(uwahoze ari Wyzecam) azwi nka Wyze,Ni kompanyi y'ikoranbuhanga yo muri America ikorera i Washington, yihariye mu gukora ibikoresho by'ubwenge mu ngo (smart home) n'ama kamera adakoresha insinga (wireless cameras). Ni start-up yashinzwe n'abakozi ba kera ba Amazon \nAmateka.\nWyze yashinzwe ku ya 19 Nyakanga 2017, n\u2019abashinze bane: Umuyobozi mukuru Yun Zhang, CPO Dongsheng Song, CMO Dave Crosby, na Elana Fishman. Ku ya 24 Ukwakira 2018, Wyze yagurishije miliyoni imwe ya Wyze Cam. Ku ya 31 Mutarama 2019, Wyze yatangaje ishoramari rya miliyoni 20 z'amadorali yatanzwe na Norwest Venture Partners. Muri Werurwe 2020, igihe icyorezo cya COVID-19 cyibasiye isi, Wyze yari hafi guhagarika, ariko isosiyete yashoboye kurokoka icyo cyorezo igabanya umubare w'amafaranga yashakaga gukusanya kuva kuri miliyoni 50 ikagera kuri miliyoni 10, ndetse no kongeraho gahunda yo kwiyandikisha ya Cam Plus, n'ibindi. Mu mpera za 2022, Wyze yatangaje ko 2023 ari \u201cumwaka wa kamera\u201d, maze asohora kamera nshya eshatu guhera ku ya 2 Werurwe 2023 \nAmakimbirane n'umutekano.\nMuri 2019, Sensormatic, ishami rya Johnson Controls ryuzuye, yareze Wyze, avuga ko yarenze ku ipatanti. Wyze yatsinze mu rubanza, guhera muri Nzeri 2020. \nMu Ukuboza 2019, Kompanyi yemeye ko kwibwira ku murongo wa server byatumye amakuru y'abakiriya bagera kuri miliyoni 2.4 agaragara. Igisubizo cy'ikigo cyarimo gukuramo abakoresha bose kuri konti zabo, bisaba ko abakoresha bose babyemeza. \nMu 2021, Xiaomi yashyikirije Amazone raporo ivuga ko Wyze yarenze ku cyuma cyayo cya 2019 \"Igikoresho cyogusukura cyigenga ndetse n\u2019umuyaga w\u2019umuyaga kimwe\" ipatanti ya robot vacuum. Ku ya 15 Nyakanga 2021, Wyze yatanze ikirego arega Xiaomi mu rukiko rw\u2019intara rwo muri Amerika mu karere k\u2019iburengerazuba bwa Washington, avuga ko ibihangano byabanjirije kubaho ndetse anasaba urukiko ko rwatangaza ko ipatanti ya robot ya Xiaomi yo muri 2019 itemewe. \nMu 2022, ikigo cy\u2019umutekano Bitdefender cyatangaje ko Wyze yahagaritse WyzeCam v1 kubera ikibazo cy\u2019umutekano Bitdefender yari yamenyesheje Wyze imyaka itatu mbere, kikaba ari igihe kirekire kidasanzwe ku buryo intege nke zitamenyekana ku baturage. Wyze ntacyo yatangaje ku mugaragaro kubyerekeye intege nke. \nKu ya 8 Nzeri 2023, bamwe mu bakoresha bavuze kuri Reddit ko abareba urubuga berekana ibiryo bya kamera bitari ibyabo. Umuvugizi wa Wyze yavuze ko ibi byatewe n'ikibazo cyo gufunga urubuga. \nMuri Gashyantare 2024, abakiriya bashinzwe umutekano wo mu rugo Wyze bagera ku 13.000 beretswe urugo rw\u2019undi. "}
{"id": "21073", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21073", "title": "Death of Patel family", "text": "Muri Mutarama 2022, Jagdish Patel, Vaishaliben Patel, hamwe n'abana babo Vihangi na Dharmik bapfiriye i Emerson, Manitoba, muri metero cumi n'ebyiri uvuye ku mupaka wa Leta zunze ubumwe za Amerika. Uyu muryango wishwe n'ubukonje, bwageze kuri -35 \u00b0 C mugihe cyo gupfa kwabo, mugihe bagerageje kwimuka bava mubuhinde bajya muri Amerika, banyuze muri Kanada.\nUmuryango wa Patel.\nIgihe yapfaga, Jagdish Patel yari afite imyaka 39. Yashakanye na Vaishaliben wari ufite imyaka 37 yagendanaga n'umukobwa wabo Vihangi, wari ufite imyaka 11 n'umuhungu wabo Dharmik, wari ufite imyaka 3. abaturage benshi muri Dingucha bifuza kwimukira muri Amerika. \nUyu muryango wavuye werekeza i Toronto ku ya 12 Mutarama 2022. Polisi yo muri Canada yasanze nyuma yaho bagiye berekeza ku mupaka wa Leta Zunze ubumwe za Amerika banyuze mu muhanda, kubera ko nta makuru y'ingendo z'indege yari agaragara ku mazina y'umuryango, bageze i Emerson, Manitoba ku wa 18 Mutarama 2022.\nKugerageza kwambuka imipaka no gupfa.\nUmuryango wa Patel hamwe n\u2019abandi barindwi bagerageje kwambuka umupaka, muri gahunda y\u2019abinjira. Umuryango birashoboka ko utari witeguye ubushyuhe buke, bwageze kuri -35 \u00b0 C icyo gihe. n'abapolisi mu murima wa Emerson, muri Manitoba. Uwo muryango washyizwe mu cyiciro cy'abahohotewe n'ubucuruzi bw'abantu, nk'uko byatangajwe n'inzego z'ubuyobozi za Canada. \nIngaruka.\nUrupfu rw'umuryango wa Patel rwongereye abantu mu bitangazamakuru no mu bitangazamakuru kumenya abahinde ba magendu bakoresha Kanada nk'inzira yo kugera muri Amerika. Mugihe umupaka wa Mexico na Amerika urinzwe cyane, umupaka wa Kanada uroroshye ugereranije. \nPolisi yo mu Buhinde yataye muri yombi abagabo babiri ku ya 16 Mutarama 2022 ikurikiranyweho ibyaha birimo gucuruza abantu no guteza urupfu. Nyuma y'iminsi itari mike, abapolisi b'Abahinde bata muri yombi undi ukekwaho icyaha. "}
{"id": "21074", "revid": "10599", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21074", "title": "Ibikorwa Remezo Byorohereza abafite ubumuga", "text": "Ibikorwa remezo mukorohereza abafite ubumuga bwingingo.\nAbafite ubumuga nabo bafite uburenganzira kuri serivisi zihabwa Abantu bose.\nIbikorwa remezo.\nLeta y'urwanda ifite pilitiki yo gishyigikira itangwa rya serivisi idaheza.\nHibandwa gushyira ibikorwa remezo byorohereza ibyiciro byose by'abantu.\nAhashyirwa ibikorwa remezo.\nAhashyirwa ibikorwa remezo byorohereza Abafite ubumuga ni Munyubako zitangirwamo serivisi zitanduka Biri munyarwanda wese acyenera harimo Inyubako ndende zubakwa ubu zikorerwamo: Amasoko,amavuriro,Amashuri,ibigo byubwishingizi,\nIbikorwa remezo mu mashuri.\nMu mashuri yubakwa ubu ashyirwamo ibikorwa remezo byorohereza Abafite ubumuga hagendewe kuri gahunda ya Leta y'urwanda yo gutanga serivisi idaheza buri munyarwanda mu mashuri hashyirwamo inzira zoroherereza abafite ubumuga bwingingo n'ibindi bitandukanye.\nIbikorwa remezo mu mavuriro.\nPolitike ya Leta y'urwanda yashyizeho gahunda yo kubaka ibikorwa remezo bitangirwamo serivisi cyane cyane ubuvuzi kugirango buri munyarwanda wese ahabwe serivisi Kandi muburyo budaheza.\nImbogamizi kubafite ubumuga.\nAbafite ubumuga byo kutabona bagaragaza imbogamizi bahuranazo zibadindiza mumwigire bituma badatsinda izombogamizi bagaragaza harimo: kutabona infashanyigisho,integanyanyigisho n'ibindi.\nIbirushijeho.\nhttps://mobile.igihe.com/serivisi/kwamamaza/article/bugesera-hubatswe-urugo-rurererwamo-abana-barenga-100-barimo-n-abafite-ubumuga\nhttps://www.kigalitoday.com/amakuru/mu-rwanda/Abafite-ubumuga-barasaba-kongererwa-ibikorwaremezo-bibafasha-mu-myigire\nhttps://mobile.igihe.com/ubuzima/article/u-rwanda-rumaze-kubaka-ibikorwaremezo-bifasha-abafite-ubumuga-mu-mavuriro-22\nhttps://www.kigalitoday.com/uburezi/ibikorwa-by-uburezi/article/kutagira-ibikoresho-bihagije-bigira-ingaruka-ku-myigire-y-abanyeshuri-bafite-ubumuga"}
{"id": "21075", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21075", "title": "Inzira ya Braille", "text": "Inzira ya Braille ni inzira yagenwe cyangwa iy\u2019imisozi igenewe kugendwamo n\u2019abantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona kugira ngo nabo babashe kuyikoresha mu buryo bworoshye kandi bw\u2019umutekano. By\u2019umwihariko, izo nzira zigaragazwa n\u2019imigozi cyangwa ibindi bigabanya inzira, kandi ibimenyetso n\u2019ibyapa bikoreshwa bigira amajwi cyangwa byanditswe mu nyuguti za Braille. \nUrugero rumwe ni Watertown Riverfront Park and Braille Trail, ruherereye mu gice cya Charles River i Watertown, muri Massachusetts, muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, rwafunguwe mu mwezi wa Nyakanga 2016. Umugozi w\u2019ubuyobozi ugenda ukurikiye urubibi rw\u2019inzira ifite intera ya 1/4 mile (metero 400), ikikije pariki y\u2019amasensori ifite ibintu bitandukanye birimo ubwato bw\u2019inkwi bwo kuririmbaho ndetse n\u2019intebe isohora amajwi (musical bench). "}
{"id": "21076", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21076", "title": "Isaha ya Braille", "text": "Isaha ya Braille ni isaha itangarizwa igihe ijyanye n\u2019abatabona cyangwa abafite bumuga bwo kutabona neza \nIbisobanuro.\nIsaha ya Braille ikoreshwa no gukorakora uruziga (dial) kugira ngo umuntu amenye ibimenyetso byanditse hejuru. Hariho verisiyo zayo zombi isanzwe n'iya mudasobwa. Verisiyo za analog zigira ikirahure cyangwa igikonoshwa gikingira isaha, gishobora gufungurwa igihe umuntu ashaka gusoma isaha. Iminwe y\u2019isaha (clock-hands) ikozwe ku buryo itanyeganyezwa n\u2019ukuyikoraho igihe umuntu utabona akoresha urutoki rwe kugira ngo amenye uko ihagaze. Mu buryo bwa digital, utudomo (nk\u2019utwandiko twabraille) duhora duhindura imyanya uko igihe gihinduka. Muri iki gihe, ugomba kumenya inyuguti za Braille kugira ngo usome isaha.\nIsaha z\u2019amashanyarazi zivuga, zivuga igihe hakoreshejwe akabuto gato, nazo zikundwa cyane n\u2019abantu batabona."}
{"id": "21077", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21077", "title": "Mae Brown", "text": "Mae Brown (1935\u20131973) yari umugore wa kabiri w'utabona kandi utumva ndetse akaba umuntu wa mbere w\u2019Umunyakanada utabona kandi utumva wabashije kubona impamyabumenyi ya kaminuza. Yarangije muri kaminuza ya Toronto Scarborough mu 1972.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nBrown yavukiye ahitwa Thunder Bay mu 1935. Ubumuga bwe bwo kubona no kumva bwakomeje gukomera mu buto bwe; mu mashuri yisumbuye, uburebure bwe bwari bwagabanutse ku buryo atashoboraga gusoma ku kibaho cy\u2019umwarimu, maze ahagarika amashuri. Operasiyo yakorewe Brown akiri mu kigero cy\u2019ubwana bwo hejuru yo gukuramo udusabo two mu bwonko yatumye atsindwa burundu no kumva.\nBrown yiyandikishije mu kigo cy\u2019igihugu cy\u2019abatabona cya Kanada, aho yahawe amahugurwa ku buryo bwo gutumanaho nka Braille, ndetse n\u2019uburyo bwo kubona akazi. CNIB kandi yatanze umwarimu wa Brown kugira ngo amufashe kurangiza amashuri yisumbuye. Iyo Brown yiyandikishije muri University of Toronto, CNIB yashakishije umusemuzi wamufashaga, Joan Mactavish, hamwe n\u2019itsinda ry\u2019abagiraneza 35 ryahinduraga ibitabo bya Brown mu nyuguti za Braille. Mactavish yahinduraga amasomo n\u2019ibizamini bya Brown akoresheje uburyo bwo gukoresha intoki mu kwandika inyuguti (finger-spelling) mu ntoki za Brown. Brown yashoboraga gutanga ibisubizo bye mu magambo. Bimwe mu bizamini byafataga iminsi myinshi kurangiza ukoresheje ubu buryo, kandi impamyabumenyi ya Brown mu mateka na psychology yaje kuyibona nyuma y\u2019imyaka 5.\nUmwuga.\nNyuma yo kurangiza amashuri, Brown yagarutse mu kazi muri CNIB, ahinduka umuyobozi w\u2019ibyerekeye abantu batabona kandi batumva, kandi ashyiraho imiyoboro n\u2019imirimo y\u2019ubufasha ku bantu batabona kandi batumva muri Canada. Ibi byari birimo amatsinda y\u2019imibereho, ibitabo n\u2019ibinyamakuru, ndetse no kugerageza ibikoresho by\u2019ikoranabuhanga. \nUrupfu.\nBrown yitabye Imana byihutirwa mu 1973 bitewe na undi tusabo two mu bwonko. Isuzuma ry\u2019ubugenzuzi bw\u2019umubiri (autopsy) ryagaragaje ko twasabo twose two mu mubiri we twatewe na neurofibromatose. Umwarimu we w\u2019ishuri rya kaminuza, Joan Mactavish, yakomeje gushyira mu bikorwa ibitekerezo bya Brown byo gufasha abantu batabona kandi batumva nyuma y\u2019urupfu rwa Brown. \nIbihembo no kumenyekana.\nMu mwaka wa 2002, akazi k\u2019ubufatanye ka Brown na Mactavish kaheshejwe icyubahiro binyuze mu gushyirwa muri Terry Fox Hall of Fame."}
{"id": "21078", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21078", "title": "Ikigo cy\u2019Iterambere ry\u2019Abantu bafite Ubumuga", "text": "Ikigo gishinzwe Iterambere ry\u2019abafite ubumuga (Mongolian \u0411\u044d\u0440\u0445\u044d\u044d\u043b\u0442 \u043a\u0438 \u0425\u04af\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u0425\u04e9\u0433\u0436\u043b\u0438\u0439\u043d \u0431\u0430\u0440\u0432) ni ikigo cy\u2019abafite ubumuga i Darkhan, Intara ya Darkhan-Uul, Mongoliya.\nAmateka.\nIki kigo cyafunguwe ku mugaragaro mu muhango wabaye ku wa 14 Nzeri 2023, witabiriwe na Minisitiri w\u2019intebe Luvsannamsrain Oyun-Erdene. Cyafunguwe byuzuye mu kwezi kwa Mutarama 2024.\nIbikorwa.\nIki kigo gitanga serivisi zitandukanye ku bantu bafite ubumuga, zirimo gukorera imyitozo ngororamubiri, gukorera imyitozo y\u2019ijwi n\u2019ubuvugizi imyitozo y\u2019umwuga (occupational therapy), n\u2019ubundi bufasha butandukanye mu by\u2019imitekerereze.\nImari.\nIki kigo cyatewe inkunga n\u2019inguzanyo ya miliyoni 25 z\u2019amadolari ya Amerika yatanzwe na Banki ishinzwe iterambere muri Aziya ndetse na impano ya miliyoni 2 z\u2019amadolari ya Amerika (US$2 million) yatanzwe na Japan Fund for Prosperous and Resilient Asia and the Pacific."}
{"id": "21079", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21079", "title": "James Charlton (umunyagitugu w\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abantu bafite ubumuga)", "text": "James I. Charlton ni umwanditsi w\u2019Umunyamerika, umunyagitugu mu uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga, ndetse akaba Visi Perezida Mukuru wa Access Living i Chicago.\nYemera ko ubumuga bushyirwaho n\u2019imibereho y\u2019abantu mu muryango. Yakoze icyitegererezo cy\u2019imikorere y\u2019umuryango w\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abantu bafite ubumuga, gishobora gutandukanya amoko atandukanye y\u2019imiryango.\nUmwuga.\nAfite impamyabumenyi ihanitse muri kaminuza ya Chicago. Charlton yamaze kuba Umuyobozi w\u2019Ibikorwa, Visi Perezida Mukuru ndetse na Perezida w\u2019Agateganyo wa Access Living guhera mu 1985. Charlton kandi ni umufasha w\u2019umwarimu muri Departema y\u2019Uburemere bw\u2019Ubumuga n\u2019Iterambere ry\u2019Umuntu muri kaminuza ya Illinois i Chicago. Ni umwe mu bagize akanama k\u2019ubuyobozi ka Chicago Transit Authority.\nMu mwaka wa 2000, yasohoye igitabo cyitwa \u201cNothing About Us Without Us: Disability Oppression and Empowerment\u201d.\nCharlton yanditse inyandiko mu kinyamakuru cy\u2019ubushakashatsi yitwa \u201cPeripheral Everywhere\u201d, ivuga ku bantu bafite ubumuga nk\u2019\u201cabantu babarirwa kabiri hanze y\u2019imibereho\u201d."}
{"id": "21080", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21080", "title": "Ishuri rya Urwibutso rwa David Hill", "text": "Ishuri ry'urwibutso rwa David Hill yari ishuri ry\u2019abakobwa batabona i Hankou, mu Bushinwa. Ryari rifitanye isano na Kiliziya ya Wesleyan. \nIri shuri ryashinzwe mu 1883. Ryibwe mu 1911 ubwo Hankou yafatwaga n\u2019ingabo z\u2019ubwami."}
{"id": "21081", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21081", "title": "Ikigo cy\u2019Iterambere ry\u2019Abana bafite Ubumuga", "text": "(Mongolian \u0425\u04e9\u0433\u0436\u043b\u0438\u0439\u043d \u0411\u044d\u0440\u0445\u044d\u044d\u043b\u0442 \u043a\u0438 \u0425\u04af\u04af\u0445\u0434\u0438\u0439\u043d \u0421\u044d\u0440\u0433\u044d\u044d\u043d \u0417\u0430\u0441\u0430\u0445 \u0425\u04e9\u0433\u0436\u043b\u0438\u0439\u043d \u043c\u0430\u0432) ni ikigo cy\u2019abana bafite ubumuga mu Karere ka Bayangol, Ulaanbaatar, Mongoliya.\nAmateka.\nUkwubakwa kw\u2019iki kigo kwatangiye ku wa 8 Nzeri 2016. Iki kigo cyashyikirijwe ku wa 24 Mutarama 2019 mu muhango witabiriwe na Ambasaderi w\u2019u Bushinwa Xing Haiming, Umuyobozi Mukuru w\u2019Abakozi ba Leta ya Mongolia Zandaakh\u00fc\u00fcgiin Enkhbold, ndetse na Minisitiri w\u2019Abakozi n\u2019Uburinganire bwa Sosiyete ya Mongolia Sodnom Chinzorig. Iki kigo cyahize ibindi mu gushimwa ku bw\u2019ubwubatsi bwiza mu 2019.\nUbwubatsi.\nIki kigo gifite ubuso bwa hegitari 1.5, gifite igorofa eshatu hejuru y\u2019ubutaka n\u2019igorofa imwe munsi y\u2019ubutaka. Kirimo uburiri 250 kandi gishobora kwakira abarwayi bahasura buri munsi bangana na 250."}
{"id": "21082", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21082", "title": "Ubumuga muri Afuganisitani", "text": "Ubushakashatsi bwakozwe n\u2019ubumuga bw\u2019icyitegererezo muri Afuganisitani bwakozwe na Asia Foundation mu 2019, hafi 80% by'abantu bakuru muri Afuganisitani bafite bumwe mu bwoko bw\u2019ubumuga.\nIkwirakwizwa.\nMuri bo bafite ubumuga, 24.6% bahuye n\u2019ubumuga buto (mild disability), 40.4% bahuye n\u2019ubumuga buri hagati (moderate disability), naho 13.9% bahuye n\u2019ubumuga bukomeye (severe disability). Ku bantu bafite ubumuga bukomeye, ahantu henshi bibarizwa ni mu Burengerazuba (25.4%), mu misozi ya Central Highlands (25.4%) ndetse no mu Majyepfo-Maso y\u2019Uburasirazuba (20.5%). Ikibazo kinini bahura nacyo mu bafite ubumuga buri hagati n\u2019ubukomeye ni imbogamizi mu kugenda, mu mibanire, mu kubona akazi no mu mashuri."}
{"id": "21083", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21083", "title": "Ubumuga mu gihugu cya Antigua na Barbuda", "text": "Ubumuga mu gihugu cya Antigua na Barbuda bivuga abantu bafite ubumuga batuye muri Antigua na Barbuda.\nAmateka.\nGuverinoma ya Antigua na Barbuda yashyize umukono ku Masezerano yerekeye uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga ku wa 30 Werurwe 2007, ayemeza ku wa 7 Mutarama 2016. \nImibare.\nMuri 2019, indwara z'umutima-damura, diyabete na kanseri nizo zabaye intandaro y'urupfu n'ubumuga mu gihugu. "}
{"id": "21084", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21084", "title": "Ubumuga muri Aruba", "text": "Ubumuga muri Aruba bivuga ababana n'ubumuga muri Aruba.\nAmateka.\nAruba yatangiye gukora urutonde rw\u2019abaturage bafite ubumuga guhera mu 1981.\nImibare.\nMu mwaka wa 2010, hari abantu 6,955 batuye muri Aruba bafite ubumuga butandukanye, bikaba byari 6.9% by\u2019abaturage bose."}
{"id": "21085", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21085", "title": "Ubumuga muri Azaribayijan", "text": "Abantu bagera kuri 624.000 bo muri Azaribayijan bafite ubumuga butandukanye, bikaba byagize hafi 6.4% by\u2019abaturage bose.\nAmateka.\nMuri Mutarama 2009, igihugu cyemeje Amasezerano yerekeye uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga (CRPD). Mu kwezi kwa Mutarama 2011, cyatanze raporo y\u2019igihugu ku ngamba zafashwe mu gushyira mu bikorwa inshingano zacyo ziri muri CRPD, ndetse n\u2019iterambere ryagezweho muri icyo rwego, ku Ishami ry\u2019Aburenganzira bw\u2019Abantu bafite Ubumuga.\nIbyiciro.\nAbenshi mu bantu bafite ubumuga muri icyo gihugu ** bafite ubumuga bw\u2019umubiri, ubumuga bwo kumva cyangwa kubona, cyangwa ubumuga bwo mu mutwe [\"ibisobanuro bikenewe\"]\nAmategeko.\nItegeko rya Disability Prevention and Disabled Persons (Rehabilitation and Social Protection) Act rya 1992 rirabujije ivangura iryo ari ryo ryose ku mwana ufite ubumuga. Itegeko ku Burenganzira bw\u2019Abana (Law on Children's Rights) ririnda abana bafite ubumuga mu nzego zitandukanye.\nInzego.\nHari ibigo 14 by\u2019ivuriro n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019abantu bafite ubumuga muri icyo gihugu, byita ku bantu bagera ku 10,000 bafite ubumuga buri mwaka.\nIbikoresho rusange.\nMuri mwaka wa 2019, Baku Metro yatangije gahunda yo gutanga abakozi babiri bagomba gufasha abantu bafite ubumuga kugera aho bagiye.\nSiporo.\nAzaribayijan yatangiye imikino Paralempike mu mikino Paralempike yo mu mwaka wa 1996 yabereye i Atlanta, hamwe n\u2019intumwa z\u2019abantu babiri bahatanira gusiganwa ku maguru no gusiganwa ku maguru. Yagiye muri buri cyiciro cyakurikiyeho cy\u2019imikino Paralympike, ariko ntabwo yigeze yitabira imikino Paralympike. "}
{"id": "21086", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21086", "title": "Ubumuga no gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe", "text": "Ubumuga no gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe ni ikinyamakuru cy\u2019ubuvuzi gisesengurwa n\u2019abahanga kigaruka ku mpande zose z\u2019ubumuga n\u2019ubuvuzi bw\u2019iterambere ry\u2019ubumuga, harimo n\u2019imyitozo ndetse n\u2019amategeko n\u2019amabwiriza agenga uburyo bwo gusubiza abantu mu buzima busanzwe. Iki kinyamakuru cyasohorwa na Taylor na Francis Group kandi umwanditsi mukuru ni Dave M\u00fcller (Suffolk New College). Cyashinzwe mu 1978, kandi cyagize igipimo cy\u2019ingaruka cya 2.054 mu 2018. Iki kinyamakuru gisohoka inshuro 26 mu mwaka."}
{"id": "21087", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21087", "title": "Ubumuga muri Bangladesh", "text": "Hagati y\u2019abantu miliyoni 16 bafite ubumuga muri Bangladesh, cyangwa 10% by\u2019abaturage b\u2019igihugu. Mu mwaka wa 2004, ubwinshi bw\u2019abantu bafite ubumuga bwari hafi 6% mu bafite munsi y\u2019imyaka 18, naho mu bafite hejuru y\u2019iyo myaka bwari hafi 14%. Abantu bafite ubumuga muri Bangaladeshi bafite uburenganzira bwo gufashwa na leta, ariko porogaramu zari zifite ubushobozi buke kandi zigakorerwa mu mijyi gusa, kandi ibijyanye n\u2019ubumuga ntibyashyizwe mu bikorwa mu porogaramu z\u2019iterambere rusange. Mu gusubiza iki kibazo, imiryango itari iya leta (NGOs) nka Centre for Disability in Development yagiye itanga ubufasha ku bantu bafite ubumuga.\nUburyo abantu benshi muri Bangladesh babona ubumuga bukomeje kuba bubi cyane. By\u2019umwihariko mu bice by\u2019icyaro, ubumuga akenshi bubonwa nk\u2019umuvumo uvuye ku makosa y\u2019ababyeyi, kandi akenshi bikemerwa ko bushobora kwandura. Abana bafite ubumuga n\u2019abatagifite akenshi ntibagira ubucuti, bigatuma habaho gutandukana gukomeza no mu buzima bw\u2019abakuze.\nBangladesh ni igihugu cyemeye Masezerano ya Loni ku Burenganzira bw\u2019Abantu bafite Ubumuga (CRPD),cyayasinye ku wa 9 Gicurasi 2007 kandi kikayemeza vuba bidatinze ku wa 30 Ugushyingo 2007. Ku wa 9 Ukwakira 2013, Bangladesh yemeje umushinga w\u2019itegeko witwa Persons with Disabilities' Rights and Protection Act 2013, washyize mu bikorwa inshingano zacyo ziri muri CRPD. Iri tegeko ryasimbuye Disabled Welfare Act rya 2001."}
{"id": "21088", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21088", "title": "Playmation", "text": "Playmation ni sisitemu y'ibikinisho,ibikoresho byambarwa, n'uburyo bwo mu mikino ya telefoni (apps) byakozwe na Disney na Hasbro. Sisitemu yashizweho kugirango ifashe abana kuguma bakora ibikorwa bibafasha gukina no kwimenyereza, isimbura gukinira kuri za ecrans n'imikino yo kwiyumvisha. Abakinnyi barashobora kwakira ubutumwa binyuze muri porogaramu ya mugenzi, kandi bagakurikirana amanota nibikorwa.\nSisitemu yo gukinisha yatangijwe mu Kwakira 2015 hamwe nicyegeranyo cya Marvel Avengers. \"Inyenyeri Yintambara\" na \"Frozen\" byari biteganijwe muri 2016 na 2017. \nBiravugwa ko benshi mu bagize itsinda ry\u2019iterambere bahagaritswe ku kazi kandi ko mu gihe umurongo w\u2019ibicuruzwa bihora Avengers uzakomeza kugurishwa kugeza kuri Noheri 2016 irindi terambere ryari rihagaze. Porogaramu n'umurongo w'igikinisho cya Marvel byahagaritswe ku ya 28 Werurwe 2019 "}
{"id": "21089", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21089", "title": "Baidu Raven", "text": "Raven ni izina ry'ikirango cy'amatangazo y'amajwi y'ubwenge (smart speakers),yatejwe imbere n'ikigo cy'abashinwa gitanga serivisi za interineti kitwa Baidu. Ibikoresho bihuza amajwi agenzurwa n'ubwenge bw'umuntu wungirije serivise DuerOS. ibisubizo bivuye ku kuba Baidu yaguze Raven Tech muri Gashyantare 2017. Raven H yatangiye kugurishwa mu Kuboza 2017, icya mbere mu bicuruzwa bitatu byateganijwe munsi y\u2019ikirango.\nIbicuruzwa.\nRaven H..\nThe Raven H n'umuvugizi w'ubwenge ugizwe ni byuma umunani. Icyuma cy'umutuku gishobora gukurwaho kiri hejuru gishobora kuzamuka no kumanuka,kandi gifite kandi igikoresho kigenga cy'ihuzanziga rya LED gifata ku kiganza (touch controller). DuerOS ishoboye guhuza amajwi, gucuranga imiziki, gutanga ikirere, no gusuhuza imodoka kuva Didi Chuxing kubikoresho. Yatangijwe bwa mbere mu Gushyingo 2017 mu nama ngarukamwaka World yabereye i Beijing. Mu ndege, igikoresho gifite disikuru ya Tymphany. Mu Bushinwa, igikoresho cyabonetse mu Kuboza 2017 ku mafaranga 1.699. \nRaven R..\nThe Raven R n'igishushanyo mbonera cy'ubwenge gifite ingingo esheshatu zigenda, zikoreshwa mu gukora imirimo yoroshye no kwerekana amarangamutima ku murongo wa LED. \nRaven Q..\nThe Raven Q ni robot yo murugo iteganijwe izashobora kuzenguruka inzu, usibye gukora nk'umufasha w'ukuri. "}
{"id": "21090", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21090", "title": "Colmena", "text": "Umushinga wa Colmena n'ubushakashatsi bwa siyanse n'ubuhanga rigamije gushushanya no kohereza robot ntoya yigenga kugirango igenzure ku buso bw'ukwezi. Yashinzwe muri kaminuza nkuru yigenga ya Mexico na Laboratoire ya LINX yo mu kirere, mu kigo cy\u2019ubumenyi bwa kirimbuzi cya UNAM. mbere bya siyansi yo muri Amerika y'Epfo yagenewe gukora ubushakashatsi ku buso bw'ukwezi. \nImizigo yari igizwe na robo eshanu ntoya, yigenga, buri imwe ipima munsi ya garama 60 kandi ipima santimetero 12 z'umurambararo, zagenewe gufatirwa hejuru y'ukwezi. [Mugihe izo robo zizagera ku buso bw'ukwezi, zikorera hamwe nk'agatsiko k'ibyonnyi kugira ngo dusohoze ubutumwa bwa siyansi ari na ho izina ry'umushinga \"Colmena\" ryaturutse, kuko mu kidage (spanish) risobanura \"urwunguko rw'inzuki\".\nYashyizwe ahagaragara ku ya 8 Mutarama 2024 mu ndege ya mbere ya roketi ya Vulcan Centaur mu rwego rwo gufatanya kwishyiriraho ubutumwa bwa Astrobotic Peregrine Mission One to the Moon. \u200b\u200bAriko kubera ikibazo cy'ikiraga ryifashishwa mu kugenda (propellent) cyabaye kuri lander, ubutumwa bwarahagaritswe, maze iyo lander hamwe na Colmena birashya mu kirere cy'isi hejuru y'inyanja y'amajyepfo ya Pasifika, aho ubutumwa bwa nyuma bwabonetse bwaturutse ku kigo gishinzwe gukurikirana ibibura cya Canberra ku isaha ya 20:59 GMT.\u200b \nKopi ya Colmena, hamwe na moderi zindi zikorerwa imizigo, yinjijwe muburyo bwikizamini cyakorewe isuzuma rya Astrobotic Technology's Peregrine lunar lander, mu rwego rwo kwerekana \"imurikagurisha mu kirere\" mu nzu ndangamurage ya Smithsonian National Air and Space Museum i Washington, DC "}
{"id": "21091", "revid": "10947", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21091", "title": "Silvert's campany", "text": "Silverts Adaptive Imyenda &amp; Inkweto, ni ubucuruzi wo muri Amerika no muri Kanada umuruza kandi akanakwirakwiza imyenda n'inkweto zijyanye n'abagabo n'abagore. sosiyete ikora imyenda ihuza imiterere itanga ibisubizo byoroshye byo kwambara kubantu babana nubushobozi buke. Bimwe mu bikoresho bitandukanye bya adaptasiyo ya Silverts birimo imyenda kubakoresha igare ry' ababana nubumuga, abarezi bafasha imyenda nko hejuru yinyuma, imyenda yoroshye yo gufunga magnetiki, hamwe ninkweto zimenyera, amasogisi hamwe nigitambambuga cyagenewe gufasha abantu bafite umuvuduko muke mu myambarire yabo ya buri munsi no kwambara. \nAmateka.\nMu mwaka wa 1929, ID Ed Alter yashinze Ububiko bw\u2019ishami rya Jack i Ingersoll, Ontario, muri Kanada. Nyuma y'urupfu rwa ID Alter, mu mwaka wa 1978, umwuzukuru we, Jeffrey Alter yinjiye muri icyo kigo. Mu 1980, isosiyete yahinduye izina ayita imyenda ya Silvert ya Seniors maze itangira kuba inzobere mu myambarire imenyereye hamwe na Jeffrey Alter nk'umuyobozi mukuru. \nSilverts yafunguye ibiro byayo, ububiko n\u2019ububiko bw\u2019ibicuruzwa i Concord, Ontario, mugihugu cya Kanada. Silvert's yari ifite ububiko bwayo bwa mbere bugendanwa kumuhanda mu 1981 naho 1987, hashyirwaho urutonde rwambere rwimyenda ihuzwa n'imiterere. Silvert yagurishije ibicuruzwa byayo binyuze mubigo nderabuzima byo mu mutwe mbere yo kugurisha abakiriya. \nSilverts yatangiye kwagura ibicuruzwa mu gihugu imyaka ibiri kandi itangira kugurisha ku rwego mpuzamahanga mu 1993. Mu 1995, Silverts yari ifite abakozi 41 bahoraho ndetse akanagira n'abakozi 15 b'igihe gito. Kuva Silvert imaze gukura mu myaka yashize hamwe na 9.01 kuri 10 ku rutonde rwa ResellerRatings.com ku ya 15 Kamena \nMumwaka wa 2019, Careismatic Brands yaguze Silverts. Muri Mutarama mu 2024, Ibicuruzwa bya Careismatic byatanze igice cya 11 gihomba. \nUgushyingo mu 2024, Silverts yaguzwe n'ubuyobozi mugura abakozi. Silverts ubu yabuze muri Kanada, ifitwe kandi ikoreshwa nabakozi bayo.\nIbicuruzwa.\nikigo cya Silverts kigurisha imyenda itandukanye yo guhuza n'imihindagurikire y'ikirere kuva ku ipantaro yambarwa n'abafite ubumuga, ikabutura, imyenda, imyenda ya nijoro, imyenda ya siporo, n'inkweto, hiyongereyeho ibikoresho byihariye bikenerwa. \nSilverts ikora ibishushanyo byayo muri Kanada kandi imyenda yayo ikorerwa muri Kanada no mubushinwa. \nImyenda myinshi ya Silverts yambarwa nabantu bakunda gutanda serivisi zo murugo, imyenda ya Silverts ndetse ninyerera zimwe zagenewe gufata abamesa inganda. \nKugurisha no kwamamaza.\nSilverts igurisha cyane cyane ibicuruzwa byayo kumurongo kandi ikoresheje kataloge isosiyete ikora kabiri mu mwaka. Urubuga rwa Silverts rwagenewe abakoresha guhaha bakurikije ubumuga bwabo nibikenewe. \nAmarushanwa yo guhangana.\nMu mwaka wa 2016, Silvert yitabiriye amarushanwa ya Business Challenge yatewe inkunga na \"The Globe na Mail\" na Telus Corp. kandi yari mu bantu 50 ba mbere batsindiye icyubahiro. "}
{"id": "21092", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21092", "title": "Magnatic Shoe Closures", "text": "Magnatic Shoe Closures nibikoresho bifunga inkweto ukoresheje bits ebyiri za magneti zifatanije ninkweto. Gufunga birashobora gukoreshwa mukweto nyinshi.\nIbisobanuro.\nIbikoresho byo gufunga inkweto za magnetiki bifunga inkweto ukoresheje bits ebyiri za magneti zifatanije ninkweto, kandi aho bits ifata umwanya w ipfundo n'umuheto. Gufunga birashobora gukoreshwa mukweto nyinshi kuko zidafitanye isano nazo, ariko umuguzi arazihuza ninkweto.\nKwakira.\nIsuzuma ryakozwe mu mwaka wa 2016 muri \"Denver Post\" ryerekanye ko igisubizo cyageragaye mu bikorwa bitandukanye, nubwo wenda bigoye kuyobora abantu bamwe bafite ubumuga. "}
{"id": "21093", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21093", "title": "MagnaReady", "text": "MagnaReady ni tekinoroji yimyambarire y'Abanyamerika hamwe na e-ubucuruzi ikorera i Raleigh, muri Caroline y'Amajyaruguru. Yibanze ku gukora imyenda imenyereye kubafite ibibazo by'ubumuga. Yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 2013 na Maura Horton, nyuma yuko umugabo we, Don Horton, yagize ikibazo cyo gukanda amashati kubera indwara ya Parkinson. MagnaReady ikoresha tekinoroji ya magnetiki ishati. \nMagnaReady niyo tekinoroji ya mbere yakozwe mubijyanye nimyambarire imenyereye yageze kwisoko rusange, hamwe nikoranabuhanga ryemerewe ibicuruzwa biboneka kubacuruza kumurongo. \nAmateka.\nMu mwaka wa 2009, Don Horton, umutoza w\u2019umupira w'amaguru muri kaminuza ya Leta ya Carolina y'Amajyaruguru, yaharaniye gukanda ishati ye mu cyumba cyo gufungiramo kubera indwara ya Parkinson. Umugore we yashakaga kubishakira igisubizo, uwahoze akora imyenda y'abana, yahisemo kudoda magneti mumashati yumugabo we kugirango byoroshye gukoreshwa. Muri 2015, hatanzwe ipatanti ku ikoranabuhanga. \nMu mwaka wa 2016, PVH Corp., producer wa Van Heusen, Tommy Hilfiger, Calvin Klein, na IZOD, yemereye ikoranabuhanga rya MagnaReady mu rwego rwo kugeza amashati ahuza abantu benshi ku isoko binyuze mu maduka no kuri interineti bityo bigafasha abantu bafite babana nubumuga kuba bahaha biboroheye binyuze kuri murandasi. Muri, umurongo uhuriweho n\u2019ishati ya VanHeusen MagnaClick washyizwe ahagaragara kandi ugurishwa ku bagabo barwaye indwara ya Parkinson. \nIn September 2017, the MagnaReady technology was licensed in partnership with LF Americas, a division of Li &amp;amp; Fung, to bring the adaptive products to a larger retail audience.\nMu Kwakira mu mwaka wa 2017, ishati ikoresha ikoranabuhanga rya MagnaReady ryerekanwe n\u2019inzu ndangamurage y\u2019ubuhanzi bugezweho ya New York mu \"bintu: Imyambarire igezweho?\" herekanwa nka verisiyo igezweho yimyenda yumugabo muri Mutarama 2017. "}
{"id": "21094", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21094", "title": "SmartThings", "text": "SmartThings Inc. ni kompanyi yo muri Amerika ikora ibyerekeye kugenzura no guhanga ingo z'ikoranabuhanga (home automation), ikaba ifite icyicaro gikuru i Mountain View, muri leta ya Californiya. Kuva muri Kanama 2014 ni ishami rya Samsung Electronics. \nYashinzwe mu mwaka wa 2012, yibanda ku iterambere rya porogaramu zikoresha amazina atazwi hamwe n\u2019ibisobanuro bifitanye isano na porogaramu zabakiriya hamwe n\u2019ibicu bigenewe amazu meza hamwe na interineti y\u2019abaguzi. SmartThings ivuga ko urubuga rwayo rufite miliyoni 62 zikoresha abakoresha, umubare uvuga ko wiyongereyeho 70% kugeza muri 2019 na 2020. \nAmateka.\nSmartThings yatekerejwe n\u2019umushinga washinze kandi wahoze ari umuyobozi mukuru, Alex Hawkinson mu itumba ry\u2019umwaka wa 2011. Hawkinson avuga ko inzu y\u2019imisozi y\u2019umuryango we idatuwe muri Colorado yangijwe cyane n\u2019imiyoboro y\u2019amazi yabanje gukonja hanyuma igaturika bikaviramo kwangirika kw\u2019amadolari 80.000. Hawkinson yavuze ko yashoboraga gukumira ibyangiritse aramutse amenye ibibera mu nzu. Kuva mu mwaka wa 2011 na 2012, Hawkinson hamwe n\u2019abafatanyabikorwa be ba SmartThings bakoze kugira ngo bakore prototype y\u2019ibisubizo bifuza gukemura ibibazo nkibi. [Icyo cyitegererezo cy'imbere cyaje kuba ishingiro ry'ubukangurambaga bwabereye kuri Kickstarter bwatangijwe muri Nzeri 2012 bukaza gukusanya miliyoni1.2 z'amdolari y'Amerika, biza kuba umushinga wa kabiri munini watewe inkunga n'abantu benshi (crowdfunding) ugamije guteza imbere ingo z'ikoranabuhanga kugeza ubu. \nGukusanya miliyoni 3 z'amadolari y'inkunga y'itangira y'umushiga mu ukuboza 2012 SmartThings yaje gushyira ku isoko ibicuruzwa byayo mu buryo bwa k'ubucuruzi mu kwezi kwa kanama 2013, mbere yo gukusanya miliyoni 12.5 z'inyongera mu cyiciro cy'ishoramari cya Series A mu mpera za 2013. \nMuri Kanama 2014, Samsung Electronics yatangaje ko imaze kumvikana yo kugura SmartThings. Amasezerano y\u2019imari y\u2019amasezerano ntabwo yigeze atangazwa ku mugaragaro ariko yagereranijwe agera kuri miliyoni 200 z\u2019amadolari y\u2019ibitabo by\u2019ubucuruzi icyo gihe. \nIbicuruzwa na serivisi.\nKu ikubitiro SmartThings yabyaye suite yibikoresho byabigenewe na serivisi za software, harimo inzu yo mu rugo ifite ubwenge hamwe na sensor. Muri Kamena 2020, umuyobozi ushinzwe ubwubatsi bwa SmartThings, Mark Benson, yatangaje ko SmartThings izitandukanya no gukora ibyuma byayo ahubwo ikibanda kuri software. Isosiyete irizera kwinjiza andi masosiyete gukora no gukwirakwiza ibyuma bya SmartThings. Mu, SmartThings yatangaje ko Aeotec izafata umurongo w\u2019ibikoresho by\u2019i Burayi. Mu Kuboza 2020, Aeotec yatangaje ko izanacunga ibikoresho bya SmartThings portfolio muri Ositaraliya, Kanada, Ubwongereza, na Amerika. \nKuva muri Gashyantare 2021, SmartThings itegura porogaramu na serivisi zicu. "}
{"id": "21095", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21095", "title": "Zygoma Implant", "text": "Zygoma Implants (cyangwa gushiramo zygomatike) bitandukanye no gutera amenyo asanzwe kubera ko yomeka kumagufwa ya zygomatike aho kuba maxilla. Bishobora gukoreshwa mugihe ubunini bw' amagupfa cyangwa ubwinshi bidahagije mugushira amenyo asanzwe. Umubare w'amagufwa adahagije ushobora guterwa no gufata amagufwa kimwe no guhumeka kwa sinus ya maxillary cyangwa guhuza byombi. Uburebure bwamagufwa ntoya kugirango hashyirwemo igice cyimbere cyurwasaya rwo hejuru bigomba kuba nka 10mm kugirango yemeze kubaho kwimikwa. Iyo hari amagufwa adahagije aboneka, uburyo bwo guhuza amagufwa hamwe nuburyo bwo kuzamura sinus bushobora gukorwa kugirango ubwinshi bwamagufwa. Uburyo bwo gutera amagufwa mu rwasaya bufite ingaruka mbi zo kuvura igihe kirekire, kubuza kwambara amenyo, uburwayi bw\u2019ahantu ho kubaga abaterankunga no kwangwa. \nGutera Zygoma byatangijwe bwa mbere mu mpera za 90 na Dr. Per Ingvar Br\u00e5nemark, uzwi cyane nka Se wa Implantology Dental Implantology. Gutera Zygomatike byakoreshejwe mu kuvura amenyo ku barwayi bafite amagufwa adahagije mu rwasaya rwo hejuru, bitewe, urugero, gusaza, kuvura ibibyimba, ihahamuka, cyangwa atrophy. Gutera Zygoma bifata anchorage kumagufwa ya zygoma / zygomatic (igufwa ryumusaya). Amagufwa ya zygomatike ni menshi mu bwiza kandi ni cortical muri kamere kuruta amagufwa yinyuma. Kubera inanga ikomeye ishobora kugerwaho mumagufa yuzuye yo mukarere ka zygomatike, hamwe no gukwirakwiza imihangayiko yagerwaho kuri ibyo byatewe, proth\u00e8se irashobora guhita ishyirwa mugihe cyo kubagwa. Gutera zygoma biraboneka muburebure buri hagati ya 30 na 52.5mm. Umutwe watewe na zygoma wakozwe kugirango yemere proth\u00e8se kumugereka wa dogere 45 kuri dogere ndende yatewe. Gutera Zygomatic ishobora gukoreshwa kubarwayi badafite amenyo mu rwasaya rwo hejuru, abarwayi bavunitse cyane amenyo cyangwa amenyo yimukanwa cyane kubera indwara nka parontontite yibasiye. Intsinzi yo gutera mubitabo kwisi yose ni 97-98%. Ingorane zijyanye no gushyirwaho ni sinusite, paresthesia mukarere ka musaya na fistula ya oroantral. \nMubusanzwe, hariho uburyo bubiri bwo kubaga uburyo bwo gutera zygomatic. Imwe muriyo ni tekiniki ya kera yasobanuwe neza na Br\u00e5nemark mu mwaka wa 1998, Sinusal, naho iyindi yo mu mwaka wa 2003, Tekinike Yongeyeho na Reginaldo Miglioran\u00e7a, yasobanuwe bwa mbere mu gitabo cyanditswe muri Mutarama mu mwaka wa 2003. "}
{"id": "21096", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21096", "title": "GlobalVision", "text": "GlobalVision ni kompayi itanga porogaramu zikorera kuri interineti (SaaS) yihariye mu byerekeye gupakira no gushyiraho labels. \nAmateka.\nGlobalVision Inc. (GlobalVision) yashinzwe na Reuben Malz mu 1990. ifite icyicaro i Montreal, muri Kanada, kandi ifite ibiro by'akarere mu Bwongereza no mu Budage. \nMuri 2013, Pfizer yagiranye amasezerano na GlobalVision yo kugenzura ubuziranenge bwo gupakira. \nGlobalVision yashyizeho urubuga rwayo rwa mbere rushingiye ku kugenzura ubuziranenge mu Ibi byakurikiwe no gushyira ku isoko verisiyo igezweho y'iyo platform yitwa Proofware mu 2014.\nMuri 2017, GlobalVision yasohoye urubuga rwo kugenzura ubuziranenge bwa desktop. \nMuri 2018, GlobalVision yafatanije na Pantone na X-Rite gutangiza gahunda ya mbere yo kugenzura amabara ya digitale ku isi yo gucapa no gupakira. "}
{"id": "21097", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21097", "title": "Digital Command Center", "text": "Digital Command Centre yari igikoresho kinini cyo kugenzura kure (remote control) cyashyiriweho televisiyo zihenze za RCA; mu 1983 kuri Colortrak 2000 hamwe na SJT400 CED umukinnyi naho 1984 muri TV ya Dimensia Lyceum. Ikintu cy'ingenzi cyaranze Digital Command Centre ni uko byari rusange mubice byinshi bya RCA, harimo VCR, abakinyi ba CED, tuneri, amplifier, CD ikinisha, nibindi, hejuru yo kugenzura monite ubwayo. Digital Command Centre yatwaye bateri enye za AA kububasha, kubera ubwinshi bwayo kandi mbere yigihe cyayo.\nIkigo cya mbere cya Digital Command Centre cyasohotse mu 1984 hamwe na sisitemu ya Dimensia, CRK35A, yari ifite buto 52, ifite ububiko bw'ibikoresho, kandi ipima hafi ikiro kimwe na batiri. \nMu 1985, RCA yasohoye sisitemu ya Digital Command Component Sisitemu, sisitemu yose y amajwi yahujwe nibikoresho byose byamajwi ya Dimensia, nayo yakoresheje Digital Command Centre kure. Igitekerezo cy'iyi sisitemu kwari ukugira ubushobozi bwuzuye bw'ijwi rwa Dimensia utagombye gukoresha monitor ya Dimensia. \nSisitemu ya Dimensia.\nIn Dimensia television systems, the remote was called \"Dimensia Intelligent Audio Video\" or \"Dimensia Digital Control\" because all of the components were integrated so that the remote could activate the entire system with the touch of one button by communicating with the built-in computer found in the Dimensia monitor via the black control jack found on all Dimensia components. This remote had 8 device keys on it; TV, VCR, VID2 (DISC), AUX, AM/FM, PHON, TAPE, and CD. Since the CED Player intended to be released with the Dimensia system in 1984 was cancelled, the VID2 button and the ability to control the CED Players was absent from later remotes. \nVideo ya Audio Intelligent Audio Dimensia yasimbujwe icyuma kimeze nk'umugozi (CRK45A) mu 1987."}
{"id": "21098", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21098", "title": "Vertebral Fixation", "text": "vertebral Fixation (izwi nka \"fixeur spinal\") nuburyo bwo kubaga amagufwa aho vertebrae ebyiri cyangwa nyinshi zomekeranye hagati yazo \" igikoresho cyo gukosora vertebral \", hagamijwe kugabanya umuvuduko wurugingo bityo ukirinda kwangirika kwumugongo cyangwa imizi yumugongo.\nIbyerekana.\nUburyo bwo gukosora urutirigongo bushobora kwerekanwa mugihe umuntu yavunitse urutirigongo, ubumuga bwurugingo, cyangwa indwara ya vertebral (nka spondylolisthesis).\nIbikoresho byo gukosora vertebral.\nIgikoresho gikoreshwa kugirango ugere kuri vertebral ikosorwe mubisanzwe ni proth\u00e8se ihoraho cyangwa igice cya kabiri gikomeye gikozwe muri titanium ; ingero zirimo inkoni, amasahani, imigozi, hamwe nuburyo butandukanye. Ubusanzwe ubundi buryo busanzwe ni ugukoresha ibikoresho bisubirwamo, bigizwe na bio-resorbable material.\nAndi makuru yerekeye iki gikoresho cyihariye cyo gukosora urutoki ushobora kubisanga muri Reta zunzubumwe za Amerika ku ya 13 Ugushyingo mu mwaka wa 2007 hashyizwe ahagaragara patenti nshya. Ubu ipatanti irashobora (23 Nzeri 2008) kuyisanga kurubuga rwa Amerika. "}
{"id": "21099", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21099", "title": "Amebis", "text": "Amebis wo muri Kamnik ni isosiyete yo muri Siloveniya mu bijyanye n'ikoranabuhanga ry'indimi. Isosiyete] [] [[\u200b\u200b \u200b Isosiyete ikora kandi ikanahindura inkoranyamagambo yo muri Siloveniya yitwa Termania, ikubiyemo inkoranyamagambo zirenga 135. Inkoranyamagambo ikoreshwa cyane kuri Termania ni inkoranyamagambo y'ubuvuzi ya Siloveniya. Ku bufatanye na sosiyete Alpineon n'Ikigo cya Jo\u017eef Stefan Institute bakoze synthesizer yo kuvuga hamwe n'umusomyi wa ecran \"Govorec\" (Speaker). Batanze kandi inkunga ya tekiniki kumasomo manini ya Slovene, yitwa FidaPLUS, Fran na Fran\u010dek. \nAmebis yanashyizeho kandi sisitemu yo guhindura imvugo mu buryo bwi'ikoranabuhanga yitwa, ikaba yongeyemo ururimi rw'I Sloveniya. \nKu ya 11 Ukwakira 2023 Amebis yahawe igihembo cya Padiri Stanislav \u0160krabec Foundation kubera ibikorwa bidasanzwe yagezeho mu bijyanye n'indimi za Slovene."}
{"id": "21100", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21100", "title": "Wake-on-ring", "text": "Wake-on-ring (WOR) cyangwa Wake-on-Modem (WOM) ni ibisobanuro byemerera mudasobwa n'ibindi bikoresho bishyigikiwe \"guhaguruka\" cyangwa kwatsa bikiri ku buryo bwo gusinzira, kuryama burundu by'agateganyo (hibernating) cyangwa \"kuba byahagaritswe buhoro (soft off)\" (urugero: ACPI state G1 cyangwa G2), hanyuma igatangira gukora.\nIcyibanze shingiro nuko ikimenyetso kidasanzwe cyoherezwa kumurongo wa terefone kuri mudasobwa binyuze muri modem yayo yo guhamagara, ikabwira imbaraga zose hanyuma ugatangira gukora. Ibikoreshwa bisanzwe byari ububiko bwububiko na BBSes, nubwo gukoresha hobbyist byari bifite akamaro.\nImashini za Fax zikoresha sisitemu isa, aho usanga ziba zihagaritse ibikorwa cyane kugeza zibonye ikimenyetso cya fax kiri kuza, kikaba aricyo gituma zitangira gukora.\nUbu buryo bwo gukora bwa kure bwatanzwe ahanini na Wake-on-LAN, ni shyashya ariko ikora muburyo bumwe."}
{"id": "21101", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21101", "title": "The Clapper", "text": "The Clapper ni amajwi akoreshwa n'amashanyarazi akoreshwa igihe yumvise urusaku, ikaba yaragurishijwe bwa mbere i San Francisco mu 1984, muri Californiya ikorera muri Joseph Enterprises, Inc. Joseph Pedott yagurishije clapper agira ati: \nClapper icomeka mu mashanyarazi yo muri Amerika yo mu mashanyarazi, kandi yemerera kugenzura ibikoresho bigera kuri bibiri byacometse muri Clapper. Moderi yazamuye, izwi nka Clapper Plus, ikubiyemo imikorere ya kure yo kugenzura hiyongereyeho amajwi ya mbere ashingiye kubikorwa. \nNubwo yagenewe gukorana n'urusaku rwo gukubita amashyi (clap), The Clapper ishobora gutangira gukora bitunguranye n'andi majwi, nko gucira kw'imbwa, k'urugero. \nPatent.\nUmunyabwenge Clapper yahimbwe na Carlile R. Stevens na Dale E. Reamer, atanga Patent yo muri Amerika # 5493618, isaba ryatanzwe kuwa 1993-05-07 kandi ryatanzwe ku ya 20 Gashyantare 1996. "}
{"id": "21102", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21102", "title": "European Home Systems Protocol", "text": "European Home Systems(EHS) Protocol yari uburyo gutumanaho (communication protocol) bugamije kugenzura no guhuza ibikoresho byo mu rugo hifashishijwe umurongo w'amashanyarazi (power line communication), byatejwe imbere, ryakozwe n'ishyirahamwe ry\u2019ibihugu by\u2019i Burayi (EHSA).\nNyuma yo guhuza hamwe na protocole ebyiri, ni igice cyurwego rwa KNX, rwubahiriza komite y\u2019ibihugu by\u2019i Burayi ishinzwe ubuziranenge bwa Electrotechnical Standard (CENELEC) EN 50090 kandi ifite amahirwe yo kuba ishingiro ryambere ryugururiwe urugo no kugenzura inyubako."}
{"id": "21103", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21103", "title": "IEC 61030", "text": "D\u00b2B (Domestic Digital Bus, IEC 61030) Ni standard ya IEC igenewe uburyo bwo gutumanaho bwa serial butari bwihuse (low-speed) kandi bushobora kugenzurwa n'abatandukanye (multi-master), ikoreshwa mu bikorwa byo guteza imbere ingo z'ikoranabuhanga (home automation).\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b Yatunganijwe bwa mbere na Philips mu myaka ya za 1980. Muri 2006 yakuweho na IEC kubera ko hashyizweho urundi rwego, JTC1 SC 83 / WG1. Haracyariho ibikoresho byinshi byujuje ibyangombwa bya IEC61030, nk'ibice bimwe na bimwe byanditseho umutwe wa Philips hamwe nabahindura CD kuva kuri stereyo y'imodoka. \nUmuhuza wa SCART atanga D\u00b2B ihuza itumanaho hagati yibikoresho."}
{"id": "21104", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21104", "title": "Instabus", "text": "Instabus, ni sisitemu yigenga kandi ifunguye ikoreeshwa mu gucunga no kugenzura ibikoresho by'amashanyarazi biri mu nyubako. Yakozwe na Berker, Gira, Jung, Merten na Siemens AG. Hano hari ibigo bigera kuri 200 byibikoresho byamashanyarazi ukoresheje protocole yitumanaho. The Europen Installation Bus (EIB) yemerera ibice byose by'amashanyarazi guhuzwa binyuze muri bisi y'amashanyarazi. Buri kintu cyose gishobora kohereza amategeko kubindi bice, aho biri hose. Umuyoboro usanzwe wa EIB ugizwe nibice byamashanyarazi nka switch, pulsers, moteri yamashanyarazi, amashanyarazi, amashanyarazi, hamwe na sensor.\nIyi bisi y'amashanyarazi ikozwe mu mashanyarazi ya 2x2x0,8mm, ihuza ibikoresho byose murusobe. Umubare ntarengwa wibintu ni 57375.\nSisitemu ya EIByatejwe imbere hagamijwe kongera kuzigama ingufu z'amashanyarazi, umutekano, ihumure n'ubwisanzure mu mikorere. \nKugenzura sisitemu.\nNubwo EIB ari sisitemu yegerejwe abaturage kandi idakenera icyerekezo icyo aricyo cyose cyamashanyarazi cyangwa igenzura, birashoboka gushyira mubikorwa sisitemu yo kugenzura PC kugirango igenzure imiterere yimiterere no kohereza amabwiriza yintoki cyangwa yabanje gutegurwa kuri kimwe cyangwa byinshi bigize umuyoboro.\nGuhuza nibindi bipimo.\nKonnex KNX (standard) yatejwe imbere bitewe no guhuza EIB, BCi na EHSA."}
{"id": "21105", "revid": "16764", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21105", "title": "Intelligent Home Control", "text": "Intelligent House Concepts ni sisitemu yo guteza imbere inyubako z'ikoranabuhanga (building automation system) ikoresha imiterere y'itumanaho rya \"star topology\" aho umugozi uba uhuza buri gikoresho cyose ku kigo nyamukuru. Ubusanzwe yakozwe na LK, ariko ubu ifitwe na Schneider Electric ikagurishwa nka \"IHC Intelligent House Concept\".\nSisitemu igizwe n'ubugenzuzi bukuru hamwe kugeza 8 byinjira hamwe na 16 bisohoka. Buri cyiciro cyinjiza gishobora kugira ibyinjijwe 16 (gucana / kuzimya) hamwe nibisohoka module 8 ya digitale (gucuna/ kuzimya), bivamo byose hamwe 128 hamwe n'ibisohoka 128 ku mugenzuzi.\nModule igenzura protocole.\nUmugenzuzi mukuru (central controller) uba ufite umugozi umwe w'itumanaho rya point-to-point uhuza buri gice (module) cy'iyo sisitemu. Porotokole hagati y'ubugenzuzi bukuru hamwe na module ikoresha 5V ubugari bwa pulse ya kodegisi kuburyo bukurikira:\nIkimenyetso cyavuzwe haruguru gihora gisubiramo."}
{"id": "21106", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21106", "title": "IP500 Alliance", "text": "The IP500 Alliance, rifite icyicaro i Berlin mu Budage, ni umuryango mpuzamahanga w\u2019abakora ibicuruzwa na sisitemu bigenewe guteza imbere inyubako z'ikoranbuhanga (building automation) no guhuza sisitemu zitandukanye (system integration). Abanyamuryango barimo Bosch, Honeywell, Siemens, Omron na Toyota Tsusho. Intego y'ubumwe bwa IP500 no gusobanura no guteza imbere imiyoboro idafite insinga, itagira aho ibogamiye kandi itekanye amakuru yoherejwe IP500 itumanaho ryinyubako nini.\nIhuriro ryashinzwe mu 2007 i Berlin. Kuva mu 2011 Ihuriro IP500 ryabaye umuryango udaharanira inyungu."}
{"id": "21107", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21107", "title": "Self-cleaning oven", "text": "Aself-cleaning cyangwa pyrolytic oven ni itanura ikoresha ubushyuhe bwo hejuru kugira ngo (hafi) ngo itwike ibisigazwa by'ibyokeje hakoreshejwe uburyo bwa pyrolysis, butagombera imiti isukura. Iyo ifuru ishobora gukoresha amashanyarazi yo mu rugo cyangwa gaz.\nInzira ya Pyrolytike.\nAmashyiga ya pirolitike yo kwisukura agabanya ibiryo byanduye ivu hamwe n'ubushyuhe bugera kuri. Inkuta z'itanura zometseho ubushyuhe- na aside irwanya feri.\nA self-cleaning oven yakozwe kugirango igume ifunze kugeza igihe ubushyuhe bwo hejuru burangiye. Kugira ngo hirindwe ibikomere bishobora gutwikwa, hifashishijwe imashini ikoreshwa kugirango urugi rwa feri rufunge kandi rufunge mugihe na nyuma yigihe cyogusukura ubushyuhe bwinshi, bumara amasaha agera kuri atatu. Mubisanzwe, umuryango urashobora gukingurwa nyuma yubushyuhe bukonje bugera kuri. \nSelf-cleaning ovens ubusanzwe afite insulation nyinshi kuruta amashyiga asanzwe kugirango agabanye umuriro. Kwikingira bigabanya kandi ingufu zikenewe mu guteka bisanzwe. \nSelf-cleaning ovens afatwa nkayoroshye kandi atwara igihe, bityo rero akoresha amafaranga menshi. Nyamara, kubera ubushyuhe bwinshi, bitanga umwotsi kandi bisaba ingufu nyinshi. Ubusanzwe umunota wiminota 150 uzakenera amashanyarazi arenze 3 kWh. Nk\u2019uko abahanga benshi babivuga, gukurura impuruza y\u2019umwotsi birashobora kwirindwa no gukoresha buri gihe gahunda yo kwisukura. \nUbundi buryo bw'ikoranabuhanga.\ncatalytic cleaning.\nAmashyiga ya catalitiki \"ikomeza isukuye\" yishingikiriza kumyuma yo mu cyuma kinini kugirango itume igabanuka ryamavuta ivu mubushyuhe busanzwe bwo guteka. Urukuta rw'itanura rya catalitiki yo kwisukura rwometseho ibikoresho bikora nka catisale ya okiside, mubisanzwe muburyo bwa catalizike muri materique ihuza. Cerium (IV) oxyde nimwe mubikoresho bisanzwe bikoreshwa. Ibindi bishoboka ni umuringa, vanadium, bismuth, molybdenum, manganese, fer, nikel, amabati, niobium, chromium, tungsten, rhenium, platine, cobalt, na oxyde zabo, zonyine cyangwa zivanze. Ipitingi ikora cyane mubusanzwe irimo oxyde y'umuringa, oxyde ya manganese cyangwa cobalt oxyde, na oxyde y'umuringa na manganese ikoreshwa hamwe. Binder irashobora kuba fluoropolymer cyangwa frit enamel. Mu myaka ya za 90, SRI International yakoze ubushakashatsi kuri Whirlpool Corporation, ihindura imiterere nogukoresha hejuru ya farumasi enamel iboneka mu ziko ihinduka imwe irimo ionic nkeya, na firime ikora ibinure mumazi ashonga. \nIsuku.\nUbundi buryo bwo kwifashisha amashyiga ni amashyiga yoza. Ikoresha amazi nubushyuhe bwo hasi kugirango isukure ifuru. [\"citation ikenewe\"]"}
{"id": "21108", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21108", "title": "Universal powerline bus", "text": "Universal Powerline Bus (UPB) ni porotokole ya porogaramu yihaariye yakozwe na Powerline Control Sisitemu kugira ngo ikoreshe itumanaho rinyuzwa mu miyoboro y'amashanyarazi hagati y'ibikoresho bikoreshwa ubwenge mu rugo (home automation). Amashanyarazi yo murugo akoreshwa mu kohereza amakuru ya digitale hagati yibikoresho bya UPB ukoresheje pulse-imyanya. \nItumanaho ni urungano rw'urungano, nta mugenzuzi mukuru ukenewe. \nAderesi ya UPB yemerera ibikoresho 250 mu nzu hamwe n'amazu 250 kuri transformateur, yemerera aderesi zose zirenga 62.500 kandi irashobora kubana n'izindi sisitemu zitwara amashanyarazi mu'rugo rumwe. \nkuva mu mwaka wa 2018,UPB yari ifite ubwoko bwinshi cyane bw'ibikoresho ugereranyije n'izindi porotokole nyinshi, kandi ishyigikiwe n'abakora ibikoresho bakomeye mu rwegorwa home automation. muri abo bakora ibikoresho, harimo cyane cyane Leviton hamwe n'ibicuruzwa byayo byo mu murongo wa Omni series by'ihuzanzira ry'ibikoresho byo mu rugo, kimwe n'ibikoresho bya UPB basanzwe bacuruza. UPB inashyigikirwa kandi n'abakora porogaramu nyinshi zikoresha home automation, bamwe muri bo bakaba barashyizwe ku rutonde rukurikira.\nKwizerwa.\nUPB ni protocole yizewe cyane yo gutangiza urugo. Ntabwo byoroshye kwivanga kwa RF, guhagarika ibimenyetso kurukuta cyangwa ibibazo bigufi byo gutangaza nka protocole zimwe na zimwe. UPB yanduza insinga zisanzweho kandi ifite urusaku runini rwo kugabanya urusaku. Ibi bituma ishobora gukora urugendo rurerure nta kibazo, ndetse no mu mashanyarazi menshi, bigatuma iba nziza kumazu manini cyane. Ibikoresho bisanzwe byibasiye X10 ibikoresho, mubisanzwe ntabwo bigira ingaruka kuri UPB. Mubyukuri, ibimenyetso bya UPB birashobora kwakirwa neza nigikoresho cyabigenewe kabone niyo haba hari urusaku rwinshi rwamashanyarazi kumurongo w'amashanyarazi. Ariko, mugihe ibikoresho murugo bitera kwivanga gukabije mugihe ukora, akayunguruzo k'urusaku ruhendutse rushobora gukoreshwa ku mwanya w'amashanyarazi kugirango ukemure ikibazo.\nImikoranire.\nAs of 2025[update], control of UPB devices is supported by the Hubitat via open source UPBeat drivers by Xeren.io.\nAs of 2020[update], control of UPB devices is supported by the Home Assistant open source software (in version 0.110 and later).\nAs of 2017[update], control of UPB devices is supported by the OpenHAB open source software.\nHomeSeer ni porogaramu izwi cyane yubucuruzi yo murugo ikoresha porogaramu ifite inkunga ya UPB.\nInkunga ya porogaramu igendanwa (IOS na Android) irahari ukoresheje PulseWorx Gateway (PGW) icomeka muri module.\nIbicuruzwa byerekana amajwi nka Alexa, Automatic Living's HAL hamwe na Assistant wa Google bishyigikirwa haba mu buryo butaziguye cyangwa butaziguye binyuze mu gikoresho cyangwa kugenzura imashini.\nUPB irashobora kubana nubundi buryo bwa tekinoroji. Irashobora kandi gukorana nibindi bikoresho byikora byifashisha RF (kurugero) binyuze mugukoresha protocole nyinshi yo kugenzura ibintu (Reba Leviton Omni, ibikoresho bya HomeSeer). Ibi bituma sisitemu yo kuvanga ikorana buhanga kugirango igere neza mubikoresho byamasomo kuva mubakora byinshi. Ariko, bitandukanye na protocole nyinshi zidafite umugozi, UPB ntisaba kugenzura imashini cyangwa hub gukora.\nKubera ko UPB ari urungano rwurungano, protocole yumuntu ku giti cye, abashinzwe kugenzura ibintu hamwe n'ubwoko butandukanye bwo gucomeka module birashobora gutegurwa kugiti cye gukora imirimo myinshi bitabaye ngombwa ko ugura hub cyangwa umugenzuzi. Ingero zimwe zibikorwa zishobora kugerwaho nta hub cyangwa umugenzuzi byaba\nhari ibikoresho bigenzura uburyo amatara cyangwa ibindi bikoresho bikora (scene controllers) bifite sensor za infrared (IR) zishyirwamo imbere, kandi ibyo bikoresho biraboneka ku isoko. Ibi bituma habaho porogaramu imwe ya kure igenzurwa (kwisi yose) nkibyakozwe na Logitech kugenzura amatara na tereviziyo cyangwa ibindi bikoresho byitangazamakuru.\nAmashakoro.\nIbikurikira nurutonde rwabakora ibikoresho bya UPB. Uru ntabwo arurutonde rwuzuye:"}
{"id": "21109", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21109", "title": "Twilight switch", "text": "Twilight switch ni igice cya elegitoronike kigena ko urumuri rwaka ku buryo bwikora igihe urumuri rusanzwe rw'akazi (nk'urwa joro cyangwa izuba) rugabanutse mu gace runaka. Mu mubare munini w'imikoreshereze, ibisanzwe ni ugushoboza gucana mu mihanda, imihanda, umuhanda munini, imihanda, ubusitani, imbuga, nibindi, mugihe urumuri rwizuba rumanutse munsi y'urwego runaka (urugero: kuva nimugoroba). \nUmuzunguruko wubatswe na twilight switch, mubihe bimwe na bimwe, bisaba ibindi bice, nka relay cyangwa abahuza, mugihe ushaka kugenzura ingufu z'amashanyarazi zisumba izindi (amatara, ibikoresho byamashanyarazi, nibindi).\nIbiranga tekinike.\nHifashishijwe icyuma gikoresha urumuri (Photoresistor, Photodiode, Phototransistor, nibindi) byerekana ingano yumucyo umurikira ibidukikije, itera uruziga rw'amashanyarazi rufungura cyangwa rugafunga imikoranire yumurongo wa mashini cyangwa ya reta ikomeye. (power transistor, thyristor, triac, nibindi), ikora sisitemu yo kumurika. Mubisanzwe, itara risanzwe rijya k'umurongo wifotozi rikoreshwa, hamwe ningaruka zitara rihita ryaka n imugoroba kandi rihora rizima mu mucyo wa mbere w'umuseke. Turashimira iyi sisitemu, ingero nini zingero zikoreshwa zarakozwe, kuva kumurika haba ahantu rusange cyangwa abikorera ku giti cyabo kugeza kwigana kuboneka, aho twilight switch itanga imikorere yigihe gito cy'umuzunguruko. itara ryo kwigana abantu badahari kumubiri. \nHariho uburyo bwinshi kandi bushya bwo guhanga udushya butuma urumuri rwizuba rwinshi, hamwe nogushobora guhindura urwego kugirango uhindure umuriro kurwego runaka rwumwijima, bityo ushireho gutinda no kuzimya kubijyanye nurumuri rwibidukikije. Hari ndetse moderi (modules) zidatuma urumuri rw'ubukorano (urumuri rukoresha amashanyarazi) rwaka,kandi zishobora gutandukanya urumuri rusanzwe (urumuri rw'izuba) n'urwo bukoraho. Ariko, mu bindi bihe, bishobora kuba byiza kubihuza n'uburyo bwo gupanga igihe (time scheduling systeems) kugira ngo bikore neza kurushaho. \nAmashanyarazi.\nIkoreshwa rya twilight ikunze gukoreshwa cyane ni ubwoko bwa electronique, butandukanye nubwa elegitoronike hifashishijwe ibyuma bya pilote bimaze kwinjizwa mu muzunguruko ubwawo, kandi bigatuma imizigo mito ihuzwa mu buryo butaziguye (urugero, itara rimwe). Twilight switch iraboneka muburyo butandukanye kugirango ihuze ibikenewe byose. Mubyukuri, zirashobora gutandukana uhereye kumiterere yabafite itara kugeza kumasanduku atandukanye (silindrike, kare, nibindi). \nWitondere umubare wamatara akoresha igikoresho nimbaraga zayo muri watts, ukurikize amabwiriza mumfashanyigisho yumukoresha, kugirango wirinde ibintu biremereye bikabije kuri konte ya disiki ya disiki, mubyukuri, niba bikenewe imitwaro myinshi, hagomba gushyirwaho umuhuza. Kumuri kumuhanda, kurugero, icyerekezo cya twilight kugiti cye kirashobora gukoreshwa, cyangwa icyerekezo cyo hagati gikora andi matara ya kure kugirango ucane amatara menshi, kuburyo umutwaro urumuri rwagati rwagati rugomba kwihanganira arirwo rupapuro rwihariye rwa relaire. \nIbyiza.\nInyungu nyamukuru yo gukoresha twilight switch ni imbaraga nyinshi zo kuzigama izana, ihujwe no korohereza gahunda idakenewe, igenga neza izuba.\nIbibi.\nIngaruka nyamukuru yo gukora installation ni uko uramutse ushyize urumuri rwububiko hafi yifoto-yerekana ifoto, switch ntishobora gufungura. Muri iki gihe, ugomba kwitondera aho amatara aherereye kubijyanye na fotodetekeri. Kandi, uzirikane ko gutwika gushingiye gusa kumubare wumucyo usanzwe uhari kandi ntabwo ushingiye ku burebure bwizuba, bityo \"gutwika udashaka\" bishobora kubaho, kurugero imbere yibicu byijimye bifitanye isano no kugabanuka gukabije kumucyo wibidukikije kuri sensor (urugero, mugihe hari umuyaga). Kugirango wirinde ibi, twilight switch irashobora guhuzwa hamwe na sisitemu yo guteganya igihe. "}
{"id": "21110", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21110", "title": "Self-making bed", "text": "A self-making bed (kizwi kandi nk'igitanda cy'ubwenge) yagenewe guhita isubiranya imyenda yo ku buriri ku buryo uburiri bwitegura gukoreshwa ku buryo bwikora. \nAmateka.\nMu mwaka wa 2008, uwahimbye Enrico Berruti yerekanye uburiri bwe bwo kwikorera, bwiswe \"Kwikunda\", mu imurikagurisha mpuzamahanga ry\u2019ivumburwa ryabereye i Geneve mu Busuwisi. Uburiri bwikora mu kurambura no koroshya amabati hejuru ya matelas ukoresheje gari ya moshi ihuza amabati yigitanda iruhande yigitanda. \nMuri 2017, isosiyete Smartduvet yasohoye umwenda wo gukora uburiri binyuze mu rusobe rw'ibyumba byo mu kirere. Iki nigice gihumeka gikozwe mubintu byoroheje. Iyo ikora irazamura urupapuro rw'ikirere rw'urupapuro, igashyira umwenda n'impapuro zisubira mu mwanya. Ukoresheje porogaramu, uyikoresha ashobora gushiraho igihe gitandukanye cyo gukora uburiri kuri buri munsi w'icyumweru. Ntabwo isimbuza uburiri buriho kandi ntabwo ihoraho kuburyo ishobora gukoreshwa hamwe n'igitambaro kiriho. "}
{"id": "21111", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21111", "title": "Tado \u00b0", "text": "tado \u00b0 GmbH ni kompanyi y\u2019ikoranabuhanga yo mu Budage ifite icyicaro i Munich (mu Budage) kandi ikora ibikoresho byo kugenzura ubushyuhe bwo mu rugo (thermostasts) n'ibyo gukontorora imashini z'ubukonje (air conditioning controls).\nAmateka.\ntado \u00b0 yashinzwe na Christian Deilmann, Johannes Swchwarz na Valentin Sawadski i Munich muri Nzeri 2011Izina rya kompanyi Tado rikomoka ku magambo y'icyiyapani \"tadiama\" (bisobanura ngo \"nagarutse mu rugo\") na \"okaeri\" (bisobanura ngo \"urakaza neza\") kuko geofencing ari yo yari imikorere ya mbere y'ingenzi muri sisitemu ya Tado mu mwaka wa 2011. Igicuruzwa cya mbere cya kompanyi, Tado Heating, cyatangijwe mu Ugushyingo 2012 mu Budage, Austria, na Suisse, hanyuma mu 2013 mu Bwongereza (United kingdom). \nMuri Nyakanga 2014, tado \u00b0 yafunze miliyoni 10 zama euro ($ 13.6m) y\u2019amafaranga yatanzwe n\u2019abandi, Target Partners na Shortcut Ventures. \nIgicuruzwa cya kabiri cy\u2019isosiyete, tado \u00b0 Smart AC Control, mu gukonjesha ubwenge, cyashyizwe ahagaragara mu Burayi no muri Amerika muri Kamena 2015.Ibirori byo kumurika byabereye mu mujyi wa New York. \nIbicuruzwa.\nUsibye kugabanya gukoresha ingufu no kongera ubwizigame, thermostat ireba abaturage neza. tado \u00b0 itahura abadahari cyangwa bahari bakoresheje terefone zabo, hanyuma igahindura ubushyuhe bwikora. Iteganyagihe hamwe nubushuhe bwurugo nka insulation byitabwaho. \nImwe mu mbogamizi kuri tado \u00b0 ni ahantu hashyushye h\u2019uburayi no guhuza no gushyigikira imiyoboro yabyo. Kugeza 2014, sisitemu zirenga 5.000 zitandukanye zirashobora kugenzurwa na tado \u00b0 Ubushyuhe. \nMuri kamena 2015, tado \u00b0 yashyize ahagaragara ibicuruzwa byayo bya kabiri, Smart AC Igenzura. Ntabwo ari ubushuhe. Ihindura ikintu icyo aricyo cyose cyo guhumeka mu bikoresho byubwenge. tado \u00b0 Igenzura rya Smart AC ikoresha aho terefone igeze kugirango ibashe kumenya niba umuturage ari murugo kandi ahita azimya AC cyangwa azimya. Ikonjesha irashobora kandi gukoreshwa n'intoki hakoreshejwe Smart AC Igenzura ukoresheje porogaramu ya tado \u00b0. \nMuri Kanama 2017, tado \u00b0 yatangaje ko ihuriweho na Google Assistant, yemerera abakiriya bombi bafite sisitemu ya tado \u00b0 ndetse n\u2019igikoresho cya Google Assistant kugenzura sisitemu ya Tado binyuze mu majwi. K'urugero, amategeko yijwi aboneka ni \"Ubushuhe burihe mubyumba?\" cyangwa \"Gabanya ubushyuhe bwo mu cyumba cya 2 \u00b0 C\". "}
{"id": "21112", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21112", "title": "Stardraw", "text": "Yashinzwe mu 1993 na ex- umuyobozi ushinzwe iterambere rya Microsoft, David Snipp Stardraw ni kompanyi ikora porogaramu zihuza kandi zigashushanya sisitemu za amajwi/amashusho (A/V system intergration and design software). \nPorogaramu.\nStardraw ifite ibice bibiri bitandukanye ariko bifitanye isano na software haba ku masoko ya Audio-visual (A / V)\nIgishushanyo cya mudasobwa.\nIgishushanyo mbonera cya Stardraw n'ugukora inyandiko za sisitemu y'amajwi / amashusho. Ibi birimo ibishushanyo bya A / V (bisa nigishushanyo cya mudasobwa ya mudasobwa), Imiterere ya Rack, Igishushanyo cyerekana (Igishushanyo mbonera), Igishushanyo mbonera cyerekana ibyuma byabugenewe, Igishushanyo mbonera cyerekana, hamwe na raporo zijyanye na byo nka Bills y'ibikoresho, Quotations na Cable Gahunda.\nIyi Porogaramu ikubiyemo ibimenyetso by'ibikoresho byateguwe mbere (present equipment icons) kugira ngo bihute mu gukora igishushanyo cya sisitemu ya A/V. \nPorogaramu zabo z'ubu bwoko zirimo\nKugenzura software.\nIgenzura rya Stardraw nigikorwa cyiterambere ryibikorwa byo gukora Touchscreen ya kure igenzura ibikoresho bitandukanye.\nImikoreshereze isanzwe ikubiyemo ibyumba byikora mubyumba byinama, inzu yimyidagaduro, inzu ndangamurage cyangwa inzu yimikino yo murugo, aho abayikoresha bakoresha ibyuma bifata ibyuma bifata ibyuma byerekana ibyuma byerekana amashusho nka porogaramu zerekana amashusho na disikuru, PC, DVD na VCR bakina ibyuma bifata amajwi, kamera, sisitemu ya terefone, ibyuma bifata amajwi / amashusho hamwe nibikoresho bitunganyirizwa, ibyuma byerekana moteri, drape, amatara, na sisitemu zitandukanye. Ibindi bikoreshwa bisanzwe birimo sisitemu yimyidagaduro, ibigo bishinzwe inganda no kugenzura, sisitemu z'umutekano, amahoteri na resitora.\nIkitandukanya software zabo nabahanganye na AMX na Crestron nuko idakenera ibyuma bidasanzwe ahubwo ikorera kumashini iyo ari yo yose ikoresha Microsoft Windows, ikindi kandi abashoferi ninyandiko zayo byanditswe mu rurimi rusange rwa programme C # aho kuba ururimi rwihariye kandi rwashizweho mu bishushanyo mbonera bisa n'ibikoreshwa n'ururimi rwa porogaramu za Microsoft.\nPorogaramu irerekana kandi interineti ya interineti ituma ibikoresho bitari Windows bigenzura porogaramu urugero nka mudasobwa ya Tablet nka iPad ya Apple"}
{"id": "21113", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21113", "title": "Sentroller", "text": "A sentroller, akoreshwa kuri enterineti y'ibintu ni sensor, umugenzuzi cyangwa actuator cyangwa guhuza ibi bitatu.\nAbagenzuzi mubintu bya enterineti.\nInterineti iriho ubu ni interineti y'abantu, ishingiye ku bantu bavugana n'abantu, bakoresheje terefone zigendanwa, tableti, mu dasobwa zigendanwa na mudasobwa, ariko ibi birahinduka: ibikoresho n'ibikoresho bihujwe na interineti (urugero: agasanduku gashyizwe hejuru, kamera, imodoka) biratangira guhindura umubare w'icyerekezo uva ku bantu ugana ku bintu. kure y'abantu. Ubuhanuzi bugera ku kintu cya 100 kugeza kuri 1 cyangwa birenga, bityo interineti yabantu izahinduka kuri enterineti. Kubwibyo, interineti yibintu izahuza kandi ivugane nizindi \"bintu\", aho guhura nabantu.\nByinshi mu bintu bishya bihujwe na enterineti bizaba byoherejwe, bivuze ko ari ibikorwa, sensor, kugenzura, cyangwa guhuza ibi bintu bitatu. Urugero rumwe rworoshye ni urugo rwa thermostat. Thermostat ni umugenzuzi kuko yumva ubushyuhe murugo, akareba niba urugo cyangwa icyumba thermostat ikurikirana ubushyuhe buri ku bushyuhe bwifuzwa, kandi niba atari byo, ifungura umushyushya cyangwa icyuma gikonjesha. Kubwibyo, thermostat ni sensor na mugenzuzi - umugenzuzi. Nta mikoranire y'abantu na thermostat cyangwa igicu bizakenerwa kugirango thermostat igumane ubushyuhe murugo kurwego rukwiye.\nMubimenyerezo, abashinzwe umutekano bakurura kandi / cyangwa batanga amakuru make cyane, ariko guhuza na enterineti ni ngombwa kubikorwa byabo. Internet y'ibintu izakira porogaramu zizi gusobanura amakuru yatanzwe n'abashinzwe umutekano n'igikorwa cyafatwa. Ubwenge bw'urugo rwubwenge, ingufu zubwenge, inyubako zubwenge, n'ibindi mu byukuri biba mubicu. [\"ushidikanya \u2013 kuganira\"]\u00a0 Abashinzwe kohereza ni impera zanyuma zizaba umubare munini wubwoko bwa interineti yibintu."}
{"id": "21114", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21114", "title": "Smart plug", "text": "A smart plug ni plug n'akabati k'amashanyarazi(bizwi kandi nka wall plug,outlet, cyangwa electrical connector) gashobora gushyirwa hagati y'imigozi y'amashanyarazi n'akabati k'amashanyarazi kugirango gakoreshwe nk'icyuma cyo guhindura amshanyarazi kigenzurwa n'aho ari kure (remote-controlled power switch). Nkibyo, amacomeka yubwenge arashobora gukoreshwa mugukora ibikoresho byamashanyarazi \"ibiragi\" ubwenge, bityo bigafasha ibikoresho nkibi byo gutangiza urugo cyangwa kubaka intego zo gutangiza. \nSmart plugs ashobora, kurugero, kugenzurwa hifashishijwe porogaramu igendanwa, urugo rwubwenge cyangwa umufasha wukuri. [\u200b\u200b\u200b Amacomeka menshi y'ubwenge afite ammeter yubatswe kugirango ikoreshwa ry'ingufu z'amashanyarazi (zapimwe mu masaha ya kilowatt) y'ibikoresho bihujwe bishobora gukurikiranwa. Smart plug akenshi afite umwirondoro woroshye kugirango utabangamira kugera ku masoko aturanye mumasoko y'urukuta cyangwa amashanyarazi.\nSmart plugs atanga ibyiza byinshi byongera ingufu z'ingirakamaro kandi byoroshye. Bemerera abakoresha kugenzura ibikoresho kure binyuze muri terefone zigendanwa cyangwa abafasha buhanga, bishobora kuba ingirakamaro cyane mu kuzimya ibikoresho bitanga ingufu nyinshi nka hoteri y\u2019amazi, ibyuma bifata ibyuma bikonjesha, cyangwa amatara iyo uri kure yurugo. Amacomeka menshi yubwenge nayo ashyigikira gahunda na automatike gahunda - kurugero, gufungura geyser iminota 30 mbere yuko umuntu agera murugo cyangwa guhita azimya nyuma yigihe cyagenwe kugirango abungabunge ingufu. Usibye kuzigama ingufu, ibyuma bimwe byubwenge bigira uruhare mu mutekano mu kugabanya ibyago by'umuriro w'amashanyarazi kubikoresho bititabiriwe."}
{"id": "21115", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21115", "title": "Smart doorbell", "text": "A smart doorbell ni idirishya ry'inzugi rikora ku muryango wa internet rikamenya nyir'urugo ku gikoresho cye (terefone cyangwa ikindi gikoresho) igihe umushyitsi ageze kumuryango. Irakora iyo umushyitsi akanze buto yumuryango wumuryango, cyangwa ubundi buryo, iyo inzogera yumuryango yunvise umushyitsi hamwe na sensor yimikorere. Inzogera yubwenge ireka nyiri urugo akoresha porogaramu ya terefone kugirango arebe kandi avugane numushyitsi akoresheje inzogera yumuryango yubatswe na kamera ya infragreire na mikoro. Birashobora kuba bateri ikoreshwa cyangwa insinga. Inzogera zimwe z'ubwenge nazo zemerera umukoresha gukingura urugi kure akoresheje gufunga ubwenge. \nAmateka.\nImwe mu nzogera za mbere zifite ubwenge bwinjiye ku isoko ni Ring Video Doorbell yakozwe na rwiyemezamirimo Jamie Siminoff mu 2013. Kuva icyo gihe, inzogera nyinshi z\u2019ubwenge zamenyekanye ku isoko, zimwe muri zo zikaba zifite ibintu byihariye, byihariye. Ikindi gikomeye ni Nest Mwaramutse. \nIbibazo byihariye.\nHagaragaye impungenge zijyanye n'umutekano w'inzogera zikoresha ubwenge. Abashakashatsi ba Pen Test Partners cyo mu Bwongereza basesenguye inzogera yo mu bwoko bwa Ring ifite ubwenge maze banzura bavuga ko bishoboka ko uwagabye igitero ashobora kugera ku muyoboro wa nyirarureshwa wa nyirarureshwa akoresheje Impeta, akanda buto yo gushiraho kandi akagera kuri URL iboneza. Mu kindi kibazo cy\u2019umutekano cyari cyaragaragaye, kuvanga imibare ibiri yemereye bamwe mu bakoresha inzogera yo mu bwoko bwa Ring ubwenge kureba amashusho ya Live kuva ku rubaraza rw\u2019imbere rw\u2019abanyamahanga. "}
{"id": "21116", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21116", "title": "Gupti", "text": "Gupti ni inkota cg Umwambi gakondo wo mu Buhinde ishobora gusoza, gushyirwa mu gasanduku k'imbaho, kandi ugashyirwaho nk'umukandara w'ugenda cyangwa inkoni ngufi. "}
{"id": "21117", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21117", "title": "Margna", "text": "The Margna (Classical Mandaic,) ni inkoni y'imbaho w'ibiti by'umwelayo (olive) ikoreshwa mu mihango ya gikirisitu nu umupadiri wa Mandaean. Umupadiri wo muri Mandaean buri gihe yitwaza margna ye mugihe cy'imihango yo kubatizwa (masbuta). \nKu bwa \"Ginza iburyo\", \"margna\" (abakozi) b'amazi mazima (\"Mia Hayya\") ni imwe mu ntwaro za Manda d-Hayyi. \nEtymology.\nIjambo rya Mandaic \"margna\" rikomoka muri Irani. \nMuri \"Qulasta\".\nMugihe c'imihango y'abapadiri, klila (indabyo ya myrtle) ishyirwa kuri margna. Muri Qulasta, ni isengesho rya klila yashyizwe kuri margna. \n muri Qulasta ryeguriwe margna. Isengesho risobanura margna itwikiriye urumuri (\"ziwa\") n'umucyo (\"nhura\"). "}
{"id": "21118", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21118", "title": "Alijeriya mu Mikino ya Paralimpike y\u2019Amahoro yo mu 1992", "text": "Abakinnyi baturutse muri Alijeriya bitabiriye imikino Paralympike yo mu 1992 yabereye i Barcelona, Espanye. Iyi ni yo yabaye inshuro ya mbere Alijeriya yitabiriye ayo mikino.\nAbahatanye.\nAlijeriya yari ifite itsinda rinini rigizwe n\u2019abantu 8 i Barselona, bose bari abagabo. Ntibohereje abagore ku nshuro ya mbere kugeza ku Mikino yo mu mwaka wa 2000. Itsinda ryari ririmo Abdelkrim Yousei. \nIbisubizo ku byabaye.\nImikino ngororamubiri.\nAbdelkrim yitabiriye isiganwa rya 5000 m ry\u2019abagabo mu cyiciro cya TW3-4, mu mukino wa kane (heat 4), arangiza ari uwa nyuma n\u2019igihe cy\u2019iminota 14 n\u2019amasegonda 2.06. Yasoje adashoboye kurangiza isiganwa (DNF) mu marato y\u2019abagabo mu cyiciro cya TW3-4. "}
{"id": "21119", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21119", "title": "Alijeriya mu Mikino ya Paralimpike y\u2019Amahoro yo mu 1996", "text": "Abakinnyi baturutse muri Alijeriya bitabiriye imikino Paralympike yo mu 1996 yabereye i Atlanta, muri Amerika.\nAbanywanyi.\nAlijeriya yari ifite itsinda rinini rigizwe n\u2019abantu 9 i Atlanta, bose bari abagabo. Ntibohereje abagore kugeza ku Mikino yo mu mwaka wa 2000."}
{"id": "21120", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21120", "title": "Alijeriya mu mikino Paralempike yo mu 2000", "text": "Alijeriya yitabiriye imikino Paralympike yo mu 2000 yabereye i Sydney, Ositaraliya. Bibaye ku nshuro ya gatatu igihugu cyitabira imikino Paralympique. Intumwa zayo zari zigizwe n'abakinnyi batandatu basiganwa ku maguru hamwe n\u2019abakinnyi babiri bakina imikino yo guterura ibiremereye. Umwirukanyi Mohamed Allek, ufite uburwayi bw'ubwonko (mu cyiciro cy\u2019ubumuga T37), ni we watsindiye Alijeriya imidali yose muri ayo mikino - yatwaye imidali itatu ya zahabu.\nAbanywanyi.\nAlijeriya yari ifite itsinda rinini rigizwe n\u2019abantu 8 i Sydney, barimo 7 bagendaga n\u2019amaguru n\u2019umwe ukoresha intebe y\u2019abamugaye. Aya ni yo Mikino ya mbere Alijeriya yari ifitemo umukinnyi w\u2019umugore muri Paralimpike.\nAbamidari.\nSprinter Mohamed Allek, ufite ubumuga bwubwonko (icyiciro cy\u2019abafite ubumuga T37), yegukanye imidari yose ya Alijeriya muri iyi mikino - zahabu eshatu. \nIbisubizo ku byabaye.\nImikino ngororamubiri.\nAlijeriya yohereje abakinnyi umunani mu mikino yo kwiruka no gusimbuka, bose bari abagabo. Mohamed Aissaoui yitabiriye amarushanwa ya 800m, 1,500m na 5,000m mu cyiciro T46, aho yegereye cyane gufata umudali mu 1,500m, arangiza ari uwa kane n\u2019igihe cy\u2019iminota 4 n\u2019amasegonda 6.85 (asigaje amasegonda 2.09 Wu Yanjian w\u2019u Bushinwa, wafashe umudali wa bronze). Bachir Zergoune, nawe uri mu cyiciro T46, wahoze atsindira umudali wa bronze mu 800m mu mwaka wa 1996, yitabiriye amarushanwa ya 800m, 1,500m na 5,000m, ariko arangiza ari uwa nyuma cyangwa uwa mbere mu nyuma muri buri marushanwa. Mohamed Allek, wahoze atsindira imidali ibiri ya zahabu mu mwaka wa 1996 (100m na 200m T36), yitabiriye amarushanwa atatu mu cyiciro cy\u2019ubumuga T37 (cerebral palsy): 100m, 200m na 400m. Yatsindiye imidali ya zahabu yose mu marushanwa atatu, ashyiraho ikindi gishya mu mateka ya Paralimpike (11.99s) mu 100m, ndetse n\u2019ikindi gishya ku isi (54.66s) mu 400m. Rezki Reguig, nawe uri umukinnyi wa T37, yitabiriye amarushanwa ya 800m, 1,500m na 5,000m, aho igisubizo cye cyiza ari ugusoza ari uwa gatandatu mu 1,500m. Omar Benchiheb, umukinnyi ufite ubumuga bwo kutabona, yitabiriye amarushanwa ya 1,500m, 5,000m na 10,000m mu cyiciro T11, asubiramo ibyavuye mu marushanwa atandukanye. Nubwo atabashije kurangiza isiganwa rya 5,000m, yageze ku cyiciro cya nyuma mu 1,500m, aho arangiza ari uwa gatanu n\u2019igihe cy\u2019iminota 4 n\u2019amasegonda 27.33. Mu isiganwa rya 10,000m, yarangije ari uwa kane, n\u2019igihe cy\u2019amasaha 36 n\u2019iminota 55.90, asigaje amasegonda make 53 Tim Willis wo muri Amerika, wafashe umudali wa bronze.\nHakim Yahiaoui, ufite ubumuga bwo kutabona, yitabiriye amarushanwa yo gutera discus no guterura shot put mu cyiciro F13, arangiza ari uwa gatandatu mu discus kandi ari uwa gatanu mu shot put.\nKuzamura ingufu.\nAbanyarwanda babiri baturutse muri Alijeriya bahisemo kwitabira imikino yo guterura ibiremereye, harimo n\u2019umukinnyi w\u2019umugore wihariye w\u2019igihugu muri aya mikino. Saleha Annab yitabiriye irushanwa ry\u2019abagore riri mu cyiciro cy\u2019ibiro 48, ariko ntiyashoboye guterura na kimwe. Djamel Meziani yakoze neza mu irushanwa ry\u2019abagabo riri mu cyiciro cy\u2019ibiro 60, aterura ibiro 165\u00a0kg arangiza ari uwa gatandatu muri cumi na babiri."}
{"id": "21121", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21121", "title": "Erez Biton", "text": "Erez Biton (Hebrew; wavutse 1942 i Oran, muri Alijeriya) ni umusizi wa Isiraheli wavukiye muri Alijeriya ukomoka muri Maroc. Niwe wahawe igihembo cya Isiraheli 2015 kubera ubuvanganzo n\u2019imivugo by\u2019igiheburayo, mu bindi bihembo by\u2019ubuvanganzo.\nUbuzima.\nErez Biton yavukiye i Oran mu muryango w'Abayahudi bo muri Maroc. Umuryango we wihishe mu 1948, utembera muri Alijeriya maze bakora aliyah bajya muri Isirayeli. Yakurira i Lodi. Ku myaka 10, yabuze ubushobozi bwo kubona ndetse n\u2019ukuboko kwe kw\u2019ibumoso kubera grenade yari yabaye igikomeza yari yabonye. Yabonye impamyabumenyi ya B.A. mu kazi k\u2019imibereho muri Kaminuza ya Hebrew i Yerusalemu ndeste na MA muri psychologiya muri kaminuza ya Bar-Ilan. Biton yashakanye na Rachel Calahorra Biton, kandi bombi bafite abana babiri.\nUmwuga.\nNyuma yo kurangiza amasomo ye, Biton yakoraga akazi k\u2019imibereho myiza (social worker) i Ashkelon imyaka irindwi, ndetse agakora nka psikoloji (psychologist) mu mujyi uri kure. Yakoraga kandi nka mutwe w\u2019itangazamakuru (journalist) kandi asohora inkingi y\u2019inkuru y\u2019icyumweru muri gazeti rikomeye rya Isirayeli, \"Maariv.\" Igiti cye cya mbere, \"Mincha Marokait\" (Impano y\u2019Abanya-Moroko), cyasohotse mu 1976, kimushyira ku mwanya w\u2019Umubyeyi w\u2019Abasizi ba Mizrahi muri Isirayeli."}
{"id": "21122", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21122", "title": "Biotelemetry", "text": "Biotelemetrie (cyangwa telemetrie yubuvuzi) isobanura ikoreshwa rya tekinologi ya telemetrie mubijyanye n'ubumenyi bw'ibinyabuzima, ubuvuzi, n'izindi serivisi z'ubucuzi hagamijwe gukurikirana kure ibimenyetso by'ingenzi by'abarwayi bashobora ba ambulatori. \nGusaba.\nIkoreshwa cyane kuri biotelemetrie ni mubice byabugenewe byita k'umutima cyangwa ibice byamanutse mu bitaro. byose bifatika bishobora kwanduzwa, porogaramu igarukira gusa ku kugenzura umutima na SpO2.\nBiotelemetry iragenda ikorwa cyane mu kumenya inyamaswa n'ibinyabuzima byo mu ishyamba, binyuze mu gupima kure imikorere y'imibiri yabo, imyitwarire yabo, n'imikoreshereze y'ingufu. Irashobora gukoreshwa mugusobanukirwa uburyo inyamaswa zimuka, hamwe nibidukikije bahura nabyo mugupima ibinyabuzima bihindagurika, nuburyo bigira yabyo mugupima ibinyabuzima bihindagurika nkumutima nubushyuhe. ya telemetrie irashobora kwomekwa hanze yinyamaswa, cyangwa igashyirwa imbere, hamwe nubwoko bwokwirakwiza kubikoresho biterwa nibidukikije inyamaswa yimukiramo. Urugero, mu bushakashatsi ku mikorere y'inyamaswa ziba mu mazi, bakoresha uburyo bwo kohereza ubutumwa hakoreshejwe amashanyarazi y'amajwi (radio transmission) cyangwa amajwi atumvikana (ultrasonic transmission). Ariko inyamaswa ziba ku butaka cyangwa iziguruka zo, zishobora gukurikiranywa hifashishijwe GPS n'ubutumwa mu kirere (satelitte transmission)\nIbigize sisitemu ya biotelemetrie.\nSisitemu isanzwe ya biotelemetrie igizwe na:\nAmateka.\nBumwe mu buryo bwa mbere bwakoreshejwe bwa sisitemu ya biotelemetrie bwatangiye mu isiganwa ry\u2019ikirere hakiri kare, aho ibimenyetso bya physiologique byakuwe mu nyamaswa cyangwa abagenzi b\u2019abantu byoherejwe ku isi kugira ngo bisesengurwe (izina ry\u2019uruganda rukora ibikoresho by\u2019ubuvuzi Spacelabs Healthcare ni uburyo rwerekana ko rwatangiye mu 1958 rutezimbere uburyo bwa biotelemetrike muri gahunda yo muri Amerika yo hambere).\nIbinyabuzima bikomoka ku binyabuzima byakoreshejwe kuva byibura 1980. Ibinyabuzima bikomoka ku binyabuzima byateye imbere kugira ngo bidasobanukirwe gusa n\u2019imiterere n\u2019imiterere y\u2019inyamaswa zidafite ubwisanzure, ahubwo binasobanura uburyo inyamaswa zitandukanye zikorana, urugero, hagati y\u2019inyamanswa n\u2019inyambo. \nIbigezweho.\nKubera ubwinshi bwa radiyo bitewe na televiziyo ya digitale iherutse gutangizwa muri Amerika no mu bindi bihugu byinshi, komisiyo ishinzwe itumanaho (FCC) kimwe n\u2019ibindi bigo bisa ahandi vuba aha. yatangiye gutanga imirongo yihariye yabugenewe yo gukoresha biotelemetrie yihariye, urugero, Serivise ya Wireless Medical Telemetry Service (WMTS). FCC yashyizeho Sosiyete y'Abanyamerika ishinzwe ubuvuzi bw\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019ibitaro by\u2019Abanyamerika (ASHE / AHA) nkumuhuzabikorwa wa WMTS.\nMubyongeyeho, hari ibicuruzwa byinshi bikoresha ibikoresho bisanzwe bya radio bisanzwe biboneka nka Bluetooth na IEEE 802.11."}
